values
  ('1121195418565210263', 'Whatcha Wearin''?', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Choi Sang-ho', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Minsu Kim', 'Kim A-joong, Ji Sung, Shin So-yul, Kang Kyung-joon, Kim Seung-o, Moon Ji-yoon, Kim Bo-mi, Kim Bo-yeon', null, 'Yoon-jung accidentally calls a stranger, instead of her boyfriend, and has phone sex with the unknown man. When Yoon-jung''s relationship with her boyfriend turns sour, Yoon-jung meets Hyun-seung, the stranger she had phone sex with.', 'Yoon-jung accidentally calls a stranger, instead of her boyfriend, and has phone sex with the unknown man. When Yoon-jung''s relationship with her boyfriend turns sour, Yoon-jung meets Hyun-seung, the stranger she had phone sex with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acoytVakE7E8lCSB4JM7KyV9Ft9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171587'),
  ('707569137631103239', 'Whatever', 1999, 'Drama', 'Philippe Harel', 'Philippe Harel', 'Philippe Harel, José Garcia, Catherine Mouchet, Cécile Reigher, Marie-Charlotte Leclaire, Géraldine Bonnet-Guérin, Philippe Bianco, Philippe Agael', null, 'It is a story of a depressed, isolated man stuck in a tedious but well-paying programming job.', 'It is a story of a depressed, isolated man stuck in a tedious but well-paying programming job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIQ9e9ztljXEfy6HMP7vowUkF9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38619'),
  ('922951450156352883', 'Whatever Happened to My Revolution', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Judith Davis, Dimitri Lykavieris, Émilie Noblet', 'Cécile Vargaftig, Judith Davis', 'Judith Davis, Malik Zidi, Mireille Perrier, Nadir Legrand, Simon Bakhouche, Claire Dumas, Mélanie Bestel, Yasin Houicha', null, 'Angela was 8 years old when the first McDonald''s opened in East Berlin - Since then, she has been fighting against the curse of her generation: to be born "too late" at a time of global political depression. Coming from a family of activists, her sister chose the world of business and her mother abandoned overnight her political struggle to move alone to the countryside.', 'Angela was 8 years old when the first McDonald''s opened in East Berlin - Since then, she has been fighting against the curse of her generation: to be born "too late" at a time of global political depression. Coming from a family of activists, her sister chose the world of business and her mother abandoned overnight her political struggle to move alone to the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQz3uz5Xe9uLO6GvGfSabB9kdj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543636'),
  ('1105904328393941170', 'Whatever Happens', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Niels Laupert, Markus Nestroy', 'Niels Laupert', 'Sylvia Hoeks, Fahri Yardım, Alexander Beyer, David Zimmerschied, Victoria Mayer, Torben Liebrecht, Amelie Kiefer, Eckhard Preuß', null, 'Hannah and Julian have separated and meet for a last time to empty out their shared apartment. But nothing goes as planned, and their last night together becomes a turbulent roller-coaster ride.', 'Hannah and Julian have separated and meet for a last time to empty out their shared apartment. But nothing goes as planned, and their last night together becomes a turbulent roller-coaster ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10caqXXqRD6HaN6W98SCMVJRFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425215'),
  ('540286506006287455', 'Whatever It Takes', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Christina Fong, David Raynr, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Mark Schwahn', 'Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Shane West, Marla Sokoloff, James Franco, Aaron Paul, Colin Hanks, Julia Sweeney, Richard Schiff', 'PG-13', 'A nerdy teen, Ryan Woodman is smitten with the popular and gorgeous Ashley Grant, who apparently has no interest in him. Meanwhile, dim star athlete Chris Campbell has his eye on Ryan''s brainy and beautiful friend, Maggie Carter. The two agree to help each other in their romantic quests, but, as they come closer to their goals, both Ryan and Chris suspect that they might be pursuing the wrong girls.', 'A nerdy teen, Ryan Woodman is smitten with the popular and gorgeous Ashley Grant, who apparently has no interest in him. Meanwhile, dim star athlete Chris Campbell has his eye on Ryan''s brainy and beautiful friend, Maggie Carter. The two agree to help each other in their romantic quests, but, as they come closer to their goals, both Ryan and Chris suspect that they might be pursuing the wrong girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9UtZNMj2m7dtOP6RcMAeRfqmnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16222'),
  ('448315395585057430', 'Whatever It Takes', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Baptiste Léonetti, David Nissen, Bastien Blum', 'Jean-Baptiste Léonetti', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Pierre Lottin, Louise Labèque, Alexis Rosenstiehl, Alma Ngoc, Mélissa Izquierdo, Kevin Marvinio, Frans Boyer', null, 'Rose and Jean have nothing in common. Rose is a force of nature who faces all her problems with a disarming joie de vivre. She lives with her 3 children upstairs in the family hotel that no longer belongs to her. They''re not poor, they''re broke... but only temporarily. Jean is a solitary, taciturn man who has buried his big heart under layers of modesty and resignation. When he arrives in this unusual family, however, he quickly becomes indispensable. What did they expect before they met? Probably nothing. He soon becomes indispensable.', 'Rose and Jean have nothing in common. Rose is a force of nature who faces all her problems with a disarming joie de vivre. She lives with her 3 children upstairs in the family hotel that no longer belongs to her. They''re not poor, they''re broke... but only temporarily. Jean is a solitary, taciturn man who has buried his big heart under layers of modesty and resignation. When he arrives in this unusual family, however, he quickly becomes indispensable. What did they expect before they met? Probably nothing. He soon becomes indispensable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtmENvIUyH4J7x8UcrsdFkmTpJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421963'),
  ('600422947622015584', 'Whatever Lola wants', 2007, 'Drama', 'Nabil Ayouch, Vincent Mathias', 'Nabil Ayouch, Jane Hawksley, Nathalie Saugeon', 'Laura Ramsey, Achmed Akkabi, Milia Ayache, Assaad Bouab, Carmen Lebbos, Hichem Rostom, Nadim Sawalha, Abdelkader Lofti', null, 'A Brooklyn postal worker follows her Egyptian boyfriend to Cairo where she takes belly-dancing lessons from a legendary but disgraced Egyptian dancer.', 'A Brooklyn postal worker follows her Egyptian boyfriend to Cairo where she takes belly-dancing lessons from a legendary but disgraced Egyptian dancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msjbvyLY28IwyOam5uWfwd41Q1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17495'),
  ('548200803055470235', 'Whatever Works', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Harris Savides, Richard Patrick', 'Woody Allen', 'Larry David, Evan Rachel Wood, Michael McKean, Conleth Hill, Patricia Clarkson, Ed Begley Jr., Carolyn McCormick, Henry Cavill', 'PG-13', 'Whatever Works explores the relationship between a crotchety misanthrope, Boris and a naïve, impressionable young runaway from the south, Melody. When Melody''s uptight parents arrive in New York to rescue her, they are quickly drawn into wildly unexpected romantic entanglements. Everyone discovers that finding love is just a combination of lucky chance and appreciating the value of "whatever works."', 'Whatever Works explores the relationship between a crotchety misanthrope, Boris and a naïve, impressionable young runaway from the south, Melody. When Melody''s uptight parents arrive in New York to rescue her, they are quickly drawn into wildly unexpected romantic entanglements. Everyone discovers that finding love is just a combination of lucky chance and appreciating the value of "whatever works."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upIYOZbiutCBnvejGYaZlJxxKcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19265'),
  ('1071917920675687220', 'Whatever You Say', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Guillaume Canet, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Canet, Philippe Lefebvre', 'Guillaume Canet, François Berléand, Diane Kruger, Philippe Lefebvre, Daniel Prévost, Clotilde Courau, Jacqueline Jehanneuf, Jean-Paul Rouve', null, 'Bastien, an ambitious young production assistant, catches the attention of Jean-Louis, a producer of high regard, and is granted a shot at his own television show.', 'Bastien, an ambitious young production assistant, catches the attention of Jean-Louis, a producer of high regard, and is granted a shot at his own television show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1XRyCECB4a8prUBMMD4WIObh7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31354'),
  ('883752614225590292', 'Whatsoeverly', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Roberto Forza, Eugenio Rigacci', 'Giulio Manfredonia', 'Antonio Albanese, Sergio Rubini, Lorenza Indovina, Nicola Rignanese, Davide Giordano, Veronica Da Silva, Mario Cordova, Massimo Cagnina', null, 'Corrupt and sleazy entrepreneur Cetto La Qualunque comes back to Italy and "jumps into politics" lest his law-abiding opponent, Giovanni De Santis, is elected as mayor.', 'Corrupt and sleazy entrepreneur Cetto La Qualunque comes back to Italy and "jumps into politics" lest his law-abiding opponent, Giovanni De Santis, is elected as mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKBYZJlZQR4FGyN1lpbmUE9uulP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56339'),
  ('250254556809848649', 'Wheatfield', 2022, 'Drama', 'Anabel Caso, Ernesto Pardo, Julio Llorente', 'Anabel Caso', 'Emilia Berjón, Abril Michel, Alberto Guerra, Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio, Úrsula Pruneda, Patricia Ortiz, Gerardo Trejo Luna, Memo Villegas', null, 'During the summer, thirteen-year-old Sofia moves to the country house, where her cousin Cristina is waiting for her to spend the vacations. During these days of games and discoveries, the two will be immersed in a love triangle with a man almost twenty years older. Its outcome will mark the passage from puberty to adolescence for both of them.', 'During the summer, thirteen-year-old Sofia moves to the country house, where her cousin Cristina is waiting for her to spend the vacations. During these days of games and discoveries, the two will be immersed in a love triangle with a man almost twenty years older. Its outcome will mark the passage from puberty to adolescence for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE1GuB0Kaiwa2c5HhPKK73QSCoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764517'),
  ('841033031065831949', 'Wheel Bag and Kopana', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Omiros Efstratiadis', 'Giannis Sklavos', 'Stamatis Gardelis, Steve Douzos, Giannis Gionakis, Nikos Rizos, Mimis Fotopoulos, Yorgos Rigas, Vina Asiki, Teta Douzou', null, 'A major hit in the Greek cinemas at the time, this comedy by Omiros Efstratiadis is about a bunch of teenagers who make things difficult for their teachers.', 'A major hit in the Greek cinemas at the time, this comedy by Omiros Efstratiadis is about a bunch of teenagers who make things difficult for their teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCzbBNL3ccdXrqHLtkhnT8HlfN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151597'),
  ('107969415926910755', 'Wheel of Fortune and Fantasy', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Toru Takano, Yukiko Iioka', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi', 'Kotone Furukawa, Ayumu Nakajima, Hyunri, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Katsuki Mori, Shouma Kai, Fusako Urabe, Aoba Kawai', null, 'An unexpected love triangle, a seduction trap, and a random encounter are the three episodes, told in three movements to depict three female characters and trace the trajectories between their choices and regrets.', 'An unexpected love triangle, a seduction trap, and a random encounter are the three episodes, told in three movements to depict three female characters and trace the trajectories between their choices and regrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3xqVWOsetW6pSEgx1uiqXfzRet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795811'),
  ('374379447532255771', 'Wheel of Time', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Tenzin Gyatso, Lama Lhundup Woeser, Takna Jigme Sangpo, Matthieu Ricard, Tenzin Dhargye, Ven. Geshe, Manfred Klell', null, 'Wheel of Time is Werner Herzog''s photographed look at the largest Buddhist ritual in Bodh Gaya, India.', 'Wheel of Time is Werner Herzog''s photographed look at the largest Buddhist ritual in Bodh Gaya, India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d26W3zIQXucyHU6s98DVyOVlqV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51311'),
  ('988666234368675755', 'Wheelman', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Crime', null, null, 'Vin Diesel, Joseph Balderrama', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dFAiSgbTF71ODOJ6qmYAO2nhZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510710'),
  ('392507628865847832', 'Wheelman', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'K.C. Colwell, Kit Conners, Craig Comstock', 'Jeremy Rush', 'Frank Grillo, Caitlin Carmichael, Garret Dillahunt, Shea Whigham, Wendy Moniz, John Cenatiempo, George Carroll, William Xifaras', 'R', 'A getaway driver for a bank robbery realizes he has been double crossed and races to find out who betrayed him.', 'A getaway driver for a bank robbery realizes he has been double crossed and races to find out who betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qitUsN1Ea8Bsg8R0QtBB35H2xgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471014'),
  ('250034514045565892', 'Wheels', 1998, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Đorđe Milosavljević', 'Đorđe Milosavljević', 'Dragan Mićanović, Anica Dobra, Ljubiša Samardžić, Nikola Kojo, Svetozar Cvetković, Neda Arnerić, Bogdan Diklić, Milorad Mandić', null, 'Nemanja leads a normal life with a steady job and a fiancée, until he is waylaid by a sudden downpour in a seedy hotel called The Wheel. The hotel is populated by seemingly upstanding citizens, until Nemanya is accused of being the notorious Laughing Monster, a serial killer who has been terrorizing the neighborhood.', 'Nemanja leads a normal life with a steady job and a fiancée, until he is waylaid by a sudden downpour in a seedy hotel called The Wheel. The hotel is populated by seemingly upstanding citizens, until Nemanya is accused of being the notorious Laughing Monster, a serial killer who has been terrorizing the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttZBf7C72xVD8F7sTKHJeC8jjYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23237'),
  ('1136498762042981981', 'Wheels of Fire', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'Frederick Bailey', 'Gary Watkins, Laura Banks, Lynda Wiesmeier, Linda Grovenor, Joe Mari Avellana, Joseph Zucchero, Jack S. Daniels, Steve Parvin', 'R', 'The Future is now. There are no rules and no place to hide from the deadly Highway Warriors who ravage the roads in machines of destruction.', 'The Future is now. There are no rules and no place to hide from the deadly Highway Warriors who ravage the roads in machines of destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0fx4ZIu4lTSCPZSDC0HobcV2zA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107319'),
  ('1116833781384270780', 'Wheels of Terror', 1990, 'Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Christopher Cain, Richard Bowen', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Joanna Cassidy, Marcie Leeds, Gary Carlos Cervantes, Arlen Dean Snyder, Henry Kendrick, Sharon Thomas Cain, Jacob Kenner, Kimberly Duncan', 'R', 'A small town is terrorized by an unknown stranger who kidnaps and abuses little girls. When her only child is kidnapped right in front of her, the school bus driver begins the desperate chase to catch the criminal.', 'A small town is terrorized by an unknown stranger who kidnaps and abuses little girls. When her only child is kidnapped right in front of her, the school bus driver begins the desperate chase to catch the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GrFOtHRD5kXFxuLnqM1W2esjqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154566'),
  ('238193811665914175', 'Wheels on Meals', 1984, 'Romance, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Wellson Chin Sing-Wai', 'Edward Tang, Johnny Lee Kwing-Kai', 'Jackie Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Biao, Lola Forner, Benny Urquidez, Keith Vitali, Herb Edelman, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon', null, 'Cousins Thomas and David, owners of a mobile restaurant, team up with their friend Moby, a bumbling private detective, to save the beautiful Sylvia, a pickpocket.', 'Cousins Thomas and David, owners of a mobile restaurant, team up with their friend Moby, a bumbling private detective, to save the beautiful Sylvia, a pickpocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCii0fXuI7xzroEEG1KBJDlqu0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11205'),
  ('1075267752725015714', 'When a Man Comes Home', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Dod Mantle, Thomas Vinterberg', 'Morten Kaufmann, Mogens Rukov', 'Oliver Møller-Knauer, Ronja Mannov Olesen, Helene Reingaard Neumann, Thomas Bo Larsen, Karen-Lise Mynster, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Morten Grunwald, Ulla Henningsen', null, 'A small provincial town is buzzing with excitement: the town´s most illustrious son, a world-famous opera singer, is coming home. Meanwhile, Sebastian, a kitchen boy who is as good as married, falls head over heels in love with the new maid, Maria. Their love affair, along with rumours that the opera singer and the kitchen boy are related, turns the town upside down, threatening to ruin everyone´s high expectations and the opera singer´s triumphant return.', 'A small provincial town is buzzing with excitement: the town´s most illustrious son, a world-famous opera singer, is coming home. Meanwhile, Sebastian, a kitchen boy who is as good as married, falls head over heels in love with the new maid, Maria. Their love affair, along with rumours that the opera singer and the kitchen boy are related, turns the town upside down, threatening to ruin everyone´s high expectations and the opera singer´s triumphant return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGmqIsXsuWWECweqtgRW0Wltn3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15844'),
  ('901346576304777106', 'When A Man Falls In The Forest', 2007, 'Drama', 'Lawrence Sher, Ryan Eslinger', 'Ryan Eslinger', 'Dylan Baker, Timothy Hutton, Sharon Stone, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Stacie Bono, Nicholas Elia, Melanie Yeats, David Williams', null, 'The intertwining lives of three men reveal that each deal with his problems in different, self-destructive ways.', 'The intertwining lives of three men reveal that each deal with his problems in different, self-destructive ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5g4HMsW5RkOxjLMr5yyLDnhlG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24059'),
  ('916236622408295199', 'When a Man Loves a Woman', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Mandoki, Lajos Koltai, Steve Danton', 'Ronald Bass, Al Franken', 'Andy Garcia, Meg Ryan, Tina Majorino, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Mae Whitman, Ellen Burstyn, Eugene Roche, Gail Strickland', 'R', 'An airline pilot and his wife are forced to face the consequences of her alcoholism when her addictions threaten her life and their daughter''s safety. While the woman enters detox, her husband must face the truth of his enabling behavior.', 'An airline pilot and his wife are forced to face the consequences of her alcoholism when her addictions threaten her life and their daughter''s safety. While the woman enters detox, her husband must face the truth of his enabling behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA1uMNX3sdWAWfMZbsgm1VIJYSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10449'),
  ('209895376242700741', 'When a Stranger Calls', 1979, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Donald Peterman, Fred Walton, Lynn M. Morgan', 'Fred Walton, Steve Feke', 'Carol Kane, Charles Durning, Colleen Dewhurst, Tony Beckley, Rutanya Alda, Carmen Argenziano, Kirsten Larkin, Ron O''Neal', 'R', 'A student babysitter has her evening disturbed when the phone rings. So begins a series of increasingly terrifying and threatening calls that lead to a shocking revelation.', 'A student babysitter has her evening disturbed when the phone rings. So begins a series of increasingly terrifying and threatening calls that lead to a shocking revelation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdhpKVuuNZcc9noZzYXruxeIxdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45964'),
  ('356784843405427026', 'When a Stranger Calls', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Simon West, Peter Menzies Jr.', null, 'Camilla Belle, Katie Cassidy, Tommy Flanagan, Brian Geraghty, Clark Gregg, Derek de Lint, Kate Jennings Grant, Steve Eastin', 'PG-13', 'Far away from the site of a gruesome murder, a teenager named Jill Johnson arrives at a luxurious home for a baby-sitting job. With the children fast asleep, she settles in for what she expects to be an ordinary evening. Soon, the ringing of a phone and the frightening words of a sadistic caller turn Jill''s routine experience into a night of terror.', 'Far away from the site of a gruesome murder, a teenager named Jill Johnson arrives at a luxurious home for a baby-sitting job. With the children fast asleep, she settles in for what she expects to be an ordinary evening. Soon, the ringing of a phone and the frightening words of a sadistic caller turn Jill''s routine experience into a night of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5FAdQAtgRpHuSI4x5ydvcVHuFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10053'),
  ('137486297931034872', 'When a Stranger Calls Back', 1993, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred Walton, Patrice Leung, Colleen Mitchell', 'Fred Walton', 'Carol Kane, Charles Durning, Jill Schoelen, Gene Lythgow, Karen Elizabeth Austin, Babs Chula, John Destry, Duncan Fraser', 'R', 'A retired detective and a crisis-center counselor hunt a killer stalking a coed.', 'A retired detective and a crisis-center counselor hunt a killer stalking a coed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2Aw6vFF9f1UpOOZbWvzAPo8p1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30554'),
  ('759770887718420784', 'When a Wolf Falls in Love with a Sheep', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Hou Chi-jan, Chou Yi-hsien', 'Hou Chi-jan', 'Kai Ko, Jian Man-shu, Shu-yao Kuo, Lu Ting-Wei, Nikki Hsieh, Tsai Chen-nan, Nolay Piho, Dennis Nieh', null, 'This heart-warming romantic comedy takes place at Nanyang Street, the most famous "cram school" street in Taipei City. A young man works at a copy shop where his life is a boring routine of copying test papers for students. One day he finds a drawing of a sheep mixed in on the test papers, which leads him to an unexpected journey.', 'This heart-warming romantic comedy takes place at Nanyang Street, the most famous "cram school" street in Taipei City. A young man works at a copy shop where his life is a boring routine of copying test papers for students. One day he finds a drawing of a sheep mixed in on the test papers, which leads him to an unexpected journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSL7bQSxjZsRhj9h7c9ld76PZ6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140822'),
  ('757984273949260342', 'When a Woman Ascends the Stairs', 1960, 'Drama', 'Masao Tamai, Mikio Naruse, Sakae Hirosawa', 'Ryuzo Kikushima', 'Hideko Takamine, Masayuki Mori, Reiko Dan, Tatsuya Nakadai, Daisuke Katō, Ganjirō Nakamura II, Eitarō Ozawa, Keiko Awaji', null, 'Keiko, whom everyone calls Mama, narrates her story: she''s a hostess on the Ginza, 30, a widow. She describes life''s vicious cycle: acting cheerful around drunks, dressing and living well to convey confidence, needing money for these expenses and for her demanding mother and brother, and knowing she''s growing older.', 'Keiko, whom everyone calls Mama, narrates her story: she''s a hostess on the Ginza, 30, a widow. She describes life''s vicious cycle: acting cheerful around drunks, dressing and living well to convey confidence, needing money for these expenses and for her demanding mother and brother, and knowing she''s growing older.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miGb5TwM8SIK5URe0mPMOYZqr3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36872'),
  ('726837399083460774', 'When a Woman Meddles', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yves Allégret', null, 'Edwige Feuillère, Jean Servais, Jean Debucourt, Bernard Blier, Pascale Roberts, Sophie Daumier, Jean Lefebvre, Yves Deniaud', null, 'French film favorite Edwige Feuillere plays a high-class gangster''s moll named Maine. When Maine''s first husband and daughter pay a visit, it''s an awkward time for our heroine and her current amour, gang boss Godot (Jean Servais). In addition to fielding a lot of embarrassing questions, Godot also has to deal with a pesky turf war with a rival mobster. Not that the ex-husband is a paragon of virtue: he''s busy trying to get even with a crooked business associate.', 'French film favorite Edwige Feuillere plays a high-class gangster''s moll named Maine. When Maine''s first husband and daughter pay a visit, it''s an awkward time for our heroine and her current amour, gang boss Godot (Jean Servais). In addition to fielding a lot of embarrassing questions, Godot also has to deal with a pesky turf war with a rival mobster. Not that the ex-husband is a paragon of virtue: he''s busy trying to get even with a crooked business associate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JLSsJsLNKIJXPXpRLrQThJdTal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93796'),
  ('1042026975628960894', 'When Angels Fall', 1959, 'Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Henryk Kucharski', 'Roman Polanski', 'Barbara Lass, Roman Polanski, Henryk Kluba, Andrzej Kondratiuk, Stefan Bartik, Ryszard Filipski, Andrzej Kostenko, Henryk Kucharski', null, 'The twenty-one-minute-film is set in a men''s public rest room and recounts the day to day existence of an elderly woman who serves as an attendant in the lavatory. As an endless procession of men pass before her, relieving themselves in the urinals, the attendant escapes her reality by daydreaming about the past and the soldier she once loved and the child she bore him.', 'The twenty-one-minute-film is set in a men''s public rest room and recounts the day to day existence of an elderly woman who serves as an attendant in the lavatory. As an endless procession of men pass before her, relieving themselves in the urinals, the attendant escapes her reality by daydreaming about the past and the soldier she once loved and the child she bore him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96Hm3VQVdHgSsfy6Kx6MNE6e3qF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150630'),
  ('235731567324417902', 'When Animals Dream', 2014, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Jonas Alexander Arnby, Niels Thastum', 'Rasmus Birch', 'Sonia Suhl, Lars Mikkelsen, Sonja Richter, Benjamin Boe Rasmussen, Mads Riisom, Jakob Oftebro, Stig Hoffmeyer, Esben Dalgaard Andersen', null, 'Teenage Marie lives on a small island with her father and catatonic mother. Virtually friendless and sullen, Marie begins to experience frightening changes in her body that mark her as a dangerous threat.', 'Teenage Marie lives on a small island with her father and catatonic mother. Virtually friendless and sullen, Marie begins to experience frightening changes in her body that mark her as a dangerous threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fbKZ1fiVJQAisje8noLiDcK1H4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270668'),
  ('823778864460050191', 'When Billie Met Lisa', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'David Silverman', 'David Mirkin, Elisabeth Kiernan Averick, Broti Gupta', 'Billie Eilish, FINNEAS, Yeardley Smith, Nancy Cartwright, Chris Edgerly, Sunkrish Bala', 'G', 'Lisa Simpson is discovered by chart-topping artists Billie Eilish and FINNEAS while searching for a quiet place to practice her saxophone. Billie invites Lisa to her studio for a special jam session she’ll never forget.', 'Lisa Simpson is discovered by chart-topping artists Billie Eilish and FINNEAS while searching for a quiet place to practice her saxophone. Billie invites Lisa to her studio for a special jam session she’ll never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNplaMrD69kilWOowsBp9rmpd3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962659'),
  ('866453134915103280', 'When Brooklyn Met Seville', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Vicente Villanueva, Luis Ángel Pérez, Carmen Martínez', 'Juan Apolo, Nacho La Casa', 'Carolina Yuste, Sergio Momo, Estefanía de los Santos, Manolo Solo, Canco Rodríguez, María Alfonsa Rosso, Asier Gago, Neizan Fernández', null, 'Young Ana, a Sevillian girl sick of her family and her neighborhood, starts a relationship with the African-American boy her mum is hosting to avoid eviction.', 'Young Ana, a Sevillian girl sick of her family and her neighborhood, starts a relationship with the African-American boy her mum is hosting to avoid eviction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwKso5wrVPNvjA6r9b2LO3ukZ6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793158'),
  ('64661289511248981', 'When Calls the Heart', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon Jr., James L. Carter', null, 'Maggie Grace, Stephen Amell, Poppy Drayton, Daniel Sharman, Cherie Lunghi, Christopher Villiers, Jean Smart, Lori Loughlin', null, 'Elizabeth Thatcher, a cultured young teacher in 1910, fears leaving her comfortable world in the city. But when she accepts a teaching position in a frontier town, she finds new purpose and love with a handsome Royal Canadian Mountie.', 'Elizabeth Thatcher, a cultured young teacher in 1910, fears leaving her comfortable world in the city. But when she accepts a teaching position in a frontier town, she finds new purpose and love with a handsome Royal Canadian Mountie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKQKlEwii03hzgsxHPpiG01vkiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229749'),
  ('198958498675458698', 'When Christmas Trees Light Up', 1950, 'Animation', 'Mstislav Pashchenko', 'Sergey Mikhalkov, Mikhail Volpin, Vladimir Suteev', 'Vladimir Volodin, Yuliya Yulskaya, Leonid Pirogov, Rostislav Plyatt, Viktoriya Ivanova, Tatyana Barysheva, Yuri Khrzhanovsky', null, 'On New Year''s Eve, two lost in the woods toys try to prove to wild and hungry predators that they''re not good to eat.', 'On New Year''s Eve, two lost in the woods toys try to prove to wild and hungry predators that they''re not good to eat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgFOe1yOdoCAbQqI8BGgPClXX7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144441'),
  ('895717327971086761', 'When Comedy Was King', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy, Documentary', 'Robert Youngson', 'Robert Youngson', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Wallace Beery, Charlie Chaplin, Charley Chase, Buster Keaton, Edgar Kennedy, Harry Langdon, Stan Laurel', null, 'A compilation featuring comedic stars of the silent era including Fatty Arbuckle, Charles Chaplin, Buster Keaton, Charley Chase, and Laurel and Hardy.', 'A compilation featuring comedic stars of the silent era including Fatty Arbuckle, Charles Chaplin, Buster Keaton, Charley Chase, and Laurel and Hardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pN3RBZvOSSsAPEFAO4hwUYUPeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99917'),
  ('5233653460097790', 'When Darkness Falls', 1960, 'Crime', 'Arne Mattsson, Hilding Bladh', 'Maria Lang', 'Karl-Arne Holmsten, Nils Asther, Birgitta Pettersson, George Fant, Elsa Prawitz, Adolf Jahr, Mimi Nelson, Sif Ruud', null, 'Young Elisabeth comes to Västlinge to meet her old relative, the vicar and and his young daughter. She is going to spend the Christmas there in peace and quiet but on Christmas Eve, the grocer is brutally murdered with an axe. Police inspector Christer Wijk comes to the small village to find the murderer. He soon discovers the puzzle of evidence that makes almost everybody a suspect.', 'Young Elisabeth comes to Västlinge to meet her old relative, the vicar and and his young daughter. She is going to spend the Christmas there in peace and quiet but on Christmas Eve, the grocer is brutally murdered with an axe. Police inspector Christer Wijk comes to the small village to find the murderer. He soon discovers the puzzle of evidence that makes almost everybody a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0zfFlt26SnXxJezwQ6CpX5qjYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71852'),
  ('222506501450995866', 'When Darkness Falls', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anders Nilsson', 'Anders Nilsson, Joakim Hansson', 'Oldoz Javidi, Bahar Pars, Mina Azarian, César Saratxu, Annika Hallin, Bibi Andersson, Lia Boysen, Anja Lundqvist', null, 'A gripping and intense thriller about honour, loyalty, and the courage to fight for what you believe.', 'A gripping and intense thriller about honour, loyalty, and the courage to fight for what you believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMRik6n8oddRZf8uwRqnx4StXku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28062'),
  ('919069702988503838', 'When Dinosaurs Ruled the Earth', 1970, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Val Guest, Dick Bush', 'Val Guest, J.G. Ballard', 'Victoria Vetri, Robin Hawdon, Patrick Allen, Drewe Henley, Sean Caffrey, Magda Konopka, Imogen Hassall, Patrick Holt', 'G', 'An ancient tribe attempts to sacrifice Sanna as an offering to the Sun god to save their tribe from dinosaurs. Tara, a young man from another tribe, saves Sanna and takes her along with him.', 'An ancient tribe attempts to sacrifice Sanna as an offering to the Sun god to save their tribe from dinosaurs. Tara, a young man from another tribe, saves Sanna and takes her along with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xyuugOtFkro2nwGFov3tiesEoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35002'),
  ('394771985988452713', 'When Eight Bells Toll', 1971, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Étienne Périer, Arthur Ibbetson', null, 'Anthony Hopkins, Robert Morley, Nathalie Delon, Jack Hawkins, Corin Redgrave, Derek Bond, Ferdy Mayne, Maurice Roëves', 'PG', 'Phillip Calvert is a British Treasury secret service agent assigned to stop the ruthless pirating of millions in gold bullion off the western coast of the Scottish highlands. His search takes him to the small port town of Torbay on the Isle of Torbay where numerous fishing boats, yachts and people have been mysteriously disappearing. A trail of deceit and subterfuge leads him to Cypriot tycoon and shipping magnate Sir Anthony Skouras and his beautiful wife, Charlotte aboard their luxury yacht anchored off the coast, who may hold the answers to the truth.', 'Phillip Calvert is a British Treasury secret service agent assigned to stop the ruthless pirating of millions in gold bullion off the western coast of the Scottish highlands. His search takes him to the small port town of Torbay on the Isle of Torbay where numerous fishing boats, yachts and people have been mysteriously disappearing. A trail of deceit and subterfuge leads him to Cypriot tycoon and shipping magnate Sir Anthony Skouras and his beautiful wife, Charlotte aboard their luxury yacht anchored off the coast, who may hold the answers to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwDYGaJx2o6mABNElpe6o9ZL7TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38654'),
  ('581249178084504388', 'When Evil Lurks', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Fabián Forte, Tomás Eloy Muñoz, Andrés Borghi', 'Demián Rugna', 'Ezequiel Rodríguez, Demián Salomón, Silvina Sabater, Luis Ziembrowski, Marcelo Michinaux, Emilio Vodanovich, Virginia Garófalo, Paula Rubinsztein', 'NR', 'When brothers Pedro and Jimi discover that a demonic infection has been festering in a nearby farmhouse, they attempt to evict the victim from their land. Failing to adhere to the proper rites of exorcism, their reckless actions inadvertently trigger an epidemic of possessions across their rural community.', 'When brothers Pedro and Jimi discover that a demonic infection has been festering in a nearby farmhouse, they attempt to evict the victim from their land. Failing to adhere to the proper rites of exorcism, their reckless actions inadvertently trigger an epidemic of possessions across their rural community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ7G9LhP7NRRIUM4Vlai3eOxBAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744857'),
  ('357182719775425416', 'When Fall Is Coming', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'François Ozon, Aude Cathelin, Antonin Bonnot', 'François Ozon, Philippe Piazzo', 'Hélène Vincent, Josiane Balasko, Ludivine Sagnier, Pierre Lottin, Vincent Colombe, Sophie Guillemin, Garlan Erlos, Malik Zidi', null, 'Michelle is enjoying a peaceful retirement in a Burgundy village, close to her longtime friend Marie-Claude. When her Parisian daughter Valérie drops off her son Lucas to spend school vacation with his grandma, Michelle, stressed out by her daughter, serves her toxic mushrooms for lunch. Valérie quickly recovers, but forbids her mother from seeing her grandson anymore. Feeling lonely and guilty, Michelle falls into a depression... until Marie-Claude''s son gets out of prison.', 'Michelle is enjoying a peaceful retirement in a Burgundy village, close to her longtime friend Marie-Claude. When her Parisian daughter Valérie drops off her son Lucas to spend school vacation with his grandma, Michelle, stressed out by her daughter, serves her toxic mushrooms for lunch. Valérie quickly recovers, but forbids her mother from seeing her grandson anymore. Feeling lonely and guilty, Michelle falls into a depression... until Marie-Claude''s son gets out of prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pazjzgxyrDFIwe3xFJ4KyFJCd77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171634'),
  ('113064220560049575', 'When Father Was Away on Business', 1985, 'Drama', 'Emir Kusturica, Vilko Filač', 'Abdulah Sidran', 'Moreno de Bartoli, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Mirjana Karanović, Mustafa Nadarević, Mira Furlan, Predrag Laković, Pavle Vuisić, Slobodan Aligrudić', null, 'In a post-WWII Yugoslavia still under Stalinist rule in the 1950s, six-year-old Malik is oblivious as to why his father, Mehmed, has suddenly disappeared. In truth, Mehmed has been sent to a labor camp as punishment for acts of sexual indiscretion involving young girls. Malik''s mother, Senija, however, has no answers, and the family must cope in the father''s absence.', 'In a post-WWII Yugoslavia still under Stalinist rule in the 1950s, six-year-old Malik is oblivious as to why his father, Mehmed, has suddenly disappeared. In truth, Mehmed has been sent to a labor camp as punishment for acts of sexual indiscretion involving young girls. Malik''s mother, Senija, however, has no answers, and the family must cope in the father''s absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhTu6UwP32jPwiBccGAkZq0yqvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21042'),
  ('138110346495354682', 'When Fortune Smiles', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Anthony Chan Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Derek Wan Man-Kit', 'Raymond To Kwok-Wai', 'Stephen Chow, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Anthony Chan Yau, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Cutie Mui Siu-Wai, Shing Fui-On, Lam Kau, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit', null, 'A daughter inherits a massive amount of fortune from his deceased father and it enrages her brother and her nephew, who then try to steal some of it from her.', 'A daughter inherits a massive amount of fortune from his deceased father and it enrages her brother and her nephew, who then try to steal some of it from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE18OpvNQ8jtjGmj5MP1BVyjQ9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135061'),
  ('819552929743452967', 'When Friendship Kills', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'James A. Contner, Richard Leiterman', 'Elizabeth Gill', 'Lynda Carter, Katie Wright, Marley Shelton, Josh Taylor, Colleen Winton, Kimberley Warnat, Malcolm Stewart, Kevin McNulty', null, 'Teenager Lexi Archer moves to Chicago with her newly divorced mother and befriends a popular girl at her new school, Jennifer. After Lexi''s volleyball coach suggests that she lose weight, Jennifer reveals she is bulimic and the two girls decide to help each other, leading to disastrous consequences.', 'Teenager Lexi Archer moves to Chicago with her newly divorced mother and befriends a popular girl at her new school, Jennifer. After Lexi''s volleyball coach suggests that she lose weight, Jennifer reveals she is bulimic and the two girls decide to help each other, leading to disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9k86hz9Ux4YEfE9lnUmfysezDDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264560'),
  ('612638532643614249', 'When Good Ghouls Go Bad', 2001, 'Family, TV Movie, Horror, Comedy', 'Patrick Read Johnson, Brian J. Breheny', null, 'Christopher Lloyd, Joe Pichler, Tom Amandes, Roy Billing, Brittany Byrnes, Imelda Corcoran, Rhonda Doyle, Brendan McCarthy', 'PG', 'In October of 1981, Curtis Danko, the creepy kid from the small town of Walker Falls, was killed in a mysterious accident. He left behind a warning to the town: "If you ever have another Halloween again, I will return and destroy you all!" Curtis was buried in a locked crypt, along with a sculpture so evil, that unearthly fates were said to await anyone who looked at it. Now, 20 years later, the Walker men have returned to Walker Falls. They start a chain of events that unleashes an army of zombies on the town. Has Curtis Danko risen from the grave to exact his revenge? And will the people of Walker Falls make it through the night?', 'In October of 1981, Curtis Danko, the creepy kid from the small town of Walker Falls, was killed in a mysterious accident. He left behind a warning to the town: "If you ever have another Halloween again, I will return and destroy you all!" Curtis was buried in a locked crypt, along with a sculpture so evil, that unearthly fates were said to await anyone who looked at it. Now, 20 years later, the Walker men have returned to Walker Falls. They start a chain of events that unleashes an army of zombies on the town. Has Curtis Danko risen from the grave to exact his revenge? And will the people of Walker Falls make it through the night?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SKXCsd4a44CO9ZQU6hNt1Kk18c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55328'),
  ('403472255510800452', 'When Granny Meets Grandpa', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gabriel Julien-Laferrière, Cyrill Renaud', 'Gabriel Julien-Laferrière, Sébastien Mounier', 'Chantal Ladesou, Patrick Chesnais, Julie Gayet, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Julie Depardieu, Claudia Tagbo, Philippe Katerine, Thierry Neuvic', null, 'Everyone''s favorite fun-loving Granny Aurore goes overboard while partying and has a little accident! She loses her memory and gets put in a nursing home. When her grandkids hear her mention a mysterious man named "Gerry", they put all seven of their heads together to figure out who he is: Aurore''s first and only true love who just might turn out to be their long-lost grandfather, too! Hoping to trigger old memories that could snap her out of her amnesia, they join forces to sneak Aurore out of the nursing home and set out into the wilderness on a mission to find the legendary "Grandpa Gerry". But the adventure turns out to be a lot more than they bargained for!', 'Everyone''s favorite fun-loving Granny Aurore goes overboard while partying and has a little accident! She loses her memory and gets put in a nursing home. When her grandkids hear her mention a mysterious man named "Gerry", they put all seven of their heads together to figure out who he is: Aurore''s first and only true love who just might turn out to be their long-lost grandfather, too! Hoping to trigger old memories that could snap her out of her amnesia, they join forces to sneak Aurore out of the nursing home and set out into the wilderness on a mission to find the legendary "Grandpa Gerry". But the adventure turns out to be a lot more than they bargained for!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4M1oU6HNrexnqXtiOZAxPSu6uv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734480'),
  ('852382057209482222', 'When Harry Met Sally...', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Rob Reiner, Aaron Barsky', 'Nora Ephron', 'Billy Crystal, Meg Ryan, Carrie Fisher, Bruno Kirby, Steven Ford, Lisa Jane Persky, Michelle Nicastro, Gretchen Palmer', 'R', 'Sex always gets in the way of friendships between men and women. At least, that''s what Harry Burns believes. So when Harry meets Sally Albright and a deep friendship blossoms between them, Harry''s determined not to let his attraction to Sally destroy it. But when a night of weakness ends in a morning of panic, can the pair avoid succumbing to Harry''s fears by remaining friends and admitting they just might be the perfect match for each other?', 'Sex always gets in the way of friendships between men and women. At least, that''s what Harry Burns believes. So when Harry meets Sally Albright and a deep friendship blossoms between them, Harry''s determined not to let his attraction to Sally destroy it. But when a night of weakness ends in a morning of panic, can the pair avoid succumbing to Harry''s fears by remaining friends and admitting they just might be the perfect match for each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFOiFUhTMtDetqCGClC9PIgnC1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639'),
  ('162222811458694411', 'When Hitler Stole Pink Rabbit', 2019, 'Drama', 'Caroline Link, Bella Halben', 'Anna Brüggemann, Caroline Link', 'Riva Krymalowski, Oliver Masucci, Carla Juri, Marinus Hohmann, Justus von Dohnányi, Ursula Werner, Rahel Hubacher, Anne Bennent', null, 'In 1933 in Berlin. Anna is only nine years old when her life changes from the ground up. To escape the Nazis, her father Arthur Kemper, a well-known Jewish journalist, has to flee to Zurich. His family, Anna, her twelve-year-old brother Max and her mother Dorothea, follow him shortly thereafter. Anna has to leave everything behind, including her beloved pink rabbit, and to face a new life full of challenges and privations abroad.', 'In 1933 in Berlin. Anna is only nine years old when her life changes from the ground up. To escape the Nazis, her father Arthur Kemper, a well-known Jewish journalist, has to flee to Zurich. His family, Anna, her twelve-year-old brother Max and her mother Dorothea, follow him shortly thereafter. Anna has to leave everything behind, including her beloved pink rabbit, and to face a new life full of challenges and privations abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9GJufkrzJkvWmgLNHeVc3wz3T6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581518'),
  ('608784444993885638', 'When I Am Dead and White', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Živojin Pavlović, Milorad Jakšić ''Fanđo''', 'Gordan Mihić, Ljubiša Kozomara', 'Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Ružica Sokić, Neda Spasojević, Darinka ''Dara'' Čalenić, Severin Bijelić, Nikola Milić, Zorica Šumadinac, Slobodan Aligrudić', null, 'The story about Jimmy Barka, a young vagabond who works as a seasonal worker. Having been sacked from the job, his dreams are to become a singer. As most of the things in the Balkans happen, he is destined to failure.', 'The story about Jimmy Barka, a young vagabond who works as a seasonal worker. Having been sacked from the job, his dreams are to become a singer. As most of the things in the Balkans happen, he is destined to failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKTsQd4wAEGnAvCdpQpBgKQLuXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155992'),
  ('337021777438723302', 'When I Get Home, My Wife Always Pretends to Be Dead', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Toshio Lee', 'Fumi Tsubota', 'Nana Eikura, Ken Yasuda, Ryohei Otani, Sumika Nono, Kazuyuki Asano, Tōru Shinagawa, Yukijiro Hotaru, Rie Minemura', 'PG-13', 'When salary man Jun gets home, he finds his wife bleeding from her mouth and lying on the floor. He is shocked by the scene, but it turns out the blood is just ketchup and she is pretending to be dead. Without telling him why, she pretends to be dead everyday. Jun is dumbfounded by his wife''s behavior, but he begins to feel uneasy with her.', 'When salary man Jun gets home, he finds his wife bleeding from her mouth and lying on the floor. He is shocked by the scene, but it turns out the blood is just ketchup and she is pretending to be dead. Without telling him why, she pretends to be dead everyday. Jun is dumbfounded by his wife''s behavior, but he begins to feel uneasy with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2RVVM9wrUMhS7AuodwGVPUJ1eX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483119'),
  ('190149856890064044', 'When I Grow Up, I''ll Be a Kangaroo', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Radivoje ''Raša'' Andrić, Dušan Joksimović', 'Miroslav Momčilović', 'Sergej Trifunović, Marija Karan, Nebojša Glogovac, Boris Milivojević, Lazar Strugar, Nikola Vujović, Gordan Kičić, Miodrag Fišeković', null, 'A young student Braca is trying to seduce a beautiful model Iris. Although they are from two different worlds, they both try not to show it. In another story, Šomi and Duje anxiously follow the football match between Manchester and Eastwich. They bet on Eastwich, because their childhood friend Kengur is their goalkeeper. The plot of the third story takes place on the roof of the solitaire, where Avaks and Hibrid are wasting time in anticipation of something happening.', 'A young student Braca is trying to seduce a beautiful model Iris. Although they are from two different worlds, they both try not to show it. In another story, Šomi and Duje anxiously follow the football match between Manchester and Eastwich. They bet on Eastwich, because their childhood friend Kengur is their goalkeeper. The plot of the third story takes place on the roof of the solitaire, where Avaks and Hibrid are wasting time in anticipation of something happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf5BCdk9cZykYIKUCiVvGTZjnjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55135'),
  ('719620057554602019', 'When I Turned Nine', 2004, 'Family, Romance', 'Yoon In-Ho, 이주생', 'Lee Man-hee', 'Lee Se-young, Jung Ae-yeun, Jung Sun-kyung, Go Seo-hee', null, 'Yeo-min is a matured and thoughtful 9 year old boy who lives in a small mountain village. Even at his young age, he has too many things to take care of. First, he has to protect his friends from the neighborhood bully Black Bird and keep peace in his neighborhood. Second, he must share his lunch with his best friend Ki-jong who lives alone with his sister. And, third, he has to sell ice cream bars after school to save enough money to buy a pair of sunglasses for his mother who injured her eye while working at a factory.', 'Yeo-min is a matured and thoughtful 9 year old boy who lives in a small mountain village. Even at his young age, he has too many things to take care of. First, he has to protect his friends from the neighborhood bully Black Bird and keep peace in his neighborhood. Second, he must share his lunch with his best friend Ki-jong who lives alone with his sister. And, third, he has to sell ice cream bars after school to save enough money to buy a pair of sunglasses for his mother who injured her eye while working at a factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAPgNyXPYtdll6knAfAirvd9Zhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132165'),
  ('730816903061966246', 'When I Was Alive', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Marco Dutra, Sergio Silva', 'Marco Dutra, Gabriela Amaral Almeida', 'Antônio Fagundes, Marat Descartes, Sandy, Gilda Nomacce, Kiko Bertholini, Helena Albergaria, Rony Koren, Tuna Dwek', null, 'After losing his job and the end of his marriage, Júnior returns to his father''s house. But that is not his childhood house anymore. His old room has been rented by a young woman and the place feels unwelcome and oppressive. Júnior develops and obsession for his family history, as strange things start happening in the house.', 'After losing his job and the end of his marriage, Júnior returns to his father''s house. But that is not his childhood house anymore. His old room has been rented by a young woman and the place feels unwelcome and oppressive. Júnior develops and obsession for his family history, as strange things start happening in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFFPrN9lnNulF3gcDRmOwKwqrah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230714'),
  ('20165985044156461', 'When I''m Ready', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Johnson, Rachael Kliman', 'Andrew Ortenberg', 'Andrew Ortenberg, June Schreiner, Thalia Besson, Dermot Mulroney, Lauren Cohan, Luciana VanDette, Theo Marshall, Eli Samek', null, 'It''s the end of the world. Seeking meaning and thrills in their last days alive, Rose and Michael embark on a cross-country road trip to see Rose''s grandmother as a devastating asteroid threatens to wipe out life on Earth. Along the way they encounter other lost souls, each with their own very different perspective on the impending doom.', 'It''s the end of the world. Seeking meaning and thrills in their last days alive, Rose and Michael embark on a cross-country road trip to see Rose''s grandmother as a devastating asteroid threatens to wipe out life on Earth. Along the way they encounter other lost souls, each with their own very different perspective on the impending doom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7T2OZVC4G70tmYmUnVzzsbbIYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013301'),
  ('891383964444300758', 'When I''m Young', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Raúl Martínez', 'Angélica Gudiño', 'Verónica Castro, Natasha Dupeyrón, Michael Ronda, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Eduardo Santamarina, Pierre Louis, Alejandra Barros, Edgar Vivar', 'PG', '70-year-old Malena gets a second chance at life when she magically turns into her 22-year-old self. Now, posing as "Maria" to hide her true identity, she becomes the lead singer of her grandson''s band and tries to recover her dream of singing, which she had to give up at some point.', '70-year-old Malena gets a second chance at life when she magically turns into her 22-year-old self. Now, posing as "Maria" to hide her true identity, she becomes the lead singer of her grandson''s band and tries to recover her dream of singing, which she had to give up at some point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hPa1NDUZCjGBDt0nvg4hnWis7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772071'),
  ('337511708262348045', 'When in Rome', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Romance', 'David Lewis, Steve Purcell, Mimosa Nistri Ranalletti', 'Michael Swerdlick', 'Ashley Olsen, Mary-Kate Olsen, Leslie Danon, Julian Stone, Michelangelo Tommaso, Ilenia Lazzarin, Archie Kao, Valentina Mattolini', 'G', 'Teenage sisters Charli and Lola are on the verge of an experience beyond their wildest dreams! Pack your bags and jet off to Rome as the girls start their summer internship working for the legendary Derek Hanson - the totally cool international tycoon whose empire reaches from airlines to cutting-edge fashion. Amid the fabulous sights of this exciting city, the girls do their best to impress their boss, while still finding time to design their own line of very hip clothing, meet some very cute guys and turn their summer abroad into one awesome adventure they - and you - will never forget!', 'Teenage sisters Charli and Lola are on the verge of an experience beyond their wildest dreams! Pack your bags and jet off to Rome as the girls start their summer internship working for the legendary Derek Hanson - the totally cool international tycoon whose empire reaches from airlines to cutting-edge fashion. Amid the fabulous sights of this exciting city, the girls do their best to impress their boss, while still finding time to design their own line of very hip clothing, meet some very cute guys and turn their summer abroad into one awesome adventure they - and you - will never forget!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjnk4BLLtvMI1eDzqTTqd6BGeFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39227'),
  ('93776315693813495', 'When in Rome', 2010, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Mark Steven Johnson, John Bailey, Kim H. Winther', 'David Diamond, David Weissman', 'Kristen Bell, Josh Duhamel, Anjelica Huston, Danny DeVito, Will Arnett, Jon Heder, Dax Shepard, Alexis Dziena', 'PG-13', 'Disillusioned with romance, Beth, an ambitious New Yorker, travels to Rome for her sister''s wedding, where she plucks magic coins from a special fountain of love. The coins attract unwanted attention from an assortment of odd yet ardent suitors: a sausage merchant, a street magician, an artist, and a male model. But when the best man from the wedding, persistent reporter Nick, throws his hat in the ring, Beth wonders if his love is the real thing.', 'Disillusioned with romance, Beth, an ambitious New Yorker, travels to Rome for her sister''s wedding, where she plucks magic coins from a special fountain of love. The coins attract unwanted attention from an assortment of odd yet ardent suitors: a sausage merchant, a street magician, an artist, and a male model. But when the best man from the wedding, persistent reporter Nick, throws his hat in the ring, Beth wonders if his love is the real thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pteIGpJpgh2aUh3jMqZnomB1rw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13477'),
  ('221568406620582326', 'When Inge Is Dancing', 2013, 'Music, Comedy', 'Armin Golisano, Wolfgang Groos', 'Thomas Winkler, Rainer Ewerrien, David Ungureit', 'Tim Oliver Schultz, Paula Kalenberg, Constantin von Jascheroff, Tino Mewes, Thando Walbaum, Jürgen Tarrach, Peter Kraus, Béatrice Jean-Philippe', null, 'The ambitious punk rocker Max and the eco-activist Inge cannot stand each other, ever since Max publicly exposed her by singing the offensive song "When Inge is Dancing" in front of the whole school. But for Max and his classmates Fabio, Joscha and Lukas this song in particular has become a real hit at school as well as in the regional music scene: Their band called Systemfehler is on the verge of a breakthrough. But just before the important gig, which could get them a record deal, guitarist Josha is injured and can''t play. Inge happens to be an excellent guitarist, and the only person who can fill in at such short notice. But when Max asks for her help, she imposes one non-negotiable condition: If she decides to play with the band, they will not perform the song "Wenn Inge tanzt".', 'The ambitious punk rocker Max and the eco-activist Inge cannot stand each other, ever since Max publicly exposed her by singing the offensive song "When Inge is Dancing" in front of the whole school. But for Max and his classmates Fabio, Joscha and Lukas this song in particular has become a real hit at school as well as in the regional music scene: Their band called Systemfehler is on the verge of a breakthrough. But just before the important gig, which could get them a record deal, guitarist Josha is injured and can''t play. Inge happens to be an excellent guitarist, and the only person who can fill in at such short notice. But when Max asks for her help, she imposes one non-negotiable condition: If she decides to play with the band, they will not perform the song "Wenn Inge tanzt".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM6h8FBNghxFfw0tmor9ROjEubz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203539'),
  ('614287043071891241', 'When Innocence Is Lost', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Bethany Rooney, Laszlo George, Philip Mead', 'Deborah Jones', 'Keri Russell, Roberta Maxwell, Vince Corazza, Charlotte Sullivan, Barry Flatman, Dave Nichols, Julie Khaner, Jill Clayburgh', null, 'When Erica French opts to keep the baby she conceived in high school, she never dreamed that one day she would be fighting for custody against the child''s father, Scott Stone. Scott Stone initially fought for custody when Erica threatened to cut off his access to their daughter. Scott continues to try to be a part of his daughter''s life, but when Molly first breaks her arm at the playground then Scott''s mother finds mysterious bruises on her granddaughter, Scott again fights for custody of young Molly, and this time he wins because the court feels his family can provide a more stable environment for Molly than a public daycare can.', 'When Erica French opts to keep the baby she conceived in high school, she never dreamed that one day she would be fighting for custody against the child''s father, Scott Stone. Scott Stone initially fought for custody when Erica threatened to cut off his access to their daughter. Scott continues to try to be a part of his daughter''s life, but when Molly first breaks her arm at the playground then Scott''s mother finds mysterious bruises on her granddaughter, Scott again fights for custody of young Molly, and this time he wins because the court feels his family can provide a more stable environment for Molly than a public daycare can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu8jBwUzsG0k6GEBUitb2GynZqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161051'),
  ('635744152105862368', 'When It Melts', 2023, 'Drama', 'Veerle Baetens, Frederic Van Zandycke, Joke Pevenage', 'Maarten Loix, Veerle Baetens', 'Charlotte De Bruyne, Rosa Marchant, Sebastien Dewaele, Naomi Vellisariou, Amber Metdepenningen, Anthony Vyt, Matthijs Meertens, Charlotte Van Der Eecken', null, 'Many years after a sweltering summer that spun out of control, Eva returns to the village she grew up in with an ice block in the back of her car. In the dead of winter, she confronts her past and faces up to her tormentors.', 'Many years after a sweltering summer that spun out of control, Eva returns to the village she grew up in with an ice block in the back of her car. In the dead of winter, she confronts her past and faces up to her tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRIumYQP6kni5HLcCio175uPmTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923387'),
  ('859343249669860311', 'When It Rains', 1995, 'Drama, Music', 'Charles Burnett', 'Charles Burnett', 'Ayuko Babu, Florence Bracy, Kenny Merritt, Juno Lewis, Charles Bracy, Brittany Bracy, Soul, Billy Woodberry', null, 'A musician spends New Year''s Day trying to help his friend pay the rent.', 'A musician spends New Year''s Day trying to help his friend pay the rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtb0YrKUmITzVX7pdR2vNzn5Ka1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146361'),
  ('19071590374372308', 'When Knighthood Was in Flower', 1922, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert G. Vignola, Ira H. Morgan, Harold Wenstrom', 'William LeBaron', 'Marion Davies, Forrest Stanley, Lyn Harding, Theresa Maxwell Conover, Pedro de Cordoba, Ruth Shepley, Ernest Glendinning, Arthur Forrest', 'NR', 'Mary Tudor falls in love with a new arrival to court, Charles Brandon. She convinces her brother King Henry VIII to make him his Captain of the Guard. Meanwhile, Henry is determined to marry her off to the aging King Louis XII of France as part of a peace agreement.', 'Mary Tudor falls in love with a new arrival to court, Charles Brandon. She convinces her brother King Henry VIII to make him his Captain of the Guard. Meanwhile, Henry is determined to marry her off to the aging King Louis XII of France as part of a peace agreement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9sS9dRTZacHSQGEIeRz3sFrlph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53801'),
  ('61740152493788130', 'When Ladies Meet', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harry Beaumont, Douglas Shearer, Ray June', 'Leon Gordon, John Meehan', 'Ann Harding, Robert Montgomery, Myrna Loy, Alice Brady, Frank Morgan, Martin Burton, Luis Alberni, Sterling Holloway', 'NR', 'Mary, a writer working on a novel about a love triangle, is attracted to her publisher. Her suitor Jimmy is determined to break them up; he introduces Mary to the publisher''s wife without telling Mary who she is.', 'Mary, a writer working on a novel about a love triangle, is attracted to her publisher. Her suitor Jimmy is determined to break them up; he introduces Mary to the publisher''s wife without telling Mary who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GGK7UGIT1mG8wbGiDouhG9joaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175035'),
  ('645760839420114881', 'When Larry Met Mary', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wen Zhang', null, 'Bao Bei''er, Song Jia, Zhu Yawen, Jiao Junyan, Ma Yili, Guo Jingfei, Jerry Lee, Chen He', null, 'Lu Yao met his kindergarten classmate Ma Li in colleague, and his attraction towards her grows in his heart. Unfortunately, he was one step too slow to tell her his affection. In the following ten years, Ma Li went through following in love, breaking up, marriage, divorce, and getting married again soon. At the same time, Lu Yao has also experienced two fruitless relationships. What would happen next?', 'Lu Yao met his kindergarten classmate Ma Li in colleague, and his attraction towards her grows in his heart. Unfortunately, he was one step too slow to tell her his affection. In the following ten years, Ma Li went through following in love, breaking up, marriage, divorce, and getting married again soon. At the same time, Lu Yao has also experienced two fruitless relationships. What would happen next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eI8M0PiQmro0P6lTerjun3xnGpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406481'),
  ('900732726181529526', 'When Love Comes', 1998, 'Drama', 'Garth Maxwell', 'Garth Maxwell, Rex Pilgrim, Peter Wells', 'Rena Owen, Dean O''Gorman, Simon Prast, Nancy Brunning, Sophia Hawthorne, Simon Westaway, Lulu Alach', null, 'Between getting trashed, tripping, blowing guys off and writing songs, Mark falls for Stephen. Fig and Sally put perform Marks songs between casual sex with anyone and everyone. Katie is a few-hit wonder who hit rock-bottom in L.A and returns to New Zealand to patch her life back together. Stephen, Mark and Katie branch out for a slumber party at a beach house of their better days. Fig and Sally arrive, and not long after Eddie arrives also (Katies American guy). Mark stops running away from Stephens love, Katie and Eddie get engaged and Fig and Sally ... have sex?', 'Between getting trashed, tripping, blowing guys off and writing songs, Mark falls for Stephen. Fig and Sally put perform Marks songs between casual sex with anyone and everyone. Katie is a few-hit wonder who hit rock-bottom in L.A and returns to New Zealand to patch her life back together. Stephen, Mark and Katie branch out for a slumber party at a beach house of their better days. Fig and Sally arrive, and not long after Eddie arrives also (Katies American guy). Mark stops running away from Stephens love, Katie and Eddie get engaged and Fig and Sally ... have sex?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8H0owxfeRJ1nw3fLojayIT8flHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283895'),
  ('837273013924704809', 'When Love Comes', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chang Tso-chi, Chang Chan', 'Chang Tso-chi', 'Lee Yi-Chieh, Lin Yu-Shun, Ho Tzu-hua, Lü Hsueh-feng, Kao Meng-Chieh, Fan Wing, Chang Tsai-hsing, Wu Kang-ren', null, 'Laichun, her father and two mothers, uncle and grandfather are of different generations; thus they all think differently. Father is the family head, and because he believes he must continue on the family name ends up taking two wives. His first wife also feels the same way, and so allows the second wife. Laichun feels the abyss between her and her parents and ends up getting pregnant, but hits a wall when her boyfriend does not take any responsibility. When her father is hospitalized, she begins to understand her father and two mothers. She is finally growing up.', 'Laichun, her father and two mothers, uncle and grandfather are of different generations; thus they all think differently. Father is the family head, and because he believes he must continue on the family name ends up taking two wives. His first wife also feels the same way, and so allows the second wife. Laichun feels the abyss between her and her parents and ends up getting pregnant, but hits a wall when her boyfriend does not take any responsibility. When her father is hospitalized, she begins to understand her father and two mothers. She is finally growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9AwrbIpJLSR2tJLh3cByLDxsc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88752'),
  ('682580362600588734', 'When Love Is Lust', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vittorio De Sisti, Aldo De Robertis, Bruno Nicolai', 'Vittorio De Sisti, Luigi Russo', 'Agostina Belli, Gianni Macchia, Françoise Prévost, Ewa Aulin, Femi Benussi, Umberto Raho, Giovanni Rosselli, Monica Monet', null, 'A decadent countess, middle-aged but still attractive, forces her young and timid daughter to marry a rich butcher. But the couple’s sexual relation is troubled, because the girl has her fair share of inhibitions. So she abandons her house and seeks refuge at her sister’s place. During her absence, her husband finds consolation in his mother in law’s arms.', 'A decadent countess, middle-aged but still attractive, forces her young and timid daughter to marry a rich butcher. But the couple’s sexual relation is troubled, because the girl has her fair share of inhibitions. So she abandons her house and seeks refuge at her sister’s place. During her absence, her husband finds consolation in his mother in law’s arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8X908FyetJIrjfoXJgDTThAUhls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270497'),
  ('1128229293116503718', 'When Love Springs', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jo-Anne Brechin, Shing Fung Cheung, Riley Ranftle', 'Ansley Gordon', 'Rhiannon Fish, James William O''Halloran, Erin Connor, Steve Nation, Victor Parascos, Renee Herbert, Callan Colley, Janaki Gerard', 'G', 'A talented PR professional, Rory, enlists the manager of a Bed & Breakfast, Noah, to pretend to be her boyfriend in front of her ex while she helps save his failing family business.', 'A talented PR professional, Rory, enlists the manager of a Bed & Breakfast, Noah, to pretend to be her boyfriend in front of her ex while she helps save his failing family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO6JD9rLK0ndPnO4nqpcsOrmmbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067821'),
  ('410088828841687591', 'When Luck Breaks the Door', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Tayfun Güneyer, Veli Kuzlu', 'Tayfun Güneyer', 'Ferhan Şensoy, Asuman Dabak, Zeki Alasya, Rasim Öztekin, Necmi Yapıcı, Sinan Çetin, Fethi Kantarcı, İpek Tuzcuoğlu', null, 'Kuddusi Yurdum, a minibus driver, competes in a TV quiz show to win a grand prize for his family. After narrowly missing the final question, they accept a consolation trip to Barbunya Island, where unexpected and funny adventures await.', 'Kuddusi Yurdum, a minibus driver, competes in a TV quiz show to win a grand prize for his family. After narrowly missing the final question, they accept a consolation trip to Barbunya Island, where unexpected and funny adventures await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A1PjDxSgL6Jv3fVavRzsc0L85K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331128'),
  ('799571146747788636', 'When Magoo Flew', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Pete Burness', null, 'Jim Backus, Henny Backus, Jerry Hausner', null, 'Mr. Magoo sets off to go to the movies but goes to an airport by mistake and gets on a plane thinking it to be a theater. Little does Magoo know the man he is sitting next to is actually a thief and when a detective appears on the plane to track the thief down, Magoo thinks it''s all part of the movie. After doing some wing walking, Magoo reenters the plane and exposes the thief to the detective. When the plane lands, Magoo remarks that they should have shown a cartoon particularly one with that "delightful near sighted fellow".', 'Mr. Magoo sets off to go to the movies but goes to an airport by mistake and gets on a plane thinking it to be a theater. Little does Magoo know the man he is sitting next to is actually a thief and when a detective appears on the plane to track the thief down, Magoo thinks it''s all part of the movie. After doing some wing walking, Magoo reenters the plane and exposes the thief to the detective. When the plane lands, Magoo remarks that they should have shown a cartoon particularly one with that "delightful near sighted fellow".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQXCUAy69aKsdpNs0gQut8wloSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205712'),
  ('567604325639112332', 'When Margaux Meets Margaux', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sophie Fillières, Emmanuelle Collinot', 'Sophie Fillières', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Agathe Bonitzer, Melvil Poupaud, Lucie Desclozeaux, Laurent Bateau, Théo Cholbi, Anthony Paliotti, Florence Muller', null, '20-year-old Margaux makes the acquaintance of 45-year-old Margaux: they have a lot in common – so much so that it turns out they are one and the same person, at two different ages and stages of their life…', '20-year-old Margaux makes the acquaintance of 45-year-old Margaux: they have a lot in common – so much so that it turns out they are one and the same person, at two different ages and stages of their life…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3onSWigYspp34uqOnvVqT054OnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505747'),
  ('1009466450074643386', 'When Marnie Was There', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Family', 'Hiromasa Yonebayashi, Masashi Ando, Koji Kasamatsu', 'Masashi Ando, Hiromasa Yonebayashi, Keiko Niwa', 'Sara Takatsuki, Kasumi Arimura, Nanako Matsushima, Susumu Terajima, Toshie Negishi, Ryoko Moriyama, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Hitomi Kuroki', 'PG', 'Upon being sent to live with relatives in the countryside due to an illness, an emotionally distant adolescent girl becomes obsessed with an abandoned mansion and infatuated with a girl who lives there - a girl who may or may not be real.', 'Upon being sent to live with relatives in the countryside due to an illness, an emotionally distant adolescent girl becomes obsessed with an abandoned mansion and infatuated with a girl who lives there - a girl who may or may not be real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vug1dvDI1tSa60Z8qjCuUE7ntkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242828'),
  ('462192107422034487', 'When Michael Calls', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Philip Leacock, Donald Wilder, Reginald H. Morris', 'James Bridges', 'Ben Gazzara, Elizabeth Ashley, Michael Douglas, Al Waxman, Larry Reynolds, Marian Waldman, Karen Pearson, Chris Pellett', null, 'A woman begins to receive ominous phone calls from her nephew, who died 15 years earlier. With each phone call, a family member dies. Will she be the next in line?', 'A woman begins to receive ominous phone calls from her nephew, who died 15 years earlier. With each phone call, a family member dies. Will she be the next in line?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKXACAQt1JUae4aQBrP7tkPZWtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90391'),
  ('832303393365092989', 'When Mom Is Away', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Federico Masiero, Miguel Lombardi, Elena Casnati', 'Mariano Vera, Juan Vera', 'Fabio De Luigi, Valentina Lodovini, Angelica Elli, Bianca Usai, Matteo Castellucci, Diana Del Bufalo, Niccolò Senni, Antonio Catania', null, 'A stressed-out mom takes off on a 10-day solo vacation, sending her family into chaos as the dad tries to take over the household duties.', 'A stressed-out mom takes off on a 10-day solo vacation, sending her family into chaos as the dad tries to take over the household duties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u8c7EveXTjBIEtf4atScpQah8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575100'),
  ('418936632335206121', 'When Mom Is Away... With the Family', 2020, 'Family, Comedy', 'Miguel Lombardi, Alessandro Genovesi, Federico Masiero', 'Giovanni Bognetti, Alessandro Genovesi', 'Fabio De Luigi, Valentina Lodovini, Diego Abatantuono, Angelica Elli, Bianca Usai, Matteo Castellucci, Beatrice Barichella, Melissa Anna Bartolini', null, 'Carlo and Giulia are grappling with new problems regarding the division of their respective tasks within the family. Since Giulia has started working again, it is Carlo who takes care of the children and the household chores. However, he starts to find the role of “Mr. Mom” a bit tight-fitting. Just when he decides to get back into the game and look for a job, Giulia reveals to him that she is up for a promotion that would lead her to move to Sweden. As if that weren’t enough, she will have to take the interview on December 24 in Stockholm. Everything seems to threaten the family unity. What should they do? Carlo comes up with a "brilliant" idea… To recover the old camper and drag the family into an adventure that will lead them on a journey to the North to spend Christmas all together lovingly. Unexpected events along the way and a hilarious encounter/confrontation with a self-styled Santa Claus will make the trip unforgettable.', 'Carlo and Giulia are grappling with new problems regarding the division of their respective tasks within the family. Since Giulia has started working again, it is Carlo who takes care of the children and the household chores. However, he starts to find the role of “Mr. Mom” a bit tight-fitting. Just when he decides to get back into the game and look for a job, Giulia reveals to him that she is up for a promotion that would lead her to move to Sweden. As if that weren’t enough, she will have to take the interview on December 24 in Stockholm. Everything seems to threaten the family unity. What should they do? Carlo comes up with a "brilliant" idea… To recover the old camper and drag the family into an adventure that will lead them on a journey to the North to spend Christmas all together lovingly. Unexpected events along the way and a hilarious encounter/confrontation with a self-styled Santa Claus will make the trip unforgettable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRTauOf9RcgD8Qf6bavSc8mECqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614420'),
  ('25628207873116675', 'When Mom Is Away... With the In-laws', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Luca Esposito, Miguel Lombardi', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Giovanni Bognetti', 'Fabio De Luigi, Valentina Lodovini, Dino Abbrescia, Giulia Bevilacqua, Angelica Elli, Matteo Castellucci, Bianca Usai, Gabriele Pizzurro', null, 'After the phenomenal success of the first two films, “When Mom is Away” and “When Mom is Away… With the Family,” the adventures of the Rovelli family continue! This time, they’re heading to Puglia, where their eldest daughter, Camilla, is moving to attend university with her boyfriend, Antonio.', 'After the phenomenal success of the first two films, “When Mom is Away” and “When Mom is Away… With the Family,” the adventures of the Rovelli family continue! This time, they’re heading to Puglia, where their eldest daughter, Camilla, is moving to attend university with her boyfriend, Antonio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHVn3hD00834WzTedC88JrpoLAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313011'),
  ('473557858187249667', 'When Mumbo Jumbo Grew Giant', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Karsten Kiilerich, Stine Marie Buhl', 'Karsten Kiilerich, Jakob Martin Strid', 'Victor Spanning, Annevig Schelde Ebbe, Kirsten Lehfeldt, Rebecca Rønde Kiilerich, Asger Reher', null, 'In an adventurous journey Mumbo Jumbo magically grows into a giant size. Now, with his three friends he has to go on a dangerous journey to find the scary witch Baba Yaga, and ask her to turn him small again.', 'In an adventurous journey Mumbo Jumbo magically grows into a giant size. Now, with his three friends he has to go on a dangerous journey to find the scary witch Baba Yaga, and ask her to turn him small again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fb4ywnKSc0feugAwWiiz8DJ9noPY.jpg', 'plex:movie:da-mumbo-jumbo-blev-kaempestor'),
  ('77601461897428730', 'When Nietzsche Wept', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pinchas Perry, Georgi Nikolov, Peter Gaitandjiev', 'Pinchas Perry', 'Ben Cross, Armand Assante, Joanna Pacula, Jamie Elman, Andreas Beckett, Katheryn Winnick, Michal Yannai, Rachel O''Meara', null, 'Viennese doctor Josef Bruer meets with philosopher Friedrich Nietzsche to help him deal with his despair.', 'Viennese doctor Josef Bruer meets with philosopher Friedrich Nietzsche to help him deal with his despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3BPypoaQ10cMVyMuLmf7OiTM3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19029'),
  ('891936718614504003', 'When Night Is Falling', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Koch, Patricia Rozema', 'Patricia Rozema', 'Pascale Bussières, Rachael Crawford, Henry Czerny, David Fox, Don McKellar, Tracy Wright, Clare Coulter, Karyne Steben', null, 'Camille is a professor at a Protestant college and is in a long-term relationship with Martin, a respected minister and fellow professor. When Camille meets Petra, a bold and flamboyant performer in a circus troupe, she is inexplicably drawn. Pursuing Petra, Camille throws her whole conservative life into disarray.', 'Camille is a professor at a Protestant college and is in a long-term relationship with Martin, a respected minister and fellow professor. When Camille meets Petra, a bold and flamboyant performer in a circus troupe, she is inexplicably drawn. Pursuing Petra, Camille throws her whole conservative life into disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ac5GLwJ01uli5mCXqXwquR36Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8391'),
  ('1059526511335771186', 'When Pigs Have Wings', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Sylvain Estibal, Romain Winding', 'Sylvain Estibal', 'Sasson Gabai, Ulrich Tukur, Baya Belal, Gassan Abbas, Myriam Tekaïa, Khalifa Natour, Lotfi Abdelli, Zohar Wexler', null, 'After a tempest, fishermen do not find only fish in their nets. That is what happens to Jafaar, a poor fisherman who lives poorly in Gaza. And what he hauls in is really upsetting: imagine that, a pig! An unclean animal judged impure not only by the Faith of Islam but also by the Jewish religion. Determined to get rid of the animal, Jafaar tries desperately to sell it, first to a United Nations official, then to a Jewish colony where Yelena raises pigs not for their meat but for security reasons. Of course, going unnoticed in the company of a "forbidden" animal, among his Palestinian brothers, past Israeli soldiers and under the scrutiny of Islamic fundamentalists is no bed of roses and a series of misadventures await Jafaar.', 'After a tempest, fishermen do not find only fish in their nets. That is what happens to Jafaar, a poor fisherman who lives poorly in Gaza. And what he hauls in is really upsetting: imagine that, a pig! An unclean animal judged impure not only by the Faith of Islam but also by the Jewish religion. Determined to get rid of the animal, Jafaar tries desperately to sell it, first to a United Nations official, then to a Jewish colony where Yelena raises pigs not for their meat but for security reasons. Of course, going unnoticed in the company of a "forbidden" animal, among his Palestinian brothers, past Israeli soldiers and under the scrutiny of Islamic fundamentalists is no bed of roses and a series of misadventures await Jafaar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWLvW5OAInSvx9b8O7NQt2FaI2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77458'),
  ('1072405948893039426', 'When Romance Meets Destiny', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Hyun-seok', 'Kim Hyun-seok', 'Kim Joo-hyuk, Bong Tae-gyu, Lee Yo-won, Jung Kyung-ho, Kim A-joong, Kim Hyung-min, Lee Dae-yeon, Kim Hyo-ju', null, 'Gwang-sik is very shy around women and he can''t even speak a word to them. Gwang-tae is a playboy who enjoys sleeping around with other women. They both meet a woman they each like around the same time, and something changes for both of them.', 'Gwang-sik is very shy around women and he can''t even speak a word to them. Gwang-tae is a playboy who enjoys sleeping around with other women. They both meet a woman they each like around the same time, and something changes for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/945Z4EZnKL1SSkcJ9wxmFJvnaDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57147'),
  ('187044254311391771', 'When Santa Fell to Earth', 2011, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Oliver Dieckmann, Alexander Fischerkoesen', 'Benjamin Biehn, Robin Getrost, Uschi Reich', 'Alexander Scheer, Mercedes Jadea Diaz, Jessica Schwarz, Fritz Karl, Volker Lechtenbrink, Christine Urspruch, Charly Hübner, Noah Kraus', null, 'Christmas is just two weeks away, it is pouring with rain, and Ben is struggling to get into the Christmas spirit. Suddenly, Bens life takes a turn for the better when Santa Niklas Goodfellow and his Christmas caravan come crashing down to Earth in the middle of thunderstorm and land in Foggy Lane. Santa is on the run from the ruthless Gerold Geronimus Goblynch and his army of nutcrackers who have outlawed all of the old magical ways and have transformed the bright and peaceful Christmas world into a dark and hostile place, governed by greed and money. Goblynch has banned work for all Santas and confined the Christmas angels to tiny prison cells, where they can no longer hear the dearest wishes of children. Goblynch also wants to force Santa Niklas Goodfellow, the last real Santa, to work for his commercialized Christmas company and forces him to do hard labour in the ordering department of the Christmas Palace.', 'Christmas is just two weeks away, it is pouring with rain, and Ben is struggling to get into the Christmas spirit. Suddenly, Bens life takes a turn for the better when Santa Niklas Goodfellow and his Christmas caravan come crashing down to Earth in the middle of thunderstorm and land in Foggy Lane. Santa is on the run from the ruthless Gerold Geronimus Goblynch and his army of nutcrackers who have outlawed all of the old magical ways and have transformed the bright and peaceful Christmas world into a dark and hostile place, governed by greed and money. Goblynch has banned work for all Santas and confined the Christmas angels to tiny prison cells, where they can no longer hear the dearest wishes of children. Goblynch also wants to force Santa Niklas Goodfellow, the last real Santa, to work for his commercialized Christmas company and forces him to do hard labour in the ordering department of the Christmas Palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viTODPsyC93eFbGPK4RwN90cbiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141476'),
