  ('100325262164998875', 'When the Daltons Rode', 1940, 'Western', 'George Marshall, Vernon Keays, Hal Mohr', 'Harold Shumate', 'Randolph Scott, Kay Francis, Brian Donlevy, George Bancroft, Broderick Crawford, Stuart Erwin, Andy Devine, Frank Albertson', 'NR', 'Young lawyer Tod Jackson arrives in pioneer Kansas to visit his prosperous rancher friends the Daltons, just as the latter are in danger of losing their land to a crooked development company. When Tod tries to help them, a faked murder charge turns the Daltons into outlaws, but more victims than villains in this fictionalized version. Will Tod stay loyal to his friends despite falling in love with Bob Dalton''s former fiancée Julie?', 'Young lawyer Tod Jackson arrives in pioneer Kansas to visit his prosperous rancher friends the Daltons, just as the latter are in danger of losing their land to a crooked development company. When Tod tries to help them, a faked murder charge turns the Daltons into outlaws, but more victims than villains in this fictionalized version. Will Tod stay loyal to his friends despite falling in love with Bob Dalton''s former fiancée Julie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUt0KgYdYyLLarmes2eiKNSLWY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156188'),
  ('146886885706749354', 'When the Day Breaks', 1999, 'Animation', 'Wendy Tilby, Amanda Forbis', null, null, null, 'A rooster has his last biscuit for breakfast and goes grocery shopping. A pig prepares her breakfast (potato peelings, with the potatoes thrown in the trash) and discovers she needs more milk. Their paths cross, a lemon falls into the sewer, and both lives are changed.', 'A rooster has his last biscuit for breakfast and goes grocery shopping. A pig prepares her breakfast (potato peelings, with the potatoes thrown in the trash) and discovers she needs more milk. Their paths cross, a lemon falls into the sewer, and both lives are changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbtZLfZnmUQbfE76iAz11t8XNAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160332'),
