  ('599776975187071820', 'When Will It Be Again Like It Never Was Before', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sonja Heiss, Manuel Dacosse', 'Sonja Heiss, Lars Hubrich', 'Camille Loup Moltzen, Arsseni Bultmann, Merlin Rose, Laura Tonke, Devid Striesow, Kolja Koddenbrock, Casper von Bülow, Leevi Tjelle Höhlein', null, 'Growing up on the grounds of one of Germany''s largest psychiatric hospitals is somehow - different. For Joachim, the director''s youngest son, the patients are like family. They are also much nicer to him than his two older brothers, who drive him into fits of rage. His mother, painting watercolors, longs for Italian summer nights instead of constant German rain, while his father secretly, but not discreetly enough, goes his own way. But while Joachim slowly grows up, his world, not only through the loss of his first love, gets more and more cracks...', 'Growing up on the grounds of one of Germany''s largest psychiatric hospitals is somehow - different. For Joachim, the director''s youngest son, the patients are like family. They are also much nicer to him than his two older brothers, who drive him into fits of rage. His mother, painting watercolors, longs for Italian summer nights instead of constant German rain, while his father secretly, but not discreetly enough, goes his own way. But while Joachim slowly grows up, his world, not only through the loss of his first love, gets more and more cracks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnYR1qW99cIorTpvA0fESqcSBNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916715'),
  ('627148080420081726', 'When Will You Get Divorced?', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Oleksii Komarovskyi', 'Oleksii Komarovskyi', 'Antonina Khyzhniak, Taras Tsymbaliuk, Natalka Denysenko', null, 'Incredible sequel to «When you get married». Favorite characters in new unforeseen situations. The film is full of intrigues, passion and love - from a disrupted wedding to adventures on the Black Sea coast, because the Black Sea unites th', 'Incredible sequel to «When you get married». Favorite characters in new unforeseen situations. The film is full of intrigues, passion and love - from a disrupted wedding to adventures on the Black Sea coast, because the Black Sea unites th', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvfV76Jgup2RGDzfIdfG3cVV9uNP.jpg', 'plex:movie:when-will-you-get-divorced'),
  ('191503493424543812', 'When Willie Comes Marching Home', 1950, 'Comedy, War', 'John Ford, Leo Tover', 'Mary Loos, Richard Sale', 'Dan Dailey, Corinne Calvet, Colleen Townsend, William Demarest, Jimmy Lydon, Lloyd Corrigan, Evelyn Varden, Whit Bissell', 'NR', 'When Willie leaves home to join the war effort he is all ready to become a hero, but he is only frustrated when his posting ends up to be in his home town, and he is recruited into training, keeping him from the action. However, when he finds himself accidently behind enemy lines he unexpectedly becomes a hero after all.', 'When Willie leaves home to join the war effort he is all ready to become a hero, but he is only frustrated when his posting ends up to be in his home town, and he is recruited into training, keeping him from the action. However, when he finds himself accidently behind enemy lines he unexpectedly becomes a hero after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AmE1YWygXiNvWbaQMrCCOEOzws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54615'),
