  ('1076977726139603542', 'Where Are You Going All Naked?', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Roberto Gerardi', 'Ottavio Jemma, Luigi Malerba, Sandro Continenza', 'Tomas Milian, Maria Grazia Buccella, Gastone Moschin, Angela Luce, Lea Lander, Vittorio Gassman, Tito LeDuc, Giancarlo Badessi', null, 'Totally drunk, a young banker marries a girl who has strange habits: she walks around the house completely naked.', 'Totally drunk, a young banker marries a girl who has strange habits: she walks around the house completely naked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FFlUd2X6xRtBZUqoW7JncC44Qh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197918'),
