  ('24211968996086586', 'Where Spring Comes Late', 1970, 'Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Tetsuo Takaha, Toshinobu Ōmine', 'Yoji Yamada, Akira Miyazaki', 'Chieko Baisho, Hisashi Igawa, Chishū Ryū, Gin Maeda, Masumi Harukawa, Hajime Hana, Kiyoshi Atsumi, Shin Morikawa', null, 'The story is set in 1970 during the time of the first EXPO in Japan. The film’s main figure is a miner who suddenly becomes unemployed because the mine he worked in was shut down. He decides to resettle with his whole family to Hokkaido in northern Japan and start a new life as a farmer.', 'The story is set in 1970 during the time of the first EXPO in Japan. The film’s main figure is a miner who suddenly becomes unemployed because the mine he worked in was shut down. He decides to resettle with his whole family to Hokkaido in northern Japan and start a new life as a farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHtmVSxGxNp9ODqrPRSA7Kp4RNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261528'),
  ('485462175329736753', 'Where the Boys Are', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Henry Levin, Al Jennings, Robert J. Bronner', 'George Wells', 'Dolores Hart, George Hamilton, Yvette Mimieux, Jim Hutton, Barbara Nichols, Paula Prentiss, Chill Wills, Frank Gorshin', null, 'Good girls Merritt, Melanie, Tuggle and Angie - all students at mid-western Penmore University - are planning on going to Fort Lauderdale, Florida for spring break to get away from the mid-western snow despite not having much money to spend once there. On the drive down, they admit their real purpose is to go where the boys are.', 'Good girls Merritt, Melanie, Tuggle and Angie - all students at mid-western Penmore University - are planning on going to Fort Lauderdale, Florida for spring break to get away from the mid-western snow despite not having much money to spend once there. On the drive down, they admit their real purpose is to go where the boys are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if6vjNZZX2JEclfd4rcus9kOHwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43049'),
  ('323103751380889714', 'Where the Boys Are', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hy Averback, James A. Contner, Maximilian Bing', 'Jeff Burkhart, Stu Krieger', 'Lisa Hartman, Lorna Luft, Wendy Schaal, Lynn-Holly Johnson, Russell Todd, Howard McGillin, Christopher McDonald, Daniel McDonald', 'R', 'Four college co-eds travel to Fort Lauderdale for their Easter week of Spring Break, and become involved in a series of adventures and misadventures', 'Four college co-eds travel to Fort Lauderdale for their Easter week of Spring Break, and become involved in a series of adventures and misadventures', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etNghqetJYdPaWE4A8NYcePSXUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59897'),
