  ('88473292426992982', 'Where the Crawdads Sing', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Polly Morgan, Olivia Newman, Andrew Shepherd', 'Lucy Alibar', 'Daisy Edgar-Jones, Taylor John Smith, Harris Dickinson, David Strathairn, Michael Hyatt, Sterling Macer Jr., Logan Macrae, Bill Kelly', 'PG-13', 'Abandoned by her family, Kya raises herself all alone in the marshes outside of her small town. When her former boyfriend is found dead, Kya is instantly branded by the local townspeople and law enforcement as the prime suspect for his murder.', 'Abandoned by her family, Kya raises herself all alone in the marshes outside of her small town. When her former boyfriend is found dead, Kya is instantly branded by the local townspeople and law enforcement as the prime suspect for his murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1el846gLDXfhOvrRCsyvaAOQWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682507'),
  ('563921874041342551', 'Where the Day Takes You', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'King Baggot, Marc Rocco, Scott Javine', 'Michael Hitchcock, Kurt Voss, Marc Rocco', 'Sean Astin, Lara Flynn Boyle, Peter Dobson, Balthazar Getty, Ricki Lake, James Le Gros, Kyle MacLachlan, Dermot Mulroney', 'R', 'King is a young man, but he''s already a veteran of life on the streets of Los Angeles. The de facto leader of a group of teenage runaways, King acts as a mentor to troubled kids such as gay hustler Little J and junkie Greg. When Heather, a beautiful girl from Chicago, starts hanging out with King and his crew, it changes the dynamic of the gang. However, it seems as though nothing will alter their dangerous lifestyle.', 'King is a young man, but he''s already a veteran of life on the streets of Los Angeles. The de facto leader of a group of teenage runaways, King acts as a mentor to troubled kids such as gay hustler Little J and junkie Greg. When Heather, a beautiful girl from Chicago, starts hanging out with King and his crew, it changes the dynamic of the gang. However, it seems as though nothing will alter their dangerous lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6W7pwB1o601kN8zySjHNz5X3QDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17736'),
  ('970821777660265782', 'Where the Devil Roams', 2023, 'Horror', 'John Adams, Zelda Adams, Toby Poser', 'John Adams, Toby Poser, Zelda Adams', 'Zelda Adams, Toby Poser, John Adams, Lulu Adams, Sam Rodd, Justin Julio, Razor De Rockefeller, Hitomi Nakamura', null, 'A family of murderous sideshow performers traverse the harsh conditions of a Depression-era America in a bloody deal with the Devil.', 'A family of murderous sideshow performers traverse the harsh conditions of a Depression-era America in a bloody deal with the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tm4CuCFUmIHXO6DtMl1gg2s0Ipq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1085113'),
  ('240773732173541860', 'Where the Green Ants Dream', 1984, 'Drama', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Werner Herzog', 'Wandjuk Marika, Roy Marika, Ray Barrett, Norman Kaye, Ralph Cotterill, Bruce Spence, Nico Lathouris, Basil Clarke', null, 'The Australian Aborigines (in this film anyway) believe that this is the place where the green ants go to dream, and that if their dreams are disturbed, it will bring down disaster on us all. The Aborigines'' belief is not shared by a giant mining company, which wants to tear open the soil and search for uranium.', 'The Australian Aborigines (in this film anyway) believe that this is the place where the green ants go to dream, and that if their dreams are disturbed, it will bring down disaster on us all. The Aborigines'' belief is not shared by a giant mining company, which wants to tear open the soil and search for uranium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60oMOwmWwpN8dnOkRIjoUA7i5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27221'),
  ('1067484179285244525', 'Where the Heart Is', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Boorman, Walter Gasparovic, Peter Suschitzky', 'Telsche Boorman, John Boorman', 'Dabney Coleman, Uma Thurman, Joanna Cassidy, Crispin Glover, Suzy Amis, Christopher Plummer, David Hewlett, Maury Chaykin', 'R', 'A wealthy businessman shows his young adult kids how tough life can be.', 'A wealthy businessman shows his young adult kids how tough life can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3DAggUcSsQX3DUFBOS3igTVQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48864'),
  ('492229976962305630', 'Where the Heart Is', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Guédiguian, Bernard Cavalié', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi, James Baldwin', 'Ariane Ascaride, Christine Brücher, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Alexandre Ogou, Laure Raoust, Véronique Balme, Pierre Banderet', null, 'From the director of Marius et Jeannette, this story of two working-class families is a fable with an optimist streak. A young black man, Francois, is wrongly accused of rape by a racist policeman. The story is told in voiceover by his childhood friend, neighbor, and the mother of his future child, Clementine, who is white. The city is Marseilles as in the previous film, symbolic with its churches, prisons and ruins. Except in this film, director Robert Guediguian also ventures outside, taking the story to Sarajevo; two different cities, one devastated by war, the other by a bad economy and unemployment. A la Place du coeur won a Special Jury Prize at the 1998 San Sebastian Film Festival and was also shown at the 1998 Toronto Film Festival and the 1998 Montreal Film Festival.', 'From the director of Marius et Jeannette, this story of two working-class families is a fable with an optimist streak. A young black man, Francois, is wrongly accused of rape by a racist policeman. The story is told in voiceover by his childhood friend, neighbor, and the mother of his future child, Clementine, who is white. The city is Marseilles as in the previous film, symbolic with its churches, prisons and ruins. Except in this film, director Robert Guediguian also ventures outside, taking the story to Sarajevo; two different cities, one devastated by war, the other by a bad economy and unemployment. A la Place du coeur won a Special Jury Prize at the 1998 San Sebastian Film Festival and was also shown at the 1998 Toronto Film Festival and the 1998 Montreal Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzDcVgPjmQM6YiQL2rHQZZoLzuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134193'),
  ('258788216926515941', 'Where the Heart Is', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matt Williams, Richard Greatrex', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Natalie Portman, Ashley Judd, Stockard Channing, Joan Cusack, Sally Field, James Frain, Dylan Bruno, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'Novalee Nation is a 17-year-old Tennessee transient who has to grow up in a hurry when she''s left pregnant and abandoned by her boyfriend on a roadside, and takes refuge in the friendly aisles of Wal-Mart. Eventually, some eccentric but kindly strangers ''adopt'' Novalee and her infant daughter, helping them buck the odds and build a new life.', 'Novalee Nation is a 17-year-old Tennessee transient who has to grow up in a hurry when she''s left pregnant and abandoned by her boyfriend on a roadside, and takes refuge in the friendly aisles of Wal-Mart. Eventually, some eccentric but kindly strangers ''adopt'' Novalee and her infant daughter, helping them buck the odds and build a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iyT5W3PjDKMKVS1vfAnDLeSXh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10564'),
  ('752972846539399970', 'Where the Lilies Bloom', 1974, 'Drama', 'William A. Graham, Urs Furrer', 'Earl Hamner, Jr.', 'Julie Gholson, Jan Smithers, Matthew Burrill, Harry Dean Stanton, Rance Howard, Helen Harmon, Sudie Bond, Tom Spratley', 'G', 'A family of children decide not to tell anyone their father has died, and to live on their own in the backwoods of rural North Carolina. If the state finds out they are on their own, they will be split up and sent to live in foster homes.', 'A family of children decide not to tell anyone their father has died, and to live on their own in the backwoods of rural North Carolina. If the state finds out they are on their own, they will be split up and sent to live in foster homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ftW1UzgHcxMhQg4EWUxTxRKbg5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128364'),
  ('139072592182142894', 'Where the Money Is', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Marek Kanievska, Thomas Burstyn, John S. Bartley', 'E. Max Frye, Topper Lilien, Carroll Cartwright', 'Paul Newman, Linda Fiorentino, Dermot Mulroney, Susan Barnes, Anne Pitoniak, Bruce MacVittie, Irma St. Paule, Michel Perron', 'PG-13', 'Henry Manning has come up with a new way to break out of prison: fake a stroke and get transferred to a nursing home. It''s a perfect plan, except for one thing: the woman assigned to take care of him at the nursing home, Carol Ann McKay, has a plan of her own.', 'Henry Manning has come up with a new way to break out of prison: fake a stroke and get transferred to a nursing home. It''s a perfect plan, except for one thing: the woman assigned to take care of him at the nursing home, Carol Ann McKay, has a plan of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6FODEWgJ9XDwKunGLWEmexguUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31776'),
  ('232973760474096110', 'Where the Red Fern Grows', 1974, 'Drama, Family', 'Norman Tokar, Dean Cundey', 'Douglas C. Stewart, Eleanor Lamb', 'Stewart Petersen, James Whitmore, Beverly Garland, Jack Ging, Lonny Chapman, Jill Clark, Jeanna Wilson, Bill Thurman', 'G', 'Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for two years to achieve his dream of buying two red-bone coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in life as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with his dogs, Old Dan and Little Ann.', 'Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for two years to achieve his dream of buying two red-bone coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in life as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with his dogs, Old Dan and Little Ann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eipRC5W6XyPKThZ9Z1kQGov3Np0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26514'),
  ('770097472511855311', 'Where the Red Fern Grows', 2003, 'Drama, Family', 'Lyman Dayton, Sam Pillsbury', 'Lyman Dayton, Eleanor Lamb, Douglas C. Stewart', 'Joseph Ashton, Dave Matthews, Renee Faia, Mac Davis, Kris Kristofferson, Ned Beatty, Dabney Coleman, Gary Anson', 'PG', 'Set in the Ozark Mountains during the Great Depression, Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for 2 years to achieve his dream of buying two coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in God as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with "Old Dan" and "Little Ann."', 'Set in the Ozark Mountains during the Great Depression, Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for 2 years to achieve his dream of buying two coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in God as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with "Old Dan" and "Little Ann."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUDxfnWLq73rQaa8YSHBDGx96ZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30071'),
  ('1047462335239082457', 'Where the River Flows', 2025, 'History, Crime', 'Donnie Lai, Chiang Min-chung, Leslie Chuang', 'Lyra Fu, Chang Wen-chi', 'Berant Zhu, Julia Wu, Chang Shih, Liang Hsiu-shen, Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Jack Yao, Angel Lee, Pan Yi-chun', null, 'A rebellious detective, distancing himself from his general father, teams up with a marginalized journalist to clear his father’s name after he’s framed for a brutal murder. As they investigate, they uncover a brutal truth hidden behind the era’s facade.', 'A rebellious detective, distancing himself from his general father, teams up with a marginalized journalist to clear his father’s name after he’s framed for a brutal murder. As they investigate, they uncover a brutal truth hidden behind the era’s facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzjEd0i625vVEedi4t5lfOVlNMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1268630'),
  ('327002546727059986', 'Where The Shadows Fall', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lorenzo Ambrosino, Luca Cucci, Marcella Libonati', 'Valentina Pedicini, Francesca Manieri', 'Elena Cotta, Federica Rosellini, Josafat Vagni, Lucrezia Guidone, Alberto Cracco, Danila Di Simio, Federico Maria Martini, Elena Maria De Luca', null, 'Nurse Anna and her assistant Hans work in an old folks’ home that was once the orphanage where they were imprisoned as children, and they still seem trapped in time and space.', 'Nurse Anna and her assistant Hans work in an old folks’ home that was once the orphanage where they were imprisoned as children, and they still seem trapped in time and space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZLv5SBLZozbkzuM7y0Ye2XGMic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474278'),
  ('442569517266764204', 'Where the Sidewalk Ends', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Otto Preminger, Joseph LaShelle, Lionel Newman', 'Ben Hecht', 'Dana Andrews, Gene Tierney, Bert Freed, Gary Merrill, Karl Malden, Tom Tully, Ruth Donnelly, Craig Stevens', 'NR', 'A police detective''s violent nature keeps him from being a good cop.', 'A police detective''s violent nature keeps him from being a good cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27Q0i6ZjmRnjfvegksunixnLxuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17221'),
  ('664125682653982197', 'Where the Spies Are', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Val Guest, Arthur Grant', 'Val Guest, Wolf Mankowitz', 'David Niven, Françoise Dorléac, John Le Mesurier, Cyril Cusack, Eric Pohlmann, Richard Marner, Paul Stassino, George Pravda', 'NR', 'A local doctor is recruited as a cold war spy to fulfill a very important secret mission in the Middle East, only to experience that his mission is complicated by a sexy female double agent.', 'A local doctor is recruited as a cold war spy to fulfill a very important secret mission in the Middle East, only to experience that his mission is complicated by a sexy female double agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esyyrqS1RQgfVmNxTW6KLD2z8jV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4893'),
  ('952911834014210314', 'Where the Tracks End', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Juan Pablo Ramírez, Ernesto Contreras', 'Javier Peñalosa', 'Adriana Barraza, Kaarlo Isaacs Barria, Memo Villegas, Diego Montessoro, Blanca Guerra, Frida Sofía Cruz Salinas, Ikal Paredes, Tete Espinoza', 'PG-13', 'Georgina is a teacher determined to make a difference in the lives of the children she educates in the classroom of a wagon school in rural Mexico.', 'Georgina is a teacher determined to make a difference in the lives of the children she educates in the classroom of a wagon school in rural Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Tf7bBXpLQjgFI0a5KJ1eHrxHTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121316'),
  ('524161990314260794', 'Where the Truth Lies', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, David Webb', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Kevin Bacon, Colin Firth, Alison Lohman, David Hayman, Rachel Blanchard, Maury Chaykin, Sonja Bennett, Kristin Adams', 'R', 'An ambitious reporter probes the reasons behind the sudden split of a 1950s comedy team.', 'An ambitious reporter probes the reasons behind the sudden split of a 1950s comedy team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gWQoxAmSeBaugpccnWdlg5Ov6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9729'),
  ('434622488217837509', 'Where the Wild Things Are', 1975, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Gene Deitch', null, 'Allen Swift', 'PG', 'A young boy named Max who, after dressing in his wolf costume, wreaks such havoc through his household that he is sent to bed without his supper. Max''s bedroom undergoes a mysterious transformation into a jungle environment, and he winds up sailing to an island inhabited by malicious beasts known as the "Wild Things." After successfully intimidating the creatures, Max is hailed as the king of the Wild Things and enjoys a playful romp with his subjects. However, he starts to feel lonely and decides to return home, to the Wild Things'' dismay. Upon returning to his bedroom, Max discovers a hot supper waiting for him.', 'A young boy named Max who, after dressing in his wolf costume, wreaks such havoc through his household that he is sent to bed without his supper. Max''s bedroom undergoes a mysterious transformation into a jungle environment, and he winds up sailing to an island inhabited by malicious beasts known as the "Wild Things." After successfully intimidating the creatures, Max is hailed as the king of the Wild Things and enjoys a playful romp with his subjects. However, he starts to feel lonely and decides to return home, to the Wild Things'' dismay. Upon returning to his bedroom, Max discovers a hot supper waiting for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc30FG9WPMosBAD9Ger15bpur5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100684'),
  ('847260554953545060', 'Where the Wild Things Are', 2009, 'Fantasy, Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Spike Jonze, Brad Shield, Jeffrey Thorp', 'Dave Eggers, Spike Jonze', 'Max Records, Catherine Keener, James Gandolfini, Lauren Ambrose, Catherine O''Hara, Forest Whitaker, Chris Cooper, Paul Dano', 'PG', 'Max imagines running away from his mom and sailing to a far-off land where large talking beasts—Ira, Carol, Douglas, the Bull, Judith and Alexander—crown him as their king, play rumpus, build forts and discover secret hideaways.', 'Max imagines running away from his mom and sailing to a far-off land where large talking beasts—Ira, Carol, Douglas, the Bull, Judith and Alexander—crown him as their king, play rumpus, build forts and discover secret hideaways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDFV9VEjwTUWF1s5sjOllsb70jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16523'),
  ('536096414458064935', 'Where the Wind Blows', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chin Ting-chang, Philip Yung Chi-Kwong, Meng Qing', 'Philip Yung Chi-Kwong, Oliver Yip, Lam Wai-Tung', 'Aaron Kwok, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Du Juan, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Chui Tien-You, Lam Yiu-Sing', null, 'The decades spanning story of two very different policemen who rise to power in Hong Kong during British rule, and end up at odds with both organised crime groups and the anti-corruption unit vowing to bring them down.', 'The decades spanning story of two very different policemen who rise to power in Hong Kong during British rule, and end up at odds with both organised crime groups and the anti-corruption unit vowing to bring them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0sawoBRatj2N2YzWROloIxjBep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531379'),
  ('726504311313077981', 'Where to Invade Next', 2015, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Michael Moore, Rick Rowley, Jayme Roy', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Dr. Pasi Sahlberg, Krista Kiuru, Jón Gnarr', 'R', 'To understand firsthand what the United States of America can learn from other nations, Michael Moore playfully “invades” some to see what they have to offer.', 'To understand firsthand what the United States of America can learn from other nations, Michael Moore playfully “invades” some to see what they have to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58gW2Uty2cAsgBgwC58vT2Z9SVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352208'),
  ('1108051402808049229', 'Where To?', 1957, 'Drama', 'Georges Nasser, Rodrigue Dahdah', 'Halim Fares, Georges Nasser, Youssef Habchi Achkar', 'Laura Azar, Tannous Dik, Chakib Khoury, Mounir Nader, Raouf Rawi, Jean Sfeir, Nazha Younes', null, 'A family lives poorly in a village in the Lebanese mountain. One day the father abandons his family and leaves for Brazil, considered an Eldorado by a great number of his compatriots. Twenty years pass. The mother raised her children with great difficulty: the elder has a family and the younger one is getting ready to immigrate to Brazil. One day a ragged old man arrives to the village.', 'A family lives poorly in a village in the Lebanese mountain. One day the father abandons his family and leaves for Brazil, considered an Eldorado by a great number of his compatriots. Twenty years pass. The mother raised her children with great difficulty: the elder has a family and the younger one is getting ready to immigrate to Brazil. One day a ragged old man arrives to the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYjQrNLQtWtptekLxYAtTQKTpfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199199'),
  ('201469390796624294', 'Where We Belong', 2019, 'Drama', 'Umpornpol Yugala, Kongdej Jaturanrasmee, Tippawan Narintorn', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee', 'Jennis Oprasert, Praewa Suthamphong, Jiradapa Intajak, Isarapa Thawatpakdee, Milin Watinthanakit, Sumitra Duangkaew, Jidarpha Chamchooy, Patchanan Jiajirachote', null, 'A teenager creates a checklist to complete before she studies abroad and realizes that her toughest task is leaving behind her best friend.', 'A teenager creates a checklist to complete before she studies abroad and realizes that her toughest task is leaving behind her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DsS7Cc1OMs78vWEve03kebP9uK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609778'),
  ('228179339898185616', 'Where Were You When the Lights Went Out?', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Hy Averback', 'Everett Freeman, Karl Tunberg', 'Doris Day, Terry-Thomas, Patrick O''Neal, Lola Albright, Steve Allen, Jim Backus, Robert Morse, Morgan Freeman', null, 'When the Great Northeast Blackout of 1965 hit, millions of people were left in the dark, including Waldo Zane, a New York executive in the process of stealing a fortune from his company, and two people whose paths he''s destined to cross, Broadway actress Margaret Garrison and her husband, Peter.', 'When the Great Northeast Blackout of 1965 hit, millions of people were left in the dark, including Waldo Zane, a New York executive in the process of stealing a fortune from his company, and two people whose paths he''s destined to cross, Broadway actress Margaret Garrison and her husband, Peter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuYNfNNgvqyeT6dkAWdGRXhTdUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42687'),
  ('480178057932254347', 'Where Your Heart Belongs', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Christie Will Wolf', 'Christie Will Wolf, Fiona Hirst, Kathryn Hudson', 'Jen Lilley, Christopher Russell, Jill Morrison, Robert Wisden, Nelson Wong, Latonya Williams, Benita Ha, Devon Alexander', 'G', 'Mackenzie Sullivan is a New York-based marketing executive struggling to keep her clients. When she returns home to a rural maple farm to help her best friend plan her wedding in just two weeks, Mackenzie learns the hard way that the love and support of family and true friends means more than she''d imagined.', 'Mackenzie Sullivan is a New York-based marketing executive struggling to keep her clients. When she returns home to a rural maple farm to help her best friend plan her wedding in just two weeks, Mackenzie learns the hard way that the love and support of family and true friends means more than she''d imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgy3W0o48YhNvZiGTOLITryzptN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805761'),
  ('687520090650649769', 'Where''d You Go, Bernadette', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Linklater, Brittany Hites, Vicky Boone', 'Holly Gent, Richard Linklater, Vincent Palmo Jr.', 'Cate Blanchett, Billy Crudup, Kristen Wiig, Judy Greer, Laurence Fishburne, Emma Nelson, Troian Bellisario, James Urbaniak', 'PG-13', 'When architect-turned-recluse Bernadette Fox goes missing prior to a family trip to Antarctica, her 15-year-old daughter, Bee, goes on a quest with Bernadette''s husband to find her.', 'When architect-turned-recluse Bernadette Fox goes missing prior to a family trip to Antarctica, her 15-year-old daughter, Bee, goes on a quest with Bernadette''s husband to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BziuuZULnGmTRLthEty1QdKSEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405177'),
  ('203447668571720879', 'Where''s Firuze?', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Ezel Akay, Hayk Kirakosyan, Figen Ermek Özçorlu', 'Levent Kazak, Özcan Deniz', 'Haluk Bilginer, Özcan Deniz, Demet Akbağ, Cem Özer, Ruhi Sarı, Ragıp Savaş, Şebnem Dönmez, Uğur Uludağ', null, 'Hayri and Orhan are two music producers head over heels in debt. In an attempt to find the next big thing to turn the business around, they contact Ferhat, a gastarbeiter in Germany, and desperately bring him to Istanbul to sign him. As they are struggling to find the necessary funds to promote Ferhat''s debut album, a mysterious rich woman named Firuze shows up and starts supporting them. The future now seems bright, but things are not always what they seem...', 'Hayri and Orhan are two music producers head over heels in debt. In an attempt to find the next big thing to turn the business around, they contact Ferhat, a gastarbeiter in Germany, and desperately bring him to Istanbul to sign him. As they are struggling to find the necessary funds to promote Ferhat''s debut album, a mysterious rich woman named Firuze shows up and starts supporting them. The future now seems bright, but things are not always what they seem...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3tJPs1jRKZ3Dofliw07bVod0Yx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89111'),
  ('910233555568052410', 'Where''s Marlowe?', 1998, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Greg Gardiner, Daniel Pyne, Christina Fong', 'John Mankiewicz, Daniel Pyne', 'Miguel Ferrer, John Livingston, Yasiin Bey, John Slattery, Allison Dean, Clayton Rohner, Elizabeth Schofield, Barbara Howard', 'R', 'After making a disastrous 3-hour documentary on New York City''s water supply, two young filmmakers focus on the goings-on of life in the LA offices of Boone and Murphy, private investigators. Cheating husbands and missing dogs fail to bring in the big bucks, however, and after sleeping with the wife of one of their clients, Murphy leaves. To stop Boone from having to close down the business, the filmmakers must resort to a more hands-on approach in the investigations to ensure the completion of their movie.', 'After making a disastrous 3-hour documentary on New York City''s water supply, two young filmmakers focus on the goings-on of life in the LA offices of Boone and Murphy, private investigators. Cheating husbands and missing dogs fail to bring in the big bucks, however, and after sleeping with the wife of one of their clients, Murphy leaves. To stop Boone from having to close down the business, the filmmakers must resort to a more hands-on approach in the investigations to ensure the completion of their movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBYQEQidyOkL5VI59FRHVmoMC4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144953'),
  ('1110208522248002322', 'Where''s Officer Tuba?', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Ma Koon-Wah, Ricky Lau', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Joey Wong, David Chiang Da-Wei, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Paul Chun Pui, Paul Chang Chung, Woo Fung', null, 'Tuba is a fainthearted cop who prefers to play in the brass section of the police band to pounding the streets. One day, he finds himself caught up in an extortion case with trigger-happy detective Rambo Chow. When Rambo gets fatally wounded, he makes a half-hearted vow to avenge his death. Tuba is more than a little surprised when Rambo''s spirit returns to make sure the timid cop makes good on his promise. Backed up by his hotshot partner Cheung, Tuba eventually summons the gumption to track down the baddies.', 'Tuba is a fainthearted cop who prefers to play in the brass section of the police band to pounding the streets. One day, he finds himself caught up in an extortion case with trigger-happy detective Rambo Chow. When Rambo gets fatally wounded, he makes a half-hearted vow to avenge his death. Tuba is more than a little surprised when Rambo''s spirit returns to make sure the timid cop makes good on his promise. Backed up by his hotshot partner Cheung, Tuba eventually summons the gumption to track down the baddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfHwZdnUAqSCrS7ByTga4KQLoLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112219'),
  ('969122853052910429', 'Where''s Picone?', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Nanni Loy, Claudio Cirillo', 'Nanni Loy, Elvio Porta', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Lina Sastri, Aldo Giuffrè, Leo Gullotta, Marzio Honorato, Carlo Croccolo, Clelia Rondinella, Armando Marra', null, 'During a debate in Naples'' town hall in the early 1980s, Pasquale Picone, a former steel-worker who has recently lost his job, sets himself on fire in front of the Municipal Council.', 'During a debate in Naples'' town hall in the early 1980s, Pasquale Picone, a former steel-worker who has recently lost his job, sets himself on fire in front of the Municipal Council.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aveNWZo0jvrUtw1tbQvnZx0SBIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58070'),
  ('1133650470973614270', 'Where’s Poppa?', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Carl Reiner, Jack Priestley', 'Robert Klane', 'George Segal, Ruth Gordon, Ron Leibman, Trish Van Devere, Barnard Hughes, Vincent Gardenia, Rae Allen, Paul Sorvino', 'R', 'When New York attorney Gordon Hocheiser meets Louise Callan, the girl of his dreams, he schemes to eliminate his aging, senile mother, even though he promised his late father that he''d always take care of her. He fears that his batty mom''s eccentricities will shortly lead to Louise''s departure.', 'When New York attorney Gordon Hocheiser meets Louise Callan, the girl of his dreams, he schemes to eliminate his aging, senile mother, even though he promised his late father that he''d always take care of her. He fears that his batty mom''s eccentricities will shortly lead to Louise''s departure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXRK08Ml1WcBOVcaPHZu1Kqxdp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42569'),
