  ('798182027063166880', 'Which Brings Me to You', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Hutchings, Karina Silva', 'Keith Bunin', 'Lucy Hale, Nat Wolff, John Gallagher Jr., Britne Oldford, Genevieve Angelson, Alexander Hodge, Ward Horton, Marceline Hugot', 'PG-13', 'Two romantic burnouts, Jane and Will, are immediately drawn to each other at a mutual friend’s wedding. After a disastrous hookup in the coatroom, the two spend the next 24 hours together, trading candid confessions of messy histories and heartbreak, on the off chance that this fling might be the real thing.', 'Two romantic burnouts, Jane and Will, are immediately drawn to each other at a mutual friend’s wedding. After a disastrous hookup in the coatroom, the two spend the next 24 hours together, trading candid confessions of messy histories and heartbreak, on the off chance that this fling might be the real thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gspoAZ5p7G7D83OU9UFOmKICejw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975043'),
