  ('1040572231512116952', 'White Girl', 2016, 'Drama', 'Elizabeth Wood, Michael Simmonds, Jessica Daniels', 'Elizabeth Wood', 'Morgan Saylor, Brian Marc, Justin Bartha, Chris Noth, Bobbi Salvör Menuez, Adrian Martinez, Anthony Ramos, Ralph Rodriguez', 'NR', 'Summer, New York City. A college girl falls hard for a guy she just met. After a night of partying goes wrong, she goes to wild extremes to get him back.', 'Summer, New York City. A college girl falls hard for a guy she just met. After a night of partying goes wrong, she goes to wild extremes to get him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kng43UXWxdYAkst1ggnX4PfOe5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336011'),
  ('30497402061849410', 'White God', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kornél Mundruczó, Marcell Rév', 'Kata Wéber, Kornél Mundruczó, Viktória Petrányi', 'Zsófia Psotta, Luke, Body, Sándor Zsótér, Szabolcs Thuróczy, Lili Monori, László Gálffi, Lili Horvát', 'R', '13 year old Lili fights to protect her dog Hagen, and is devastated when her father sets Hagen free on the streets. Still innocently believing love can conquer any difficulty, Lili sets out to save her dog. Failing in his desperate efforts to find his beloved owner, Hagen joins a canine revolt leading a revolution against their human abusers.', '13 year old Lili fights to protect her dog Hagen, and is devastated when her father sets Hagen free on the streets. Still innocently believing love can conquer any difficulty, Lili sets out to save her dog. Failing in his desperate efforts to find his beloved owner, Hagen joins a canine revolt leading a revolution against their human abusers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jT9IjPwA5aIYlgvC55VxJOLc0sI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267999'),
