  ('1110779263295150510', 'White Wolves', 1969, 'Drama, Western, Adventure', 'Konrad Petzold, Eberhard Borkmann, Boško Bošković', 'Günter Karl', 'Gojko Mitić, Horst Schulze, Barbara Brylska, Holger Mahlich, Slobodan Dimitrijević, Slobodan Velimirović, Helmut Schreiber, Fred Delmare', null, 'Farsighted Falcon, chief of the Lakota, seeks refuge in the Black Hills with his wife Blue Hair and two warriors, sole survivors of their tribe. When they are attacked by the outlaw Bashan, Falcon strikes out for the town of Tanglewood to take on Bashan''s boss, mining magnate Harrington.', 'Farsighted Falcon, chief of the Lakota, seeks refuge in the Black Hills with his wife Blue Hair and two warriors, sole survivors of their tribe. When they are attacked by the outlaw Bashan, Falcon strikes out for the town of Tanglewood to take on Bashan''s boss, mining magnate Harrington.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja6Uxh0vhCOHb3IU8V2jNvhl2VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5036'),
  ('236683143970217039', 'White Zombie', 1932, 'Horror', 'Victor Halperin, Arthur Martinelli, William Cody', null, 'Bela Lugosi, Madge Bellamy, John Harron, Robert Frazer, Joseph Cawthorn, Frederick Peters, George Burr Macannan, Brandon Hurst', 'NR', 'A wealthy landowner living in Haiti convinces a sorcerer to lure the woman he has fallen for away from her fiancé. The madman later betrays their agreement by keeping the woman for himself…As a zombie.', 'A wealthy landowner living in Haiti convinces a sorcerer to lure the woman he has fallen for away from her fiancé. The madman later betrays their agreement by keeping the woman for himself…As a zombie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5DnfWHGeCExlweIFF4JOHKyx3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26860'),
  ('895980013669879426', 'White: Melody of Death', 2011, 'Horror, Music, Mystery', 'Kim Gok, Kim Sun, Lee Eui-haeng', 'Kim Sun, Kim Gok', 'Ham Eun-jung, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Maydoni, Choi Ah-ra, Byeon Jung-su, Kim Young-min, Jin Se-yeon, Lee Jun-ho', null, 'When each member of Pink Dolls falls into a horrible accident, Eun-ju realizes that their hit song "White" is cursed and attempts to reveal the secret.', 'When each member of Pink Dolls falls into a horrible accident, Eun-ju realizes that their hit song "White" is cursed and attempts to reveal the secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xNTRiFUqb6H8tiu7k7EEeWruzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74860'),
  ('65971139118114359', 'Whiteboyz', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Marc Levin, Mark Benjamin', 'Garth Belcon, Marc Levin, Richard Stratton', 'Danny Hoch, Piper Perabo, Dr. Dre, Fat Joe, Eugene Byrd, Dash Mihok, Mark Webber, William N. Mayberry', 'R', 'In a virtually all-white Iowa town, Flip daydreams of being a hip-hop star, hanging with Snoop Doggy Dogg and Dr. Dre. He practices in front of a mirror and with his two pals, James and Trevor. He talks Black slang, he dresses Black. He''s also a wannabe pusher, selling flour as cocaine. And while he talks about "keeping it real," he hardly notices real life around him: his father''s been laid off, his mother uses Food Stamps, his girlfriend is pregnant, James may be psychotic, one of his friends (one of the town''s few Black kids) is preparing for college, and, on a trip to Chicago to try to buy drugs, the cops shoot real bullets. What will it take for Flip to get real?', 'In a virtually all-white Iowa town, Flip daydreams of being a hip-hop star, hanging with Snoop Doggy Dogg and Dr. Dre. He practices in front of a mirror and with his two pals, James and Trevor. He talks Black slang, he dresses Black. He''s also a wannabe pusher, selling flour as cocaine. And while he talks about "keeping it real," he hardly notices real life around him: his father''s been laid off, his mother uses Food Stamps, his girlfriend is pregnant, James may be psychotic, one of his friends (one of the town''s few Black kids) is preparing for college, and, on a trip to Chicago to try to buy drugs, the cops shoot real bullets. What will it take for Flip to get real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5hHP3JaD6wak6ovkuZL7Ggqzyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40879'),
  ('142155757419033793', 'Whiteout', 2000, 'Action, Thriller', 'Setsuro Wakamatsu, Hideo Yamamoto, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Yuji Oda, Nanako Matsushima, Koichi Sato, Ken Ishiguro, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Katsuo Nakamura, Mitsuru Hirata, Saishin Kudo', null, 'A group of terrorists has taken hold of the largest dam in Japan. They also capture the workers as hostages, and demanded $5 billion yen from the government with a 24 hour deadline in exchange for the lives of the hostages. To make things more complicated, there was a snowstorm and no one can get in or out near the area. Fortunately, the terrorists did not capture Togashi, the dam controller, and he is the only person who can rescue those hostages from the terrorists...', 'A group of terrorists has taken hold of the largest dam in Japan. They also capture the workers as hostages, and demanded $5 billion yen from the government with a 24 hour deadline in exchange for the lives of the hostages. To make things more complicated, there was a snowstorm and no one can get in or out near the area. Fortunately, the terrorists did not capture Togashi, the dam controller, and he is the only person who can rescue those hostages from the terrorists...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gHfA4VGr4AVO9Lt3YkFYOZ5Mi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69009'),
  ('1137097790009485437', 'Whiteout', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christopher Soos, Dominic Sena, Val Kharitonashvili', 'Carey Hayes, Jon Hoeber, Erich Hoeber', 'Kate Beckinsale, Gabriel Macht, Tom Skerritt, Columbus Short, Shawn Doyle, Alex O''Loughlin, Joel S. Keller, Jesse Todd', 'R', 'The only U.S. Marshal assigned to Antarctica, Carrie Stetko will soon leave the harsh environment behind for good – in three days, the sun will set and the Amundsen-Scott Research Station will shut down for the long winter. When a body is discovered out on the open ice, Carrie''s investigation into the continent''s first homicide plunges her deep into a mystery that may cost her her own life.', 'The only U.S. Marshal assigned to Antarctica, Carrie Stetko will soon leave the harsh environment behind for good – in three days, the sun will set and the Amundsen-Scott Research Station will shut down for the long winter. When a body is discovered out on the open ice, Carrie''s investigation into the continent''s first homicide plunges her deep into a mystery that may cost her her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkXXA3353MX60B8PRSkTGRabxXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22787'),
  ('1046705608730733622', 'Whiteout', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Derek Barnes', 'Derek Barnes, Douglas Nyback, James McDougall', 'James McDougall, Douglas Nyback, Joel Labelle, Ian Matthews, Dru Viergever, Jonathan Goad, Jonathan Whittaker', 'R', 'After escaping a Russian labor camp, three men must overcome the treacherous wilderness and each other, as their journey home turns into a brutal fight for survival.', 'After escaping a Russian labor camp, three men must overcome the treacherous wilderness and each other, as their journey home turns into a brutal fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x84psre99S5nqaFatB8wtHVXFYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113951'),
  ('892652075909300794', 'Whitetail', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Nanouk Leopold, Frank van den Eeden, Louise Kiely, Thyrza Ging', 'Nanouk Leopold', 'Natasha O''Keeffe, Andrew Bennett, Aaron McCusker, Rory Nolan, Simone Kirby', null, 'Jen has carried the guilt of a tragic accident since her teens - now, the past catches up, forcing her to find a way forward.', 'Jen has carried the guilt of a tragic accident since her teens - now, the past catches up, forcing her to find a way forward.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Ft2pGZGVIyzS0FnZyTyrsWakMve3.jpg', 'plex:movie:whitetail-2026'),
  ('157277019587245835', 'Whitey', 1980, 'Drama', 'Robbe De Hert, Walther van den Ende', 'Fernand Auwera, Louis Paul Boon, Robbe De Hert', 'Clerckx Eric, Willy Vandermeulen, Blanka Heirman, Paul ''s Jongers, Jos Verbist, Magda De Winter, Paul-Emile Van Royen, Martha Dewachter', null, 'The second movie version, now in color, of Flemish (heimat-)author Ernest Claes'' classical novel, titled after the nickname (Dutch ''the White'', referring to a blond male) of the main character. The smart but naughty farmhands son''s eternal mischief, pranks and disobedience drive his elders (especially teachers, family and father''s grumpy employer, a rich farmer, but also neighbors and even the kind curate whose liturgical server he is) and classmates to despair in a time when a boy''s punishment was still inevitable, swift and often severe; thus when his mother catches him skinny dipping she takes all his clothes home, forcing him to a long walk of shame, dreading dad''s wrath all the way. This version also stresses the story''s social and Flamingant aspects.', 'The second movie version, now in color, of Flemish (heimat-)author Ernest Claes'' classical novel, titled after the nickname (Dutch ''the White'', referring to a blond male) of the main character. The smart but naughty farmhands son''s eternal mischief, pranks and disobedience drive his elders (especially teachers, family and father''s grumpy employer, a rich farmer, but also neighbors and even the kind curate whose liturgical server he is) and classmates to despair in a time when a boy''s punishment was still inevitable, swift and often severe; thus when his mother catches him skinny dipping she takes all his clothes home, forcing him to a long walk of shame, dreading dad''s wrath all the way. This version also stresses the story''s social and Flamingant aspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4alMRfBtdnmfVfIOq2AORcHc8Mo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199916'),
  ('345895365531681158', 'Whitey: United States of America v. James J. Bulger', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Joe Berlinger, Robert Richman, Étienne Sauret', null, 'Stephen Rakes, James ''Whitey'' Bulger, Tommy Donahue, David Boeri', 'R', 'A documentary that captures the sensational trial of infamous gangster James ''Whitey'' Bulger, using the legal proceedings as a springboard to explore allegations of corruption within the highest levels of law enforcement. Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Joe Berlinger examines Bulger''s relationship with the FBI and Department of Justice that allowed him to reign over a criminal empire in Boston for decades.', 'A documentary that captures the sensational trial of infamous gangster James ''Whitey'' Bulger, using the legal proceedings as a springboard to explore allegations of corruption within the highest levels of law enforcement. Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Joe Berlinger examines Bulger''s relationship with the FBI and Department of Justice that allowed him to reign over a criminal empire in Boston for decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNfl6Oh6yO46mOVo0NdQZpEg3Ic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246743'),
  ('826329579255788166', 'Whitney', 2015, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Angela Bassett, Anastas N. Michos', 'Shem Bitterman', 'Yaya DaCosta, Arlen Escarpeta, Yolonda Ross, Suzzanne Douglas, Mark Rolston, Wesley Jonathan, Hampton Fluker, Reign Morton', null, 'Chronicles Whitney Houston''s rise to fame and turbulent relationship with husband Bobby Brown.', 'Chronicles Whitney Houston''s rise to fame and turbulent relationship with husband Bobby Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXcO796Kp9cmHMz5BiOlYsWBeNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319096'),
  ('638741296867267194', 'Whitney', 2018, 'Music, Documentary', 'Kevin Macdonald, Nelson Hume', 'Kevin Macdonald', 'Whitney Houston, Bobby Brown, Cissy Houston, Clive Davis, L.A. Reid, Kevin Costner, Dionne Warwick, Bobbi Kristina Brown', 'R', 'Examines the life and career of singer Whitney Houston. Features never-before-seen archival footage, exclusive recordings, rare performances and interviews with the people who knew her best.', 'Examines the life and career of singer Whitney Houston. Features never-before-seen archival footage, exclusive recordings, rare performances and interviews with the people who knew her best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1c6dTycYBMZs2T1wKA6bknLLa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507256'),
  ('796596117040464889', 'Whitney Houston: I Wanna Dance with Somebody', 2022, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Barry Ackroyd, Kim Taylor-Coleman, Alyssa Boffoli', 'Anthony McCarten', 'Naomi Ackie, Ashton Sanders, Stanley Tucci, Nafessa Williams, Lance A. Williams, Tamara Tunie, Clarke Peters, Daniel Washington', 'PG-13', 'The joyous, emotional, heartbreaking celebration of the life and music of Whitney Houston, the greatest female R&B pop vocalist of all time. Tracking her journey from obscurity to musical superstardom.', 'The joyous, emotional, heartbreaking celebration of the life and music of Whitney Houston, the greatest female R&B pop vocalist of all time. Tracking her journey from obscurity to musical superstardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oodPJ3Op1pWBhnEFyw5fampRCWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696157'),
  ('1052223665160522423', 'Whitney: Can I Be Me', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield, Rudi Dolezal', 'Nick Broomfield', 'Whitney Houston, Cissy Houston, Bobbi Kristina Brown, Bobby Brown, Robyn Crawford, John Russell Houston Jr., David Roberts, Clive Davis', null, 'The life and tragic death of Whitney Houston.', 'The life and tragic death of Whitney Houston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gDcXT1bNvSpFYeEXwqdCuKC5P1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448449'),
  ('210922701568988182', 'Whity', 1971, 'Western, Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Harry Baer', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Günther Kaufmann, Ulli Lommel, Harry Baer, Hanna Schygulla, Ron Randell, Helga Ballhaus, Katrin Schaake, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', null, '"Whity" is the mulatto butler of the dysfunctional Nicholson family in the American Southwest in 1878. The father, Ben Nicholson, has an attractive young wife, Katherine, and two sons by a previous marriage: the homosexual Frank and the feeble-minded Davy. Whity tries to carry out all their orders, however demeaning, until various family members ask him to kill some of the others.', '"Whity" is the mulatto butler of the dysfunctional Nicholson family in the American Southwest in 1878. The father, Ben Nicholson, has an attractive young wife, Katherine, and two sons by a previous marriage: the homosexual Frank and the feeble-minded Davy. Whity tries to carry out all their orders, however demeaning, until various family members ask him to kill some of the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tNrHnRgIezx88vU01bA9iKDUVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105757'),
  ('803080363495610871', 'Who Am I', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Nikolaus Summerer, Baran bo Odar', 'Jantje Friese, Baran bo Odar', 'Tom Schilling, Elyas M''Barek, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Antoine Monot Jr., Hannah Herzsprung, Trine Dyrholm, Stephan Kampwirth, Leopold Hornung', 'NR', 'Benjamin, a young German computer whiz, is invited to join a subversive hacker group that wants to be noticed on the world''s stage.', 'Benjamin, a young German computer whiz, is invited to join a subversive hacker group that wants to be noticed on the world''s stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR3tbNzJMJmCKS5O5fanU9yxIOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284427'),
  ('1082098971675980061', 'Who Am I This Time?', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Neal Miller', 'Christopher Walken, Susan Sarandon, Robert Ridgely, Dorothy Patterson, Caitlin Hart, Aaron Freeman, Mike Bacarella, Ron Parady', 'PG', 'Harry is a shy hardware store employee. But whenever he takes a part in a local amateur theater production, he becomes the part completely--while on stage. Helene is new in town, a lonely itinerant telephone company employee. On a whim, she auditions for and gets the part of Stella to Harry''s Stanley when the theater group performs A Streetcar Named Desire. Before anyone realizes the growing affection between Helene and Stanley, she falls deeply in love with the sexy brute, not knowing what the real man is like.', 'Harry is a shy hardware store employee. But whenever he takes a part in a local amateur theater production, he becomes the part completely--while on stage. Helene is new in town, a lonely itinerant telephone company employee. On a whim, she auditions for and gets the part of Stella to Harry''s Stanley when the theater group performs A Streetcar Named Desire. Before anyone realizes the growing affection between Helene and Stanley, she falls deeply in love with the sexy brute, not knowing what the real man is like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81KzQ4AGbDmO6NtzNIwlIC8VQHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134743'),
  ('176035813701693705', 'Who Am I?', 1998, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Poon Hang-Sang, Jackie Chan, Benny Chan Muk-Sing', 'Jackie Chan, Lee Reynolds, Susan Chan Suk-Yin', 'Jackie Chan, Michelle Ferre, Mirai Yamamoto, Ron Smerczak, Ed Nelson, Ton Pompert, Glory Simon, Fred van Ditmarsch', null, 'A group of covert CIA operatives trailing a potential new energy source are double-crossed by corrupt agent Morgan, who causes a helicopter crash in remote South Africa. The sole survivor, suffering severe amnesia, is nursed to recovery by a kindly native tribe who call him "Whoami" after the question he keeps asking. With the help of a mysterious reporter Christine, Whoami pieces together his past and tracks the turncoat agent and his criminal cohorts.', 'A group of covert CIA operatives trailing a potential new energy source are double-crossed by corrupt agent Morgan, who causes a helicopter crash in remote South Africa. The sole survivor, suffering severe amnesia, is nursed to recovery by a kindly native tribe who call him "Whoami" after the question he keeps asking. With the help of a mysterious reporter Christine, Whoami pieces together his past and tracks the turncoat agent and his criminal cohorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YDKLbBmWGpxG5bO3TBawtNNOAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8697'),
  ('132996667864375842', 'Who Are You, Charlie Brown?', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Michael Bonfiglio', 'Michael Bonfiglio, Marcella Steingart', 'Lupita Nyong''o, Tyler James Nathan, Terry McGurrin, Isabella Leo, Holly Gorski, Hattie Kragten, Isis Moore, Wyatt White', 'G', 'Lupita Nyong''o narrates a documentary about Peanuts and its creator, Charles M. Schulz. Famous fans—including Drew Barrymore, Kevin Smith, and Al Roker—share its influence on them, and a new animated story finds Charlie Brown on a quest.', 'Lupita Nyong''o narrates a documentary about Peanuts and its creator, Charles M. Schulz. Famous fans—including Drew Barrymore, Kevin Smith, and Al Roker—share its influence on them, and a new animated story finds Charlie Brown on a quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqQfs98qAEwirmuZM48JH6ydQjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836919'),
  ('503237778916741667', 'Who Are You, Polly Maggoo?', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama', 'William Klein, Pierre Grunstein, Alain Franchet', 'William Klein', 'Dorothy McGowan, Jean Rochefort, Sami Frey, Grayson Hall, Philippe Noiret, Alice Sapritch, Delphine Seyrig, Fernando Arrabal', null, 'A model tells a television crew about her dreams of a life with prince charming all while fending off the lecherous advances of a horde of men.', 'A model tells a television crew about her dreams of a life with prince charming all while fending off the lecherous advances of a horde of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7n7KBjh1eIN5dztryxljSDyZLMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66953'),
  ('1049121319143667821', 'Who Are You?', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Pakphum Wongjinda, Tiwa Moeithaisong', 'Eakasit Thairaat, Pakphum Wongjinda', 'Sinjai Plengpanich, Kanya Rattanapetch, Teerapong Liaorakwong, Khomapat Attaya, Pongpitch Preechaborisuthikul, Chatsoroth Thanuthipayakul, Patipan Supsawatdichot, Salina Rattana', null, 'Nida is a single mother who takes care of her anti-social son who has locked himself in his room for five years. The only way to communicate with her son is to write on a piece of paper and slip it under the door. But, when outsiders start to get curious about what is going on behind the door of her son''s room, a series of terrible events starts to happen.', 'Nida is a single mother who takes care of her anti-social son who has locked himself in his room for five years. The only way to communicate with her son is to write on a piece of paper and slip it under the door. But, when outsiders start to get curious about what is going on behind the door of her son''s room, a series of terrible events starts to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2dXs0vWkrilIe2XxKC62yIHGyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137618'),
  ('1024773062470497279', 'Who by Fire', 2024, 'Drama', 'Philippe Lesage, Balthazar Lab', 'Philippe Lesage', 'Noah Parker, Arieh Worthalter, Paul Ahmarani, Aurélia Arandi-Longpré, Antoine Marchand-Gagnon, Sophie Desmarais, Guillaume Laurin, Carlo Harrietha', 'NR', 'Seventeen-year-old Jeff stays at film director Blake Cadieux''s wilderness lodge after being invited by friend Max''s family. When strange events occur, Jeff suspects something is amiss with the director and his retreat.', 'Seventeen-year-old Jeff stays at film director Blake Cadieux''s wilderness lodge after being invited by friend Max''s family. When strange events occur, Jeff suspects something is amiss with the director and his retreat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j9YuZLOOBF4tBWRgN6EqWewViO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001432'),
  ('697133457623656661', 'Who Can Kill a Child?', 1976, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador, Manuel Pérez, José Luis Alcaine', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador', 'Lewis Fiander, Prunella Ransome, Antonio Iranzo, Miguel Narros, María Luisa Arias, Marisa Porcel, Juan Cazalilla, Luis Ciges', null, 'A couple of English tourists arrive at the island of Almanzora, off the Spanish Mediterranean coast, where they discover that there are no adults in a small fishing village, only some children who stare at them and smile mysteriously.', 'A couple of English tourists arrive at the island of Almanzora, off the Spanish Mediterranean coast, where they discover that there are no adults in a small fishing village, only some children who stare at them and smile mysteriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLHgyZv6IRtMFFuglDFQIW31tos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43751'),
  ('1101011856420633089', 'Who Cares: Anatomy of a Delivery Boy', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Claude Faraldo, Robin Davis, Anne Mirman', 'Claude Faraldo', 'Marie Dubois, Julian Negulesco, Paul Crauchet, Marie-Hélène Breillat, Mamadou Diop, Michel Fortin, Annick Fougery, Lara Lane', null, 'Experiencing something of a mid-life crisis after his beloved son marries and moves out, a factory worker makes some drastic changes in his life, moves in with the boy and his wife, and sets them all on the path to a communal lifestyle.', 'Experiencing something of a mid-life crisis after his beloved son marries and moves out, a factory worker makes some drastic changes in his life, moves in with the boy and his wife, and sets them all on the path to a communal lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya40CsCSiEYF8qriq79Vgt6zqpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65609'),
  ('741311989844594883', 'Who Could Kill a Sweet Old Lady', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Tom Shell, Samuel Calvin, Justin Jayne, Ricki Maslar', 'Sarah-Doe Osborne, Sarah Doe Osborne', 'Alexandra Harris, Laurie Cummings, Phillip Andre Botello, David Greyson, Jobie James', 'TV-PG', 'A compassionate nurse moves in to care for a wealthy elderly woman who fears murderous plots against her life. When strange events begin to unfold, the nurse must determine if her patient''s paranoia is justified before time runs out.', 'A compassionate nurse moves in to care for a wealthy elderly woman who fears murderous plots against her life. When strange events begin to unfold, the nurse must determine if her patient''s paranoia is justified before time runs out.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs7ilq3jvGO2wjhLDxRZXBGXapKt.jpg', 'plex:movie:who-could-kill-a-sweet-old-lady'),
  ('1092395021152422564', 'Who Dares Wins', 1982, 'Action, Thriller', 'Phil Meheux, Jim Morahan, Chris Brock', 'Reginald Rose', 'Lewis Collins, Judy Davis, Richard Widmark, Edward Woodward, Robert Webber, Kenneth Griffith, Maurice Roëves, Ingrid Pitt', 'R', 'When SAS Captain Peter Skellen is thrown out of the service for gross misconduct due to unnecessary violence and bullying, he is soon recruited by The People''s Lobby, a fanatical group aiming to hold several US dignitaries hostage. But Skellen''s dismissal is a front to enable him to get close to the terrorist group. Can he get close enough to stop the Lobby from creating an international incident?', 'When SAS Captain Peter Skellen is thrown out of the service for gross misconduct due to unnecessary violence and bullying, he is soon recruited by The People''s Lobby, a fanatical group aiming to hold several US dignitaries hostage. But Skellen''s dismissal is a front to enable him to get close to the terrorist group. Can he get close enough to stop the Lobby from creating an international incident?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1WlefWWKtPjTfWx7GXEQykQnMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19322'),
  ('1033199698687559911', 'Who Do I Gotta Kill?', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Frank Rainone, Adam Kimmel, Danielle Schillingthorpe', 'James Lorinz, Frank Rainone, Rocco Simonelli', 'James Lorinz, Tony Darrow, John Costelloe, Richard Bright, Sandra Bullock, Stephen Lee, Janice Steinmetz, Sandy Colosimo', 'R', 'A struggling writer takes a job for his mobster uncle in order to obtain first-hand material for a book on conspiracy plots and the JFK assassination. They often say that a good writer lives what he writes, but what happens when the life that the writer is living could likely get him killed?', 'A struggling writer takes a job for his mobster uncle in order to obtain first-hand material for a book on conspiracy plots and the JFK assassination. They often say that a good writer lives what he writes, but what happens when the life that the writer is living could likely get him killed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQw4tC4onERymDQ6kESTqI9DC7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54052'),
  ('1145826973291026717', 'Who Do You Think You''re Fooling?', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Mike White', 'Mike White', 'Chan Chi-Fai, Joseph Chi Chiong Chavez, Harvey Keitel, Tim Roth, Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Lawrence Tierney', null, 'A short film that took director Quentin Tarantino to task for failing to credit director Ringo Lam''s City on Fire (1987 film) as an influence upon the making of Reservoir Dogs. It screened at the New York Underground Film Festival.', 'A short film that took director Quentin Tarantino to task for failing to credit director Ringo Lam''s City on Fire (1987 film) as an influence upon the making of Reservoir Dogs. It screened at the New York Underground Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWmJGzpLrEflVdNvQjXKTmuC3B8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188461'),
  ('764489804368023133', 'Who Done It?', 1942, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Erle C. Kenton, Bernard B. Brown, Howard Christie', 'Stanley Roberts, Edmund Joseph, John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Patric Knowles, Louise Allbritton, Mary Wickes, William Gargan, William Bendix, Thomas Gomez', 'NR', 'Two dumb soda jerks dream of writing radio mysteries. When they try to pitch an idea at a radio station, they end up in the middle of a real murder when the station owner is killed during a broadcast.', 'Two dumb soda jerks dream of writing radio mysteries. When they try to pitch an idea at a radio station, they end up in the middle of a real murder when the station owner is killed during a broadcast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6frjQZNXvSbx6LKzp1S9L3yM0wG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49092'),
  ('109581415606663105', 'Who Done It?', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Edward Bernds, Ira H. Morgan', 'Edward Bernds', 'Shemp Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Christine McIntyre, Ralph Dunn, Charles T. Knight, Emil Sitka, Duke York', null, 'The stooges are private detectives looking for a missing millionaire. They wander around the millionaire''s spooky mansion confronting various crooks and a dangerous dame. The stooges vanquish the crooks (Shemp uses his "trusty shovel") and find the missing man.', 'The stooges are private detectives looking for a missing millionaire. They wander around the millionaire''s spooky mansion confronting various crooks and a dangerous dame. The stooges vanquish the crooks (Shemp uses his "trusty shovel") and find the missing man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrT96VPOABh5cQ2Dw2LclBpLAtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116271'),
  ('618654129823485356', 'Who Done It?', 1956, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Basil Dearden, David Tringham, Tom Pevsner', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Benny Hill, Belinda Lee, David Kossoff, Garry Marsh, Denis Shaw, Ernest Thesiger, George Margo, Frederick Schiller', null, 'This movie debut for saucy British TV comic Benny Hill has Benny leaving his job as a sweeper after winning some money. He becomes a private detective and investigates a plot to assassinate British scientists.', 'This movie debut for saucy British TV comic Benny Hill has Benny leaving his job as a sweeper after winning some money. He becomes a private detective and investigates a plot to assassinate British scientists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MUpS7pnxmVPtZnIbmmK7G22UmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46892'),
  ('744375449530915453', 'Who Finds a Friend Finds a Treasure', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Luigi Kuveiller, Mimmola Girosi', 'Mario Amendola, Sergio Corbucci', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, John Fujioka, Louise Bennett, Sal Borgese, Kainowa Lauritzen, Mirna Seya, Terry Moni Mapuana', 'PG', 'Alan gets a map to some war treasure which the Japanese army left behind on a small Pacific island at the end of World War II. But some gangsters try to steal the map from him and so he hides on Charlie''s boat which just leaves the harbor. He manipulates the ship''s compass so that Charlie is not aware that he is sailing to the treasure island. But when they step on the island, they discover that it is not as abandoned as they believed: there are some natives - and a Japanese soldier still defending the treasure', 'Alan gets a map to some war treasure which the Japanese army left behind on a small Pacific island at the end of World War II. But some gangsters try to steal the map from him and so he hides on Charlie''s boat which just leaves the harbor. He manipulates the ship''s compass so that Charlie is not aware that he is sailing to the treasure island. But when they step on the island, they discover that it is not as abandoned as they believed: there are some natives - and a Japanese soldier still defending the treasure', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fl6sXVv5fWMpDxFDab54qc71tv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6399'),
  ('929870281584417914', 'Who Framed Harry Lund?', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mats Arehn, Daniel Alfredson, Mischa Gavrjusjov', 'Mats Arehn', 'Johan Ulveson, Peter Haber, Eva Dahlman, Claes Malmberg, Ursula Fogelström, Sten Ljunggren, Gert Fylking, Gösta Bredefeldt', null, 'Harry Lund is having a bad day. First he gets fired. And then loses his entire fortune at an illegal gambling club. On his way out, he is assaulted and drugged by unknown men, and wakes up in a car with another man. A very dead man. A very murdered man. And Harry''s penknife sticks out of his body. Harry flees in panic to Stockholm. And now not only the bad guys are close on his heels - but also the police...', 'Harry Lund is having a bad day. First he gets fired. And then loses his entire fortune at an illegal gambling club. On his way out, he is assaulted and drugged by unknown men, and wakes up in a car with another man. A very dead man. A very murdered man. And Harry''s penknife sticks out of his body. Harry flees in panic to Stockholm. And now not only the bad guys are close on his heels - but also the police...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0ymZ8WfhjarZMAHieJFCcC8bPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584192'),
  ('269941484376703918', 'Who Framed Roger Rabbit', 1988, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dean Cundey, Chris Brock', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Bob Hoskins, Christopher Lloyd, Joanna Cassidy, Charles Fleischer, Kathleen Turner, Stubby Kaye, Alan Tilvern, Richard LeParmentier', 'PG', '''Toon star Roger is worried that his wife Jessica is playing pattycake with someone else, so the studio hires detective Eddie Valiant to snoop on her. But the stakes are quickly raised when Marvin Acme is found dead and Roger is the prime suspect.', '''Toon star Roger is worried that his wife Jessica is playing pattycake with someone else, so the studio hires detective Eddie Valiant to snoop on her. But the stakes are quickly raised when Marvin Acme is found dead and Roger is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYfRc57Kx9VgLZ48iulu0HKnM15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856'),
