  ('718816434690719265', 'Who Gets the Dog?', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Huck Botko, Joseph White', 'Rick Rapoza, Matt JL Wheeler', 'Alicia Silverstone, Ryan Kwanten, Randall Batinkoff, Matty Ryan, Rachel Cerda, Devin Bethea, Paul Rawson, Amy J. Carle', 'PG', 'Six years after saying "I do," Olive and Clay call it quits. Although they split amicably, both want custody of their beloved dog Wesley and they end up in court. With everything at stake, can man''s best friend find a way to reunite the couple?', 'Six years after saying "I do," Olive and Clay call it quits. Although they split amicably, both want custody of their beloved dog Wesley and they end up in court. With everything at stake, can man''s best friend find a way to reunite the couple?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLXPoZ2ApBD5pFMNTyxhyJvoxkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415766'),
