  ('28552981414701283', 'Who Is Cletis Tout?', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Chris Ver Wiel, Jerzy Zieliński', 'Chris Ver Wiel', 'Christian Slater, Tim Allen, Portia De Rossi, Richard Dreyfuss, Billy Connolly, RuPaul, Peter MacNeill, Bill MacDonald', 'R', 'With a hitman’s gun aimed at him, Finch tells the story of how he broke out of jail, fell in love, and took the identity of a man wanted by the Mafia.', 'With a hitman’s gun aimed at him, Finch tells the story of how he broke out of jail, fell in love, and took the identity of a man wanted by the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udHRTgyZa1Fh2ryrUbInDviJl6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33152'),
  ('50769698377528989', 'Who Is Harry Kellerman and Why Is He Saying Those Terrible Things About Me?', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ulu Grosbard, Victor J. Kemper, Peter R. Scoppa', 'Herb Gardner', 'Dustin Hoffman, Barbara Harris, Jack Warden, David Burns, Gabriel Dell, Betty Walker, Rose Gregorio, Dom DeLuise', null, 'Hugely successful but impossibly neurotic songwriter Georgie Soloway is sliding into a mid-life crisis. He believes that all of his past romantic relationships have been destroyed not by his own failings but by the interference of the mysterious Harry Kellerman. Family, friends, and his psychiatrist cannot give him the help he seeks. When his father is diagnosed with a terminal illness, Georgie begins spending more and more time flying his personal aircraft, distancing himself physically, emotionally, and mentally from the real world.', 'Hugely successful but impossibly neurotic songwriter Georgie Soloway is sliding into a mid-life crisis. He believes that all of his past romantic relationships have been destroyed not by his own failings but by the interference of the mysterious Harry Kellerman. Family, friends, and his psychiatrist cannot give him the help he seeks. When his father is diagnosed with a terminal illness, Georgie begins spending more and more time flying his personal aircraft, distancing himself physically, emotionally, and mentally from the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6nilgcgFQ5FpIIBKzgK3SqhC5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91607'),
  ('506790194497555440', 'Who Is Killing the Cheerleaders?', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime, Horror, Drama', 'Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan, Jeff Hare', 'Lauren Balson Carter', 'Ella Cannon, Austin Freeman, Summer Madison, Kayla Fields, Grace Patterson, Nick Clark, Frances Dell Bendert, Greg Corbett', null, 'Ellie, a former cheerleader, returns to her high school as a teacher ten years after she was nearly killed in a series of brutal slayings on the squad. When the attacks start up again shortly after her arrival, she must find the killer before they get to her first.', 'Ellie, a former cheerleader, returns to her high school as a teacher ten years after she was nearly killed in a series of brutal slayings on the squad. When the attacks start up again shortly after her arrival, she must find the killer before they get to her first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJat6I5uwHuXQRJx35PIQJlEUKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755249'),
  ('603818506486232550', 'Who Is Killing the Great Chefs of Europe?', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ted Kotcheff, John Alcott, Wolfgang Glattes', 'Peter Stone', 'George Segal, Jacqueline Bisset, Robert Morley, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Philippe Noiret, Jean Rochefort, Gigi Proietti, Stefano Satta Flores', 'PG', 'Mystery abounds when it is discovered that, one by one, the greatest chefs in Europe are being killed. The intriguing part of the murders is that each chef is killed in the same manner that their own special dish is prepared in. Food critics and the (many) self-proclaimed greatest chefs in Europe demand the mystery be solved.', 'Mystery abounds when it is discovered that, one by one, the greatest chefs in Europe are being killed. The intriguing part of the murders is that each chef is killed in the same manner that their own special dish is prepared in. Food critics and the (many) self-proclaimed greatest chefs in Europe demand the mystery be solved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/N98Pdb4hdNqZsYO5bBXXb897RS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42216'),
  ('612744848195332969', 'Who Is Luigi Mangione?', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Brian Ross, Rhonda Schwartz, Marc Bloomgarden', 'Brian Ross', 'Luigi Mangione, Brian Thompson, Dan Abrams, Philip Klein, Kelly Wirtz, Joseph Kenny, Casey Jordan, Giovanna Aquia Blatterman', null, 'Writings and social media posts help to reveal the secret life and troubles of Luigi Mangione, the man accused of the brazen murder of United Healthcare CEO Brian Thompson and whom so many people are calling a hero.', 'Writings and social media posts help to reveal the secret life and troubles of Luigi Mangione, the man accused of the brazen murder of United Healthcare CEO Brian Thompson and whom so many people are calling a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfGZ8tjK4HVTRjmD5X9JIKDepGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1433947'),
