  ('822627365127290735', 'Who Killed Doc Robbin?', 1948, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Bernard Carr, Jack Temple, Menifee Johnstone', 'Maurice Geraghty, Dorothy Davenport', 'Larry Olsen, Eilene Janssen, Peter Miles, Ardda Lynwood, Dale Belding, Virginia Grey, Don Castle, George Zucco', null, 'A group of people find themselves trapped in a creepy mansion, complete with secret passageways, a mad doctor and a murderous gorilla.', 'A group of people find themselves trapped in a creepy mansion, complete with secret passageways, a mad doctor and a murderous gorilla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvj0gfk0kymK9iqeX2ffqRCWZ34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29472'),
  ('700294322606630400', 'Who Killed Johnny R.?', 1966, 'Western', 'José Luis Madrid, Julio Pérez de Rozas', 'Paul Jarrico, Peter A. Chilles, Ladislas Fodor', 'Lex Barker, Joachim Fuchsberger, Marianne Koch, Ralf Wolter, Barbara Bold, Sieghardt Rupp, César Ojinaga, Isidro Novellas', null, 'An assumed-dead gangster wants to implicate a completely innocent man to pay for his crimes so he can give the slip to his avengers and persecutors.', 'An assumed-dead gangster wants to implicate a completely innocent man to pay for his crimes so he can give the slip to his avengers and persecutors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jZXlFY74NninWazOM6wHtTtONc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91135'),
  ('109209663162248938', 'Who Killed Lady Winsley?', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Hiner Saleem, Andreas Sinanos', 'Hiner Saleem, Thomas Bidegain, Véronique Wüthrich', 'Mehmet Kurtuluş, Ezgi Mola, Şenay Gürler, Ergun Kuyucu, Turgay Aydın, Lila Gürmen, Arın Kuşaksızoğlu, Ahmed Adel', null, 'When Lady Winsley, the famous American novelist, is discovered dead on the remote Turkish island of Büyükada, the great detective Fergün is sent from Istanbul to solve the murder case. With the help of Azra, the beautiful local hotel tenant, he must confront stubborn members of the island community to untangle well-guarded family secrets and discover who the murderer is.', 'When Lady Winsley, the famous American novelist, is discovered dead on the remote Turkish island of Büyükada, the great detective Fergün is sent from Istanbul to solve the murder case. With the help of Azra, the beautiful local hotel tenant, he must confront stubborn members of the island community to untangle well-guarded family secrets and discover who the murderer is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sML5dq9ncv2N14WOlrClJMuhHPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511468'),
  ('155797621443537183', 'Who Killed Pasolini?', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Marco Tullio Giordana, Barbara Melega, Stefano Amatucci', 'Marco Tullio Giordana, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Carlo DeFilippi, Nicoletta Braschi, Toni Bertorelli, Andrea Occhipinti, Victor Cavallo, Rosa Pianeta, Giulio Scarpati, Francesco Siciliano', 'NR', 'November 2, 1975: Pier Paolo Pasolini is murdered in the outskirts of Rome. The suspect, a 17-year-old hustler, pleads to have acted in self-defense, citing Pasolini''s notorious sexual habits as proof. However, many inconsistencies start to undermine his version, pointing to him not having acted alone or even being assaulted in the first place. Was Pasolini also killed for another reason?', 'November 2, 1975: Pier Paolo Pasolini is murdered in the outskirts of Rome. The suspect, a 17-year-old hustler, pleads to have acted in self-defense, citing Pasolini''s notorious sexual habits as proof. However, many inconsistencies start to undermine his version, pointing to him not having acted alone or even being assaulted in the first place. Was Pasolini also killed for another reason?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWR4OPViXD3Ry9LUGUt1Sipw8WT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45997'),
  ('66299888491927129', 'Who Killed Pixote?', 1996, 'Drama', 'José Joffily, Nonato Estrela', 'José Joffily', 'Cassiano Carneiro, Luciana Rigueira, Joana Fomm, Tuca Andrada, Roberto Bomtempo, Carol Machado, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Orlando Vieira', null, 'The true story of the boy who became famous when he was cast for the main part on the Brazilian film Pixote: A Lei do Mais Fraco (1981). After the film was over, he tried to work as an actor on other projects, with little success. As time went by, he got involved with crime.', 'The true story of the boy who became famous when he was cast for the main part on the Brazilian film Pixote: A Lei do Mais Fraco (1981). After the film was over, he tried to work as an actor on other projects, with little success. As time went by, he got involved with crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ham9Qy2FVuyIHiaznkC4971hrDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8442'),
  ('418969629031428364', 'Who Killed Santa Claus?', 1941, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Armand Thirard, Christian-Jaque', 'Charles Spaak', 'Harry Baur, Renée Faure, Robert Le Vigan, Raymond Rouleau, Michel François, Bernard Daydé, Marie-Hélène Dasté, Jean Brochard', null, 'A village in the French Alps is rocked by a series of crimes, including the theft of a sacred ring and the murder of a man dressed as Père Noël (Father Christmas).', 'A village in the French Alps is rocked by a series of crimes, including the theft of a sacred ring and the murder of a man dressed as Père Noël (Father Christmas).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xScDM79VloXlS53zZHiiHgl0add.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6296'),
  ('1010242874785475546', 'Who Killed Santa? A Murderville Murder Mystery', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Laura Murphy, Frank Barrera', 'Krister Johnson, Kerry O''Neill', 'Will Arnett, Jason Bateman, Maya Rudolph, Pete Davidson, Sean Hayes, Tawny Newsome, Lilan Bowden, Kurt Braunohler', 'R', 'A holiday-hating detective is forced to solve a murder — and save Christmas — with help from famous trainees who must improv their way through the case.', 'A holiday-hating detective is forced to solve a murder — and save Christmas — with help from famous trainees who must improv their way through the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycy6Ks6Ort2k3A8VQKgEsJkJbp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1050266'),
  ('545488016831308143', 'Who Killed Teddy Bear?', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Cates, Joseph C. Brun, Sidney Kupferschmid', 'Arnold Drake, Leon Tokatyan', 'Sal Mineo, Juliet Prowse, Jan Murray, Elaine Stritch, Margot Bennett, Daniel J. Travanti, Diana Moore, Frank Campanella', null, 'A grim police detective embarks on a one-man crusade to track down a depraved sex maniac when a nightclub deejay receives a disturbing series of obscene phone calls. Finding himself getting far too close to the victim for comfort, the hard-boiled cop must track down the unbalanced pervert before he can carry out his sick threats.', 'A grim police detective embarks on a one-man crusade to track down a depraved sex maniac when a nightclub deejay receives a disturbing series of obscene phone calls. Finding himself getting far too close to the victim for comfort, the hard-boiled cop must track down the unbalanced pervert before he can carry out his sick threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYhJ3zodSUffgxvQUUjKfHXrp0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85246'),
  ('162448490996299967', 'Who Killed the Electric Car?', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Chris Paine', 'Chris Paine', 'Martin Sheen, Mel Gibson, Chelsea Sexton, Tom Hanks, Reverend Gadget, Ed Begley Jr.', null, 'In 1996, electric cars began to appear on roads all over California. They were quiet and fast, produced no exhaust, and ran without gasoline... Ten years later, these cars were destroyed.', 'In 1996, electric cars began to appear on roads all over California. They were quiet and fast, produced no exhaust, and ran without gasoline... Ten years later, these cars were destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMamC9o5zNU9wn8fyuAo2gUCMiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13508'),
