  ('795383228487865189', 'Who Killed Who?', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Robert Emmett O''Connor, Tex Avery, Sara Berner, Billy Bletcher, Richard Haydn, Kent Rogers', null, 'A murder has occurred at Gruesome Gables, and the dog detective trying to find the killer has to deal with some suspicious suspects and a haunted house.', 'A murder has occurred at Gruesome Gables, and the dog detective trying to find the killer has to deal with some suspicious suspects and a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38Lb9PiqQlpo6XfQWdXlfFK9A3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87234'),
  ('429692454820689258', 'Who Pulled the Plug?', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Hans Iveberg', 'Hans Iveberg', 'Kim Anderzon, Janne ''Loffe'' Carlsson, Stig Ossian Ericson, Yvonne Lombard, Nils Eklund, Stig Engström, Magnus Härenstam, Rolv Wesenlund', null, 'To secure an order for 1 000 cabin cruisers from an Arab prince, two companies have to compete by racing each other by canal from Stockholm to Gothenburg. A small family owned company on the brink of bankruptcy is pitted against a much larger competitor and both resort to dirty tricks in order to reach the goal line first.', 'To secure an order for 1 000 cabin cruisers from an Arab prince, two companies have to compete by racing each other by canal from Stockholm to Gothenburg. A small family owned company on the brink of bankruptcy is pitted against a much larger competitor and both resort to dirty tricks in order to reach the goal line first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0IdVBOA3eqdSPtDyq81UP1H8lm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22435'),
  ('270088234507755490', 'Who Pulled the Plug? 2', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Pelle Seth', null, 'Janne ''Loffe'' Carlsson, Eva Röse, Henrik Lundström, Kim Anderzon, Pino Ammendola, Danilo Bejarano, Rafael Edholm, Lena Endre', null, 'Andersson''s boatyard remains after 25 years, still chased by the same stringent, but misfortuned debt collector. TV producer Vonna Jigert wants Andersson to compete against an Italian company and their boat Fortuna in a race on Göta Kanal – live on TV. The race is broadcasted as a reality show. Same gangly canoer like 25 years ago also has a canoeing vacation on the canal when the race starts.', 'Andersson''s boatyard remains after 25 years, still chased by the same stringent, but misfortuned debt collector. TV producer Vonna Jigert wants Andersson to compete against an Italian company and their boat Fortuna in a race on Göta Kanal – live on TV. The race is broadcasted as a reality show. Same gangly canoer like 25 years ago also has a canoeing vacation on the canal when the race starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g13KqwencLCNDtLREXkaQXOCvXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22436'),
  ('148363063354394675', 'Who Said Meow?', 1962, 'Animation', 'Boris Voronov, Vladimir Degtyarev', null, 'Rina Zelyonaya', null, 'After hearing someone''s "meow" for the first time in his life, baby puppy goes in search of the unknown beast and meets various inhabitants of the house and yard. On children''s curiosity and the first acquaintance with the world.', 'After hearing someone''s "meow" for the first time in his life, baby puppy goes in search of the unknown beast and meets various inhabitants of the house and yard. On children''s curiosity and the first acquaintance with the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f3wj6vCI3pcjSAmjQWY6OaMQMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278615'),
