  ('931046261693027409', 'Who Took Johnny', 2014, 'Documentary', 'David Beilinson, Suki Hawley, Michael Galinsky', 'David Beilinson, Michael Galinsky, Suki Hawley', 'Noreen Gosch, Johnny Gosch, John Gosch Sr., John Walsh, John DeCamp, Paul Bonacci', null, 'An examination of the infamous thirty-year-old cold case of Iowa paperboy Johnny Gosch, the first missing child to appear on a milk carton. The film focuses on Johnny’s mother, Noreen Gosch, and her relentless quest to find the truth about what happened to her son. Along the way there have been mysterious sightings, bizarre revelations, and a confrontation with a person who claims to have helped abduct Johnny.', 'An examination of the infamous thirty-year-old cold case of Iowa paperboy Johnny Gosch, the first missing child to appear on a milk carton. The film focuses on Johnny’s mother, Noreen Gosch, and her relentless quest to find the truth about what happened to her son. Along the way there have been mysterious sightings, bizarre revelations, and a confrontation with a person who claims to have helped abduct Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93QgSxYD68F3jeICIB8mYaZzhPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251220'),
  ('1136219792657500280', 'Who Took My Family?', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Damián Romay', 'Rachel Morton', 'Chelsea Buck, Kyle Kankonde, Roy Lynam, Steven McCormack, Gina Vitori', null, 'When Courtney''s husband and young daughters mysteriously vanish, she begins a relentless search that unearths chilling threats and buried secrets, forcing her to question everything she thought she knew about the people closest to her.', 'When Courtney''s husband and young daughters mysteriously vanish, she begins a relentless search that unearths chilling threats and buried secrets, forcing her to question everything she thought she knew about the people closest to her.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FuLmZHVg0yg7BBp9x3WRwc80F5ar.jpg', 'plex:movie:who-took-my-family'),
  ('1033494371881756548', 'Who Wants to Kill Jessie?', 1966, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Václav Vorlíček, Eva Mičulková, Jaroslav Pour', 'Miloš Macourek, Václav Vorlíček', 'Dana Medřická, Jiří Sovák, Olga Schoberová, Juraj Višný, Karel Effa, Jan Libíček, Walter Taub, Bedřich Prokoš', 'NR', 'In this zany Czechoslovakian comedy, a scientist invents a machine that projects a sleeping person''s dream on a screen; disaster soon follows when the machine malfunctions and the cartoon-like dream characters become very real!', 'In this zany Czechoslovakian comedy, a scientist invents a machine that projects a sleeping person''s dream on a screen; disaster soon follows when the machine malfunctions and the cartoon-like dream characters become very real!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTyGH9bn948xMGaLjInhZp9tqyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65904'),
  ('44063144760160748', 'Who Wants to Marry an Astronaut?', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Matamoros', 'Mònica Cambra, Claudia Garcia, Clara Hernández', 'Raúl Tejón, Alejandro Nones, Raúl Fernández de Pablo, Sabrina Praga, Pablo Turturiello, Francisco Andrade, Lluïsa Mallol, Sofia Nemirovsky', null, 'David is a dopey hopeless romantic with a hippy mother and a best friend who also works for him. After fifteen years of living together, on an impulse, he decides to ask his partner to marry him in Las Vegas. His anticipation for the dream wedding and trip is crushed when his partner answers ‘No’. David decides to power through with his plans and now he has ten days to find the knight in shining armor that will marry him in Las Vegas.', 'David is a dopey hopeless romantic with a hippy mother and a best friend who also works for him. After fifteen years of living together, on an impulse, he decides to ask his partner to marry him in Las Vegas. His anticipation for the dream wedding and trip is crushed when his partner answers ‘No’. David decides to power through with his plans and now he has ten days to find the knight in shining armor that will marry him in Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SBePVhGosxVnyfSURUahiR1bGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1254754'),
  ('832163625784181578', 'Who Was Nothing...', 1974, 'History', 'Takhir Sabirov', 'Igor Lukovskiy', 'Khodzha Kuli Narliyev, Anatoli Barchuk, Gulsara Abdullayeva, Baba Annanov, Bolot Beyshenaliev, Yuri Dedovich, Igor Dmitriev, Dzhavlon Khamrayev', null, 'Two-part epic about the establishment of Soviet power in Tajikistan based on the works of S. Aini.', 'Two-part epic about the establishment of Soviet power in Tajikistan based on the works of S. Aini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEg6inBJj0WqgB5J8nSZv3hIgQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619200'),
  ('119399234863063242', 'Who Was That Lady?', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Sidney, Harry Stradling Sr., David Silver', 'Norman Krasna', 'Tony Curtis, Dean Martin, Janet Leigh, James Whitmore, John McIntire, Barbara Nichols, Larry Keating, Larry Storch', 'NR', 'In order to get back into the good graces with his wife with whom he has had a misunderstanding, a young chemistry professor concocts a wild story that he is an undercover FBI agent. To help him with his story he enlists the aid of a friend who is a TV writer. The wife swallows the story and the film''s climax takes place in the sub-basements of the Empire State Building. The professor and his friend, believing themselves prisoners on an enemy submarine, patriotically try to scuttle the vessel and succeed only in rocking the building.', 'In order to get back into the good graces with his wife with whom he has had a misunderstanding, a young chemistry professor concocts a wild story that he is an undercover FBI agent. To help him with his story he enlists the aid of a friend who is a TV writer. The wife swallows the story and the film''s climax takes place in the sub-basements of the Empire State Building. The professor and his friend, believing themselves prisoners on an enemy submarine, patriotically try to scuttle the vessel and succeed only in rocking the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRf7LnZD6zOTHbM4gpVXDmWibpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105406'),
  ('1067844271001554443', 'Who Will Love My Children?', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Thomas Del Ruth, Jimmy Simons', 'Michael Bortman', 'Ann-Margret, Frederic Forrest, Cathryn Damon, Donald Moffat, Lonny Chapman, Patricia Smith, Jess Osuna, Christopher Allport', 'PG', 'Lucile Fray has 10 children and terminal cancer. As her ne''er-do-well alcoholic husband, isn''t capable enough to handle raising them, there''s only one option left. As her last act on earth, Fray is determined to make sure her children have a secure future.', 'Lucile Fray has 10 children and terminal cancer. As her ne''er-do-well alcoholic husband, isn''t capable enough to handle raising them, there''s only one option left. As her last act on earth, Fray is determined to make sure her children have a secure future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGy8zREsjkhoIaFLqGF8yTEiTIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146814'),
  ('853689305598142420', 'Who Will Tell A Fable?', 1982, 'Animation', 'Robert Sahakyants', 'Robert Sahakyants', 'Oleg Golubitsky, Yaroslava Turylyova, Yuriy Sorokin, Vladimir Antonik, Stanislav Zakharov, Andrey Tarasov, Yan Yanakiyev', null, '"...whoever tells me a story and I say, "It''s not true, I don''t believe it," will receive half the kingdom as a reward." decided the bored king.', '"...whoever tells me a story and I say, "It''s not true, I don''t believe it," will receive half the kingdom as a reward." decided the bored king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2fVjrEaAYONJicSRETKI2VtnnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84810'),
  ('507611974311584372', 'Who Works Is Lost', 1963, 'Drama', 'Tinto Brass, Franco Arcalli, Gianfranco Campigotto', 'Franco Arcalli', 'Sady Rebbot, Pascale Audret, Nando Angelini, Andreina Carli, Gino Cavalieri, Franco Arcalli, Piero Vida, Enzo Nigro', null, 'Bonifacio is 27 years old and he is roaming about Venice. He is trying to decide whether to accept a job or not. In so doing, he recalls all his past life: his love story with Gabriella, his old friend Claudio, who had always regarded working as a worthwhile thing, the war, the partisans.', 'Bonifacio is 27 years old and he is roaming about Venice. He is trying to decide whether to accept a job or not. In so doing, he recalls all his past life: his love story with Gabriella, his old friend Claudio, who had always regarded working as a worthwhile thing, the war, the partisans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6Dus8Jb4u6zPiEjnJNhNLoKO29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135536'),
