  ('617118391161477659', 'Who''s Harry Crumb?', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Paul Flaherty, Stephen M. Katz, Susan Bluestein', 'Robert Conte, Peter Wortmann', 'John Candy, Jeffrey Jones, Annie Potts, Tim Thomerson, Barry Corbin, Shawnee Smith, Valri Bromfield, Doug Steckler', 'PG-13', 'Harry Crumb is a bumbling and inept private investigator who is hired to solve the kidnapping of a young heiress which he''s not expected to solve because his employer is the mastermind behind the kidnapping.', 'Harry Crumb is a bumbling and inept private investigator who is hired to solve the kidnapping of a young heiress which he''s not expected to solve because his employer is the mastermind behind the kidnapping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iUoyyaMklULVoGJDyHcN4nGgSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11718'),
  ('1132942998934157534', 'Who''s Kitten Who?', 1952, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, breaks free from a crate at the Zoo Office and hops into the house of Sylvester Cat and his son, Junior. They mistake Hippety for a giant mouse, and Sylvester is pummelled again and again by the playful kangaroo, causing Junior to put a paper bag over his head in shame for his father.', 'A baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, breaks free from a crate at the Zoo Office and hops into the house of Sylvester Cat and his son, Junior. They mistake Hippety for a giant mouse, and Sylvester is pummelled again and again by the playful kangaroo, causing Junior to put a paper bag over his head in shame for his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHrp3VuR8QeXiWF1819VHGCZMv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235944'),
  ('225547984108680033', 'Who''s Minding the Mint?', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Morris, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Harvey Bullock, R.S. Allen', 'Jim Hutton, Dorothy Provine, Milton Berle, Joey Bishop, Bob Denver, Walter Brennan, Victor Buono, Jack Gilford', 'G', 'A bumbling government employee accidentally destroys a small fortune and decides to break into the US Mint to replace it, but before long everyone wants a slice of the action - and the money.', 'A bumbling government employee accidentally destroys a small fortune and decides to break into the US Mint to replace it, but before long everyone wants a slice of the action - and the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg3BPrfZ5Kf4S08KkCi8IPhS03u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43710'),
  ('292644194278177958', 'Who''s Minding the Store?', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Frank Tashlin, Harry Tugend', 'Jerry Lewis, Jill St. John, Ray Walston, John McGiver, Agnes Moorehead, Francesca Bellini, Fritz Feld, Nancy Kulp', 'PG', 'Jerry Lewis plays Norman Phiffer, a proud man in a humble life, who doesn''t know that his girlfriend, Barbara, is heir to the Tuttle Department Store dynasty. Mrs. Tuttle, Barbara''s mother, is determined to split the two lovers, and hires Norman in an attempt to humiliate him enough that Barbara leaves him. Will she ruin their love, or will he ruin her store?', 'Jerry Lewis plays Norman Phiffer, a proud man in a humble life, who doesn''t know that his girlfriend, Barbara, is heir to the Tuttle Department Store dynasty. Mrs. Tuttle, Barbara''s mother, is determined to split the two lovers, and hires Norman in an attempt to humiliate him enough that Barbara leaves him. Will she ruin their love, or will he ruin her store?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4VFfXDJPIu9oJxH7lMJpDTtsYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42305'),
  ('1124899644859134827', 'Who''s My Favourite Girl?', 1999, 'Drama', 'Adrian McDowall', null, null, null, 'Two young Scots boys travel to school to find that one is offered on by a girl. Despite his nerves his older friend teaches him how to kiss and develops his confidence with surprising results!', 'Two young Scots boys travel to school to find that one is offered on by a girl. Despite his nerves his older friend teaches him how to kiss and develops his confidence with surprising results!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjReq4MZo3WZCneYcQv5aiCbqRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49305'),
  ('290838237466330008', 'Who''s Singin'' Over There?', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Slobodan Šijan, Božidar ''Bota'' Nikolić, Zdravko Randić', 'Dušan Kovačević', 'Pavle Vuisić, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Aleksandar Berček, Neda Arnerić, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić, Taško Načić, Boro Stjepanović', null, 'On Saturday, 5 April 1941, one day before the Invasion of Yugoslavia of the Kingdom of Yugoslavia, a colourful group of random passengers on a country road deep in the heart of Serbia board a dilapidated bus, headed for the capital Belgrade. The group includes two gypsy musicians, a World War I veteran, a Germanophile, a budding singer, a sickly looking man, and a hunter with a shotgun. The bus is owned by Krstic senior, and driven by his impressionable and dim-witted son Misko.', 'On Saturday, 5 April 1941, one day before the Invasion of Yugoslavia of the Kingdom of Yugoslavia, a colourful group of random passengers on a country road deep in the heart of Serbia board a dilapidated bus, headed for the capital Belgrade. The group includes two gypsy musicians, a World War I veteran, a Germanophile, a budding singer, a sickly looking man, and a hunter with a shotgun. The bus is owned by Krstic senior, and driven by his impressionable and dim-witted son Misko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1r4buAPUyqWwhdKxki1fyBeehsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17909'),
  ('240367067951143142', 'Who’s Stopping Us', 2021, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jonás Trueba, Jonás Trueba', 'Jonás Trueba', 'Candela Recio, Pablo Hoyos, Silvio Aguilar, Pablo Gavira, Claudia Navarro, Marta Casado, Rony-Michelle Pinzaru, Javier Sánchez', null, 'Quién lo impide is a call to change our perception of adolescents and youths; our idea of those born in the early 21st century who have recently reached adulthood; those who now seem guilty of everything as they themselves see their hopes dashed. Somewhere between documentary, fiction and pure testimonial record, the young adolescents show themselves the way they really are, the way we rarely see them, or the way they let us see them: taking advantage of the film camera to show off the best of themselves and renew our trust in the future; from fragility and emotion, with humour, intelligence, beliefs and ideas. Because the young people who speak to us about love, friendship, politics or education refer not only to their own situation, but to the things that always matter to us, at any age. Quién lo impide is a film about ourselves: about what we were, what we are and what we will continue to be.', 'Quién lo impide is a call to change our perception of adolescents and youths; our idea of those born in the early 21st century who have recently reached adulthood; those who now seem guilty of everything as they themselves see their hopes dashed. Somewhere between documentary, fiction and pure testimonial record, the young adolescents show themselves the way they really are, the way we rarely see them, or the way they let us see them: taking advantage of the film camera to show off the best of themselves and renew our trust in the future; from fragility and emotion, with humour, intelligence, beliefs and ideas. Because the young people who speak to us about love, friendship, politics or education refer not only to their own situation, but to the things that always matter to us, at any age. Quién lo impide is a film about ourselves: about what we were, what we are and what we will continue to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeZ2RvSLS4iuHuYUMaXIwNNfr75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531921'),
  ('1020162997750279509', 'Who''s That Girl', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Foley, Jan de Bont', 'Ken Finkleman, Andrew Smith', 'Madonna, Griffin Dunne, Bibi Besch, John McMartin, John Mills, Haviland Morris, Coati Mundi, Drew Pillsbury', 'PG', 'An uptight New York City tax lawyer gets his life turned upside down one day when he''s asked to escort a feisty free-spirited ex-convict who asks him to help prove her innocence of her crime.', 'An uptight New York City tax lawyer gets his life turned upside down one day when he''s asked to escort a feisty free-spirited ex-convict who asks him to help prove her innocence of her crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Yu6ciKKgSWIZAzUg4IrrifO23z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26827'),
  ('78591660498582158', 'Who''s That Knocking at My Door', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mardik Martin, Martin Scorsese, Michael Wadleigh', 'Martin Scorsese', 'Harvey Keitel, Zina Bethune, Anne Collette, Lennard Kuras, Michael Scala, Harry Northup, Tsuai Yu-Lan, Saskia Holleman', 'R', 'A Catholic New Yorker falls in love with a girl and wants to marry her, but he struggles to accept her past and what it means for their future.', 'A Catholic New Yorker falls in love with a girl and wants to marry her, but he struggles to accept her past and what it means for their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcH6pKZKeImwcBtIH7fSdUyoQ2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42694'),
  ('724233412414519627', 'Who''s That Soldier?', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Petr Tuček, Josef Pávek, Milan Cieslar', 'Pavel Hajný, Petr Tuček', 'Jiří Langmajer, Karel Roden, Pavel Hejlík, Tomáš Valík, Václav Čížkovský, Ivo Helikar, Tomáš Karger, Veronika Gajerová', null, 'In the Czech film comedy from 1988, you can see for yourself that the war was not easy, but otherwise it was great fun. Sergeant Kouba serving with the paratroopers has a soft spot for women. His superior does not like him. However, during a military exercise on the way to the barracks, Kouba shows his true character when he saves the life of a little boy, convicts a thief and finds a lifelong partner in the commander''s sister.', 'In the Czech film comedy from 1988, you can see for yourself that the war was not easy, but otherwise it was great fun. Sergeant Kouba serving with the paratroopers has a soft spot for women. His superior does not like him. However, during a military exercise on the way to the barracks, Kouba shows his true character when he saves the life of a little boy, convicts a thief and finds a lifelong partner in the commander''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYo6YQCyJ06vZzTv9lUDhzefnL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74798'),
  ('53868906908155520', 'Who''s the Man?', 1993, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Ted Demme, Adam Kimmel', 'Seth Greenland', 'Ed Lover, Doctor Dré, Badja Djola, Denis Leary, Cheryl ''Salt'' James, Jim Moody, Ice-T, Richard Bright', 'R', 'Ed Lover and Doctor Dre are two inept barbers. Deciding that maybe they ought to find another line of work, they join the police. A big mistake, as far as their duty sergeant, Sgt Cooper is concerned, who proceeds to harass them at every turn. Despite this, they discover a major crime, and proceed to solve it in their own unusual fashion.', 'Ed Lover and Doctor Dre are two inept barbers. Deciding that maybe they ought to find another line of work, they join the police. A big mistake, as far as their duty sergeant, Sgt Cooper is concerned, who proceeds to harass them at every turn. Despite this, they discover a major crime, and proceed to solve it in their own unusual fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgRLvO8cnPsKKPIzNwlbuoeoY0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25925'),
  ('390236808974801220', 'Who''s the Woman, Who''s the Man?', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Leslie Cheung', 'Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah, James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Leslie Cheung, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Carina Lau, Moses Chan Ho', null, 'Music producer Sam and his cross-dressing protege Wing have finally professed their love for another, but now what?', 'Music producer Sam and his cross-dressing protege Wing have finally professed their love for another, but now what?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vZWOQhQzW6Nc5yN3L78fKU37tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133578'),
  ('77407089297605787', 'Who''s Your Caddy?', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Don Michael Paul, Thomas L. Callaway, Chris Howell', 'Robert Henny, Don Michael Paul, Bradley Allenstein', 'Big Boi, Lil Wayne, Faizon Love, Andy Milonakis, Terry Crews, Tony Cox, Cam Gigandet, Tamala Jones', 'PG-13', 'Superstar rap mogul C-Note wants to join the Carolina Pines Golf & Country Club, but faces stiff opposition from the establishment''s snooty members. C-Note forces the issue by purchasing the land adjacent to the golf course''s 17th hole. As the club leaders search for a way to revoke his membership, C-Note realizes his family''s honor and golf history are at stake, and digs in for the fight of his life.', 'Superstar rap mogul C-Note wants to join the Carolina Pines Golf & Country Club, but faces stiff opposition from the establishment''s snooty members. C-Note forces the issue by purchasing the land adjacent to the golf course''s 17th hole. As the club leaders search for a way to revoke his membership, C-Note realizes his family''s honor and golf history are at stake, and digs in for the fight of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wBBy7y5woqSICjbQekzZjwJBe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15581'),
  ('1102602888544053786', 'Who''s Your Daddy?', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Andy Fickman, Nathan Hope, Stan Spry', 'Maria Veltre Druse, Jack Sekowski, Andy Fickman', 'Leslie Appleyard, William Atherton, Justin Berfield, Ryan Bittle, Gary Blumsack, Tara Boger, Robert A. Butler, Colleen Camp', 'R', 'An adopted Ohio high school senior discovers he is the inherited heir to a porn empire. Dropped into a bitter power struggle, his new flock of beautiful co-workers come to his aid.', 'An adopted Ohio high school senior discovers he is the inherited heir to a porn empire. Dropped into a bitter power struggle, his new flock of beautiful co-workers come to his aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ltWt2Wm5p6kH7lAIvR2fbZ7NQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13618'),
  ('779966141056902368', 'Whoa, Be-Gone!', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian', 'NR', 'Wile E. Coyote''s plans for catching the Road Runner involve a giant elastic spring, a gun and trampoline, TNT sticks in a barrel, and tornado seeds.', 'Wile E. Coyote''s plans for catching the Road Runner involve a giant elastic spring, a gun and trampoline, TNT sticks in a barrel, and tornado seeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gaoVZC4Ps8clX6Q2SbvZEU02Py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118607'),
  ('104485573192023165', 'Whoever Dies, Dies in Pain', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Morin', null, 'Patrick Robert', null, 'A botched police raid on a crack house turns into a 36 hour long siege in which the junkies share their perspective to the cameraman of a reality program.', 'A botched police raid on a crack house turns into a 36 hour long siege in which the junkies share their perspective to the cameraman of a reality program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTgcc96rZ4khrBAYUoPARs0Y9Cx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283270'),
  ('734798857761617214', 'Whoever Slew Auntie Roo?', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Desmond Dickinson, Curtis Harrington, Colin M. Brewer', 'Robert Blees, Jimmy Sangster', 'Shelley Winters, Mark Lester, Chloe Franks, Ralph Richardson, Lionel Jeffries, Hugh Griffith, Rosalie Crutchley, Pat Heywood', 'PG', 'A demented widow lures unsuspecting children into her mansion in a bizarre "Hansel and Gretel" twist.', 'A demented widow lures unsuspecting children into her mansion in a bizarre "Hansel and Gretel" twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvjAXWzNX8Eurt3z5w6p4E5fSzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6976'),
  ('786721599252770224', 'Whole Lotta Sole', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Terry George', 'Thomas Gallagher, Terry George', 'Colm Meaney, Brendan Fraser, Martin McCann, Yaya DaCosta, David O''Hara, Michael Legge, Conor MacNeill, Frankie McCafferty', 'R', 'In a misguided attempt to protect his family and pay back gambling debts to the local Mobster, Jimbo robs a fish market, which is coincidentally owned by the same Mobster. On the run, Jimbo is cornered in a local curio shop, where he takes hostage an assortment of colourful characters, including a man who may be his illegitimate father. Surrounded by the Police, the SAS and the Mobster''s crew, the young man must find a way out of his precarious predicament with the help of his oddball captives.', 'In a misguided attempt to protect his family and pay back gambling debts to the local Mobster, Jimbo robs a fish market, which is coincidentally owned by the same Mobster. On the run, Jimbo is cornered in a local curio shop, where he takes hostage an assortment of colourful characters, including a man who may be his illegitimate father. Surrounded by the Police, the SAS and the Mobster''s crew, the young man must find a way out of his precarious predicament with the help of his oddball captives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YhkPG9R14UenoJMh4y37CLYqdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165477'),
  ('1044817221484073997', 'Whole New Thing', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amnon Buchbinder, Christopher Ball', 'Amnon Buchbinder, Daniel MacIvor', 'Aaron Webber, Rebecca Jenkins, Robert Joy, Daniel MacIvor, Callum Keith Rennie, Hugh Thompson, Marguerite McNeil, Kathryn MacLellan', null, 'Socially isolated by his parents, an androgynous teen enrolls in high school and develops a crush on his male teacher.', 'Socially isolated by his parents, an androgynous teen enrolls in high school and develops a crush on his male teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58GCH9SepojAwKLtp23BuPMErb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14344'),
  ('954406610093177596', 'Wholetrain', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Florian Gaag, Christian Rein', 'Florian Gaag', 'Mike Adler, Florian Renner, Elyas M''Barek, Jacob Matschenz, Alexander Held, Patrick von Blume, David Mayonga, Vincenzo Rosso', null, 'This feature takes a look at the graffiti movement and young people who populate the niche culture. Following four such artists as they shape the graffiti community through both their art and their interactions, the film tells the story of how the foursome''s decision to paint an entire train would affect their lives forever.', 'This feature takes a look at the graffiti movement and young people who populate the niche culture. Following four such artists as they shape the graffiti community through both their art and their interactions, the film tells the story of how the foursome''s decision to paint an entire train would affect their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSSeQg9BIsavmDYjM9acAi1LU9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14231'),
  ('336173145671849531', 'Wholly Moses', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Gary Weis, Frank Stanley', 'Guy Thomas', 'Dudley Moore, Laraine Newman, James Coco, Paul Sand, Jack Gilford, Dom DeLuise, John Houseman, Madeline Kahn', 'PG', 'Harvey and Zoey, two tourists in Israel, discover an ancient scroll about Herschel, the man who was almost Moses. Herschel receives the command from God to free his people from slavery, but Moses keeps getting all the credit.', 'Harvey and Zoey, two tourists in Israel, discover an ancient scroll about Herschel, the man who was almost Moses. Herschel receives the command from God to free his people from slavery, but Moses keeps getting all the credit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2k9h9F9gf3YJAJojl2TzevTZaaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33076'),
  ('185626061715606845', 'Wholly Smoke', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tedd Pierce', 'NR', 'A neighborhood bully convinces Porky to take a puff from his cigar, causing Porky to hallucinate a smoke-man named Nick O. Teen, along with a musical number done by cigars, cigarettes and pipes in the likeness of the 3 Stooges, etc.', 'A neighborhood bully convinces Porky to take a puff from his cigar, causing Porky to hallucinate a smoke-man named Nick O. Teen, along with a musical number done by cigars, cigarettes and pipes in the likeness of the 3 Stooges, etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j8XNnrFCKnt9akmXF321MQtDQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236197'),
  ('1049460846728901646', 'Whom the Gods Wish to Destroy', 1966, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Harald G. Petersson, Ladislas Fodor, Harald Reinl', 'Uwe Beyer, Karin Dor, Maria Marlow, Rolf Henniger, Siegfried Wischnewski, Hans von Borsody, Fred Williams, Terence Hill', null, 'Siegfried of Xanten snatches the Nibelung treasure from the king of the underworld and slays the dragon Fafnir, whose blood makes him invulnerable. Siegfried falls in love with Kriemhild, the sister of the Burgundian king. But only if Siegfried helps Gunther marry Brunhild will he be allowed to marry Kriemhild. He fulfills this condition, but the two women bring ruin upon Xanten and Burgundy...', 'Siegfried of Xanten snatches the Nibelung treasure from the king of the underworld and slays the dragon Fafnir, whose blood makes him invulnerable. Siegfried falls in love with Kriemhild, the sister of the Burgundian king. But only if Siegfried helps Gunther marry Brunhild will he be allowed to marry Kriemhild. He fulfills this condition, but the two women bring ruin upon Xanten and Burgundy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9lKgq8Ij1DBf7PMSR32kNhTj8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5608'),
  ('528109830745898441', 'Whom the Gods Wish to Destroy 2', 1967, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Ladislas Fodor, Harald G. Petersson, Harald Reinl', 'Maria Marlow, Herbert Lom, Karin Dor, Siegfried Wischnewski, Rolf Henniger, Terence Hill, Fred Williams, Hans von Borsody', null, 'Now Brunhild knows by which treason she was won for king Gunther of Burgund by Siegfried of Xanthen, and has been revenged by his foul murder by Hagen, more bloody revenge is inevitable. Hagen steals the Nibelungen-treasure to sink it in the stream and manages to kill Alberich and seize his invisibility-cap. Queen Kriemhild is packed of to an abbey so her son may grow up to become a prelate, but Hagen''s men raid them and kill the child. She now accepts to become the wife of Etzel, king of the truly barbaric Hun nomads and invites the Burgund court nomenclature at their Danube court for their heir''s baptism a few years later, but prepared a bloody conspiracy with her xenophobic brother-in-law behind her surprisingly chivalric husband''s back, while Gunther accepts, hoping to avoid a far bloodier war, despite the danger for his party of knights, which materializes...', 'Now Brunhild knows by which treason she was won for king Gunther of Burgund by Siegfried of Xanthen, and has been revenged by his foul murder by Hagen, more bloody revenge is inevitable. Hagen steals the Nibelungen-treasure to sink it in the stream and manages to kill Alberich and seize his invisibility-cap. Queen Kriemhild is packed of to an abbey so her son may grow up to become a prelate, but Hagen''s men raid them and kill the child. She now accepts to become the wife of Etzel, king of the truly barbaric Hun nomads and invites the Burgund court nomenclature at their Danube court for their heir''s baptism a few years later, but prepared a bloody conspiracy with her xenophobic brother-in-law behind her surprisingly chivalric husband''s back, while Gunther accepts, hoping to avoid a far bloodier war, despite the danger for his party of knights, which materializes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQHpbrsTfLtin3kzHI2rVNszBZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5609'),
  ('911202198561070091', 'Whoopee!', 1930, 'Music, Comedy, Western', 'Thornton Freeland, Ray Rennahan, Lee Garmes', null, 'Eddie Cantor, Ethel Shutta, Paul Gregory, Eleanor Hunt, Jack Rutherford, Walter Law, Spencer Charters, Albert Hackett', 'NR', 'Western sheriff Bob Wells is preparing to marry Sally Morgan; she loves part-Indian Wanenis, whose race is an obstacle. Sally flees the wedding with hypochondriac Henry Williams, who thinks he''s just giving her a ride; but she left a note saying they''ve eloped! Chasing them are jilted Bob, Henry''s nurse Mary (who''s been trying to seduce him) and others.', 'Western sheriff Bob Wells is preparing to marry Sally Morgan; she loves part-Indian Wanenis, whose race is an obstacle. Sally flees the wedding with hypochondriac Henry Williams, who thinks he''s just giving her a ride; but she left a note saying they''ve eloped! Chasing them are jilted Bob, Henry''s nurse Mary (who''s been trying to seduce him) and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVggH7wheJahCoQWUzt1CA2KGVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108224'),
  ('1118115047151411998', 'Whooping Cough', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Péter Gárdos, Tibor Máthé', 'Péter Gárdos, András Osvát', 'Mari Törőcsik, Dezső Garas, Judit Hernádi, Marcell Tóth, Károly Eperjes, Gábor Reviczky, Péter Rudolf, Dénes Ujlaki', null, 'The story of 10-year-old boy and his family against the backdrop of the bloody events of 1956, in Budapest. Children do not yet understand what is going on, but they''re happy because the schools are closed. But gradually, to adults and children comes the understanding that something terrible is happening. Disappearing relatives, friends, and even killed some. Tips sent an army to put down the counterrevolutionary rebellion.', 'The story of 10-year-old boy and his family against the backdrop of the bloody events of 1956, in Budapest. Children do not yet understand what is going on, but they''re happy because the schools are closed. But gradually, to adults and children comes the understanding that something terrible is happening. Disappearing relatives, friends, and even killed some. Tips sent an army to put down the counterrevolutionary rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7advHkSGkVSJNcrLWVTas6eqgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133427'),
  ('833457710533890502', 'Whoops Apocalypse', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Tom Bussmann, Ron Robson', 'David Renwick, Andrew Marshall', 'Peter Cook, Loretta Swit, Michael Richards, Herbert Lom, Richard Wilson, Ian Richardson, Richard Pearson, Rik Mayall', 'R', 'When a small British owned island in the Caribbean is invaded and the world''s most dangerous terrorist kidnaps a member of the Royal family, the countdown to World War 3 begins. If anyone can prevent the oncoming apocalypse it''s the American President, but her closest ally the British Prime Minister appears to have gone stark raving mad.', 'When a small British owned island in the Caribbean is invaded and the world''s most dangerous terrorist kidnaps a member of the Royal family, the countdown to World War 3 begins. If anyone can prevent the oncoming apocalypse it''s the American President, but her closest ally the British Prime Minister appears to have gone stark raving mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1mmmdqQPJjNdXGgORoDTDt732w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30120'),
  ('33299187936205725', 'Whoops, I''m an Indian!', 1936, 'Comedy, Western', 'Del Lord', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Bud Jamison, Al Thompson, Al Ferguson, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'Set in the Old West, the stooges are crooked gamblers swindling the residents of a frontier town. They are discovered and must escape into the woods. To elude the sheriff they disguise themselves as Indians. Their plan works until Curly, dressed as a squaw, is forced to marry a local tough guy. The stooges are unmasked and wind up in the hoosegow.', 'Set in the Old West, the stooges are crooked gamblers swindling the residents of a frontier town. They are discovered and must escape into the woods. To elude the sheriff they disguise themselves as Indians. Their plan works until Curly, dressed as a squaw, is forced to marry a local tough guy. The stooges are unmasked and wind up in the hoosegow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7ABm1yPWtCS9oGKVIWM6Lx6NQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115809'),
  ('685148843019610807', 'Whore and Beloved', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marc Ferrer, Laura Ruiz Penacho, Marc Ferrer', 'Marc Ferrer', 'Zaida Carmona, Júlia Betrian, Marc Ferrer, Adrià Arbona, Jairo Morés, Laura Martinova, Yurena, Nausicaa Bonnín', null, 'Puta y amada is a comedy that narrates the constant ruptures and reconciliations of Marcos, a film director who is going through a creative crisis, and Adrián, a pop music composer. Both Marcos and his two friends, Zaida and Julia (with whom he shares his love for cinema), embark on a series of superficial relationships, which will make them move from simple selfishness to the revelation and awareness of the loved one, in this moral tale about the end of youth and the desidealization of the world.', 'Puta y amada is a comedy that narrates the constant ruptures and reconciliations of Marcos, a film director who is going through a creative crisis, and Adrián, a pop music composer. Both Marcos and his two friends, Zaida and Julia (with whom he shares his love for cinema), embark on a series of superficial relationships, which will make them move from simple selfishness to the revelation and awareness of the loved one, in this moral tale about the end of youth and the desidealization of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFGwzK4hLS6n6n8H0lr2GYcLj5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529643'),
  ('679999715165861580', 'Whores'' Glory', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Michael Glawogger, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Michael Glawogger', 'Emma, Ning, Toh, Wat, Palm, Lolita, Jhorna, Ruma', null, 'In Bangkok, Thailand, women punch a clock and wait for clients in a brightly lit glass box; in the red-light district of Faridpur, Bangladesh, a madam haggles over the price of a teenage girl; and in the border town of Reynosa, Mexico, crack-addicted women pray to a deity named Lady Death.', 'In Bangkok, Thailand, women punch a clock and wait for clients in a brightly lit glass box; in the red-light district of Faridpur, Bangladesh, a madam haggles over the price of a teenage girl; and in the border town of Reynosa, Mexico, crack-addicted women pray to a deity named Lady Death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MToUaJwsqxcS3JgDa3afL2P0io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85533'),
  ('108105916590963009', 'Whose Life Is It Anyway?', 1981, 'Drama', 'John Badham, Mario Tosi', 'Brian Clark, Reginald Rose', 'Richard Dreyfuss, John Cassavetes, Christine Lahti, Bob Balaban, Kenneth McMillan, Kaki Hunter, Thomas Carter, Alba Oms', 'R', 'Ken Harrison is an artist that lives to make sculptures. One day he is involved in a car accident, and is paralyzed from his neck down. All he can do is talk and move his head, and he wants to die. Whilst he is in hospital he makes friends with some of the staff, and they support him when he goes to trial to be allowed to die.', 'Ken Harrison is an artist that lives to make sculptures. One day he is involved in a car accident, and is paralyzed from his neck down. All he can do is talk and move his head, and he wants to die. Whilst he is in hospital he makes friends with some of the staff, and they support him when he goes to trial to be allowed to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qutLxh74RsoGEWfrI205yvwAlnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31695'),
  ('547810524617726674', 'Why', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nanni Loy, Sergio D''Offizi, Franco Lo Cascio', 'Sergio Amidei, Emilio Sanna', 'Alberto Sordi, Elga Andersen, Andrea Aureli, Nazzareno Natale, Michele Gammino, Lino Banfi, Luca Sportelli, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'Giuseppe Di Noi, an Italian surveyor living in Swiden, gets arrested at the border while going back to Italy with his family for a vacation. But can someone tell the man why?', 'Giuseppe Di Noi, an Italian surveyor living in Swiden, gets arrested at the border while going back to Italy with his family for a vacation. But can someone tell the man why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFGvi77y4sHMOTopRXJGTTzqEU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73827'),
  ('887028968960408385', 'Why Are the Bells Ringing, Mitica?', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucian Pintilie', 'Ion Luca Caragiale', 'Victor Rebengiuc, Mariana Mihuț, Tora Vasilescu, Gheorghe Dinică, Petre Gheorghiu, Mircea Diaconu, Ştefan Iordache, Florin Zamfirescu', null, 'Based on a theatrical text by Romanian writer Ion Luca Caragiale (1852-1912), who was a bitter and funny witness of the turn-of-the-20th-century Romanian bourgeois mores, Carnival Scenes manages to preserve and further enhance the slightly hysteric atmosphere of his plays. Pintilie creates a strange combination of carnival scenes which is brought to the screen as a burlesque, fast-paced, screwball comedy with a meditative undertone. This film was banned in Romania for a decade until the death of Ceausescu in 1989 and was only released after the 1989 revolution.', 'Based on a theatrical text by Romanian writer Ion Luca Caragiale (1852-1912), who was a bitter and funny witness of the turn-of-the-20th-century Romanian bourgeois mores, Carnival Scenes manages to preserve and further enhance the slightly hysteric atmosphere of his plays. Pintilie creates a strange combination of carnival scenes which is brought to the screen as a burlesque, fast-paced, screwball comedy with a meditative undertone. This film was banned in Romania for a decade until the death of Ceausescu in 1989 and was only released after the 1989 revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DIsTfwarutGiAcTzTtxoEmLalO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123712'),
  ('101072706343292555', 'Why Are We Creative?', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Hermann Vaske', 'Hermann Vaske', 'David Bowie, Stephen Hawking, Marina Abramović, Ai Weiwei, Angelina Jolie, Quentin Tarantino, Diane Kruger, Yoko Ono', null, 'A 30 years odyssey: the world''s most intriguing artists and thinkers from the fields of visual art, music, filmmaking, acting, literature, philosophy, politics, business and science, are asked the same question: "Why are you creative?"', 'A 30 years odyssey: the world''s most intriguing artists and thinkers from the fields of visual art, music, filmmaking, acting, literature, philosophy, politics, business and science, are asked the same question: "Why are you creative?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD7HPBmdH67J2zHsBSzFHbETDhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540003'),
  ('2409203059971480', 'Why Be Good?', 1929, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'William A. Seiter, Sidney Hickox', 'Carey Wilson', 'Colleen Moore, Bodil Rosing, John St. Polis, Neil Hamilton, Edward Martindel, Louis Natheaux, Lincoln Stedman, Eddie Clayton', 'NR', 'A flapper unwittingly falls for the boss'' son.', 'A flapper unwittingly falls for the boss'' son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owoMPgy3HMAHoO1egp6zIaup6Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288521'),
  ('930563959149175066', 'Why Can''t I Be Tarkovsky?', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Murat Düzgünoğlu, Arzu Gamze Kılınç, Serdar Guz', 'Murat Düzgünoğlu, Şebnem Vitrinel', 'Tansu Biçer, Esra Kızıldoğan, Menderes Samancılar, Vuslat Saraçoğlu, Tülay Bursa, Recep Yener, Sacide Taşaner, Hüseyin Baylan', null, 'Bahadır, an aspiring 35-year-old director, spends his life making cheap television films inspired by the stories of folk songs. On the other hand, he has a great ambition to make films like his idol, Tarkovsky. He stands between his dreams and the real, tragicomic conditions.', 'Bahadır, an aspiring 35-year-old director, spends his life making cheap television films inspired by the stories of folk songs. On the other hand, he has a great ambition to make films like his idol, Tarkovsky. He stands between his dreams and the real, tragicomic conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKkpcl1sVopOMBiUfp3tgrYXKWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328593'),
  ('176090560125252124', 'Why Change Your Wife?', 1920, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Alvin Wyckoff, Sam Wood', 'Sada Cowan, Olga Printzlau', 'Gloria Swanson, Thomas Meighan, Bebe Daniels, Theodore Kosloff, Sylvia Ashton, Clarence Geldart, Mayme Kelso, Lucien Littlefield', 'NR', 'Robert and Beth Bordon are married but share little. He runs into Sally at a cabaret and the Gordons are soon divorced. Just as he gets bored with Sally''s superficiality, Beth strives to improve her looks. The original couple falls in love again at a summer resort.', 'Robert and Beth Bordon are married but share little. He runs into Sally at a cabaret and the Gordons are soon divorced. Just as he gets bored with Sally''s superficiality, Beth strives to improve her looks. The original couple falls in love again at a summer resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c9Q4eSS4are9PemWgDOAxNhikw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53766'),
  ('693025361522373393', 'Why Cheat India', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Soumik Sen, Yash Nagarkoti, Alphonse Roy', 'Soumik Sen', 'Emraan Hashmi, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Ammar Taalwala, Samiksha Gaur, Shibani Bedi, Manuj Sharma', null, 'Rakesh Singh runs a business that allows education scams to flourish in the country. He enrolls bright students into his plan, makes them write proxy exams for students who are unable to score or pass, and then, helps them procure a fake degree.', 'Rakesh Singh runs a business that allows education scams to flourish in the country. He enrolls bright students into his plan, makes them write proxy exams for students who are unable to score or pass, and then, helps them procure a fake degree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cljRxxAOlmsmt1GOKymbNZNTHBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569584'),
  ('657862615719095975', 'Why Did I Get Married Too?', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tyler Perry, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Janet Jackson, Jill Scott, Sharon Leal, Malik Yoba, Richard T. Jones, Tasha Smith, Michael Jai White', 'PG-13', 'Four couples reunite for their annual vacation in order to socialize and to spend time analyzing their marriages. Their intimate week in the Bahamas is disrupted by the arrival of an ex-husband determined to win back his recently remarried wife.', 'Four couples reunite for their annual vacation in order to socialize and to spend time analyzing their marriages. Their intimate week in the Bahamas is disrupted by the arrival of an ex-husband determined to win back his recently remarried wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbSqG5ur1ipvs6WvGdQvc6Bt2K4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35688'),
  ('1117873551442052183', 'Why Did I Get Married?', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Janet Jackson, Jill Scott, Sharon Leal, Tasha Smith, Malik Yoba, Richard T. Jones, Michael Jai White', 'PG-13', 'Eight married college friends plus one other non-friend (all of whom have achieved middle to upper class economic status) go to Colorado for their annual week-long reunion, but the mood shifts when one couple''s infidelity comes to light. As secrets are revealed, each couple begins to question their own relationship.', 'Eight married college friends plus one other non-friend (all of whom have achieved middle to upper class economic status) go to Colorado for their annual week-long reunion, but the mood shifts when one couple''s infidelity comes to light. As secrets are revealed, each couple begins to question their own relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kmqgVuELTEoMt0dqRt3H48VcOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17202'),
  ('799654550355716311', 'Why Did You Come to My House', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hwang Soo-ah', 'Kim Ji-hye', 'Park Hee-soon, Kang Hye-jung, SEUNGRI, David Lee, Lee Do-hyeon, Ahn Byeong gyun, Ryu Hye yeon', null, 'Two misfits form an unlikely relationship after a woman breaks into a man''s house only to discover him in the midst of a suicide attempt.', 'Two misfits form an unlikely relationship after a woman breaks into a man''s house only to discover him in the midst of a suicide attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWObhU3yjhIs7P86FrYYTD1cyvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50340'),
  ('700033126697108698', 'Why Did You Kill Me?', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Fredrick Munk, Douglas Brian Miller, Carmen Delaney', null, 'Belinda Lane', 'R', 'The line between justice and revenge blurs when a devastated family uses social media to track down the people who killed 24-year-old Crystal Theobald.', 'The line between justice and revenge blurs when a devastated family uses social media to track down the people who killed 24-year-old Crystal Theobald.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYbyICfrtFyg666rVYX2yCb8EKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810731'),
  ('176082990011109337', 'Why Did You Pick On Me?', 1980, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Michele Lupo, Franco Di Giacomo, Salvatore Basile', 'Marcello Fondato, Francesco Scardamaglia', 'Bud Spencer, Cary Guffey, Ferruccio Amendola, Claudio Undari, John Bartha, Carlo Reali, Giancarlo Bastianoni, Giovanni Cianfriglia', null, 'Following the events of The Sheriff and the Satellite Kid, Sheriff Hall and H-725 (using the official identity of Charlie Warren) still get no rest from the military - because the little alien has not yet grasped the meaning of keeping a low profile. They are constantly on the move, and H-725''s father has had to pick them out of a tight spot too many times already.', 'Following the events of The Sheriff and the Satellite Kid, Sheriff Hall and H-725 (using the official identity of Charlie Warren) still get no rest from the military - because the little alien has not yet grasped the meaning of keeping a low profile. They are constantly on the move, and H-725''s father has had to pick them out of a tight spot too many times already.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWKXh3Uu696oQyoEdtNRg3ohTR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11039'),
  ('95334387240014080', 'Why Didn''t They Ask Evans?', 1980, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'John Davies, Tony Wharmby, Mike Humphreys', 'Pat Sandys', 'Francesca Annis, John Gielgud, Bernard Miles, Eric Porter, Leigh Lawson, James Warwick, Madeline Smith, Connie Booth', null, 'This intriguing story is set in the 1930s at a country house, where two amateur sleuths, Bobby Jones and Lady Frankie Derwent, try to unravel the mystery behind a tale of murder, suspense and false identities. And the only clues the two have to go on are the puzzling last words of a dying man. Featuring characters created by Agatha Christie, Why Didn''t They Ask Evans is a classic crime thriller sure to please murder-mystery fans.', 'This intriguing story is set in the 1930s at a country house, where two amateur sleuths, Bobby Jones and Lady Frankie Derwent, try to unravel the mystery behind a tale of murder, suspense and false identities. And the only clues the two have to go on are the puzzling last words of a dying man. Featuring characters created by Agatha Christie, Why Didn''t They Ask Evans is a classic crime thriller sure to please murder-mystery fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei8eVF9qZ14YBvuBI1FPr1lgqMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122775'),
  ('297289206185022989', 'Why Do Fools Fall In Love', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gregory Nava, Edward Lachman', 'Tina Andrews', 'Larenz Tate, Halle Berry, Vivica A. Fox, Lela Rochon, Pamela Reed, Clifton Powell, Paul Mazursky, Miguel A. Núñez Jr.', 'R', 'In the mid-80s, three women (each with an attorney) arrive at the office of New York entertainment manager, Morris Levy. One is an L.A. singer, formerly of the Platters; one is a petty thief from Philly; one teaches school in a small Georgia town. Each claims to be the widow of long-dead doo-wop singer-songwriter Frankie Lyman, and each wants years of royalties due to his estate, money Levy has never shared. During an ensuing civil trial, flashbacks tell the story of each one''s life with Lyman, a boyish, high-pitched, dynamic performer, lost to heroin. Slowly, the three wives establish their own bond.', 'In the mid-80s, three women (each with an attorney) arrive at the office of New York entertainment manager, Morris Levy. One is an L.A. singer, formerly of the Platters; one is a petty thief from Philly; one teaches school in a small Georgia town. Each claims to be the widow of long-dead doo-wop singer-songwriter Frankie Lyman, and each wants years of royalties due to his estate, money Levy has never shared. During an ensuing civil trial, flashbacks tell the story of each one''s life with Lyman, a boyish, high-pitched, dynamic performer, lost to heroin. Slowly, the three wives establish their own bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSj2g6VdJ2UXeWk9wRa19SsxRFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46702'),
  ('633145351805975920', 'Why Do They Call It Love When They Mean Sex?', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Manuel Gómez Pereira, Joaquín Oristrell', 'Jorge Sanz, Verónica Forqué, Rosa María Sardà, Fernando Guillén, Ayanta Barilli, Chacho Carreras, Fernando Colomo, Félix Cubero', null, 'Gloria is a porn artist that performs live-sex. When his mate gets sick he brings her a young substitute, Manu. The boy works surprisingly well and then Gloria decides to go into business with him. Things get complicated when Gloria discovers that Manu is in trouble because of his gambling debts.', 'Gloria is a porn artist that performs live-sex. When his mate gets sick he brings her a young substitute, Manu. The boy works surprisingly well and then Gloria decides to go into business with him. Things get complicated when Gloria discovers that Manu is in trouble because of his gambling debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dExiB3KIxSEq6d8v3GoQgHqf7X2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71796'),
  ('610931377114892132', 'Why Does Herr R. Run Amok?', 1970, 'Drama', 'Dietrich Lohmann, Michael Fengler, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Fengler', 'Kurt Raab, Lilith Ungerer, Lilo Pempeit, Franz Maron, Hanna Schygulla, Irm Hermann, Ingrid Caven, Harry Baer', null, 'Technical draftsman Herr R. is a dependable guy. He gets along with his colleagues although his boss wants him to go beyond technical cleanliness to problem solving. He''s a dutiful husband; his wife''s a social climber and pressures him to seek a promotion, but they also share sweet moments. He''s a caring father, helping his son with homework. His parents visit; his mother criticizes his wife. Old schoolmates drop by, as do neighbours. Some comment on his wife''s expensive tastes. His promotion may be a long shot, especially after he gives a dull and tipsy toast at an office dinner. But why would Herr R. run amok?', 'Technical draftsman Herr R. is a dependable guy. He gets along with his colleagues although his boss wants him to go beyond technical cleanliness to problem solving. He''s a dutiful husband; his wife''s a social climber and pressures him to seek a promotion, but they also share sweet moments. He''s a caring father, helping his son with homework. His parents visit; his mother criticizes his wife. Old schoolmates drop by, as do neighbours. Some comment on his wife''s expensive tastes. His promotion may be a long shot, especially after he gives a dull and tipsy toast at an office dinner. But why would Herr R. run amok?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnHawdMrCGmeeCb2SyYKuc1CvWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10308'),
  ('1052541581201587040', 'Why Don''t You Just Die!', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Kirill Sokolov, Aleksandr Kopeykin, Dmitriy Ulyukaev', 'Kirill Sokolov', 'Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Vitaliy Khaev, Evgeniya Kregzhde, Mikhail Gorevoy, Elena Shevchenko, Alexandr Domogarov Jr., Igor Grabuzov, Vladimir Afanasyev', 'NR', 'Andrey, a detective and the world''s most horrible father, brings together a terrible group of people in his apartment: his resentful actress daughter, an angry thug, and a cheated cop. Each one of them has a reason to want revenge..', 'Andrey, a detective and the world''s most horrible father, brings together a terrible group of people in his apartment: his resentful actress daughter, an angry thug, and a cheated cop. Each one of them has a reason to want revenge..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/warC8GJApWssmU9vXXZDY7OrU9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514684'),
  ('1103726950629198151', 'Why Don''t You Play in Hell?', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Sion Sono, Hideo Yamamoto, Go KINOMOTO', 'Sion Sono', 'Jun Kunimura, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Hiroki Hasegawa, Gen Hoshino, Fumi Nikaido, Tomochika, Tak Sakaguchi, Itsuji Itao', 'NR', 'In Japan, gonzo filmmakers hatch a three-pronged plan to save an actress''s career, end a yakuza war and make a hit movie.', 'In Japan, gonzo filmmakers hatch a three-pronged plan to save an actress''s career, end a yakuza war and make a hit movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jVK9vvUDp9eH0JSIUgcvlrqdGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134350'),
