  ('7224567708224946', 'Why Me?', 1990, 'Comedy, Action', 'Gene Quintano, Peter Deming', 'David Koepp', 'Christopher Lambert, Kim Greist, Christopher Lloyd, J.T. Walsh, Gregory Millar, Wendel Meldrum, Michael J. Pollard, John Hancock', 'R', 'A jewel thief steals a sacred ruby which sets off a chase by the police, the Turkish government, nutty American terrorists, and the CIA.', 'A jewel thief steals a sacred ruby which sets off a chase by the police, the Turkish government, nutty American terrorists, and the CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pj7CohDGed93oqA3755GeT6Qrad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142946'),
  ('93393015139557684', 'Why Men Don''t Listen and Women Can''t Read Maps', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Leander Haußmann, Tilman Büttner', 'Rochus Hahn, Alexander Stever', 'Benno Fürmann, Jessica Schwarz, Annika Kuhl, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Nadja Becker, Sasha, Tom Schilling, Lars Rudolph', null, 'Jan is an absolute heartthrob and a diehard Hertha fan. Katrin is attractive, just as successful and an incorrigible romantic. Chance makes the two the ideal couple. At least almost. Everything would be perfect if the two flagship models of their species did not lapse into primeval behavioral patterns. And so Jan sinks a little too deep in the cleavage of his secretary Melanie, and Katrin can not resist the adventurer Jonathan''s lead role.', 'Jan is an absolute heartthrob and a diehard Hertha fan. Katrin is attractive, just as successful and an incorrigible romantic. Chance makes the two the ideal couple. At least almost. Everything would be perfect if the two flagship models of their species did not lapse into primeval behavioral patterns. And so Jan sinks a little too deep in the cleavage of his secretary Melanie, and Katrin can not resist the adventurer Jonathan''s lead role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRsSvgnmKatNQm52WMzGfstNGiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5338'),
  ('880302629954553319', 'Why Not Me?', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stéphane Giusti, Antoine Roch', 'Stéphane Giusti', 'Amira Casar, Julie Gayet, Bruno Putzulu, Johnny Hallyday, Alexandra London, Carmen Chaplin, Brigitte Roüan, Marie-France Pisier', null, 'Four gay French expatriots share a business in Barcelona. When they and their parents are thrown together for a "coming out" party, another French Farce ensues.', 'Four gay French expatriots share a business in Barcelona. When they and their parents are thrown together for a "coming out" party, another French Farce ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFnhRI9RWcyEG2yXwt2SbAoyGJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61663'),
  ('250758689507146346', 'Why Not!', 1977, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Coline Serreau, Jean-François Robin', 'Coline Serreau', 'Sami Frey, Christine Murillo, Mario Gonzales, Nicole Jamet, Michel Aumont, Mathé Souverbie, Alain Salomon, Jacques Rispal', null, 'Alexa, Fernand, and Louis form a tender yet unconventional trio in a quiet suburban home. Fleeing failed marriages and societal expectations, they build a life rooted in love and mutual support. But their unorthodox arrangement stirs suspicion, especially from a curious police inspector whose own life is about to change in unexpected ways.', 'Alexa, Fernand, and Louis form a tender yet unconventional trio in a quiet suburban home. Fleeing failed marriages and societal expectations, they build a life rooted in love and mutual support. But their unorthodox arrangement stirs suspicion, especially from a curious police inspector whose own life is about to change in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iO6WoJM70CDhAe3Sr4gqUcT1VkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245567'),
  ('163390904618005055', 'Why Not!', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ryszard Zatorski, Tomasz Dobrowolski, Artur Zwierzchowski', 'Jan Kwiatkowski', 'Anna Cieślak, Maciej Zakościelny, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Anna Przybylska, Tomasz Kot, Antoni Pawlicki, Joanna Jabłczyńska, Agnieszka Warchulska', null, 'Maggie - comes from the province. Only come to Warsaw to begin studies at the Academy of Fine Arts. When you leave school - with a diploma in hand - must find a job, which is not an easy task from the perspective of today''s graduates opting for more emigration than to seek a good job in the country. In the case of Gretel everything ends happily, and in addition to that dream job find your love?', 'Maggie - comes from the province. Only come to Warsaw to begin studies at the Academy of Fine Arts. When you leave school - with a diploma in hand - must find a job, which is not an easy task from the perspective of today''s graduates opting for more emigration than to seek a good job in the country. In the case of Gretel everything ends happily, and in addition to that dream job find your love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FHxdlD28x3NvC0QYCs0BPyNwjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36384'),
  ('1134443018814442969', 'Why Not?', 1981, 'Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shinsaku Himeda, Hideo Nanbu', 'Shōhei Imamura, Ken Miyamoto', 'Shigeru Izumiya, Kaori Momoi, Masao Kusakari, Ken Ogata, Norihei Miki, Junzaburō Ban, Mitsuko Baisho, Shigeru Tsuyuguchi', null, 'The film depicts carnivalesque atmosphere summed up by the cry "Ei ja nai ka" ("Why not?") in Japan in 1867 and 1868 in the days leading to the Meiji Restoration. It examines the effects of the political and social upheaval of the time, and culminates in a revelrous march on the Tokyo Imperial Palace, which turns into a massacre. Characteristically, Imamura focuses not on the leaders of the country, but on characters in the lower classes and on the fringes of society.', 'The film depicts carnivalesque atmosphere summed up by the cry "Ei ja nai ka" ("Why not?") in Japan in 1867 and 1868 in the days leading to the Meiji Restoration. It examines the effects of the political and social upheaval of the time, and culminates in a revelrous march on the Tokyo Imperial Palace, which turns into a massacre. Characteristically, Imamura focuses not on the leaders of the country, but on characters in the lower classes and on the fringes of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g82MEaenPvPkSiRGqKcFeYQHmub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42143'),
  ('626139119678564455', 'Why Stop Now?', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ron Nyswaner, Phil Dorling, Ben Kutchins', 'Ron Nyswaner, Phil Dorling', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Melissa Leo, Tracy Morgan, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Sarah Ramos, Emma Rayne Lyle, Stephanie March', 'R', 'When a college piano prodigy tries to check his mother into rehab, he is taken hostage by her drug dealer and swept along on a wild adventure.', 'When a college piano prodigy tries to check his mother into rehab, he is taken hostage by her drug dealer and swept along on a wild adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEaVD2RJADGWUhlBkhGV0vQoHrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118677'),
