  ('910924499707963805', 'Why Try to Escape from That Which You Know You Can''t Escape From? Because You Are a Coward', 1970, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Lars von Trier', 'Lars von Trier', null, null, 'A man is being haunted by a masked stranger. The only language used in the movie comes from three (inter) title cards and a few sentences of sermon-like talk in Danish. Some of the talk is modified citations from the bible and similar sources.', 'A man is being haunted by a masked stranger. The only language used in the movie comes from three (inter) title cards and a few sentences of sermon-like talk in Danish. Some of the talk is modified citations from the bible and similar sources.', null, 'tmdb:movie:261272'),
  ('671927592903528237', 'Why Was I Born a Woman?', 1970, 'Drama', 'Rogelio A. González', 'Miriam Salinas Price', 'Sara García, Andrés Soler, Prudencia Grifell, Ofelia Guilmáin, Ana Martín, Pilar Pellicer, Gilberto Román, José Gálvez', null, 'A family gathers to celebrate Mother''s Day, that day a woman discuss many problems about her woman condition; husband, children and grandchildren will hear she tired and overwhelmed silenced by submission and obedience. Analysis of the family and gender roles.', 'A family gathers to celebrate Mother''s Day, that day a woman discuss many problems about her woman condition; husband, children and grandchildren will hear she tired and overwhelmed silenced by submission and obedience. Analysis of the family and gender roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C2rV6DncMoqBoVKakApZSyd8qA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144301'),
  ('26552251808157308', 'Why We Fight', 2005, 'Documentary, History', 'Eugene Jarecki, May Ying Welsh, Étienne Sauret', 'Eugene Jarecki', 'Chalmers Johnson, Joseph Cirincione, Gore Vidal, Charles Lewis, Richard Perle, William Kristol, John McCain, Ken Adelman', 'PG-13', 'Is American foreign policy dominated by the idea of military supremacy? Has the military become too important in American life? Jarecki''s shrewd and intelligent polemic would seem to give an affirmative answer to each of these questions.', 'Is American foreign policy dominated by the idea of military supremacy? Has the military become too important in American life? Jarecki''s shrewd and intelligent polemic would seem to give an affirmative answer to each of these questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfOmnlwt1rrhxmxc05X3i9mHSOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14286'),
  ('137192928296346001', 'Why We Fight: Divide and Conquer', 1943, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, Anatole Litvak, Arthur L. Todd', 'Roger Q. Denny, Philip G. Epstein, Julius J. Epstein', 'Knox Manning, Murray Alper, General Bergeret, Monte Blue, Karl Brandt, Maurice Brierre, Winston Churchill, Ann Codee', null, 'The third film of Frank Capra''s ''Why We Fight" propaganda film series, dealing with the Nazi conquest of Western Europe in 1940.', 'The third film of Frank Capra''s ''Why We Fight" propaganda film series, dealing with the Nazi conquest of Western Europe in 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7i7ABmUn3yONKJtnlg8xodysLmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159849'),
  ('322090738141633573', 'Why We Fight: Prelude to War', 1942, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, Anatole Litvak, Robert Flaherty', null, 'Walter Huston, Max Schmeling, Adolf Hitler', null, 'Prelude to War was the first film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series, commissioned by the Pentagon and George C. Marshall. It was made to convince American troops of the necessity of combating the Axis Powers during World War II. This film examines the differences between democratic and fascist states.', 'Prelude to War was the first film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series, commissioned by the Pentagon and George C. Marshall. It was made to convince American troops of the necessity of combating the Axis Powers during World War II. This film examines the differences between democratic and fascist states.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpkCDbVQDXth2lK3Zw5FYcxAvX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23336'),
  ('1101875343852944464', 'Why We Fight: The Battle of Britain', 1943, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, Anthony Veiller', null, 'Walter Huston, Frieda Inescort, John B. Hughes', 'PG', 'The fourth of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight series of seven propaganda films, which made the case for fighting and winning the Second World War. It was released in 1943 and concentrated on the German bombardment of the United Kingdom in anticipation of Operation Sea Lion, the planned German invasion.', 'The fourth of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight series of seven propaganda films, which made the case for fighting and winning the Second World War. It was released in 1943 and concentrated on the German bombardment of the United Kingdom in anticipation of Operation Sea Lion, the planned German invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8sXpxL7uIynG4VpqwC5RVYTENY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79090'),
  ('494265934837592103', 'Why We Fight: The Battle of China', 1944, 'War, Documentary', 'Anatole Litvak, Frank Capra', null, 'Anthony Veiller, Walter Huston', null, 'The sixth film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series illustrates Japan''s occupation of China, including Madame Chiang Kai-Shek''s stirring address before congress, the rape of Nanking, the great 2,000 mile migration, and Claire Chennault''s Flying Tigers.', 'The sixth film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series illustrates Japan''s occupation of China, including Madame Chiang Kai-Shek''s stirring address before congress, the rape of Nanking, the great 2,000 mile migration, and Claire Chennault''s Flying Tigers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6O8iJ5AiTewW9fuBEHlCYND8Yfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86084'),
  ('144331683763137298', 'Why We Fight: The Battle of Russia', 1943, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, Anatole Litvak, Robert Flaherty', null, 'Anthony Veiller, Ion Antonescu, Nikolai Cherkasov, Miklós Horthy, Alfred Jodl, King Boris III, King Michael', null, 'The fifth film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series, revealing the nature and process of the fight between the Soviet Union and Germany in the Second World War.', 'The fifth film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series, revealing the nature and process of the fight between the Soviet Union and Germany in the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgcuUIKFkiVwtUzZy7iE7oeD8ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112912'),
  ('290786762818079790', 'Why We Fight: The Nazis Strike', 1943, 'War, Documentary', 'Frank Capra, Anatole Litvak, Robert Flaherty', null, 'Edvard Beneš, Neville Chamberlain, Clementine Churchill, Winston Churchill, Galeazzo Ciano, Édouard Daladier, Walter Huston', null, 'The second film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series. It introduces Germany as a nation whose aggressive ambitions began in 1863 with Otto von Bismarck and the Nazis as its latest incarnation.', 'The second film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight propaganda film series. It introduces Germany as a nation whose aggressive ambitions began in 1863 with Otto von Bismarck and the Nazis as its latest incarnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXnZp8mmZUWG4jH3CaoULJoJcom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86082'),
  ('586945574514081293', 'Why Worry?', 1923, 'Comedy', 'Sam Taylor, Fred C. Newmeyer, Walter Lundin', 'Sam Taylor, Ted Wilde, Tim Whelan', 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, John Aasen, Wally Howe, James Pier Mason, Leo White, Gaylord Lloyd, Mark Jones', 'NR', 'A hypochondriac vacations in the tropics for the fresh air - and finds himself in the middle of a revolution instead.', 'A hypochondriac vacations in the tropics for the fresh air - and finds himself in the middle of a revolution instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NrgFBBgOyL0vDAZ17jo3EIQ2uo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41348'),
  ('606389513166141849', 'Why, Charlie Brown, Why?', 1990, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Sam Jaimes', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Adrienne Stiefel, Kaleb Henley, Brandon Stewart, Olivia Burnette, Jennifer Banko, Bill Melendez', null, 'A new girl comes to the neighbourhood school and Linus is smitten with her. Unfortunately, she develops the symptoms of leukemia and must go to the hospital for cancer treatment. Linus and Charlie Brown help her through the traumas of chemotherapy as best they can while Snoopy plays at being the world''s greatest doctor.', 'A new girl comes to the neighbourhood school and Linus is smitten with her. Unfortunately, she develops the symptoms of leukemia and must go to the hospital for cancer treatment. Linus and Charlie Brown help her through the traumas of chemotherapy as best they can while Snoopy plays at being the world''s greatest doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bWXHBekb1MgVU80So6rES9pGo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133131'),
  ('878034050665454583', 'Why?', 1987, 'Drama', 'Karel Smyczek, Miloš Kohout, Alice Kulhánková Ronovská', 'Radek John, Karel Smyczek', 'Jiří Langmajer, Martin Sobotka, Pavel Zvarič, Pavlína Mourková, Jan Potměšil, Daniel Heyna Větrovský, Daniel Landa, Markéta Zmožková', null, 'Why? (Czech: Proč?) is a 1987 Czechoslovak drama film directed by Karel Smyczek. It was screened in the Un Certain Regard section at the 1988 Cannes Film Festival. The film deals with the hooliganism in Czechoslovakia, particularly with the fans of football club Sparta from Prague, whose supporters were the pioneers of the football fan riots in Czechoslovakia, starting with hooligan actions already in the 1960s, like breaking the trains in which they travelled when they went on Sparta''s away games. The film deals with one of such episodes', 'Why? (Czech: Proč?) is a 1987 Czechoslovak drama film directed by Karel Smyczek. It was screened in the Un Certain Regard section at the 1988 Cannes Film Festival. The film deals with the hooliganism in Czechoslovakia, particularly with the fans of football club Sparta from Prague, whose supporters were the pioneers of the football fan riots in Czechoslovakia, starting with hooligan actions already in the 1960s, like breaking the trains in which they travelled when they went on Sparta''s away games. The film deals with one of such episodes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DQ8Wa0Mo1u9fRbK0jwCvwusz1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123849'),
  ('842848892956774228', 'Wichita', 1955, 'Western', 'Jacques Tourneur, Harold Lipstein, Austen Jewell', 'Daniel B. Ullman', 'Joel McCrea, Vera Miles, Lloyd Bridges, Wallace Ford, Edgar Buchanan, Peter Graves, Keith Larsen, Carl Benton Reid', null, 'Former buffalo hunter and entrepreneur Wyatt Earp arrives in the lawless cattle town of Wichita Kansas. His skill as a gun-fighter makes him a perfect candidate for Marshal, but he refuses the job until he feels morally obligated to bring law and order to this wild town.', 'Former buffalo hunter and entrepreneur Wyatt Earp arrives in the lawless cattle town of Wichita Kansas. His skill as a gun-fighter makes him a perfect candidate for Marshal, but he refuses the job until he feels morally obligated to bring law and order to this wild town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne83mYnmEBLhXnU8qawebKTA1nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114975'),
  ('362588711274853626', 'Wick Is Pain', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Jeffrey Doe', null, 'Keanu Reeves, Chad Stahelski, David Leitch, Jackson Spidell, Basil Iwanyk, Erica Lee, Heidi Moneymaker, Daniel Bernhardt', 'NR', 'Witness the never-before-seen footage and true story behind the John Wick phenomenon – from independent film to billion-dollar franchise.', 'Witness the never-before-seen footage and true story behind the John Wick phenomenon – from independent film to billion-dollar franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctZ9bjmCYyfFt3cUepc9axr0zHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1472668'),
  ('482525150601815759', 'Wicked', 1998, 'Thriller', 'Michael Steinberg, Bernd Heinl', 'Eric Weiss', 'Julia Stiles, William R. Moses, Patrick Muldoon, Vanessa Zima, Louise Myrback, Chelsea Field, Casey Rion, Venessa Verdugo', 'R', 'A cul-de-sac in an oppressive suburb becomes a literal dead end for wife and mother Karen Christianson when she is brutally murdered in her own home. In the wake of the event, Karen''s teenage daughter Ellie begins to exhibit bizarre behaviors as she slowly acquires her mother''s demeanor and mannerisms. Meanwhile, Karen''s husband Ben nurtures a less-than-innocent interest in the family''s sultry live-in nanny, Lena.', 'A cul-de-sac in an oppressive suburb becomes a literal dead end for wife and mother Karen Christianson when she is brutally murdered in her own home. In the wake of the event, Karen''s teenage daughter Ellie begins to exhibit bizarre behaviors as she slowly acquires her mother''s demeanor and mannerisms. Meanwhile, Karen''s husband Ben nurtures a less-than-innocent interest in the family''s sultry live-in nanny, Lena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13ix5ryXWE9l8UhtEKuJrkjmsTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44046'),
  ('709286177073066040', 'Wicked', 2021, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Taryn O''Neill, Steven Parker', 'Joany Kane', 'Liam Hall, Anna Maiche, Kevin Joy, Andrew Rogers, Joy Rovaris, Dean J. West, Elyse Mirto, Cyrus Farmer', null, 'Ivy Morgan, a college student in New Orleans, falls for Ren Owens, the last person she expected to enter her rigidly controlled life.', 'Ivy Morgan, a college student in New Orleans, falls for Ren Owens, the last person she expected to enter her rigidly controlled life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gp6TJEs5atttH9xFqEootyQz5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834143'),
  ('227645403569516444', 'Wicked', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Alice Brooks, Stephen Oremus, John Powell', 'Winnie Holzman, Dana Fox', 'Cynthia Erivo, Ariana Grande, Michelle Yeoh, Jonathan Bailey, Ethan Slater, Marissa Bode, Jeff Goldblum, Peter Dinklage', 'PG', 'In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two''s unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.', 'In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two''s unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402431'),
  ('734656665466664128', 'Wicked as They Come', 1956, 'Drama', 'Basil Emmott, Ken Hughes, Philip Shipway', 'Ken Hughes', 'Arlene Dahl, Philip Carey, Herbert Marshall, Michael Goodliffe, David Kossoff, Marvin Kane, Sidney James, Gil Winfield', 'NR', 'A ruthless woman takes advantage of gullible men to climb up the social ladder.', 'A ruthless woman takes advantage of gullible men to climb up the social ladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T7LfDPrvnCpwU5UYdDhRMB4v3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37462'),
  ('691141330556651445', 'Wicked Blood', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Young, Gregg Easterbrook, John Michael Sudol', 'Mark Young', 'Abigail Breslin, James Purefoy, Sean Bean, Alexa PenaVega, Jake Busey, Lew Temple, Thomas Francis Murphy, Dodie Brown', 'NR', 'Hannah and Amber Baker are trapped in a dark Southern underworld of violence, drugs and bikers. Both live in fear of their "Uncle Frank" Stinson, the ruthless leader of a crime organization.', 'Hannah and Amber Baker are trapped in a dark Southern underworld of violence, drugs and bikers. Both live in fear of their "Uncle Frank" Stinson, the ruthless leader of a crime organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTxOsk0wVG1EgyCbWbaNxQXZLxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256740'),
  ('78191477829906979', 'Wicked City', 1987, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Kinichi Ishikawa', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Norio Osada', 'Yusaku Yara, Toshiko Fujita, Ichiro Nagai, Takeshi Aono, Mari Yokoo, Tamio Ohki, Koji Totani, Yasuo Muramatsu', 'NR', 'A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.', 'A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFtLwGv6pcqO72M1v5iQYZOCkZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21453'),
  ('1012422772120948414', 'Wicked City', 1992, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Mak Tai-Kit, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Tsui Hark, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Leon Lai Ming, Michele Reis, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Tatsuya Nakadai, Yuen Woo-Ping, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Reiko Hayama', 'NR', 'A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.', 'A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/560uq9mziscCktjYGYBc24q9z44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69011'),
  ('967401084972423628', 'Wicked Flying Monkeys', 2015, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Alberto Mar', 'Jorge R. Gutierrez, Evan Gore, Doug Langdale', 'Loreto Peralta, Susana Zabaleta, Maya Tremblay, Mikey Bolts, Erik Braa, Liliana Barba Meinecke, José Antonio Toledano, Magda Giner', 'G', 'Ozzy is an enthusiastic and friendly flying monkey, son of the legendary Goliath, the brave warrior. They serve Evilene - the wicked witch - just as the rest of their kin. But Ozzy is not happy about it and when Evilene''s plans put Oz once again in peril, Ozzy reaches out to the Champions of Oz, three great friends (the Lion, the Scarecrow and the Tinman) with incredible qualities that have taken Emerald City to its maximum splendor.', 'Ozzy is an enthusiastic and friendly flying monkey, son of the legendary Goliath, the brave warrior. They serve Evilene - the wicked witch - just as the rest of their kin. But Ozzy is not happy about it and when Evilene''s plans put Oz once again in peril, Ozzy reaches out to the Champions of Oz, three great friends (the Lion, the Scarecrow and the Tinman) with incredible qualities that have taken Emerald City to its maximum splendor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AAl2v9ZTNuUjptVKNOV6jWL4ts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268689'),
  ('775334457768758559', 'Wicked Girl', 2017, 'Drama, Animation', 'Ayçe Kartal', 'Ayçe Kartal', 'Zeynep Naz Daldal', null, 'S. is an eight-year-old Turkish girl endowed with an exuberant imagination, who loves nature and animals. When, from her hospital bed she recalls the happy days spent in her grandparents village, dark and terrifying memories rise to the surface and slowly start to make sense.', 'S. is an eight-year-old Turkish girl endowed with an exuberant imagination, who loves nature and animals. When, from her hospital bed she recalls the happy days spent in her grandparents village, dark and terrifying memories rise to the surface and slowly start to make sense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npHiN4gUAXKIHoXcmH39SnH9Z24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461301'),
  ('403056989848162373', 'Wicked Lake', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Zach Passero', 'Adam Rockoff, Chris Sivertson', 'Carlee Baker, Angela Bettis, Eve Mauro, Robin Sydney, Will Keenan, J.D. Brown, Michael Esparza, Eryn Joslyn', null, 'Two clans of deranged males make the mistake of stalking four young women they assume to be easy prey, only to find out that at the stroke of midnight the tables will be turned and all hell will break loose.', 'Two clans of deranged males make the mistake of stalking four young women they assume to be easy prey, only to find out that at the stroke of midnight the tables will be turned and all hell will break loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smM6OKykgl5xctEloc6VfBohRen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25579'),
