  ('391657668792853975', 'Wicked Minds', 2003, 'Mystery, Drama, Romance, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jason Hreno, Georges Archambault', 'Turi Meyer, Alfredo Septién', 'Angie Everhart, Andrew W. Walker, Winston Rekert, Amy Sloan, Frank Schorpion, Ellen David, Conrad Pla, Alan Fawcett', 'PG-13', 'Holden returns home from college and is surprised to find his overpowering competitive father married to a much younger woman Lana. Holden quickly falls for the beauty and charisma of his step mother. A passionate affair begins between son and stepmother.', 'Holden returns home from college and is surprised to find his overpowering competitive father married to a much younger woman Lana. Holden quickly falls for the beauty and charisma of his step mother. A passionate affair begins between son and stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6A15cDR8mpdOxW4y7UzFanzbM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153104'),
