  ('93886188106030551', 'Wicked, Wicked', 1973, 'Horror, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Frederick Gately, Richard L. Bare', 'Richard L. Bare', 'David Bailey, Tiffany Bolling, Randolph Roberts, Scott Brady, Edd Byrnes, Diane McBain, Madeleine Sherwood, Indira Stefanianna', 'PG', 'Simmons, the manager of a seaside hotel in California, has a problem: Guests are turning up dead, and Sgt. Ramsey, the hotel''s detective, has no information as to the identity of the murderer. The only thing anybody knows is that the killer wears a strange mask and has a fondness for blonde women. As Ramsey tracks down a list of suspects that includes the hotel handyman, Lisa, the hotel''s lounge singer, finds herself in danger.', 'Simmons, the manager of a seaside hotel in California, has a problem: Guests are turning up dead, and Sgt. Ramsey, the hotel''s detective, has no information as to the identity of the murderer. The only thing anybody knows is that the killer wears a strange mask and has a fondness for blonde women. As Ramsey tracks down a list of suspects that includes the hotel handyman, Lisa, the hotel''s lounge singer, finds herself in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eynk0Kkiu0aZlZClVRv5o3n5PKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86494'),
  ('221910609868969969', 'Wicked: For Good', 2025, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Romance', 'Jon M. Chu, Alice Brooks, John Powell', 'Winnie Holzman, Dana Fox', 'Cynthia Erivo, Ariana Grande, Jeff Goldblum, Michelle Yeoh, Jonathan Bailey, Ethan Slater, Marissa Bode, Colman Domingo', 'PG', 'As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba will need to come together one final time. With their singular friendship now the fulcrum of their futures, they will need to truly see each other, with honesty and empathy, if they are to change themselves, and all of Oz, for good.', 'As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba will need to come together one final time. With their singular friendship now the fulcrum of their futures, they will need to truly see each other, with honesty and empathy, if they are to change themselves, and all of Oz, for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si9tolnefLSUKaqQEGz1bWArOaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967941'),
