  ('121823834472284015', 'Wicker Park', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Paul McGuigan, Peter Sova, Pedro Gandol', 'Brandon Boyce', 'Josh Hartnett, Rose Byrne, Matthew Lillard, Diane Kruger, Christopher Cousins, Jessica Paré, Vlasta Vrana, Amy Sobol', 'PG-13', 'Matthew, a young advertising executive in Chicago, puts his life and a business trip to China on hold when he thinks he sees Lisa, the love of his life who left him without a word two years earlier, walking out of a restaurant one day.', 'Matthew, a young advertising executive in Chicago, puts his life and a business trip to China on hold when he thinks he sees Lisa, the love of his life who left him without a word two years earlier, walking out of a restaurant one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRKEluSpV1wBrZVTvLLaCSkzqcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11208'),
