  ('205083293360087145', 'Widow on the Hill', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Peter Svatek, David Greene', null, 'Natasha Henstridge, James Brolin, Jewel Staite, Gabriel Hogan, Jeff Roop, Roman Podhora, Melinda Deines, Michèle Duquet', null, 'A sexy young hospice nurse, is hired by a wealthy man to care for his sick wife who eventually dies. When the nurse becomes the widower''s new bride and then he dies suspiciously leaving his vast fortune to the new Mrs., his daughter becomes convinced that her gold-digging stepmother is up to no good and could be a murderess.', 'A sexy young hospice nurse, is hired by a wealthy man to care for his sick wife who eventually dies. When the nurse becomes the widower''s new bride and then he dies suspiciously leaving his vast fortune to the new Mrs., his daughter becomes convinced that her gold-digging stepmother is up to no good and could be a murderess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HRVig979HjAyxnkd6Tw0jH7B0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60660'),
