  ('259689195240736078', 'Widow''s Walk', 1987, 'Crime', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Charles Van Damme', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre', 'Philippe Noiret, Guy Marchand, Élisabeth Bourgine, Anne Roussel, Gabrielle Lazure, Marie Trintignant, Andréa Ferréol, Philippe Polet', null, 'Molinat is assigned to the case of a man found with a bullet in his ear on the shore of a little Atlantic coast resort he knows well. Indeed, he used to live there before his wife disappeared at sea, never to be found again. As the ocean rejects a new corpse everyday, the mystery thickens and the list of potential suspects grows longer. This slows Molinat''s progress as much as the cumbersome Leroyer, sent in to spy on him and hopefully impede his progress. The tension mounts and the ring involving the three young ladies in the grey mansion, the village idiot and the real estate agent starts spinning out of control.', 'Molinat is assigned to the case of a man found with a bullet in his ear on the shore of a little Atlantic coast resort he knows well. Indeed, he used to live there before his wife disappeared at sea, never to be found again. As the ocean rejects a new corpse everyday, the mystery thickens and the list of potential suspects grows longer. This slows Molinat''s progress as much as the cumbersome Leroyer, sent in to spy on him and hopefully impede his progress. The tension mounts and the ring involving the three young ladies in the grey mansion, the village idiot and the real estate agent starts spinning out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMDnQxeJQxAJjhPPVuFnHC9PBGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230823'),
