  ('298614637016721583', 'Wife''s Sexual Fantasy: Before Husband''s Eyes', 1980, 'Drama, Crime', 'Masaru Konuma, Shun Nakahara, Masaru Mori', 'Kazuo Komizu', 'Yuki Kazamatsuri, Rika Takahara, Yoshiko Sasaki, Hiroshi Unayama, Ryoichi Kusanagi, Ren Seidō, Hidemi Satô, Tetsuya Ogiwara', null, 'After a married businessman has his way with a young prostitute he takes good soak in the bath. When he returns to the bedroom he discovers her bloody body. Suddenly two men enter the room with cameras proceed to blackmail him. At first they just want money but when they find out the businessman has a sexy wife she becomes part of the payment.', 'After a married businessman has his way with a young prostitute he takes good soak in the bath. When he returns to the bedroom he discovers her bloody body. Suddenly two men enter the room with cameras proceed to blackmail him. At first they just want money but when they find out the businessman has a sexy wife she becomes part of the payment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yB8piTFpVwXhgcYU3tYsSjvvgOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349186'),
  ('298199609024038493', 'Wifelike', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot, James Bird', 'James Bird', 'Elena Kampouris, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Doron Bell, Agam Darshi, Sara Sampaio, Alix Villaret, Fletcher Donovan, C.J. Perry Barnyashev', 'R', 'A grieving detective in the near-future hunts down criminals who trade artificial humans on the black market. In the fight to end AI exploitation, an underground resistance attempts to infiltrate him by sabotaging the programming of the artificial human assigned as his companion to behave like his late wife. She begins to question her reality as memories of a past life begin to surface in a world where nothing is as it seems.', 'A grieving detective in the near-future hunts down criminals who trade artificial humans on the black market. In the fight to end AI exploitation, an underground resistance attempts to infiltrate him by sabotaging the programming of the artificial human assigned as his companion to behave like his late wife. She begins to question her reality as memories of a past life begin to surface in a world where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tea2gDZPxw0wfKC2S2VRWHagtt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001835'),
