  ('348136153154887004', 'Wild America', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'William Dear, Ingrid K. Behrens, Melanie Grefé', 'David Michael Wieger', 'Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Scott Bairstow, Devon Sawa, Frances Fisher, Jamey Sheridan, Tracey Walter, Danny Glover, Zack Ward', 'PG', 'Three brothers - Marshall, Marty and Mark dream of becoming naturalists and portraying animal life of America. One summer their dream comes true, they travel through America, filming alligators, bears and moose.', 'Three brothers - Marshall, Marty and Mark dream of becoming naturalists and portraying animal life of America. One summer their dream comes true, they travel through America, filming alligators, bears and moose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9VIy9qtq49EDwgYFg07ganUYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38225'),
