  ('351531465065763138', 'Wild Animals', 1984, 'Thriller', 'Jean-Louis Daniel', 'Philippe Setbon, Jean-Louis Daniel', 'Daniel Auteuil, Philippe Léotard, Véronique Delbourg, Florent Pagny, Gabrielle Lazure, Macha Méril, Jean-François Balmer, Farid Chopel', null, 'Berg and Bela are married stunt drivers, but one night Bela dies in an accident. Jaded and reclusive, Berg becomes a nighttime security guard where he befriends a young woman, Mimi, who works nights too. Soon a shadowy figure from Bela''s past comes into Berg and Mimi''s lives. Berg is forced to protect Mimi and seems responsible for a murder, but the man from Bela''s past who caused her so much pain won''t stop until he sees Berg suffer as much as Bela did.', 'Berg and Bela are married stunt drivers, but one night Bela dies in an accident. Jaded and reclusive, Berg becomes a nighttime security guard where he befriends a young woman, Mimi, who works nights too. Soon a shadowy figure from Bela''s past comes into Berg and Mimi''s lives. Berg is forced to protect Mimi and seems responsible for a murder, but the man from Bela''s past who caused her so much pain won''t stop until he sees Berg suffer as much as Bela did.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/251B88YtmF98HNIVRr039mu765P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270447'),
