  ('28868910024428827', 'Wild Boys of the Road', 1933, 'Drama', 'William A. Wellman, Arthur L. Todd, Maxwell Arnow', 'Earl Baldwin', 'Frankie Darro, Edwin Phillips, Rochelle Hudson, Dorothy Coonan Wellman, Sterling Holloway, Arthur Hohl, Ann Hovey, Minna Gombell', 'NR', 'At the height of the Great Depression, Tommy''s mother has been out of work for months when Eddie''s father loses his job. Eager not to burden their parents, the two high school sophomores decide to hop the freight trains and look for work.', 'At the height of the Great Depression, Tommy''s mother has been out of work for months when Eddie''s father loses his job. Eager not to burden their parents, the two high school sophomores decide to hop the freight trains and look for work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1nq13h6Q7C90LTnxFIV5XaI7VQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50073'),
  ('263860473235112151', 'Wild Camp', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christophe Ali, Nicolas Bonilauri, Jérôme Peyrebrune', 'Nicolas Bonilauri, Christophe Ali', 'Denis Lavant, Isild Le Besco, Pascal Bongard, Jean-Michel Guerin, Martine Demaret, Raphaëlle Misrahi, Emmanuelle Bercot, Marcel Fix', null, 'A tranquil campground in rural France is the backdrop for this erotic sizzler between beautiful teenager Camille and down on his luck ex con, Blaise. Fresh out of prison, Blaise accepts a job as sailing instructor at the camp. Haunted by violent nightmares and reminded daily of his estranged wife and children, Blaise tries mightily to resist Camille’s charms. But the girl’s spontaneity and nubile sexuality awaken Blaise’s own repressed capacity for life.', 'A tranquil campground in rural France is the backdrop for this erotic sizzler between beautiful teenager Camille and down on his luck ex con, Blaise. Fresh out of prison, Blaise accepts a job as sailing instructor at the camp. Haunted by violent nightmares and reminded daily of his estranged wife and children, Blaise tries mightily to resist Camille’s charms. But the girl’s spontaneity and nubile sexuality awaken Blaise’s own repressed capacity for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEnRGNk8DUSCZ3mnbURCLSYNzXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40185'),
  ('1134345574757767635', 'Wild Card', 2003, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Kim Yoo-jin', 'Lee Man-hee', 'Yang Dong-geun, Jung Jin-young, Han Chae-young, Yoo Ha-bok, Ki Joo-bong, Lee Do-gyeong', null, 'Two detectives investigate a string of horrific murders in Seoul and zero in on a sadistic gang leader who carries an actual ball and chain.', 'Two detectives investigate a string of horrific murders in Seoul and zero in on a sadistic gang leader who carries an actual ball and chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RENRRP2qVL7wr0w1OSPxU5gY2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52884'),
  ('145032316059350277', 'Wild Card', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Simon West, Shelly Johnson, Ann C. Salzer', 'William Goldman', 'Jason Statham, Michael Angarano, Dominik Garcia, Milo Ventimiglia, Hope Davis, Max Casella, Stanley Tucci, Sofía Vergara', 'R', 'When a Las Vegas bodyguard with lethal skills and a gambling problem gets in trouble with the mob, he has one last play… and it''s all or nothing.', 'When a Las Vegas bodyguard with lethal skills and a gambling problem gets in trouble with the mob, he has one last play… and it''s all or nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zN80Tlly8oMpKbVJv2TfRIj8dHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265208'),
  ('500588093024217797', 'Wild Cherry', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Dana Lustig, Michael Marshall', 'David Kolbowicz, Grant Vetters', 'Tania Raymonde, Rumer Willis, Kristin Cavallari, Rob Schneider, Ryan Merriman, Jesse Moss, John White, Tia Carrere', 'R', 'A virginal high school senior decides to get revenge on her jock boyfriend when she discovers he''s only dating her in hopes that she''ll end up in his team''s "bang book."', 'A virginal high school senior decides to get revenge on her jock boyfriend when she discovers he''s only dating her in hopes that she''ll end up in his team''s "bang book."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxmKhXpIznlYvIjAKJKQKKb3T8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53729'),
  ('63977331796792900', 'Wild Chicks in Love', 2007, 'Romance, Family, Comedy', 'Vivian Naefe, Peter Döttling', 'Vivian Naefe, Marie Graf, Uschi Reich', 'Michelle von Treuberg, Lucie Hollmann, Paula Riemann, Zsá Zsá Inci Bürkle, Jette Hering, Jeremy Mockridge, Philip Wiegratz, Martin Kurz', null, 'Five teenage girls navigate the twists and turns of their complicated emotional lives, and learn the secrets of the heart through their friendship.', 'Five teenage girls navigate the twists and turns of their complicated emotional lives, and learn the secrets of the heart through their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GMz6UC5ukse6QLJVe2yhm1oRnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28995'),
  ('29040265649501380', 'Wild Child', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nick Moore, Chris Seager, Martin Kenzie', 'Lucy Dahl', 'Emma Roberts, Alex Pettyfer, Natasha Richardson, Kimberley Nixon, Juno Temple, Johnny Pacar, Linzey Cocker, Aidan Quinn', 'PG-13', 'Sixteen-year-old Poppy has everything her unlimited credit cards can buy, and a spoiled attitude to match. After a final thoughtless prank, her exasperated father ships her off to boarding school in England. There, Poppy meets her match in a stern headmistress and a class full of girls who will not tolerate her selfishness.', 'Sixteen-year-old Poppy has everything her unlimited credit cards can buy, and a spoiled attitude to match. After a final thoughtless prank, her exasperated father ships her off to boarding school in England. There, Poppy meets her match in a stern headmistress and a class full of girls who will not tolerate her selfishness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwbFEPubG4wroLDZdmTWRGNnnWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13971'),
  ('1037829420175055885', 'Wild Diamond', 2024, 'Drama', 'Juliette Gamblin, Maéva Ranc, Léa-Jade Horlier', 'Agathe Riedinger', 'Malou Khebizi, Idir Azougli, Andréa Bescond, Ashley Romano, Alexis Manenti, Kilia Fernane, Léa Gorla, Alexandra Noisier', null, 'Liane, 19 years old, daring and fiery, lives with her mother and little sister under the dusty sun of Fréjus in the South of France. Obsessed with beauty and the need to become “someone”, she sees reality TV as her opportunity to be loved... Fate smiles upon her when she auditions for “Miracle Island”.', 'Liane, 19 years old, daring and fiery, lives with her mother and little sister under the dusty sun of Fréjus in the South of France. Obsessed with beauty and the need to become “someone”, she sees reality TV as her opportunity to be loved... Fate smiles upon her when she auditions for “Miracle Island”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEF2q2e3vntpKsHa4hQfaF0CVR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108336'),
  ('1093124356547219891', 'Wild Dog', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ahishor Solomon, Upasana Chhetri, David Ismalone', 'Kiran Kumar, Ahishor Solomon', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Dia Mirza, Saiyami Kher, Atul Kulkarni, Anish Kuruvilla, Dayanand Reddy, Rahul Singh, Avijit Dutt', null, 'Wild Dog aka Vijay Varma is an NIA agent who’s brought back to field from a desk job to handle a terrorism case. Despite having a personal motive, he moves heaven and earth to ensure justice is served for the sake of the country.', 'Wild Dog aka Vijay Varma is an NIA agent who’s brought back to field from a desk job to handle a terrorism case. Despite having a personal motive, he moves heaven and earth to ensure justice is served for the sake of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8377XckHbfJDMrkSpEa9ZQJlVE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802068'),
  ('1126884195539086182', 'Wild Eyed and Wicked', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gordon Shoemaker Foxwood, Matheus Bastos', 'Gordon Shoemaker Foxwood', 'Molly Kunz, Michael X. Sommers, Colleen Camp, Stefanie Estes, Claire Saunders, William Ford-Conway, Evyn Flanders', 'PG-13', 'Lily Pierce is sick of being haunted. She decides to reconnect with her estranged father, a disgraced history professor, and learn how to draw upon a time of steel and blade when armor-clad knights rode out and dueled their monsters to the death.', 'Lily Pierce is sick of being haunted. She decides to reconnect with her estranged father, a disgraced history professor, and learn how to draw upon a time of steel and blade when armor-clad knights rode out and dueled their monsters to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA0S3tLtLlCHD35f2ibonKerKaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197830'),
  ('669362452259105500', 'Wild Flower', 1943, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa, Felipe Palomino', 'Emilio Fernández, Mauricio Magdaleno', 'Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, Emilio Fernández, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Armando Soto La Marina ''El Chicote'', Agustín Isunza, Eduardo Arozamena, Mimí Derba', null, 'The film features Fernandez himself as a character named Rogellio Torres. The lion''s share of the footage, however, is devoted to the romance between Esperanza, granddaughter of a common laborer, and Jose Luis Castro, the firebrand son of a landowner. Joining a revolutionary movements, Castro is disowned by his father, but Esperanza remains loyally by his side. Later on, Castro''s father is killed by outlaws; in seeking vengeance, he sacrifices his own life, while Esperanza carries on his revolutionary work with their young son in tow.', 'The film features Fernandez himself as a character named Rogellio Torres. The lion''s share of the footage, however, is devoted to the romance between Esperanza, granddaughter of a common laborer, and Jose Luis Castro, the firebrand son of a landowner. Joining a revolutionary movements, Castro is disowned by his father, but Esperanza remains loyally by his side. Later on, Castro''s father is killed by outlaws; in seeking vengeance, he sacrifices his own life, while Esperanza carries on his revolutionary work with their young son in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lIiPASdgZe1L2HQkcETmYLLAFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120295'),
  ('1091292265220010341', 'Wild Flowers', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Niels Gråbøl, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Per Daumiller, Niels Gråbøl', 'Ditte Gråbøl, Andrea Vagn Jensen, Mira Wanting, Peter Frödin, Niels Olsen, Sixten Tobias Kai Nielsen, Søren Sætter-Lassen, Dea Fog', null, 'Denmark in the 70''s. The teenager Christoffer''s parents Nisse and Maria have decided to move into a commune because they want to try the alternative lifestyle. But Christoffer doesn''t like it and has trouble adapting. In school the others tease him because he lives in a commune. As a plan from the elders in the commune he starts in a Maoist group to learn about the real ways of the society. He doesn''t like it but when his new girlfriend starts to see what he does as cool he goes into it. But at the same time the police start to suspect him to be the terrorist who blows up telephone booths around Copenhagen.', 'Denmark in the 70''s. The teenager Christoffer''s parents Nisse and Maria have decided to move into a commune because they want to try the alternative lifestyle. But Christoffer doesn''t like it and has trouble adapting. In school the others tease him because he lives in a commune. As a plan from the elders in the commune he starts in a Maoist group to learn about the real ways of the society. He doesn''t like it but when his new girlfriend starts to see what he does as cool he goes into it. But at the same time the police start to suspect him to be the terrorist who blows up telephone booths around Copenhagen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdTMN5Dfki8sX41sIOAqNKWyve4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48728'),
  ('610838932726044897', 'Wild Flowers', 2000, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'F. A. Brabec, Jiří Klenka, David Rauch', 'F. A. Brabec, Miloš Macourek, Deana Horváthová', 'Martina Bezoušková, Sylvie Kraslová, Sára Voříšková, Anna Bezoušková, Dan Bárta, Linda Rybová, Jana Švandová, Vojtěch Sahula', null, 'Seven seemingly unconnected fairy tales - glued together only by folklore, mood, color and light - make up this Czech collection of visual poetry. The original piece of literature, written by Karel Jaromír Erben in 1853, contained twelve tales.', 'Seven seemingly unconnected fairy tales - glued together only by folklore, mood, color and light - make up this Czech collection of visual poetry. The original piece of literature, written by Karel Jaromír Erben in 1853, contained twelve tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGA4nUbaCOtVzhwPO6GqOtR8DUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45952'),
  ('191482182181271372', 'Wild Flowers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Jaime Rosales', 'Bárbara Díez, Jaime Rosales', 'Anna Castillo, Oriol Pla, Carolina Yuste, Manolo Solo, Neus Pàmies, Lluís Marquès, Quim Àvila Conde, Diana Gómez', null, 'Julia, a 22-year-old mother of two, falls in love with Óscar, a troubled boy with whom she embarks on a love affair. The more time they spend together, the more Julia asks herself if Óscar is the person she really needs by her side, prompting her to set out on a personal journey to find happiness for herself and for her family.', 'Julia, a 22-year-old mother of two, falls in love with Óscar, a troubled boy with whom she embarks on a love affair. The more time they spend together, the more Julia asks herself if Óscar is the person she really needs by her side, prompting her to set out on a personal journey to find happiness for herself and for her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHK4c0UZKrqkmXZ2HJeGNhNetRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766804'),
  ('682394226412514120', 'Wild Foxes', 2026, 'Drama, Sport', 'Valery Carnoy, Arnaud Guez, Valérie Houdart, Jordan Witz', 'Valery Carnoy', 'Samuel Kircher, Faycal Anaflous, Jef Jacobs, Anna Heckel, Jean-Baptiste Durand', null, 'A promising young boxer survives a deadly accident thanks to his friend Matteo. After recovery, mysterious pain begins consuming him, jeopardizing his boxing career in a world where weakness isn''t tolerated.', 'A promising young boxer survives a deadly accident thanks to his friend Matteo. After recovery, mysterious pain begins consuming him, jeopardizing his boxing career in a world where weakness isn''t tolerated.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2QXvhRTbsCTVYcYcGfnpuWQru4c.jpg', 'plex:movie:wild-foxes-2026'),
  ('449167467891126694', 'Wild France', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Samuel Guiton, Franck Cuvelier, Christian Moullec', 'Marie-Noëlle Himbert, Frédéric Fougea, Jacques Malaterre', 'Guillaume de Tonquédec, Arnaud Petit, Stéphanie Bodet, Nathan Willcocks, Christian Couloumy, Marie Barbancey, Julien Le Guet, Franck Ibanez', 'G', 'A documentary that shows the different fauna that populates natural habitats of France, and the people that aims to protect and preserve them.', 'A documentary that shows the different fauna that populates natural habitats of France, and the people that aims to protect and preserve them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mhhC7I0avVfw18plfb8vixnHkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244481'),
  ('1022216294806096067', 'Wild Gals of the Naked West', 1962, 'Comedy, Western', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Jack Moran, Russ Meyer', 'Sammy Gilbert, Anthony-James Ryan, Jackie Moran, Terri Taylor, Frank Bolger, Werner Kirsch, Julie Williams, Ken Parker', null, 'An old geezer recalls some of the antics of the citizens of his Western town, more wild and woolly than Tombstone or Dodge City. In this town, they shoot like Stormtroopers, the women seek new meat, and practical jokers abound.', 'An old geezer recalls some of the antics of the citizens of his Western town, more wild and woolly than Tombstone or Dodge City. In this town, they shoot like Stormtroopers, the women seek new meat, and practical jokers abound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQbTEKAq7YHSTFaGGCWGmkYRgCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5646'),
  ('1106440698144413704', 'Wild Geese II', 1985, 'Action, Thriller', 'Peter R. Hunt', 'Reginald Rose', 'Scott Glenn, Barbara Carrera, Edward Fox, Laurence Olivier, Robert Webber, Robert Freitag, Kenneth Haigh, Stratford Johns', 'R', 'A group of mercenaries is hired to spring Rudolf Hess from Spandau Prison in Berlin.', 'A group of mercenaries is hired to spring Rudolf Hess from Spandau Prison in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqlQdtfWzDmWZA3GQPz1Hr0RV06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46971'),
  ('721902258799337487', 'Wild Girl', 1932, 'Western', 'Raoul Walsh, Norbert Brodine, Horace Hough', 'Doris Anderson, Edwin Justus Mayer', 'Charles Farrell, Joan Bennett, Ralph Bellamy, Eugene Pallette, Irving Pichel, Minna Gombell, Willard Robertson, Sarah Padden', 'NR', 'Salomy Jane, a California mountain girl, is sought after by a number of men in the nearby small town of Redwood City. She is affected when two criminals are pursued by authorities: one for killing a hypocritical mayoral candidate, the other for robbing the stagecoach.', 'Salomy Jane, a California mountain girl, is sought after by a number of men in the nearby small town of Redwood City. She is affected when two criminals are pursued by authorities: one for killing a hypocritical mayoral candidate, the other for robbing the stagecoach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3h2xFJjb74gsDO8ZrFtSZZatzXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137509'),
  ('76826852510198267', 'Wild Grass', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Resnais, Éric Gautier, Christophe Jeauffroy', 'Alex Réval, Laurent Herbiet', 'André Dussollier, Sabine Azéma, Emmanuelle Devos, Mathieu Amalric, Anne Consigny, Michel Vuillermoz, Annie Cordy, Nicolas Duvauchelle', null, 'Marguerite loses her wallet, and it''s found by Georges, a seemingly happy head of family. As he looks through the wallet and examines the photos of Marguerite, he finds he''s fascinated with her and her life, and soon his curiosity about her becomes an obsession.', 'Marguerite loses her wallet, and it''s found by Georges, a seemingly happy head of family. As he looks through the wallet and examines the photos of Marguerite, he finds he''s fascinated with her and her life, and soon his curiosity about her becomes an obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLy9Tp03uaQLV5IRHtjAYGiURdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37842'),
  ('1021717287534635281', 'Wild Guitar', 1962, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Joseph V. Mascelli, Alan O’Day', 'Arch Hall Sr., Bob Wehling', 'Arch Hall Jr., Nancy Czar, Arch Hall Sr., Ray Dennis Steckler, Marie Denn, Robert Crumb, Virginia Broderick, Al Scott', 'NR', 'A young rock &amp; roll hopeful is given a shot at the big time by the unscrupulous owner of a small record company.', 'A young rock &amp; roll hopeful is given a shot at the big time by the unscrupulous owner of a small record company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH5KslajuatYp9XOwm0tgUeBfJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89924'),
  ('837910960502868877', 'Wild Heart', 2018, 'Music, Documentary', 'Charly Hübner, Sebastian Schultz, Martin Farkas', 'Charly Hübner, Sebastian Schultz', 'Jan Gorkow, Kai Irrgang, Olaf Ney, Christoph Sell, Max Bobzin, Jacobus North, Michael Ebert, Jürgen Hingst', null, 'A portrait of Jan "Monchi" Gorkow, front man for the punk band Feine Sahne Fischfilet, and his campaign against racism and right-wing extremism.', 'A portrait of Jan "Monchi" Gorkow, front man for the punk band Feine Sahne Fischfilet, and his campaign against racism and right-wing extremism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8k42HLowDTLjQZ9Eup9GAFfHaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484568'),
  ('846157002061049517', 'Wild Heart', 2023, 'Family, Adventure', 'Markus Dietrich', 'Peter Freund', 'Martha Haberland, Franz Ferdinand Krause, Anna Schudt, Christoph Letkowski, Sophie Lutz, Dieter Hallervorden, Peter Lohmeyer, Nilam Farooq', null, 'Moving from the city to the countryside, 11-year-old Anni has a tough time settling in – until she encounters Wild Heart, an untamed horse, to whom she feels an almost magical connection. But soon after, their bond is put at risk, as some ruthless horse thieves are targeting Wild Heart’s herd.', 'Moving from the city to the countryside, 11-year-old Anni has a tough time settling in – until she encounters Wild Heart, an untamed horse, to whom she feels an almost magical connection. But soon after, their bond is put at risk, as some ruthless horse thieves are targeting Wild Heart’s herd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gha8UzNmOm2T4iJqyKoT9QDq0zI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137207'),
  ('280287743054646367', 'Wild Hearts Can''t Be Broken', 1991, 'Drama, Family', 'Steve Miner, Daryn Okada', 'Matt Williams, Oley Sassone', 'Gabrielle Anwar, Cliff Robertson, Michael Schoeffling, Dylan Kussman, Kathleen York, Frank Renzulli, Nancy Moore Atchison, Lisa Norman', 'G', 'A runaway orphan, young Sonora, persists in a menial job mucking stables in Doc Carver''s travelling stunt show. Her great wish is to become a death-defying "diving girl," but Doc refuses her pleas. Undaunted, Sonora''s gutsy resolve finally convinces him to give her a break. On the brink of stardom, however, a cruel twist of fate threatens to destroy her dream.', 'A runaway orphan, young Sonora, persists in a menial job mucking stables in Doc Carver''s travelling stunt show. Her great wish is to become a death-defying "diving girl," but Doc refuses her pleas. Undaunted, Sonora''s gutsy resolve finally convinces him to give her a break. On the brink of stardom, however, a cruel twist of fate threatens to destroy her dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY7KaiN3vh4g49Pn3ShM2ATnFVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23438'),
  ('627780158209267792', 'Wild Hogs', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Robbie Greenberg, Walt Becker, Jack Gill', 'Brad Copeland', 'Tim Allen, John Travolta, Martin Lawrence, William H. Macy, Ray Liotta, Kevin Durand, M.C. Gainey, Marisa Tomei', 'PG-13', 'Restless and ready for an adventure, four suburban bikers leave the safety of their subdivision and head out on the open road. But complications ensue when they cross paths with an intimidating band of New Mexico bikers known as the Del Fuegos.', 'Restless and ready for an adventure, four suburban bikers leave the safety of their subdivision and head out on the open road. But complications ensue when they cross paths with an intimidating band of New Mexico bikers known as the Del Fuegos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYyPCZcpNGZwbyBo1gwdCiW5hHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11199'),
  ('431028821883935759', 'Wild Horses', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Duvall, Barry Markowitz', 'Robert Duvall, Michael Shell', 'Robert Duvall, James Franco, Josh Hartnett, Adriana Barraza, Jim Parrack, Luciana Pedraza, Angie Cepeda, Darien Willardson', 'R', 'Texas Ranger Samantha Payne reopens a 15-year-old missing person case, and uncovers evidence that suggests that the boy was likely murdered on a ranch belonging to wealthy family man, Scott Briggs. When Scott’s estranged son unexpectedly returns home during the investigation, Samantha becomes even more convinced that the Briggs family was involved, and will stop at nothing to discover the truth about the boy’s death - even putting her own life in jeopardy.', 'Texas Ranger Samantha Payne reopens a 15-year-old missing person case, and uncovers evidence that suggests that the boy was likely murdered on a ranch belonging to wealthy family man, Scott Briggs. When Scott’s estranged son unexpectedly returns home during the investigation, Samantha becomes even more convinced that the Briggs family was involved, and will stop at nothing to discover the truth about the boy’s death - even putting her own life in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77iVwo0oBaHRk4sFOBcMCh71xlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324333'),
  ('1100529555214012460', 'Wild in the Country', 1961, 'Drama', 'Philip Dunne, William C. Mellor, Harry Scott', 'Clifford Odets', 'Elvis Presley, Hope Lange, Tuesday Weld, Millie Perkins, Rafer Johnson, John Ireland, Gary Lockwood, William Mims', 'PG', 'A troubled young man discovers that he has a knack for writing when a counselor encourages him to pursue a literary career.', 'A troubled young man discovers that he has a knack for writing when a counselor encourages him to pursue a literary career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZTKTY0lWrm07kdxPE6RjpG4EBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32825'),
  ('570739549081109120', 'Wild in the Streets', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Barry Shear, Richard Moore', 'Robert Thom', 'Shelley Winters, Christopher Jones, Diane Varsi, Hal Holbrook, Millie Perkins, Richard Pryor, Bert Freed, Kevin Coughlin', 'R', 'Musician Max Frost lends his backing to a Senate candidate who wants to give 18-year-olds the right to vote, but he takes things a step further than expected. Inspired by their hero''s words, Max''s fans pressure their leaders into extending the vote to citizens as young as 15. Max and his followers capitalize on their might by bringing new issues to the fore, but, drunk on power, they soon take generational warfare to terrible extremes.', 'Musician Max Frost lends his backing to a Senate candidate who wants to give 18-year-olds the right to vote, but he takes things a step further than expected. Inspired by their hero''s words, Max''s fans pressure their leaders into extending the vote to citizens as young as 15. Max and his followers capitalize on their might by bringing new issues to the fore, but, drunk on power, they soon take generational warfare to terrible extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJHCvd5wQszKZdVZ43U5Wu0k03Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42688'),
  ('471475351783028123', 'Wild Indian', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Edward Bennett, Lyle Mitchell Corbine Jr., Eli Born', 'Lyle Mitchell Corbine Jr.', 'Michael Greyeyes, Chaske Spencer, Kate Bosworth, Phoenix Wilson, Julian Gopal, Lisa Cromarty, Jesse Eisenberg, Elisha Pratt', 'NR', 'Decades after covering up his classmate’s murder, Michael has moved on from his reservation and fractured past. When a man who shares his violent secret seeks vengeance, Michael goes to great lengths to protect his new life with his wife and boss from the demons of his past.', 'Decades after covering up his classmate’s murder, Michael has moved on from his reservation and fractured past. When a man who shares his violent secret seeks vengeance, Michael goes to great lengths to protect his new life with his wife and boss from the demons of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhOpkNvgW1ZzmEpR4iqxKwKKShL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656991'),
  ('91290736739904503', 'Wild Innocence', 2001, 'Drama', 'Philippe Garrel, Raoul Coutard, Aude Cathelin', 'Philippe Garrel', 'Julia Faure, Mehdi Belhaj Kacem, Michel Subor, Mathieu Genet, Mahé Macaire, Valérie Kéruzoré, Jean Pommier, Francine Bergé', null, 'A movie director does a new film against heroin consumption, and the producers are heroin dealers.', 'A movie director does a new film against heroin consumption, and the producers are heroin dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RcB9o9QwQN0C5dfD2gascwSXUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103692'),
  ('594255736693929309', 'Wild Is the Wind', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, Charles Lang', 'Arnold Schulman', 'Anna Magnani, Anthony Quinn, Anthony Franciosa, Joseph Calleia, Dolores Hart, Lily Valenty, James Flavin, Dick Ryan', 'NR', 'A widowed Nevada rancher goes to Italy and marries the sister of his deceased wife and brings her back to the ranch, but his haunting memories of his lost love and her tendency to drift away to other men cause the two to have a tough time at keeping a marriage together.', 'A widowed Nevada rancher goes to Italy and marries the sister of his deceased wife and brings her back to the ranch, but his haunting memories of his lost love and her tendency to drift away to other men cause the two to have a tough time at keeping a marriage together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vnKOkyrvJ77uLlGk5hzXyqyAfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93528'),
  ('593344696388709084', 'Wild Is the Wind', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bert Haitsma, Fabian Medea', 'Fabian Medea', 'Mothusi Magano, Chris Chameleon, Frank Rautenbach, Izel Bezuidenhout, Phoenix Baaitse, Deon Coetzee, Brendon Daniels, Michelle Douglas', null, 'When two corrupt police officers investigate the brutal murder of a young girl, tensions come to a head in their small, racially-segregated town.', 'When two corrupt police officers investigate the brutal murder of a young girl, tensions come to a head in their small, racially-segregated town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyn395RyxeP64T6jEgOGE4K7O46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033107'),
  ('786662217153585482', 'Wild Life', 2014, 'Drama', 'Cédric Kahn', 'Cédric Kahn, Nathalie Najem', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Céline Sallette, David Gastou, Sofiane Neveu, Romain Depret, Jules Ritmanic, Jenna Thiam, Tara-Jay Bangalter', null, 'The new film by French director Cédric Kahn focusses on Philippe Fournier, a man who lives with his 2 sons, having decided not to give them back to their mother after she won custody of the children. The children Okyesa and Tsali must grow up in the shadow, hunted by the police but always free and on the move.', 'The new film by French director Cédric Kahn focusses on Philippe Fournier, a man who lives with his 2 sons, having decided not to give them back to their mother after she won custody of the children. The children Okyesa and Tsali must grow up in the shadow, hunted by the police but always free and on the move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EwY1JFY6j120Wg66cxG7CtKPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288587'),
  ('1093241139835562770', 'Wild London', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Joe Loncraine', 'Tom Hugh Jones, Joe Loncraine', 'David Attenborough', null, 'Sir David Attenborough explores the wildlife of his London hometown, from urban deer to rooftop peregrines and many others, revealing how nature thrives in the world''s greenest major city.', 'Sir David Attenborough explores the wildlife of his London hometown, from urban deer to rooftop peregrines and many others, revealing how nature thrives in the world''s greenest major city.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3yTYwbilgxE240qShWxcNmp9WHZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:wild-london'),
  ('775773511964597848', 'Wild Love', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Mauro Bolognini, Massimo Franciosa', 'Antonella Lualdi, Franco Interlenghi, Sergio Raimondi, Valeria Moriconi, Nino Manfredi, Nadia Bianchi, Oscar Blando, Decimo Cristiani', null, 'The film tells the love stories of several young people: Nando, owner of a mechanical shop, supplements his income by posing for photo novels, sparking jealousy in his girlfriend Marisa. Otello, who works as a barber, sincerely loves Adriana, Nando''s sister, who has been promised to Franco, who is tempted by the charms of Ines, owner of the neighbourhood trattoria.', 'The film tells the love stories of several young people: Nando, owner of a mechanical shop, supplements his income by posing for photo novels, sparking jealousy in his girlfriend Marisa. Otello, who works as a barber, sincerely loves Adriana, Nando''s sister, who has been promised to Franco, who is tempted by the charms of Ines, owner of the neighbourhood trattoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rhNNWQXXGulEBqVrRBs3nIkm4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199222'),
  ('1000533548710470665', 'Wild Love', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'MegaComputeur, Zoé Sottiaux, Corentin Yvergniaux', 'Maryka Laudet, Léa Georges, Paul Autric', null, null, 'While on a romantic getaway, Alan and Beverly cause a fatal accident. This crime won''t remain unpunished...', 'While on a romantic getaway, Alan and Beverly cause a fatal accident. This crime won''t remain unpunished...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLmcZtz5DQwU3bG3iloU5OtaXzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574366'),
  ('831653236859760502', 'Wild Man Blues', 1997, 'Music, Documentary', 'Barbara Kopple, Tom Hurwitz', null, 'Woody Allen, Letty Aronson, Soon-Yi Previn, Dan Barrett, Simon Wettenhall, John Gill, Greg Cohen, Cynthia Sayer', null, 'Wild Man Blues is a 1998 documentary film directed by Barbara Kopple, about the musical avocation of actor/director/comic Woody Allen. The film takes its name from a jazz composition sometimes attributed to Jelly Roll Morton and sometimes to Louis Armstrong and recorded by both (among others). Allen''s love of early 20th century New Orleans music is depicted through his 1996 tour of Europe with his New Orleans Jazz Band. Allen has played clarinet with this band for over 25 years. Although Allen''s European tour is the film''s primary focus, it was also notable as the first major public showcase for Allen''s relationship with Soon-Yi Previn.', 'Wild Man Blues is a 1998 documentary film directed by Barbara Kopple, about the musical avocation of actor/director/comic Woody Allen. The film takes its name from a jazz composition sometimes attributed to Jelly Roll Morton and sometimes to Louis Armstrong and recorded by both (among others). Allen''s love of early 20th century New Orleans music is depicted through his 1996 tour of Europe with his New Orleans Jazz Band. Allen has played clarinet with this band for over 25 years. Although Allen''s European tour is the film''s primary focus, it was also notable as the first major public showcase for Allen''s relationship with Soon-Yi Previn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CaJQIscbAiHOr7RMbdXA8UqL7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76330'),
  ('684078509013311123', 'Wild Men', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Martin Kildegaard Hem, Jonatan Rolf Mose, Thomas Daneskov', 'Morten Pape, Thomas Daneskov', 'Rasmus Bjerg, Zaki Youssef, Bjørn Sundquist, Sofie Gråbøl, Marco Ilsø, Jonas Bergen Rahmanzadeh, Håkon T. Nielsen, Tommy Karlsen', null, 'Armed only with a bow and an ensemble of animal skins, Martin sets off into the forest in a misguided attempt to overcome his midlife crisis. A chance meeting with a fugitive named Musa leads to a twisted trip through the fjords with police, drug runners, and Martin''s family not far behind. As an unlikely friendship develops and wildly original set-pieces unfold, Martin''s quest for manhood leads to deep and hilariously uncomfortable realizations about the presumed masculine ideal.', 'Armed only with a bow and an ensemble of animal skins, Martin sets off into the forest in a misguided attempt to overcome his midlife crisis. A chance meeting with a fugitive named Musa leads to a twisted trip through the fjords with police, drug runners, and Martin''s family not far behind. As an unlikely friendship develops and wildly original set-pieces unfold, Martin''s quest for manhood leads to deep and hilariously uncomfortable realizations about the presumed masculine ideal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbnCh0al5gaWQozLBbt9ncuC2ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776717'),
  ('716011667840983974', 'Wild Mountain Thyme', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jonathan Shaw, Neil Guerin, Tom Speirs', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Emily Blunt, Jamie Dornan, Jon Hamm, Christopher Walken, Dearbhla Molloy, Danielle Ryan, Barry McGovern, Don Wycherley', 'PG-13', 'Headstrong farmer Rosemary Muldoon has her heart set on winning her neighbour Anthony Reilly''s love. The problem is, Anthony seems to have inherited a family curse, and remains oblivious to his beautiful admirer. Stung by his father''s plans to sell the family farm to his American nephew, Anthony is jolted into pursuing his dreams.', 'Headstrong farmer Rosemary Muldoon has her heart set on winning her neighbour Anthony Reilly''s love. The problem is, Anthony seems to have inherited a family curse, and remains oblivious to his beautiful admirer. Stung by his father''s plans to sell the family farm to his American nephew, Anthony is jolted into pursuing his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMW81htT6Kki8x0G4UNb7l48iIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628333'),
  ('446873834761555308', 'Wild Mouse', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Josef Hader, Xiaosu Han, Andreas Thalhammer', 'Josef Hader', 'Josef Hader, Pia Hierzegger, Georg Friedrich, Jörg Hartmann, Denis Moschitto, Crina Semciuc, Nora Waldstätten, Murathan Muslu', null, 'Kings should be treated courteously! At least, that''s what famous music critic Georg thinks. But he finds himself counting pennies when his chief editor suddenly fires him from the Viennese newspaper for which he has been writing for decades. While keeping his dismissal a secret from his psychotherapist wife Johanna, whose mind is occupied solely by getting pregnant, Georg begins to plot his revenge.', 'Kings should be treated courteously! At least, that''s what famous music critic Georg thinks. But he finds himself counting pennies when his chief editor suddenly fires him from the Viennese newspaper for which he has been writing for decades. While keeping his dismissal a secret from his psychotherapist wife Johanna, whose mind is occupied solely by getting pregnant, Georg begins to plot his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWI8TMdCzx9ztuvWkbAWozk07xM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424634'),
  ('81420508915944033', 'Wild Oats', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicolas Harvard, Katey Wheelhouse, Jason Altieri', 'Claudia Myers, Gary Kanew', 'Shirley MacLaine, Jessica Lange, Billy Connolly, Santiago Segura, Howard Hesseman, Matt Walsh, Jay Hayden, Rebecca Da Costa', 'PG-13', 'Everything changes for Eva when she receives an insurance settlement check accidentally made out for $5,000,000 instead of the expected $50,000. She and her best friend take the money and head out for the adventure of a lifetime.', 'Everything changes for Eva when she receives an insurance settlement check accidentally made out for $5,000,000 instead of the expected $50,000. She and her best friend take the money and head out for the adventure of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRHfKgRaLmnWInSRsaPcx4bWEzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406992'),
  ('250248668062989037', 'Wild Oranges', 1924, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Paul Ivano, John W. Boyle', 'Joseph Hergesheimer', 'Frank Mayo, Virginia Valli, Ford Sterling, Nigel De Brulier, Charles A. Post', null, 'Millie Stope lives with her grandfather on a remote island. Man-child Nicholas, a fugitive from justice, also lives there and is terrorizing them - and he''s interested in Millie. One day widower John Woolfolk, sailing on his yacht, happens upon the island. Soon he and Millie fall in love. Will jealous Nicholas stand for this?', 'Millie Stope lives with her grandfather on a remote island. Man-child Nicholas, a fugitive from justice, also lives there and is terrorizing them - and he''s interested in Millie. One day widower John Woolfolk, sailing on his yacht, happens upon the island. Soon he and Millie fall in love. Will jealous Nicholas stand for this?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kglby0X1l12atVQB9w2SYBXrsQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120673'),
  ('454234931488855056', 'Wild Orchid', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zalman King, Gale Tattersall, James Dyer', 'Zalman King, Patricia Louisianna Knop', 'Carré Otis, Mickey Rourke, Jacqueline Bisset, Assumpta Serna, Bruce Greenwood, Oleg Vidov, Milton Gonçalves, Michael Villella', 'R', 'A woman lawyer becomes mesmerized by a self-made millionaire during an encounter in Rio setting off a series of erotic encounters.', 'A woman lawyer becomes mesmerized by a self-made millionaire during an encounter in Rio setting off a series of erotic encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UfS8J9Ixn0BAv1aeuAFWom5YEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5203'),
  ('688187903862616221', 'Wild Orchid II: Two Shades of Blue', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marc Reshovsky, Zalman King', 'Zalman King', 'Nina Siemaszko, Wendy Hughes, Tom Skerritt, Robert Davi, Brent David Fraser, Christopher McDonald, Joe Dallesandro, Casey Sander', 'R', 'Blue is a teenage girl who lives with her Jazz playing father Ham. Ham gets very sick and dies, and now Blue must support herself somehow. Elle, the headmistress at a brothel, talks her into living and working at her establishment. She decides to leave the business and lead a normal life. Elle is hellbent to see that she never has one.', 'Blue is a teenage girl who lives with her Jazz playing father Ham. Ham gets very sick and dies, and now Blue must support herself somehow. Elle, the headmistress at a brothel, talks her into living and working at her establishment. She decides to leave the business and lead a normal life. Elle is hellbent to see that she never has one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3r89A0iiRKhLW3SEGFIOnwExUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5233'),
  ('215614611895944707', 'Wild Orchids', 1929, 'Romance, Adventure', 'Sidney Franklin, William H. Daniels', 'Marian Ainslee, Ruth Cummings, Willis Goldbeck', 'Greta Garbo, Lewis Stone, Nils Asther, Dick Sutherland', null, 'A prince in Java tries to seduce his visitor''s wife, but he''s discovered.', 'A prince in Java tries to seduce his visitor''s wife, but he''s discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7jpRSFWGRFf9hCqruC9wnXvyBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5201'),
  ('881706124209950092', 'Wild Over You', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A wildcat escapes from the zoo, disguises herself as a skunk to fool her pursuers, but that only attracts lovestruck Pepe le Pew.', 'A wildcat escapes from the zoo, disguises herself as a skunk to fool her pursuers, but that only attracts lovestruck Pepe le Pew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYcRYKLbMauYoHcjVhgZTQqSS3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235813'),
  ('534513144191205206', 'Wild Poses', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Robert F. McGowan, Francis Corby', null, 'Matthew Beard, Tommy Bond, Jerry Tucker, George McFarland, Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel, Gay Seabrook, Emerson Treacy', null, 'Spanky''s parents take their reluctant boy to get his portrait taken by a prissy photographer.', 'Spanky''s parents take their reluctant boy to get his portrait taken by a prissy photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvbzxYpizHIaaIH2UpLVW43bDq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127037'),
  ('927538150169939434', 'Wild Reeds', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Olivier Massart, Gilles Taurand, André Téchiné', 'Élodie Bouchez, Gaël Morel, Stéphane Rideau, Frédéric Gorny, Michèle Moretti, Jacques Nolot, Eric Kreikenmayer, Nathalie Vignes', null, 'As the Algerian War draws to a close, a teenager with a girlfriend starts feeling homosexual urges for two of his classmates: a country boy, and a French-Algerian intellectual.', 'As the Algerian War draws to a close, a teenager with a girlfriend starts feeling homosexual urges for two of his classmates: a country boy, and a French-Algerian intellectual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTBEcAsD8OoIs8thYXl7FZuUXN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26933'),
  ('356026480033979905', 'Wild River', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charles H. Maguire, Elia Kazan, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Paul Osborn', 'Montgomery Clift, Lee Remick, Jo Van Fleet, Albert Salmi, Jay C. Flippen, James Westerfield, Bruce Dern, Barbara Loden', null, 'A young bureaucrat for the Tennessee Valley Authority goes to rural Tennessee to oversee the building of a dam. He encounters opposition from the local people, in particular a farmer who objects to his employment (with pay) of local black laborers. Much of the plot revolves around the eviction of a stubborn octogenarian from her home on an island in the river, and the young man''s love affair with that woman''s widowed granddaughter. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'A young bureaucrat for the Tennessee Valley Authority goes to rural Tennessee to oversee the building of a dam. He encounters opposition from the local people, in particular a farmer who objects to his employment (with pay) of local black laborers. Much of the plot revolves around the eviction of a stubborn octogenarian from her home on an island in the river, and the young man''s love affair with that woman''s widowed granddaughter. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5zzhqAkxMPy6kqXL0Pk54Cl2fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82311'),
  ('13993462904691279', 'Wild Rose', 2019, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Martin McNee, Zoe Smith, Liam Shaw', 'Nicole Taylor', 'Jessie Buckley, Julie Walters, Sophie Okonedo, Jamie Sives, Craig Parkinson, Adam Mitchell, Daisy Littlefield, Janey Godley', 'R', 'A young Scottish singer, Rose-Lynn Harlan, dreams of making it as a country artist in Nashville after being released from prison.', 'A young Scottish singer, Rose-Lynn Harlan, dreams of making it as a country artist in Nashville after being released from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79THplH9WM7y3gRPYM4dcC0IRPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482981'),
  ('534087932978453532', 'Wild Rovers', 1971, 'Action, Western', 'Blake Edwards, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Blake Edwards', 'William Holden, Ryan O''Neal, Karl Malden, Lynn Carlin, Tom Skerritt, Joe Don Baker, Geoffrey Edwards, James Olson', 'PG', 'Ross Bodine and Frank Post are cowhands on Walt Buckman''s R-Bar-R ranch. Bodine is older and broods a bit about how he will get along when he''s too old to cowboy. Post is young and rambunctious and ambitious for a better life than wrangling cows. When one of their fellow cowboys is killed in a corral accident, Post suggests a way into a better life for himself and his friend: robbing a bank. Bodine reluctantly joins in the plan and the two contrive to rob the local bank. They make good their escape initially, but Walt Buckman and his two sons, John and Paul, are incensed at this betrayal by their own trusted employees. John and Paul set out to bring Bodine and Post to justice.', 'Ross Bodine and Frank Post are cowhands on Walt Buckman''s R-Bar-R ranch. Bodine is older and broods a bit about how he will get along when he''s too old to cowboy. Post is young and rambunctious and ambitious for a better life than wrangling cows. When one of their fellow cowboys is killed in a corral accident, Post suggests a way into a better life for himself and his friend: robbing a bank. Bodine reluctantly joins in the plan and the two contrive to rob the local bank. They make good their escape initially, but Walt Buckman and his two sons, John and Paul, are incensed at this betrayal by their own trusted employees. John and Paul set out to bring Bodine and Post to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi86WQgEfPEADexlsyCxyEhyonC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42531'),
  ('971213004513153028', 'Wild Search', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Nam Yin', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Tommy Wong, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Paul Chun Pui, Chan Cheuk-Yan, Ku Feng, Lau Kong', null, 'While conducting a raid of an illegal arms deal, detective Mew Mew discovers the body of a dead woman and her daughter who witnessed the murder. Believing that the girl may be in danger, Mew Mew seeks out her aunt Cher, and the three develop a bond, but Cher''s ex-husband and a vengeful gunrunner soon show up to disrupt their short-lived peace.', 'While conducting a raid of an illegal arms deal, detective Mew Mew discovers the body of a dead woman and her daughter who witnessed the murder. Believing that the girl may be in danger, Mew Mew seeks out her aunt Cher, and the three develop a bond, but Cher''s ex-husband and a vengeful gunrunner soon show up to disrupt their short-lived peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmy1c5n6vpRSnfUbOiCG6u78cOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119336'),
  ('613750652499441796', 'Wild Seas', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Augustin Barbaroux, Adrien Coché, Valentin Dahmani', 'Rémi Brachet, Héloïse Pelloquet', 'Cécile de France, Félix Lefebvre, Grégoire Monsaingeon, Ghislaine Girard, Josée Lambert, Imane Laurence, Jean-Pierre Couton, Françoise Gillard', null, 'A couple of fisher-folk are joined by a young new apprentice in the middle of a raging storm.', 'A couple of fisher-folk are joined by a young new apprentice in the middle of a raging storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QNu8zNmFn1giBX4YjvbeVIVHvH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925098'),
  ('592774790332526231', 'Wild Session', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Paco Limón, Julio César Sánchez, Ernesto Herrera', 'Paco Limón, Julio César Sánchez', 'Javier Aguirre, Simón Andreu, Paco Cabezas, Carmen Carrión, Álex de la Iglesia, Álvaro de Luna, Carlo De Marchis, Fernando Esteso', null, 'A walk through the golden age of Spanish exploitation cinema, from the sixties to the eighties; a low-budget cinema and great popular acceptance that exploited cinematographic fashions: westerns, horror movies, erotic comedies and thrillers about petty criminals.', 'A walk through the golden age of Spanish exploitation cinema, from the sixties to the eighties; a low-budget cinema and great popular acceptance that exploited cinematographic fashions: westerns, horror movies, erotic comedies and thrillers about petty criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KhjhzR1IHm3S5MiWb4yWAjMK5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637490'),
  ('195547571219628038', 'Wild Side', 1996, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Donald Cammell, Philip Gallegos, Paul N. Martin', 'Donald Cammell, China Kong', 'Anne Heche, Christopher Walken, Joan Chen, Steven Bauer, Allen Garfield, Adam Novak, Randy Crowder, Marcus Aurelius', 'R', 'A bank accountant who moonlights as a high-priced call girl becomes embroiled in the lives of a money launderer, his seductive wife, and his bodyguard.', 'A bank accountant who moonlights as a high-priced call girl becomes embroiled in the lives of a money launderer, his seductive wife, and his bodyguard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFRrKn9wqPECjN1QOrDdS3BVdL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26674'),
  ('401269712059491562', 'Wild Side', 2004, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Agnès Godard', 'Stéphane Bouquet, Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Stéphanie Michelini, Yasmine Belmadi, Edouard Nikitine, Josiane Stoléru, Corentin Carinos, Perrine Stevenard, Benoît Verhaert, Fabrice Rodriguez', 'NR', 'A transgender woman returns — with her two male lovers — to her family home in the countryside to look after her dying mother.', 'A transgender woman returns — with her two male lovers — to her family home in the countryside to look after her dying mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZ0ETlO7sFMW5PKBHIt4kxBhldh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12812'),
  ('1011631567672886228', 'Wild Style', 1982, 'Drama, Music', 'Charlie Ahearn, Clive Davidson, John Foster', 'Charlie Ahearn', 'Lee Quiñones, Lady Pink, Fab 5 Freddy, Patti Astor, ZEPHYR, Busy Bee, Carlos Morales, Alfredo Valez', 'R', 'Legendary New York graffiti artist Lee Quinones plays the part of Zoro, the city''s hottest and most elusive graffiti writer. The actual story of the movie concerns the tension between Zoro''s passion for his art and his personal life, particularly his strained relationship with fellow artist Rose.', 'Legendary New York graffiti artist Lee Quinones plays the part of Zoro, the city''s hottest and most elusive graffiti writer. The actual story of the movie concerns the tension between Zoro''s passion for his art and his personal life, particularly his strained relationship with fellow artist Rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhlf38aasEZjgdWQOzXwMhaOvGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14243'),
  ('516962145861118548', 'Wild Tango', 1993, 'Drama, Music', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Noemí Nemirovsky, Pamela Sander', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Aída Bortnik', 'Fernán Mirás, Cecilia Dopazo, Imanol Arias, Héctor Alterio, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Federico D''Elía, David Masajnik, Cristina Banegas', null, 'A biopic based on the life of one of the pioneer argentine rock stars ''Tanguito''. The movie tells the story of his rise and fall from grace, encompassed in violent times of a military regime.', 'A biopic based on the life of one of the pioneer argentine rock stars ''Tanguito''. The movie tells the story of his rise and fall from grace, encompassed in violent times of a military regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSwYYGs1iQjqKLbhxTBFksdg8xI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73857'),
  ('649063481874405855', 'Wild Target', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Pierre Salvadori, Gilles Henry', 'Pierre Salvadori', 'Jean Rochefort, Marie Trintignant, Guillaume Depardieu, Patachou, Wladimir Yordanoff, Serge Riaboukine, Charlie Nelson, Philippe Girard', null, 'Victor Meynard, a hit man who still lives with his mother, is becoming more reluctant to pull the trigger during assignments. He meets a young man, Antoine, whom he takes under his wing after being unable to kill him. Their lives change when he meets Renée, an art forger who has earned the wrath of powerful mob leaders. Unwilling to assassinate the new object of his affections, Victor must run and hide with two new friends in tow.', 'Victor Meynard, a hit man who still lives with his mother, is becoming more reluctant to pull the trigger during assignments. He meets a young man, Antoine, whom he takes under his wing after being unable to kill him. Their lives change when he meets Renée, an art forger who has earned the wrath of powerful mob leaders. Unwilling to assassinate the new object of his affections, Victor must run and hide with two new friends in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vut3MfR5VRfYNszndFPmpoTtr6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62133'),
  ('669131766676663431', 'Wild Target', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonathan Lynn, David Johnson', 'Pierre Salvadori', 'Bill Nighy, Emily Blunt, Rupert Grint, Rupert Everett, Eileen Atkins, Martin Freeman, Geoff Bell, Rory Kinnear', 'PG-13', 'Victor Maynard is a middle-aged, solitary assassin who lives to please his formidable mother, despite his own peerless reputation for lethal efficiency. His professional routine is interrupted when he finds himself drawn to one of his intended victims. After sparing her life, he unexpectedly acquires a young apprentice. Believing Victor to be a private detective, his two new companions tag along, while he attempts to thwart the murderous attentions of his unhappy client.', 'Victor Maynard is a middle-aged, solitary assassin who lives to please his formidable mother, despite his own peerless reputation for lethal efficiency. His professional routine is interrupted when he finds himself drawn to one of his intended victims. After sparing her life, he unexpectedly acquires a young apprentice. Believing Victor to be a private detective, his two new companions tag along, while he attempts to thwart the murderous attentions of his unhappy client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejKD5DQ7jouzEkz1fx5Fr8li2ZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44147'),
  ('928793924055012235', 'Wild Thing', 1987, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Max Reid, René Verzier', 'John Sayles', 'Robert Knepper, Kathleen Quinlan, Robert Davi, Maury Chaykin, Betty Buckley, Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Robert Bednarski, Clark Johnson', 'PG-13', 'A child witnesses drug dealers murder his parents. He escapes and grows up wild in the city''s slums. Years later he emerges to help the residents of the area who are being terrorized by street gangs and drug dealers.', 'A child witnesses drug dealers murder his parents. He escapes and grows up wild in the city''s slums. Years later he emerges to help the residents of the area who are being terrorized by street gangs and drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRirxsDqOsuABds7INM3UE5fshQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85798'),
  ('1103869868925028538', 'Wild Things', 1998, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'John McNaughton, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Bruce Franklin', 'Stephen Peters', 'Kevin Bacon, Matt Dillon, Neve Campbell, Denise Richards, Theresa Russell, Bill Murray, Daphne Rubin-Vega, Robert Wagner', 'R', 'When teen-socialite Kelly Van Ryan and troubled bad girl Suzie Toller accuse guidance counselor Sam Lombardo of rape, he''s suspended by the school, rejected by the town, and fighting to get his life back. One cop suspects conspiracy, but nothing is what it seems...', 'When teen-socialite Kelly Van Ryan and troubled bad girl Suzie Toller accuse guidance counselor Sam Lombardo of rape, he''s suspended by the school, rejected by the town, and fighting to get his life back. One cop suspects conspiracy, but nothing is what it seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrcTDD9T7Ga5c9MW7kaOo2qwIvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617'),
  ('619893643026055335', 'Wild Things 2', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jack Perez, Alexa Sheehan, Jonathan Southard', 'Andy Hurst, Ross Helford', 'Susan Ward, Leila Arcieri, Isaiah Washington, Joe Michael Burke, Linden Ashby, Tony Denison, Ski Carr, Dylan Kussman', 'R', 'Two Florida high school vixens hatch a murderous plan to win an inheritance, but they hadn''t bargained for an escalating whirlpool of blackmail and sexual games with a sleazy insurance investigator who has his own plans for the money.', 'Two Florida high school vixens hatch a murderous plan to win an inheritance, but they hadn''t bargained for an escalating whirlpool of blackmail and sexual games with a sleazy insurance investigator who has his own plans for the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aoRiK4Q36kS4kYWWeF1CG4HhZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10367'),
  ('652865958178422784', 'Wild Things: Diamonds in the Rough', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jay Lowi, Tami Hodges Gruneich, Jonathan Southard', 'Ross Helford, Andy Hurst', 'Serah D''Laine, Sandra McCoy, Brad Johnson, Claire Coffee, Van Epperson, Ron Melendez, Dina Meyer, Nikki Griffin', 'R', 'Two young women will stop at nothing for one to gain a $4 million inheritance of two priceless diamonds, while two detectives try to thwart their plans, but find complications abound.', 'Two young women will stop at nothing for one to gain a $4 million inheritance of two priceless diamonds, while two detectives try to thwart their plans, but find complications abound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O01MpwB6eV0ars0Jxk0yh4x5ED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17124'),
  ('396614213101482442', 'Wild Things: Foursome', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Andy Hurst, Jeffrey D. Smith', 'Howard Zemski, Monty Featherstone', 'Jillian Murray, Marnette Patterson, Ashley Parker Angel, John Schneider, Ethan S. Smith, Jessie Nickson, Cameron Daddo, Marc Macaulay', 'R', 'A murdered hotel millionaire''s son finds himself tangled up in a game of seduction and murder after a raunchy night with three beautiful women.', 'A murdered hotel millionaire''s son finds himself tangled up in a game of seduction and murder after a raunchy night with three beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCbVWscuNzqrboYoxVCLfmQQ2Yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37708'),
  ('668724324570159113', 'Wild Tigers I Have Known', 2006, 'Drama', 'Cam Archer, Aaron Platt, Julia Kim', 'Cam Archer', 'Malcolm Stumpf, Patrick White, Max Paradise, Fairuza Balk, Kim Dickens, Tom Gilroy, Ruth Elliott', 'NR', 'A lyrical telling of the coming of age of a 14-year-old boy who learns to cope with his new found sexuality and his unrequited love for the cool kid in school.', 'A lyrical telling of the coming of age of a 14-year-old boy who learns to cope with his new found sexuality and his unrequited love for the cool kid in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij0bRoMZiKJgRxpcnGnguk7VHgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59995'),
