  ('308430713979761389', 'Wildflower', 1991, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Diane Keaton, Janusz Kamiński', null, 'Beau Bridges, Patricia Arquette, Reese Witherspoon, Susan Blakely, William McNamara, Collin Wilcox Paxton, Norman Max Maxwell, Richard K. Olsen', null, 'One day Sammy and his younger sister Ellie happen upon a cabin where Alice, a young, partially deaf girl with epilepsy is being kept by her abusive stepfather. The three soon become friends and hope to get Alice an education and help her escape from the torture she undergoes daily. However, Alice''s stepfather soon finds out about the friendship Alice has struck up and punishes her brutally. This story of friendship and youth shows that everyone is human and deserves to be treated so, no matter their disability or weakness.', 'One day Sammy and his younger sister Ellie happen upon a cabin where Alice, a young, partially deaf girl with epilepsy is being kept by her abusive stepfather. The three soon become friends and hope to get Alice an education and help her escape from the torture she undergoes daily. However, Alice''s stepfather soon finds out about the friendship Alice has struck up and punishes her brutally. This story of friendship and youth shows that everyone is human and deserves to be treated so, no matter their disability or weakness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84foP2vS8PTHMhQSbTGGNdWbyI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21546'),
  ('978385715660227210', 'Wildflower', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matt Smukler, Carrie Rudolph, Jill Maxcy', 'Jana Savage', 'Kiernan Shipka, Alexandra Daddario, Charlie Plummer, Jean Smart, Jacki Weaver, Kannon Omachi, Dash Mihok, Reid Scott', 'R', 'The story of Bea Johnson from birth to graduation as she navigates life with an intellectually disabled parent and an extended family who can''t quite agree on the best way to help.', 'The story of Bea Johnson from birth to graduation as she navigates life with an intellectually disabled parent and an extended family who can''t quite agree on the best way to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zNOqdjcdYojs7M3WgwtVgFhFsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915523'),
  ('529625523105803936', 'Wildhood', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Godfree, Bretten Hannam, Christopher Ball', 'Bretten Hannam', 'Phillip Forest Lewitski, Joshua Odjick, Michael Greyeyes, Joel Thomas Hynes, Avery Winters-Anthony, Savonna Spracklin, Jordan Poole, Steve Lund', null, 'Link and his brother flee their abusive father and embark on a journey where Link discovers his sexuality and rediscovers his Mi’kmaw heritage.', 'Link and his brother flee their abusive father and embark on a journey where Link discovers his sexuality and rediscovers his Mi’kmaw heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6ShzPuitNifo5XkWuSC7ZQ04x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856496'),
  ('38956448061435186', 'Wildland', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Family', 'Jeanette Nordahl, David Gallego, Peter Hingebjerg', 'Ingeborg Topsøe', 'Sandra Guldberg Kampp, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Joachim Fjelstrup, Elliott Crosset Hove, Besir Zeciri, Carla Philip Røder, Sofie Torp, Omar Shargawi', null, 'Following a car accident, which kills her mother, 17-year-old Ida moves in with her estranged aunt and her aunt’s grown sons. The home is filled with physical tenderness and love, but outside of the home, the family leads a violent and criminal life.', 'Following a car accident, which kills her mother, 17-year-old Ida moves in with her estranged aunt and her aunt’s grown sons. The home is filled with physical tenderness and love, but outside of the home, the family leads a violent and criminal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25TLEK4DUinIhgqM4kpn0haPEl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522893'),
  ('340061327127086994', 'Wildlife', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kim Dang, Paul Dano, Diego García', 'Paul Dano, Zoe Kazan', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Carey Mulligan, Ed Oxenbould, Zoe Colletti, Bill Camp, Travis W Bruyer, Tom Huston Orr, Darryl Cox', 'PG-13', '14-year-old Joe is the only child of Jeanette and Jerry — a housewife and a golf pro — in a small town in 1960s Montana. Nearby, an uncontrolled forest fire rages close to the Canadian border, and when Jerry loses his job (and his sense of purpose) he decides to join the cause of fighting the fire, leaving his wife and son to fend for themselves.', '14-year-old Joe is the only child of Jeanette and Jerry — a housewife and a golf pro — in a small town in 1960s Montana. Nearby, an uncontrolled forest fire rages close to the Canadian border, and when Jerry loses his job (and his sense of purpose) he decides to join the cause of fighting the fire, leaving his wife and son to fend for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQSUwjSSRtWCA5EBoY22gGzaE8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417812'),
  ('859604656705683196', 'Wildlike', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Hillary Spera, Frank Hall Green, Chris Carroll', 'Frank Hall Green', 'Bruce Greenwood, Ella Purnell, Brian Geraghty, Ann Dowd, Nolan Gerard Funk, Diane Farr, Joshua Leonard, Erin Lindsay King', 'NR', 'Fourteen-year-old Mackenzie is sent to live with her uncle in Juneau when her mother can’t care for her anymore. The living situation quickly takes a turn for the worse, and she runs away to rejoin her mother in Seattle. While on her dangerous journey of sleeping in cars and breaking into hotel rooms, she’s drawn to Rene, a lonesome backpacker looking for tranquility in the wilderness.', 'Fourteen-year-old Mackenzie is sent to live with her uncle in Juneau when her mother can’t care for her anymore. The living situation quickly takes a turn for the worse, and she runs away to rejoin her mother in Seattle. While on her dangerous journey of sleeping in cars and breaking into hotel rooms, she’s drawn to Rene, a lonesome backpacker looking for tranquility in the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePr0yezWy3DKsHDv3fUdxSJ6Mz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300654'),
  ('500353308729883341', 'Wildling', 2018, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller, Drama', 'Fritz Böhm, Toby Oliver, Quenell Jones', 'Fritz Böhm, Florian Eder', 'Bel Powley, Liv Tyler, Collin Kelly-Sordelet, Brad Dourif, James Le Gros, Troy Ruptash, Charlotte Ubben, Aviva Winick', 'R', 'A young woman held in captivity discovers the realities of truth and lies in the outside world.', 'A young woman held in captivity discovers the realities of truth and lies in the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZQR6hKRUBqHRL4lfECFES68zGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362826'),
  ('790097504579089214', 'Wildside', 1998, 'Drama', 'Simon Staho, Lísa Kristjánsdóttir', 'Simon Staho, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Mads Mikkelsen, Nukâka Coster-Waldau, Pálína Jónsdóttir, Sævar Örn, Jón Sigurbjörnsson, Egill Ólafsson, Finni Johannsson', null, 'Charming desperado Ossy, carrying a deadly secret, tracks down his childhood pal Jimmy in Iceland. But Jimmy, now with a family and a regular job, will do anything to hide his past.', 'Charming desperado Ossy, carrying a deadly secret, tracks down his childhood pal Jimmy in Iceland. But Jimmy, now with a family and a regular job, will do anything to hide his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTFoCB3gOWnAw1LtsdefZoHo6MU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23598'),
  ('53223640515344322', 'Will', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Ellen Perry, Paul Ghirardani, Oliver Stapleton', 'Ellen Perry', 'Damian Lewis, Bob Hoskins, Rebekah Staton, Perry Eggleton, Kieran Wallbanks, Malcolm Storry, Harvey Walsh, Alice Krige', null, 'Brennan is Liverpool''s number one fan, able to recite facts ad infinitum about the club and at a public school in the south of England since his father Gareth is emotionally unable to care for him following the death of Will''s mother. Gareth appears one day out of the blue with tickets for Liverpool''s trip to the 2005 Champions League Final in Istanbul.', 'Brennan is Liverpool''s number one fan, able to recite facts ad infinitum about the club and at a public school in the south of England since his father Gareth is emotionally unable to care for him following the death of Will''s mother. Gareth appears one day out of the blue with tickets for Liverpool''s trip to the 2005 Champions League Final in Istanbul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aEpPFYcOQyqtAinGIqlRws6oaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91979'),
  ('815951341570488361', 'WILL', 2023, 'Drama, War, History', 'Tim Mielants, Robrecht Heyvaert, Józef Grzymała', 'Carl Joos, Jeroen Olyslaegers', 'Stef Aerts, Matteo Simoni, Annelore Crollet, Kevin Janssens, Dirk Roofthooft, Dimitrij Schaad, Pierre Bokma, Karina Smulders', 'R', 'Two young police officers find themselves torn between collaboration and resistance as they navigate the Nazi-occupied Antwerp during World War II.', 'Two young police officers find themselves torn between collaboration and resistance as they navigate the Nazi-occupied Antwerp during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAhD2oipCFMUXcZ5YDtQg0pwbUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973468'),
  ('159560228817191457', 'Will & Harper', 2024, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Josh Greenbaum, Zoë White', null, 'Will Ferrell, Harper Steele, Tim Meadows, Seth Meyers, Kristen Wiig, Colin Jost, Lorne Michaels, Will Forte', 'R', 'When Will Ferrell''s good friend Harper comes out as a trans woman, they take a road trip to bond and reintroduce Harper to the country as her true self.', 'When Will Ferrell''s good friend Harper comes out as a trans woman, they take a road trip to bond and reintroduce Harper to the country as her true self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xbYcoEb9gqezNnLgjWcZI5Hlsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214506'),
  ('803571807933413071', 'Will Ferrell: You''re Welcome America - A Final Night with George W. Bush', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Marty Callner, Christine Clark Bradley, Adam McKay', 'Will Ferrell', 'Will Ferrell, Michael Delaney, Pia Glenn, Adam Mucci, Patrick Ferrell', null, 'After playing George W. Bush on Saturday Night Live for many years, funny man Will Ferrell brings his impression to Broadway to send up the 43rd President of the United States of America.', 'After playing George W. Bush on Saturday Night Live for many years, funny man Will Ferrell brings his impression to Broadway to send up the 43rd President of the United States of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyuPRxLRPEvhfMT0sNTncNbOwpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16239'),
  ('983198853121109778', 'Will It Snow for Christmas?', 1996, 'Drama', 'Sandrine Veysset, Hélène Louvart', 'Sandrine Veysset, Antoinette de Robien', 'Dominique Reymond, Daniel Duval, Jessica Martinez, Alexandre Roger, Xavier Colonna, Fanny Rochetin, Flavie Chimènes, Jérémy Chaix', null, 'A woman and her seven children live on a farm in Southern France. In spite of the hard work and the mediocre accommodation, their life would be a happy one, but for one person: the owner of the farm, an egotistic and authoritarian individual who is also the lover of the woman and the father of all her children. The farmer handles them as his property, uses them as cheap labour to work in the fields, and denies them the right to leave the farm. It is only the love of the woman for her children that allows them to endure their situation; but even for her, disenchantment has set in.', 'A woman and her seven children live on a farm in Southern France. In spite of the hard work and the mediocre accommodation, their life would be a happy one, but for one person: the owner of the farm, an egotistic and authoritarian individual who is also the lover of the woman and the father of all her children. The farmer handles them as his property, uses them as cheap labour to work in the fields, and denies them the right to leave the farm. It is only the love of the woman for her children that allows them to endure their situation; but even for her, disenchantment has set in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw74c1V7FlqCfZiJAAx85g9sjs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58777'),
  ('644119417838864835', 'Will Our Heroes Be Able to Find Their Friend Who Has Mysteriously Disappeared in Africa?', 1968, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ettore Scola, Claudio Cirillo', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Ettore Scola', 'Alberto Sordi, Bernard Blier, Nino Manfredi, Giuliana Lojodice, Franca Bettoia, Manuel Zarzo, Erika Blanc, José María Mendoza', null, 'A rich businessman is fed up with work, family, society, and goes with his accountant to Africa, in search of his brother-in-law who had vanished there in mysterious circumstances. They will find him alright - as a tribal chief, surrounded with lots of topless, shapely wives. They are going to return to civilisation, but will their friend come with them?', 'A rich businessman is fed up with work, family, society, and goes with his accountant to Africa, in search of his brother-in-law who had vanished there in mysterious circumstances. They will find him alright - as a tribal chief, surrounded with lots of topless, shapely wives. They are going to return to civilisation, but will their friend come with them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mzYidHJIRffpSS2e91BZM3Yqmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68816'),
  ('1112074591807523753', 'Will Penny', 1967, 'Western, Romance', 'Tom Gries, Lucien Ballard', 'Tom Gries', 'Charlton Heston, Joan Hackett, Donald Pleasence, Lee Majors, Bruce Dern, Ben Johnson, Slim Pickens, Clifton James', 'NR', 'Will Penny, an aging cowpoke, takes a job on a ranch which requires him to ride the line of the property looking for trespassers or, worse, squatters. He finds that his cabin in the high mountains has been appropriated by a woman whose guide to Oregon has deserted her and her son. Too ashamed to kick mother and child out just as the bitter winter of the mountains sets in, he agrees to share the cabin until the spring thaw. But it isn''t just the snow that slowly thaws; the lonely man and woman soon forget their mutual hostility and start developing a deep love for one another.', 'Will Penny, an aging cowpoke, takes a job on a ranch which requires him to ride the line of the property looking for trespassers or, worse, squatters. He finds that his cabin in the high mountains has been appropriated by a woman whose guide to Oregon has deserted her and her son. Too ashamed to kick mother and child out just as the bitter winter of the mountains sets in, he agrees to share the cabin until the spring thaw. But it isn''t just the snow that slowly thaws; the lonely man and woman soon forget their mutual hostility and start developing a deep love for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3RcNrqutEPGsiTLd31J3U735kB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1676'),
  ('1033906687020287977', 'Will Success Spoil Rock Hunter?', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Tashlin, Joseph MacDonald, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Tony Randall, Jayne Mansfield, Betsy Drake, Joan Blondell, John Williams, Henry Jones, Lili Gentle, Mickey Hargitay', 'NR', 'To save his career, an ad man wants a sex symbol to endorse a lipstick but in exchange, she wants him to pretend to be her lover.', 'To save his career, an ad man wants a sex symbol to endorse a lipstick but in exchange, she wants him to pretend to be her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzBZE9SHJFaew2Csi5DPfeJEBcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37124'),
  ('85107396959174066', 'Will the High Salaried Workers Raise Their Hands!', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Étienne Becker', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Yves Stavrides', 'Jean Poiret, Michel Piccoli, Daniel Auteuil, François Perrot, Pierre Pernet, Tchéky Karyo, Florence Pernel, Patrick Bouchitey', null, 'The cynical boss of a big insurance agency invites his top-salary employees to spend a week-end in his country house. A modest clerical worker, also invited, discovers the hidden reason for this party - and decides to take advantage of it.', 'The cynical boss of a big insurance agency invites his top-salary employees to spend a week-end in his country house. A modest clerical worker, also invited, discovers the hidden reason for this party - and decides to take advantage of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mydj4ByyzqqB6LRs1qPnxbz2EMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78803'),
  ('969298793048576054', 'Will You Be My Girlfriend?.', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ihtzi Hurtado, Daniel Anguiano', 'Ihtzi Hurtado', 'Ludwika Paleta, Juanpa Zurita, Harold Azuara, Yuriria del Valle, Moisés Arizmendi', null, 'Javi and Lu''s relationship faces dangerous territory as old and new temptations emerge: a young woman reigniting Javi''s chemistry and a mature man pursuing Lu. Through humor, entanglements, and surprises, their love is tested.', 'Javi and Lu''s relationship faces dangerous territory as old and new temptations emerge: a young woman reigniting Javi''s chemistry and a mature man pursuing Lu. Through humor, entanglements, and surprises, their love is tested.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoscW8xV8EhRYj7iAhyVlBohKqxo.jpg', 'plex:movie:will-you-be-my-girlfriend'),
  ('1135057918292014164', 'Will You Be There', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Kang Dae-hui, Hong Ji-young, Park Hong-yeol', 'Hong Ji-young', 'Kim Yun-seok, Byun Yo-han, Chae Seo-jin, Kim Sang-ho, Ahn Se-ha, Park Hye-su, Kim Ho-jung, Kim Sung-ryung', null, 'Soo-hyun comes across magical pills that allow him to go back and forth in time. 30 years to the past, young Soo-hyun meets future Soo-hyun and learns that his girlfriend will soon die because of him. In order to save her, the two Soo-hyuns try to change the past together, but a completely new and unexpected past is formed that leads to a new future.', 'Soo-hyun comes across magical pills that allow him to go back and forth in time. 30 years to the past, young Soo-hyun meets future Soo-hyun and learns that his girlfriend will soon die because of him. In order to save her, the two Soo-hyuns try to change the past together, but a completely new and unexpected past is formed that leads to a new future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFyWyuZ7H0cqxwGH8H3DgQbsbEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422576'),
  ('862686770821045394', 'Will You Look at Me', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Shuli Huang', 'Shuli Huang', null, null, 'As a young Chinese filmmaker returns to his hometown in search for himself, a long due conversation with his mother dives the two of them into a quest for acceptance and love.', 'As a young Chinese filmmaker returns to his hometown in search for himself, a long due conversation with his mother dives the two of them into a quest for acceptance and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg33Zx2r6WcUsdj7RaRCvtYRJEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965170'),
  ('490885308986963350', 'Will You Marry My Wife?', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshishige Miyake, Masashige Nakanishi', 'Arisa Kaneko', 'Yuji Oda, Yoh Yoshida, Taizo Harada, Reiko Takashima, Kaito Komie, Kanna Mori, Hidekazu Mashima, Arisa Sato', null, 'Shuji Mimura works as a broadcast writer. He learns that he doesn''t have much time left to live. He decides to concentrate on the future of his beloved family. Shuji Mimura''s final plan is to find the best man to marry his wife Ayako.', 'Shuji Mimura works as a broadcast writer. He learns that he doesn''t have much time left to live. He decides to concentrate on the future of his beloved family. Shuji Mimura''s final plan is to find the best man to marry his wife Ayako.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWxeUxlKO9RJQGYnlKdW4O34qWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457484'),
  ('46435284523015028', 'Will You Still Love Me Tomorrow?', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Arvin Chen, Hsia Shao-yu', 'Arvin Chen', 'Richie Jen, Mavis Fan, Shih Chin-Hang, Hsia Yu-chiao, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Wong Ka-Lok, Wei-Ning Chang, Gabriel Lan', null, 'Introverted Weichung has been married to Feng for nine years. They have one son together, and Feng would like to have another child with him. One day Stephen, an old friend who now organises weddings, appears and encourages Weichung to return to the gay life he had previously. Anxious not to lose his wife, Weichung tentatively begins seeing a flight attendant behind Feng''s back.', 'Introverted Weichung has been married to Feng for nine years. They have one son together, and Feng would like to have another child with him. One day Stephen, an old friend who now organises weddings, appears and encourages Weichung to return to the gay life he had previously. Anxious not to lose his wife, Weichung tentatively begins seeing a flight attendant behind Feng''s back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsPFNJbfjXK4VQsosFWczuSW0Sk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168814'),
  ('973384622996921466', 'Will Your Heart Beat Faster?', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Mike de Leon, Rody Lacap', 'Clodualdo del Mundo Jr., Raquel Villavicencio, Mike de Leon', 'Christopher de Leon, Charo Santos, Jay Ilagan, Sandy Andolong, Boboy Garrovillo, Johnny Delgado, Armida Siguion-Reyna, Leo Martinez', null, 'In a spoof on the contemporary sacred cons, two yuppy couples get entangled with warring smugglers of dope that include fake priests and nuns as well as Japanese and Chinese agents.', 'In a spoof on the contemporary sacred cons, two yuppy couples get entangled with warring smugglers of dope that include fake priests and nuns as well as Japanese and Chinese agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mYGpYjWVYtze77WmeXwuXAl6xW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253060'),
  ('509420289651874099', 'Will-o''-the-Wisp', 2022, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'João Pedro Rodrigues', 'Paulo Lopes Graça, João Rui Guerra da Mata, João Pedro Rodrigues', 'Mauro Costa, André Cabral, Joel Branco, Oceano Cruz, Margarida Vila-Nova, Miguel Loureiro, Dinis Vila-Nova, Luísa Castelo Branco', 'NR', 'On his deathbed, His Majesty Alfredo, King without a crown, is taken back to distant youth memories from the time when he dreamt of becoming a fireman. His encounter with instructor Afonso from the fire brigade, opens a new chapter in the life of the two young men devoted to love and desire, and the will to change the status quo.', 'On his deathbed, His Majesty Alfredo, King without a crown, is taken back to distant youth memories from the time when he dreamt of becoming a fireman. His encounter with instructor Afonso from the fire brigade, opens a new chapter in the life of the two young men devoted to love and desire, and the will to change the status quo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11DCSb6hWSok3zF0MDFalLCkCiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964704'),
  ('352137440904123434', 'Willard', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Daniel Mann, Robert B. Hauser, Robert Goodstein', 'Gilbert Ralston', 'Bruce Davison, Ernest Borgnine, Sondra Locke, Elsa Lanchester, Michael Dante, Jody Gilbert, William Hansen, John Myhers', 'PG', 'A social misfit, Willard is made fun of by his co-workers, and squeezed out of the company started by his deceased father by his boss. His only friends are a couple of rats he raised at home, Ben and Socrates. However, when one of them is killed at work, he goes on a rampage using his rats to attack those who have been tormenting him.', 'A social misfit, Willard is made fun of by his co-workers, and squeezed out of the company started by his deceased father by his boss. His only friends are a couple of rats he raised at home, Ben and Socrates. However, when one of them is killed at work, he goes on a rampage using his rats to attack those who have been tormenting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhDAH8JRO9R1ROjSH24GoJPaJBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42532'),
  ('996035980652427380', 'Willard', 2003, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert McLachlan, Glen Morgan, Catherine Schroer', 'Gilbert Ralston', 'Crispin Glover, R. Lee Ermey, Laura Harring, Jackie Burroughs, Ashlyn Gere, Laara Sadiq, William S. Taylor, Ty Olsson', 'PG-13', 'Desperate for companionship, the repressed Willard befriends a group of rats that inhabit his late father''s deteriorating mansion. In these furry creatures, Willard finds temporary refuge from daily abuse at the hands of his bedridden mother and his father''s old partner, Frank. Soon it becomes clear that the brood of rodents is ready and willing to exact a vicious, deadly revenge on anyone who dares to bully their sensitive new master.', 'Desperate for companionship, the repressed Willard befriends a group of rats that inhabit his late father''s deteriorating mansion. In these furry creatures, Willard finds temporary refuge from daily abuse at the hands of his bedridden mother and his father''s old partner, Frank. Soon it becomes clear that the brood of rodents is ready and willing to exact a vicious, deadly revenge on anyone who dares to bully their sensitive new master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRVP8Ud9ehv7tp5WWQ4CHk2XNus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10929'),
  ('109819883165920566', 'Willenbrock', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andreas Dresen, Michael Hammon', 'Laila Stieler', 'Axel Prahl, Inka Friedrich, Anne Ratte-Polle, Dagmar Manzel, Christian Grashof, Andrzej Szopa, Tilo Prückner, Wladimir Tarasjanz', null, 'Second-hand car sales man Willenbrock has everything that he could ever wish for. He is married, has two lovers, a cottage in the German city Grünen, and a BMW. Yet one day while at his cottage he gets mugged and his life is drastically changed. Little by little the world he once felt safe in falls apart around him.', 'Second-hand car sales man Willenbrock has everything that he could ever wish for. He is married, has two lovers, a cottage in the German city Grünen, and a BMW. Yet one day while at his cottage he gets mugged and his life is drastically changed. Little by little the world he once felt safe in falls apart around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVIVSw0XcuAnQN7SWdv80ppepcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894'),
  ('481223943025354933', 'William - The Young Conqueror', 2015, 'History, Adventure', 'Fabien Drugeon, Fabien Drugeon', 'Fabien Drugeon', 'Dan Bronchinson, Tiésay Deshayes, Jean-Damien Détouillon, Geoffroy Lidvan, Eric Rulliat, Thomas Debaene, Pierrick Billard, Gauthier Battoue', null, 'In the year of 1066AD, William the Conqueror is about to embark from Dives-sur-Mer to conquer England. In the event that he would not return alive, Guillaume introduced his son Robert to his loyal barons to receive the ducal throne heritage.', 'In the year of 1066AD, William the Conqueror is about to embark from Dives-sur-Mer to conquer England. In the event that he would not return alive, Guillaume introduced his son Robert to his loyal barons to receive the ducal throne heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySHtkSZBoZVwacEsQU1k8mPFbyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338832'),
  ('300531089212858858', 'William & Kate', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mark Rosman, Anthony B. Richmond, Dennis Crow', 'Nancey Silvers', 'Camilla Luddington, Nico Evers-Swindell, Victoria Tennant, Charles Shaughnessy, Ben Cross, Serena Scott Thomas, Samantha Whittaker, Trilby Glover', null, 'Inspired by the royal wedding and retelling the highs and lows of the nine-year courtship of Kate Middleton and Prince William. The couple struggles to keep their relationship together in the face of intense media scrutiny and family pressures, but the story ultimately ends in a fairytale wedding.', 'Inspired by the royal wedding and retelling the highs and lows of the nine-year courtship of Kate Middleton and Prince William. The couple struggles to keep their relationship together in the face of intense media scrutiny and family pressures, but the story ultimately ends in a fairytale wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usUshqdbO9YA1VZu73BrGW8eRzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62796'),
  ('1010608988606004282', 'William Buys a Parrot', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Antony Balch', 'William S. Burroughs', 'William S. Burroughs', null, 'A bizarre silent short film showing author William S. Burroughs negotiating to buy a parrot.', 'A bizarre silent short film showing author William S. Burroughs negotiating to buy a parrot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MWhZwMjAAZNd8yWjHcjZchU0sJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101810'),
  ('876271340821750888', 'William Tell', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Nick Hamm, Jamie D. Ramsay', 'Nick Hamm', 'Claes Bang, Connor Swindells, Golshifteh Farahani, Jonah Hauer-King, Ellie Bamber, Rafe Spall, Emily Beecham, Jonathan Pryce', 'R', 'The narrative unfolds in the 14th Century, when the European nations vie for supremacy within the Holy Roman Empire. The ambitious Austrian Empire, desiring more land, invades neighbouring Switzerland, a serene and pastoral nation. Protagonist William Tell, a formerly peaceful hunter, finds himself forced to take action as his family and homeland come under threat from the oppressive Austrian King and his ruthless warlords.', 'The narrative unfolds in the 14th Century, when the European nations vie for supremacy within the Holy Roman Empire. The ambitious Austrian Empire, desiring more land, invades neighbouring Switzerland, a serene and pastoral nation. Protagonist William Tell, a formerly peaceful hunter, finds himself forced to take action as his family and homeland come under threat from the oppressive Austrian King and his ruthless warlords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SdaetXSTPyQVDb5pTEPRLBSx15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195631'),
  ('66003398895804716', 'William, the New Judo Master', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ricardo Silva, Omar Guzmán', 'Ricardo Silva, Omar Guzmán', 'William Clauson, Edward Coward, Hoze Meléndez, Pako Houston, José Luis Figueroa, Arak Bernal', null, 'Portrays the universe of an eternal being that exists within a lifecycle filled with disappointments and hopelessness. It''s the chronicle about the search for love and the fight against oblivion.', 'Portrays the universe of an eternal being that exists within a lifecycle filled with disappointments and hopelessness. It''s the chronicle about the search for love and the fight against oblivion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa52LcwoqULC4fCsd10PrQzxS0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423614'),
