  ('258246996374125585', 'Willie & Phil', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Mazursky, Sven Nykvist', 'Paul Mazursky', 'Michael Ontkean, Margot Kidder, Ray Sharkey, Jan Miner, Tom Brennan, Julie Bovasso, Louis Guss, Kathleen Maguire', null, 'Life imitates art when two Manhattanites — pompous teacher Willie and quiet photographer Phil — become friends after a thought-provoking screening of "Jules et Jim," Truffaut''s classic film about a decades-long ménage à trois. Soon, the men meet Jeanette, a sexually liberated southern transplant who promptly falls for both of them. Frustrated passions curdle into jealousy as Jeanette entertains love affairs with each in the ensuing years.', 'Life imitates art when two Manhattanites — pompous teacher Willie and quiet photographer Phil — become friends after a thought-provoking screening of "Jules et Jim," Truffaut''s classic film about a decades-long ménage à trois. Soon, the men meet Jeanette, a sexually liberated southern transplant who promptly falls for both of them. Frustrated passions curdle into jealousy as Jeanette entertains love affairs with each in the ensuing years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ9EbDHZ1zg6KQUS75FDgpXCDGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92323'),
  ('295815626975816460', 'Willie Dynamite', 1974, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gilbert Moses, Jim Hogan, William Holbrook', 'Joe Keyes, Ron Cutler', 'Roscoe Orman, Diana Sands, Thalmus Rasulala, Joyce Walker, Roger Robinson, George Murdock, Albert Hall, Norma Donaldson', 'R', 'Willie Dynamite is a pimp who operates in New York City. Willie was a big success as a pimp, but now, just as fast as he rose to the top, he has hit bottom. A former prostitute who has become a social worker tries to get Willie to clean up his life while it is still possible.', 'Willie Dynamite is a pimp who operates in New York City. Willie was a big success as a pimp, but now, just as fast as he rose to the top, he has hit bottom. A former prostitute who has become a social worker tries to get Willie to clean up his life while it is still possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmjJ176Ff9R7cpT6TWB6T9dtRBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46018'),
  ('680431289261048692', 'Willie the Operatic Whale', 1946, 'Animation', 'Hamilton Luske, Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Nelson Eddy', 'NR', 'The Metropolitan Opera is looking for the sea monster reported in newspaper headlines, because this monster sings beautifully! The "monster" is actually Willie, a whale who can sing in several voices simultaneously. A friend of his, a gull called Whitey, tells him about the searching ship, and Willie goes to audition, as it''s been his ambition to perform on stage. Unfortunately, Professor Tetti Tatti from the Opera believes that one or more singers have been swallowed by the whale, and need to be rescued.', 'The Metropolitan Opera is looking for the sea monster reported in newspaper headlines, because this monster sings beautifully! The "monster" is actually Willie, a whale who can sing in several voices simultaneously. A friend of his, a gull called Whitey, tells him about the searching ship, and Willie goes to audition, as it''s been his ambition to perform on stage. Unfortunately, Professor Tetti Tatti from the Opera believes that one or more singers have been swallowed by the whale, and need to be rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RI4ATApf5nlLlNUmOBTdB6OH5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63272'),
  ('339466239235303540', 'Willow', 1988, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Adrian Biddle, Ron Howard, Ken Baker', 'Bob Dolman', 'Warwick Davis, Val Kilmer, Joanne Whalley, Patricia Hayes, Gavan O''Herlihy, Phil Fondacaro, Pat Roach, Rick Overton', 'PG', 'The evil Queen Bavmorda hunts the newborn princess Elora Danan, a child prophesied to bring about her downfall. When the royal infant is found by Willow, a timid farmer and aspiring sorcerer, he''s entrusted with delivering her from evil.', 'The evil Queen Bavmorda hunts the newborn princess Elora Danan, a child prophesied to bring about her downfall. When the royal infant is found by Willow, a timid farmer and aspiring sorcerer, he''s entrusted with delivering her from evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAIRGMIdN7ZdZhflazdV2ezuJ9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847'),
  ('88324915752563914', 'Willow Creek', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Evan Phelan, Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Alexie Gilmore, Bryce Johnson, Peter Jason, Timmy Red, Bucky Sinister, Laura Montagna', 'NR', 'Looking to make a splash online with his research videos into the existence of Bigfoot, Jim and his girlfriend Kelly take a camping trip to the small town of Willow Creek, California, and the surrounding mountains where the infamous footage of the supposed sasquatch was filmed.', 'Looking to make a splash online with his research videos into the existence of Bigfoot, Jim and his girlfriend Kelly take a camping trip to the small town of Willow Creek, California, and the surrounding mountains where the infamous footage of the supposed sasquatch was filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79JtBWsWmG6zhektBbwq0u8r9pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185460'),
  ('30640919807193953', 'Willy Fog: Around the World in 80 Days', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Fumio Kurokawa, Toshiaki Morita', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Claudio Rodríguez, Gloria Cámara, Manuel Peiró, José Moratalla, Rafael de Penagos, Luis Marín, Antolín García, Eduardo Jover', null, 'Willy Fog is a British millionaire who bets that he will be able to go around the world in only eighty days.', 'Willy Fog is a British millionaire who bets that he will be able to go around the world in only eighty days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bq9bEPCoTjVtL8CL8GjxYp8LXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323816'),
  ('1078095961932900238', 'Willy Signori e vengo da lontano', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti, Ferzan Özpetek, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Francesco Nuti, Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Francesco Nuti, Isabella Ferrari, Anna Galiena, Alessandro Haber, Novello Novelli, Cristina Gaïoni, Geoffrey Copleston, Antonio Petrocelli', null, 'Willy is involved in a fatal car accident. Willy takes on the responsibility of supporting the dead man''s pregnant girlfriend and the child, after it''s birth.', 'Willy is involved in a fatal car accident. Willy takes on the responsibility of supporting the dead man''s pregnant girlfriend and the child, after it''s birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sACDaDzj3FaLJgYcHBs7JSHjvBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78065'),
  ('634090628315447215', 'Willy the 1st', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zoran Boukherma, Hugo P. Thomas, Ludovic Boukherma', 'Hugo P. Thomas, Ludovic Boukherma, Zoran Boukherma', 'Daniel Vannet, Noémie Lvovsky, Romain Léger, Robert Follet, Geneviève Plet, Eric Jacquet, Kiki, Lea Viller', null, 'Willy, a boorish 50 something, finally moves out of his parents’ to start a new life', 'Willy, a boorish 50 something, finally moves out of his parents’ to start a new life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYgl9KDnNQTENvedOC6WbldKL7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396924'),
  ('840982689654062164', 'Willy the Sparrow', 1989, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'József Gémes, György Varga, Erzsébet Nemes', 'József Nepp, József Gémes', 'Levente Igaz, Klári Tolnay, József Székhelyi, Eszter Kárász, Cecília Esztergályos, Mátyás Usztics, József Gyabronka, Tibor Szilágyi', null, 'Vili fakes illness so he doesn''t have to take a math test. Instead, he starts shooting at sparrows from the window with an air rifle. The kindly old lady who feeds the birds turns out to be a real-life fairy who tries to turn Vili into a good boy.', 'Vili fakes illness so he doesn''t have to take a math test. Instead, he starts shooting at sparrows from the window with an air rifle. The kindly old lady who feeds the birds turns out to be a real-life fairy who tries to turn Vili into a good boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDeOmFzH7MA2xL0OjJTPfoq9Uuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37587'),
  ('9872007048799153', 'Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory', 1971, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mel Stuart, Arthur Ibbetson, Wolfgang Glattes', 'Anthony Newley, Leslie Bricusse', 'Gene Wilder, Jack Albertson, Peter Ostrum, Roy Kinnear, Julie Dawn Cole, Leonard Stone, Denise Nickerson, Nora Denney', 'G', 'When eccentric candy man Willy Wonka promises a lifetime supply of sweets and a tour of his chocolate factory to five lucky kids, penniless Charlie Bucket seeks the golden ticket that will make him a winner.', 'When eccentric candy man Willy Wonka promises a lifetime supply of sweets and a tour of his chocolate factory to five lucky kids, penniless Charlie Bucket seeks the golden ticket that will make him a winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmpsZkrs4Uvkp9r1atL8B3frA63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252'),
  ('983331945128402306', 'Willy''s Wonderland', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Newbert, Kevin Lewis', 'G.O. Parsons', 'Nicolas Cage, Emily Tosta, Beth Grant, Ric Reitz, Chris Warner, Kai Kadlec, Caylee Cowan, Jonathan Mercedes', 'NR', 'When his car breaks down, a quiet loner agrees to clean an abandoned family fun center in exchange for repairs. He soon finds himself waging war against possessed animatronic mascots while trapped inside Willy''s Wonderland.', 'When his car breaks down, a quiet loner agrees to clean an abandoned family fun center in exchange for repairs. He soon finds himself waging war against possessed animatronic mascots while trapped inside Willy''s Wonderland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keEnkeAvifw8NSEC4f6WsqeLJgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643586'),
  ('884782541577490925', 'Willy/Milly', 1986, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Dominique Chapuis, Paul Schneider, Gary Marcus', 'Walter Carbone, Carla Reuben', 'Pamela Adlon, Eric Gurry, Mary Tanner Bailey, John Glover, Patty Duke, Seth Green, JD Cullum, Corey Parker', 'PG-13', 'Milly is annoyed whenever her mom tells her to behave more appropriate for a girl. She''s just not interested in fancy dresses or prom dances. Some day her best friend''s little brother offers her a potion which can make her deepest wish come true during a solar eclipse. She goes through with it and ends up with male genitals, additionally. So she has to decide if she wants to live as a boy or a girl. Her father, who always wanted a son, supports her in checking out life as a boy. Hence Milly changes school and starts out as Willy.', 'Milly is annoyed whenever her mom tells her to behave more appropriate for a girl. She''s just not interested in fancy dresses or prom dances. Some day her best friend''s little brother offers her a potion which can make her deepest wish come true during a solar eclipse. She goes through with it and ends up with male genitals, additionally. So she has to decide if she wants to live as a boy or a girl. Her father, who always wanted a son, supports her in checking out life as a boy. Hence Milly changes school and starts out as Willy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM45veApm8KhnSolOROA67ScjJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46836'),
  ('541673837859613236', 'Wilson', 1944, 'Drama', 'Henry King, Leon Shamroy', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Alexander Knox, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Thomas Mitchell, Ruth Nelson, Cedric Hardwicke, Charles Coburn, Vincent Price, William Eythe', 'NR', 'The political career of Woodrow Wilson is chronicled, beginning with his decision to leave his post at Princeton to run for Governor of New Jersey, and his subsequent ascent to the Presidency of the United States. During his terms in office, Wilson must deal with the death of his first wife, the onslaught of German hostilities leading to American involvement in the Great War, and his own country''s reticence to join the League of Nations. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2006.', 'The political career of Woodrow Wilson is chronicled, beginning with his decision to leave his post at Princeton to run for Governor of New Jersey, and his subsequent ascent to the Presidency of the United States. During his terms in office, Wilson must deal with the death of his first wife, the onslaught of German hostilities leading to American involvement in the Great War, and his own country''s reticence to join the League of Nations. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nXIUIUwh4GZ8mQvEhgqUuqMann.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84084'),
  ('147329029826382754', 'Wilson', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Johnson, Richard L. Fox, Frederick Elmes', 'Daniel Clowes', 'Woody Harrelson, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Cheryl Hines, Isabella Amara, Laura Dern, Judy Greer, Brett Gelman, Margo Martindale', 'R', 'Middle-aged and divorced, Wilson finds himself lonely, smug, and obsessed with his past.', 'Middle-aged and divorced, Wilson finds himself lonely, smug, and obsessed with his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m63h5MxevYrKn3720hVgKZAx86S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346681'),
  ('660362228627528328', 'Wilt', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Tuchner, Norman G. Langley', 'Andrew Marshall, David Renwick', 'Mel Smith, Griff Rhys Jones, Alison Steadman, Roger Lloyd Pack, Diana Quick, Jeremy Clyde, Roger Allam, David Ryall', 'R', 'Henry Wilt is a more or less failed teacher who fantasizes about murdering his dominant, non-attentive wife Eva. At a party who gets stuck in an inflatable doll and makes a complete fool of himself. Eventually, he dumps the doll in a hole at a building site. However, he has been witnessed getting rid of the doll and when his wife disappears on the night after the party, the police and Inspector Flint have strong suspicions on Mr Wilt.', 'Henry Wilt is a more or less failed teacher who fantasizes about murdering his dominant, non-attentive wife Eva. At a party who gets stuck in an inflatable doll and makes a complete fool of himself. Eventually, he dumps the doll in a hole at a building site. However, he has been witnessed getting rid of the doll and when his wife disappears on the night after the party, the police and Inspector Flint have strong suspicions on Mr Wilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCtlP8MmcQig98jsmcLYKQaxkCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44561'),
  ('16380066850920439', 'Wimbledon', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Loncraine, Darius Khondji, Tony Halton', 'Mark Levin, Adam Brooks, Jennifer Flackett', 'Kirsten Dunst, Paul Bettany, Sam Neill, Jon Favreau, Bernard Hill, Eleanor Bron, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Austin Nichols', 'PG-13', 'Britain’s Peter Colt has never quite lived up to his dreams of tennis stardom. Once ranked as high as number 11 in the world, the journeyman veteran has watched his number slip to 119 as his confidence on the court slowly ebbs away. Now, on the eve of his leaving the world of professional tennis, he’s granted a wild card, allowing him to play his final Wimbledon tournament…make that his final tournament ever.', 'Britain’s Peter Colt has never quite lived up to his dreams of tennis stardom. Once ranked as high as number 11 in the world, the journeyman veteran has watched his number slip to 119 as his confidence on the court slowly ebbs away. Now, on the eve of his leaving the world of professional tennis, he’s granted a wild card, allowing him to play his final Wimbledon tournament…make that his final tournament ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agiItFfsvNsjpinLGwjfpYOhLaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11823'),
  ('603556166958651016', 'Wimbledon Stage', 2002, 'Drama', 'Mathieu Amalric, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Mathieu Amalric', 'Jeanne Balibar, Esther Gorintin, Anna Prucnal, Ariella Reggio, Peter Hudson', null, 'The story is about a woman who is going to Trieste (a city in Italy) to search for informations about a writer who has never written.', 'The story is about a woman who is going to Trieste (a city in Italy) to search for informations about a writer who has never written.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1kMTmd5olhSwFDErEBAM7HGVzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125848'),
