  ('445634451326517813', 'Winchester ''73', 1950, 'Western', 'Anthony Mann, William H. Daniels, Jesse Hibbs', 'Borden Chase, Robert L. Richards', 'James Stewart, Shelley Winters, Dan Duryea, Stephen McNally, Millard Mitchell, Charles Drake, John McIntire, Will Geer', null, 'Lin McAdam rides into town on the trail of Dutch Henry Brown, only to find himself in a shooting competition against him. McAdam wins the prize, a one-in-a-thousand Winchester rifle, but Dutch steals it and leaves town. McAdam follows, intent on settling his old quarrel, while the rifle keeps changing hands and touching a number of lives.', 'Lin McAdam rides into town on the trail of Dutch Henry Brown, only to find himself in a shooting competition against him. McAdam wins the prize, a one-in-a-thousand Winchester rifle, but Dutch steals it and leaves town. McAdam follows, intent on settling his old quarrel, while the rifle keeps changing hands and touching a number of lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqRgjWqSmK9oI6duvigPmn49aVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14551'),
  ('899318341095035228', 'Wind', 1988, 'Animation', 'Robert Sahakyants, Alice Kyurdyan', 'Robert Sahakyants, Grigor Danielyan', null, null, 'Anti-nuclear cartoon about a soldier at a nuclear test site. Among other things, the mutating effect of radiation is shown in a bizarre form.', 'Anti-nuclear cartoon about a soldier at a nuclear test site. Among other things, the mutating effect of radiation is shown in a bizarre form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVn1UNDtMk7Ruldsy2ogyesmAXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462186'),
  ('283585438604033003', 'Wind', 1992, 'Action, Drama', 'Carroll Ballard, John Toll', 'Rudy Wurlitzer, Mac Gudgeon', 'Matthew Modine, Jennifer Grey, Cliff Robertson, Jack Thompson, Stellan Skarsgård, Rebecca Miller, James Rebhorn, Ned Vaughn', 'PG-13', 'In 1983, yacht sailor Will Parker leads an American crew financed by millionaire Morgan Weld to defeat during the America''s Cup race against an Australian crew. Determined to get the prize back, Will convinces Morgan to finance an experimental boat designed by his ex-girlfriend Kate''s new beau, Joe Heisler. When the boat is completed, the Americans head to Australia to reclaim the cup.', 'In 1983, yacht sailor Will Parker leads an American crew financed by millionaire Morgan Weld to defeat during the America''s Cup race against an Australian crew. Determined to get the prize back, Will convinces Morgan to finance an experimental boat designed by his ex-girlfriend Kate''s new beau, Joe Heisler. When the boat is completed, the Americans head to Australia to reclaim the cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qj7RAiqrLVp3TCzDnhQlONm9In4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28881'),
  ('410406082325085774', 'Wind', 1996, 'Drama', 'Marcell Iványi, Zsolt Haraszti, Imre Juhász', 'Marcell Iványi', 'Szilvia Czobor, Ilona Somogyi, Margit Gyovai', null, 'During a film course lead by Yvette Biro at the Hungarian Academy of Drama and film in 1995, the director students were shown a black-and-white photo taken by Lucien Herve in 1952, and they were given the task of writing a short film based on it. Three women are standing at the outskirts of a village, looking out of the picture in the same direction. This six-minute one-shot film shows what the Herve photo does not.', 'During a film course lead by Yvette Biro at the Hungarian Academy of Drama and film in 1995, the director students were shown a black-and-white photo taken by Lucien Herve in 1952, and they were given the task of writing a short film based on it. Three women are standing at the outskirts of a village, looking out of the picture in the same direction. This six-minute one-shot film shows what the Herve photo does not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQiVFNlgOmXQDHA4vK1316Vkhnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247436'),
  ('482595377553788614', 'Wind', 2018, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Serkan Acar', 'Volkan Girgin', 'Belçim Bilgin, Halil Sezai Paracıkoğlu, Ata Berk Mutlu, Nebil Sayın, Cezmi Baskın, Hülya Duyar, Seymen Aydın, Altuğ Yücel', null, 'At the age of 35, Ece is the assistant general manager of a company that produces baby diapers. She has a happy relationship with her lover Alper. Because Ece resists Alper’s desire to have a child, they cannot get married. At this moment, the 10-year-old Rüzgar, a snatching gang member, unexpectedly enters their lives and changes everything. After that, their journey on becoming a family evolves. They bring down a street gang, take control of their lives and manage to become a big family.', 'At the age of 35, Ece is the assistant general manager of a company that produces baby diapers. She has a happy relationship with her lover Alper. Because Ece resists Alper’s desire to have a child, they cannot get married. At this moment, the 10-year-old Rüzgar, a snatching gang member, unexpectedly enters their lives and changes everything. After that, their journey on becoming a family evolves. They bring down a street gang, take control of their lives and manage to become a big family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhXlJeEpcXxxYvzIWihNO7qha6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511586'),
  ('852268926610869144', 'Wind', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Drama, Adventure', 'Edwin Chang, Robert Kinkead, Scott Clifford', 'Edwin Chang', 'Emilio Fuentes, Sonoko Konishi', 'G', 'Set in a world of magical realism, "Wind" sees a grandmother and her grandson trapped down an endless chasm, scavenging debris that surrounds them to realize their dream of escaping to a better life.', 'Set in a world of magical realism, "Wind" sees a grandmother and her grandson trapped down an endless chasm, scavenging debris that surrounds them to realize their dream of escaping to a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCQOiAWjXmRPlktXFEu4vt22Kz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574091'),
  ('337405607579859575', 'Wind Across the Everglades', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, Charles H. Maguire, Joseph C. Brun', 'Budd Schulberg', 'Burl Ives, Christopher Plummer, Chana Eden, Gypsy Rose Lee, Tony Galento, Sammy Renick, Pat Henning, Peter Falk', 'NR', 'Set in the early 20th century, the film follows a game warden who arrives in Florida to enforce conservation laws. He soon finds himself pitted against Cottonmouth, the leader of a fierce group of bird poachers.', 'Set in the early 20th century, the film follows a game warden who arrives in Florida to enforce conservation laws. He soon finds himself pitted against Cottonmouth, the leader of a fierce group of bird poachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuRd5ZzKERVlm9M2aiVxhng4tmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80555'),
  ('776417531193357266', 'Wind Blast', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Western', 'Du Jie, Gao Qunshu', 'Gao Qunshu', 'Duan Yihong, Ni Dahong, Wu Jing, Zhang Li, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Yu Nan, Xia Yu, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei', null, 'Zhang Ning, a hitman and underground boxer fleeing through the Gobi with his pregnant girlfriend, Sun Jing. Several nemeses are hot on their trail, including a pair of ruthless assassins and a cadre of lawmen.', 'Zhang Ning, a hitman and underground boxer fleeing through the Gobi with his pregnant girlfriend, Sun Jing. Several nemeses are hot on their trail, including a pair of ruthless assassins and a cadre of lawmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGCQT2PhWpEVMizrgNKrbysSe7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50005'),
  ('461483107017268190', 'Wind Chill', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Gregory Jacobs, Dan Laustsen, Trey Batchelor', 'Joe Gangemi, Steven Katz', 'Emily Blunt, Ashton Holmes, Martin Donovan, Ned Bellamy, Ian A. Wallace, Donny Lucas, Chelan Simmons, Darren Moore', 'R', 'Two college students share a ride home for the holidays. When they break down on a deserted stretch of road, they''re preyed upon by the ghosts of people who have died there.', 'Two college students share a ride home for the holidays. When they break down on a deserted stretch of road, they''re preyed upon by the ghosts of people who have died there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCHJNA3ZhfwmbMARfj0XqwYI0hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14223'),
  ('225511297878710242', 'Wind from the East', 1970, 'Drama, Western', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Pierre Gorin, Gérard Martin', 'Sergio Bazzini, Jean-Luc Godard, Daniel Cohn-Bendit', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Anne Wiazemsky, Cristiana Tullio-Altan, Allen Midgette, José Varela, Paolo Pozzesi, Götz George, Glauber Rocha', null, 'A politically oriented film in which images suggestive of a mock western are accompanied by an attack on all cinematic conventions to date and a debate on the nature and possibility of revolutionary cinema.', 'A politically oriented film in which images suggestive of a mock western are accompanied by an attack on all cinematic conventions to date and a debate on the nature and possibility of revolutionary cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPVceLwjuB3bo1DkCI3ASJUI78H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113629'),
  ('937150772536636169', 'Wind River', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Taylor Sheridan, Ben Richardson, Eric Dvorsky', 'Taylor Sheridan', 'Jeremy Renner, Elizabeth Olsen, Gil Birmingham, Graham Greene, Jon Bernthal, Kelsey Asbille, Teo Briones, Tantoo Cardinal', 'R', 'An FBI agent teams with the town''s veteran game tracker to investigate a murder that occurred on a Native American reservation.', 'An FBI agent teams with the town''s veteran game tracker to investigate a murder that occurred on a Native American reservation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pySivdR845Hom4u4T2WNkJxe6Ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395834'),
  ('589427377139816105', 'Wind Vane', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Chris Welsby', null, null, null, 'Two cameras mounted on tripods with wind vane attachments were positioned about 50 feet apart along an axis of 45 degrees to the direction of the wind. Both cameras were free to pan through 360 degrees in the horizontal plane. There are three continuous 100 foot takes for each screen. The movements of the two cameras, which were filming simultaneously, were controlled by the wind strength and direction.', 'Two cameras mounted on tripods with wind vane attachments were positioned about 50 feet apart along an axis of 45 degrees to the direction of the wind. Both cameras were free to pan through 360 degrees in the horizontal plane. There are three continuous 100 foot takes for each screen. The movements of the two cameras, which were filming simultaneously, were controlled by the wind strength and direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1g9ZbnuREGyvWUYWvmYrzYNASm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357866'),
  ('588086067366581945', 'Wind with the Gone', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Agresti, Mauricio Rubinstein, Daniel Rosenfeld', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Vera Fogwill, Fabián Vena, Ángela Molina, Jean Rochefort, Ulises Dumont, Carlos Roffé, Sergio Poves Campos, Mario Paolucci', null, 'Soledad, a girl tired of being a taxi driver in Buenos Aires, travels with her car to Patagonia. She stops in a village whose inhabitants live in isolation and their only contact with the outside world is a cinema where old films are projected.', 'Soledad, a girl tired of being a taxi driver in Buenos Aires, travels with her car to Patagonia. She stops in a village whose inhabitants live in isolation and their only contact with the outside world is a cinema where old films are projected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g45f8kJ8YKN5r1PWOz5rc1kCNnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56949'),
  ('584455452876937578', 'Windaria', 1986, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Mutsumi Inomata, Noriyoshi Matsuura', 'Keisuke Fujikawa', 'Toru Furuya, Naoko Matsui, Kazuhiko Inoue, Waka Kanda, Gara Takashima, Sho Saito, Kan Tokumaru, Rihoko Yoshida', null, 'In a land filled with magic and mystery, two rival kingdoms are readying for war: Isa, the beautiful water-laden city, and Paro, the industrialized wasteland. Windaria follows the tale of two sets of lovers: Marin and Izu, a young pair of farmers who are devoted to one another, and Ahanas and Jill, princess and prince of the rival kingdoms. With war approaching, these star-crossed lovers will experience the true depth of tragedy as they struggle to survive.', 'In a land filled with magic and mystery, two rival kingdoms are readying for war: Isa, the beautiful water-laden city, and Paro, the industrialized wasteland. Windaria follows the tale of two sets of lovers: Marin and Izu, a young pair of farmers who are devoted to one another, and Ahanas and Jill, princess and prince of the rival kingdoms. With war approaching, these star-crossed lovers will experience the true depth of tragedy as they struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjvAyAaUetO8Gur7c6N6XD6TP1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52439'),
  ('1123668693930265623', 'Windbag the Sailor', 1936, 'Comedy', 'William Beaudine', 'Robert Stevenson, Leslie Arliss', 'Will Hay, Moore Marriott, Graham Moffatt, Norma Varden, Kenneth Warrington, Dennis Wyndham, Amy Veness, Peter Gawthorne', null, 'Will Hay plays a bragging sea captain whose maritime experience actually extends to navigating a coal barge down inland waterways. His tall tales catch him out when he is co-erced into commanding an unseaworthy ship by an unscrupulous shipping agent who means to have it wrecked. This was the first film to couple Will Hay with both Moore Marriott and Graham Moffatt.', 'Will Hay plays a bragging sea captain whose maritime experience actually extends to navigating a coal barge down inland waterways. His tall tales catch him out when he is co-erced into commanding an unseaworthy ship by an unscrupulous shipping agent who means to have it wrecked. This was the first film to couple Will Hay with both Moore Marriott and Graham Moffatt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZOiy2qoLhrOwYu57zIOITEFCgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110457'),
  ('550070107779103702', 'Windfall', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Memduh Ün', 'Orhan Aksoy, Orhan Kemal', 'Kemal Sunal, Serpil Çakmaklı, Mehtap Ar, Hüseyin Kutman, Reha Yurdakul, Bülent Kayabaş, Yadigar Ejder, Merih Fırat', null, 'This is one of the tragicomic films of Kemal Sunal who is most "serious-comic" artist of the Turkish cinema. This film also reflects socio-economic and cultural life of the 70''s-80''s Turkiye. The film obviously talk to Turkish audience but who wonder that era of Turkiye can taste of it. The film underlines of love, friendship and -richness in the poorness- and also is a story about the people who prefers love, instead of money and fortune. The theme and narration may include some populist elements -like most Kemal Sunal films- but generally tells its story as well. The story is familiar to Turkish audience: A young man loves young girl. In most Turkish love films one of the partners is rich or poor according to the other but in this movie both sides are poor and they have many difficulties to reach happy end. In my opinion, these kind of movies always gives hope to people to get over it.', 'This is one of the tragicomic films of Kemal Sunal who is most "serious-comic" artist of the Turkish cinema. This film also reflects socio-economic and cultural life of the 70''s-80''s Turkiye. The film obviously talk to Turkish audience but who wonder that era of Turkiye can taste of it. The film underlines of love, friendship and -richness in the poorness- and also is a story about the people who prefers love, instead of money and fortune. The theme and narration may include some populist elements -like most Kemal Sunal films- but generally tells its story as well. The story is familiar to Turkish audience: A young man loves young girl. In most Turkish love films one of the partners is rich or poor according to the other but in this movie both sides are poor and they have many difficulties to reach happy end. In my opinion, these kind of movies always gives hope to people to get over it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7fgxTJRYUJdb4orEOBX35IiKsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126986'),
  ('33369396738729433', 'Windfall', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Isiah Donté Lee, Ben Kahn, Colin O’Rourke', 'Andrew Kevin Walker, Justin Lader', 'Jason Segel, Lily Collins, Jesse Plemons, Omar Leyva', 'R', 'In an opulent vacation home, a mysterious intruder is forced to kidnap the property owners -- a wealthy CEO and his wife -- when they arrive unexpectedly.', 'In an opulent vacation home, a mysterious intruder is forced to kidnap the property owners -- a wealthy CEO and his wife -- when they arrive unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njBc0nNdl9QbsfMwyRqJkmW4NQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850018'),
  ('686544877790739076', 'Windfall in Athens', 1954, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Alevise Orfanelli, Anis Nohra', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Ellie Lambeti, Dimitris Horn, Giorgos Pappas, Tasso Kavadia, Margarita Papageorgiou, Sapfo Notara, Theano Ioannidou, Hrysoula Pateraki', null, 'On a lazy Athenian Sunday, a young and fresh saleswoman loses her soon-to-be winning lottery ticket, only to meet its handsome new owner. Of course, she wants it back; however, what if fortune and ardent Cupid are already on her doorstep?', 'On a lazy Athenian Sunday, a young and fresh saleswoman loses her soon-to-be winning lottery ticket, only to meet its handsome new owner. Of course, she wants it back; however, what if fortune and ardent Cupid are already on her doorstep?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8otMrScgF8i2CSyWEEBB2PBYv6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199440'),
  ('467764243517004090', 'Windjammer: The Voyage of the Christian Radich', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Bill Colleran, Louis De Rochemont', null, 'Bjørn Amvik, Arne Andersen, Per Antonsen, Niels Arntsen, Pablo Casals, Arild Kristo', null, 'Windjammer, the first presentation in CINEMIRACLE, is the record of a training cruise of the full-rigged S/S Christian Radich from Oslo across the Atlantic, through the Caribbean, to New York and back home again.', 'Windjammer, the first presentation in CINEMIRACLE, is the record of a training cruise of the full-rigged S/S Christian Radich from Oslo across the Atlantic, through the Caribbean, to New York and back home again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtkgxgJw5LPAyKJzAkXV3ozfpA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134310'),
  ('1023986094812819335', 'Windom''s Way', 1957, 'Drama', 'Ronald Neame, Christopher Challis', 'Jill Craigie', 'Peter Finch, Mary Ure, Natasha Parry, Robert Flemyng, Michael Hordern, Grégoire Aslan, John Cairney, Marne Maitland', null, 'A doctor''s sophisticated wife joins him at his remote Asian practice to try and patch up their marriage. Increasingly violent friction between local rubber plantation workers and the authorities force both parties to make decisions.', 'A doctor''s sophisticated wife joins him at his remote Asian practice to try and patch up their marriage. Increasingly violent friction between local rubber plantation workers and the authorities force both parties to make decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7bm20vAZJaskQdSFHwMK24xZWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268554'),
  ('86224331384866507', 'Window Cleaners', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Donald is washing windows on a high-rise; Pluto is his assistant, hauling the rope for the platform and refilling buckets but mostly sleeping. And when things are finally going well, Donald makes the mistake of tormenting a bee.', 'Donald is washing windows on a high-rise; Pluto is his assistant, hauling the rope for the platform and refilling buckets but mostly sleeping. And when things are finally going well, Donald makes the mistake of tormenting a bee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arkOt0ekaLQlxpepzkUhrMebADx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99968'),
  ('1045060282571195972', 'Window to Paris', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Yuri Mamin, Leonid Gavrichenko, Bernard Cassus-Soulanis', 'Arkadiy Tigay, Vladimir Vardunas, Feliks Mironer', 'Agnès Soral, Sergey Dreyden, Viktor Mikhaylov, Nina Usatova, Kira Krejlis-Petrova, Natalya Ipatova, Viktor Gogolev, Tamara Timofeeva', 'PG-13', 'Nikolai (played by Sergei Dontsov) has been fired from his job as a music teacher and has to live in the gym until he finds a place to stay. Finally, he gets a communal room in the apartment of Gorokhov (Victor Mikhalkov). The room''s previous inhabitant, an old lady, has died a year ago, and yet her cat, Maxi, is still in the locked room, healthy and fat. Soon, Nikolai and his neighbours discover the mystery: there is a window to Paris in the room. That''s when the comedy begins - will the Russians be able to cope with the temptation to profit from the discovery?', 'Nikolai (played by Sergei Dontsov) has been fired from his job as a music teacher and has to live in the gym until he finds a place to stay. Finally, he gets a communal room in the apartment of Gorokhov (Victor Mikhalkov). The room''s previous inhabitant, an old lady, has died a year ago, and yet her cat, Maxi, is still in the locked room, healthy and fat. Soon, Nikolai and his neighbours discover the mystery: there is a window to Paris in the room. That''s when the comedy begins - will the Russians be able to cope with the temptation to profit from the discovery?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8WmmNqcX3MLGdXYsBBs0QxBmxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41043'),
  ('883937798082753265', 'Window to the Sea', 2020, 'Drama', 'Miguel Ángel Jiménez, Gorka Gómez Andreu', 'Luis Gamboa, Luis Moya, Miguel Ángel Jiménez', 'Emma Suárez, Akilas Karazisis, Gaizka Ugarte, Katerina Zafeiropoulou, Antonis Kafetzopoulos', null, 'Faced with life changing news, María, a fifty-five-year-old Spanish woman from Bilbao, chooses to take a trip to Greece with her closest girlfriends against the advice of her son and doctors. A spontaneous decision leads her to the island of Nisyros, a tiny haven of peace and calm that immediately feels like home. While exploring the beautiful island and soaking in its hidden treasures, she meets Stefanos and finds herself falling in love against all odds.', 'Faced with life changing news, María, a fifty-five-year-old Spanish woman from Bilbao, chooses to take a trip to Greece with her closest girlfriends against the advice of her son and doctors. A spontaneous decision leads her to the island of Nisyros, a tiny haven of peace and calm that immediately feels like home. While exploring the beautiful island and soaking in its hidden treasures, she meets Stefanos and finds herself falling in love against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WMMlxxZwDJCeuihCSRY0yOMd41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635366'),
  ('218048136288698253', 'Window Water Baby Moving', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage, Stan Brakhage', null, 'Jane Wodening, Myrrena Brakhage, Stan Brakhage', null, 'On a winter''s day, a woman stretches near a window then sits in a bathtub of water. She''s happy. Her lover is nearby; there are close ups of her face, her pregnant belly, and his hands caressing her. She gives birth: we see the crowning of the baby''s head, then the birth itself; we watch a pair of hands tie off and cut the umbilical cord. With the help of the attending hands, the mother expels the placenta. The infant, a baby girl, nurses. We return from time to time to the bath scene. By the end, dad''s excited; mother and daughter rest. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'On a winter''s day, a woman stretches near a window then sits in a bathtub of water. She''s happy. Her lover is nearby; there are close ups of her face, her pregnant belly, and his hands caressing her. She gives birth: we see the crowning of the baby''s head, then the birth itself; we watch a pair of hands tie off and cut the umbilical cord. With the help of the attending hands, the mother expels the placenta. The infant, a baby girl, nurses. We return from time to time to the bath scene. By the end, dad''s excited; mother and daughter rest. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDGJ3vy1WIBCKfZkeqpBYu0Ava4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97513'),
  ('1098362519914460315', 'Window Wonderland', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Michael M. Scott', 'Tippi Dobrofsky, Neal H. Dobrofsky', 'Chyler Leigh, Paul Campbell, Naomi Judd, Cameron Mathison, Matty Finochio, Eric Keenleyside, Terence Kelly, Christie Laing', 'G', 'With the Christmas season fast approaching, department store window decorator Sloan Van Doren is hoping to take over the recently-vacated head window designer spot but finds she has to prove herself by going up against rival Jake Dooley. As the two compete they find they may have more in common than they think. Stars Chyler Leigh and Naomi Judd.', 'With the Christmas season fast approaching, department store window decorator Sloan Van Doren is hoping to take over the recently-vacated head window designer spot but finds she has to prove herself by going up against rival Jake Dooley. As the two compete they find they may have more in common than they think. Stars Chyler Leigh and Naomi Judd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3zHaTJZPYr2AI4lOWY6uDLMPcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239180'),
  ('275180252149960378', 'Windows', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', null, 'A sort of documentary on the people known to have fallen out of windows in a certain time frame in a certain geographical location. One of Greenaway''s early short films.', 'A sort of documentary on the people known to have fallen out of windows in a certain time frame in a certain geographical location. One of Greenaway''s early short films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zX3T5wQoAVHxRMEnHD4p0uLRtMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219827'),
  ('675815848877315327', 'Windows', 1980, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Willis, Gordon Willis', 'Barry Siegel', 'Talia Shire, Elizabeth Ashley, Joe Cortese, Kay Medford, Michael Gorrin, Russell Horton, Michael Lipton, Rick Petrucelli', 'R', 'Emily Hollander becomes the subject of a lesbian obsession at the hands of Andrea Glassen, her next-door neighbour.', 'Emily Hollander becomes the subject of a lesbian obsession at the hands of Andrea Glassen, her next-door neighbour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4xaABkDbVOJRb1xllsfN3z2CPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83857'),
  ('55886418403563588', 'Windows on Monday', 2006, 'Drama', 'Patrick Orth, Ulrich Köhler', 'Ulrich Köhler', 'Isabelle Menke, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Amber Bongard, Elisa Seydel, Sülke Pierach, Ilie Năstase, Ingo Haeb, Hartmut Becker', null, 'A new house in a new town could mean the beginning of a phase of domestic bliss for a small family. Nina, a doctor, has taken a few days off. Her husband Frieder is busy laying tiles, while their daughter Charlotte plays in her new room. But Nina is having her doubts; she stands about in the half-empty rooms, feeling thoroughly alienated. Suddenly, without saying a word, she decides to leave...', 'A new house in a new town could mean the beginning of a phase of domestic bliss for a small family. Nina, a doctor, has taken a few days off. Her husband Frieder is busy laying tiles, while their daughter Charlotte plays in her new room. But Nina is having her doubts; she stands about in the half-empty rooms, feeling thoroughly alienated. Suddenly, without saying a word, she decides to leave...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WUyva0MFPVd1fah15lbXDKHyXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4979'),
  ('1022323530040252167', 'Windrider', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincent Monton, Joseph Pickering, Steve Jodrell', 'Everett De Roche', 'Simon Chilvers, Tom Burlinson, Nicole Kidman, Jill Perryman, Charles Tingwell, Kim Bullad, Stig Wemyss, Mark Williams', 'R', 'A rock star falls for a rich man''s son who competitively board-sails the coast of Western Australia.', 'A rock star falls for a rich man''s son who competitively board-sails the coast of Western Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f32RwGkQll2nncXo06UNUCajuF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135663'),
  ('150840747704227040', 'Winds of Havana', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Félix Viscarret', 'Lucia Lopez Coll, Félix Viscarret', 'Juana Acosta, Jorge Perugorría, Mariam Hernández, Yoima Valdés, Pilar Mayo, Pilar Mayo, Laura Ramos, Carlos Enrique Almirante', null, 'The killing of a fiery young teacher sets Detective Mario Conde on the trail of a drug kingpin with ties to the high school he once attended.', 'The killing of a fiery young teacher sets Detective Mario Conde on the trail of a drug kingpin with ties to the high school he once attended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twyIGnGPYgoJd4qpHIDLGnrPxmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403662'),
  ('1149355483738013026', 'Winds of September', 2008, 'Drama', 'Tom Lin, Yu Jing-pin', 'Tom Lin, Henry Tsai', 'Rhydian Vaughan, Chieh Chang, Jennifer Chia-Ching Chu, Edison Wang, Chi-Tai Lin, Nelson Shen, Chris Chiu, Teresa Daley', null, 'Lin Shu-Yu''s semi auto-biographical debut takes us back to 1996, during the time of the tragic Taiwan baseball scandal, an event that devastated many teenage boys. The story follows Yen and Tang and their gang through the last year of their high school life. From chasing girls to midnight skinny dipping to rooting for their favorite baseball team, they do everything together. When an accident throws Yen into a coma, their world starts falling apart.', 'Lin Shu-Yu''s semi auto-biographical debut takes us back to 1996, during the time of the tragic Taiwan baseball scandal, an event that devastated many teenage boys. The story follows Yen and Tang and their gang through the last year of their high school life. From chasing girls to midnight skinny dipping to rooting for their favorite baseball team, they do everything together. When an accident throws Yen into a coma, their world starts falling apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3UylNbyqwOnkBO7IQYLqzRhdN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77411'),
  ('1012229994561442062', 'Winds of the Wasteland', 1936, 'Western', 'Mack V. Wright, William Nobles', 'Joseph F. Poland', 'John Wayne, Phyllis Fraser, Lew Kelly, Douglas Cosgrove, Lane Chandler, Sam Flint, Bob Kortman, Ed Cassidy', 'NR', 'The arrival of the telegraph put Pony Express riders like John Blair and his pal Smoky out of work. A race will decide whether they or stageline owner Drake get the government mail contract.', 'The arrival of the telegraph put Pony Express riders like John Blair and his pal Smoky out of work. A race will decide whether they or stageline owner Drake get the government mail contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD0v5nxEoiRG3hwyL9OulUjNcBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40743'),
  ('1149408362900288925', 'Windstorm', 2013, 'Adventure, Family', 'Katja von Garnier, Torsten Breuer', 'Kristina Magdalena Henn, Lea Schmidbauer', 'Hanna Binke, Marvin Linke, Cornelia Froboess, Tilo Prückner, Nina Kronjäger, Jürgen Vogel, Detlev Buck, Marla Menn', 'NR', 'While spending the summer at her grandmother''s farm, a girl discovers a talent for communicating with horses and tries to tame a fierce stallion.', 'While spending the summer at her grandmother''s farm, a girl discovers a talent for communicating with horses and tries to tame a fierce stallion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrc77L0reVIgrQzIWLMZg9gMYR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233639'),
  ('1003184395128251159', 'Windstorm 2', 2015, 'Family, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Torsten Breuer, Katja von Garnier', 'Lea Schmidbauer, Kristina Magdalena Henn', 'Hanna Binke, Jannis Niewöhner, Amber Bongard, Marvin Linke, Kenzie Dysli, Cornelia Froboess, Nina Kronjäger, Tilo Prückner', null, 'Summer vacation. Mika is overjoyed to see Windstorm again. But then she discovers strange wounds on the belly of Windstorm, for which no one has an explanation. Yet this is Kaltenbach verge of bankruptcy! With a heavy heart Mika decides to participate in a variety tournament in which beckons a high prize money. But during training affects Windstorm distracted, often he runs away easily. Mika pursued the black stallion until deep into the forest and is quite surprised: From the thicket a seemingly magical gray mare appears and the two horses dance around lovingly. Suddenly, a strange boy named Milan appears, who says the mare had escaped him. He claimed that he could Help Mika to win the tournament. But is there still time to save Kaltenbach?', 'Summer vacation. Mika is overjoyed to see Windstorm again. But then she discovers strange wounds on the belly of Windstorm, for which no one has an explanation. Yet this is Kaltenbach verge of bankruptcy! With a heavy heart Mika decides to participate in a variety tournament in which beckons a high prize money. But during training affects Windstorm distracted, often he runs away easily. Mika pursued the black stallion until deep into the forest and is quite surprised: From the thicket a seemingly magical gray mare appears and the two horses dance around lovingly. Suddenly, a strange boy named Milan appears, who says the mare had escaped him. He claimed that he could Help Mika to win the tournament. But is there still time to save Kaltenbach?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OBjiVZwjGlYDMG5bGmtJkdpr6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334354'),
  ('1021906052353827152', 'Windstorm 3', 2017, 'Family, Adventure', 'Florian Emmerich, Katja von Garnier', 'Lea Schmidbauer', 'Hanna Binke, Lea van Acken, Amber Bongard, Marvin Linke, Nicolette Krebitz, Thomas Sarbacher, Jannis Niewöhner, Tilo Prückner', null, 'Ostwind and Mika have found a real home at the farm Kaltenbach with Mika''s grandmother. In the hustle of running therapy center and due to Mika''s fame as a horse-whisperer, she feels that she doesn''t have enough freedom and time to ride. After a serious disagreement with her grandmother, Mika secretly sets off for the night in eastern Andalusia, Spain, where she suspects Ostwind''s roots are.', 'Ostwind and Mika have found a real home at the farm Kaltenbach with Mika''s grandmother. In the hustle of running therapy center and due to Mika''s fame as a horse-whisperer, she feels that she doesn''t have enough freedom and time to ride. After a serious disagreement with her grandmother, Mika secretly sets off for the night in eastern Andalusia, Spain, where she suspects Ostwind''s roots are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUM4l9LelUzrGaSkZdd1OKdWmOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422766'),
  ('844917402882691394', 'Windstorm 4', 2019, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Florian Emmerich, Theresa von Eltz', 'Lea Schmidbauer', 'Luna Paiano, Hanna Binke, Marvin Linke, Amber Bongard, Tilo Prückner, Cornelia Froboess, Lili Epply, Sabin Tambrea', null, 'Grandmother Maria, Sam and the riding instructor Kaan are trying together to keep Gut Kaltenbach running, which is in financial difficulties. The ambitious Isabell supports her, although she secretly pursues her own goals. The impulsive Ari comes to riding training in Kaltenbach, where she develops a special relationship with Windstorm, the eponymous horse of the film series, and she also makes friends with Mika. Mika and Ari try to save the estate and protect Windstorm from reckless horse trainer Thordur Thorvaldson.', 'Grandmother Maria, Sam and the riding instructor Kaan are trying together to keep Gut Kaltenbach running, which is in financial difficulties. The ambitious Isabell supports her, although she secretly pursues her own goals. The impulsive Ari comes to riding training in Kaltenbach, where she develops a special relationship with Windstorm, the eponymous horse of the film series, and she also makes friends with Mika. Mika and Ari try to save the estate and protect Windstorm from reckless horse trainer Thordur Thorvaldson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JNrBpYN7WksXUHUg0akV7XMgGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550755'),
  ('831336679045067006', 'Windstorm: The Great Hurricane', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Florian Emmerich, Lea Schmidbauer', 'Lea Schmidbauer', 'Luna Paiano, Hanna Binke, Marvin Linke, Amber Bongard, Tilo Prückner, Cornelia Froboess, Gedeon Burkhard, Matteo Miska', null, 'Due to the sudden outbreak of a hurricane, a traveling circus, famous for its stunning numbers with horses, calls into the small German estate of Kaltenbach. Soon, Ari realizes that one of the horses of this circus, named Orcan, is in mortal danger. Together with the boy Carlo and their faithful friend, the horse Ostwind, they try to save Orkan from the cruel owner of a traveling circus. However, the shrewd director unravels their audacious plan. And Ostwind''s horse is also in trouble. Ari and Carlo have very little time to rectify the situation and save Ostwind.', 'Due to the sudden outbreak of a hurricane, a traveling circus, famous for its stunning numbers with horses, calls into the small German estate of Kaltenbach. Soon, Ari realizes that one of the horses of this circus, named Orcan, is in mortal danger. Together with the boy Carlo and their faithful friend, the horse Ostwind, they try to save Orkan from the cruel owner of a traveling circus. However, the shrewd director unravels their audacious plan. And Ostwind''s horse is also in trouble. Ari and Carlo have very little time to rectify the situation and save Ostwind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8N8rHkDWzQRGiTKHoGbvDhwE4It.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680447'),
  ('447227218952863033', 'Windstruck', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Han-cheol Jeong, Kwak Jae-yong', null, 'Gianna Jun, Jang Hyuk, Kim Jung-tae, Kim Soo-ro, Lee Ki-woo, Kim Chang-wan, Jung Ho-bin, Im Ye-jin', null, 'Kyung-jin, a police officer who finds herself chasing down a suspected bag-snatcher on her day off. However, the man she catches turns out to be Myungwoo, a passer-by who was himself trying to apprehend the real criminal.', 'Kyung-jin, a police officer who finds herself chasing down a suspected bag-snatcher on her day off. However, the man she catches turns out to be Myungwoo, a passer-by who was himself trying to apprehend the real criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OyugG9zsjK4HT42yIcqXMXc2CR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10103'),
  ('657680698292375110', 'Windtalkers', 2002, 'War, Action', 'John Woo, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Joan Cunningham', 'John Rice, Joe Batteer', 'Nicolas Cage, Adam Beach, Peter Stormare, Noah Emmerich, Mark Ruffalo, Brian Van Holt, Martin Henderson, Roger Willie', 'R', 'Joe Enders is a gung-ho Marine assigned to protect a "windtalker" - one of several Navajo Indians who were used to relay messages during World War II because their spoken language was indecipherable to Japanese code breakers.', 'Joe Enders is a gung-ho Marine assigned to protect a "windtalker" - one of several Navajo Indians who were used to relay messages during World War II because their spoken language was indecipherable to Japanese code breakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/547q4HXlvEcS06lujfb2yzsTP3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12100'),
  ('690269306235814681', 'Windwalker', 1980, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Reed Smoot, Kieth Merrill', 'Blaine Yorgason, Ray Goldrup', 'Trevor Howard, Nick Ramus, James Remar, Serene Hedin, Dusty McCrea, Silvana Gallardo, Emerson John, Jason Stevens', 'PG', 'An ancient Indian warrior who has reached the end of his life is brought back from his ''death'' to save his family from a raiding party of enemy Indians in this unique story of ''Indians without a single cowboy.', 'An ancient Indian warrior who has reached the end of his life is brought back from his ''death'' to save his family from a raiding party of enemy Indians in this unique story of ''Indians without a single cowboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPbAGObhxzMRWMJdxGZVa6CleIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85548'),
  ('849935179139400175', 'Windy City Heat', 2003, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Brad Sellers, Jim Goldthwait', 'Tony Barbieri, Jimmy Kimmel, Don Barris', 'Perry Caravello, Don Barris, Tony Barbieri, Bobcat Goldthwait, Dane Cook, Jimmy Kimmel, Adam Carolla, William Perry', 'R', 'A man caught up in the glamor of being a Hollywood celebrity has no idea that the production he''s in is a fake.', 'A man caught up in the glamor of being a Hollywood celebrity has no idea that the production he''s in is a fake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAHkyMQbTufFk9P6f7Jv5BXaQCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47126'),
  ('1062911962592443625', 'Wine Country', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Amy Poehler, Tom Magill, Steve Day', 'Emily Spivey, Liz Cackowski', 'Amy Poehler, Maya Rudolph, Rachel Dratch, Ana Gasteyer, Paula Pell, Emily Spivey, Tina Fey, Jason Schwartzman', 'R', 'A group of friends head to the land of oaky Chardonnays and big, bold Cabernet Sauvignons for one member of the squad’s 50th birthday party.', 'A group of friends head to the land of oaky Chardonnays and big, bold Cabernet Sauvignons for one member of the squad’s 50th birthday party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi5l29DQFdwrTXxbqM2OLbs830H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513083'),
  ('948160723632669655', 'Wine to Love', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Domenico Fortunato, Federico Annicchiarico', 'Salvatore De Mola, Domenico Fortunato', 'Ornella Muti, Domenico Fortunato, Michele Venitucci, Alessandro Intini, Giulia Ramires, Caterina Shulha, Alessandro Tersigni, Marianna Robustelli', null, 'Laura Rush, director of a luxury New York wine shop, has launched a campaign to buy Italian wineries to unify under her brand. Things become tangled when beautiful Anna Monti, a former top model, arrives in Italy.', 'Laura Rush, director of a luxury New York wine shop, has launched a campaign to buy Italian wineries to unify under her brand. Things become tangled when beautiful Anna Monti, a former top model, arrives in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnNGIDMyrHCXklcL0s4EUu9eBDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568354'),
  ('772040835666121449', 'Wing and a Prayer', 1944, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Glen MacWilliams', 'Jerome Cady', 'Don Ameche, Dana Andrews, William Eythe, Charles Bickford, Cedric Hardwicke, Kevin O''Shea, Richard Jaeckel, Harry Morgan', 'PG', 'An aircraft carrier is sent on a decoy mission around the Pacific, with orders to avoid combat, thus lulling Japanese alertness before the battle of Midway.', 'An aircraft carrier is sent on a decoy mission around the Pacific, with orders to avoid combat, thus lulling Japanese alertness before the battle of Midway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHx4awWZOTyGLD2eWBkDj7yy6Z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69847'),
  ('43859389980951715', 'Wing Chun', 1994, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Donnie Yen', 'Anthony Wong Wing-Fai, Elsa Tang Bik-Yin', 'Michelle Yeoh, Donnie Yen, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Catherine Hung Yan, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Cheng Pei-Pei, Chui A-Fai', null, 'Martial arts expert Wing Chun battles bandits in this magical film that provides as many laughs as it does wallops. Besides horse thieves, Wing Chun must deal with the men around her who simply can''t handle a strong, independent woman. Ultimately, she must dish out "lessons" again and again and again until the respect for her remarkable skills is finally won.', 'Martial arts expert Wing Chun battles bandits in this magical film that provides as many laughs as it does wallops. Besides horse thieves, Wing Chun must deal with the men around her who simply can''t handle a strong, independent woman. Ultimately, she must dish out "lessons" again and again and again until the respect for her remarkable skills is finally won.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL8fYCzy3qPTvbp1Vf9bbvw0Yx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25645'),
  ('771329612966183125', 'Wing Commander', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Thierry Arbogast, Christopher Roberts, Charles Dwight Lee', 'Christopher Roberts', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Saffron Burrows, Matthew Lillard, Tchéky Karyo, Jürgen Prochnow, David Suchet, David Warner, Ginny Holder', 'PG-13', 'In the mid-27th century, the Terran Confederation is at war with the vicious alien Kilrathi Empire. When the Kilrathi capture a crucial navigational device that could lead them to Earth, the Confederation’s only hope rests with a small group of young fighter pilots. Lieutenant Christopher Blair, along with his wingman Todd ''Maniac'' Marshall and Commander Jeanette ''Angel'' Deveraux, must intercept the alien fleet and prevent the destruction of mankind. Battling overwhelming odds and racing against time, they face not only external threats but also inner fears and rivalries as they fight to save Earth from annihilation.', 'In the mid-27th century, the Terran Confederation is at war with the vicious alien Kilrathi Empire. When the Kilrathi capture a crucial navigational device that could lead them to Earth, the Confederation’s only hope rests with a small group of young fighter pilots. Lieutenant Christopher Blair, along with his wingman Todd ''Maniac'' Marshall and Commander Jeanette ''Angel'' Deveraux, must intercept the alien fleet and prevent the destruction of mankind. Battling overwhelming odds and racing against time, they face not only external threats but also inner fears and rivalries as they fight to save Earth from annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3p2vkA4mnFaBlyAIntkZWkzOJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10350'),
  ('449962725342292094', 'Winged Creatures', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rowan Woods, Katie Carroll, Donald Murphy', 'Roy Freirich', 'Kate Beckinsale, Forest Whitaker, Guy Pearce, Dakota Fanning, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Embeth Davidtz, Troy Garity, Josh Hutcherson', 'R', 'A psychotic man opens fire in a diner, murdering numerous people before killing himself. The survivors struggle in different ways following this horrendous event: a doctor doubts his own instincts and elects to use an experimental medical procedure on his wife, while a gambler believes he''s on a lucky streak. A waitress begins engaging in promiscuous sex, and a young girl whose father is among the dead gains unexpected fame.', 'A psychotic man opens fire in a diner, murdering numerous people before killing himself. The survivors struggle in different ways following this horrendous event: a doctor doubts his own instincts and elects to use an experimental medical procedure on his wife, while a gambler believes he''s on a lucky streak. A waitress begins engaging in promiscuous sex, and a young girl whose father is among the dead gains unexpected fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkKSPO5CuYogooyUzRlNckoJTkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16056'),
  ('823868155869215659', 'Winged Migration', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Jacques Perrin, Luc Drion, Bruno Coulais', 'Jean Dorst, Jacques Perrin, Valentine Marvel', 'Jacques Perrin, Philippe Labro', 'G', 'This documentary follows various migratory bird species on their long journeys from their summer homes to the equator and back, covering thousands of miles and navigating by the stars. These arduous treks are crucial for survival, seeking hospitable climates and food sources. Birds face numerous challenges, including crossing oceans and evading predators, illness, and injury. Although migrations are undertaken as a community, birds disperse into family units once they reach their destinations, and every continent is affected by these migrations, hosting migratory bird species at least part of the year.', 'This documentary follows various migratory bird species on their long journeys from their summer homes to the equator and back, covering thousands of miles and navigating by the stars. These arduous treks are crucial for survival, seeking hospitable climates and food sources. Birds face numerous challenges, including crossing oceans and evading predators, illness, and injury. Although migrations are undertaken as a community, birds disperse into family units once they reach their destinations, and every continent is affected by these migrations, hosting migratory bird species at least part of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjv7cYLSufwf03So0SuRFU7sRxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11516'),
  ('763304956892603217', 'Wingman 2', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Kari Ketonen, Alvi Pakarinen', 'Antti Luusuaniemi, Kari Ketonen, Lauri Nurkse', 'Maria Ylipää, Taneli Mäkelä, Ilkka Villi, Lasse Karkjärvi, Eden Pentikäinen', null, 'When Tommi''s father-in-law Johan is ordered to take a break after a medical emergency, the family decides to go on vacation to sunny Spain. Johan has one condition: he wants to take his car with him. Tommi agrees to drive Johan''s car to Spain – together with Juhis. However, things don''t go quite as planned, and when Johan''s car is stolen, Tommi and Juhis decide to take matters into their own hands, and soon our heroes are hurtling from one disaster to the next at breakneck speed.', 'When Tommi''s father-in-law Johan is ordered to take a break after a medical emergency, the family decides to go on vacation to sunny Spain. Johan has one condition: he wants to take his car with him. Tommi agrees to drive Johan''s car to Spain – together with Juhis. However, things don''t go quite as planned, and when Johan''s car is stolen, Tommi and Juhis decide to take matters into their own hands, and soon our heroes are hurtling from one disaster to the next at breakneck speed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2BBITyh7ooq0LlR4xGQz2cwgMo9.jpg', 'plex:movie:luottomies-elokuva-lepoloma'),
  ('796176527870322885', 'Wings', 1927, 'Drama, Action, War, Romance', 'Harry Perry, William A. Wellman', 'Hope Loring, Louis D. Lighton', 'Clara Bow, Charles ''Buddy'' Rogers, Richard Arlen, Jobyna Ralston, El Brendel, Richard Tucker, Gary Cooper, Gunboat Smith', 'PG-13', 'Two young men, one rich, one middle class, both in love with the same woman, become US Air Corps fighter pilots and, eventually, heroic flying aces during World War I. Devoted best friends, their mutual love of the girl eventually threatens their bond. Meanwhile, a hometown girl who''s the lovestruck lifelong next door neighbor of one of them pines away.', 'Two young men, one rich, one middle class, both in love with the same woman, become US Air Corps fighter pilots and, eventually, heroic flying aces during World War I. Devoted best friends, their mutual love of the girl eventually threatens their bond. Meanwhile, a hometown girl who''s the lovestruck lifelong next door neighbor of one of them pines away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEl6KCBgdmT1Nex3ka0EIWAOmtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28966'),
  ('379193285179844581', 'Wings', 1966, 'Drama', 'Larisa Shepitko, Igor Slabnevich, Olga Upenik', 'Valentin Ezhov, Natalya Ryazantseva', 'Maya Bulgakova, Zhanna Bolotova, Pantelejmon Krymov, Leonid Dyachkov, Vladimir Gorelov, Yuri Medvedev, Nikolay Grabbe, Zhanna Aleksandrova', null, 'Former fighter pilot turned provincial schoolmistress Nadezhda Petrovna struggles to adapt to peacetime, having internalised military ideals of service and obedience.', 'Former fighter pilot turned provincial schoolmistress Nadezhda Petrovna struggles to adapt to peacetime, having internalised military ideals of service and obedience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGWFjV5e86OJWxs8QYbwo9MHtyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50013'),
  ('770926712721352134', 'Wings in the Dark', 1935, 'Adventure, Romance', 'James Flood', 'Jack Kirkland, Frank Partos', 'Myrna Loy, Cary Grant, Roscoe Karns, Hobart Cavanaugh, Dean Jagger, Russell Hopton, Matt McHugh, Graham McNamee', 'NR', 'In his dedicated pursuit of technology that will aid pilots to safely "fly blind" during adverse conditions, aerial innovator Ken Gordon is literally blinded in an accident, but this setback doesn''t deter him from his goal.', 'In his dedicated pursuit of technology that will aid pilots to safely "fly blind" during adverse conditions, aerial innovator Ken Gordon is literally blinded in an accident, but this setback doesn''t deter him from his goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRE4KFogJ1Rs8yeSM5YU4Jpsi2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81115'),
  ('227029230655383138', 'Wings of a Serf', 1926, 'Drama, History', 'Yuri Tarich, Mikhail Vladimirsky, Leonid Leonidov', 'Yuri Tarich, Viktor Shklovskiy', 'Ivan Klyukvin, Leonid Leonidov, Safiyat Askarova, Vladimir Korsh, Nikolai Prozorovsky, Sofya Garrel, Aleksandr Zhukov, Lev Ivanov', null, 'This SovKino production was a major early experiment in Soviet historical film about the oprichnina period of Muscovite history, combining the costumed drama and Gothic thrills of the genre with historical materialist commentary on the dialectical collision of scientific progress and patriarchal religious tyranny under Tsar Ivan the Terrible. It follows a self-taught inventor from the serf class Nikishka, whose efforts to build a flying machine incite accusations of witchcraft. Nikishka and his beloved Fima are persecuted by the feudal lord Kurlyatev, who took their village in a petty land squabble. They’re rescued when Kurlyatev’s lands are taken by the Tsar in his autocratic campaign against the feudal system. Ivan puts Nikishka to work in his linen mill, where the young serf is coveted by Tsarina Maria Temryukovna, who the Tsar’s been ignoring in favor of his cupbearer Feodor. A series of harrowing intrigues wind a bloody dance through bedchamber, feast hall, cathedral and dungeon.', 'This SovKino production was a major early experiment in Soviet historical film about the oprichnina period of Muscovite history, combining the costumed drama and Gothic thrills of the genre with historical materialist commentary on the dialectical collision of scientific progress and patriarchal religious tyranny under Tsar Ivan the Terrible. It follows a self-taught inventor from the serf class Nikishka, whose efforts to build a flying machine incite accusations of witchcraft. Nikishka and his beloved Fima are persecuted by the feudal lord Kurlyatev, who took their village in a petty land squabble. They’re rescued when Kurlyatev’s lands are taken by the Tsar in his autocratic campaign against the feudal system. Ivan puts Nikishka to work in his linen mill, where the young serf is coveted by Tsarina Maria Temryukovna, who the Tsar’s been ignoring in favor of his cupbearer Feodor. A series of harrowing intrigues wind a bloody dance through bedchamber, feast hall, cathedral and dungeon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owVGwMQtsPyIvDEBeAw4ZXbICGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160661'),
  ('1004124532798450889', 'Wings of Courage', 1995, 'Romance, Adventure', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Robert Fraisse', 'Alain Godard, Jean-Jacques Annaud', 'Craig Sheffer, Elizabeth McGovern, Tom Hulce, Ken Pogue, Ron Sauvé, Val Kilmer, Freddy Andreiuci, Molly Parker', 'G', 'In 1930 South America, a small group of French pilots struggle to prove they can offer a reliable airmail service over the Andes. When one of the young pilots crashes on such a flight, he has to try and get back to civilization on foot. Back home, his wife and colleagues start to fear the worst.', 'In 1930 South America, a small group of French pilots struggle to prove they can offer a reliable airmail service over the Andes. When one of the young pilots crashes on such a flight, he has to try and get back to civilization on foot. Back home, his wife and colleagues start to fear the worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoxqNb6v55C35DDqNn03Grzhzgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78802'),
  ('1008606723149555218', 'Wings of Fame', 1990, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Otakar Votoček', 'Herman Koch, Otakar Votoček', 'Peter O''Toole, Colin Firth, Marie Trintignant, Andréa Ferréol, Robert Stephens, Ellen Umlauf, Maria Becker, Gottfried John', 'R', 'A famous movie actor claims that he has written a book. As result, a real author, not a very well known writer, vengefully kills him but then dies as a result of an accident. Next, they both find themselves in after-life, where souls of all famous people are gathered.', 'A famous movie actor claims that he has written a book. As result, a real author, not a very well known writer, vengefully kills him but then dies as a result of an accident. Next, they both find themselves in after-life, where souls of all famous people are gathered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hGYkShX2SrVmvsHsIIjNTa4XYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48198'),
  ('57997765861611535', 'Wings of Hope', 1999, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger, Herbert Golder', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Juliane Koepcke, Juan Zaplana Ramirez, Erich Diller', null, 'Werner Herzog returns to the South American jungle with Juliane Koepcke, the German woman who was the sole survivor of a plane crash there in 1971. They find the remains of the plane and recreate her journey out of the jungle.', 'Werner Herzog returns to the South American jungle with Juliane Koepcke, the German woman who was the sole survivor of a plane crash there in 1971. They find the remains of the plane and recreate her journey out of the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ru9fBYoWeovh7GdRJXQ4tyVMP4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99657'),
  ('182371178443122690', 'Wings of the Night', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Serdar Akar, Mustafa Kuşçu', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Ahmet Küçükkayalı', 'Beren Saat, Murat Ünalmış, Erkan Petekkaya, Yavuz Bingöl, Arif Erkin Güzelbeyoğlu, Cezmi Baskın, Alper Kul, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı', null, 'After losing her parents during a police raid at an early age, Grace is pledged to become a suicide bomber, but she falls in love.', 'After losing her parents during a police raid at an early age, Grace is pledged to become a suicide bomber, but she falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK4U3tZMe26UJsASPeWoUfOqBhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52183'),
  ('841625064248856016', 'Wings of Victory', 1941, 'Drama, War', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Semyon Derevyansky, Aleksandr Gintsburg', 'Georgi Bajdukov, Boris Chirskov, Dmitri Tarasov', 'Vladimir Belokurov, Mikheil Gelovani, Semyon Mezhinsky, Kseniya Tarasova, Vasili Vanin, Pyotr Beryozov, Boris Zhukovsky, Fyodor Bogdanov', null, 'Based on the true story of Russian pilot Valeri Chkalov (1904 - 1938), who set several long-distance flight records. Chkalov and co-pilots Baidukov and Belyakov altogether had accomplished several nonstop long-distance flights. In June 1937, Chkalov set the world record, covering 12,000 kilometers in 63 hours of nonstop flight from Moscow to Vancouver, Washington, flying over the North Pole.', 'Based on the true story of Russian pilot Valeri Chkalov (1904 - 1938), who set several long-distance flight records. Chkalov and co-pilots Baidukov and Belyakov altogether had accomplished several nonstop long-distance flights. In June 1937, Chkalov set the world record, covering 12,000 kilometers in 63 hours of nonstop flight from Moscow to Vancouver, Washington, flying over the North Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQdnce7UpKWIWOhGdenYvdmBU6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322840'),
  ('109733691674210097', 'Wings, Legs and Tails', 1986, 'Animation', 'Aleksandr Tatarskiy, Igor Kovalyov', 'Igor Kovalyov, Aleksandr Tatarskiy', 'Aleksandr Filippenko, Aleksey Ptitsyn', null, 'An ostrich is trying to learn how to fly in a dessert.', 'An ostrich is trying to learn how to fly in a dessert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70bijwOXQo7dv6syrEIIkgW3Yuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333372'),
  ('524989422358572463', 'Wingwomen', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Mélanie Laurent, Antoine Roch, Michaël Laguens', 'Cédric Anger, Chris Deslandes, Mélanie Laurent', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, Mélanie Laurent, Manon Bresch, Isabelle Adjani, Philippe Katerine, Félix Moati, Damien Zanoly, Olivier Kissita', 'R', 'Tired of life on the run, a pro thief decides to retire — but not before one easy last job with her partner in crime and a feisty new getaway driver.', 'Tired of life on the run, a pro thief decides to retire — but not before one easy last job with her partner in crime and a feisty new getaway driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atatNvrn7kBvkARD2YodyYkKicr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010928'),
  ('1093549560353287448', 'Winky''s Horse', 2005, 'Family', 'Mischa Kamp, Lennert Hillege', 'Tamara Bos', 'Ebbie Tam, Jan Decleir, Betty Schuurman, Aaron Wan, Hanyi Han, Mamoun Elyounoussi, Sallie Harmsen, Peter Bolhuis', null, 'There is only one thing Winky wants: a horse, a real horse to ride. But horses are expensive. Fortunately it is the season of Sinterklaas; Winky just asks Sinterklaas for a horse. Than everything will work out alright. Or will it?', 'There is only one thing Winky wants: a horse, a real horse to ride. But horses are expensive. Fortunately it is the season of Sinterklaas; Winky just asks Sinterklaas for a horse. Than everything will work out alright. Or will it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IyD83Zu4EghaURBXjY8bEuLqev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50730'),
  ('700842296021927470', 'Winnebago Man', 2010, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Ben Steinbauer, Berndt Mader, Bradley Beesley', 'Malcolm Pullinger, Ben Steinbauer', 'Jack Rebney, Ben Steinbauer, Nick Prueher, Joe Pickett, Douglas Rushkoff, Charlie Sotelo, Alan Berliner, Alexsey Vayner', 'NR', 'Jack Rebney is the most famous man you''ve never heard of - after cursing his way through a Winnebago sales video, Rebney''s outrageously funny outtakes became an underground sensation and made him an internet superstar. Filmmaker Ben Steinbauer journeys to the top of a mountain to find the recluse who unwittingly became the "Winnebago Man".', 'Jack Rebney is the most famous man you''ve never heard of - after cursing his way through a Winnebago sales video, Rebney''s outrageously funny outtakes became an underground sensation and made him an internet superstar. Filmmaker Ben Steinbauer journeys to the top of a mountain to find the recluse who unwittingly became the "Winnebago Man".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9XEQk8KY7cBxzC5xE2NCGMBhsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42918'),
  ('464379943318124502', 'Winner', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Reed Makayev, Susanna Fogel, Steve Yedlin', 'Kerry Howley, Susanna Fogel', 'Emilia Jones, Connie Britton, Zach Galifianakis, Danny Ramirez, Kathryn Newton, Leah Gibson, Averie Peters, Sam Duke', 'PG-13', 'Winner is a brilliant young misfit from Texas who finds her morals challenged while serving in the U.S. Air Force and working as an NSA contractor. A fresh take on the traditional whistleblower thriller, the coming-of-age story follows an idealistic young woman persecuted for standing by her principles.', 'Winner is a brilliant young misfit from Texas who finds her morals challenged while serving in the U.S. Air Force and working as an NSA contractor. A fresh take on the traditional whistleblower thriller, the coming-of-age story follows an idealistic young woman persecuted for standing by her principles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvTlXCh0XKukjsQtFGC4qtnO6Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039659'),
  ('535733818288340778', 'Winner Takes the Cake', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Santos', 'Carlos Santos', 'Giovanna Romo, Sergio Mayer, Liliana Arriaga, Yanet Garcia, Priscila Arias, Ricardo Peralta, Emmanuel Orenday, Alejandro de la Madrid', null, 'Sofía quits her job after confronting her misogynistic boss. Determined, she starts her own company to rival her former employer, igniting a David vs. Goliath showdown in the business world.', 'Sofía quits her job after confronting her misogynistic boss. Determined, she starts her own company to rival her former employer, igniting a David vs. Goliath showdown in the business world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obYQkGeTciQx3HNz8O78igbJjV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233620'),
  ('633991045525868130', 'Winners and Sinners', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Ricky Lau', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, John Shum Kin-Fun, Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Jackie Chan, Cecilia Yip Tung', null, 'Five friends are released from prison and do their best to stay out trouble. While trying to mind their own business (and run their 5-Star Cleaning Service), they are caught up in a war between rival Triad gangs fighting for control of the counterfeit currency market.', 'Five friends are released from prison and do their best to stay out trouble. While trying to mind their own business (and run their 5-Star Cleaning Service), they are caught up in a war between rival Triad gangs fighting for control of the counterfeit currency market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngFYme3fGnwkssHkPXZr3peI6iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25539'),
  ('979547114173813585', 'Winners Take All', 1987, 'Action, Adventure', 'Fritz Kiersch, Ernie F. Orsatti, Fred Murphy', 'Ed Turner', 'Don Michael Paul, Kathleen York, Robert Krantz, Deborah Richter, Peter DeLuise, Courtney Gains, Paul Hampton, Gerardo Mejía', 'PG-13', 'Billy Robinson has become the hottest hot-rodder on the professional motorcycle-racing circuit. But when he returns in triumph to his hometown to bask in all the adulation, he also skids into some pretty rank jealousy from envious motorcycling wanna-bes. And when a local race is organized, Billy must shift gears completely and compete against his best friend, Rick, for the top prize.', 'Billy Robinson has become the hottest hot-rodder on the professional motorcycle-racing circuit. But when he returns in triumph to his hometown to bask in all the adulation, he also skids into some pretty rank jealousy from envious motorcycling wanna-bes. And when a local race is organized, Billy must shift gears completely and compete against his best friend, Rick, for the top prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZITVIhBaLgCagW1i8bo5JBrXay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117636'),
  ('197248220234826208', 'Winnetou - A New World', 2016, 'Western, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Philipp Stölzl', 'Jan Berger, Alexander M. Rümelin', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Nik Xhelilaj, Iazua Larios, Jürgen Vogel, Rainer Bock, Leslie Malton, Milan Peschel, Gojko Mitić', null, 'The first part, "A New World", tells how the young German engineer Karl May comes to America and starts to work for a railway company in the Wild West. Under dramatic circumstances, he meets Apache chief Winnetou and becomes friends with him and his tribe. The Apaches give it the name Old Shatterhand. Together they fight now against the unscrupulous henchmen of the railway company, who wants to lay a route through the Indian area.', 'The first part, "A New World", tells how the young German engineer Karl May comes to America and starts to work for a railway company in the Wild West. Under dramatic circumstances, he meets Apache chief Winnetou and becomes friends with him and his tribe. The Apaches give it the name Old Shatterhand. Together they fight now against the unscrupulous henchmen of the railway company, who wants to lay a route through the Indian area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH9kaIBOPmpW184lWzLmSBaDPOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367177'),
  ('1028353498975267597', 'Winnetou - The Last Fight', 2016, 'Adventure, Western, TV Movie', 'Philipp Stölzl', 'Jan Berger', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Nik Xhelilaj, Iazua Larios, Michael Maertens, Mario Adorf, Milan Peschel, Henny Reents, Gustav Peter Wöhler', null, 'In Part Three, entitled "The Last Fight," gangster Santer Jr. attempts to seize an oil well on Indian territory. To prevent this, Winnetou and Old Shatterhand must reconcile the warring Indian tribes so that they can take up the fight against the henchmen of the criminal.', 'In Part Three, entitled "The Last Fight," gangster Santer Jr. attempts to seize an oil well on Indian territory. To prevent this, Winnetou and Old Shatterhand must reconcile the warring Indian tribes so that they can take up the fight against the henchmen of the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofnP05L8JBCKbfwJGVIZaNfZDmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431731'),
  ('788228861595617938', 'Winnetou - The Secret of Silver Lake', 2016, 'Adventure, Western, TV Movie', 'Philipp Stölzl', 'Jan Berger, Alexander M. Rümelin', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Nik Xhelilaj, Iazua Larios, Fahri Yardım, Milan Peschel, Matthias Matschke, Henny Reents, Carlo Ljubek', null, 'In the second part of the German remake of the Winnetou films, Winnetou''s sister Nscho Tschi is kidnapped by a brutal crook who wants to find a mythical Apache treasure. Old Shatterhead and Winnetou get forced to search for the precious in the silver sea by their evil opponent El Mas Loco.', 'In the second part of the German remake of the Winnetou films, Winnetou''s sister Nscho Tschi is kidnapped by a brutal crook who wants to find a mythical Apache treasure. Old Shatterhead and Winnetou get forced to search for the precious in the silver sea by their evil opponent El Mas Loco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqjIFrD2uKjsQLWJEmyqBD6eDOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431730'),
  ('824680797567797006', 'Winnetou and the Crossbreed', 1966, 'Adventure, Western', 'Harald Philipp, Heinz Hölscher', 'Fred Denger', 'Lex Barker, Pierre Brice, Götz George, Uschi Glas, Ralf Wolter, Walter Barnes, Miha Baloh, Marija Crnobori', 'G', 'On her b-day, settler''s daughter Apanatschi receives her father''s secret gold mine but greedy neighboring prospectors resort to murder and kidnapping in order to get the gold, forcing the girl and her brother to seek Winnetou''s protection.', 'On her b-day, settler''s daughter Apanatschi receives her father''s secret gold mine but greedy neighboring prospectors resort to murder and kidnapping in order to get the gold, forcing the girl and her brother to seek Winnetou''s protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO4PpdZPWUYdR6Mwei2YMR9Ydtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9628'),
  ('674510380069815530', 'Winnie the Pooh', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Don Hall, Stephen J. Anderson, Julio Macat', null, 'Jim Cummings, Bud Luckey, Craig Ferguson, Travis Oates, Tom Kenny, Kristen Anderson-Lopez, Wyatt Dean Hall, Jack Boulter', 'G', 'During an ordinary day in Hundred Acre Wood, Winnie the Pooh sets out to find some honey. Misinterpreting a note from Christopher Robin, Owl convinces Pooh, Tigger, Rabbit, Piglet, Kanga, Roo, and Eeyore that their young friend has been captured by a creature named "Backson" and they set out to rescue him.', 'During an ordinary day in Hundred Acre Wood, Winnie the Pooh sets out to find some honey. Misinterpreting a note from Christopher Robin, Owl convinces Pooh, Tigger, Rabbit, Piglet, Kanga, Roo, and Eeyore that their young friend has been captured by a creature named "Backson" and they set out to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlFs85nq62jeR4a9iHNGB113m6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51162'),
  ('1131128587080413581', 'Winnie the Pooh & Christmas Too', 1991, 'Animation, Family', 'Jamie Mitchell, Gary Perkovac', 'Karl Geurs, Mark Zaslove', 'Jim Cummings, Peter Cullen, John Fiedler, Paul Winchell, Edan Gross, Ken Sansom, Michael Gough, Nicholas Melody', null, 'Pooh is so busy gathering up his friends'' wish lists for Santa that he forgets to include his own. After retrieving the list and adding his own desires, he realizes he''s late getting it where it needs to go. Off he goes to the North Pole on Christmas Eve, with pals Eeyore, Tigger, Piglet, Rabbit, and Christopher Robin missing him', 'Pooh is so busy gathering up his friends'' wish lists for Santa that he forgets to include his own. After retrieving the list and adding his own desires, he realizes he''s late getting it where it needs to go. Off he goes to the North Pole on Christmas Eve, with pals Eeyore, Tigger, Piglet, Rabbit, and Christopher Robin missing him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43viCWUdwNvfsTFcfHRaXQNeA35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80357'),
  ('966317102864663830', 'Winnie the Pooh and a Day for Eeyore', 1983, 'Family, Animation', 'Rick Reinert', null, 'Hal Smith, Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Will Ryan, Paul Winchell, Kim Christiansen, Laurie Main, Ralph Wright', 'G', 'Winnie the Pooh and friends decide to throw a birthday celebration for gloomy, old Eeyore.', 'Winnie the Pooh and friends decide to throw a birthday celebration for gloomy, old Eeyore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvfogh10Seq7o7R9w0P6JjjeCYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24926'),
  ('952707435014238091', 'Winnie the Pooh and the Blustery Day', 1968, 'Family, Animation, Music', 'Wolfgang Reitherman, Frank Thomas, Ollie Johnston', 'A.A. Milne', 'Sterling Holloway, John Fiedler, Paul Winchell, Hal Smith, Jon Walmsley, Ralph Wright, Sebastian Cabot, Howard Morris', null, 'Winnie the Pooh and his friends experience high winds, heavy rains, and a flood in Hundred Acre Wood.', 'Winnie the Pooh and his friends experience high winds, heavy rains, and a flood in Hundred Acre Wood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kNFx8GW0zgtLDkhfNBOMMVmJTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81310'),
  ('1145209962032597112', 'Winnie the Pooh and the Honey Tree', 1966, 'Family, Animation', 'Wolfgang Reitherman', 'Vance Gerry', 'Sterling Holloway, Junius Matthews, Sebastian Cabot, Howard Morris, Hal Smith, Bruce Reitherman, Ralph Wright, Barbara Luddy', 'G', 'Christopher Robin''s bear attempts to raid a beehive in a tall tree.', 'Christopher Robin''s bear attempts to raid a beehive in a tall tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y0F2gWQwbEmh0d3TGIAMguIv4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36540'),
  ('454105070071192235', 'Winnie the Pooh and Tigger Too', 1974, 'Family, Animation', 'John Lounsbery, Richard Rich', null, 'Sebastian Cabot, Dori Whitaker, Paul Winchell, Sterling Holloway, John Fiedler, Junius Matthews, Barbara Luddy, Timothy Turner', 'G', 'Rabbit is tired of Tigger always bouncing him, so he gets Pooh and Piglet together to come up with an idea to get the bounce out of Tigger. Then, Tigger and little Roo go out for a bounce and get caught in a tree.', 'Rabbit is tired of Tigger always bouncing him, so he gets Pooh and Piglet together to come up with an idea to get the bounce out of Tigger. Then, Tigger and little Roo go out for a bounce and get caught in a tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DUGoHzZHxD22AL4OIGTkkBpqm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72185'),
  ('24286263762143542', 'Winnie the Pooh Discovers the Seasons', 1981, 'Animation, Family', 'Rick Reinert', 'Ronald Kidd', 'Kim Christiansen, Hal Smith, John Fiedler, Ray Erlenborn, Ron Feinberg, Laurie Main', null, 'Christopher Robin gives Winnie the Pooh a calendar, and Pooh uses it to learn about the seasons.', 'Christopher Robin gives Winnie the Pooh a calendar, and Pooh uses it to learn about the seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbl9ShLxSC00w1GM1oswUscWfJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197754'),
  ('308346649984690925', 'Winnie the Pooh: A Valentine for You', 1999, 'Animation, Family', 'Keith Ingham', 'Carter Crocker', 'Jerome Beidler, Brady Bluhm, Peter Cullen, Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Michael Gough, Steven Schachter, Andre Stojka', 'G', 'After Pooh, Piglet, Tigger, and Rabbit see Christopher Robin making a valentine for -- gasp! -- a girl, they find he''s been bitten by a "Smitten" and is lovesick! Worried that he''ll no longer have time for them, and hoping a second bite from the love bug will cure him, they set out on a wild adventure to capture the Smitten. This wonderful story, filled with magic and whimsy, and sweetened with three new songs, reminds us all that the heart is big and always has plenty of room for friends -- old and new.', 'After Pooh, Piglet, Tigger, and Rabbit see Christopher Robin making a valentine for -- gasp! -- a girl, they find he''s been bitten by a "Smitten" and is lovesick! Worried that he''ll no longer have time for them, and hoping a second bite from the love bug will cure him, they set out on a wild adventure to capture the Smitten. This wonderful story, filled with magic and whimsy, and sweetened with three new songs, reminds us all that the heart is big and always has plenty of room for friends -- old and new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izYcm6J732THFjxYP7VustQP0zR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76669'),
  ('923489062687380726', 'Winnie the Pooh: A Very Merry Pooh Year', 2002, 'Animation, Family', 'Gary Katona, Ed Wexler, Jamie Mitchell', 'Ted Henning, Brian Hohlfeld, Karl Geurs', 'Jim Cummings, Peter Cullen, John Fiedler, Ken Sansom, Kath Soucie, William Green, Nikita Hopkins, Michael York', 'G', 'It''s Christmastime in the Hundred Acre Wood and all of the gang is getting ready with presents and decorations. The gang makes a list of what they want for Christmas and send it to Santa Claus - except that Pooh forgot to ask for something. So he heads out to retrieve the letter and get it to Santa by Christmas...which happens to be tomorrow!', 'It''s Christmastime in the Hundred Acre Wood and all of the gang is getting ready with presents and decorations. The gang makes a list of what they want for Christmas and send it to Santa Claus - except that Pooh forgot to ask for something. So he heads out to retrieve the letter and get it to Santa by Christmas...which happens to be tomorrow!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Xfh2PPZsjEwFyLqp6bisrbdxZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13706'),
  ('191719686587369056', 'Winnie the Pooh: Blood and Honey', 2023, 'Horror', 'Hunter Clin, Rhys Frake-Waterfield, Vince Knight', 'Rhys Frake-Waterfield', 'Nikolai Leon, Craig David Dowsett, Chris Cordell, Maria Taylor, Natasha Rose Mills, Amber Doig-Thorne, Danielle Ronald, Natasha Tosini', 'NR', 'After Christopher Robin abandons them for college, Pooh and Piglet embark on a bloody rampage as they search for a new source of food.', 'After Christopher Robin abandons them for college, Pooh and Piglet embark on a bloody rampage as they search for a new source of food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3iPrVHicDBcx2N6eamv0jbHH6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980078'),
  ('1119833118970809578', 'Winnie the Pooh: Springtime with Roo', 2004, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Saul Blinkoff, Elliot M. Bour, Jamie Thomason', 'Tom Rogers', 'Jim Cummings, Ken Sansom, Jimmy Bennett, David Ogden Stiers, John Fiedler, Peter Cullen, Kath Soucie', 'G', 'Spring has sprung, and baby Roo is excited to get out and explore and make new friends. But Rabbit seems preoccupied with spring cleaning, instead of embracing his usual role of playing Easter Bunny. Leave it to Roo to show Rabbit -- through love -- that it''s more important who you love and not who''s in charge.', 'Spring has sprung, and baby Roo is excited to get out and explore and make new friends. But Rabbit seems preoccupied with spring cleaning, instead of embracing his usual role of playing Easter Bunny. Leave it to Roo to show Rabbit -- through love -- that it''s more important who you love and not who''s in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAgVcU1BdPqvnyYnOkb1QtVNd5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16394'),
  ('769521302827583515', 'Winnie the Pooh: Un-Valentine''s Day', 1995, 'Animation, Family', null, null, 'Jim Cummings, Ken Sansom, Andre Stojka, Paul Winchell', 'PG', 'It''s the time of year when Pooh and his pals like to show how much they care. But Rabbit insists they cancel Valentine''s Day because of the flood of cards that littered the Hundred Acre Wood last year! Reluctantly, everyone agrees, until someone anonymously sends Pooh a pot of honey. Contains stories from two episodes of the series The New Adventures of Winnie the Pooh - ''Un-Valentine’s Day'' and ''Three Little Piglets''', 'It''s the time of year when Pooh and his pals like to show how much they care. But Rabbit insists they cancel Valentine''s Day because of the flood of cards that littered the Hundred Acre Wood last year! Reluctantly, everyone agrees, until someone anonymously sends Pooh a pot of honey. Contains stories from two episodes of the series The New Adventures of Winnie the Pooh - ''Un-Valentine’s Day'' and ''Three Little Piglets''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCI9rJi5UBWEgmgspapg2zL37yF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264417'),
  ('906803808157285864', 'Winnie-the-Pooh', 1969, 'Animation, Family', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Nina Klimova', 'Boris Zakhoder, Fyodor Khitruk', 'Evgeni Leonov, Iya Savvina, Vladimir Osenev', null, 'According to Winnie-the-Pooh himself, bears love honey very much. That''s why it always runs out very quickly. And you can''t do without honey, so Winnie, along with Piglet, sets off for a tall tree with a beehive hanging from it. Winnie fearlessly climbs up to the beehive on a balloon, singing a song about a little cloud.', 'According to Winnie-the-Pooh himself, bears love honey very much. That''s why it always runs out very quickly. And you can''t do without honey, so Winnie, along with Piglet, sets off for a tall tree with a beehive hanging from it. Winnie fearlessly climbs up to the beehive on a balloon, singing a song about a little cloud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSzuXChK281KUVFAZApTDJshHrZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36161'),
  ('1056036947722161203', 'Winnie-the-Pooh and a Busy Day', 1972, 'Family, Animation', 'Gennadiy Sokolskiy, Fyodor Khitruk', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Boris Zakhoder', 'Evgeni Leonov, Iya Savvina, Erast Garin, Zinaida Naryshkina, Vladimir Osenev', null, 'Another Soviet Winnie-the-Pooh story. This time the donkey, known from the Pooh stories as Eeyore, is sad because he has no tail. Pooh goes in search of one and finds it attached to a bell that hangs from the treehouse of one Owl.', 'Another Soviet Winnie-the-Pooh story. This time the donkey, known from the Pooh stories as Eeyore, is sad because he has no tail. Pooh goes in search of one and finds it attached to a bell that hangs from the treehouse of one Owl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOnnIpNwDMxGSScB0MjLi2GeMoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36162'),
  ('569960218071770038', 'Winnie-the-Pooh Goes Visiting', 1971, 'Animation, Family', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Mikhail Druyan', 'Boris Zakhoder, Fyodor Khitruk', 'Evgeni Leonov, Iya Savvina, Anatoliy Shchukin, Vladimir Osenev', null, 'The second of the Soviet Winnie-the-Pooh series. This one had Pooh and Piglet visiting Rabbit for a meal with honey.', 'The second of the Soviet Winnie-the-Pooh series. This one had Pooh and Piglet visiting Rabbit for a meal with honey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHXgv9GGgmoaWN6VAfLICvS6c2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36163'),
  ('493214207748699366', 'Winnie-the-Pooh: Blood and Honey 2', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vince Knight, Rhys Frake-Waterfield, Darcy Baker', 'Matt Leslie', 'Scott Chambers, Ryan Oliva, Tallulah Evans, Lewis Santer, Marcus Massey, Eddy MacKenzie, Peter DeSouza-Feighoney, Simon Callow', 'NR', 'Five months following the murders, Christopher Robin struggles to maintain a regular life while dealing with PTSD. However, deep within the 100-Acre-Wood, a destructive rage grows as Pooh, Piglet, Owl, and Tigger find their home and their lives endangered after their existence is revealed.', 'Five months following the murders, Christopher Robin struggles to maintain a regular life while dealing with PTSD. However, deep within the 100-Acre-Wood, a destructive rage grows as Pooh, Piglet, Owl, and Tigger find their home and their lives endangered after their existence is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sADrLwMQof6yYmrJRSa04tFZuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079485'),
  ('1005652899254877718', 'Winning', 1969, 'Action, Drama', 'James Goldstone, Richard Moore, Earl J. Bellamy', 'Howard Rodman', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Robert Wagner, Richard Thomas, David Sheiner, Clu Gulager, Barry Ford, Karen Arthur', null, 'Frank Capua is a rising star on the race circuit who dreams of winning the big one - the Indianapolis 500. But to get there he runs the risk of losing his wife Elora to his rival, Luther Erding, and strains the relationship with his stepson.', 'Frank Capua is a rising star on the race circuit who dreams of winning the big one - the Indianapolis 500. But to get there he runs the risk of losing his wife Elora to his rival, Luther Erding, and strains the relationship with his stepson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53FriH2moj4sL4iNDpv3GbYZRVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42621'),
  ('1111019613446610879', 'Winning London', 2001, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Craig Shapiro, David Lewis, Rob Lundsgaard', 'Karol Ann Hoeffner', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Brandon Tyler, Jesse Spencer, Rachel Roth, Eric Jungmann, Claire Yarlett, Steven Shenbaum', 'G', 'When Chloe and Riley Lawrence are invited to London to participate in the international Model U.N. competition, they enjoy seeing the sights and head over heals romance with cute british boys of course.', 'When Chloe and Riley Lawrence are invited to London to participate in the international Model U.N. competition, they enjoy seeing the sights and head over heals romance with cute british boys of course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wzA0yGuwpoIjduC6OoTXigWtMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36269'),
  ('1054363393551265121', 'Winning Streak', 2012, 'Drama', 'Eduard Cortés, David Omedes, Pol Rodríguez', 'Eduard Cortés, Piti Español', 'Daniel Brühl, Lluís Homar, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Oriol Vila, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Huichi Chiu, Blanca Suárez, Marina Salas', null, 'Winning Streak is the astonishing story of a group of young down-and-outs who are presented with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity; to change their luck and set off on the adventure of their lives. Thanks to an infallible method based on the roulette wheel’s imperfection, their lifestyle is about to become better than their wildest dreams, as they set out to break the banks at casinos around the world.', 'Winning Streak is the astonishing story of a group of young down-and-outs who are presented with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity; to change their luck and set off on the adventure of their lives. Thanks to an infallible method based on the roulette wheel’s imperfection, their lifestyle is about to become better than their wildest dreams, as they set out to break the banks at casinos around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAsLL6Keq1WuZ9kx8WBtDYp5K8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98586'),
  ('72430801515076754', 'Winning Your Wings', 1942, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Owen Crump, John Huston', 'Owen Crump', 'James Stewart, Jean Ames, Leah Baird, Don DeFore, Charles Drake, Bill Edwards, Inez Gay, Creighton Hale', null, 'Winning Your Wings is a 1942 short American World War II recruitment film produced by Warner Bros. Studios for the US Army Air Forces, starring Jimmy Stewart. It was aimed at young men who were thinking about joining the Air Force.', 'Winning Your Wings is a 1942 short American World War II recruitment film produced by Warner Bros. Studios for the US Army Air Forces, starring Jimmy Stewart. It was aimed at young men who were thinking about joining the Air Force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUgWvZXOWOvdoo9iwUxa9g19keC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152237'),
  ('14541136540906880', 'Winona Ryder: The Ghosts She Called', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Lukas Hoffmann', 'Lukas Hoffmann', 'Johannes Steck, Violet Lucca, Nigel Goodall, Rekha Tulsiram, Karron Graves, Lindsay Gibb, David Seltzer, Winona Ryder', null, 'A portrait of the actress Winona Ryder, the great muse of nineties cinema, who, although she has had an atypical and somewhat erratic career, has always offered performances as sensitive as they are honest.', 'A portrait of the actress Winona Ryder, the great muse of nineties cinema, who, although she has had an atypical and somewhat erratic career, has always offered performances as sensitive as they are honest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSA131VRzZcu6XlJUSUEFu4P5Xc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955001'),
  ('388608907783903620', 'Winstanley', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Charles Rees, Ian Sellar, Charles Ware', 'Kevin Brownlow, Andrew Mollo', 'Miles Halliwell, Jerome Willis, Terry Higgins, Phil Oliver, David Bramley, Alison Halliwell, Dawson France, Bill Petch', null, 'Gerrard Winstanley is the leader of a 17th Century religious group that believes the land should be owned communally. His convictions bring him into conflict with both the state and the church.', 'Gerrard Winstanley is the leader of a 17th Century religious group that believes the land should be owned communally. His convictions bring him into conflict with both the state and the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7grFQTY8ru6kn3W5q6I3NoKZJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128891'),
  ('766658511255831587', 'Winston Churchill: A Giant in the Century', 2014, 'Documentary, History, War, TV Movie', 'David Korn-Brzoza', 'Jacques Dubuisson, David Korn-Brzoza, François Kersaudy', 'Vincent Lindon, Winston Churchill, Clementine Churchill, Diana Churchill, Mary Churchill, Randolph Churchill, Sarah Churchill, Adolf Hitler', null, 'A new look at the public and private life of one of the most important statesmen in the history of Europe: Winston Churchill (1874-1965), soldier, politician, writer, painter, leader of his country in the darkest hours, winner of the Nobel Prize in Literature, a myth, a giant of the 20th century.', 'A new look at the public and private life of one of the most important statesmen in the history of Europe: Winston Churchill (1874-1965), soldier, politician, writer, painter, leader of his country in the darkest hours, winner of the Nobel Prize in Literature, a myth, a giant of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzyftGhgtRsb9QCgVdwypeKxgcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394046'),
  ('1123213206695697754', 'Winter', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'In the last of the Silly Symphonies season cycle, bears hibernate (or try to), raccoons sneeze, moose swim, and pretty much everyone ice skates. Everyone gathers around the groundhog to see what happens.', 'In the last of the Silly Symphonies season cycle, bears hibernate (or try to), raccoons sneeze, moose swim, and pretty much everyone ice skates. Everyone gathers around the groundhog to see what happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df59Bwd6slAjQYd57zNyRYs6gLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67788'),
  ('684975839298948416', 'Winter', 1969, 'Drama', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Marcel Hanoun, Maurice Cury', 'Tiziana Siffi, Michael Lonsdale, Christian Barbier, Frédéric Latin, Maurice Poullenot', null, 'While working on a documentary about the city of Bruges, an artistically frustrated filmmaker must deal with the increasing difficulties in his marriage.', 'While working on a documentary about the city of Bruges, an artistically frustrated filmmaker must deal with the increasing difficulties in his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHK7uR5u4UR9fatV19tiuaL3Xke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273241'),
  ('985545593462109701', 'Winter', 1988, 'Animation', 'Pete Docter', 'Pete Docter', 'Pete Docter', null, 'This delightful story is simply about a boy wanting to go outside and play in the snow. After getting all bundled up by his mother, the boy has found that he is unable to move! Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2011.', 'This delightful story is simply about a boy wanting to go outside and play in the snow. After getting all bundled up by his mother, the boy has found that he is unable to move! Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSec5FgIqGuOfOxQ5Sl1cPqiM64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209679'),
  ('344975082624201928', 'Winter Break', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marni Banack, Alexa Sheehan, George Mooradian', 'Mark Botvinick', 'Milo Ventimiglia, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Justin Urich, Eddie Mills, Sean Smith, Anna Faris, Rachel Wilson, Victor Alfieri', 'R', 'Viscerally experience a "year off" in Aspen, Colorado with a group of recent college grads who have elected to defer graduate school and career opportunities to ski, snow-board, climb, party, fall in love and basically live life to its absolute fullest out in this spectacular mountain town.', 'Viscerally experience a "year off" in Aspen, Colorado with a group of recent college grads who have elected to defer graduate school and career opportunities to ski, snow-board, climb, party, fall in love and basically live life to its absolute fullest out in this spectacular mountain town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEPVFr6b9L1QSPmfAquDSNgKcrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14427'),
  ('172421053959483920', 'Winter Carousel', 1958, 'Animation', 'Władysław Starewicz', 'Władysław Starewicz, Irene Starewicz', null, null, 'A small group of animals gathers around a frozen pond. The animals then play together on the ice and in the snow. Later, when the season changes, they look for new ways of passing the time.', 'A small group of animals gathers around a frozen pond. The animals then play together on the ice and in the snow. Later, when the season changes, they look for new ways of passing the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dWy2CyNMfvXk3WGXCnBQMxxS5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178459'),
  ('571415002682862529', 'Winter Castle', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Tien, Marita Grabiak', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Emilie Ullerup, Kevin McGarry, Meghan Heffern, Habree Larratt, Melanie Mullen, Justine Eyre, Richard Nash, Pierre Simpson', 'G', 'When Jenny attends her sister’s winter wedding at an ice hotel, her heart melts over the best man, the problem is he unexpectedly brings a “plus one,” seemingly dashing her hopes for a wintery romance.', 'When Jenny attends her sister’s winter wedding at an ice hotel, her heart melts over the best man, the problem is he unexpectedly brings a “plus one,” seemingly dashing her hopes for a wintery romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2th61cu88aJld83u1dEiuSW1107.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570186'),
  ('864246146782311337', 'Winter Cherries', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Igor Maslennikov, Vladimir Brylyakov, Tatiana Buzyan', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Elena Safonova, Vitali Solomin, Nina Ruslanova, Larisa Udovichenko, Aleksandr Lenkov, Ivars Kalnins, Denis Kirillov, Sergei Parshin', null, 'Olga, is a young intelligent woman who raises a young son. She ends up falling in love with a married man who does not dare to leave his family.', 'Olga, is a young intelligent woman who raises a young son. She ends up falling in love with a married man who does not dare to leave his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qaq8YLHScvWMnYCvEEcyaPzXxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72811'),
  ('474242855957721767', 'Winter Crossing', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Stéphane Marchetti, Sébastien Goepfert, Camille Servignat', 'Laurette Polmanss', 'Florence Loiret Caille, Saabo Balde, Jonathan Couzinié, Aurélia Petit, Philippe Frécon, Souleymane Touré, Marie Narbonne, Amal Affani', null, 'Marie, in her forties, lives in the Hautes-Alpes, cut off from her relatives. She only has her lover, Alex, a border policeman. Thanks to him, she smuggles cigarettes between Italy and France for her '' get out. On her way to France, she bumps into Mouneer, a 20-year-old Sudanese migrant, determined to join his little sister. He guesses her trafficking and persuades her to bring migrants across the border.', 'Marie, in her forties, lives in the Hautes-Alpes, cut off from her relatives. She only has her lover, Alex, a border policeman. Thanks to him, she smuggles cigarettes between Italy and France for her '' get out. On her way to France, she bumps into Mouneer, a 20-year-old Sudanese migrant, determined to join his little sister. He guesses her trafficking and persuades her to bring migrants across the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZk7PWOIQAU0sG30XSCyJRPIPhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001112'),
  ('1105002192828997559', 'Winter Days', 2003, 'Animation', 'Isao Takahata, Raoul Servais, Shinichi Suzuki', 'Kihachiro Kawamoto', 'Ryuta Kashiwagi, Noboru Mitani, Kyôko Kishida, Mutsumi Sasaki, Joe Watanabe, Kazutoyo Yoshimi', null, 'An animated film based on one of the renku (collaborative linked poems) in the 1684 collection of the same name by the 17th-century Japanese poet Bashō. The creation of the film followed the traditional collaborative nature of the source material – the visuals for each of the 36 stanzas were independently created by 35 different animators. As well as many Japanese animators, Kawamoto assembled leading names in animation from across the world. Each animator was asked to contribute at least 30 seconds to illustrate their stanza, and most of the sequences are under a minute (Yuriy Norshteyn''s, though, is nearly two minutes long).', 'An animated film based on one of the renku (collaborative linked poems) in the 1684 collection of the same name by the 17th-century Japanese poet Bashō. The creation of the film followed the traditional collaborative nature of the source material – the visuals for each of the 36 stanzas were independently created by 35 different animators. As well as many Japanese animators, Kawamoto assembled leading names in animation from across the world. Each animator was asked to contribute at least 30 seconds to illustrate their stanza, and most of the sequences are under a minute (Yuriy Norshteyn''s, though, is nearly two minutes long).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omjYHYRYMv1FhDwogNcvhrFgZkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69484'),
  ('169808000484751513', 'Winter Evening in Gagry', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Vladimir Shevtsik, Vladimir Kuchinsky', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov', 'Evgeniy Evstigneev, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Natalya Gundareva, Sergey Nikonenko, Pyotr Shcherbakov, Svetlana Amanova, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Mikhail Derzhavin', null, 'A young romantic loves step dance but there is only one person who knows this forgotten art. Beglov was a step dance super star back in 50s but as step became unpopular he lost everything. He hates even this word - ''chechotka'' (step dance). But somehow the young man convinces him to become his coach and manager.', 'A young romantic loves step dance but there is only one person who knows this forgotten art. Beglov was a step dance super star back in 50s but as step became unpopular he lost everything. He hates even this word - ''chechotka'' (step dance). But somehow the young man convinces him to become his coach and manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQyEc4agCG4snTlSY7IniWRyjI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65110'),
  ('852399882883722632', 'Winter Holidays', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Michele Lupo, Aldo Tonti', 'Oreste Biancoli, Jacques Sigurd, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Michèle Morgan, Vittorio De Sica, Georges Marchal, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Dorian Gray, Denise Provence, Renato Salvatori', null, 'Alberto Moretti arrives in Cortina D''Ampezzo, with daughter Marcella,who has just won a TV contest, the prize of which is a free stay in a luxury hotel.', 'Alberto Moretti arrives in Cortina D''Ampezzo, with daughter Marcella,who has just won a TV contest, the prize of which is a free stay in a luxury hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BMKbgWB6xXJtGODlotvBDKm1tl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59134'),
  ('868948717664023145', 'Winter in Prostokvashino', 1984, 'Animation', 'Vladimir Popov', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Mariya Vinogradova, Oleg Tabakov, Lev Durov, Valentina Talyzina, Boris Novikov, German Kachin, Zinaida Naryshkina', null, 'A third movie about Fyodor and his friends from the Prostokvashino village and their adventures - this time during the winter.', 'A third movie about Fyodor and his friends from the Prostokvashino village and their adventures - this time during the winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npVjTdinip4kvViCjLpBIY44jXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77762'),
  ('864365923379183841', 'Winter in Sokcho', 2025, 'Drama', 'Koya Kamura, Yeonu Choi, Laura Lestrade', 'Stéphane Ly-Cuong, Koya Kamura', 'Bella Kim, Roschdy Zem, Park Mi-hyeon, Ryu Tae-ho, Gong Do-yu, Jung Kyung-soon, Minhee Cho, Ki Hui-hyeon', null, 'In the snowy seaside town of Sokcho, 25-year-old Soo-Ha works at a guesthouse. She drifts between her mother’s fish stall and her boyfriend until a French artist’s arrival stirs questions about her identity. As winter deepens, Soo-Ha and the artist form an unspoken connection through food and art.', 'In the snowy seaside town of Sokcho, 25-year-old Soo-Ha works at a guesthouse. She drifts between her mother’s fish stall and her boyfriend until a French artist’s arrival stirs questions about her identity. As winter deepens, Soo-Ha and the artist form an unspoken connection through food and art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVF00d1iCOpEnPx73tUGzsh1uaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001010'),
  ('133388237260760396', 'Winter in Vail', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Neil Cervin, Terry Ingram', 'Delondra Williams, Duane Poole', 'Lacey Chabert, Tyler Hynes, Sage Kitchen, Greg Lawson, Marla Renae, Constance Marie, Karen Barker, Liana Shannon', null, 'Chelsea inherits a house in Vail. She meets Owen and gets a much needed break. Together, they put on Strudelfest to highlight the charm of Old Vail.', 'Chelsea inherits a house in Vail. She meets Owen and gets a much needed break. Together, they put on Strudelfest to highlight the charm of Old Vail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMX4Rx0FEN5ooF114mSJIbLsLNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656844'),
  ('440650572250365882', 'Winter in Wartime', 2008, 'Drama, History, War', 'Martin Koolhoven, Guido van Gennep, Bastiaan Houtkoper', 'Paul Jan Nelissen, Martin Koolhoven, Mieke de Jong', 'Martijn Lakemeier, Melody Klaver, Yorick van Wageningen, Jamie Campbell Bower, Raymond Thiry, Anneke Blok, Mees Peijnenburg, Jesse van Driel', 'R', 'During World War II in the freezing winter of 1944-45 the western Netherlands are in the grip of a famine. Many people move east to provide for their families. Fourteen year old Michiel can''t wait to join the Dutch resistance, to the dismay of his father, who, as mayor, works to prevent escalations in the village.', 'During World War II in the freezing winter of 1944-45 the western Netherlands are in the grip of a famine. Many people move east to provide for their families. Fourteen year old Michiel can''t wait to join the Dutch resistance, to the dismay of his father, who, as mayor, works to prevent escalations in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwPAQjLoIqqAAGRZ5ke5j7OpKSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16564'),
  ('852832095228715793', 'Winter Kept Us Warm', 1965, 'Drama', 'David Secter, Ernest J.L. Meershoek, Robert Fresco', 'David Secter, Ian Porter, John Clute', 'John Labow, Henry Tarvainen, Joy Fielding, Janet Amos, Iain Ewing, Jack Messinger, Larry Greenspan, Sol Mandlsohn', null, 'It is the 1960s at the University of Toronto. Doug is a well-liked senior with an equally popular girlfriend. Peter is a shy Finnish freshman who is new to the big city. The two become best friends and begin doing all sorts of activities together — until Doug starts viewing their relationship differently.', 'It is the 1960s at the University of Toronto. Doug is a well-liked senior with an equally popular girlfriend. Peter is a shy Finnish freshman who is new to the big city. The two become best friends and begin doing all sorts of activities together — until Doug starts viewing their relationship differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mX10nt5HZQhGFOanpto6LeBAcCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169796'),
  ('438612962590560913', 'Winter Kills', 1979, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'William Richert, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'William Richert', 'Jeff Bridges, John Huston, Anthony Perkins, Eli Wallach, Sterling Hayden, Dorothy Malone, Tomas Milian, Belinda Bauer', null, 'The younger brother of an assassinated US President is led down a rabbit hole of conspiracies and dead ends after learning of a man claiming to be the real shooter.', 'The younger brother of an assassinated US President is led down a rabbit hole of conspiracies and dead ends after learning of a man claiming to be the real shooter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iEF0LlgWjCYp7UkhjcZH73v1gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42178'),
  ('1062880686828634919', 'Winter Lemons', 2023, 'Romance', 'Daniele Ciprì, Caterina Carone, Rebecca Cervato', 'Anna Pavignano, Caterina Carone, Remo Tebaldi', 'Christian De Sica, Teresa Saponangelo, Francesco Bruni, Luca Lionello, Max Malatesta, Agnese Nano, Anna Iodice, Sergio Basile', null, 'Pietro and Eleonora, both avid gardeners, are strangers who only meet because their two terraces are close to each other. The relationship that grows between them helps them to alleviate the pain each feels over something secret and very serious, a pain both try to hide from themselves and those around them. In this limbo they inhabit, the two make a stab at finding happiness together, until their paths diverge once more.', 'Pietro and Eleonora, both avid gardeners, are strangers who only meet because their two terraces are close to each other. The relationship that grows between them helps them to alleviate the pain each feels over something secret and very serious, a pain both try to hide from themselves and those around them. In this limbo they inhabit, the two make a stab at finding happiness together, until their paths diverge once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32jzdFfVwzHGwjqNWnfnUzF6iAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066575'),
  ('699911397193357742', 'Winter Nomads', 2012, 'Documentary, History', 'Manuel von Stürler, Camille Cottagnoud', 'Manuel von Stürler, Claude Muret', 'Pascal Eguisier, Carole Noblanc, Jean-Paul Peguiron', null, 'Pascal, 53, and Carole, 28, are shepherds. In the month of November 2010, they embark on their long winter transhumance: four months during which they will have to cover 600 km in the Swiss-French region, accompanied by three donkeys, four dogs and eight hundred sheep. An exceptional adventure is about to begin: they brave the cold and the bad weather day in day out, with a canvas cover and animal skins as their only shelter at night. This saga reveals a tough and exacting profession, requiring constant improvisation and unflinching attention to nature, the animals and the cosmos. An eventful journey with surprise encounters, moving reunions with farmer friends, nostalgic figures of country life that is shrinking away fast. Αn adventure film, a contemporary road movie, a reflection of our current world, which takes us back to our roots and our inner questions.', 'Pascal, 53, and Carole, 28, are shepherds. In the month of November 2010, they embark on their long winter transhumance: four months during which they will have to cover 600 km in the Swiss-French region, accompanied by three donkeys, four dogs and eight hundred sheep. An exceptional adventure is about to begin: they brave the cold and the bad weather day in day out, with a canvas cover and animal skins as their only shelter at night. This saga reveals a tough and exacting profession, requiring constant improvisation and unflinching attention to nature, the animals and the cosmos. An eventful journey with surprise encounters, moving reunions with farmer friends, nostalgic figures of country life that is shrinking away fast. Αn adventure film, a contemporary road movie, a reflection of our current world, which takes us back to our roots and our inner questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY2oH8onYDZhPYPJPnEGtop5cZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99879'),
  ('811266492537088083', 'Winter of The Braves', 2019, 'History, War, Drama', 'Oleksii Shapariev, Sergey Pivnenko, Taras Myskiv', 'Kostiantyn Konovalov, Oleksii Shapariev', 'Yevhen Lamakh, Andrii Fedinchyk, Vitalii Salii, Oleksii Trytenko, Volodymyr Filatov, Tomasz Sobczak, Maksym Donets, Oleksandr Piskunov', null, '1918 Ukraine. Patriotic students, protagonists of the film, get ready to defend Kyiv and fight heroically in the Battle of Kruty. On this historical background reveals the story of the Savytskyi family - the general of Ukraine''s counterintelligence and his two sons, Andrii and Oleksa.', '1918 Ukraine. Patriotic students, protagonists of the film, get ready to defend Kyiv and fight heroically in the Battle of Kruty. On this historical background reveals the story of the Savytskyi family - the general of Ukraine''s counterintelligence and his two sons, Andrii and Oleksa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnh7yx2cqY2WOsSLkCKjffICkBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511619'),
  ('729470746108404760', 'Winter of the Crow', 2026, 'Biography, Crime, Drama, History, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kasia Adamik, Olga Chajdas, Tomasz Naumiuk, Mateusz Wichłacz, Jakub Burakiewicz', 'Kasia Adamik, Lucinda Coxon, Sandra Buchta, Olga Tokarczuk', 'Lesley Manville, Zofia Wichłacz, Andrzej Konopka, Sascha Ley, Tom Burke', null, 'A British professor witnesses a student''s murder by secret police in 1981 Warsaw under martial law. She becomes a target while running through the city''s streets, eventually forced to stop and take a stand.', 'A British professor witnesses a student''s murder by secret police in 1981 Warsaw under martial law. She becomes a target while running through the city''s streets, eventually forced to stop and take a stand.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1Fxy0yTc4oJEMAtbNtuidhGFjBo.jpg', 'plex:movie:winter-of-the-crow'),
  ('867170944512054945', 'Winter on Fire: Ukraine''s Fight for Freedom', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Evgeny Afineevsky, Viacheslav Tsvietkov, Evgeny Afineevsky', 'Den Tolmor', 'Cissy Jones, Bishop Agapit, Catherine Ashton, Serhii Averchenko, Kristina Berdinskikh, Pavlo Dobryanskyy, Valery Dovgiy, Bogdan Dubas', 'R', 'Over 93 days in Ukraine, what started as peaceful student demonstrations became a violent revolution and full-fledged civil rights movement.', 'Over 93 days in Ukraine, what started as peaceful student demonstrations became a violent revolution and full-fledged civil rights movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGKMWhYsK3OxQ6ceqMnvXBfFd7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355020'),
  ('371946487438717015', 'Winter Passing', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adam Rapp, Terry Stacey', 'Adam Rapp', 'Zooey Deschanel, Will Ferrell, Ed Harris, Amy Madigan, Amelia Warner, John Bedford Lloyd, Deirdre O''Connell, Mandy Siegfried', 'R', 'Actress Reese Holden has been offered a small fortune by a book editor if she can secure for publication the love letters that her father, a reclusive novelist, wrote to her mother, who has since passed away. Returning to Michigan, Reese finds that an ex-grad student and a would-be musician have moved in with her father, who cares more about his new friends than he does about his own health and well-being.', 'Actress Reese Holden has been offered a small fortune by a book editor if she can secure for publication the love letters that her father, a reclusive novelist, wrote to her mother, who has since passed away. Returning to Michigan, Reese finds that an ex-grad student and a would-be musician have moved in with her father, who cares more about his new friends than he does about his own health and well-being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNAiNCHd7015BzeNggoRiTT4abf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14256'),
  ('928930224202113118', 'Winter People', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ted Kotcheff, François Protat', 'Carol Sobieski', 'Kurt Russell, Kelly McGillis, Lloyd Bridges, Mitchell Ryan, Jeffrey Meek, Don Michael Paul, Lanny Flaherty, Eileen Ryan', 'PG-13', 'Wayland Jackson, a widower with a young daughter, moves to a small, impoverished mountain village in North Carolina, circa 1934. They are taken in by Collie Wright, a single mother with an illegitimate baby, and she and Wayland soon fall in love. Trouble starts when the identity of her baby''s father is revealed.', 'Wayland Jackson, a widower with a young daughter, moves to a small, impoverished mountain village in North Carolina, circa 1934. They are taken in by Collie Wright, a single mother with an illegitimate baby, and she and Wayland soon fall in love. Trouble starts when the identity of her baby''s father is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uttDBa6mvuDWXXWcL1yPS35ehFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108969'),
  ('153583808700667521', 'Winter Sleep', 2014, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Gökhan Tiryaki, Emel Erden', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Ebru Ceylan', 'Haluk Bilginer, Melisa Sözen, Demet Akbağ, Ayberk Pekcan, Serhat Kılıç, Tamer Levent, Nejat İşler, Nadir Sarıbacak', null, 'Aydın is a hotel owner and a retired actor in rural Turkey. As winter emerges he begins navigating the conflicts within the relationships with his wife, sister and existence.', 'Aydın is a hotel owner and a retired actor in rural Turkey. As winter emerges he begins navigating the conflicts within the relationships with his wife, sister and existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95j83qOqH3Ivz4RYkaSjGT0VSNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265169'),
  ('881747009972585750', 'Winter Sleepers', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Ulrich Matthes, Marie-Lou Sellem, Floriane Daniel, Heino Ferch, Josef Bierbichler, Laura Tonke, Sophia Dirscherl, Sebastian Schipper', null, 'Young blonde translator Rebecca lives with her boyfriend ski instructor Marco in a mountain villa owned by her friend, nurse Laura. Rene, local cinema projectionist, steals Marco''s car and gets into a car crash with local Theo, whose daughter, after being in coma for a time, dies. Rene suffers from partial short term memory loss and starts a relationship with Laura. Meanwhile Marco is looking for the man who stole his car and Theo - for the man who killed his daughter...', 'Young blonde translator Rebecca lives with her boyfriend ski instructor Marco in a mountain villa owned by her friend, nurse Laura. Rene, local cinema projectionist, steals Marco''s car and gets into a car crash with local Theo, whose daughter, after being in coma for a time, dies. Rene suffers from partial short term memory loss and starts a relationship with Laura. Meanwhile Marco is looking for the man who stole his car and Theo - for the man who killed his daughter...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eSSVuhQ197uSzhgkuW8rKGQ1bo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781'),
  ('192486607788139905', 'Winter Soldier', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Rusty Sachs, Michaël Weill', null, 'Rusty Sachs, Kenneth Campbell, Joe Bangert, Scott Shimabukuro, Scott Camil, John Kerry, Steve Pitkin, Jonathan Birch', null, 'For three days in 1971, former US soldiers who were in Vietnam testify in Detroit about their war experiences. Nearly 30 speak, describing atrocities personally committed or witnessed, telling of inaccurate body counts, and recounting the process of destroying a village.', 'For three days in 1971, former US soldiers who were in Vietnam testify in Detroit about their war experiences. Nearly 30 speak, describing atrocities personally committed or witnessed, telling of inaccurate body counts, and recounting the process of destroying a village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIagxsIvSEGAXQuuCkximnhhyL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34921'),
  ('388960419703967995', 'Winter Solstice', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'Shot at a steel mill, Winter Solstice is full of outpourings of fire, of smoke, of sparks, of molten metal — all erupting against an otherwise black background in an activated pictorial space.', 'Shot at a steel mill, Winter Solstice is full of outpourings of fire, of smoke, of sparks, of molten metal — all erupting against an otherwise black background in an activated pictorial space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hh9RslDpNs8Weka1cnOTb6YuKLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166714'),
  ('300619061596626993', 'Winter Song', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Otar Iosseliani, Martine Marignac, Julie Grünebaum', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Pierre Étaix, Mathieu Amalric, Rufus, Amiran Amiranashvili (II), Mathias Jung, Enrico Ghezzi, Altinaï Petrovitch-Niegosh, Sarah Brannens', null, 'Two old friends have urban adventures connected to the skull of an executed French aristocrat.', 'Two old friends have urban adventures connected to the skull of an executed French aristocrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dID4rltOMLC9lXIToiUtEnbSIi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354148'),
  ('567108698842015392', 'Winter Spring Summer or Fall', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Graham Robbins, Tiffany Paulsen', 'Dan Schoffer', 'Jenna Ortega, Percy Hynes White, Adam Rodriguez, Marisol Nichols, Elias Kacavas, Corynn Treadwell, Ahaise, Alexis Zollicoffer', 'R', 'Remi and Barnes, two very different teenagers, meet by chance in the winter of their senior year, then spend four days together over the course of a year that will change their lives forever.', 'Remi and Barnes, two very different teenagers, meet by chance in the winter of their senior year, then spend four days together over the course of a year that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEPi5ISa5RmzpzeDfwkhX0CcNsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059073'),
  ('557835074977700118', 'Winter Storage', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'It''s October 7th and Chip is working industriously to store enough acorns in the tree for the winter. Dale would rather sleep in his matchbox, but an angry kick from Chip gets him working furiously. But there''s only so much they can do. Their tree is nearly out of acorns. Luckily, the two semi-intelligible chipmunks happen to see the half-unintelligible Donald Duck, a park ranger, planting acorns. They immediately set to steal his bag of the precious nuts. Donald soon realizes what they are up to, and sets out a box propped up with a stick. It''s a crude trap, with an acorn as bait; but it''s not too crude to fool Dale, who upsets it and traps Chip. Soon, Donald finds he can have fun instigating a fight between these two quarrelsome chipmunks, but he underestimates their friendship and their ability to work as a team against a common enemy: in this case, a bad-tempered duck.', 'It''s October 7th and Chip is working industriously to store enough acorns in the tree for the winter. Dale would rather sleep in his matchbox, but an angry kick from Chip gets him working furiously. But there''s only so much they can do. Their tree is nearly out of acorns. Luckily, the two semi-intelligible chipmunks happen to see the half-unintelligible Donald Duck, a park ranger, planting acorns. They immediately set to steal his bag of the precious nuts. Donald soon realizes what they are up to, and sets out a box propped up with a stick. It''s a crude trap, with an acorn as bait; but it''s not too crude to fool Dale, who upsets it and traps Chip. Soon, Donald finds he can have fun instigating a fight between these two quarrelsome chipmunks, but he underestimates their friendship and their ability to work as a team against a common enemy: in this case, a bad-tempered duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uSF2KDAD2C5TWgNND2OlrxF1sg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67789'),
  ('608685050319558282', 'Winter Vacation', 2011, 'Drama', 'Li Hongqi', 'Li Hongqi', 'Jinfeng Bai, Lei Bao, Ying Xie, Naqi Zhang, Wang Hui', null, 'An ordinary village in Northern China, the last day of the winter vacation. Four idle, aimless adolescents gather at Zhou Zhixin''s home, a friend who lives with his father, brother and nephew. Like most contemporary teenagers, these youths want to enjoy their last day of holiday and simply hang out in this place where nothing ever seems likely to happen. Their conversations are desultory and they sometimes seem to argue for argument''s sake. One of them, Laowu, talks frankly with his girlfriend about how teenage love might affect their studies, while Laobao questions school''s value and relevance to real life.', 'An ordinary village in Northern China, the last day of the winter vacation. Four idle, aimless adolescents gather at Zhou Zhixin''s home, a friend who lives with his father, brother and nephew. Like most contemporary teenagers, these youths want to enjoy their last day of holiday and simply hang out in this place where nothing ever seems likely to happen. Their conversations are desultory and they sometimes seem to argue for argument''s sake. One of them, Laowu, talks frankly with his girlfriend about how teenage love might affect their studies, while Laobao questions school''s value and relevance to real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXSoPxPkXVk9hc1qXAkR1iePFOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95361'),
  ('1136741726859652020', 'Winter War', 2017, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Bastien Calou, David Aboucaya, Alain Marseglia', 'David Aboucaya', 'Manuel Gonçalves, Laurent Guiot, Laurent Cerulli, Benoit Davin, Brian Messina, Tommy Lee Baïk, Natale Naccari, David Aboucaya', null, 'January 1945. The first French regiment of paratroopers to fight with an American unit to liberate Alsace in France. An Allied Division must take the forest bordering the town of Jebsheim, several days before the attack that would later be called the ''French Stalingrad.'' Prisoners of the cold, snow, and harsh winter conditions, and pounded by German forces, the French and American soldiers learn the violence and hell of war In this struggle for freedom and survival, they will face and unexpected enemy.', 'January 1945. The first French regiment of paratroopers to fight with an American unit to liberate Alsace in France. An Allied Division must take the forest bordering the town of Jebsheim, several days before the attack that would later be called the ''French Stalingrad.'' Prisoners of the cold, snow, and harsh winter conditions, and pounded by German forces, the French and American soldiers learn the violence and hell of war In this struggle for freedom and survival, they will face and unexpected enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jTcpK4e7C4I6uPWGXWh9wemkgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452739'),
  ('302091097875896295', 'Winter Wonderland', 2003, 'Animation, Family', 'Harry Arends', 'Jim Paddock', 'Wayne Allwine, Peter Behn, Bill Farmer, Andrew Keenan-Bolger, Paige O''Hara, Russi Taylor, Tony Anselmo, Donnie Dunagan', null, 'A look at everyone''s favorite Disney characters as they explore the joys of Christmas.', 'A look at everyone''s favorite Disney characters as they explore the joys of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycWHKVVPSDk5ScV3cCgCJEmDDud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260787'),
  ('608054149611068073', 'Winter''s Bone', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Debra Granik, Michael McDonough, Jolian Blevins', 'Debra Granik, Anne Rosellini', 'Jennifer Lawrence, John Hawkes, Kevin Breznahan, Dale Dickey, Garret Dillahunt, Sheryl Lee, Shelley Waggener, Isaiah Stone', 'R', 'After discovering her father put their house up for his bail bond and then disappeared, 17-year-old Ree Dolly must confront the local criminal underworld and the harsh Ozark wilderness in order to to track down her father and save her family.', 'After discovering her father put their house up for his bail bond and then disappeared, 17-year-old Ree Dolly must confront the local criminal underworld and the harsh Ozark wilderness in order to to track down her father and save her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0qhPkNlxLfsf5B2jFyI1Pp04XV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39013'),
  ('28208402761589565', 'Winter''s Child', 1989, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Denis Lenoir, Hubert Engammare', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Clotilde de Bayser, Michel Feller, Marie Matheron, Gérard Blain, Anouk Grinberg, Nathalie Richard, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Vincent Vallier', null, 'Feckless aspiring architect Stéphane leaves his pregnant girlfriend for theater designer Sabine; Sabine in turn vainly attempts to overcome her violent obsession with an actor in her theater company. A game of emotional chutes and ladders ensues.', 'Feckless aspiring architect Stéphane leaves his pregnant girlfriend for theater designer Sabine; Sabine in turn vainly attempts to overcome her violent obsession with an actor in her theater company. A game of emotional chutes and ladders ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iw5IGtG3ssHPpoXeAgfcsrKAvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120648'),
  ('926748851103234644', 'Winter''s Tale', 2014, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Romance', 'Akiva Goldsman, Caleb Deschanel, David R. Ellis', 'Akiva Goldsman', 'Colin Farrell, Jessica Brown Findlay, Russell Crowe, William Hurt, Jennifer Connelly, Will Smith, Eva Marie Saint, Graham Greene', 'PG-13', 'A burglar falls for an heiress as she dies in his arms. When he learns that he has the gift of reincarnation, he sets out to save her.', 'A burglar falls for an heiress as she dies in his arms. When he learns that he has the gift of reincarnation, he sets out to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwDAUpidqVEql6w1o51VIPlMtbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137321'),
  ('1103615561196669355', 'Winterbeast', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Christopher Thies, Craig B. Mathieson, Bob Goodness', 'Christopher Thies', 'Tim R. Morgan, Mike Magri, Charles Majka, Bob Harlow, Lissa Breer, Dori May Kelly, David Mica, Bill MacLeod', null, 'People are being killed off near a popular New England mountain lodge, with a legend claiming that the mountain is haunted by a deadly Native American demonic curse.', 'People are being killed off near a popular New England mountain lodge, with a legend claiming that the mountain is haunted by a deadly Native American demonic curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uuj0HXdGBtTDYpjtS83ksmNyac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86492'),
  ('595280348917809461', 'Wintergartenprogramm', 1895, null, 'Max Skladanowsky', 'Max Skladanowsky', 'Ploetz, Larella, Sylvester Schäffer Sr., Grunato, Tscherpanoff, Ancion, Eugen Sandow, Greiner', null, 'On 1 November 1895, the brothers Max and Emil Skladanowsky presented their pioneer film work and legendary Bioscop program in Berlin′s Wintergarten Theater. With live musical accompaniment, the compilation program included short film sequences with famous artists of the time: Italienischer Bauerntanz, Komisches Reck, Der Jongleur, Das boxende Känguruh, Kamarinskaja, Die Serpentintänzerin, Akrobatisches Potpourri, Ringkampf, and Apotheose, with the Skladanowsky brothers bowing to their audience.', 'On 1 November 1895, the brothers Max and Emil Skladanowsky presented their pioneer film work and legendary Bioscop program in Berlin′s Wintergarten Theater. With live musical accompaniment, the compilation program included short film sequences with famous artists of the time: Italienischer Bauerntanz, Komisches Reck, Der Jongleur, Das boxende Känguruh, Kamarinskaja, Die Serpentintänzerin, Akrobatisches Potpourri, Ringkampf, and Apotheose, with the Skladanowsky brothers bowing to their audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aDwAhwo3dF2Xo9qSDB06EPMW6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144421'),
  ('810275945040078903', 'Winterhawk', 1975, 'Western, Adventure', 'Charles B. Pierce, James W. Roberson', 'Kalai Strode, Earl E. Smith', 'Leif Erickson, Woody Strode, Denver Pyle, L.Q. Jones, Elisha Cook Jr., Seamon Glass, Dennis Fimple, Arthur Hunnicutt', 'PG', 'Smallpox plagues Chief Winterhawk''s tribe. He seeks cure from the white men, who in turn, in fear of getting the smallpox, kill two of his companions. Winterhawk comes back to kidnap a girl and her brother from the white men''s settlement, and thus begins the chase...', 'Smallpox plagues Chief Winterhawk''s tribe. He seeks cure from the white men, who in turn, in fear of getting the smallpox, kill two of his companions. Winterhawk comes back to kidnap a girl and her brother from the white men''s settlement, and thus begins the chase...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhUb1vC6v8dIgaq8Scdqpuyfz4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143516'),
  ('114856632924251163', 'Winterkartoffelknödel', 2014, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ed Herzog, Sebastian Edschmid', 'Ed Herzog, Kerstin Schmidbauer, Sascha Bigler', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Simon Schwarz, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Enzi Fuchs, Eisi Gulp, Gerhard Wittmann, Jeanette Hain, Monika Gruber', null, 'A policeman suspects that several bizarre deaths in the same family were murders and that the killer is a mysterious woman who just moved to the village.', 'A policeman suspects that several bizarre deaths in the same family were murders and that the killer is a mysterious woman who just moved to the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaHdUviVHsyEk5yGiN796JfKRXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289984'),
  ('992953654605345464', 'Winterset', 1936, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Alfred Santell, J. Peverell Marley', 'Anthony Veiller', 'Burgess Meredith, Margo, Eduardo Ciannelli, Maurice Moscovitch, John Carradine, Edward Ellis, Paul Guilfoyle, Stanley Ridges', null, 'A man is determined to find the real culprit behind the crime for which his father was wrongly executed.', 'A man is determined to find the real culprit behind the crime for which his father was wrongly executed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3t9wRsjNYJobOV5leydtv9tuPfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87445'),
  ('1046456346041670748', 'Winx Club - Magic Adventure', 2010, 'Animation, Family', 'Iginio Straffi, Mauro Uzzeo', 'Iginio Straffi, Alessandro Bilotta, Francesco Artibani', 'Letizia Ciampa, Perla Liberatori, Ilaria Latini, Gemma Donati, Emiliano Coltorti, Domitilla D''Amico, Tatiana Dessi, Valeria Vidali', 'PG', 'Reunited with her birth parents, Oritel and Marion, Bloom discovers what it is like to live as a princess of Domino. Adding to her joy at being with her parents is the upcoming Princess Ball, which Sky has asked Bloom to attend with him. But Bloom''s happiness is short lived when Sky is forbidden by his own father to escort her. Meanwhile, the evil Ancestral Witches who had once destroyed Domino join forces with the Trix - Icy, Darcy, and Stormy - to erase all positive magic from the Magic Dimension. To reverse the effects of the Witches'' devastating reign of darkness, the Winx and the Specialists must travel to the cursed city of Avram and come face to face with the Trix and the Ancestral Witches. Only by defeating the witches can the Winx restore the positive magic in the entire dimension and regain their own powers.', 'Reunited with her birth parents, Oritel and Marion, Bloom discovers what it is like to live as a princess of Domino. Adding to her joy at being with her parents is the upcoming Princess Ball, which Sky has asked Bloom to attend with him. But Bloom''s happiness is short lived when Sky is forbidden by his own father to escort her. Meanwhile, the evil Ancestral Witches who had once destroyed Domino join forces with the Trix - Icy, Darcy, and Stormy - to erase all positive magic from the Magic Dimension. To reverse the effects of the Witches'' devastating reign of darkness, the Winx and the Specialists must travel to the cursed city of Avram and come face to face with the Trix and the Ancestral Witches. Only by defeating the witches can the Winx restore the positive magic in the entire dimension and regain their own powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P1Z0voZehYFDRNHigG2XAelKVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74658'),
  ('354659091019692742', 'Winx Club - The Fate of Bloom', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Iginio Straffi, Jason Caparaz', null, 'Molly C. Quinn, Amy Gross, Romi Dames, Alejandra Reynoso, Morgan Decker, Matt Shively, Adam Gregory, Sam Riegel', null, 'Bloom discovers she is a fairy. She gets the chance to attend Alfea College with her new BFFs: Stella, Flora, Tecna, and Musa.', 'Bloom discovers she is a fairy. She gets the chance to attend Alfea College with her new BFFs: Stella, Flora, Tecna, and Musa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oQrJbftY6xF9PVp0ea1CVHRi9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433641'),
  ('661458775347718481', 'Winx Club: The Mystery of the Abyss', 2014, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Iginio Straffi', 'Giovanni Masi', 'Letizia Ciampa, Perla Liberatori, Ilaria Latini, Gemma Donati, Domitilla D''Amico, Laura Lenghi, Marco Vivio, Emanuela Rossi', 'G', 'The archenemies of the Winx Club, the Trix witches, team up with the evil nymph Politea and find out that, to defeat the fairies once and for all and become invincible, it takes very little: a Pearl hidden in the Deep of the Infinite Ocean! As small as powerful, the Pearl of the Depth gives enormous powers to those who possess it! For the Winx there is not a minute to waste: how will they stop the plans of their enemies before it''s too late? Get ready: the most dangerous mission of the Winx is about to begin!', 'The archenemies of the Winx Club, the Trix witches, team up with the evil nymph Politea and find out that, to defeat the fairies once and for all and become invincible, it takes very little: a Pearl hidden in the Deep of the Infinite Ocean! As small as powerful, the Pearl of the Depth gives enormous powers to those who possess it! For the Winx there is not a minute to waste: how will they stop the plans of their enemies before it''s too late? Get ready: the most dangerous mission of the Winx is about to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tf0QLY55SjgEDHqk44LnkRkfemM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290841'),
  ('882652708853081718', 'Winx Club: The Secret of the Lost Kingdom', 2007, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Iginio Straffi, Mauro Uzzeo', 'Sean Molyneaux, Iginio Straffi', 'Letizia Ciampa, Perla Liberatori, Ilaria Latini, Gemma Donati, Domitilla D''Amico, Laura Lenghi, Marco Vivio, Gianfranco Miranda', 'PG', 'Sixteen years ago the most powerful warrior wizards of the Magic Dimension sacrificed themselves to fight against absolute evil. Now the fate of a kingdom is in the hands of a young girl - Bloom, the fairy of the Dragon''s flame. Accompanied by her Winx Club girlfriends, Bloom must overcome the greatest challenge of all: enter the depths of the obscure dimension, fight against evil to bring her parents back to life and reveal the mystery linked to her origins. The destiny of the entire Magic Dimension depends on the outcome of this conflict.', 'Sixteen years ago the most powerful warrior wizards of the Magic Dimension sacrificed themselves to fight against absolute evil. Now the fate of a kingdom is in the hands of a young girl - Bloom, the fairy of the Dragon''s flame. Accompanied by her Winx Club girlfriends, Bloom must overcome the greatest challenge of all: enter the depths of the obscure dimension, fight against evil to bring her parents back to life and reveal the mystery linked to her origins. The destiny of the entire Magic Dimension depends on the outcome of this conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T37TmZ7WV8qgJNoE1mTQchUXug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80797'),
  ('608121094824838163', 'Wipe Out', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antony Diaz, Rodolphe Lauga', 'Rodolphe Lauga', 'Sneazzy, Christopher Lambert, Alice David, Fred Testot, Christine Citti, Pascal Demolon, Jean-François Cayrey, Maya Racha', null, 'Samir lives in the projects of a second zone city in France. He is bored, rebellious, and on the verge of becoming a small-time criminal. Until his dad brutally dies and he has to become a plumber to be the breadwinner for his family. But accompanying his younger sister to the public library, he stumbles upon a surfing magazine and has a revelation: he too shall ride the waves professionally one day. The hiccup? He doesn’t even know how to swim. Enters an ex-bodybuilding champion and local loser who takes him under his wing and decides to help. Samir then leaves for the French surfing beaches, determined to make his dreams come true.', 'Samir lives in the projects of a second zone city in France. He is bored, rebellious, and on the verge of becoming a small-time criminal. Until his dad brutally dies and he has to become a plumber to be the breadwinner for his family. But accompanying his younger sister to the public library, he stumbles upon a surfing magazine and has a revelation: he too shall ride the waves professionally one day. The hiccup? He doesn’t even know how to swim. Enters an ex-bodybuilding champion and local loser who takes him under his wing and decides to help. Samir then leaves for the French surfing beaches, determined to make his dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gteEY7gyrEH44DSaMYLlegkuzYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608954'),
  ('489269101583165128', 'Wir hau''n die Pauker in die Pfanne', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Harald Reinl, Peter Reimer', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Hansi Kraus, Uschi Glas, Fritz Wepper, Rudolf Schündler, Jutta Speidel, Ruth Stephan, Balduin Baas, Theo Lingen', null, 'Principal Gottlieb Taft''s twin brother Gotthold Taft partakes in the most recent prank by faking his death and promising a large inheritance to the Mommsen-Gymnasium and the principal. Of course, the inheritance is tied to many embarrassing conditions.', 'Principal Gottlieb Taft''s twin brother Gotthold Taft partakes in the most recent prank by faking his death and promising a large inheritance to the Mommsen-Gymnasium and the principal. Of course, the inheritance is tied to many embarrassing conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwYC9CWuUOJymfKKZgqDkkvCeh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12234'),
  ('21042015289013149', 'Wir sind die Neuen', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ralf Westhoff, Ian Blumers', 'Ralf Westhoff', 'Gisela Schneeberger, Heiner Lauterbach, Michael Wittenborn, Claudia Eisinger, Karoline Schuch, Patrick Güldenberg, Julia Koschitz, Katharina M. Schubert', null, 'Three old friends from college move back in together in an apartment in Munich for financial reasons.', 'Three old friends from college move back in together in an apartment in Munich for financial reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIC9lDrT75JrvhhHfwH0GFdW5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271433'),
  ('194464544907033314', 'Wire Room', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'Matt Eskandari, Will Barratt, Theo Kypri', 'Brandon Stiefer', 'Kevin Dillon, Bruce Willis, Oliver Trevena, Texas Battle, Cameron Douglas, Shelby Cobb, MWW Michael Wilkerson, Adam Huel Potter', 'R', 'New recruit Justin Rosa must monitor arms-smuggling cartel member Eddie Flynn — and keep him alive at all costs. When a SWAT team descends on Flynn’s home, Rosa breaks protocol and contacts the gangster directly to save his life. As gunmen break into the Wire Room and chaos erupts, Mueller and Rosa make a final, desperate stand against the corrupt agents and officials who seek to destroy evidence and kill them both.', 'New recruit Justin Rosa must monitor arms-smuggling cartel member Eddie Flynn — and keep him alive at all costs. When a SWAT team descends on Flynn’s home, Rosa breaks protocol and contacts the gangster directly to save his life. As gunmen break into the Wire Room and chaos erupts, Mueller and Rosa make a final, desperate stand against the corrupt agents and officials who seek to destroy evidence and kill them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9ykj4v8ykjRoGB7SpI1OuxblNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921360'),
  ('440705696906431803', 'Wired', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Larry Peerce, Tony Imi', 'Bob Woodward', 'Michael Chiklis, Ray Sharkey, J.T. Walsh, Patti D''Arbanville, Lucinda Jenney, Alex Rocco, Gary Groomes, Jere Burns', null, 'The ghost of John Belushi looks back on his troubled life and career.', 'The ghost of John Belushi looks back on his troubled life and career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1BzaleWQOjihUjtrfpg0TO3h8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78151'),
  ('1118414617265132914', 'Wired Shut', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Martin Taube, Kevin Brown, Alexander Sharp', 'Peter Malone Elliott', 'Blake Stadel, Natalie Sharp, Behtash Fazlali', null, 'Reed Rodney, a disillusioned, world-famous novelist, is recovering at his remote mountain home from major reconstructive jaw surgery, which has rendered him physically unable to speak. Reed receives an unexpected visit from his estranged daughter, Emmy. After a life-threatening secret is exposed and upends their reality as they know it, Reed and Emmy must decide how far they are willing to go together in the name of survival and redemption.', 'Reed Rodney, a disillusioned, world-famous novelist, is recovering at his remote mountain home from major reconstructive jaw surgery, which has rendered him physically unable to speak. Reed receives an unexpected visit from his estranged daughter, Emmy. After a life-threatening secret is exposed and upends their reality as they know it, Reed and Emmy must decide how far they are willing to go together in the name of survival and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXaQHMOV0iPtxPnXZ3IRqq0utrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834347'),
  ('956976450511520640', 'Wisconsin Death Trip', 1999, 'Documentary, Crime', 'James Marsh, Eigil Bryld, Frankie DeMarco', 'James Marsh', 'Ian Holm, Marcus Monroe, Marilyn White, John Baltes, Molly Nikki Anderson, Brittany Haydock, Eddie Kunz, Steven Strobel', 'NR', 'Inspired by the book of the same name, film-maker James Marsh relays a tale of tragedy, murder and mayhem that erupted behind the respectable facade of Black River Falls, Wisconsin in the 19th century.', 'Inspired by the book of the same name, film-maker James Marsh relays a tale of tragedy, murder and mayhem that erupted behind the respectable facade of Black River Falls, Wisconsin in the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atngFVxShIsk2KDQdHnehtRtSZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37044'),
  ('424084781852926975', 'Wisdom', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Emilio Estevez, Adam Greenberg, Donald P.H. Eaton', 'Emilio Estevez', 'Demi Moore, Emilio Estevez, Tom Skerritt, Veronica Cartwright, William Allen Young, Charlie Sheen, Richard Minchenberg, Ernie Lively', 'R', 'Unable to find work after a past felony, graduate John Wisdom and his girlfriend embark on a cross-country bank-robbing spree in order to aid American farmers.', 'Unable to find work after a past felony, graduate John Wisdom and his girlfriend embark on a cross-country bank-robbing spree in order to aid American farmers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJiKZG7vauFCeax5Aj5fahrcKUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41090'),
  ('896039467307707236', 'Wisdom Teeth', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Roxanna Hibdon', null, 'After a wisdom tooth operation, a man decides to let his friend pull out one of the stitches.', 'After a wisdom tooth operation, a man decides to let his friend pull out one of the stitches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytz98kFn7CMozOgl6fnuIAQ4dcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153599'),
  ('948373233094059953', 'Wisdom Tooth', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Liang Ming, He Shan', null, 'Lu Xingchen, Wu Xiaoliang, Wang Jiajia, Chen Yongzhong, Lu Celeste, Wang Weishen, Tao Hai', null, 'Gu Xi is about to lose her job because of undocumented citizenship status. While making use of all her connections in her effort to get official registration papers, she also tries to getting along with her brother''s new girlfriend.', 'Gu Xi is about to lose her job because of undocumented citizenship status. While making use of all her connections in her effort to get official registration papers, she also tries to getting along with her brother''s new girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unniA9kVpHuRezDARcxqRxMZRY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639298'),
  ('389444320615961698', 'Wise Blood', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Huston, Tom Shaw, Gerry Fisher', 'Benedict Fitzgerald, Michael Fitzgerald', 'Brad Dourif, Dan Shor, Amy Wright, Harry Dean Stanton, Mary Nell Santacroce, Ned Beatty, John Huston, William Hickey', 'PG', 'A Southerner--young, poor, ambitious but uneducated--determines to become something in the world. He decides that the best way to do that is to become a preacher and start up his own church.', 'A Southerner--young, poor, ambitious but uneducated--determines to become something in the world. He decides that the best way to do that is to become a preacher and start up his own church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSZQC6u86iaugBSs1KBrXST7KSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42179'),
  ('905451586583639626', 'Wise Guys', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Brian De Palma, Fred Schuler, Ron Bozman', 'George Gallo', 'Danny DeVito, Joe Piscopo, Harvey Keitel, Ray Sharkey, Dan Hedaya, Louis Albano, Julie Bovasso, Patti LuPone', 'R', 'Harry Valentini and Moe Dickstein are both errand boys for the Mob. When they lose $250,000, they are set up to kill each other. But they run off to Atlantic City and comedy follows.', 'Harry Valentini and Moe Dickstein are both errand boys for the Mob. When they lose $250,000, they are set up to kill each other. But they run off to Atlantic City and comedy follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN4xnH6SqigBlyTlOnOkZ2tdWAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31659'),
  ('625935249975388861', 'Wise Quackers', 1949, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Daffy Duck falls from the sky onto Elmer Fudd''s farm. Rather than be shot, he begs Elmer to accept him as a personal slave. After torturing Elmer with his type of kindness, slave Daffy puts a whip in Elmer''s hands, then instantly dresses like Abraham Lincoln to scold Elmer for "whipping slaves".', 'Daffy Duck falls from the sky onto Elmer Fudd''s farm. Rather than be shot, he begs Elmer to accept him as a personal slave. After torturing Elmer with his type of kindness, slave Daffy puts a whip in Elmer''s hands, then instantly dresses like Abraham Lincoln to scold Elmer for "whipping slaves".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX7Of1qE7Jjdfkwjq7zqMTBp9Pf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237307'),
  ('422723218924712364', 'Wisegal', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Gerald Packer, Jerry Ciccoritti, Mark Tataryn', 'Shelley Evans', 'Alyssa Milano, Jason Gedrick, James Caan, Janet Wright, Gabriel Hogan, Heather Hanson, Tony Nappo, Alessandro Costantini', 'PG', 'A drama centered around Patty Montanari, the widowed mother of two who went to work for her lover Frank Russo, a captain in a Brooklyn crime family.', 'A drama centered around Patty Montanari, the widowed mother of two who went to work for her lover Frank Russo, a captain in a Brooklyn crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk7AAJlTkieLXXnSbsJ0NWbZBgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19402'),
  ('923232972250545806', 'WiseGirls', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'David Anspaugh', 'John Meadows', 'Mira Sorvino, Mariah Carey, Melora Walters, Arthur J. Nascarella, Saul Stein, Joseph Siravo, Christian Maelen, Noam Jenkins', 'R', 'Meg, Raychel and Kate are three waitresses at a restaurant frequented by mob bosses. Their lives become complicated when one of the women witnesses a crime, and the three friends suddenly find themselves entangled in their customers’ dangerous world.', 'Meg, Raychel and Kate are three waitresses at a restaurant frequented by mob bosses. Their lives become complicated when one of the women witnesses a crime, and the three friends suddenly find themselves entangled in their customers’ dangerous world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUNOBEKNsa3vhRuPE3FDDoUHzOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41209'),
  ('743491610115510665', 'Wish', 2009, 'Drama', 'Lee Seong-han', 'Lee Seong-han', 'Jung Woo, Hwang Jung-eum, Yang Jae-young, Son Ho-jun, Kwon Jai-hyun, You Chea-myung, Lee Yoo-jun, Kim Hee-jin', null, 'Jjang-gu joins "Monster," a violent organization at his high school. As a rite of passage, he learns a lesson about being a man while following the course.', 'Jjang-gu joins "Monster," a violent organization at his high school. As a rite of passage, he learns a lesson about being a man while following the course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tQllFOiI0i5K6IYDLLGXLWyPZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249277'),
  ('738978664323731231', 'Wish', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Fawn Veerasunthorn, Chris Buck', 'Allison Moore, Jennifer Lee', 'Ariana DeBose, Chris Pine, Alan Tudyk, Angelique Cabral, Victor Garber, Natasha Rothwell, Jennifer Kumiyama, Harvey Guillén', 'PG', 'Asha, a sharp-witted idealist, makes a wish so powerful that it is answered by a cosmic force – a little ball of boundless energy called Star. Together, Asha and Star confront a most formidable foe - the ruler of Rosas, King Magnifico - to save her community and prove that when the will of one courageous human connects with the magic of the stars, wondrous things can happen.', 'Asha, a sharp-witted idealist, makes a wish so powerful that it is answered by a cosmic force – a little ball of boundless energy called Star. Together, Asha and Star confront a most formidable foe - the ruler of Rosas, King Magnifico - to save her community and prove that when the will of one courageous human connects with the magic of the stars, wondrous things can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nesuSdJakNkf0zs7OfoasB6Clxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022796'),
  ('336540990667732365', 'Wish I Was Here', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zach Braff, David H. Venghaus Jr., Lawrence Sher', 'Zach Braff, Adam J. Braff', 'Zach Braff, Kate Hudson, Joey King, Mandy Patinkin, Ashley Greene, Josh Gad, Jim Parsons, Michael Weston', 'R', 'Aidan Bloom, a struggling actor, father and husband, is 35 years old and still trying to find a purpose for his life. He and his wife are barely getting by financially and Aidan passes his time by fantasizing about being the great futuristic Space-Knight he''d always dreamed he''d be as a little kid. When his ailing father can no longer afford to pay for private school for his two kids and the only available public school is on its last legs, Aidan reluctantly agrees to attempt to home-school them. Through teaching them about life his way, Aidan gradually discovers some of the parts of himself he couldn''t find.', 'Aidan Bloom, a struggling actor, father and husband, is 35 years old and still trying to find a purpose for his life. He and his wife are barely getting by financially and Aidan passes his time by fantasizing about being the great futuristic Space-Knight he''d always dreamed he''d be as a little kid. When his ailing father can no longer afford to pay for private school for his two kids and the only available public school is on its last legs, Aidan reluctantly agrees to attempt to home-school them. Through teaching them about life his way, Aidan gradually discovers some of the parts of himself he couldn''t find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDDXIWLBS6rNPJS4tQvEXWxGXjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231576'),
  ('987489639095619547', 'Wish of the Fairy Fish', 2023, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Vladimir Bashta, Alexander Voitinsky, Pavel Doreuli', 'Alexandr Arkhipov', 'Nikita Kologrivyy, Mila Ershova, Roman Madyanov, Alina Alekseeva, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Agrippina Steklova, Fyodor Lavrov, Sergey Burunov', null, 'If you go fishing, be prepared to draw the fish of your dreams, the magical Pike, which can grant any three wishes. Only Emelya let two wishes down the drain, and decided to save the third. Therefore, in order to achieve the hand of the royal daughter Anfisa, he will have to act without magical power, on his own. And Pike will help him, who without her skin will appear as an ordinary girl Vasilisa.', 'If you go fishing, be prepared to draw the fish of your dreams, the magical Pike, which can grant any three wishes. Only Emelya let two wishes down the drain, and decided to save the third. Therefore, in order to achieve the hand of the royal daughter Anfisa, he will have to act without magical power, on his own. And Pike will help him, who without her skin will appear as an ordinary girl Vasilisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okV0jIBJnkONugxNkkwK5uiABLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033774'),
  ('83648165866912', 'Wish Taxi', 2013, 'Drama', 'Park Chang-Jin', 'Lee Ji-hyeon-II', 'Jang Seong-won, Oh In-hye, Han So-yeong, Kim Sun-young, Jang Hee-woong', null, 'In-man is a timid but caring man who creates a suicide group for his first night with his girlfriend and suggests a ''bucket list''. Strong but weak woman Ji-eun is at risk of being sold to some islands because of debt thats started with her college fees so she decides to spend a whole lot of money before she dies. Hye-ri is a bright but pained girl who gave everything to a man she loved but got nothing in return. Cho-hee is a woman who''s life isn''t the same after sending away everyone she ever loved. The four people alike, fulfill their ''bucket list'' before they die and find hope and happiness in the process.', 'In-man is a timid but caring man who creates a suicide group for his first night with his girlfriend and suggests a ''bucket list''. Strong but weak woman Ji-eun is at risk of being sold to some islands because of debt thats started with her college fees so she decides to spend a whole lot of money before she dies. Hye-ri is a bright but pained girl who gave everything to a man she loved but got nothing in return. Cho-hee is a woman who''s life isn''t the same after sending away everyone she ever loved. The four people alike, fulfill their ''bucket list'' before they die and find hope and happiness in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq7BOP1OdMczkIlwJ84wULUGOb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255882'),
  ('685361625717095118', 'Wish Upon', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'John R. Leonetti, Michael Galbraith', 'Barbara Marshall', 'Joey King, Ki Hong Lee, Sydney Park, Shannon Purser, Sherilyn Fenn, Elisabeth Röhm, Ryan Phillippe, Mitchell Slaggert', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl discovers a box with magical powers, but those powers comes with a deadly price.', 'A teenage girl discovers a box with magical powers, but those powers comes with a deadly price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0vnocj57vJt5DHoBEqUOD1G4SU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440597'),
  ('647435487861748727', 'Wish upon a Pike', 1938, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Aleksandr Rou, Ivan Gorchilin, Sergey Yurtsev', 'Oleg Leonidov, Yelizaveta Tarakhovskaya', 'Pyotr Savin, Georgi Millyar, Vladimir Lepko, Andrey Fayt, Ye. Terentyeva, Lev Potyomkin, Aleksandr Zhukov, Tatyana Strukova', null, 'Adapted from four different Russian folk-tales, this early Soviet fantasy film tells the story of Emelya the Fool, who, fishing one day, catches a talking pike who pleads for his life and in return grants Emelya wishes for a life spared.', 'Adapted from four different Russian folk-tales, this early Soviet fantasy film tells the story of Emelya the Fool, who, fishing one day, catches a talking pike who pleads for his life and in return grants Emelya wishes for a life spared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEchzAhACTW4ukj5CEmKq7KN7gv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71340'),
  ('563468498102189105', 'Wish Upon a Star', 1996, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Brian Sullivan, Blair Treu, Miriam Footer', 'Jessica Barondes', 'Katherine Heigl, Danielle Harris, Donnie Jeffcoat, Scott Wilkinson, Mary Parker Williams, Lois Chiles, Ivey Lloyd, Matt Barker', 'PG', 'A younger sister wishes to switch places with her popular older sister and the two bickering siblings awaken to find the wish has come true.', 'A younger sister wishes to switch places with her popular older sister and the two bickering siblings awaken to find the wish has come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vgfcw4y4UVE2BUA4RTauUX62jQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27681'),
  ('394812638635439394', 'Wish Upon a Unicorn', 2020, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Ricky Dean Monsey, Steve Bencich', 'Steve Bencich', 'Ryan Kiera Armstrong, Summer Fontana, Kevin J. O''Connor, Anthony Backman, Steve Bencich, Tait Blum, Seth Bowling, Brian Brown', null, 'Two children discover that their mother is gone. The youngest of the pair, adventurer and upcomming singer, Long Johnson forces his older sister, Lily Johnson, to hunt down a unicorn with magical blood.', 'Two children discover that their mother is gone. The youngest of the pair, adventurer and upcomming singer, Long Johnson forces his older sister, Lily Johnson, to hunt down a unicorn with magical blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9juXj68arIv7A20X7FAiJlJGSJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743227'),
  ('510397006576865360', 'Wish You', 2021, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Seong Do-joon', 'Seong Do-joon', 'Kang In-soo, Lee Sang, Park Soo-bin, Baek Seo-bin, Jung Ji Yeon', null, 'Singing and dreaming together, a talented singer-songwriter and a same-aged keyboardist add harmony and love to each other''s lives.', 'Singing and dreaming together, a talented singer-songwriter and a same-aged keyboardist add harmony and love to each other''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvYrAUfx9DkhLVC07vD8wJQK3iA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783753'),
  ('505953438539278943', 'Wish You Were Here', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Leland, Ian Wilson', 'David Leland', 'Emily Lloyd, Tom Bell, Jesse Birdsall, Clare Clifford, Sheila Kelley, Trudi Cavanagh, Barbara Durkin, Geoffrey Hutchings', 'R', 'In a staid English seaside town after the Second World War, young Lynda grows up with her widowed father and younger sister. Rebellious Lynda has been swearing constantly from an early age. At sixteen, she becomes more exhibitionist and seeks out sexual encounters challenging the prevailing lower-middle class attitudes to sex.', 'In a staid English seaside town after the Second World War, young Lynda grows up with her widowed father and younger sister. Rebellious Lynda has been swearing constantly from an early age. At sixteen, she becomes more exhibitionist and seeks out sexual encounters challenging the prevailing lower-middle class attitudes to sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cULL2vpyXLK6F3CAsO3h5nCzNQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46976'),
  ('283446626972460676', 'Wish You Were Here', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kieran Darcy-Smith, Jules O''Loughlin, Drew Bailey', 'Kieran Darcy-Smith, Felicity Price', 'Joel Edgerton, Teresa Palmer, Felicity Price, Antony Starr, Nicholas Cassim, Otto Page, Isabelle Austin-Boyd, Tina Bursill', 'R', 'Four friends lose themselves in a carefree South-East Asian holiday. Only three come back. Dave and Alice return home to their young family desperate for answers about Jeremy''s mysterious disappearance. When Alice''s sister Steph returns not long after, a nasty secret is revealed about the night her boyfriend went missing. But it is only the first of many. Who amongst them knows what happened on that fateful night when they were dancing under a full moon in Cambodia?', 'Four friends lose themselves in a carefree South-East Asian holiday. Only three come back. Dave and Alice return home to their young family desperate for answers about Jeremy''s mysterious disappearance. When Alice''s sister Steph returns not long after, a nasty secret is revealed about the night her boyfriend went missing. But it is only the first of many. Who amongst them knows what happened on that fateful night when they were dancing under a full moon in Cambodia?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5z2G9ZofW4yMQmMkLKZkZL6ohU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60270'),
  ('648069779289486791', 'Wish You Were Here', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Julia Stiles, Michael T. Meador, Ryan De Franco', 'Reneé Carlino, Julia Stiles', 'Isabelle Fuhrman, Mena Massoud, Gabby Kono, Jimmie Fails, Josh Caras, Jennifer Grey, Kelsey Grammer, Jordan Gavaris', 'PG-13', 'Charlotte finds herself in a rut, searching for a spark that seems just out of reach. After she has a whirlwind night of romance and imagining a future with a man named Adam, he ghosts her. When Charlotte finally discovers that Adam is terminally ill, she helps him spend his last days living life to the fullest.', 'Charlotte finds herself in a rut, searching for a spark that seems just out of reach. After she has a whirlwind night of romance and imagining a future with a man named Adam, he ghosts her. When Charlotte finally discovers that Adam is terminally ill, she helps him spend his last days living life to the fullest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX40XUTBJFIskKmpThelUnRXelq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842328'),
  ('880825812063507719', 'Wishcraft', 2002, 'Horror', 'Danny Graves, Richard Wenk, Suki Medencevic', 'Larry Katz', 'Michael Weston, Alexandra Holden, Austin Pendleton, A.J. Buckley, Huntley Ritter, Gregory Cooke, Meat Loaf, Charlie Talbert', 'R', 'Brett is a high-school outcast who doesn''t run with the in crowd, unlike Samantha, the cheerleader he has a desperate crush on. Then one day, he gets a parcel in the mail -- a totem with the power to grant his deepest, darkest desires. Brett wishes for Samantha to love him, and she does, although after a while her affection starts leaning toward obsession. Then murders start occurring in the school, which Brett gradually starts to connect to the totem.', 'Brett is a high-school outcast who doesn''t run with the in crowd, unlike Samantha, the cheerleader he has a desperate crush on. Then one day, he gets a parcel in the mail -- a totem with the power to grant his deepest, darkest desires. Brett wishes for Samantha to love him, and she does, although after a while her affection starts leaning toward obsession. Then murders start occurring in the school, which Brett gradually starts to connect to the totem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCHr1JaeGEFQmnJmZ3t1BeEBPwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24649'),
  ('953444399514678267', 'Wishful Thinking', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adam Park, Ellery Ryan', 'Adam Park', 'Drew Barrymore, Jennifer Beals, Desiree Casado, Isabel Gillies, Mel Gorham, James Le Gros, Joseph Mosso, Lázaro Pérez', 'R', 'Elizabeth, a vet assistant, falls for Max, who brings in an abused dog. His jealousy burdens their relationship as does talk of marriage. Lena wants Max and she schemes.', 'Elizabeth, a vet assistant, falls for Max, who brings in an abused dog. His jealousy burdens their relationship as does talk of marriage. Lena wants Max and she schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nA3eMtLYyo0fjwvC3moqJzZZHRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86913'),
  ('553404038709710131', 'Wishing Stairs', 2003, 'Horror', 'Yun Jae-yeon, Oh Seung-chul', 'Lee Shin-ae, Lee Yong-yeon, Kim Soo-ah', 'Song Ji-hyo, Park Han-byul, Jo An, Park Ji-yeon, Gong Sang-a, Lee Mi-yeon, Moon Jeong-hee, Kwak Ji-min', null, 'A staircase leading to a schoolgirls'' dormitory usually has 28 steps, but sometimes a 29th step appears. Any wish you make while standing on this step comes true, even if it must come true in the most horrific way possible.', 'A staircase leading to a schoolgirls'' dormitory usually has 28 steps, but sometimes a 29th step appears. Any wish you make while standing on this step comes true, even if it must come true in the most horrific way possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX1CdiS8hJJxY8TuAmMoExYXKfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32237'),
  ('352514754066359419', 'Wishlist', 2020, 'Drama', 'Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo, Valentín Álvarez', 'Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo', 'María León, Victoria Abril, Silvia Alonso, Boré Buika, Salva Reina, Paco Tous, Andrés Velencoso, Mara Guil', null, 'Eva and Carmen are two women who meet in the worst place: the doctor’s office, waiting to hear the results of their cancer screenings. So Carmen has an idea: why don’t she and Eva rent an RV with her best pal, Mar, make a list of things they’ve always wanted to do… and do them.', 'Eva and Carmen are two women who meet in the worst place: the doctor’s office, waiting to hear the results of their cancer screenings. So Carmen has an idea: why don’t she and Eva rent an RV with her best pal, Mar, make a list of things they’ve always wanted to do… and do them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xIRChyyXjnrlxop3FU6gtpOmTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650728'),
  ('251118604984169680', 'Wishmaster', 1997, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Robert Kurtzman, Jacques Haitkin, Allen Kupetsky', 'Peter Atkins', 'Angus Scrimm, Andrew Divoff, Tammy Lauren, Robert Englund, Ari Barak, Jake McKinnon, Greg Funk, Richard Assad', 'R', 'The Djinn, having been released from his ancient prison, seeks to capture the soul of the woman who discovered him, thereby opening a portal and freeing his fellow Djinn to take over the earth.', 'The Djinn, having been released from his ancient prison, seeks to capture the soul of the woman who discovered him, thereby opening a portal and freeing his fellow Djinn to take over the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7rep7SCqiy4COUsq2cOcdQwzU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10351'),
  ('606918410335411246', 'Wishmaster 2: Evil Never Dies', 1999, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Jack Sholder, Carlos González, Jürgen Baum', 'Jack Sholder', 'Andrew Divoff, Holly Fields, Paul Johansson, Bokeem Woodbine, Carlos Leon, Robert LaSardo, Oleg Vidov, Tommy Lister Jr.', 'R', 'During a failed art heist, the Djinn is once again liberated. This time, to complete the 1001 wishes that he needs before the final 3, he lets himself go to prison, where he starts his evil reign twisting the hopes of the prisoners. Meanwhile, the woman who set him free accidentally, Morgana, tries to find a way to stop him, aided by a young priest.', 'During a failed art heist, the Djinn is once again liberated. This time, to complete the 1001 wishes that he needs before the final 3, he lets himself go to prison, where he starts his evil reign twisting the hopes of the prisoners. Meanwhile, the woman who set him free accidentally, Morgana, tries to find a way to stop him, aided by a young priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3FXNYaCDFoQILCbYqFdv6V01ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12594'),
  ('1101170927046390263', 'Wishmaster 3: Beyond the Gates of Hell', 2001, 'Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Chris Angel, Richard O''Brien-Moran, Curtis Petersen', 'Alex Wright', 'Jason Connery, A. J. Cook, Tobias Mehler, Louisette Geiss, Aaron Smolinski, Daniella Evangelista, Emmanuelle Vaugier, John Novak', 'R', 'The evil Djinn is back at it again, this time wreaking havoc on the students of Illinois'' Baxter University. His victim is a beautiful, innocent and studious teenage girl named Diana Collins who accidentally opened up the Djinn''s tomb and released him.', 'The evil Djinn is back at it again, this time wreaking havoc on the students of Illinois'' Baxter University. His victim is a beautiful, innocent and studious teenage girl named Diana Collins who accidentally opened up the Djinn''s tomb and released him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQaOymRoRpNBFOaFRnoxXj6dwJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28635'),
  ('1040253023697757824', 'Wishmaster 4: The Prophecy Fulfilled', 2002, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Chris Angel, Danielle Dumesnil, Kevin Thomson', 'John Benjamin Martin', 'Tara Spencer-Nairn, Michael Trucco, Jason Thompson, John Novak, Victor Webster, John Benjamin Martin, Kimberly Huie, Mariam Bernstein', 'R', 'The unspeakable evil of the soul-devouring djinn rises again in this fourth electrifying installment of the unstoppable Wishmaster horror legacy! But now, as a host of new victims see their most nightmarish wishes come true, the world faces the ultimate demonic terror: an onslaught of multiple djinns hell-bent on destroying everything in their path!', 'The unspeakable evil of the soul-devouring djinn rises again in this fourth electrifying installment of the unstoppable Wishmaster horror legacy! But now, as a host of new victims see their most nightmarish wishes come true, the world faces the ultimate demonic terror: an onslaught of multiple djinns hell-bent on destroying everything in their path!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/am5GYs2Zd4AE8faxTGkdSBvdgbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38157'),
  ('679348923698647744', 'Wit', 2001, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mike Nichols, Seamus McGarvey, Michael Haley', 'Margaret Edson, Mike Nichols, Emma Thompson', 'Emma Thompson, Audra McDonald, Jonathan M. Woodward, Christopher Lloyd, Eileen Atkins, Benedict Wong, Harold Pinter, Raffaello Degruttola', 'PG-13', 'A renowned professor is forced to reassess her life when she is diagnosed with terminal ovarian cancer.', 'A renowned professor is forced to reassess her life when she is diagnosed with terminal ovarian cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ONOsIo5gby9hABPdknL7OAYBLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26976'),
  ('40159478458829778', 'Witch from Nepal', 1986, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Chui Jing-Hong', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Yammie Lam Kit-Ying, Emily Chu Bo-Yee, Dick Wei, Ng Hong-Sang, Buffalo Tang Tai-Wo', null, 'A Hong Kong man goes on vacation to Nepal where a local tribe imbues him with magical powers which he must use to fight a growing evil.', 'A Hong Kong man goes on vacation to Nepal where a local tribe imbues him with magical powers which he must use to fight a growing evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPcJfpI1vYQSGNu198HgJGxaD60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250638'),
  ('689052263898040009', 'Witch Hunt', 1994, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Paul Schrader, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Joseph Dougherty', 'Dennis Hopper, Penelope Ann Miller, Eric Bogosian, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Julian Sands, Valerie Mahaffey, John Epperson, Debi Mazar', null, 'Magic and murder connect an actress, a private eye, a senator and a witch in 1950s Hollywood.', 'Magic and murder connect an actress, a private eye, a senator and a witch in 1950s Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmOXxbrAN013vKE2BJXIyl46hLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41595'),
  ('181525630858368236', 'Witch Hunt', 2008, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Don Hardy Jr., Dana Nachman', null, 'Sean Penn', null, 'Executive Producer Sean Penn presents "Witch Hunt," a gripping indictment of the American justice system told through the lens of one small town. Voters in Bakersfield, California elected a tough on crime district attorney into office for more than 25 years. During his tenure he convicted dozens of innocent working class moms and dads. They went to prison, some for decades, before being exonerated. He remains in office today. This story on a micro level mirrors what the US has experienced over the last eight years. When power is allowed to exist without oversight civil rights are in jeopardy.', 'Executive Producer Sean Penn presents "Witch Hunt," a gripping indictment of the American justice system told through the lens of one small town. Voters in Bakersfield, California elected a tough on crime district attorney into office for more than 25 years. During his tenure he convicted dozens of innocent working class moms and dads. They went to prison, some for decades, before being exonerated. He remains in office today. This story on a micro level mirrors what the US has experienced over the last eight years. When power is allowed to exist without oversight civil rights are in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d48eaPyxqVrFgHgI35GF0SkSFxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43734'),
  ('323688822166312340', 'Witch Hunt', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Nico Aguilar, Jordan Little, Anthony Ruff', 'Elle Callahan', 'Gideon Adlon, Abigail Cowen, Elizabeth Mitchell, Echo Campbell, Cameron Crovetti, Nicholas Crovetti, Lulu Antariksa, Natasha Tina Liu', 'R', 'In a modern America where witches are real and witchcraft is illegal, a sheltered teenager must face her own demons and prejudices as she helps two young witches avoid law enforcement and cross the southern border to asylum in Mexico.', 'In a modern America where witches are real and witchcraft is illegal, a sheltered teenager must face her own demons and prejudices as she helps two young witches avoid law enforcement and cross the southern border to asylum in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHKlIci8f38GaAd361EW0VSx91k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670429'),
  ('45328277477021902', 'Witch Story', 1989, 'Horror', 'Alessandro Capone, Kevin Kirton, Bill Williams', 'Rosario Galli', 'Amy Adams, Pierre Agostino, Jeff Bankert, Ian Bannen, Bob Bouchard, John Boyd, Charon Butler, Todd Conner', null, 'A young girl and her brother take some friends on trip to check out a house the pair has just inherited. What they don''t know is that the house is haunted by demons and the ghost of a woman who was burned at the stake as a witch, and who now plans to take revenge by killing off the siblings and their friends.', 'A young girl and her brother take some friends on trip to check out a house the pair has just inherited. What they don''t know is that the house is haunted by demons and the ghost of a woman who was burned at the stake as a witch, and who now plans to take revenge by killing off the siblings and their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mGEg3VeoAA5Qw6vtdEVOeT0UF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102013'),
  ('149836553744597542', 'Witch''s Cradle', 1944, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Maya Deren', null, 'Pajorita Matta, Marcel Duchamp', null, 'The surrealist film shows repetitive imagery involving a string fashioned in a bizarre, almost spiderweb-like pattern over the hands of several individuals, most notably an unnamed young woman and an elderly gentleman. The film also shows a shadowy darkness and people filmed at odd angles, an exposed human heart, and other occult symbols and ritualistic imagery which evokes an unsettling and dream-like aura. Considered an unfinished film.', 'The surrealist film shows repetitive imagery involving a string fashioned in a bizarre, almost spiderweb-like pattern over the hands of several individuals, most notably an unnamed young woman and an elderly gentleman. The film also shows a shadowy darkness and people filmed at odd angles, an exposed human heart, and other occult symbols and ritualistic imagery which evokes an unsettling and dream-like aura. Considered an unfinished film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN6XtnX0L8tC2WkvbqMhcz4RE3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47425'),
  ('61169373966935189', 'Witchblade', 2000, 'TV Movie, Action, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Ralph Hemecker, Anghel Decca', 'J. D. Zeik', 'Yancy Butler, Anthony Cistaro, Conrad Dunn, David Chokachi, Kenneth Welsh, Will Yun Lee, Eric Etebari, Lazar Rockwood', 'PG-13', 'NYPD Detective Sara Pezzini''s main goal in life was to bring down Tommy Gallo, the hitman who killed her father, her best friend, and eventually her partner. While chasing down one of Gallo''s thugs, she acquires the Witchblade, an enchanted armored glove once used by Joan of Arc that deflects bullets, extends into bladed weapons, produces visions, and neatly compacts itself into a bracelet.', 'NYPD Detective Sara Pezzini''s main goal in life was to bring down Tommy Gallo, the hitman who killed her father, her best friend, and eventually her partner. While chasing down one of Gallo''s thugs, she acquires the Witchblade, an enchanted armored glove once used by Joan of Arc that deflects bullets, extends into bladed weapons, produces visions, and neatly compacts itself into a bracelet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeYnBrsunBHdeMkYIXzcXgypLI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174797'),
  ('618992237390174805', 'Witchboard', 1986, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kevin Tenney, Roy H. Wagner, Robin Jones', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Todd Allen, Tawny Kitaen, Stephen Nichols, Kathleen Wilhoite, Burke Byrnes, James W. Quinn, Rose Marie, Judy Tatum', 'R', 'Playing around with a Ouija board, a trio of friends succeeds in contacting the spirit of a young boy. Trouble begins when the evil spirit, Malfeitor, takes over one of their bodies.', 'Playing around with a Ouija board, a trio of friends succeeds in contacting the spirit of a young boy. Trouble begins when the evil spirit, Malfeitor, takes over one of their bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5lDHBzEgBkgAarXpUl56u2vM8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17994'),
  ('576987129893968727', 'Witchboard', 2025, 'Horror', 'Chuck Russell, Yaron Levy', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Madison Iseman, Aaron Dominguez, Mel Jarnson, Charlie Tahan, Antonia Desplat, Jamie Campbell Bower, David La Haye, Victoria Lenhardt', 'R', 'A cursed Witchboard awakens dark forces, dragging a young couple into a deadly game of possession, deception, and supernatural terror in New Orleans.', 'A cursed Witchboard awakens dark forces, dragging a young couple into a deadly game of possession, deception, and supernatural terror in New Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RcN5FHkJVNJdOaL6WtTePU7CyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1107325'),
  ('385909319114569223', 'Witchboard 2', 1993, 'Mystery, Horror', 'David Lewis, Kevin Tenney', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Ami Dolenz, Timothy Gibbs, Laraine Newman, John Gatins, Julie Michaels, Christopher Michael Moore, Sarah Kaite Coughlan, Marvin Kaplan', 'R', 'A young woman starts receiving messages through a Ouija board, claiming to be from the former occupant of her apartment.', 'A young woman starts receiving messages through a Ouija board, claiming to be from the former occupant of her apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apQdrG3dYseOFsLTatijYHQtZQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40251'),
  ('273222678010508899', 'Witchboard III: The Possession', 1997, 'Drama, Horror', 'Peter Svatek, Barry Gravelle', 'Jon Ezrine', 'David Nerman, Elizabeth Lambert, Cedric Smith, Donna Sarrasin, Danette MacKay, Addison Bell, Richard Zeman, Bernard Bourgault', 'R', 'Brian, an out-of-work stockbroker, is introduced by his landlord Mr. Redman to a new source of insider information: the Ouija! The Ouija makes him rich, but when Mr. Redman kills himself and Brian suffers a freak accident, Brian''s wife starts noticing changes in her husband...', 'Brian, an out-of-work stockbroker, is introduced by his landlord Mr. Redman to a new source of insider information: the Ouija! The Ouija makes him rich, but when Mr. Redman kills himself and Brian suffers a freak accident, Brian''s wife starts noticing changes in her husband...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atfbGfESaNEvFkG1U2BeOCpXakK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40252'),
  ('700703107323606575', 'Witchcraft', 1964, 'Horror', 'Don Sharp, Arthur Lavis, Frank Nesbitt', 'Harry Spalding', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Jack Hedley, Jill Dixon, David Weston, Diane Clare, Yvette Rees, Viola Keats, Marie Ney', null, 'When her grave is disturbed by modern-day land developers, a 300-year-old witch is accidentally resurrected and terrorizes an English village.', 'When her grave is disturbed by modern-day land developers, a 300-year-old witch is accidentally resurrected and terrorizes an English village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXxxW0Gl66xqwJE9fpTLN0bPqBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83519'),
