  ('814281191771599542', 'Witchcraft 666: The Devil''s Mistress', 1994, 'Horror', 'Julie Davis, Denis Maloney', 'Peter E. Fleming, Julie Davis', 'Jerry Spicer, Debra Beatty, Shannon McLeod, Craig Stepp, Kurt Alan, John E. Holiday, Bryan Nutter, Stephanie Swinney', 'R', 'A serial killer targets young women wearing gold crosses; Detectives Lutz and Garner enlist Will Spanner to help with the occult angles of the case.', 'A serial killer targets young women wearing gold crosses; Detectives Lutz and Garner enlist Will Spanner to help with the occult angles of the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRU3jc9vat2Bb8i1NrBVdpqiQvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111749'),
  ('955825927724000125', 'Witchcraft II: The Temptress', 1990, 'Horror', 'Jens Sturup, Mark Woods', 'Jim Hanson, Sal Manna', 'Delia Sheppard, Charles Solomon Jr., David Homb, Mia M. Ruiz, John Henry Richardson, Cheryl Janecky, Mary Shelley, Frank Woods', 'R', 'Witch from the first Witchcraft movie stalks the now teenage child. She attempts to kill his friends in order to slowly corrupt him to Satan. However the boy is able to defeat the evil Satanic witch, and not enter into Evil with her', 'Witch from the first Witchcraft movie stalks the now teenage child. She attempts to kill his friends in order to slowly corrupt him to Satan. However the boy is able to defeat the evil Satanic witch, and not enter into Evil with her', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbWTMYwYLxetFWmApRmadP4Ujx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84951'),
  ('332420066105069540', 'Witchcraft III: The Kiss of Death', 1991, 'Horror', 'Rachel Feldman, John Thomas', 'Jerry Daly', 'Charles Solomon Jr., Lisa Toothman, Domonic Luciana, Leana Hall, William Lewis Baker, Sha Bennett, Nicole Lauren, Ahmad Reese', 'R', 'A warlock refuses to use his powers for evil, but comes across another warlock who isn''t bothered by such trivial matters. In fact, the evil warlock falls for the good warlock''s girlfriend, and decides to get rid of his competition so he can turn the girlfriend into one of his many sex slaves. The good warlock, not quite sure how to handle the situation, turns to an African witch doctor for help.', 'A warlock refuses to use his powers for evil, but comes across another warlock who isn''t bothered by such trivial matters. In fact, the evil warlock falls for the good warlock''s girlfriend, and decides to get rid of his competition so he can turn the girlfriend into one of his many sex slaves. The good warlock, not quite sure how to handle the situation, turns to an African witch doctor for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7uC5tUgEG0M02ooTvs17VipUla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203022'),
  ('42708619828160317', 'Witchcraft IV: The Virgin Heart', 1992, 'Horror', 'James Merendino, Kevin Morrisey', 'James Merendino, Michael Paul Girard', 'Charles Solomon Jr., Julie Strain, Clive Pearson, Lisa Jay Harrington, Erol Landis, Orien Richman, Sunset Thomas, Jason Black', 'R', 'Rock musicians are selling their souls to the devil for fame and fortune. An attorney with magical powers attempts to stop it.', 'Rock musicians are selling their souls to the devil for fame and fortune. An attorney with magical powers attempts to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Wh1pZOmqr4qISPxuqwlaeNreec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203021'),
  ('673494497550405370', 'Witchcraft IX: Bitter Flesh', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Paul Girard, Jeff Gatesman', 'Stephen Downing', 'Landon Hall, David Byrnes, Stephanie Beaton, Mikul Robins, Julius Antonio, Leah Kourtne Ballantine, Joseph Haggerty, Christian Malmin', null, 'Will Spanner, parted from his body, finds a hooker who can hear him; meanwhile Detectives Lutz and Garner investigate a string of murders seemingly tied to ancient Egypt.', 'Will Spanner, parted from his body, finds a hooker who can hear him; meanwhile Detectives Lutz and Garner investigate a string of murders seemingly tied to ancient Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOkxgISrTxTZIJfXywOpHCFT1ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28083'),
  ('590621718787208064', 'Witchcraft V: Dance with the Devil', 1993, 'Horror', 'Talun Hsu, Denis Maloney', 'Steve Tymon, James Merendino', 'Marklen Kennedy, Carolyn Taye-Loren, Nicole Sassaman, David Huffman, Lenny Rose, Freddy Andreiuci, Kimberly Bolin, Ralph Sturges', 'R', 'An evil warlock takes over a rock club. He uses beautiful, large-breasted and frequently nude women to try to collect enough souls so that he may be able to bring Satan to Earth.', 'An evil warlock takes over a rock club. He uses beautiful, large-breasted and frequently nude women to try to collect enough souls so that he may be able to bring Satan to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWZu6Yu5UhkZ1RZjh0pwpSxnQwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177901'),
