  ('621554236755623831', 'Witchcraft vs. Curse', 1991, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Fong Yau, Hoh Tin-Shing', 'Fong Yau, Hoh Tin-Shing', 'Tsang Siu-Yin, Ng Gong, Yim Hung Chung, Lindzay Chan, Michiko Nishiwaki, Yeung Chak-Lam', null, 'Hung is disappointed when her man, Yuk Lung, becomes engaged to pretty Pai Lin. Hung and her scheming mother engage a sorcerer, Ko Yin Yau, to place a spell on him. Yuk Lung becomes possessed by the Adultery Ghost, and he leaves Pai Lin in the middle of having sex with her, going to Hung. Pai Lin and her friend Nancy rush to Thailand, seeking the help of another sorcerer, Simol. The title alludes to the battle of the two spell-casters, through their two hosts. Along the way, plenty of excuses are found to get all the clothes off a number of lovely young women.', 'Hung is disappointed when her man, Yuk Lung, becomes engaged to pretty Pai Lin. Hung and her scheming mother engage a sorcerer, Ko Yin Yau, to place a spell on him. Yuk Lung becomes possessed by the Adultery Ghost, and he leaves Pai Lin in the middle of having sex with her, going to Hung. Pai Lin and her friend Nancy rush to Thailand, seeking the help of another sorcerer, Simol. The title alludes to the battle of the two spell-casters, through their two hosts. Along the way, plenty of excuses are found to get all the clothes off a number of lovely young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TJ9UokiBmtKskNAo5Z6IlGEEHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230887'),
  ('1030278920752789890', 'Witchcraft X: Mistress of the Craft', 1999, 'Horror', 'Donna Gyarmati, Elisar Cabrera, Frank Scantori', 'Elisar Cabrera', 'Wendy Cooper, Eileen Daly, Kerry Knowlton, Stephanie Beaton, Sean Harry, Frank Scantori, Emily Booth, Talitha Tallett', 'NR', 'In England, bisexual British vampires free Californian Satanist Hyde from police custody; LAPD Detective Lutz and Interpol''s Bureau 17 try to catch them.', 'In England, bisexual British vampires free Californian Satanist Hyde from police custody; LAPD Detective Lutz and Interpol''s Bureau 17 try to catch them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zESF4uxCw5oHSKazhhMly327IbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203025'),
  ('1081754429327637797', 'Witchery', 1988, 'Horror', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Fabrizio Laurenti', 'Daniele Stroppa, Harry Spalding', 'David Hasselhoff, Linda Blair, Catherine Hickland, Hildegard Knef, Annie Ross, Leslie Cumming, Robert Champagne, Rick Farnsworth', 'R', 'A student and her photographer boyfriend visit an island off of Massachusetts to research a hotel supposedly haunted by a witch.', 'A student and her photographer boyfriend visit an island off of Massachusetts to research a hotel supposedly haunted by a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCcAeP1Vqz8KkPlKMcceJbqV8Ud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4457'),
  ('603692017755528214', 'Witches', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Elizabeth Sankey, Chloë Thomson', 'Elizabeth Sankey', 'Elizabeth Sankey, Sophia Di Martino, Catherine Cho, David Emson, Shema Tariq, Milli Richards, Lucy Warwick-Guasp, Krystal Wilkinson', null, 'Elizabeth Sankey''s deeply personal documentary examines the relationship between the cinematic portrayals of witches and the all-too-real experiences of postpartum depression by utilizing footage that spans the entirety of film history alongside heartrending personal testimony.', 'Elizabeth Sankey''s deeply personal documentary examines the relationship between the cinematic portrayals of witches and the all-too-real experiences of postpartum depression by utilizing footage that spans the entirety of film history alongside heartrending personal testimony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdQLz6TmexpUBVKY1cLdf9EZTYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276031'),
  ('1129681709483425712', 'Witches in the Woods', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jordan Barker', 'Christopher Borrelli', 'Hannah Kasulka, Craig Arnold, Sasha Clements, Corbin Bleu, Alexander De Jordy, Humberly González, Kyle Mac, Ian Matthews', null, 'A group of students head off for a snowboarding adventure on an untouched piece of land. When their SUV mysteriously stalls in a brutal snowstorm they are not only faced with the reality of freezing to death but a fate even more horrifying. For they have become stranded in Stoughton Valley, home of some Witch Trials even more horrendous than Salem, and are being hunted by a supernatural creature determined to keep them there.', 'A group of students head off for a snowboarding adventure on an untouched piece of land. When their SUV mysteriously stalls in a brutal snowstorm they are not only faced with the reality of freezing to death but a fate even more horrifying. For they have become stranded in Stoughton Valley, home of some Witch Trials even more horrendous than Salem, and are being hunted by a supernatural creature determined to keep them there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYlHTdKFnhjNsJ0jvHMsJCIFG0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614204'),
  ('278927412948656810', 'Witches of Amityville', 2020, 'Horror', 'Becca Hirani', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Kira Reed Lorsch, Donna Spangler, Sarah T. Cohen, Nicola Wright, Jake Francis, Amanda-Jade Tyler, Toby Wynn-Davies, Barbara Dabson', null, 'Jessica accepts an invitation to study at the private and exclusive Amityville Academy. After her induction, she realizes that it''s a coven of evil witches trying to summon and unleash the demon Botis in order to spread terror throughout the world.', 'Jessica accepts an invitation to study at the private and exclusive Amityville Academy. After her induction, she realizes that it''s a coven of evil witches trying to summon and unleash the demon Botis in order to spread terror throughout the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iy18iNg3jQOlvsUjrcKeEOf6hv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750121'),
