  ('913774705789749112', 'Witchouse', 1999, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Gabriel Kosuth, Viorel Sergovici', 'Matthew Jason Walsh', 'Ariauna Albright, Matt Raftery, Monica Serene Garnich, Brooke Mueller, Ashley McKinney, Dave Oren Ward, Ryan Scott Greene, Marissa Tait', 'R', 'On Mayday 1998 in the town of Dunwich, Massachusetts, Elizabeth gathers together a group of specially selected friends for a rather odd party. It turns out that she is the descendent of a malevolent witch named Lilith who was burned at the stake precisely three hundred years ago. Now Elizabeth hopes to resurrect her dreadful ancestor and has a specific (and murderous) need for the guests she has chosen', 'On Mayday 1998 in the town of Dunwich, Massachusetts, Elizabeth gathers together a group of specially selected friends for a rather odd party. It turns out that she is the descendent of a malevolent witch named Lilith who was burned at the stake precisely three hundred years ago. Now Elizabeth hopes to resurrect her dreadful ancestor and has a specific (and murderous) need for the guests she has chosen', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvofpT5xe7bmVOJVsDtc3vfy9lJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139484'),
