  ('976896287779296259', 'With Byrd at the South Pole', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Julian Johnson', 'Julian Johnson', 'Floyd Gibbons, Richard E. Byrd', null, 'With Byrd at the South Pole (1930) is a documentary film about Rear Admiral Richard E. Byrd and his 1st quest to the South Pole beginning at the Little America-Exploration Base. The film''s soundtrack consists mostly of music and sound effects, with narration read by Floyd Gibbons. The film won at the 3rd Academy Awards for Best Cinematography.', 'With Byrd at the South Pole (1930) is a documentary film about Rear Admiral Richard E. Byrd and his 1st quest to the South Pole beginning at the Little America-Exploration Base. The film''s soundtrack consists mostly of music and sound effects, with narration read by Floyd Gibbons. The film won at the 3rd Academy Awards for Best Cinematography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PZHvCe8b0uvIixnhXL6pst9wfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101383'),
