  ('273014580831263849', 'With Fire and Sword', 1999, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Grzegorz Kędzierski, Jerzy Hoffman', 'Jerzy Hoffman, Andrzej Krakowski', 'Izabella Scorupco, Alexandr Domogarov, Michał Żebrowski, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Bohdan Stupka, Andrzej Seweryn, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Wiktor Zborowski', null, 'In the mid-17th century, Poland was the largest, most democratic, and most tolerant country in Europe. However, a tragic civil war brought about the gradual decline of the once glorious republic... An epic story about the Ukrainian uprising against the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth magnates in the 17th Century.', 'In the mid-17th century, Poland was the largest, most democratic, and most tolerant country in Europe. However, a tragic civil war brought about the gradual decline of the once glorious republic... An epic story about the Ukrainian uprising against the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth magnates in the 17th Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxU0LgylPjRhHkzATXawtws5r23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31273'),
