  ('612914072018330359', 'With Love and Hisses', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Anita Garvin, Janet Gaynor, Viola Richard, Symona Boniface, Josephine Dunn', null, 'Dimwitted Cuthbert Hope is enlisted in the army, and gets himself and his sergeant in constant trouble.', 'Dimwitted Cuthbert Hope is enlisted in the army, and gets himself and his sergeant in constant trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEuUchexOPCfINUeEB7ILhTjsDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50920'),
  ('536807112939193735', 'With Love, Christmas', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Mike Kam, Marita Grabiak', 'Marcy Holland, Danni Hodson', 'Emilie Ullerup, Aaron O''Connell, Rebecca Davis, Lindsay Winch, Kazumi Evans, Milo Shandel, Rustin Gresiuk, Jett Klyne', 'G', 'Advertising execs Melanie Welsh and Donovan Goodwin disagree on a cellphone Christmas commercial they’re pitching. He says his sleek design will win over the client but she knows it lacks holiday spirit.', 'Advertising execs Melanie Welsh and Donovan Goodwin disagree on a cellphone Christmas commercial they’re pitching. He says his sleek design will win over the client but she knows it lacks holiday spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nbTHrFz2hPH1TkG3K92UkYPKyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474976'),
  ('625153898531997082', 'With Love... from the Age of Reason', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yann Samuell, Antoine Roch', 'Yann Samuell', 'Sophie Marceau, Jonathan Zaccaï, Marton Csokas, Michel Duchaussoy, Thierry Hancisse, Déborah Marique, Emmanuelle Grönvold, Juliette Chappey', null, 'The day she turns 40, Marguerite Flora, a successful rep for a nuclear power company, begins receiving letters she''d sent to herself at age seven. The letters tell her what to do if her life hasn''t turned out the way she thought it should, when she was living in poverty with her mother and brother in a small village in southern France. She decides to go back to her birthplace to get the lawyer to stop the letters, but also to visit her childhood sweetheart and her long-forgotten brother, in order to find peace within herself.', 'The day she turns 40, Marguerite Flora, a successful rep for a nuclear power company, begins receiving letters she''d sent to herself at age seven. The letters tell her what to do if her life hasn''t turned out the way she thought it should, when she was living in poverty with her mother and brother in a small village in southern France. She decides to go back to her birthplace to get the lawyer to stop the letters, but also to visit her childhood sweetheart and her long-forgotten brother, in order to find peace within herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhn8obmeebHKhnzmI0fX5URV9ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51090'),
  ('968802773166363916', 'With My Heart in Yambo', 2011, 'Documentary', 'María Fernanda Restrepo, François Laso', 'María Fernanda Restrepo', 'María Fernanda Restrepo, Pedro Restrepo, Doris Morán', null, 'Filmmaker María Fernanda Restrepo reconstructs events that led to her older brothers'' murders at the hands of Ecuadorian police.', 'Filmmaker María Fernanda Restrepo reconstructs events that led to her older brothers'' murders at the hands of Ecuadorian police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4NLaRk4uZG0K6sRBdSBaCIsESb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390244'),
  ('201073443630167344', 'With Open Arms', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Guilbert, Philippe de Chauveron', 'Guy Laurent, Marc de Chauveron', 'Christian Clavier, Ary Abittan, Elsa Zylberstein, Cyril Lecomte, Nanou Garcia, Oscar Berthe, Mirela Nicolau, Ioana Visalon', null, 'Jean-Étienne Fougerole is an intellectual bohemian who released his new novel "In Open Arms" and calling the wealthiest people to welcome home the families in need. While he promotes his book during a televised debate, his opponent criticized him for not applying what he himself advocates. While stuck, Jean-Étienne Fougerole accepts the challenge, for fear of being discredited. The same evening, a family of Roma rings the door of his Marnes-la-Coquette villa and the writer feels obliged to house them.', 'Jean-Étienne Fougerole is an intellectual bohemian who released his new novel "In Open Arms" and calling the wealthiest people to welcome home the families in need. While he promotes his book during a televised debate, his opponent criticized him for not applying what he himself advocates. While stuck, Jean-Étienne Fougerole accepts the challenge, for fear of being discredited. The same evening, a family of Roma rings the door of his Marnes-la-Coquette villa and the writer feels obliged to house them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80xD4q66TnfuZyM5zC4tWF0EijK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430365'),
  ('1145911682941566426', 'With or Without Kids', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Elsa Blayau, David Maria Putorti, Evgenia Alexandrova', 'Elsa Blayau, Alexis Rault, Antonin Fourlon', 'Rayane Bensetti, Bertrand Usclat, Tiphaine Daviot, Julien Pestel, Alessandra Carrillo, Joséphine Draï, Corentin Guillot, Adèle Galloy', null, 'Pio and Anaïs, a couple about to get married, announce to their friends that their wedding will be child-free. However, their friends, who are now parents, decide to bring their children along, thinking they can hide them from the bride and groom.', 'Pio and Anaïs, a couple about to get married, announce to their friends that their wedding will be child-free. However, their friends, who are now parents, decide to bring their children along, thinking they can hide them from the bride and groom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HP7uJWU9zdovVGUMtZsWfiz2AT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181161'),
  ('153973387574377454', 'With or Without Love', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Serrano', 'Olga Iglesias, David Serrano', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Angie Cepeda, Miren Ibarguren, Juana Acosta', null, 'Claudia is an attractive and enterprising thirties forming an ideal family with her husband and son. Her life is perfect, even she has a handsome lover named Paul who takes phenomenal. However, one day Paul is tired of the relationship and is bundled with Elena, a young loving but jealous when another woman ahead. Claudia asks for help from her sister to take back what is theirs and the two hatch a plan to win back Paul. The key is to get him away from Elena.', 'Claudia is an attractive and enterprising thirties forming an ideal family with her husband and son. Her life is perfect, even she has a handsome lover named Paul who takes phenomenal. However, one day Paul is tired of the relationship and is bundled with Elena, a young loving but jealous when another woman ahead. Claudia asks for help from her sister to take back what is theirs and the two hatch a plan to win back Paul. The key is to get him away from Elena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWY5qL09h6pn3KGvVIR9jDnny61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148292'),
  ('892924625461471880', 'With or Without You', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Winterbottom, Benoît Delhomme, Toby Hosking', 'John Forte', 'Christopher Eccleston, Dervla Kirwan, Yvan Attal, Alun Armstrong, Julie Graham, Doon Mackichan, Fionnula Flanagan, Lloyd Hutchinson', null, 'Rosie and Vincent know each other for ten years, and are married for five. She doesn''t like her job, he isn''t too pleased working with her dad. They''re trying to have a baby. One morning Benoit, a Frenchman and former pen pal of Rosie, whom she never met, comes to visit. Did Rosie love him? Does she love him now?', 'Rosie and Vincent know each other for ten years, and are married for five. She doesn''t like her job, he isn''t too pleased working with her dad. They''re trying to have a baby. One morning Benoit, a Frenchman and former pen pal of Rosie, whom she never met, comes to visit. Did Rosie love him? Does she love him now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaMAGlbKUlb5NoIHzD9SymMbzf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49306'),
  ('150886116178742240', 'With or Without You', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stefano Sardo, Gergely Pahornok', 'Stefano Sardo, Valentina Gaia', 'Guido Caprino, Elena Radonicich, Thony, Libero De Rienzo, Alessandro Giallocosta, Isabella Aldovini, Francesca Chillemi, Tommaso Ragno', null, 'Alice and Tommaso have been together for fifteen years; they don’t have children, he‘s a musician, she’s an actress. Invited to dinner for an announcement, their friends think it’s going to be a marriage announcement, but instead discover that decided to break up: but without drama or emotional rifts, staying friends with each other. A legitimate but naive ambition. Love stories end, because people change. And no change is, nor can it be, painless.', 'Alice and Tommaso have been together for fifteen years; they don’t have children, he‘s a musician, she’s an actress. Invited to dinner for an announcement, their friends think it’s going to be a marriage announcement, but instead discover that decided to break up: but without drama or emotional rifts, staying friends with each other. A legitimate but naive ambition. Love stories end, because people change. And no change is, nor can it be, painless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cywP0RTFDd4ryBEgUfYePo4z9ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794246'),
  ('89522781553250415', 'With Six You Get Eggroll', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Harry Stradling Jr., Ellsworth Fredericks, Howard Morris', 'Harvey Bullock, Paul Dubov, Gwen Bagni', 'Doris Day, Brian Keith, Pat Carroll, Barbara Hershey, George Carlin, Alice Ghostley, John Findlater, Elaine Devry', 'G', 'Abby McClure, a widow with three sons, and Jake Iverson, a widower with a teenage daughter, begin dating and eventually decide to get married. But they''re not prepared for the hostile reactions from their children, who are not very excited about the new union between the two families.', 'Abby McClure, a widow with three sons, and Jake Iverson, a widower with a teenage daughter, begin dating and eventually decide to get married. But they''re not prepared for the hostile reactions from their children, who are not very excited about the new union between the two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lftVCP4BmMvikPBJ40391htsyUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39225'),
  ('827056994283283958', 'With the Abraham Lincoln Brigade in Spain', 1937, 'Documentary', 'Henri Cartier-Bresson, Herbert Kline, Jacques Lemare', null, null, null, 'This advocacy documentary about the Lincoln Brigade was shot during the Spanish Civil War to raise funds for bringing wounded American volunteers home. Some 2,800 Americans enlisted in the International Brigades to fight against fascism in defense of the Spanish Republic. The film was directed by Henri Cartier-Bresson with Herbert Kline and additional photography was provided by Jacques Lemare and Robert Capa. This film is held at New York University’s Tamiment Library and is part of a vast collection of materials in the Abraham Lincoln Brigades Archive.', 'This advocacy documentary about the Lincoln Brigade was shot during the Spanish Civil War to raise funds for bringing wounded American volunteers home. Some 2,800 Americans enlisted in the International Brigades to fight against fascism in defense of the Spanish Republic. The film was directed by Henri Cartier-Bresson with Herbert Kline and additional photography was provided by Jacques Lemare and Robert Capa. This film is held at New York University’s Tamiment Library and is part of a vast collection of materials in the Abraham Lincoln Brigades Archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vinQ0lSEVNeWSdbgf2gx0OMaC4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498073'),
  ('1148033611191063434', 'With the East Wind', 1967, 'Action, Drama', 'Mario Camus', 'Mario Camus', 'Antonio Gades, María José Alfonso, Vicente Escudero, María Luisa Ponte, Antonio Ferrandis, Erasmo Pascual, José Manuel Martín, Imperio Argentina', null, 'The life of Sebastián, a 28-year-old Roma, changes drastically after he kills a man. From that moment, he must flee, experiencing the torments of loneliness, guilt, and the rejection of his people.', 'The life of Sebastián, a 28-year-old Roma, changes drastically after he kills a man. From that moment, he must flee, experiencing the torments of loneliness, guilt, and the rejection of his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hGdavPEpDP6WRekojDt1RuDFny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113025'),
  ('1110088369440971823', 'With The Grace Of a God', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Massimiliano Kuveiller, Giuseppe Barletta, Alessandro Roja', 'Alessandro Roja, Ivano Fachin', 'Tommaso Ragno, Maya Sansa, Sergio Romano, Mathe Kabe, Ahmed Hafiene, Roberta Mattei, Aldo Ottobrino, Angelica Tuccini', null, 'Back in Genoa for the first time in twenty-five years, to attend the funeral of his best friend from when he was growing up, Luca reunites with the old gang of yore. All of them are sure that the late lamented had brought it on himself, with his dissipated lifestyle. Not Luca: he wants to know, investigate, understand. He searches his memory, in a city as changed as he is, as characters and situations reemerge ghost-like from a buried past, along with Luca’s own true nature, which he thought he had definitively tamed.', 'Back in Genoa for the first time in twenty-five years, to attend the funeral of his best friend from when he was growing up, Luca reunites with the old gang of yore. All of them are sure that the late lamented had brought it on himself, with his dissipated lifestyle. Not Luca: he wants to know, investigate, understand. He searches his memory, in a city as changed as he is, as characters and situations reemerge ghost-like from a buried past, along with Luca’s own true nature, which he thought he had definitively tamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1Gms6Mev2L3kQc50kAJrOec2CV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157725'),
  ('995737472366883507', 'With the Marines at Tarawa', 1944, 'Documentary, War', 'Richard Brooks, Louis Hayward', null, 'William Lundigan', null, 'Documentary short film depicting the harrowing battle between the U.S. Marines and the Japanese for control of the Pacific island of Tarawa. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with National Archives and Records Administration in 2005.', 'Documentary short film depicting the harrowing battle between the U.S. Marines and the Japanese for control of the Pacific island of Tarawa. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with National Archives and Records Administration in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxe4nBCQFRfEhn19a9VNpcXqhcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101586'),
  ('289665841144935614', 'With the Wind', 2018, 'Drama', 'Bettina Oberli, Stéphane Kuthy', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Mélanie Thierry, Pierre Deladonchamps, Nuno Lopes, Anastasia Shevtsova, Audrey Cavelius, Patrick Lapp, Juliana Samarine', null, 'An isolated farm in a remote part of the Jura region: this is where Pauline and Alex are living in complete self-sufficient harmony with nature. Their life project is sealed by their love, their ideals and their work. The couple is now ready to take the step towards total independence, and start producing their own electricity. The arrival of Samuel, who comes to install a wind turbine, deeply troubles Pauline, upsetting their relationship and their values.', 'An isolated farm in a remote part of the Jura region: this is where Pauline and Alex are living in complete self-sufficient harmony with nature. Their life project is sealed by their love, their ideals and their work. The couple is now ready to take the step towards total independence, and start producing their own electricity. The arrival of Samuel, who comes to install a wind turbine, deeply troubles Pauline, upsetting their relationship and their values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZLVVPA2MDoIKZo5eU1wGidIpu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536666'),
  ('980795780093358643', 'With the Years We Have Left', 2022, 'Comedy, Action', 'Frank Ariza', 'Frank Ariza', 'Regina Blandón, Aislinn Derbez, Paco Tous, Manuel Vega, Estefanía de los Santos, Michelle Rodríguez, Antonia San Juan, Enrique Villén', null, 'The life of Macarena, a Spanish immigrant in the USA, becomes complicated when she has to pay a debt contracted by her father.', 'The life of Macarena, a Spanish immigrant in the USA, becomes complicated when she has to pay a debt contracted by her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVIe897guSz9i7S2MkuqCqRvrnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038130'),
  ('510168379010225853', 'With This Ring', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nzingha Stewart, Anastas N. Michos, Dwight Williams', null, 'Regina Hall, Jill Scott, Eve, Brooklyn Sudano, Deion Sanders, Stephen Bishop, Jason George, Brian J. White', null, 'After attending their friend Elise''s wedding to Nate on New Year''s Eve, Trista, a career-­driven talent agent, Viviane, a successful gossip columnist, and Amaya, a struggling actress, make a pact to get married within the year to either a new love or a man waiting in the wings. But the close friends face their own set of challenges - Trista has not gotten over her commitment-­phobic ex-­boyfriend Damon, Viviane is secretly in love with Sean, the father of her son, and Amaya is desperate to break up her boyfriend Keith''s unhappy marriage so they can live happily ever after. Each woman starts the year with high hopes and dreams of what will happen over the next 12 months... but will they all make it to the altar?', 'After attending their friend Elise''s wedding to Nate on New Year''s Eve, Trista, a career-­driven talent agent, Viviane, a successful gossip columnist, and Amaya, a struggling actress, make a pact to get married within the year to either a new love or a man waiting in the wings. But the close friends face their own set of challenges - Trista has not gotten over her commitment-­phobic ex-­boyfriend Damon, Viviane is secretly in love with Sean, the father of her son, and Amaya is desperate to break up her boyfriend Keith''s unhappy marriage so they can live happily ever after. Each woman starts the year with high hopes and dreams of what will happen over the next 12 months... but will they all make it to the altar?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R48sYK97CSQXqFnh1tLCwyyyQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321160'),
  ('1143266417263181703', 'With You in the Future', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roberto Girault', 'Roberto Girault', 'Sandra Echeverría, Michel Brown, Mariané Cartas, Fernando Cattori, Mauricio Barrientos, Diego Guzmán, Harold Azuara, Aminta Ireta', null, 'Carlos and Elena are about to sign a divorce when they receive an unexpected gift that will allow them to travel back in time. Back in the ''90s, that nostalgic era of leather jackets, rowdy hairstyles and pop-rock, they will seek to change their destiny.', 'Carlos and Elena are about to sign a divorce when they receive an unexpected gift that will allow them to travel back in time. Back in the ''90s, that nostalgic era of leather jackets, rowdy hairstyles and pop-rock, they will seek to change their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94UuKFxMiEwTjdwBMhm1y3jKKKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429299'),
  ('792302256433615273', 'With You The World Is Fun', 1983, 'Comedy, Family', 'Marie Poledňáková, Petr Slabý, Drahomíra Králová', 'Marie Poledňáková', 'Július Satinský, Jana Šulcová, Václav Postránecký, Eliška Balzerová, Pavel Nový, Zdena Studenková, Květa Fialová, Zuzana Gutheisová', null, 'Three middle-aged go for a vacation into the mountains with their children. How will they cope with their youngsters every-day needs without their wives? The annual men''s ride of three fathers becomes something like a kindergarten in the winter countryside due to the wives'' vigorous intervention. It turns out that in certain situations, fathers make better moms than moms themselves, which is especially true when moms aren''t in sight. Their parenting methods are very peculiar and cause a lot of confusion and hilarity...', 'Three middle-aged go for a vacation into the mountains with their children. How will they cope with their youngsters every-day needs without their wives? The annual men''s ride of three fathers becomes something like a kindergarten in the winter countryside due to the wives'' vigorous intervention. It turns out that in certain situations, fathers make better moms than moms themselves, which is especially true when moms aren''t in sight. Their parenting methods are very peculiar and cause a lot of confusion and hilarity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUU0tpIaTnNP5w0sUxMgUDayToc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50873'),
  ('28094680755568941', 'Wither', 2013, 'Horror', 'Tommy Wiklund, Sonny Laguna, Tommy Wiklund', 'Tommy Wiklund, David Liljeblad, Sonny Laguna', 'Patrik Almkvist, Jessica Blomkvist, Johannes Brost, Lisa Henni, Patrick Saxe, Amanda Renberg, Max Wallmo, Anna Henriksson', 'NR', 'Ida and Albin are a happy couple. They set off to a cabin in the vast Swedish woodlands to have a fun holiday with their friends. But under the floorboards is an evil that waits to be unleashed.', 'Ida and Albin are a happy couple. They set off to a cabin in the vast Swedish woodlands to have a fun holiday with their friends. But under the floorboards is an evil that waits to be unleashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJGXQyhekGgFEHUXQmuR9b3k6Iu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134812'),
  ('874656899290308259', 'Within', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Yasu Tanida, Yetee Osunsanmi, Zachary Steinback', 'Olatunde Osunsanmi', 'Sybil Darrow, Ogy Durham, Mustafa Shakir, Andres Hudson, Danny Jacobs, Andrew Caple-Shaw, Cassandra Duarden, Neno Pervan', null, 'In a Asian desert, a team of explorers learn of a newly discovered cave system and set out to explore it. However as soon as they begin the descent, it becomes clear that this was a secret that should have remained below the surface.', 'In a Asian desert, a team of explorers learn of a newly discovered cave system and set out to explore it. However as soon as they begin the descent, it becomes clear that this was a secret that should have remained below the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVEnRvjpWMPplRN5EX28cyNnVZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10042'),
  ('595903304809747462', 'Within', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Phil Claydon, James Kniest', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Michael Vartan, Erin Moriarty, Nadine Velazquez, Ronnie Gene Blevins, JoBeth Williams, Blake Jenner, Dorian Kingi, Misty Upham', 'R', 'A widower, his daughter, and his new wife move into a peaceful neighborhood. At first it appears to be a perfect neighborhood but the family quickly realize that something is not right about their new home.', 'A widower, his daughter, and his new wife move into a peaceful neighborhood. At first it appears to be a perfect neighborhood but the family quickly realize that something is not right about their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfOaPl9lfzRuMjbnJZ8joBHG1h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291413'),
  ('177813810524191693', 'Within Our Gates', 1920, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Oscar Micheaux', 'Oscar Micheaux', 'Evelyn Preer, Flo Clements, James D. Ruffin, Jack Chenault, Charles D. Lucas, Bernice Ladd, Mrs. Evelyn, William Starks', 'NR', 'Abandoned by her fiancé, an educated black woman with a traumatizing past dedicates herself to helping a near bankrupt school for impoverished black children.', 'Abandoned by her fiancé, an educated black woman with a traumatizing past dedicates herself to helping a near bankrupt school for impoverished black children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uz1ONg4DXS9VulSlgF7SOzY7Hz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77621'),
  ('259433202713214346', 'Within the Rock', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie', 'Gary J. Tunnicliffe, Adam Kane', 'Gary J. Tunnicliffe', 'Xander Berkeley, Caroline Barclay, Bradford Tatum, Brian Krause, Michael Zelniker, Duane Whitaker, Calvin Levels, Earl Boen', 'R', 'Space miners sent to stop a moon''s collision course with the earth discover a hibernating creature that soon revives and starts slaughtering the mining crew.', 'Space miners sent to stop a moon''s collision course with the earth discover a hibernating creature that soon revives and starts slaughtering the mining crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6t6YyKt2MrXCX0t01ww7jMDzxC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133714'),
  ('536808775136557996', 'Within the Woods', 1979, 'Horror', 'Sam Raimi, Tim Philo', 'Sam Raimi', 'Bruce Campbell, Ellen Sandweiss, Scott Spiegel, Mary Valenti', null, 'A group of young friends spending time at a remote cabin are pursued by a demonic force after a burial site is disturbed. Made on a small budget and starring Bruce Campbell and Ellen Sandweiss, the film was produced as a proof of concept to attract investors. Its ideas and sequences later formed the basis for Sam Raimi’s "The Evil Dead" (1981).', 'A group of young friends spending time at a remote cabin are pursued by a demonic force after a burial site is disturbed. Made on a small budget and starring Bruce Campbell and Ellen Sandweiss, the film was produced as a proof of concept to attract investors. Its ideas and sequences later formed the basis for Sam Raimi’s "The Evil Dead" (1981).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHCOOSmfNLu3spzPMoEbc3yjEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2186'),
  ('692106867566302414', 'Withnail & I', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce Robinson, Peter Hannan, Kathy Sykes', 'Bruce Robinson', 'Richard E. Grant, Paul McGann, Richard Griffiths, Ralph Brown, Michael Elphick, Daragh O''Malley, Michael Wardle, Una Brandon-Jones', 'R', 'Two out-of-work actors -- the anxious, luckless Marwood and his acerbic, alcoholic friend, Withnail -- spend their days drifting between their squalid flat, the unemployment office and the pub. When they take a holiday "by mistake" at the country house of Withnail''s flamboyantly gay uncle, Monty, they encounter the unpleasant side of the English countryside: tedium, terrifying locals and torrential rain.', 'Two out-of-work actors -- the anxious, luckless Marwood and his acerbic, alcoholic friend, Withnail -- spend their days drifting between their squalid flat, the unemployment office and the pub. When they take a holiday "by mistake" at the country house of Withnail''s flamboyantly gay uncle, Monty, they encounter the unpleasant side of the English countryside: tedium, terrifying locals and torrential rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i18cIp8A10A2JgByrfA9oIC9299.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13446'),
  ('1112187911606564370', 'Without a Clue', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Thom Eberhardt, Alan Hume, Gerry Toomey', 'Larry Strawther, Gary Murphy', 'Michael Caine, Ben Kingsley, Jeffrey Jones, Lysette Anthony, Nigel Davenport, Peter Cook, Gregor Fisher, Paul Freeman', 'PG', 'Sherlock Holmes is as dashing as ever, but with a little secret: Dr. Watson is the brains behind the operation. When Reginald Kincaid, the actor he has hired to play Holmes becomes insufferable, Watson fires him and tries to go out on his own, but finds that he has done too good a job building Holmes up in the public''s mind.', 'Sherlock Holmes is as dashing as ever, but with a little secret: Dr. Watson is the brains behind the operation. When Reginald Kincaid, the actor he has hired to play Holmes becomes insufferable, Watson fires him and tries to go out on his own, but finds that he has done too good a job building Holmes up in the public''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZmoKYDfF965UAgPrUSz0FbavsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12582'),
  ('115797409509484719', 'Without a Paddle', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Jonathan Brown, Steven Brill, Simon Ambridge', 'Mitch Rouse, Jay Leggett', 'Seth Green, Matthew Lillard, Dax Shepard, Ethan Suplee, Abraham Benrubi, Antony Starr, Burt Reynolds, Christina Moore', 'PG-13', 'Three friends, whose lives have been drifting apart, reunite for the funeral of a fourth childhood friend. When looking through their childhood belongings, they discover a trunk which contained details on a quest their friend was attempting. It revealed that he was hot on the trail of the $200,000 that went missing with airplane hijacker D.B. Cooper in 1971. They decide to continue his journey, but do not understand the dangers they will soon encounter.', 'Three friends, whose lives have been drifting apart, reunite for the funeral of a fourth childhood friend. When looking through their childhood belongings, they discover a trunk which contained details on a quest their friend was attempting. It revealed that he was hot on the trail of the $200,000 that went missing with airplane hijacker D.B. Cooper in 1971. They decide to continue his journey, but do not understand the dangers they will soon encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSQBfHDzyfzxrCLepjegVb5F8j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10762'),
  ('855725997227031426', 'Without a Paddle: Nature''s Calling', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ellory Elkayem', 'Stephen Mazur', 'Oliver James, Kristopher Turner, Rik Young, Madison Riley, Amber McDonald, Jerry Rice, Madison Bontempo, Robert Blanche', 'PG-13', 'Venturing into the woods causes nothing but trouble and hilarity for three misguided males in this straight to video spin-off of 2004''s "Without A Paddle".', 'Venturing into the woods causes nothing but trouble and hilarity for three misguided males in this straight to video spin-off of 2004''s "Without A Paddle".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXgC6OcN2UElZTB0CAQpJQ34zfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28677'),
  ('135084109754367359', 'Without a Stitch', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Annelise Meineche, Aage Wiltrup', 'Annelise Meineche, John Hilbard', 'Anne Grete Nissen, Ib Mossin, Søren Strømberg, John Martinus, Åke Engfeldt, Joan Gamst, Niels Dybeck, Ann Bennett', null, 'When a high-school girl complains of her inability to reach sexual climax, her doctor suggests that she keep a diary of her sexual encounters. She does just that and soon finds herself caught up in a sexual merry-go-round that includes making a hardcore porno film in Sweden, an escapade with a German sadist and a lesbian encounter.', 'When a high-school girl complains of her inability to reach sexual climax, her doctor suggests that she keep a diary of her sexual encounters. She does just that and soon finds herself caught up in a sexual merry-go-round that includes making a hardcore porno film in Sweden, an escapade with a German sadist and a lesbian encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTgt0Ai4BEW485l6oSg4twONQox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76321'),
  ('980836460791755165', 'Without a trace', 2023, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Eva Spreitzhofer, Eva Testor', 'Eva Spreitzhofer, Wolf Jakoby', 'Christina Cervenka, Michael Glantschnig, Dominik Warta, Julia Cencig, Gregor Seberg, Michael Weger, Caroline Frank, Fritz Egger', null, 'When Lisa''s younger sister suddenly disappears without a trace, she returns to her home village to search for the missing girl on her own. But before she can follow up a real lead, a dead girl is found by the river.', 'When Lisa''s younger sister suddenly disappears without a trace, she returns to her home village to search for the missing girl on her own. But before she can follow up a real lead, a dead girl is found by the river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXgeLmDNHLbA0UJYk2Y9RFTRklm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075540'),
  ('828998834726468902', 'Without a Trace', 1983, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stanley R. Jaffe, John Bailey', 'Beth Gutcheon', 'Kate Nelligan, Judd Hirsch, David Dukes, Stockard Channing, Jacqueline Brookes, Keith McDermott, Kathleen Widdoes, Danny Corkill', 'PG', 'English professor Susan Selky lives alone in a Brooklyn apartment with her young son, Alex. When Alex fails to return home from school one afternoon, a frantic Selky contacts the police. Detective Al Menetti, a father himself, takes an interest in the case that quickly turns into an obsession. As a devastated Selky struggles to come to terms with Alex''s disappearance, Menetti steps out from behind the badge to continue investigating.', 'English professor Susan Selky lives alone in a Brooklyn apartment with her young son, Alex. When Alex fails to return home from school one afternoon, a frantic Selky contacts the police. Detective Al Menetti, a father himself, takes an interest in the case that quickly turns into an obsession. As a devastated Selky struggles to come to terms with Alex''s disappearance, Menetti steps out from behind the badge to continue investigating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xegLaEuvt5Ii21eochgdystk6x6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47944'),
  ('402366719754378416', 'Without a Trace', 2001, 'Drama', 'María Novaro', 'María Novaro', 'Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Tiaré Scanda, Jesús Ochoa, Martín Altomaro, Gerardo Taracena, Silverio Palacios, José Sefami', null, 'A woman steals from her drug-dealer boyfriend and runs away. She meets a sympathetic woman on the way who helps her escape.', 'A woman steals from her drug-dealer boyfriend and runs away. She meets a sympathetic woman on the way who helps her escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfoci8y0lOEKsykZDrV47vjNOKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73525'),
  ('1104403605008748860', 'Without a Trace', 2018, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Jacques Maillot', 'Jean-Luc Estèbe', 'Bernard Le Coq, Esther Garrel, Grégory Montel, Lilou Fogli, Cécile Fisera, Julie Badoc, Loïc Guingand', null, 'Two mismatched strangers, Martin and Adele, try to unravel the mysterious disappearance of Martin''s son and Adele''s father, who were living together a couple.', 'Two mismatched strangers, Martin and Adele, try to unravel the mysterious disappearance of Martin''s son and Adele''s father, who were living together a couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ab1DsXMBhAiu6Ca8BDYdHxHHaIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:686749'),
  ('839780285436996370', 'Without Anesthesia', 1978, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Krystyna Grochowicz, Jolanta Jedynak', 'Krzysztof Zaleski', 'Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Ewa Dałkowska, Andrzej Seweryn, Krystyna Janda, Roman Wilhelmi, Emilia Krakowska, Kazimierz Kaczor, Magda Teresa Wójcik', null, 'A famous Polish journalist presents a problem for the powers-that-be when he displays his full political skill and knowledge on a television show featuring questions and answers on a world conference by a panel of journalists. His enemies take away his privileges when he is away. The shock of being "unwanted" parallels a deeper disappointment in his private life: his wife has an affair with a jealous young rival, and after 15 years of marriage and two daughters wants a divorce. She offers no explanations as he tries to untie these problems himself. All the moves he makes are the wrong ones. He takes on drinking heavily with students eager to attend his seminar after discovering the class has been canceled. The journalist, once suave and commanding, is reduced to silence.', 'A famous Polish journalist presents a problem for the powers-that-be when he displays his full political skill and knowledge on a television show featuring questions and answers on a world conference by a panel of journalists. His enemies take away his privileges when he is away. The shock of being "unwanted" parallels a deeper disappointment in his private life: his wife has an affair with a jealous young rival, and after 15 years of marriage and two daughters wants a divorce. She offers no explanations as he tries to untie these problems himself. All the moves he makes are the wrong ones. He takes on drinking heavily with students eager to attend his seminar after discovering the class has been canceled. The journalist, once suave and commanding, is reduced to silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxS0z1Ji4VVWZthMZpooi0Fcviu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42199'),
  ('905258810346614849', 'Without Apparent Motive', 1971, 'Crime', 'Philippe Labro, Jean Penzer', 'Vincenzo Labella, Philippe Labro, Jacques Lanzmann', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Dominique Sanda, Sacha Distel, Carla Gravina, Paul Crauchet, Laura Antonelli, Michel Bardinet, Jean-Pierre Marielle', 'PG', 'A series of murders is committed in Nice on the French riviera. The commissaire Carella is in charge and tries to find a missing link between all these murders.', 'A series of murders is committed in Nice on the French riviera. The commissaire Carella is in charge and tries to find a missing link between all these murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWYgYyux5pisHML36KW5D1ARQZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150587'),
  ('852633337403858786', 'Without Blood', 2025, 'Drama', 'Angelina Jolie, Seamus McGarvey', 'Angelina Jolie', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Demián Bichir, Juan Minujín, Andrés Delgado, Jorge Antonio Guerrero, Alfredo Herrera, Alfredo Herrera, Nika Perrone', null, 'In a frontier landscape at the beginning of the 20th century, gunmen descend on a remote farmhouse, determined to exact revenge. Their target, a doctor — alone with his son and daughter — tries desperately to protect his children. Inevitably, bullets fly.', 'In a frontier landscape at the beginning of the 20th century, gunmen descend on a remote farmhouse, determined to exact revenge. Their target, a doctor — alone with his son and daughter — tries desperately to protect his children. Inevitably, bullets fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhljcpKJbqe9qr2HRGcAIztVeJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945883'),
  ('307652367861945705', 'Without Destination', 2002, 'Drama', 'Leopoldo Laborde', 'Leopoldo Laborde', 'Francisco Rey, David Valdez, Roberto Cobo, Sylvia Vilchis, Arturo Ramírez, Mariana Gajá, Roberto Trujillo', null, 'Sin Destino follows the life of a 15 year old Mexican boy, Francisco, as he struggles to survive on the streets. His primary source of income is money raised by prostituting himself to men for sex, and the film implies that this learned behaviour has arisen as a result of a contact with a single man when Francisco was 9 years old. This man, Sebastien, is an "artist" who initially claimed to want to photograph the boy, but it is clear that their relationship at one time extended far beyond that of photographer/model.', 'Sin Destino follows the life of a 15 year old Mexican boy, Francisco, as he struggles to survive on the streets. His primary source of income is money raised by prostituting himself to men for sex, and the film implies that this learned behaviour has arisen as a result of a contact with a single man when Francisco was 9 years old. This man, Sebastien, is an "artist" who initially claimed to want to photograph the boy, but it is clear that their relationship at one time extended far beyond that of photographer/model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJb5KVl62xEhwzNsfpW86avEdfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245930'),
  ('823858159167489340', 'Without Evidence', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gill Dennis, Gus Holzer, Peter Vanderwall', 'Gill Dennis', 'Scott Plank, Anna Gunn, Angelina Jolie, Andrew Prine, Paul Perri, Kristen Peckinpah, Allen Nause, Chris Mastrandrea', 'R', 'It is based on the true story of Michael Francke, who was the Head of Corrections for the state of Oregon before being murdered. Just before his murder, Francke visits his brother and informs him of a drug ring involving his prison colleagues. When Michael is killed, his brother begins his own investigation into the murder, leading him to more lies and deceit.', 'It is based on the true story of Michael Francke, who was the Head of Corrections for the state of Oregon before being murdered. Just before his murder, Francke visits his brother and informs him of a drug ring involving his prison colleagues. When Michael is killed, his brother begins his own investigation into the murder, leading him to more lies and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngwlWUKxPSY3Y68mL3FShFAoa3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23476'),
  ('1111285200258402766', 'Without Family', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vittorio Gassman, Mario Vulpiani, Renato Rizzuto', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Vittorio Gassman', 'Vittorio Gassman, Paolo Villaggio, Fortunato Arena, Isa Bellini, Liù Bosisio, Annamaria Chio, Carlo Delle Piane, Rossana Di Lorenzo', null, 'Released from the orphanage at the age of thirty, a man dreams of finding his mother.', 'Released from the orphanage at the age of thirty, a man dreams of finding his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4pbULZEAFW3OTdNmO8XNyajVAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325645'),
  ('622674376545640790', 'Without Family', 2000, 'Drama, Family', 'Jiří Macháně, Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe', 'Frédéric Vitoux', 'Pierre Richard, Jules Sitruk, Stefano Dionisi, Veronica Ferres, Marianne Sägebrecht, Bernard Fresson, Claude Jade, Marcel Dossogne', null, 'Young Remi, a foundling, lives on the farm run by his impoverished foster parents. When their money runs out, unbeknown to his foster-mother, Rémi is sold by his hard-hearted foster father to an old street performer named Vitalis. Vitalis was once a famous opera singer, but became destitute after a tragic love affair.', 'Young Remi, a foundling, lives on the farm run by his impoverished foster parents. When their money runs out, unbeknown to his foster-mother, Rémi is sold by his hard-hearted foster father to an old street performer named Vitalis. Vitalis was once a famous opera singer, but became destitute after a tragic love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj3qaOEGoS0OfZO9xDKErYLhYn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2394'),
  ('1046043301018986136', 'Without Honor', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'Irving Pichel, Lionel Lindon', 'James Poe', 'Laraine Day, Dane Clark, Franchot Tone, Agnes Moorehead, Bruce Bennett, Frank Marlowe, Harry Lauter, Peter Virgo', 'NR', 'Jane, a housewife, is confronted during her daily chores by Dennis, her married lover with whom she has had a long affair. Dennis tells Jane that he has to break off their relationship. She threatens suicide, but when she picks up a shish kabob skewer, the two struggle and Dennis is stabbed in the chest and collapses. Jane hides the body in the house. Before she can leave, her brother-in-law arrives and tells her that he knows about the affair and that he has invited her husband, her lover, and his wife to her house that evening so that he can tell them about the affair.', 'Jane, a housewife, is confronted during her daily chores by Dennis, her married lover with whom she has had a long affair. Dennis tells Jane that he has to break off their relationship. She threatens suicide, but when she picks up a shish kabob skewer, the two struggle and Dennis is stabbed in the chest and collapses. Jane hides the body in the house. Before she can leave, her brother-in-law arrives and tells her that he knows about the affair and that he has invited her husband, her lover, and his wife to her house that evening so that he can tell them about the affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmHudoXnyEyFipjqsqzbXPwMQQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61141'),
  ('725624243084411687', 'Without Leaving an Address', 1951, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Marc Fossard', 'Alex Joffé', 'Bernard Blier, Danièle Delorme, Pierre Trabaud, Pierre Mondy, Julien Carette, France Roche, Paul Villé, Yvette Etiévant', null, 'A woman in Paris hires a taxi driver to locate her ex-lover, father to her newborn child, who left her without leaving an address.', 'A woman in Paris hires a taxi driver to locate her ex-lover, father to her newborn child, who left her without leaving an address.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0bsxvBSQWa4ZnDPjVsHxVxRc5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162344'),
