  ('783596659766024365', 'Without Witness', 1983, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Valentin Bobrovsky', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Ramiz Fataliyev, Sofya Prokofeva', 'Irina Kupchenko, Mikhail Ulyanov, Eduard Artemyev', null, 'In visiting his ex-wife’s apartment a man learns that she plans to remarry a scientist named Valentin Shlyakhov. In his past, the man wrote a scathing letter about Shlyakhov which greatly impacted his career. Fearing that this information will come to light when his ex-wife marries Shlyakhov, the man insists that the wedding be called off. What follows is an intimate portrayal of the relationship between a man and a woman (who are never named), whose history as husband and wife plays out during a heated conversation.', 'In visiting his ex-wife’s apartment a man learns that she plans to remarry a scientist named Valentin Shlyakhov. In his past, the man wrote a scathing letter about Shlyakhov which greatly impacted his career. Fearing that this information will come to light when his ex-wife marries Shlyakhov, the man insists that the wedding be called off. What follows is an intimate portrayal of the relationship between a man and a woman (who are never named), whose history as husband and wife plays out during a heated conversation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSueDoVR1RMPpXXH9I4O4hlVLfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150288'),
  ('78977039732171236', 'Without You I''m Nothing', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Joseph Yacoe, John Boskovich', 'John Boskovich, Sandra Bernhard', 'Sandra Bernhard, Steve Antin, John Doe, Lu Leonard, Ken Foree, Cynthia Bailey, Grace Broughton, Kimberli Williams', null, 'Sandra Bernhard stars in a studio version of her off-Broadway show, blending re-enactments of the original show''s pieces with concept vignettes and ''testimonials'' to underscore the relationship between a performer and an audience.', 'Sandra Bernhard stars in a studio version of her off-Broadway show, blending re-enactments of the original show''s pieces with concept vignettes and ''testimonials'' to underscore the relationship between a performer and an audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1pCEfRbvadTWQwFSJIY6VCPpgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5302'),
  ('292155251197945263', 'Witless Protection', 2008, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Charles Robert Carner', 'Charles Robert Carner', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Ivana Miličević, Jenny McCarthy, Yaphet Kotto, Peter Stormare, Eric Roberts, Joe Mantegna, Kurt Naebig', 'PG-13', 'When a small-town sheriff witnesses what he believes to be an attempted kidnapping, his effort to save the beautiful damsel in distress sets him down a wild path of comic mishap.', 'When a small-town sheriff witnesses what he believes to be an attempted kidnapping, his effort to save the beautiful damsel in distress sets him down a wild path of comic mishap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oqQn2Yp0yc52mxZH1TDn6ByOb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15365'),
  ('193453438937519376', 'Witness', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Weir, John Seale, Pamela M. Eilerson', 'William Kelley, Earl W. Wallace', 'Harrison Ford, Kelly McGillis, Josef Sommer, Lukas Haas, Jan Rubeš, Alexander Godunov, Danny Glover, Brent Jennings', 'R', 'While protecting an Amish boy—the sole witness to a brutal murder—and his mother, a detective is forced to seek refuge within their community when his own life comes under threat.', 'While protecting an Amish boy—the sole witness to a brutal murder—and his mother, a detective is forced to seek refuge within their community when his own life comes under threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOymD1rChAMykmDVEzJpIh4OYS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9281'),
  ('1068707358033861638', 'Witness for the Prosecution', 1982, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Alan Gibson, Arthur Ibbetson', 'John Gay, Billy Wilder, Harry Kurnitz', 'Ralph Richardson, Deborah Kerr, Beau Bridges, Donald Pleasence, Wendy Hiller, Diana Rigg, David Langton, Richard Vernon', 'PG', 'An ailing barrister is thrust back into the courtroom in what becomes one of the most unusual and eventful murder cases of the lawyer''s career when he finds himself defending a man being tried for the murder of a socialite.', 'An ailing barrister is thrust back into the courtroom in what becomes one of the most unusual and eventful murder cases of the lawyer''s career when he finds himself defending a man being tried for the murder of a socialite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sreUg3pWJGL24C1qV4HZLxkbZD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5972'),
  ('110841596572052812', 'Witness in the City', 1959, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Édouard Molinaro, Henri Decaë', 'Édouard Molinaro, Gérard Oury, Alain Poiré', 'Lino Ventura, Jacques Berthier, Daniel Ceccaldi, Robert Dalban, Micheline Luccioni, Franco Fabrizi, Janine Darcey, Jacques Monod', 'NR', 'Industrialist Pierre Verdier kills his mistress Jeanne Ancelin by throwing her off a train. Her husband, Ancelin, decides to take revenge on his wife''s murderer, who has been acquitted by justice.', 'Industrialist Pierre Verdier kills his mistress Jeanne Ancelin by throwing her off a train. Her husband, Ancelin, decides to take revenge on his wife''s murderer, who has been acquitted by justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KDCNs8whTsu1wf9p6lAxmKUo7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77980'),
  ('812952053045817566', 'Witness of Another World', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Alan Stivelman', 'Alan Stivelman', 'Jacques Vallée', null, 'Juan lives a solitary existence on a remote farm ever since he witnessed a UFO event. Filmmaker Alan Stivelman—together with the help of famous astrophysicist Jacques Vallée—begin an epic journey to help Juan in understanding the deep meaning of his close encounter. This true story shows the long-term consequences of close encounters, proving that no one is exempt from a potential contact.', 'Juan lives a solitary existence on a remote farm ever since he witnessed a UFO event. Filmmaker Alan Stivelman—together with the help of famous astrophysicist Jacques Vallée—begin an epic journey to help Juan in understanding the deep meaning of his close encounter. This true story shows the long-term consequences of close encounters, proving that no one is exempt from a potential contact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ip5OcMmvmelmMR0AXtVgGjPMvLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526370'),
  ('464828511178595843', 'Witness Protection', 1999, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Richard Pearce, Fred Murphy, Andrew Menzies', 'Daniel Therriault', 'Forest Whitaker, Tom Sizemore, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Shawn Hatosy, Skye McCole Bartusiak, William Sadler, Jim Metzler, Greg Pitts', 'R', 'Would you be willing to walk away from everyone and everything you''ve ever known in exchange for your safety? This is the question facing career criminal Bobby "Bats" Batton (Tom Sizemore); on the outs with the mob and facing prosecution for a number of serious crimes, Batton is offered a deal by the FBI in which he will be given immunity in exchange for testifying against his former partners. However, Batton will have to join the Federal Witness Protection Program, which means that he, his wife, and his children will never again see their friends and family.', 'Would you be willing to walk away from everyone and everything you''ve ever known in exchange for your safety? This is the question facing career criminal Bobby "Bats" Batton (Tom Sizemore); on the outs with the mob and facing prosecution for a number of serious crimes, Batton is offered a deal by the FBI in which he will be given immunity in exchange for testifying against his former partners. However, Batton will have to join the Federal Witness Protection Program, which means that he, his wife, and his children will never again see their friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEHelrqC5AFnHSjPFR8XoIF0b7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98431'),
  ('677266031005688679', 'Witness to Murder', 1954, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Roy Rowland, John Alton', 'Chester Erskine', 'Barbara Stanwyck, George Sanders, Gary Merrill, Jesse White, Harry Shannon, Claire Carleton, Lewis Martin, Dick Elliott', 'NR', 'A woman fights to convince the police that she witnessed a murder while looking out her bedroom window.', 'A woman fights to convince the police that she witnessed a murder while looking out her bedroom window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aPVHx9eiQFcj3qNW1fvy4CuwRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37635'),
  ('1147109828426213439', 'Witness to the Mob', 1998, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Thaddeus O''Sullivan, Frank Prinzi', 'Stanley Weiser', 'Nicholas Turturro, Tom Sizemore, Debi Mazar, Abe Vigoda, Philip Baker Hall, Kirk Acevedo, Adam J. Roth, Frank Vincent', null, 'Sammy ''The Bull'' Gravano was mafiosi. He started out as a soldier, but his talent for murder, including the slayings of his best friends, his wife''s brother and his own boss, Paul Castellano, saw him rise to under-boss in the Gambino crime family. However, betrayals within the family saw him break the code of silence and became the highest ranking member of the mob to turn into a rat - ''a rat in a suit,- assisting the government to finally put away the Teflon Don, John Gotti.', 'Sammy ''The Bull'' Gravano was mafiosi. He started out as a soldier, but his talent for murder, including the slayings of his best friends, his wife''s brother and his own boss, Paul Castellano, saw him rise to under-boss in the Gambino crime family. However, betrayals within the family saw him break the code of silence and became the highest ranking member of the mob to turn into a rat - ''a rat in a suit,- assisting the government to finally put away the Teflon Don, John Gotti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niX9b5Sew9GxXML09Wl5o6gLcT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64920'),
  ('884192463726106363', 'Wittgenstein', 1993, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Derek Jarman, James Welland', 'Terry Eagleton, Derek Jarman, Ken Butler', 'Clancy Chassay, Karl Johnson, Michael Gough, Tilda Swinton, Kevin Collins, Nabil Shaban, Sally Dexter, Lynn Seymour', 'NR', 'A dramatization, in modern theatrical style, of the life and thought of the Viennese-born, Cambridge-educated philosopher Ludwig Wittgenstein, whose principal interest was the nature and limits of language. A series of sketches depict the unfolding of his life from boyhood, through the era of the first World War, to his eventual Cambridge professorship and association with Bertrand Russell and John Maynard Keynes. The emphasis in these sketches is on the exposition of the ideas of Wittgenstein, a homosexual, and an intuitive, moody, proud, and perfectionistic thinker generally regarded as a genius.', 'A dramatization, in modern theatrical style, of the life and thought of the Viennese-born, Cambridge-educated philosopher Ludwig Wittgenstein, whose principal interest was the nature and limits of language. A series of sketches depict the unfolding of his life from boyhood, through the era of the first World War, to his eventual Cambridge professorship and association with Bertrand Russell and John Maynard Keynes. The emphasis in these sketches is on the exposition of the ideas of Wittgenstein, a homosexual, and an intuitive, moody, proud, and perfectionistic thinker generally regarded as a genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdUtfHPGTRjPiKMw39NUZ6z5Mn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58937'),
  ('51917671339233318', 'Witwer mit 5 Töchtern', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Willy Winterstein, Erich Engels, Franz Barrenstein', 'Erich Engels', 'Heinz Erhardt, Susanne Cramer, Helmuth Lohner, Lotte Rausch, Angelika Meissner, Vera Tschechowa, Elke Aberle, Christine Kaufmann', null, 'Father Scherzer generally buries himself in the books of the castle library, which he is responsible for managing. He is a warm-hearted but somewhat overwhelmed father to his five daughters, ranging from a preschooler to two teenage girls to a successful press photographer who flirts with a dashing dentist. While he is trying to sell the castle to an overbearing American millionaire, the housekeeper quits, and the youth welfare office insists on discipline and order in the five-girl household.', 'Father Scherzer generally buries himself in the books of the castle library, which he is responsible for managing. He is a warm-hearted but somewhat overwhelmed father to his five daughters, ranging from a preschooler to two teenage girls to a successful press photographer who flirts with a dashing dentist. While he is trying to sell the castle to an overbearing American millionaire, the housekeeper quits, and the youth welfare office insists on discipline and order in the five-girl household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9H22LZbVF5h1GJIlsBYT5MqZFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6913'),
  ('956151185886916415', 'Wives Under Suspicion', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Whale, George Robinson, Charles Previn', 'Myles Connolly', 'Warren William, Gail Patrick, Ralph Morgan, William Lundigan, Constance Moore, Cecil Cunningham, Jonathan Hale, Lillian Yarbo', null, 'A merciless district attorney prosecutes a case that mirrors his own life.', 'A merciless district attorney prosecutes a case that mirrors his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDQJ1kWms6662Ytau4ReQubyH3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130243'),
  ('1070487279898589004', 'Wizards', 1977, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Ralph Bakshi, Ted C. Bemiller, Irven Spence', 'Ralph Bakshi', 'Bob Holt, Jesse Welles, Richard Romanus, David Proval, Mark Hamill, Jim Connell, Steve Gravers, Barbara Sloane', 'PG', 'After the death of his mother, evil mutant wizard Blackwolf discovers long-lost military technologies. Full of ego and ambition, Blackwolf claims his mother''s throne, assembles an army, and sets out to brainwash and conquer Earth. Meanwhile, Blackwolf''s gentle twin brother, the bearded sage Avatar, calls upon his own magical abilities to foil Blackwolf''s plans for world domination — even if it means eliminating his own flesh and blood.', 'After the death of his mother, evil mutant wizard Blackwolf discovers long-lost military technologies. Full of ego and ambition, Blackwolf claims his mother''s throne, assembles an army, and sets out to brainwash and conquer Earth. Meanwhile, Blackwolf''s gentle twin brother, the bearded sage Avatar, calls upon his own magical abilities to foil Blackwolf''s plans for world domination — even if it means eliminating his own flesh and blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeAxoYepnVirGe0H7pmwviSZYul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16220'),
  ('979009213879480416', 'Wizards of the Lost Kingdom', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Leonardo Rodríguez Solís, Héctor Olivera', 'Ed Naha', 'Bo Svenson, Vidal Peterson, Thom Christopher, Barbara Stock, María Socas, Augusto Larreta, Marcos Woinsky, Edward Morrow', 'PG', 'Simon, son of the king, must flee when the empire is overthrown by the evil Shurka. Schooled in the arts of magic, he must find the Ring of Magic and the Sword of Power and defeat the wizard who killed his father. He is joined in his quest by the swordmaster Kor, his faithful protector Gulfax, and the Forest Wizard Hurla.', 'Simon, son of the king, must flee when the empire is overthrown by the evil Shurka. Schooled in the arts of magic, he must find the Ring of Magic and the Sword of Power and defeat the wizard who killed his father. He is joined in his quest by the swordmaster Kor, his faithful protector Gulfax, and the Forest Wizard Hurla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DHquDuiTx0Wp1SOH0oZSQUbkvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7234'),
  ('479138278138899511', 'Wizards of the Lost Kingdom II', 1989, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Charles B. Griffith, Geza Sinkovics', 'Charles B. Griffith, Lance Smith', 'Mel Welles, Robert Jayne, David Carradine, Susan Lee Hoffman, Blake Bahner, Lana Clarkson, Henry Brandon, Wayne Grace', 'PG', 'Three kingdoms have been overtaken by three evil lords and only Tyor, a teenage boy with magical powers, can restore peace to the land with the help of a bumbling elder, wizard and a hero in each kingdom. Tyor fights alongside them and eventually becomes a powerful wizard in his own right.', 'Three kingdoms have been overtaken by three evil lords and only Tyor, a teenage boy with magical powers, can restore peace to the land with the help of a bumbling elder, wizard and a hero in each kingdom. Tyor fights alongside them and eventually becomes a powerful wizard in his own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39Emk29cNi1lBfW86yGFCVOawzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7237'),
  ('696163112938990787', 'Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie', 2009, 'Family, TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Lev L. Spiro, Raphy Molinary, David A. Makin', 'Dan Berendsen', 'Selena Gomez, David Henrie, Jake T. Austin, Maria Canals-Barrera, David DeLuise, Steve Valentine, Jennifer Alden, Xavier Torres', 'PG', 'A young wizard accidentally conjures a spell that puts her family in jeopardy.', 'A young wizard accidentally conjures a spell that puts her family in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrjLcGBLurVem5lXN8237qz4tyE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26736'),
  ('102666174854029864', 'wkw/tk/1996@7''55''''hk.net', 1996, 'Romance', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Christopher Doyle', null, 'Tadanobu Asano, Karen Mok Man-Wai', null, 'A Japanese-Chinese couple hangs out and shoots each other.', 'A Japanese-Chinese couple hangs out and shoots each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orOngXdKBDRtv0nvaZibfuPKuft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259463'),
