  ('991388392019525992', 'Wodaabe: Herdsmen of the Sun', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', null, 'Herzog''s documentary of the Wodaabe people of the Sahara/Sahel region. Particular attention is given to the tribe''s spectacular courtship rituals and ''beauty pageants'', where eligible young men strive to outshine each other and attract mates by means of lavish makeup, posturing and facial movements.', 'Herzog''s documentary of the Wodaabe people of the Sahara/Sahel region. Particular attention is given to the tribe''s spectacular courtship rituals and ''beauty pageants'', where eligible young men strive to outshine each other and attract mates by means of lavish makeup, posturing and facial movements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8omhuFpeCC3WFu3kd89hMZ4CY0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36880'),
  ('352269590434237976', 'Woe to the Young', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Vassilis Mariolis', 'Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Dimitris Horn, Maro Kodou, Smaro Stefanidou, Spyros Mousouris, Andreas Douzos, Nikos Fermas, Eva Evangelidou, Giorgos Velentzas', null, 'Two rich old friends, Andreas and Agisilaos are in love with young Rita. Andreas believes that is youth and not money that drive the world. He sells his soul to the devil, becomes young and flirts Rita. However, Andreas understands that youth alone is not enough and decides to give a dowry to lovely Rita so that she can marry the one she loves.', 'Two rich old friends, Andreas and Agisilaos are in love with young Rita. Andreas believes that is youth and not money that drive the world. He sells his soul to the devil, becomes young and flirts Rita. However, Andreas understands that youth alone is not enough and decides to give a dowry to lovely Rita so that she can marry the one she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVtDRVKAZGP8sohUH4h9LybMxoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409870'),
  ('532910922716900926', 'Wojnarowicz: Fuck You Faggot Fucker', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Chris McKim', null, 'Fran Lebowitz, David Wojnarowicz, Alan Barrows, Barry Blinderman, Nan Goldin', null, 'A collage-like, incisive look at the life of writer, painter and thinker David Wojnarowicz, whose powerful, unapologetic way of seeing the world gave voice to queer rights at a critical time in US history.', 'A collage-like, incisive look at the life of writer, painter and thinker David Wojnarowicz, whose powerful, unapologetic way of seeing the world gave voice to queer rights at a critical time in US history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTToc9TY2D3XXDM1MVDfQTP1JUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685263'),
  ('95029030704219782', 'Wok the Kasbah', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Benamou', 'Nicolas Benamou, Jérôme Borenstejn', 'Nader Boussandel, Vincent Lacoste, Tien Shué, Alice Belaïdi, Azeddine Benamara, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Claude Gensac, Julie Ferrier', null, 'A funny comedy about the war suddenly started between two restaurant owners families.', 'A funny comedy about the war suddenly started between two restaurant owners families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPwioid4rOUUkj7oDcwRRqcl9GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118354'),
  ('892025513606973068', 'Woken', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Alan Friel, Richard Kendrick', 'Alan Friel', 'Erin Kellyman, Maxine Peake, Peter McDonald, Ivanno Jeremiah, Oscar Coleman, Corrado Invernizzi, Joseph Palmer, Derek Carroll', null, 'Anna wakes to kind faces she doesn’t recognize and a remote island she has no memory of. She is forced to re-learn everything about herself, her husband and the baby she is carrying. But when two disfigured people arrive on the island and there is a violent altercation she discovers that the human race is close to extinction and goes searching for the truth about herself.', 'Anna wakes to kind faces she doesn’t recognize and a remote island she has no memory of. She is forced to re-learn everything about herself, her husband and the baby she is carrying. But when two disfigured people arrive on the island and there is a violent altercation she discovers that the human race is close to extinction and goes searching for the truth about herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88eSX0LQKn7LNNi7stZ6M6z6nTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960470'),
  ('93393203460857094', 'Wolf', 1994, 'Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Mike Nichols, Giuseppe Rotunno, Michael Haley', 'Jim Harrison, Wesley Strick', 'Jack Nicholson, Michelle Pfeiffer, James Spader, Kate Nelligan, Richard Jenkins, Christopher Plummer, Eileen Atkins, David Hyde Pierce', 'R', 'An aging publisher becomes a demon wolf and, with this newfound youthful vigor, fights to keep his job.', 'An aging publisher becomes a demon wolf and, with this newfound youthful vigor, fights to keep his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TprU55U2zjAMCwr2jQra3zj1zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10395'),
  ('637228499331285756', 'Wolf', 2004, 'Thriller, History', 'Miguel Courtois, Manuel L. Cañizares, Carmen Torres', 'Antonio Onetti', 'Eduardo Noriega, Jose Coronado, Mélanie Doutey, Silvia Abascal, Santiago Ramos, Patrick Bruel, Jorge Sanz, Manuel Zarzo', null, 'Based on a true story. In the 70s, during the last stages of Franco''s dictatorship, Txema, a basque construction worker, is arrested because of his connection to some terrorists who have just committed a murder. The secret service see in him an ideal candidate to infiltrate the terrorist band ETA and become a mole, so they try to offer him a deal if he will do so.', 'Based on a true story. In the 70s, during the last stages of Franco''s dictatorship, Txema, a basque construction worker, is arrested because of his connection to some terrorists who have just committed a murder. The secret service see in him an ideal candidate to infiltrate the terrorist band ETA and become a mole, so they try to offer him a deal if he will do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grbm7ADpAzXCQLWPWITHtKP2UBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36610'),
  ('262919449890249375', 'Wolf', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jim Taihuttu, Lennart Verstegen, Jeroen Houben', 'Jim Taihuttu', 'Marwan Kenzari, Chems Eddine Amar, Raymond Thiry, Bo Maerten, Cahit Ölmez, Nasrdin Dchar, Mark Catuogno, Werner Kolf', null, 'A promising kickboxer struggles to resist the temptations of a life of crime.', 'A promising kickboxer struggles to resist the temptations of a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axGiNAdvkTJ3otlytSP2EEKQ1Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191104'),
  ('210132248980128186', 'Wolf', 2018, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Can Emre, Cem Özüduru', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Serkan Çayoğlu, Emir Benderlioğlu, Murat Arkın, Mesut Akusta, Can Nergis, Ahmet Pınar, Ozan Ağaç, Bedii Akın', null, 'Picking up from the explosive cliffhanger of the sixth episode of the miniseries, the film follows the harrowing coup attempt night of July 15th, and the Police Special Operations and Special Forces heroes who put everything on the line to prevent a cultist takeover of Turkey.', 'Picking up from the explosive cliffhanger of the sixth episode of the miniseries, the film follows the harrowing coup attempt night of July 15th, and the Police Special Operations and Special Forces heroes who put everything on the line to prevent a cultist takeover of Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OGabWhuHqTzVrJQ2eHfazmgHZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568490'),
  ('181294537343094612', 'Wolf', 2021, 'Drama', 'Michał Dymek, Nathalie Biancheri', 'Nathalie Biancheri', 'George MacKay, Lily-Rose Depp, Eileen Walsh, Paddy Considine, Fionn O''Shea, Lola Petticrew, Karise Yansen, Darragh Shannon', 'R', 'Jacob, a man who believes he is a wolf trapped in a human body, is sent to a clinic by his family where he is forced to undergo increasingly extreme forms of "curative" therapies at the hands of The Zookeeper. Jacob’s only solace is the enigmatic Wildcat, with whom he roams the hospital in the dead of night. The two form an improbable friendship that develops into infatuation.', 'Jacob, a man who believes he is a wolf trapped in a human body, is sent to a clinic by his family where he is forced to undergo increasingly extreme forms of "curative" therapies at the hands of The Zookeeper. Jacob’s only solace is the enigmatic Wildcat, with whom he roams the hospital in the dead of night. The two form an improbable friendship that develops into infatuation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39SHAfnH7xoP2SH7BQoUXMeXjUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673121'),
  ('21224369499233539', 'Wolf and Calf', 1984, 'Animation', 'Mikhail Kamenetskiy, Yuriy Kamenetskiy', 'Mikhail Lipskerov', 'Vsevolod Larionov, Oleg Tabakov, Vladimir Vinokur, Olga Gromova', null, 'One day, the Wolf stole the newborn Calf and brought him home to eat, but regretted it and decided not to eat it, but wait until he grows up. The Wolf becomes attached to the Calf, takes care of him, feeds milk, sings lullabies, reads books. For the sake of the Calf, the Wolf keeps cleanliness - "children - they can not grow in the mud." And the Wild Boar, which smokes a cigarette, the Wolf literally drives a rag. Gradually, the Wolf and the Calf are so used to each other that they began to live like a father and son.', 'One day, the Wolf stole the newborn Calf and brought him home to eat, but regretted it and decided not to eat it, but wait until he grows up. The Wolf becomes attached to the Calf, takes care of him, feeds milk, sings lullabies, reads books. For the sake of the Calf, the Wolf keeps cleanliness - "children - they can not grow in the mud." And the Wild Boar, which smokes a cigarette, the Wolf literally drives a rag. Gradually, the Wolf and the Calf are so used to each other that they began to live like a father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnWBlrREOXyoHe41MDjDkFt2AVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91673'),
  ('834453517743510457', 'Wolf and Dog', 2022, 'Drama', 'Rui Xavier, Cláudia Varejão', 'Cláudia Varejão', 'Ana Cabral, Ruben Pimenta, Cristiana Branquinho, João Tavares, Marlene Cordeiro, Nuno Ferreira, Luísa Alves, Maria Furtado', null, 'Ana was born in São Miguel, an island in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean ruled by religion and traditions. Growing up as the middle child of a family of three with her mother and grandmother. Early Ana realized that girls and boys were given different tasks. Through her friendship with Luis, her queer best friend who loves dresses as much as pants, Ana questions the world that is promised to her. When her friend Cloé arrives from Canada, bringing with her the glowing days of youth, Ana embarks on a journey that will take her beyond the horizon.', 'Ana was born in São Miguel, an island in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean ruled by religion and traditions. Growing up as the middle child of a family of three with her mother and grandmother. Early Ana realized that girls and boys were given different tasks. Through her friendship with Luis, her queer best friend who loves dresses as much as pants, Ana questions the world that is promised to her. When her friend Cloé arrives from Canada, bringing with her the glowing days of youth, Ana embarks on a journey that will take her beyond the horizon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxeiWXO9KSqeyr1qUrt7TTVk5ih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005696'),
  ('862809852795318783', 'Wolf Children', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Kotaro Tamura, Ryo Horibe', 'Satoko Okudera, Mamoru Hosoda', 'Haru Kuroki, Yukito Nishii, Aoi Miyazaki, Takao Osawa, Momoka Ohno, Amon Kabe, Takuma Hiraoka, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG', 'After her werewolf lover unexpectedly dies in an accident, a woman must find a way to raise the son and daughter that she had with him. However, their inheritance of their father''s traits prove to be a challenge for her.', 'After her werewolf lover unexpectedly dies in an accident, a woman must find a way to raise the son and daughter that she had with him. However, their inheritance of their father''s traits prove to be a challenge for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Nllh6JgcrFdtOn6iFOWHudNInd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110420'),
  ('216320684724827708', 'Wolf Children', 2013, 'History, Drama, War', 'Rick Ostermann, Leah Striker', 'Rick Ostermann', 'Jördis Triebel, Levin Liam, Helena Phil, Vivien Ciskowski, Patrick Lorenczat, Willow Voges-Fernandes, Til-Niklas Theinert, Hannah Lehmann', null, 'The story of a boy who, driven by the search for his lost brother in the turmoil of WWII, joins a group of children in order to survive the chaos of post-war anarchy in the haunted forests of Lithuania.', 'The story of a boy who, driven by the search for his lost brother in the turmoil of WWII, joins a group of children in order to survive the chaos of post-war anarchy in the haunted forests of Lithuania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FyJ3rMjsMSnbzW6iM5ZxOtPFp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210052'),
  ('260251271234018450', 'Wolf Creek', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Will Gibson, Greg McLean', 'Greg McLean', 'John Jarratt, Cassandra Magrath, Kestie Morassi, Nathan Phillips, Gordon Poole, Guy O''Donnell, Phil Stevenson, Geoff Revell', 'R', 'Three backpackers stranded in the Australian outback are plunged inside a hellish nightmare of insufferable torture by a sadistic psychopathic local.', 'Three backpackers stranded in the Australian outback are plunged inside a hellish nightmare of insufferable torture by a sadistic psychopathic local.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/545PYpfCeDwVgdgydHCQqXFr168.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9885'),
  ('986940934819978167', 'Wolf Creek 2', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Greg McLean, Toby Oliver, Ernie Clark', 'Greg McLean, Aaron Sterns', 'John Jarratt, Ryan Corr, Ben Gerrard, Shane Connor, Shannon Ashlyn, Philippe Klaus, Chloé Boreham, Sarah Roberts', 'NR', 'Lured by the promise of an Australian holiday, backpackers Rutger, Katarina and Paul visit the notorious Wolf Creek Crater. Their dream Outback adventure soon becomes a horrific reality when they encounter the site''s most infamous local, the last man any traveller to the region ever wants to meet—Mick Taylor. As the backpackers flee, Mick pursues them on an epic white knuckled rampage across hostile wasteland.', 'Lured by the promise of an Australian holiday, backpackers Rutger, Katarina and Paul visit the notorious Wolf Creek Crater. Their dream Outback adventure soon becomes a horrific reality when they encounter the site''s most infamous local, the last man any traveller to the region ever wants to meet—Mick Taylor. As the backpackers flee, Mick pursues them on an epic white knuckled rampage across hostile wasteland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uELzdTzPOpZwSFqBbwpjuKE7UW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199534'),
  ('174408232189960054', 'Wolf Girl', 2001, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Thom Fitzgerald, J. Miles Dale, Adrian Conerth', 'Lori Lansens', 'Victoria Sanchez, Dov Tiefenbach, Tim Curry, Grace Jones, Shawn Ashmore, Nate Dushku, Darlene Cates, Lesley Ann Warren', 'R', 'Tara Talbot is afflicted with the rare genetic condition hypertrichosis: she is covered head to toe in hair. She lives her life in Harley Dune''s Travelling Freak Show, on display as the ''Terrifying Wolf Girl'', but underneath she is just a teenage girl who longs to be normal.', 'Tara Talbot is afflicted with the rare genetic condition hypertrichosis: she is covered head to toe in hair. She lives her life in Harley Dune''s Travelling Freak Show, on display as the ''Terrifying Wolf Girl'', but underneath she is just a teenage girl who longs to be normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpfV3n3UIXPz0sw3IUgX6dHD9q7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43749'),
  ('729618698907424243', 'Wolf Girl – Teaching Wild Girls', 2020, null, null, null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Min Do-yoon, Min Jong', null, 'At the request of his uncle, Tak-yi, who managed the Youth Association for several months, is a clergyman. Taki is concerned about the unidentified girl wandering around. I don’t want to meet you, but I feel sad after seeing my boat sit on the road. Tak decided to take a girl home for a while to protect her from a shabby inn, and she seems to have been left on the street from a very young age. Taki gives the girl the name Flower and does her best to serve as a guardian, but she begins to know what she needs to do to eat a side dish.', 'At the request of his uncle, Tak-yi, who managed the Youth Association for several months, is a clergyman. Taki is concerned about the unidentified girl wandering around. I don’t want to meet you, but I feel sad after seeing my boat sit on the road. Tak decided to take a girl home for a while to protect her from a shabby inn, and she seems to have been left on the street from a very young age. Taki gives the girl the name Flower and does her best to serve as a guardian, but she begins to know what she needs to do to eat a side dish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjwiQrTV4lJhhYIetSndZzAvZpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171624'),
  ('193164492603223939', 'Wolf Girl and Black Prince', 2016, 'Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Yukiko Manabe', 'Fumi Nikaido, Kento Yamazaki, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Mugi Kadowaki, Ryusei Yokohama, Elaiza Ikeda, Tina Tamashiro, Ryo Yoshizawa', null, 'Erika Shinohara is a first year of high school student. While talking to friends, she makes up a story about her "boyfriend." In reality, Erika Shinohara doesn''t have a boyfriend. Erika''s friends soon begin to doubt her story and Erika is also running out of lies. Erika then sees a pretty boy on the street and takes his picture discreetly. She later shows his picture to her friends as her boyfriend. The boy in the picture is Kyouya Sata and happens to attend the same school as Erika. She tells Kyouya about her situation and asks him to be her pretend boyfriend. Even though Kyouya has a pretty appearance, he has a dark side.', 'Erika Shinohara is a first year of high school student. While talking to friends, she makes up a story about her "boyfriend." In reality, Erika Shinohara doesn''t have a boyfriend. Erika''s friends soon begin to doubt her story and Erika is also running out of lies. Erika then sees a pretty boy on the street and takes his picture discreetly. She later shows his picture to her friends as her boyfriend. The boy in the picture is Kyouya Sata and happens to attend the same school as Erika. She tells Kyouya about her situation and asks him to be her pretend boyfriend. Even though Kyouya has a pretty appearance, he has a dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc0Rkyi3DOpdS3mxQ1SVzOQDlrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375533'),
  ('602208147358583385', 'Wolf Guy', 1975, 'Crime, Horror, Action', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Yoshio Nakajima, Michio Fukuyu', 'Fumio Kōnami', 'Sonny Chiba, Kyōsuke Machida, Etsuko Nami, Kumi Taguchi, Yayoi Watanabe, Rikiya Yasuoka, Harumi Sone, Hiroshi Nawa', null, 'Akira Inugami is the only survivor of a clan of ancient werewolves who relies on his supernatural powers to solve mysterious crimes. After a series of bloody killings perpetrated by an unseen force, Inugami uncovers a conspiracy involving a murdered cabaret singer, corrupt politicians, and a plot by the J-CIA to harvest his blood in order to steal his lycanthropic powers.', 'Akira Inugami is the only survivor of a clan of ancient werewolves who relies on his supernatural powers to solve mysterious crimes. After a series of bloody killings perpetrated by an unseen force, Inugami uncovers a conspiracy involving a murdered cabaret singer, corrupt politicians, and a plot by the J-CIA to harvest his blood in order to steal his lycanthropic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNQvi7sxrDUwf3ezgXmmmpl543r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165282'),
  ('195287210057192950', 'Wolf Hiding', 2023, 'Action, Crime', 'Marc Ma, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Gu Haoran, Marc Ma, Zhao Haozhe', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Ethan Juan, Darren Wang, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Paul Chun Pui, He Xinlin, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Andrew Lin Hoi', null, 'A criminal group is facing a change of leadership, and all forces are trying to intervene.', 'A criminal group is facing a change of leadership, and all forces are trying to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e01rnJQ5pGaboCAcNbvD7MUl9bH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950019'),
  ('380389117018133852', 'Wolf Hound', 2022, 'War, Action', 'Michael B. Chait', 'Michael B. Chait, Timothy Ritchey', 'James Maslow, Trevor Donovan, John Turk, Michael Wayne Foster, Ronald Woodhead, Michael Parrish, Brian Heintz, Callie Bussell', 'R', 'Inspired by the real-life German special operations unit KG 200 that shot down, repaired, and flew Allied aircraft as Trojan horses, "Wolf Hound" takes place in 1944 German-occupied France and follows the daring exploits of Jewish-American fighter pilot Captain David Holden. Ambushed behind enemy lines, Holden must rescue a captured B-17 Flying Fortress crew, evade a ruthless enemy stalking him at every turn, and foil a plot that could completely alter the outcome of World War II.', 'Inspired by the real-life German special operations unit KG 200 that shot down, repaired, and flew Allied aircraft as Trojan horses, "Wolf Hound" takes place in 1944 German-occupied France and follows the daring exploits of Jewish-American fighter pilot Captain David Holden. Ambushed behind enemy lines, Holden must rescue a captured B-17 Flying Fortress crew, evade a ruthless enemy stalking him at every turn, and foil a plot that could completely alter the outcome of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hCP2gaTcaPkajADVF0mOsKfAjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542196'),
  ('1053003452975451139', 'Wolf Lake', 1980, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Burt Kennedy, Álex Phillips Jr., Carlos Montaño', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Rod Steiger, David Huffman, Robin Mattson, Richard Herd, Jerry Hardin, Paul Mantee, Conrad Hool', 'R', 'War veterans visit a lakeside cabin for a week of shooting, drinking, etc. but find the cabin being looked after by a young caretaker named David. When David''s status as a war deserter is revealed, all hell breaks loose.', 'War veterans visit a lakeside cabin for a week of shooting, drinking, etc. but find the cabin being looked after by a young caretaker named David. When David''s status as a war deserter is revealed, all hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyKKq1Lco2y8oallyDPYryRgvqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262839'),
  ('417491800802721278', 'Wolf Man', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Leigh Whannell, Stefan Duscio, Melissa Spicer', 'Leigh Whannell, Corbett Tuck', 'Christopher Abbott, Julia Garner, Matilda Firth, Sam Jaeger, Ben Prendergast, Zac Chandler, Benedict Hardie, Milo Cawthorne', 'R', 'With his marriage fraying, Blake persuades his wife Charlotte to take a break from the city and visit his remote childhood home in rural Oregon. As they arrive at the farmhouse in the dead of night, they''re attacked by an unseen animal and barricade themselves inside the home as the creature prowls the perimeter. But as the night stretches on, Blake begins to behave strangely, transforming into something unrecognizable.', 'With his marriage fraying, Blake persuades his wife Charlotte to take a break from the city and visit his remote childhood home in rural Oregon. As they arrive at the farmhouse in the dead of night, they''re attacked by an unseen animal and barricade themselves inside the home as the creature prowls the perimeter. But as the night stretches on, Blake begins to behave strangely, transforming into something unrecognizable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpSDzTBfF0Eeo5lzu2w9FTujGqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710295'),
  ('876899435785004862', 'Wolf Mountain', 2022, 'Action, Horror', 'David Lipper, Joshua Santana', 'Keli Price', 'Keli Price, Tobin Bell, Malu Trevejo, Karissa Lee Staples, Danny Trejo, David Lipper, Eddie McClintock, Fernanda Romero', 'R', 'Aj and his brother revisit the spot where their parents were killed. But legend has it there is something mysterious roaming these woods.', 'Aj and his brother revisit the spot where their parents were killed. But legend has it there is something mysterious roaming these woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRBsjarhPCNv0budtWKEKT5eNjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106213'),
  ('644978540815082968', 'Wolf Pack', 2022, 'Action, War, Thriller', 'Michael Chiang', null, 'Max Zhang, Aarif Rahman, Jiang Luxia, Mark Luu, Zhang Yi, Xue Jianing, Ye Liu, Alexandre Robillard', null, 'During one of the missions, of the Wolf Pack squad led by Lao Diao who are engaged in overseas security work for a long time discovers that foreign terrorist forces have extended their reach into China''s energy lifeline.', 'During one of the missions, of the Wolf Pack squad led by Lao Diao who are engaged in overseas security work for a long time discovers that foreign terrorist forces have extended their reach into China''s energy lifeline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aro3MZ5nK6RGEWfdOyZ5RK83Xk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856742'),
  ('561658962342936150', 'Wolf Summer', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Peder Norlund, Lene Andersen Norlund, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', 'Peder Norlund', 'Julia Pauline Boracco Braathen, Jørgen Langhelle, Line Verndal, Samuel Fröler, Niklas James Knudsen, Ingar Helge Gimle, Aksel Hennie, Robert Skjærstad', null, 'The young Norwegian girl Kim almost gets killed after falling from a hillside. She finds shelter and stumbles upon the territory of a wolf and her puppy. When she finds out three shepherds are out to kill the wolf, she decides to get across the border to Sweden, where they don''t hunt for wolves.', 'The young Norwegian girl Kim almost gets killed after falling from a hillside. She finds shelter and stumbles upon the territory of a wolf and her puppy. When she finds out three shepherds are out to kill the wolf, she decides to get across the border to Sweden, where they don''t hunt for wolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJ6HG4ozXmYB58485aHLcVlh37J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115383'),
  ('2045863619107325', 'Wolf Totem', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Jean-Jacques Annaud', 'Jiang Rong, Alain Godard', 'William Feng, Shawn Dou, Ankhnyam Ragchaa, Yin Zhusheng, Baasanjav Mijid, Tumenbayaer, Han Tongsheng, Huang Xiaolei', null, 'In 1969, a young Beijing student, Chen Zhen, is sent to live among the nomadic herdsmen of Inner Mongolia. Caught between the advance of civilization from the south and the nomads'' traditional enemies - the marauding wolves - to the north; humans and animals, residents and invaders alike, struggle to find their true place in the world.', 'In 1969, a young Beijing student, Chen Zhen, is sent to live among the nomadic herdsmen of Inner Mongolia. Caught between the advance of civilization from the south and the nomads'' traditional enemies - the marauding wolves - to the north; humans and animals, residents and invaders alike, struggle to find their true place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WHE5b5pO3lLyStt5cA2vMLYPI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309302'),
  ('1073169539383233267', 'Wolf Walk', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', null, 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', null, 'After being missing for almost 80 years and despite the obstacles, the wolves are on their way back to their former territories. The documentary tells the great mystery of the dispersal of wolves: how the young wolves leave the territory where they were born and the way in which these adventurers set out to conquer new territories. For two years, Jean-Michel Bertrand conducted real research to try to understand the complex and erratic functioning of these young wolves, their encounters with their peers, and the opportunities to become a couple.', 'After being missing for almost 80 years and despite the obstacles, the wolves are on their way back to their former territories. The documentary tells the great mystery of the dispersal of wolves: how the young wolves leave the territory where they were born and the way in which these adventurers set out to conquer new territories. For two years, Jean-Michel Bertrand conducted real research to try to understand the complex and erratic functioning of these young wolves, their encounters with their peers, and the opportunities to become a couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG42cY66UC3hCWNiNukC6Q052Dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651846'),
  ('1130307016363067255', 'Wolf Warrior', 2015, 'Action, War', 'Wu Jing, Ad Zhjun', 'Wu Jing, Liu Yi, Dong Qun', 'Wu Jing, Scott Adkins, Yu Nan, Ni Dahong, Shi Zhaoqi, Zhou Xiaoou, Kevin Lee, Ma Dongyan', null, 'A Chinese special force soldier with extraordinary marksmanship is confronted by a group of deadly foreign mercenaries who are hired to assassinate him by a vicious drug lord.', 'A Chinese special force soldier with extraordinary marksmanship is confronted by a group of deadly foreign mercenaries who are hired to assassinate him by a vicious drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tGyxJcPUQclngSCcT18oEs80Yn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335462'),
  ('511147239016766719', 'Wolf Warrior 2', 2017, 'War, Action', 'Wu Jing, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Wu Jing, Gao Yan, Dong Qun', 'Wu Jing, Frank Grillo, Celina Jade, Hans Zhang, Wu Gang, Chunyu Shanshan, Yu Qian, Diana Sylla', null, 'China''s deadliest special forces operative settles into a quiet life on the sea. When sadistic mercenaries begin targeting nearby civilians, he must leave his newfound peace behind and return to his duties as a soldier and protector.', 'China''s deadliest special forces operative settles into a quiet life on the sea. When sadistic mercenaries begin targeting nearby civilians, he must leave his newfound peace behind and return to his duties as a soldier and protector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87aWrVqaVhXhblhO7sYHLC2y8TT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452557'),
  ('786519872540903918', 'Wolf''s Hole', 1987, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jaromír Šofr, Petr Hartl, Věra Chytilová', 'Daniela Fischerová, Věra Chytilová', 'Miroslav Macháček, Tomáš Palatý, Štěpánka Červenková, Jan Bidlas, Rita Dudušová, Irena Mrozková, Hanka Mrozková, Norbert Pýcha', null, 'Eleven disparate adolescents, gathered for a skiing camp at an isolated winter resort, find themselves preyed upon and set against one another by their three mysterious instructors.', 'Eleven disparate adolescents, gathered for a skiing camp at an isolated winter resort, find themselves preyed upon and set against one another by their three mysterious instructors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GfaK7FUqgc90peUBH4uSWIVCAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123839'),
  ('127258817582487037', 'WolfCop', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lowell Dean, Peter La Rocque', 'Lowell Dean', 'Leo Fafard, Amy Matysio, Sarah Lind, Corinne Conley, Jesse Moss, Jonathan Cherry, Aidan Devine, James Whittingham', 'NR', 'It''s not unusual for alcoholic cop Lou to black out and wake up in unfamiliar surroundings, but lately things have taken a turn for the strange...and hairy. WolfCop is the story of one cop''s quest to become a better man. One transformation at a time.', 'It''s not unusual for alcoholic cop Lou to black out and wake up in unfamiliar surroundings, but lately things have taken a turn for the strange...and hairy. WolfCop is the story of one cop''s quest to become a better man. One transformation at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOhgErWiWKX2yg4xEXfG2yTFti5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262840'),
  ('737761157590971442', 'Wolfen', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Wadleigh, Fredric Abeles, Gerry Fisher', 'David Eyre, Michael Wadleigh', 'Albert Finney, Diane Venora, Edward James Olmos, Gregory Hines, Tom Noonan, Dick O''Neill, Dehl Berti, Peter Michael Goetz', 'R', 'A New York City cop and an expert criminologist trying to solve a series of grisly deaths in which the victims have seemingly been maimed by feral animals discover a sinister connection between the crimes and an old legend.', 'A New York City cop and an expert criminologist trying to solve a series of grisly deaths in which the victims have seemingly been maimed by feral animals discover a sinister connection between the crimes and an old legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb4TJBeElGyIa7tmF2466iwwItB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10725'),
  ('596022757222038869', 'Wolfgang', 2025, 'Family, Drama, Music', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Sergi Vilanova, Judit Costa', 'Laia Aguilar, Valentina Viso, Yago Alonso', 'Jordi Catalán, Miki Esparbé, Àngels Gonyalons, Berto Romero, Anna Castillo, Nausicaa Bonnín, Dafnis Balduz, Reichel Delgado', null, 'Wolfgang, a 9-year-old boy with an IQ of 125, is forced to live with his father, Carles, whom he has never seen, after the sudden death of his mother. He has one obsession, to run away to Paris to study at the Grimald Academy and become the best pianist in the world. But what Wolfgang doesn’t know is that the biggest challenge is right in front of him and that is to get along with his father.', 'Wolfgang, a 9-year-old boy with an IQ of 125, is forced to live with his father, Carles, whom he has never seen, after the sudden death of his mother. He has one obsession, to run away to Paris to study at the Grimald Academy and become the best pianist in the world. But what Wolfgang doesn’t know is that the biggest challenge is right in front of him and that is to get along with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGnpjUPdFWGj3spbsnjGGAakaaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306284'),
  ('825553294166246874', 'Wolfhound of the Grey Dog Clan', 2006, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Irek Hartowicz, Gustáv Kyselica, Viktor Lakisov', 'Nikolay Lebedev', 'Aleksandr Bukharov, Oksana Akinshina, Igor Petrenko, Anatoliy Belyy, Juozas Budraitis, Nina Usatova, Tatyana Lyutaeva, Alexandr Domogarov', 'R', 'He was doomed to die, but managed to survive, and now his mission is to revenge for the annihilation of his tribe. He is the great warrior who calls himself Volkodav, and is the last man from the tribe of Serie Psi (Grey Hounds). After escaping certain death, Volkodaw — accompanied by Neletuchaya Mysh — is on a mission to kill Ludoed who is responsible to what happened to Serie Psi.', 'He was doomed to die, but managed to survive, and now his mission is to revenge for the annihilation of his tribe. He is the great warrior who calls himself Volkodav, and is the last man from the tribe of Serie Psi (Grey Hounds). After escaping certain death, Volkodaw — accompanied by Neletuchaya Mysh — is on a mission to kill Ludoed who is responsible to what happened to Serie Psi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uWSweoe5ykaxpEmXvzaEOHQFl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13334'),
  ('1023596590734521969', 'Wolfkin', 2023, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jacques Molitor, Amandine Klee', 'Jacques Molitor, Régine Abadia, Magali Negroni', 'Louise Manteau, Victor Dieu, Marja-Leena Junker, Jules Werner, Marco Lorenzini, Myriam Muller, Yuliya Chernyshkova, Jean-Jacques Rausin', null, 'Single mother Elaine is disturbed by her son Martin''s aggressive behaviour, she visits his late father''s estranged family in small-town Luxembourg, which hides a much darker nature. When she realizes that Martin could become like them, Elaine is forced into a desperate fight for her son''s future.', 'Single mother Elaine is disturbed by her son Martin''s aggressive behaviour, she visits his late father''s estranged family in small-town Luxembourg, which hides a much darker nature. When she realizes that Martin could become like them, Elaine is forced into a desperate fight for her son''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDg2LcMWQPbx2kNQCuL1yyIvq8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986263'),
  ('754697268208539684', 'Wolfman', 1979, 'Horror', 'Worth Keeter, Darrell Cathcart', 'Worth Keeter', 'Earl Owensby, Ed Grady, Helene Tryon, Kristina Reynolds, Sid Rancer, Richard Dedmon, Maggie Lauterer, Martin Beck', 'PG', 'A man finds out that his family has a werewolf curse put upon them.', 'A man finds out that his family has a werewolf curse put upon them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LypV5ukcjuMWGGCQtNh76vxsna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156310'),
  ('387891355561158021', 'Wolfman vs. Godzilla', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Shizuo Nakajima', null, 'Shitosi Shima, Ema Ishihara', null, 'A high production fan film directed and produced by Shizuo Nakajima and several former Toho filmmakers in 1983. Principal photography on Wolfman vs. Godzilla began in 1983 and concluded in the mid 1980''s. Post-production ("editing, sound design, and visual effects") is ongoing.', 'A high production fan film directed and produced by Shizuo Nakajima and several former Toho filmmakers in 1983. Principal photography on Wolfman vs. Godzilla began in 1983 and concluded in the mid 1980''s. Post-production ("editing, sound design, and visual effects") is ongoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oedrQMhyl9TrzAMCQYjT1WDHl8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633012'),
  ('196376547537006605', 'Wolfs', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jon Watts, Larkin Seiple, Nilo Otero', 'Jon Watts', 'George Clooney, Brad Pitt, Austin Abrams, Amy Ryan, Poorna Jagannathan, Zlatko Burić, Richard Kind, Frances McDormand', 'R', 'Hired to cover up a high-profile crime, a fixer soon finds his night spiralling out of control when he''s forced to work with an unexpected counterpart.', 'Hired to cover up a high-profile crime, a fixer soon finds his night spiralling out of control when he''s forced to work with an unexpected counterpart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOX1Zng472PC2KnS0B9nRfM8aaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877817'),
  ('609478708329323219', 'Wolfsburg', 2003, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm', 'Christian Petzold', 'Benno Fürmann, Nina Hoss, Antje Westermann, Astrid Meyerfeldt, Matthias Matschke, Soraya Sala, Stephan Kampwirth, Martin Aaron Müseler', null, 'Philipp Gerber is a smart, but self-satisfied car salesman. In an inattentive moment at the wheel of his car, he runs over a boy on a bike and, instead of helping him, he drives away. As he has feelings of guilt, he tries to find out more about the accident’s victim.', 'Philipp Gerber is a smart, but self-satisfied car salesman. In an inattentive moment at the wheel of his car, he runs over a boy on a bike and, instead of helping him, he drives away. As he has feelings of guilt, he tries to find out more about the accident’s victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIxi4i3NzjyPeqNlo6lFeDEmr7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88418'),
  ('1030843071017383599', 'Wolfsland – Ewig Dein', 2016, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'André Erkau', null, 'Götz Schubert, Yvonne Catterfeld, Andreas Schmidt, Julius Nitschkoff, Emma Nova, Karina Plachetka, Marko Dyrlich, Jan Dose', null, 'The body of John Staffler, a well-known, successful lawyer, lies in front of the police officers. In his mouth: a red thong that definitely doesn''t belong to his wife. At least that''s what the former Hamburg criminalist Viola Delbrück and the Upper Lusatian loner Burkhard Schulz agree on. And also in the fact that the place where the body was found is not the crime scene. The investigation leads them to a country estate where Staffler apparently housed his lover. The trail continues to lead them to a young Polish-German couple, whose escape becomes more and more desperate the closer the two inspectors get to them.', 'The body of John Staffler, a well-known, successful lawyer, lies in front of the police officers. In his mouth: a red thong that definitely doesn''t belong to his wife. At least that''s what the former Hamburg criminalist Viola Delbrück and the Upper Lusatian loner Burkhard Schulz agree on. And also in the fact that the place where the body was found is not the crime scene. The investigation leads them to a country estate where Staffler apparently housed his lover. The trail continues to lead them to a young Polish-German couple, whose escape becomes more and more desperate the closer the two inspectors get to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvPnPaydDbgT40xVZHiWtTuuYdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429292'),
  ('417163785963046664', 'Wolfy', 2009, 'Drama', 'Kirill Bobrov, Mark Ziselson, Aleksandr Kopeykin', 'Vasiliy Sigarev', 'Polina Pluchek, Yana Troyanova, Veronika Lysakova, Marina Gapchenko, Galina Dolganova, Andrey Dymshakov, Evgeniy Volotskiy, Irma Arendt', null, 'There are two of them: a mother and a girl. They have no names. And they are in a constant run. The mother runs away from the daughter in an attempt to start new life, and the girl runs after her mother as she has no idea how to live without her. This endless run is full with repeated mistakes and resembles a barrel-organ sorrowful song or a spinning-top rotation. This small ridiculous toy "volchok" was the first toy in the girl''s life, the only thing that tied her with the mother.', 'There are two of them: a mother and a girl. They have no names. And they are in a constant run. The mother runs away from the daughter in an attempt to start new life, and the girl runs after her mother as she has no idea how to live without her. This endless run is full with repeated mistakes and resembles a barrel-organ sorrowful song or a spinning-top rotation. This small ridiculous toy "volchok" was the first toy in the girl''s life, the only thing that tied her with the mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zC2vwbgqMDEEg3jbIZZRuNSKF0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51272'),
  ('137280782394269650', 'Wolfy: The Incredible Secret', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'Eric Omond', 'Emmanuel Solotareff', 'Malik Zidi, Stéphane Debac, Anaïs Demoustier, Carlo Brandt, Marianne Basler, Léonore Chaix, Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain, Patrick Paroux', null, 'Loulou is a wolf. Tom is a rabbit. As curious as it may seem, Loulou and Tom have been inseparable since they were little. Now in their teens, they live the easy life in the Land of the Rabbits. But Loulou, who thought he was an orphan, learns that his bohemian mother is alive. The two friends set out to find her in the principality of Wolfenberg, the Land of the Wolves. They arrive in the middle of the Meat-eaters'' Festival, a yearly get together for the world''s great carnivores. Will Loulou and Tom''s friendship survive in the land where herbivores always end up as the main course? What incredible secret lies behind Loulou''s birth?', 'Loulou is a wolf. Tom is a rabbit. As curious as it may seem, Loulou and Tom have been inseparable since they were little. Now in their teens, they live the easy life in the Land of the Rabbits. But Loulou, who thought he was an orphan, learns that his bohemian mother is alive. The two friends set out to find her in the principality of Wolfenberg, the Land of the Wolves. They arrive in the middle of the Meat-eaters'' Festival, a yearly get together for the world''s great carnivores. Will Loulou and Tom''s friendship survive in the land where herbivores always end up as the main course? What incredible secret lies behind Loulou''s birth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGYNajggg7L0AVM4nKxJtidtaxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265838'),
  ('1122642336131917356', 'Wolke unterm Dach', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alain Gsponer, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Dirk Ahner', 'Frederick Lau, Romy Schroeder, Hannah Herzsprung, Barbara Auer, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Nicolette Krebitz, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, Marlon Barth', null, 'Paul, Julia and Lilly are a happy family, until Julia dies unexpectedly. For the sake of his daughter, Paul wants to function and suppress his grief. Lilly keeps challenging him with her imagination and her very own view of Mum''s death.', 'Paul, Julia and Lilly are a happy family, until Julia dies unexpectedly. For the sake of his daughter, Paul wants to function and suppress his grief. Lilly keeps challenging him with her imagination and her very own view of Mum''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8bxEvWFtjLQDKvdNJZLDjOwmTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915997'),
  ('1000862237569210796', 'Wolves', 2014, 'Horror, Action', 'David Hayter, Gavin Smith, Robbin MacDonald', 'David Hayter', 'Lucas Till, Jason Momoa, John Pyper-Ferguson, Stephen McHattie, Merritt Patterson, Janet-Laine Green, Melanie Scrofano, Kaitlyn Leeb', 'R', 'The coming-of-age story of Cayden Richards. Forced to hit the road after the murder of his parents, Cayden wanders lost without purpose... Until he meets a certifiable lunatic named Wild Joe who sets him on a path to the ominous town of Lupine Ridge to hunt down the truths of his history. But in the end| who''s really hunting whom?', 'The coming-of-age story of Cayden Richards. Forced to hit the road after the murder of his parents, Cayden wanders lost without purpose... Until he meets a certifiable lunatic named Wild Joe who sets him on a path to the ominous town of Lupine Ridge to hunt down the truths of his history. But in the end| who''s really hunting whom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q5sTH90MSvguFlb9UfcpeA2P5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290555'),
  ('580311444349706102', 'Wolves', 2016, 'Drama', 'Bart Freundlich, Juan Miguel Azpiroz', 'Bart Freundlich', 'Taylor John Smith, Carla Gugino, Zazie Beetz, Michael Shannon, Chris Bauer, Jessica Rothe, Jake Choi, Cindy Cheung', null, 'Anthony Keller, star of his NYC high school basketball team, is riding his way to Cornell on a sports scholarship. But he can only maintain his popular jock facade for so long, as his troubled father Lee has a gambling addiction that threatens to derail his dreams both on and off the court.', 'Anthony Keller, star of his NYC high school basketball team, is riding his way to Cornell on a sports scholarship. But he can only maintain his popular jock facade for so long, as his troubled father Lee has a gambling addiction that threatens to derail his dreams both on and off the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a4YYmFf6BsKirzqPfmfPLHgS8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345909'),
  ('817515759576765890', 'Wolves at the Door', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John R. Leonetti, Michael St. Hilaire', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Katie Cassidy, Elizabeth Henstridge, Adam Campbell, Miles Fisher, Chris Mulkey, Jane Kaczmarek, Spencer Daniels, Lucas Adams', 'R', 'Four friends gather at an elegant home during the Summer of Love, 1969. Unbeknownst to them, deadly visitors are waiting outside. What begins as a simple farewell party turns to a night of primal terror as the intruders stalk and torment the four, who struggle for their lives against what appears to be a senseless attack.', 'Four friends gather at an elegant home during the Summer of Love, 1969. Unbeknownst to them, deadly visitors are waiting outside. What begins as a simple farewell party turns to a night of primal terror as the intruders stalk and torment the four, who struggle for their lives against what appears to be a senseless attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kizBwSEfvJFEOuYfwbOGtWZit3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363111'),
  ('921113869529094748', 'Wolves of Wall Street', 2002, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau', 'Barry Levy', 'William Gregory Lee, Elisa Donovan, Michael Bergin, Jason-Shane Scott, Bradley Stryker, Louise Lasser, Eric Roberts, Jeff Branson', 'R', 'Jeff Allen just got a new job in one of Manhattan''s wealthiest brokerage firms, Wolfe Brothers. Here young, good-looking stockbrokers make a lot of money by being particularly cutthroat. Jeff finds out that the real secret to their success is an animal instinct that is turning him into a werewolf, but it may be too late for him to get out.', 'Jeff Allen just got a new job in one of Manhattan''s wealthiest brokerage firms, Wolfe Brothers. Here young, good-looking stockbrokers make a lot of money by being particularly cutthroat. Jeff finds out that the real secret to their success is an animal instinct that is turning him into a werewolf, but it may be too late for him to get out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eDVM9rdCeLnN2ueQvcNxwvk7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27674'),
  ('1066547861400514909', 'Wolves That Do Not Eat Meat', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Samir A. Khouri', 'Samir A. Khouri', 'Ezzat Al Alaily, Silvana Badrkhan, Nahed Sherif, Mohammed Al-Mansour, Eman, Mohsen Sarhan, Ali AlMufeedi, Gazi Havvas', null, 'Wolves That Do Not Eat Meat is an Arabic narrative film from the adventure and suspense films produced in 1973, represented by Izzat Al-Alayli in the role of "Anwar", Nahed Sharif in the role of "Thuraya" and Mohsen Sarhan in the role of "Saleh", and from Kuwait Muhammad Al-Mansour in the role of "Al-Saffah" Khaled Al-Saqabi in the role of “The Officer” and Ali Al-Mufidi in the role of “Al-Akhras”, and from Lebanon Silvana Badrakhan in the role of “Linda” and Les Sirkisian or actress Iman as she was known later in the role of “Nihad”. And directed by Samir A. Khouri. All the movie clips were shot in the State of Kuwait.', 'Wolves That Do Not Eat Meat is an Arabic narrative film from the adventure and suspense films produced in 1973, represented by Izzat Al-Alayli in the role of "Anwar", Nahed Sharif in the role of "Thuraya" and Mohsen Sarhan in the role of "Saleh", and from Kuwait Muhammad Al-Mansour in the role of "Al-Saffah" Khaled Al-Saqabi in the role of “The Officer” and Ali Al-Mufidi in the role of “Al-Akhras”, and from Lebanon Silvana Badrakhan in the role of “Linda” and Les Sirkisian or actress Iman as she was known later in the role of “Nihad”. And directed by Samir A. Khouri. All the movie clips were shot in the State of Kuwait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygdIxSW7Dcffm2dyC0ocKDgaRho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85269'),
  ('452611714704642357', 'Wolvesbayne', 2009, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Horror', 'Griff Furst', 'Leigh Scott', 'Jeremy London, Christy Carlson Romano, Yancy Butler, Mark Dacascos, Rhett Giles, Marcus Lyle Brown, Joseph Diaz, Stephanie Honoré', null, 'A supernatural thriller that follows Russel Bayne who quickly finds himself in the middle of a supernatural war between vampires, werewolves, and human hunters after being bitten by a werewolf. To make matters worse, it seems a civil war has erupted among the vampires, with a clan breaking from the others in a quest to return a vampire goddess back to power.', 'A supernatural thriller that follows Russel Bayne who quickly finds himself in the middle of a supernatural war between vampires, werewolves, and human hunters after being bitten by a werewolf. To make matters worse, it seems a civil war has erupted among the vampires, with a clan breaking from the others in a quest to return a vampire goddess back to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY6mkRIZnU1qUWxPx26u2uJdLgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24799'),
  ('31225257873871796', 'Woman', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Giuseppe Ferlito, Mauro Marchetti', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi', 'Monica Guerritore, Alberto Di Stasio, Roberto Farnesi, Sara Anticoli, Simona Caramelli, Massimo Alì, Giorgio Crisafi, Luisita De La Cruz', null, 'A beautiful wife of good social standing falls into a flaming passion with a young man. Sooner than expected, she will be unable to terminate the liaison. It will follows that her husband is not wanted. And you can be sure she''s not considering divorce as a solution.', 'A beautiful wife of good social standing falls into a flaming passion with a young man. Sooner than expected, she will be unable to terminate the liaison. It will follows that her husband is not wanted. And you can be sure she''s not considering divorce as a solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HaF4GqukttROusdzJkuuumVBoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108469'),
  ('76867159373218515', 'Woman', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Anastasia Mikova, Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Tanguy Apel-Muller', null, 'Aleksandra Orbeck-Nilssen, Norma Bastidas, Gabriela Melgoza, Virginie Raisson, Florence de Paz', null, 'The film is based on interviews with 2,000 women from 50 countries, and covers the status of women all over the world. The topics covered include forced marriages, sexual assault, female genital mutilation, acid attacks, motherhood, sexuality, menstruation, education and the professional success of women.', 'The film is based on interviews with 2,000 women from 50 countries, and covers the status of women all over the world. The topics covered include forced marriages, sexual assault, female genital mutilation, acid attacks, motherhood, sexuality, menstruation, education and the professional success of women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgETjYe2VDWkHrDMoVpCOM16S5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618260'),
  ('268281129972208947', 'Woman at Sea', 2023, 'Drama', 'Dinara Drukarova, William Thomas Möller, Fahad Falur Jabali', 'Raphaëlle Desplechin, Léa Fehner, Gilles Taurand', 'Dinara Drukarova, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Sam Louwyck, Antonythasan Jesuthasan, Dylan Robert, Hjörtur Jóhann Jónsson, Magne-Håvard Brekke, David Menéndez', null, 'Lili has left everything behind to travel to the edge of the earth and accomplish her dream, fishing the Northern seas. She persuades Ian, the captain of a trawler by the name of Rebel, to give her a chance and let her join the crew. The only woman on board, they call her Sparrow. Hidden behind a frail appearance is a will of steel, and her courage and determination ultimately win over their respect. Adopted into this world of often unfortunate individuals, Lili will conquer her right to live differently, free.', 'Lili has left everything behind to travel to the edge of the earth and accomplish her dream, fishing the Northern seas. She persuades Ian, the captain of a trawler by the name of Rebel, to give her a chance and let her join the crew. The only woman on board, they call her Sparrow. Hidden behind a frail appearance is a will of steel, and her courage and determination ultimately win over their respect. Adopted into this world of often unfortunate individuals, Lili will conquer her right to live differently, free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZrz8Te3rZrB4ArQQetVxNHYuGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958195'),
  ('624445119689854746', 'Woman at War', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Hálfdán Theodórsson, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Jóhann Sigurðarson, Davíð Þór Jónsson, Magnús Trygvason Eliassen, Ómar Guðjónsson, Iryna Danyleiko, Galyna Goncharenko, Susanna Kurpenko', null, 'Halla declares a one-woman-war on the local aluminium industry. She is prepared to risk everything to protect the pristine Icelandic Highlands she loves… Until an orphan unexpectedly enters her life.', 'Halla declares a one-woman-war on the local aluminium industry. She is prepared to risk everything to protect the pristine Icelandic Highlands she loves… Until an orphan unexpectedly enters her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IwRoLxbYF1Vu1KxHt0aLbyeS5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348657'),
  ('479885305530347507', 'Woman Demon Human', 1987, 'Drama', 'Huang Shuqin, Hongsheng Ji, Lixing Xia', 'Huang Shuqin, Zhiyu Li, Guoxun Song', 'Li Baotian, Xu Shouli, Ji Qilin, Yanling Pei, Li Cun, Shi Yuan, Li Di, Song Yining', null, 'The fictional life and career of a famous actress in Chinese opera, a woman who goes against tradition by specializing in playing male roles, especially that of Zhang Kui, a benevolent ghost who appears in several Chinese operas. Although the actress''s career brings wealth and fame, it is attained only through considerable struggle against an anti-female system and an unhappy personal life.', 'The fictional life and career of a famous actress in Chinese opera, a woman who goes against tradition by specializing in playing male roles, especially that of Zhang Kui, a benevolent ghost who appears in several Chinese operas. Although the actress''s career brings wealth and fame, it is attained only through considerable struggle against an anti-female system and an unhappy personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjP0ChYModjOeQsUF0h1CMX27fC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94019'),
  ('46682843940955295', 'Woman Haters', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Archie Gottler, Joseph H. August, Louis Silvers', 'Jerome S. Gottler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Marjorie White, Walter Brennan, Fred ''Snowflake'' Toones, Dorothy Vernon, A.R. Haysel', 'NR', 'The stooges join the "Women Haters" club and vow to have nothing to do with the fair sex. Larry marries a girl anyway and attempts to hide the fact from Moe and Curly as they take a train trip.', 'The stooges join the "Women Haters" club and vow to have nothing to do with the fair sex. Larry marries a girl anyway and attempts to hide the fact from Moe and Curly as they take a train trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMBbFg3b6r2gZDbKj9OLWoflhFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115771'),
  ('883714713519700290', 'Woman in a Box: Virgin Sacrifice', 1985, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Masaru Konuma, Yoshihiro Takane, Takeshi Tajima', 'Kazuo Komizu', 'Reiko Sai, Saeko Kizuki, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Takashi Obara, Hiroshi Tamura', null, 'A young virgin is captured by an abnormal couple. The girl is kept locked in a wooden box, and subjected to sexual torture and abuse. Loosely inspired by the real-life case of Colleen Stan.', 'A young virgin is captured by an abnormal couple. The girl is kept locked in a wooden box, and subjected to sexual torture and abuse. Loosely inspired by the real-life case of Colleen Stan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joQB0JAhyzNKFXGUSEEmR4EhQGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340670'),
  ('471104789820046575', 'Woman in a Dressing Gown', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'J. Lee Thompson', 'Ted Willis', 'Yvonne Mitchell, Anthony Quayle, Sylvia Syms, Andrew Ray, Carole Lesley, Michael Ripper, Nora Gordon, Marianne Stone', null, 'A married, middle-aged woman is shocked to discover that her husband, who she thought was content in their marriage, has become infatuated with a beautiful younger woman and is planning to leave his family for her.', 'A married, middle-aged woman is shocked to discover that her husband, who she thought was content in their marriage, has become infatuated with a beautiful younger woman and is planning to leave his family for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBOR3FwMheSBLyB6WpyJdDS2f9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119687'),
  ('258978489450343229', 'Woman in Chains', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Andréas Winding, Robert Ménégoz', 'Marcel Moussy, Henri-Georges Clouzot, Monique Lange', 'Laurent Terzieff, Bernard Fresson, Elisabeth Wiener, Dany Carrel, Claude Piéplu, Noëlle Adam, Germaine Delbat, Michel Etcheverry', null, 'Gallery director Stanislas bolsters the development of modern art with his collection of surprising works. His newest acquisition is a sculpture by Gilbert, whose wife Josée is captivated by Stanislas. But unbeknownst to her, Stanislas is amassing photographs of a very perverse, disturbed nature.', 'Gallery director Stanislas bolsters the development of modern art with his collection of surprising works. His newest acquisition is a sculpture by Gilbert, whose wife Josée is captivated by Stanislas. But unbeknownst to her, Stanislas is amassing photographs of a very perverse, disturbed nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3Da5Fn4C1CfL0AWwyDGlK387aE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70496'),
  ('919441584028448093', 'Woman in Gold', 2015, 'Drama', 'Simon Curtis, Ross Emery, Dominic Masters', 'Alexi Kaye Campbell', 'Helen Mirren, Ryan Reynolds, Tatiana Maslany, Katie Holmes, Max Irons, Charles Dance, Daniel Brühl, Tom Schilling', 'PG-13', 'Maria Altmann, an octogenarian Jewish refugee, takes on the government to recover artwork she believes rightfully belongs to her family.', 'Maria Altmann, an octogenarian Jewish refugee, takes on the government to recover artwork she believes rightfully belongs to her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eoj6bozvgwNuDV3vOrqlvrCrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304357'),
  ('675955594001420028', 'Woman in Hiding', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Gordon, William H. Daniels, Frank Shaw', 'Oscar Saul', 'Ida Lupino, Stephen McNally, Howard Duff, Peggy Dow, John Litel, Taylor Holmes, Irving Bacon, Don Beddoe', 'NR', 'As far as the rest of the world is concerned, mill heiress Deborah Chandler Clark is dead, killed in a freak auto accident. But Deborah is alive, if not too well. Having discovered a horrible truth about her new husband, Deborah is now a “woman in hiding,” living in mortal fear that someday her husband will catch up with her again. When a returning GI recognizes Deborah, however, she must decide whether or not she can trust him.', 'As far as the rest of the world is concerned, mill heiress Deborah Chandler Clark is dead, killed in a freak auto accident. But Deborah is alive, if not too well. Having discovered a horrible truth about her new husband, Deborah is now a “woman in hiding,” living in mortal fear that someday her husband will catch up with her again. When a returning GI recognizes Deborah, however, she must decide whether or not she can trust him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QDEOAZpqVnGZ0kvha3lwIQp4J1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61149'),
  ('790424609044548655', 'Woman in Love', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Detlev Buck, Cosima Lohse, Tine Rogoll', 'Detlev Buck, Anika Decker', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Alexandra Maria Lara, Detlev Buck, Maximilian Brückner, Denis Moschitto, Max von Thun, Max Giermann, Sunnyi Melles', null, 'An actor''s career takes a "Tootsie"-like turn when he lets himself be cast as a woman in a movie.', 'An actor''s career takes a "Tootsie"-like turn when he lets himself be cast as a woman in a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SmlwvWXuGU0OdrN78Cp9Tg2PTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80125'),
  ('238755419061179324', 'Woman in the Dark', 1934, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phil Rosen, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Sada Cowan, Charles Williams, Marcy Klauber', 'Fay Wray, Ralph Bellamy, Melvyn Douglas, Roscoe Ates, Ruth Gillette, Nell O''Day, Granville Bates, Frank Shannon', 'NR', 'A recently released prisoner lives alone in his cabin so that his bad temper won''t get him back in any more trouble, but his peaceful existence is disrupted when a mysterious woman arrives.', 'A recently released prisoner lives alone in his cabin so that his bad temper won''t get him back in any more trouble, but his peaceful existence is disrupted when a mysterious woman arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5R1DGGIx8daXroNSYrXz29m9qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179603'),
  ('325019976386202960', 'Woman in the Moon', 1929, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Konstantin Irmen-Tschet, Otto Kanturek, Fritz Lang', 'Fritz Lang, Hermann Oberth, Thea von Harbou', 'Willy Fritsch, Gerda Maurus, Klaus Pohl, Fritz Rasp, Gustav von Wangenheim, Tilla Durieux, Margarete Kupfer, Alexa von Porembsky', null, 'A scientist discovers that there''s gold on the moon. He builds a rocket to fly there, but there''s too much rivalry among the crew to have a successful expedition.', 'A scientist discovers that there''s gold on the moon. He builds a rocket to fly there, but there''s too much rivalry among the crew to have a successful expedition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s6zEsOAY3LD5qvzljmKKzjnLiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3007'),
  ('1080969271222795363', 'Woman in Witness Protection', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Jūzō Itami, Yonezō Maeda, Takehiko Nakajima', 'Jūzō Itami', 'Nobuko Miyamoto, Masahiko Nishimura, Takehiro Murata, Kazuya Takahashi, Masahiko Tsugawa, Tohru Emori, Akira Nagoya, Taro Yamamoto', null, 'Vain, middle-aged actress Biwako is placed in witness protection while authorities investigate the brutal murder she witnessed. Under the watch of two dedicated cops, Biwako struggles to maintain her career, her public image, and her personal life as she prepares for her new role on the witness stand.', 'Vain, middle-aged actress Biwako is placed in witness protection while authorities investigate the brutal murder she witnessed. Under the watch of two dedicated cops, Biwako struggles to maintain her career, her public image, and her personal life as she prepares for her new role on the witness stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjdqZq7ctHBsOdkcROHPfS27Okc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164207'),
  ('411571980481580774', 'Woman Is the Future of Man', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Kang-san, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Sung Hyun-ah, Kim Tae-woo, Oh Yoo-jin, Uhm Soo-jung, Min Young, Kim Nan-hwi, Bae Yun-beom', null, 'As the first snow falls in Seoul, two old friends reunite; one is a successful college professor, and the other, a struggling filmmaker recently returned from the United States. After their reminiscences, they finally decide to go in search of the young woman each had romanced years earlier.', 'As the first snow falls in Seoul, two old friends reunite; one is a successful college professor, and the other, a struggling filmmaker recently returned from the United States. After their reminiscences, they finally decide to go in search of the young woman each had romanced years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bovtjGw5XB3aDKaWkfYnCupBbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16447'),
  ('11686929736396028', 'Woman Obsessed', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry Hathaway, William C. Mellor', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Susan Hayward, Stephen Boyd, Barbara Nichols, Dennis Holmes, Theodore Bikel, Ken Scott, James Philbrook, Florence MacMichael', null, 'After her husband dies in a fire, a woman (Susan Hayward) is left to tend for her young son and the family farm on her own. Soon, she takes in a drifting handyman, they fall in love, and a resentment begins to build between the son and his new "step-father" who treats the boy harshly on purpose to prepare him for life on the frontier.', 'After her husband dies in a fire, a woman (Susan Hayward) is left to tend for her young son and the family farm on her own. Soon, she takes in a drifting handyman, they fall in love, and a resentment begins to build between the son and his new "step-father" who treats the boy harshly on purpose to prepare him for life on the frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5H57o0vfGWSLHujOj4Yg8tGQer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199072'),
  ('589689630841985787', 'Woman of Desire', 1994, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert Ginty, Neil Johnson, Hanro Möhr', 'Robert Ginty', 'Jeff Fahey, Bo Derek, Steven Bauer, Robert Mitchum, Thomas Hall, John Matshikiza, Warrick Grier, Todd Jensen', 'R', 'Christina Ford is a temptress who isn''t afraid to use her desires to get what she wants. When her wealthy boyfriend, identical twin Ted Ashby hires retired cop Jack Lynch to captain their yacht, passions ignite at sea and Jack finds himself a pawn in a game where there are no rules. In their world, nobody is who they appear to be and the only one who knows the truth is dead. After washing ashore, Jack is accused of murdering his boss, Ted, and raping the victim''s girlfriend, Christina. With no one believing his side of the story, Jack seeks the help of veteran attorney Walter J. Hill to prove his innocence.', 'Christina Ford is a temptress who isn''t afraid to use her desires to get what she wants. When her wealthy boyfriend, identical twin Ted Ashby hires retired cop Jack Lynch to captain their yacht, passions ignite at sea and Jack finds himself a pawn in a game where there are no rules. In their world, nobody is who they appear to be and the only one who knows the truth is dead. After washing ashore, Jack is accused of murdering his boss, Ted, and raping the victim''s girlfriend, Christina. With no one believing his side of the story, Jack seeks the help of veteran attorney Walter J. Hill to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jS4XwpZkJvMrR6f3ccE1IoQLXkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91023'),
  ('661806624548750382', 'Woman of My Life', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Luca Lucini', 'Giulia Calenda, Teresa Ciabatti', 'Luca Argentero, Alessandro Gassmann, Stefania Sandrelli, Valentina Lodovini, Giorgio Colangeli, Sonia Bergamasco, Gaia Bermani Amaral, Lella Costa', null, 'Longtime Italian cinema star Stefania Sandrelli (The First Beautiful Thing) is Alba, the mother of two very different adult sons. While Giorgio is a playboy who constantly cheats on his wife, Leonardo (Luca Argentero, Eat Pray Love) is always unlucky in love. When Leonardo finally meets the woman of his dreams, Sara, he brings her home to meet the family, but it appears this is not the first time that Sara has met Giorgio. Directed by Luca Lucini and stars Luca Argentero, Alessandro Gassman and Stefania Sandrelli.', 'Longtime Italian cinema star Stefania Sandrelli (The First Beautiful Thing) is Alba, the mother of two very different adult sons. While Giorgio is a playboy who constantly cheats on his wife, Leonardo (Luca Argentero, Eat Pray Love) is always unlucky in love. When Leonardo finally meets the woman of his dreams, Sara, he brings her home to meet the family, but it appears this is not the first time that Sara has met Giorgio. Directed by Luca Lucini and stars Luca Argentero, Alessandro Gassman and Stefania Sandrelli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ib9hrGlLtRCiW3tmvGtTi8hpeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58223'),
  ('545642571865747622', 'Woman of Rome', 1954, 'Drama', 'Luigi Zampa, Leopoldo Savona, Luciano Martino', 'Giorgio Bassani, Alberto Moravia, Luigi Zampa', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Daniel Gélin, Franco Fabrizi, Raymond Pellegrin, Pina Piovani, Giovanni Di Benedetto, Renato Tontini, Xenia Valderi', null, 'During the fascist era, Adriana a beautiful young model, becomes a prostitute after a love affair gone wrong. She meets Mino, a partisan who falls in love with her and wants to redeem her.', 'During the fascist era, Adriana a beautiful young model, becomes a prostitute after a love affair gone wrong. She meets Mino, a partisan who falls in love with her and wants to redeem her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s57Oz0WWH91yRYGOBEKw2BxU86G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85044'),
  ('574235966404767336', 'Woman of Straw', 1964, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Basil Dearden, Otto Heller', 'Robert Muller, Stanley Mann', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Sean Connery, Ralph Richardson, Alexander Knox, Johnny Sekka, Peter Madden, Danny Daniels, Laurence Hardy', 'NR', 'Anthony Richmond schemes to get the fortune of his tyrannical, wheelchair-using tycoon uncle Charles Richmond by persuading Maria, a nurse he employs, to marry him.', 'Anthony Richmond schemes to get the fortune of his tyrannical, wheelchair-using tycoon uncle Charles Richmond by persuading Maria, a nurse he employs, to marry him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzBJBCwqXKNuIzDUuP03kA0an26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4999'),
  ('284877035694172999', 'Woman of the Hour', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Zach Kuperstein, Anna Kendrick, Chad Belair', 'Ian McDonald', 'Anna Kendrick, Daniel Zovatto, Nicolette Robinson, Jedidiah Goodacre, Autumn Best, Pete Holmes, Kelley Jakle, Kathryn Gallagher', 'R', 'An aspiring actress crosses paths with a prolific serial killer in ''70s LA when they''re cast on an episode of "The Dating Game."', 'An aspiring actress crosses paths with a prolific serial killer in ''70s LA when they''re cast on an episode of "The Dating Game."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc9ZqrJFbcUdlMg9lxXXtJb24jU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835113'),
  ('683725336082109935', 'Woman of the Lake', 1966, 'Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Toshirō Ishidō, Yasuko Ōno, Yoshishige Yoshida', 'Mariko Okada, Shigeru Tsuyuguchi, Tamotsu Hayakawa, Keiko Natsu, Hiroko Masuda, Aiko Masuda, Sakae Umezu, Yukio Tada', null, 'A married woman lets her lover take naked pictures of her. The photos end up in possession of a man who starts blackmailing the couple.', 'A married woman lets her lover take naked pictures of her. The photos end up in possession of a man who starts blackmailing the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF1nMrnI433OjlW3NeMxiiwd7E3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104374'),
  ('729369449748503353', 'Woman of the River', 1954, 'Drama', 'Mario Soldati, Florestano Vancini, Cesare Olivieri', 'Florestano Vancini, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Mario Soldati', 'Sophia Loren, Gérard Oury, Lise Bourdin, Rik Battaglia, Enrico Olivieri, Guido Celano, Maria Conventi, Edward Fleming', null, 'When peasant girl Nives is deserted by smuggler Gino Lodi, she betrays him to the police. Police officer Enzo Cinti, who loves Nives, traces her to the Po River cane-fields, where she is working as a cutter to support herself and an infant son, and warns her that Gino has escaped from prison and is seeking revenge. She rejects his offer to protect her. Gino finds Nives, mourning the drowning death of their son. He surrenders himself to the police and then walks at Nives'' side in the funeral procession.', 'When peasant girl Nives is deserted by smuggler Gino Lodi, she betrays him to the police. Police officer Enzo Cinti, who loves Nives, traces her to the Po River cane-fields, where she is working as a cutter to support herself and an infant son, and warns her that Gino has escaped from prison and is seeking revenge. She rejects his offer to protect her. Gino finds Nives, mourning the drowning death of their son. He surrenders himself to the police and then walks at Nives'' side in the funeral procession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVNyEAoYwkLVQ1BYlyEUB1doZSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225216'),
  ('169974209292184100', 'Woman of the Year', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'George Stevens, Robert A. Golden, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Ring Lardner, Jr., Michael Kanin', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Fay Bainter, Reginald Owen, Minor Watson, William Bendix, Gladys Blake, Dan Tobin', 'NR', 'Rival reporters Sam Craig and Tess Harding fall in love and get married, only to find their relationship strained when Sam comes to resent Tess'' hectic lifestyle.', 'Rival reporters Sam Craig and Tess Harding fall in love and get married, only to find their relationship strained when Sam comes to resent Tess'' hectic lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0Cf2GElBW2UfnQAFUqcqGYV7cY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20640'),
  ('1054712238749376115', 'Woman of Tokyo', 1933, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Masaru Kashiwabara, Hideo Shigehara', 'Tadao Ikeda, Kōgo Noda', 'Yoshiko Okada, Ureo Egawa, Kinuyo Tanaka, Shin''yō Nara, Chishū Ryū', null, 'Ryoichi and Chikako, brother and sister, live together. Chikako toils during the day and, at night, prostitutes herself to fund his college tuition.', 'Ryoichi and Chikako, brother and sister, live together. Chikako toils during the day and, at night, prostitutes herself to fund his college tuition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp4ZyjIeLHdBsm5jXXsPVoLpt1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142918'),
  ('291563582997117310', 'Woman of Water', 2002, 'Drama', 'Hidenori Sugimori, Hiroshi Machida', 'Hidenori Sugimori', 'UA, Tadanobu Asano, Mayumi Ogawa, Yutaka Enatsu, Ryuichi Ohura, Hikaru', null, 'Ryo personifies water, since whenever something important happens in her life, it rains. She inherits a bathhouse and meets a pyromaniac named Yusaku. Their confrontation leads to an inevitable union, just like elements of nature blend together.', 'Ryo personifies water, since whenever something important happens in her life, it rains. She inherits a bathhouse and meets a pyromaniac named Yusaku. Their confrontation leads to an inevitable union, just like elements of nature blend together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD2e3DBcAirkISr9dcrjihSAmGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71117'),
  ('65257105988504526', 'Woman on the Beach', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Kwang-kuk, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kim Seung-woo, Ko Hyun-jung, Song Sun-mi, Kim Tae-woo, Banyah Maria Choi, Oh Tae-kyung, Lee Ki-woo, Moon Sung-keun', null, 'A movie director entices his young friend to come to the beach on the pretext of writing a script. He then starts an affair with the friend''s girlfriend.', 'A movie director entices his young friend to come to the beach on the pretext of writing a script. He then starts an affair with the friend''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYgJt5vETydZuFofUUgvJUtFVzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54659'),
  ('1085568321398425824', 'Woman on the Run', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Norman Foster, Hal Mohr, Maurie M. Suess', 'Alan Campbell, Norman Foster', 'Ann Sheridan, Dennis O''Keefe, Robert Keith, John Qualen, Frank Jenks, Ross Elliott, Jane Liddell, Joan Shawlee', 'NR', 'Frank Johnson, a sole witness to a gangland murder, goes into hiding and is trailed by Police Inspector Ferris, on the theory that Frank is trying to escape from possible retaliation. Frank''s wife, Eleanor, suspects he is actually running away from their unsuccessful marriage. Aided by a newspaperman, Danny Leggett, Eleanor sets out to locate her husband. The killer is also looking for him, and keeps close tabs on Eleanor.', 'Frank Johnson, a sole witness to a gangland murder, goes into hiding and is trailed by Police Inspector Ferris, on the theory that Frank is trying to escape from possible retaliation. Frank''s wife, Eleanor, suspects he is actually running away from their unsuccessful marriage. Aided by a newspaperman, Danny Leggett, Eleanor sets out to locate her husband. The killer is also looking for him, and keeps close tabs on Eleanor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wp0FpyQvYVphtUSvANiCarawop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28663'),
  ('171654557850142379', 'Woman on Top', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Fina Torres, Thierry Arbogast', 'Vera Blasi', 'Penélope Cruz, Murilo Benício, Mark Feuerstein, John de Lancie, Anne Ramsay, Ana Gasteyer, Harold Perrineau, June Carryl', 'R', 'Set to the intoxicating rhythms of Brazil, "Woman on Top" is a spicy, sexy comedy about the magic of food, love and music. Meet Isabella, a sultry enchantress born with the special gift of melting the palates and hearts of men everywhere. When she decides to break free from her rocky marriage and the stifling kitchen of her husband''s restaurant in Brazil, she spirits off to San Francisco in pursuit of her dreams of a real culinary career.', 'Set to the intoxicating rhythms of Brazil, "Woman on Top" is a spicy, sexy comedy about the magic of food, love and music. Meet Isabella, a sultry enchantress born with the special gift of melting the palates and hearts of men everywhere. When she decides to break free from her rocky marriage and the stifling kitchen of her husband''s restaurant in Brazil, she spirits off to San Francisco in pursuit of her dreams of a real culinary career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYHvcMeVjWPwATYI0VCdecMy2n3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14629'),
  ('750996408061478511', 'Woman They Almost Lynched', 1953, 'Western', 'Allan Dwan, Reggie Lanning', 'Steve Fisher', 'John Lund, Brian Donlevy, Audrey Totter, Joan Leslie, Ben Cooper, James Brown, Nina Varela, Ellen Corby', 'NR', 'Led by its female mayor, a neutral town on the Arkansas-Missouri border during the Civil War attempts to stay peaceful. A newcomer looking for her brother is pulled into the town’s violence.', 'Led by its female mayor, a neutral town on the Arkansas-Missouri border during the Civil War attempts to stay peaceful. A newcomer looking for her brother is pulled into the town’s violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8Pcbb8UcPGBIHoiNcezLOJDu7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158359'),
  ('203888060787717647', 'Woman Times Seven', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Monnet, Marc Grunebaum, Vittorio De Sica', 'Cesare Zavattini', 'Shirley MacLaine, Peter Sellers, Rossano Brazzi, Lex Barker, Alan Arkin, Adrienne Corri, Robert Morley, Michael Caine', null, 'Seven mini-stories of adultery: a widow misbehaves at her husband''s funeral, a wife turns to streetwalking for revenge, a prudish girl surprises, a neglected wife vies for her husband''s attention, a fight over a dress, a death pact, and a detective revealed as a jealous husband''s spy.', 'Seven mini-stories of adultery: a widow misbehaves at her husband''s funeral, a wife turns to streetwalking for revenge, a prudish girl surprises, a neglected wife vies for her husband''s attention, a fight over a dress, a death pact, and a detective revealed as a jealous husband''s spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQMMWWZ86T9N7T2LBGRHain3jHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61041'),
  ('213614030566021914', 'Woman to Woman', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'Victor Saville', 'Victor Saville, Nicholas Fodor', 'Betty Compson, George Barraud, Juliette Compton, Reginald Sharland, Winter Hall, Margaret Chambers, Georgie Billings', 'NR', 'While on leave in WW I France an English officer and French cabaret star fall in love with one another and plan to marry. However, he is recalled to the front, wounded and has memory loss.', 'While on leave in WW I France an English officer and French cabaret star fall in love with one another and plan to marry. However, he is recalled to the front, wounded and has memory loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssyPDA2ZFQMrbOL9zCE7rxGuUCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190361'),
