  ('325324721070088809', 'Woman Without a Face', 1947, 'Drama', 'Gustaf Molander, Åke Dahlqvist', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gustaf Molander', 'Alf Kjellin, Gunn Wållgren, Anita Björk, Stig Olin, Olof Winnerstrand, Marianne Löfgren, Georg Funkquist, Åke Grönberg', null, 'Martin is married to Frida and together they have a son. One day after a quarrel with his wife, he goes to buy flowers to ask for forgiveness. In the flower shop he meets the beautiful Rut and falls instantly in love. They both start a passionate love affair but beneath the beautiful surface hides a completely different woman than he expected ...', 'Martin is married to Frida and together they have a son. One day after a quarrel with his wife, he goes to buy flowers to ask for forgiveness. In the flower shop he meets the beautiful Rut and falls instantly in love. They both start a passionate love affair but beneath the beautiful surface hides a completely different woman than he expected ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CtVxx9CfQFNMDccGWFtWtXwzKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268265'),
  ('864274393882813313', 'Woman''s Bedroom: Lusty Competition', 1978, 'Drama', 'Shinichi Shiratori, Shōhei Andō, Yuzo Yamaguchi', 'Susumu Saji', 'Junko Miyashita, Naomi Tani, Etsuko Hara, Osamu Tsuruoka, Jun Hongo, Tarō Ishi, Hirokazu Inoue, Hidetoshi Kageyama', null, 'A former mistress, an unhappy wife and a frisky female college student meet in a bar. It turns out that they all have developed an interest an eligible doctor.', 'A former mistress, an unhappy wife and a frisky female college student meet in a bar. It turns out that they all have developed an interest an eligible doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paVqJUxVQeKNnPODbUEzQHodFZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007942'),
  ('301476180183548839', 'Woman''s Lake', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zoltan Paul, Fabian Spuck', 'Zoltan Paul', 'Nele Rosetz, Therese Hämer, Lea Draeger, Constanze Wächter, Thomas Thieme', null, 'What could be lovelier than Women''s Lake - a magical summer setting near Berlin? Rosa, perhaps. She''s the slightly melancholy guardian of the lake, spending her days in a boat, trapping fish and watching for poachers. Or her lover, the polished and prosperous Kirsten, with her perfect cottage on the shore of Frauensee. How does their relationship work, and what effect will the two young lesbians in the canoe have on it all? Thoughtful, complex and beautiful.', 'What could be lovelier than Women''s Lake - a magical summer setting near Berlin? Rosa, perhaps. She''s the slightly melancholy guardian of the lake, spending her days in a boat, trapping fish and watching for poachers. Or her lover, the polished and prosperous Kirsten, with her perfect cottage on the shore of Frauensee. How does their relationship work, and what effect will the two young lesbians in the canoe have on it all? Thoughtful, complex and beautiful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhMxhiePJ4xsi1dLhKyJKhOXaR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209115'),
  ('118664799346097537', 'Woman''s World', 1954, 'Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Henry Weinberger', 'Claude Binyon, Russel Crouse, Howard Lindsay', 'Clifton Webb, June Allyson, Cornel Wilde, Lauren Bacall, Fred MacMurray, Van Heflin, Arlene Dahl, Elliott Reid', null, 'Needing to fill the position of general manager of his company, and believing that an executive''s wife is crucial to her husband''s success, auto industry mogul Gifford brings three couples to New York to size up: Jerry and Carol: he hard-driven and self-reliant, she willing to use her beauty to further her husband''s career; Sid and Elizabeth, he ulcer-ridden and torn between achieving success and restoring their troubled marriage, she positive that his job will kill him, but gamely agreeing to play the good wife for the duration; and down-to-earth Bill, whose good-natured Katie fears that his promotion would spell the end of their idyllic familiy existence.', 'Needing to fill the position of general manager of his company, and believing that an executive''s wife is crucial to her husband''s success, auto industry mogul Gifford brings three couples to New York to size up: Jerry and Carol: he hard-driven and self-reliant, she willing to use her beauty to further her husband''s career; Sid and Elizabeth, he ulcer-ridden and torn between achieving success and restoring their troubled marriage, she positive that his job will kill him, but gamely agreeing to play the good wife for the duration; and down-to-earth Bill, whose good-natured Katie fears that his promotion would spell the end of their idyllic familiy existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6NBpVPI0qiyzpynRLpnE2Y9w1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113843'),
  ('591437238930349426', 'Womaneater', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Charles Saunders, Douglas Hermes, Ernest Palmer', 'Brandon Fleming', 'George Coulouris, Vera Day, Peter Forbes-Robertson, Joyce Gregg, Jimmy Vaughn, Maxwell Foster, Edward Higgins, Joy Webster', 'NR', 'A mad scientist captures women and feeds them to a flesh-eating tree, which in turn gives him a serum that helps bring the dead back to life.', 'A mad scientist captures women and feeds them to a flesh-eating tree, which in turn gives him a serum that helps bring the dead back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cOBmfsM1WCD5hSFeVPopOaJodi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63027'),
  ('877642009522022701', 'Womanlight', 1979, 'Drama', 'Costa-Gavras, Ricardo Aronovich, Reynald Calcagni', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Yves Montand, Romy Schneider, Romolo Valli, Lila Kedrova, Heinz Bennent, Roberto Benigni, Dieter Schidor, Catherine Allégret', 'NR', 'Having both suffered extreme losses, two disparate souls try to form a relationship for consolation rather than romance.', 'Having both suffered extreme losses, two disparate souls try to form a relationship for consolation rather than romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8opi4dSSXu7UbG0EN4xUdLpAT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4948'),
  ('445079792004071935', 'Womb', 2010, 'Romance, Science Fiction', 'Benedek Fliegauf, Péter Szatmári, Margarethe Heitmüller', 'Benedek Fliegauf', 'Eva Green, Matt Smith, Lesley Manville, Peter Wight, István Lénárt, Hannah Murray, Ruby O. Fee, Tristan Christopher', 'NR', 'A woman''s consuming love forces her to bear the clone of her dead beloved. From his infancy to manhood, she faces the unavoidable complexities of her controversial decision.', 'A woman''s consuming love forces her to bear the clone of her dead beloved. From his infancy to manhood, she faces the unavoidable complexities of her controversial decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raTEzBZBflPyVhOls4PmrryvPos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59457'),
  ('33926727345500159', 'Women', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Anton Sigurðsson', 'Anton Sigurðsson', 'Anna Marie Dobbins, Anna Maiche, Adam Dorsey, Kylie Delre, Tara Warren, Denise Gossett, Heather Fusari, Anthony Del Negro', null, 'A small town detective while investigating the disappearance of a local woman comes across an unassuming Sociology professor who is hiding a secret life.', 'A small town detective while investigating the disappearance of a local woman comes across an unassuming Sociology professor who is hiding a secret life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTgSMm9LRXVGxfaKqmlPCcQx5RJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719164'),
  ('957429908163643274', 'Women Are Weak', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Michel Boisrond, Robert Lefebvre', 'Michel Boisrond, Annette Wademant', 'Alain Delon, Mylène Demongeot, Pascale Petit, Jacqueline Sassard, Noël Roquevert, André Luguet, Pierre Mondy, Simone Renant', null, 'A playboy is pursued by three women seeking romance.', 'A playboy is pursued by three women seeking romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naZ65EbmfN8FtceegpiSnnb3BRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265104'),
  ('475217092741377311', 'Women at War (1939-1945)', 2015, 'Documentary, War, History', 'Hugues Nancy, Fabien Beziat', null, null, null, 'Mothers, nurses, soldiers and deportees - these women fought against persecution for freedom and survival amid the turbulence of World war II.', 'Mothers, nurses, soldiers and deportees - these women fought against persecution for freedom and survival amid the turbulence of World war II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9f1A3lQlE3TkyhA8kdKNhGSHlLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497182'),
  ('29036007078772403', 'Women at War 1914-1918', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Fabien Beziat, Hugues Nancy', 'Fabien Beziat, Hugues Nancy', null, null, 'Trace the overlapping journeys of exceptional women swept up in World War I and hear their tales of bravery on history''s front lines', 'Trace the overlapping journeys of exceptional women swept up in World War I and hear their tales of bravery on history''s front lines', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sfpE8Z4KDdCsFSKvhTIVTKA4X3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496302'),
  ('578997181015116338', 'Women Behind Bars', 1975, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco', 'Marius Lesoeur', 'Lina Romay, Martine Stedil, Nathalie Chape, Roger Darton, Frieda Altstadt, Raymond Hardy, Jesús Franco, Joëlle Le Quément', null, 'A small-time hood brings the attention of the law with an insurance scam and diamond theft, but things become even more interesting when his moll murders him and is slammed behind bars where she faces all manner of electric shock treatments to various parts of her anatomy', 'A small-time hood brings the attention of the law with an insurance scam and diamond theft, but things become even more interesting when his moll murders him and is slammed behind bars where she faces all manner of electric shock treatments to various parts of her anatomy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpzdBsa2mea4gm3mGMgE1N0xUwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70922'),
  ('204971420500173743', 'Women Fighting', 1896, 'Comedy, Action', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Auguste Lumière', null, 'A quarrel between two women that a man attempts to separate.', 'A quarrel between two women that a man attempts to separate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ1Vr5YFodoMBAeEEZSn7tjEvE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190565'),
  ('147288491526272408', 'Women from the Lake of Scented Souls', 1993, 'Drama', 'Xiaoran Bao, Xie Fei', 'Xie Fei', 'Siqin Gaowa, Wu Yujuan, Chen Baoguo, Lei Kesheng, Hu Xiaoguang, Ma Xiaoqing', null, 'If money can''t buy happiness, can it at least buy control over others? Xiang is hard-working, running a small sesame oil business. Her husband is lazy and drinks; her son is blood simple. When Japanese investors provide capital to expand Xiang''s business, she has the wealth to raise her social standing and buy a wife for her son, Dunzi. When money and a forceful personality fail to bend others to her will, including daughter-in-law Huanhuan, Xiang must find another way to tranquillity.', 'If money can''t buy happiness, can it at least buy control over others? Xiang is hard-working, running a small sesame oil business. Her husband is lazy and drinks; her son is blood simple. When Japanese investors provide capital to expand Xiang''s business, she has the wealth to raise her social standing and buy a wife for her son, Dunzi. When money and a forceful personality fail to bend others to her will, including daughter-in-law Huanhuan, Xiang must find another way to tranquillity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia8HCqjRhto8lvtRY7pVFsJVjOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162841'),
  ('1031368055798549000', 'Women in Cages', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Gerardo de Leon, Felipe Sacdalan', 'James H. Watkins, David Osterhout', 'Judith Brown, Roberta Collins, Jennifer Gan, Pam Grier, Bernard Bonnin, Charlie Davao, Johnny Long, Dwight Howard', 'R', 'Carol Jeffries is a naive American woman staying in the Philippines. She is given ten years in prison after being set up by her drug-dealer boyfriend, Rudy. She endures the harsh conditions, sadistic head matron and attempts on her life, then convinces her cell-mates to try to escape with her through the jungle, in spite of the knowledge that ruthless trackers will be sent out after them.', 'Carol Jeffries is a naive American woman staying in the Philippines. She is given ten years in prison after being set up by her drug-dealer boyfriend, Rudy. She endures the harsh conditions, sadistic head matron and attempts on her life, then convinces her cell-mates to try to escape with her through the jungle, in spite of the knowledge that ruthless trackers will be sent out after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaXqLsz2u6D2Plr3xyw6LEOqJJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34462'),
  ('594316409284538452', 'Women in Cellblock 9', 1978, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Horror', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Karine Gambier, Howard Vernon, Susan Hemingway, Aida Gouveia, Esther Studer, Dora Doll, Cesar Anahory', null, 'A group of female freedom-fighters led by Karine Levere is caught by the warden of a women''s prison, located somwhere in the South American jungle. None of them will reveal the secrets of their organisation or the names of their collaborators in the cities, so they are handed over to Dr. Costa who, after four years inactivity in Europe, is delighted to be able to practice his torture techniques once more. Laverne fails to resist the inhuman treatments and reveals all. The only hope of saving the organization is for the girls to warn the city cell before it''s too late. They trick the prison guard into having sex with them, knock him out and break out of prison. The warden and Dr. Costa must prevent them from revealing the practices inside the prison. The hunt is on and it''s shoot to kill...', 'A group of female freedom-fighters led by Karine Levere is caught by the warden of a women''s prison, located somwhere in the South American jungle. None of them will reveal the secrets of their organisation or the names of their collaborators in the cities, so they are handed over to Dr. Costa who, after four years inactivity in Europe, is delighted to be able to practice his torture techniques once more. Laverne fails to resist the inhuman treatments and reveals all. The only hope of saving the organization is for the girls to warn the city cell before it''s too late. They trick the prison guard into having sex with them, knock him out and break out of prison. The warden and Dr. Costa must prevent them from revealing the practices inside the prison. The hunt is on and it''s shoot to kill...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tF9HfLwTwf0kCbeZOGeXvuu36S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68635'),
  ('247846674072813041', 'Women in Fury', 1984, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Edson Batista', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini', 'Suzane Carvalho, Rossana Ghessa, Henri Pagnoncelli, Gloria Cristal , Paulo Guarnieri, Zaira Bueno, Vera Holtz, Gilson Moura', null, 'The young, pretty and shy Angela Duvall is jailed for murder in some Latin American country. In the prison she gets brutally "initiated" by the other inmates. The nice, honest and handsome prison doctor believe she''s innocent and tries to help her out.', 'The young, pretty and shy Angela Duvall is jailed for murder in some Latin American country. In the prison she gets brutally "initiated" by the other inmates. The nice, honest and handsome prison doctor believe she''s innocent and tries to help her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpQ5YAg9IwXpnlkjTZxWSj1P8Jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39456'),
  ('926296667296028683', 'Women in Love', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ken Russell, Billy Williams', 'Larry Kramer', 'Alan Bates, Oliver Reed, Glenda Jackson, Jennie Linden, Eleanor Bron, Alan Webb, Vladek Sheybal, Catherine Willmer', 'R', 'Growing up in the sheltered confines of a 1920s English coal-mining community, free-spirited sisters Gudrun and Ursula explore erotic love with a wealthy playboy and a philosophical educator, with cataclysmic results for all four.', 'Growing up in the sheltered confines of a 1920s English coal-mining community, free-spirited sisters Gudrun and Ursula explore erotic love with a wealthy playboy and a philosophical educator, with cataclysmic results for all four.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHfThxdQC99LLoe2jKZ1u3vIge2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66027'),
  ('970600206448777096', 'Women in Prison', 1978, 'Drama', 'Toshiharu Ikeda, Nobuaki Shirai, Katsumasa Naoi', 'Chiho Katsura', 'Erina Miyai, Natsuko Yashiro, Tōru Ibuki, Yūsuke Kazato, Satoko Aikawa, Midori Mori, Kenji Shimamura, Tayori Hinatsu', null, 'A woman ends up in prison because of her lying, manipulative and exploitative lover. There she discovers that she is not alone.', 'A woman ends up in prison because of her lying, manipulative and exploitative lover. There she discovers that she is not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/optt7Q2r7jIrBsSLKOskgPUSAyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558189'),
  ('431665319124059463', 'Women in Revolt', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Paul Morrissey, Andy Warhol, Jed Johnson', 'Paul Morrissey', 'Holly Woodlawn, Candy Darling, Jackie Curtis, Johnny Kemper, Geri Miller, Jonathan Kramer, Michael Sklar, Maurice Braddell', null, 'Candy is an aloof heiress caught in an unhappy relationship with her brother. Jackie is a virginal intellectual who believes women are oppressed in contemporary American society. And Holly is a nymphomaniac who has come to loathe men, despite her attraction to them. Together, they join a militant feminist group, P.I.G. (Politically Involved Girls), but their newfound liberation doesn''t make them any happier.', 'Candy is an aloof heiress caught in an unhappy relationship with her brother. Jackie is a virginal intellectual who believes women are oppressed in contemporary American society. And Holly is a nymphomaniac who has come to loathe men, despite her attraction to them. Together, they join a militant feminist group, P.I.G. (Politically Involved Girls), but their newfound liberation doesn''t make them any happier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hlI1Ij8MdgUcPpWfWzk3b50MVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112234'),
  ('196557428792914812', 'Women in Trouble', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sebastian Gutierrez, Cale Finot', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Carla Gugino, Adrianne Palicki, Connie Britton, Marley Shelton, Garcelle Beauvais, Elizabeth Berkley, Josh Brolin, Emmanuelle Chriqui', 'R', 'A serpentine day in the life of ten seemingly disparate women: a porn star, a flight attendant, a psychiatrist, a masseuse, a bartender, a pair of call girls, etc. All of them with one crucial thing in common. Trouble.', 'A serpentine day in the life of ten seemingly disparate women: a porn star, a flight attendant, a psychiatrist, a masseuse, a bartender, a pair of call girls, etc. All of them with one crucial thing in common. Trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY1L1QuJS4PFiw3Kc5fiVBD0gJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31723'),
  ('926279684128486712', 'Women of Devil''s Island', 1962, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Domenico Paolella', 'Domenico Paolella', 'Guy Madison, Michèle Mercier, Federica Ranchi, Marisa Belli, Paul Müller, Tullio Altamura, Antonella Della Porta, Gisella Arden', 'NR', 'Italian costume drama about convicted women in France being sent to the penal colony on Devil''s Island where they must wade through alligator-infested waters and find gold. Life on the island is tough for these buxom, beautifully-swept coiffed maidens - virtually none who look like they had even the slightest knowledge of crimes worthy of such a punishment. Here, if the girls want to get a day of rest they must work the night with the guards and/or warden of the island, but some changes come when Guy Madison arrives as the new warden out to change the horrible lives led by these playmate-wannabes.', 'Italian costume drama about convicted women in France being sent to the penal colony on Devil''s Island where they must wade through alligator-infested waters and find gold. Life on the island is tough for these buxom, beautifully-swept coiffed maidens - virtually none who look like they had even the slightest knowledge of crimes worthy of such a punishment. Here, if the girls want to get a day of rest they must work the night with the guards and/or warden of the island, but some changes come when Guy Madison arrives as the new warden out to change the horrible lives led by these playmate-wannabes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJUTwW3NjoaBuKFJi30dNYfa0yE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79513'),
  ('5662452594587746', 'Women of Mafia', 2018, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Mirosław Kuba Brożek, Patryk Vega, Marek Nowakowski', 'Patryk Vega, Olaf Olszewski', 'Olga Bołądź, Aleksandra Popławska, Katarzyna Warnke, Julia Wieniawa, Janusz Chabior, Sebastian Fabijański, Filip Guźla, Bogusław Linda', null, 'A maligned police officer receives one last chance to save her career when she must break up a crime syndicate by masquerading as one of their own.', 'A maligned police officer receives one last chance to save her career when she must break up a crime syndicate by masquerading as one of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mS6upz3yoEM7AK2xmcXBUekWPFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498214'),
  ('162666371015739728', 'Women of Mafia 2', 2019, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Mirosław Kuba Brożek, Mikołaj Syguła, Patryk Vega', 'Sylwia Koperska-Mrozińska', 'Angie Cepeda, Agnieszka Dygant, Aleksandra Grabowska, Aleksandra Popławska, Katarzyna Warnke, Piotr Adamczyk, Enrique Arce, Amin Bensalem', null, 'After taking control of the capital, Nanny''s gang prepares for the biggest smuggling action in the history of Poland.', 'After taking control of the capital, Nanny''s gang prepares for the biggest smuggling action in the history of Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ry6YUwRNAsC45KadGgHPOxi6kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569133'),
  ('1024990067895953697', 'Women of the Mine', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Malena Bystrowicz, Loreley Unamuno', 'Loreley Unamuno, Malena Bystrowicz', null, null, 'Portraits of three women who live and work in the infamous mines of El Cerro Rico in Bolivia. Work inside the mines has been limited to men, while the women are forced to work outside searching for mineral scraps on the side of the mountain. The film highlights the women''s strength, determination and resilience in the face of struggle and hardship.', 'Portraits of three women who live and work in the infamous mines of El Cerro Rico in Bolivia. Work inside the mines has been limited to men, while the women are forced to work outside searching for mineral scraps on the side of the mountain. The film highlights the women''s strength, determination and resilience in the face of struggle and hardship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUcSHLqrivDxSnm6Mbf0e89MzgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512737'),
  ('1076426871821063190', 'Women of the Night', 1948, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kōhei Sugiyama', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Sanae Takasugi, Tomie Tsunoda, Mitsuo Nagata, Kōju Murata, Kumeko Urabe, Kikue Mōri, Minpei Tomimoto', null, 'In early post-war Osaka, three women—war widow Fusako, her Korean expat sister Natsuko, and Kumiko, Fusako''s sister-in-law—descend into prostitution, all for their individual reasons.', 'In early post-war Osaka, three women—war widow Fusako, her Korean expat sister Natsuko, and Kumiko, Fusako''s sister-in-law—descend into prostitution, all for their individual reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFjyz3hLnC6gkZiRh6RjZpWgVro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85844'),
  ('455350097813066876', 'Women of the Prehistoric Planet', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Arthur C. Pierce, Archie R. Dalzell, Richard Dixon', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Wendell Corey, Keith Larsen, John Agar, Merry Anders, Irene Tsu, Robert Ito, Paul Gilbert, Suzie Kaye', null, 'A space ship crash lands on the third planet of a distant solar system, killing all hands except for a young boy named Tang. The rescue ship arrives some 20 years later. One of the crew, a girl named Linda meets Tang and falls in love with him. They are attacked by the native humanoids of the planet and many of them are killed off. Also, the crew encounters many strange beasts on this strange, but somewhat familiar world.', 'A space ship crash lands on the third planet of a distant solar system, killing all hands except for a young boy named Tang. The rescue ship arrives some 20 years later. One of the crew, a girl named Linda meets Tang and falls in love with him. They are attacked by the native humanoids of the planet and many of them are killed off. Also, the crew encounters many strange beasts on this strange, but somewhat familiar world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teURW8JLrjCFFcBCzIr9IviFL2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42727'),
  ('56091324428030114', 'Women of the World', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Paolo Cavara, Gualtiero Jacopetti, Franco Prosperi', 'Paolo Cavara, Franco Prosperi, Gualtiero Jacopetti', 'Stefano Sibaldi, Belinda Lee, Peter Ustinov, Gualtiero Jacopetti', null, 'A mondo doc detailing the wild and weird world of women... around the world.', 'A mondo doc detailing the wild and weird world of women... around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia2YPhA2tslNuUenp8POLu5cvbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87521'),
  ('436007964893782504', 'Women of Valor', 1986, 'War, TV Movie', 'Mike Fash, Buzz Kulik', 'Jonas McCord', 'Susan Sarandon, Kristy McNichol, Alberta Watson, Valerie Mahaffey, Terry O''Quinn, Suzanne Lederer, Neva Patterson, Jay Acovone', 'PG', 'A group of American Army nurses are captured by the Japanese in April 1942 and spend three years in a prisoner-of-war camp in Bataan. Lt Margaret Ann Jessup, the head army nurse, survives the camp and testifies against the Japanese in front of the United States Congressional subcommittee years later as a colonel.', 'A group of American Army nurses are captured by the Japanese in April 1942 and spend three years in a prisoner-of-war camp in Bataan. Lt Margaret Ann Jessup, the head army nurse, survives the camp and testifies against the Japanese in front of the United States Congressional subcommittee years later as a colonel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNf7Kszn2w6bDBxcbsVpTIfCROr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210486'),
  ('244698117984000672', 'Women on the Edge', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Maximiliano Hunglinger, Miranda de Sá Souza, Santiago Masip', 'Azul Lombardía, Alberto Rojas Apel, Sebastián Meschengieser', 'Carla Peterson, Julieta Díaz, Esteban Lamothe, Martín Garabal, Salvador del Solar, Carlos Alcántara, Alfonso Tort, Celina Font', null, 'After meeting in an anger management group, two women embark on a journey of empowerment and friendship when they set out to expose a surgeon with a suspicious reputation.', 'After meeting in an anger management group, two women embark on a journey of empowerment and friendship when they set out to expose a surgeon with a suspicious reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnj9sEjNpgfKotr5wM0Z9RnjyHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106053'),
  ('315985620119544862', 'Women on the Run', 1993, 'Action, Thriller', 'Richard Yuen Tak, David Lai Tai-Wai, Corey Yuen', 'Calvin Poon Yuen-Leung', 'Farini Cheung Yui-Ling, Tamara Guo, Won Jin, Corey Yuen, David Lai Tai-Wai, Wong Wai-Tak, Chan Sek, Johnny Cheung Wa', null, 'A young woman named Yin dreams of leaving her modest village life for a chance to try to make it big as a martial arts movie star. Leaving for the big city with her boyfriend, life takes a turn for poor Yin when she soon finds herself addicted to drugs and being pimped out by her boyfriend. After a violent altercation forces Yin to flee to Hong Kong, it''s not long before she ends up on the radar of the police. Without any other options, Yin makes a deal with the police to go undercover with one of their straight-laced female detectives, Hung, in order to try and bring down a notorious drug dealer nicknamed "King Kong." Victimized by the men in their lives, the two unlikely friends must team up to protect each other from the criminals out to get them and work together to get revenge on those who have betrayed them.', 'A young woman named Yin dreams of leaving her modest village life for a chance to try to make it big as a martial arts movie star. Leaving for the big city with her boyfriend, life takes a turn for poor Yin when she soon finds herself addicted to drugs and being pimped out by her boyfriend. After a violent altercation forces Yin to flee to Hong Kong, it''s not long before she ends up on the radar of the police. Without any other options, Yin makes a deal with the police to go undercover with one of their straight-laced female detectives, Hung, in order to try and bring down a notorious drug dealer nicknamed "King Kong." Victimized by the men in their lives, the two unlikely friends must team up to protect each other from the criminals out to get them and work together to get revenge on those who have betrayed them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfYDXHiyogSMc5cZ1tjW48dfKFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45403'),
  ('1130730130588879598', 'Women on the Verge of a Nervous Breakdown', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'José Luis Alcaine, Pedro Almodóvar, Miguel Ángel Pérez Campos', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Carmen Maura, Antonio Banderas, Julieta Serrano, María Barranco, Rossy de Palma, Kiti Mánver, Guillermo Montesinos, Chus Lampreave', 'R', 'After being dumped by her lover, Pepa finds her life and the lives of those around her spiraling out of control in a deliciously chaotic series of events.', 'After being dumped by her lover, Pepa finds her life and the lives of those around her spiraling out of control in a deliciously chaotic series of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C5FJlUo96pj1xAs2BKnB58PYzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4203'),
