  ('816445286827499615', 'Women Vs Men', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Brizzi, Alessandro Pascuzzo, Marcello Montarsi', 'Fausto Brizzi, Massimiliano Bruno, Pulsatilla', 'Claudio Bisio, Nancy Brilli, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Francesca Inaudi, Luciana Littizzetto, Emilio Solfrizzi, Serena Autieri', null, 'Anna and Piero fighting routine of a long marriage, when Piero loses his memory, Anna reconstructs his way. For its part, the concierge Rocco and his friend Michele play in a group that emulates the Beatles and face opposition from their partners. Finally, Marcello and Paola are a divorced couple who, from time to time, pretend they are still together to avoid problems. They are victims of a relentless war of sexes.', 'Anna and Piero fighting routine of a long marriage, when Piero loses his memory, Anna reconstructs his way. For its part, the concierge Rocco and his friend Michele play in a group that emulates the Beatles and face opposition from their partners. Finally, Marcello and Paola are a divorced couple who, from time to time, pretend they are still together to avoid problems. They are victims of a relentless war of sexes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzgtKiqb5wQeojXond9BLo9g4iB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58444'),
  ('775406267470606623', 'Women Who Flirt', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edmond Pang, Jake Pollock', 'Edmond Pang', 'Zhou Xun, Huang Xiaoming, Sonia Sui, Xie Yi-lin, Choenyi Tsering, Michael Kai Sui, Cady Yang, Long De', null, 'When Zhang Hui is told by long-time best friend Xiao Gong that he has a new girlfriend, she is determined to learn new tricks to gain him back. Based on the novel written by Luo Fuman, Everyone Loves Tender Women.', 'When Zhang Hui is told by long-time best friend Xiao Gong that he has a new girlfriend, she is determined to learn new tricks to gain him back. Based on the novel written by Luo Fuman, Everyone Loves Tender Women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DDUpJmJcP7fmQ1xTUNYXU14TRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299828'),
  ('207739674905936844', 'Women Without Innocence', 1978, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Peter Baumgartner', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Nanda van Bergen, Michael Maien, Esther Studer, Monica Swinn, Peggy Markoff, Kurt Meinicke, Brigitte Meyer', null, 'Margarita is found, naked and bloody in a luxurious house and is promptly taken to a mental institute. The doctors and nurses meant to take care of her aren''t exactly who they seem and a mysterious figure, clad in black, circles the premise at night, offing nubile young women.', 'Margarita is found, naked and bloody in a luxurious house and is promptly taken to a mental institute. The doctors and nurses meant to take care of her aren''t exactly who they seem and a mysterious figure, clad in black, circles the premise at night, offing nubile young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyfenUYTs6Fz2lqXwxRtDAvQm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68642'),
  ('1137927877852704079', 'Women Without Men', 2009, 'Drama', 'Shoja Azari, Shirin Neshat, Martin Gschlacht', 'Shoja Azari', 'Shabnam Toloui, Pegah Ferydoni, Orsolya Tóth, Arita Shahrzad, Bijan Daneshmand, Navid Navid, Ahmad Hamed', null, 'Against the tumultuous backdrop of Iran''s 1953 CIA-backed coup d''état, the destinies of four women converge in a beautiful orchard garden, where they find independence, solace and companionship.', 'Against the tumultuous backdrop of Iran''s 1953 CIA-backed coup d''état, the destinies of four women converge in a beautiful orchard garden, where they find independence, solace and companionship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCcboYYdiHwd8PFu3XaVlJVOzxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44159'),
  ('136321519072646237', 'Women''s Camp 119', 1977, 'Thriller, Horror, War', 'Bruno Mattei, Giacinto Bonacquisti', 'Bruno Mattei, Giacinto Bonacquisti, Aureliano Luppi', 'Lorraine De Selle, Ivano Staccioli, Ria De Simone, Nello Riviè, Gabriele Carrara, Giovanni Attanasio, Sonia Viviani, Marina Daunia', null, 'A prisoner is forced to serve as a doctor''s assistant, giving her a front row seat for the horrible goings-on. There''s the experiment to revive Nazi soldiers who have frozen to death by having nude women rub their bodies all over the corpse (that one works), and the experiment tries to "cure" homosexual men by having nude women dance for them. This is only some of the horrors that are going on there.', 'A prisoner is forced to serve as a doctor''s assistant, giving her a front row seat for the horrible goings-on. There''s the experiment to revive Nazi soldiers who have frozen to death by having nude women rub their bodies all over the corpse (that one works), and the experiment tries to "cure" homosexual men by having nude women dance for them. This is only some of the horrors that are going on there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzKt8qSmPrTUHmyvZOi7R4klu2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40363'),
  ('500132698714603434', 'Women''s Prison', 1955, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lewis Seiler, Lester White', 'Crane Wilbur, Jack DeWitt', 'Ida Lupino, Jan Sterling, Cleo Moore, Audrey Totter, Phyllis Thaxter, Howard Duff, Warren Stevens, Barry Kelley', null, 'A crusading psychiatrist battles a sadistic female warden to improve conditions at a women''s prison.', 'A crusading psychiatrist battles a sadistic female warden to improve conditions at a women''s prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79dZhoqHrqWRiq2eQAQQ5vrpZcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25788'),
  ('986278260751188649', 'Women''s Prison Massacre', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei, Claudio Fragasso, Henry Frogers', 'Olivier Lefait, Claudio Fragasso', 'Laura Gemser, Gabriele Tinti, Ursula Flores, Maria Romano, Antonella Giacomini, Raul Cabrera, Pierangelo Pozzato, Robert Mura', 'NR', 'Emanuelle is framed by a corrupt D.A. while investigating a drug smuggling operation and has to tough it out under lock and key, dealing with a strict warden and abusive guards.', 'Emanuelle is framed by a corrupt D.A. while investigating a drug smuggling operation and has to tough it out under lock and key, dealing with a strict warden and abusive guards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d648Kstj9gGUa4RsktDukHsFpjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45233'),
  ('471207334897584544', 'Won Ton Ton: The Dog Who Saved Hollywood', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Michael Winner, Richard H. Kline', 'Arnold Schulman, Cy Howard', 'Bruce Dern, Madeline Kahn, Art Carney, Phil Silvers, Teri Garr, Ron Leibman, Sterling Holloway, Virginia Mayo', null, 'A would-be filmmaker and actress shake up the industry with a trick dog who gets discovered by a studio bus driver in the 1920s.', 'A would-be filmmaker and actress shake up the industry with a trick dog who gets discovered by a studio bus driver in the 1920s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mabS3g532eQH00B1gAh1eJZvsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36820'),
  ('1067663445328732201', 'Won''t Back Down', 2012, 'Drama', 'Daniel Barnz, Roman Osin, Donald Sparks', 'Brin Hill', 'Viola Davis, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Ving Rhames, Lance Reddick, Rosie Perez, Emily Alyn Lind, Stephen Weigand, Liza Colón-Zayas', 'PG', 'Jamie Fitzpatrick and Nona Alberts are two women from opposites sides of the social and economic track, but they have one thing in common: a mission to fix their community''s broken school and ensure a bright future for their children. The two women refuse to let any obstacles stand in their way as they battle a bureaucracy that''s hopelessly mired in traditional thinking, and they seek to re-energize a faculty that has lost its passion for teaching.', 'Jamie Fitzpatrick and Nona Alberts are two women from opposites sides of the social and economic track, but they have one thing in common: a mission to fix their community''s broken school and ensure a bright future for their children. The two women refuse to let any obstacles stand in their way as they battle a bureaucracy that''s hopelessly mired in traditional thinking, and they seek to re-energize a faculty that has lost its passion for teaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Repugxu8BQXMYSGpzqRrBjFRna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82631'),
  ('771869401987427073', 'Won''t You Be My Neighbor?', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Neville, Graham Willoughby', null, 'Margaret Whitmer, Tom Junod, Joanne Rogers, Jim Rogers, Max King, Hedda Sharapan, Betty Seamans, Junlei Li', 'PG-13', 'For more than thirty years, and through his television program, Fred Rogers (1928-2003), host, producer, writer and pianist, accompanied by his puppets and his many friends, spoke directly to young children about some of life''s most important issues.', 'For more than thirty years, and through his television program, Fred Rogers (1928-2003), host, producer, writer and pianist, accompanied by his puppets and his many friends, spoke directly to young children about some of life''s most important issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qE8NZjiP2M884baH0VoLF828Vp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490003'),
  ('374780005409302062', 'Wonder', 2017, 'Family, Drama', 'Stephen Chbosky, Don Burgess, Michael Burgess', 'Steven Conrad, Stephen Chbosky, Jack Thorne', 'Jacob Tremblay, Julia Roberts, Owen Wilson, Izabela Vidovic, Noah Jupe, Millie Davis, Bryce Gheisar, Mandy Patinkin', 'PG', 'The story of August Pullman – a boy with facial differences – who enters fifth grade, attending a mainstream elementary school for the first time.', 'The story of August Pullman – a boy with facial differences – who enters fifth grade, attending a mainstream elementary school for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sONh3LYGFcVDTy8pm1tbSOB13Li.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406997'),
  ('631581905986799654', 'Wonder Bar', 1934, 'Crime, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Lloyd Bacon, Sol Polito', 'Earl Baldwin', 'Al Jolson, Kay Francis, Dolores del Río, Ricardo Cortez, Dick Powell, Guy Kibbee, Ruth Donnelly, Hugh Herbert', 'NR', 'Harry and Inez are a dance team at the Wonder Bar. Inez loves Harry, but he is in love with Liane, the wife of a wealthy business man. Al Wonder and the conductor/singer Tommy are in love with Inez. When Inez finds out that Harry wants to leave Paris and is going to the USA with Liane, she kills him.', 'Harry and Inez are a dance team at the Wonder Bar. Inez loves Harry, but he is in love with Liane, the wife of a wealthy business man. Al Wonder and the conductor/singer Tommy are in love with Inez. When Inez finds out that Harry wants to leave Paris and is going to the USA with Liane, she kills him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noCvd3gFaPtk5y601WRDzERl217.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132883'),
  ('62411537959540284', 'Wonder Boy', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Anissa Bonnefont', 'Anissa Bonnefont', 'Olivier Rousteing, Dani Alves, Alessandra Ambrosio, Imran Amed, Kiko Arai, Yvonne Bevanda, Juliette Binoche, Jessie Bloemendaal', 'NR', 'At age 25, Olivier Rousteing was named the creative director of the French luxury fashion house, Balmain. At the time, Rousteing was a relatively unknown designer, but in the decade since, he’s proven his business prowess and artistic instinct by leading Balmain to new heights. Wonderboy gives the viewer the rare opportunity to experience the inner sanctum of the fashion world, as we stand shoulder-to-shoulder with this extraordinary individual while he works.', 'At age 25, Olivier Rousteing was named the creative director of the French luxury fashion house, Balmain. At the time, Rousteing was a relatively unknown designer, but in the decade since, he’s proven his business prowess and artistic instinct by leading Balmain to new heights. Wonderboy gives the viewer the rare opportunity to experience the inner sanctum of the fashion world, as we stand shoulder-to-shoulder with this extraordinary individual while he works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUetNzEDucAg9BCZFZejA3QHodI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639947'),
  ('327592956031818198', 'Wonder Boys', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Curtis Hanson, Dante Spinotti, Renee Hill-Sweet', 'Steve Kloves', 'Michael Douglas, Tobey Maguire, Frances McDormand, Robert Downey Jr., Katie Holmes, Rip Torn, Richard Knox, Jane Adams', 'R', 'Grady is a 50-ish English professor who hasn''t had a thing published in years—not since he wrote his award winning ''Great American Novel'' 7 years ago. This weekend proves even worse than he could imagine as he finds himself reeling from one misadventure to another in the company of a new wonder boy author.', 'Grady is a 50-ish English professor who hasn''t had a thing published in years—not since he wrote his award winning ''Great American Novel'' 7 years ago. This weekend proves even worse than he could imagine as he finds himself reeling from one misadventure to another in the company of a new wonder boy author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGOdSLaZmu42qqwDUMgrfctJ65M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11004'),
  ('1095239294546663411', 'Wonder Dog', 1950, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto is infatuated by a pretty lady dog, but she sighs for Prince, a circus wonder dog she sees on a poster.', 'Pluto is infatuated by a pretty lady dog, but she sighs for Prince, a circus wonder dog she sees on a poster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhuWpVgka9YEyUbTEqqHRjdwmKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164949'),
  ('548613787056200027', 'Wonder Garden', 2013, 'Music, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Yojiro Arai', null, null, null, 'A young girl is transported to a magical world by a storefront bear in this anime short by Studio Colorido.', 'A young girl is transported to a magical world by a storefront bear in this anime short by Studio Colorido.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1o1IWWtHcA5jKSokqUOo3R3eD5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257837'),
  ('166174467847324961', 'Wonder Man', 1945, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, William E. Snyder, Victor Milner', 'Don Hartman, Melville Shavelson, Philip Rapp', 'Danny Kaye, Virginia Mayo, Vera-Ellen, Donald Woods, S.Z. Sakall, Allen Jenkins, Edward Brophy, Steve Cochran', 'NR', 'Boisterous nightclub entertainer Buzzy Bellew was the witness to a murder committed by gangster Ten Grand Jackson. One night, two of Jackson''s thugs kill Buzzy and dump his body in the lake at Prospect Park in Brooklyn. Buzzy comes back as a ghost and summons his bookworm twin, Edwin Dingle, to Prospect Park so that he can help the police nail Jackson.', 'Boisterous nightclub entertainer Buzzy Bellew was the witness to a murder committed by gangster Ten Grand Jackson. One night, two of Jackson''s thugs kill Buzzy and dump his body in the lake at Prospect Park in Brooklyn. Buzzy comes back as a ghost and summons his bookworm twin, Edwin Dingle, to Prospect Park so that he can help the police nail Jackson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9PXUextPtjQD4Z7WBopKJzFVtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34127'),
  ('603792961279149419', 'Wonder Park', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Dylan Brown', 'Josh Appelbaum, André Nemec', 'Brianna Denski, Norbert Leo Butz, Ken Hudson Campbell, Mila Kunis, John Oliver, Kenan Thompson, Ken Jeong, Jennifer Garner', 'PG', 'A young girl named June with a big imagination makes an incredible discovery -- the amusement park of her dreams has come to life. Filled with the world''s wildest rides operated by fun-loving animals, the excitement never ends. But when trouble hits, June and her misfit team of furry friends begin an unforgettable journey to save the park.', 'A young girl named June with a big imagination makes an incredible discovery -- the amusement park of her dreams has come to life. Filled with the world''s wildest rides operated by fun-loving animals, the excitement never ends. But when trouble hits, June and her misfit team of furry friends begin an unforgettable journey to save the park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KomINZhIuJeB4oB7k7tkq8tmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400157'),
  ('236182824980402898', 'Wonder Wheel', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chris Dreyer, Vittorio Storaro, Hugh Landwehr', 'Woody Allen', 'Kate Winslet, Juno Temple, Jim Belushi, Justin Timberlake, Max Casella, Jack Gore, David Krumholtz, Robert C. Kirk', 'PG-13', 'The story of four characters whose lives intertwine amid the hustle and bustle of the Coney Island amusement park in the 1950s: Ginny, an emotionally volatile former actress now working as a waitress in a clam house; Humpty, Ginny’s rough-hewn carousel operator husband; Mickey, a handsome young lifeguard who dreams of becoming a playwright; and Carolina, Humpty’s long-estranged daughter, who is now hiding out from gangsters at her father’s apartment.', 'The story of four characters whose lives intertwine amid the hustle and bustle of the Coney Island amusement park in the 1950s: Ginny, an emotionally volatile former actress now working as a waitress in a clam house; Humpty, Ginny’s rough-hewn carousel operator husband; Mickey, a handsome young lifeguard who dreams of becoming a playwright; and Carolina, Humpty’s long-estranged daughter, who is now hiding out from gangsters at her father’s apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKYpAL1A01T9a1taGXAyfqXjI5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429189'),
  ('756561879202121242', 'Wonder Woman', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Vincent McEveety, Jack Roe, Joseph F. Biroc', 'John D. F. Black', 'Cathy Lee Crosby, Kaz Garas, Andrew Prine, Ricardo Montalban, Charlene Holt, Anitra Ford, Richard X. Slattery, Jordan Rhodes', null, 'A super-hero uses her powers to thwart an international spy ring.', 'A super-hero uses her powers to thwart an international spy ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJuphyQM3MDWId1Hk8rF399I3dP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161620'),
  ('54401899538668438', 'Wonder Woman', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Lauren Montgomery', 'Michael Jelenic', 'Keri Russell, Nathan Fillion, Alfred Molina, Rosario Dawson, Marg Helgenberger, Oliver Platt, Virginia Madsen, Skye Arens', 'PG-13', 'On the mystical island of Themyscira, a proud and fierce warrior race of Amazons have raised a daughter of untold beauty, grace and strength: Princess Diana. When an Army fighter pilot, Steve Trevor, crash-lands on the island, the rebellious and headstrong Diana defies Amazonian law by accompanying Trevor back to civilization.', 'On the mystical island of Themyscira, a proud and fierce warrior race of Amazons have raised a daughter of untold beauty, grace and strength: Princess Diana. When an Army fighter pilot, Steve Trevor, crash-lands on the island, the rebellious and headstrong Diana defies Amazonian law by accompanying Trevor back to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6sI0yLJXkmrbSJzVRCmmfa4nhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15359'),
  ('746756745644451826', 'Wonder Woman', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Patty Jenkins, Patrick Harris, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Allan Heinberg', 'Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Connie Nielsen, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Saïd Taghmaoui, Ewen Bremner', 'PG-13', 'An Amazon princess comes to the world of Man in the grips of the First World War to confront the forces of evil and bring an end to human conflict.', 'An Amazon princess comes to the world of Man in the grips of the First World War to confront the forces of evil and bring an end to human conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4ncgZjG2Zu8ZW5al1vIZTsSjqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297762'),
  ('301197599254065172', 'Wonder Woman 1984', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Emily Thomas, Patty Jenkins, Matthew Jensen', 'David Callaham, Patty Jenkins, Geoff Johns', 'Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Kristen Wiig, Pedro Pascal, Robin Wright, Connie Nielsen, Lilly Aspell, Amr Waked', 'PG-13', 'A botched store robbery places Wonder Woman in a global battle against a powerful and mysterious ancient force that puts her powers in jeopardy.', 'A botched store robbery places Wonder Woman in a global battle against a powerful and mysterious ancient force that puts her powers in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UlWHLMpgZm9bx6QYh0NFoq67TZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464052'),
  ('38745293242049474', 'Wonder Woman: Bloodlines', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Justin Copeland, Sam Liu', 'Mairghread Scott', 'Rosario Dawson, Jeffrey Donovan, Marie Avgeropoulos, Kimberly Brooks, Ray Chase, Michael Dorn, Mozhan Navabi, Adrienne C. Moore', 'PG-13', 'Witness the legendary origin of renowned Justice League member Wonder Woman as she fights for good with her sword and magic lasso. Equally strong in body, heart and will, she makes it her mission to help a troubled young girl enlisted by a deadly organization known as Villainy, Inc., whose criminal members have their sights set on invading Themyscira, Wonder Woman’s paradise home. The battle will be epic, because if there''s one thing an Amazon knows, it’s war!', 'Witness the legendary origin of renowned Justice League member Wonder Woman as she fights for good with her sword and magic lasso. Equally strong in body, heart and will, she makes it her mission to help a troubled young girl enlisted by a deadly organization known as Villainy, Inc., whose criminal members have their sights set on invading Themyscira, Wonder Woman’s paradise home. The battle will be epic, because if there''s one thing an Amazon knows, it’s war!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1SBqj0fn1j72ST5i1jauWo3swT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537055'),
  ('893651559689941743', 'Wonder Women', 1973, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Vincent O''Neil, Ricardo M. David', 'Lou Whitehill', 'Maria De Aragon, Roberta Collins, Ross Hagen, Claire Polan, Nancy Kwan, Tony Lorea, Sid Haig, Vic Diaz', 'PG', 'Dr. Tsu is a brilliant surgeon with her own exotic island off the coast of Manila. Using her sexy, all-girl army of martial-arts experts, Tsu kidnaps some of the world''s greatest athletes. She is able to transplant any body part, so she uses the athletes for spare parts to sell to the world''s richest men. Mike Harber is a womanizing, wise-cracking insurance investigator for Lloyd''s of London sent to Manila to investigate the disappearance of a jai-alai player, and becomes involved with Dr. Tsu''s mad mission.', 'Dr. Tsu is a brilliant surgeon with her own exotic island off the coast of Manila. Using her sexy, all-girl army of martial-arts experts, Tsu kidnaps some of the world''s greatest athletes. She is able to transplant any body part, so she uses the athletes for spare parts to sell to the world''s richest men. Mike Harber is a womanizing, wise-cracking insurance investigator for Lloyd''s of London sent to Manila to investigate the disappearance of a jai-alai player, and becomes involved with Dr. Tsu''s mad mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxTFSLmbqRa8p8RiXNTEdZFh7QK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116445'),
  ('454134419193085879', 'Wonderful Absinthe', 1899, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'Gentlemen get into a misunderstanding over absinthe. There is no known credited director for this film, although the attribution usually goes for Alice Guy.', 'Gentlemen get into a misunderstanding over absinthe. There is no known credited director for this film, although the attribution usually goes for Alice Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeZSnzSLG2BQMDTagj2OwUNDglH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119964'),
  ('933022985505800875', 'Wonderful Days', 2003, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Moon-saeng Kim, Young Ki Yoon', 'Jun-Young Park, Jay Lender, Michael Keyes', 'Won-Je Tak, Eun Yeong Seon, Oh In Seong, Kim Sung-min, Yoo Ji-tae, Sunmin Park, Joon-ho Chung, Pak Ton-ha', null, 'Civilization has been destroyed by war and pollution, but the survivors have built the last city of Ecoban. As most natural resources have been exhausted, Ecoban is powered by pollution. The citizens of Ecoban need to continue creating this pollution leading them into conflict with the inhabitants of Marr while one man just wants to clear away the clouds and see the sky.', 'Civilization has been destroyed by war and pollution, but the survivors have built the last city of Ecoban. As most natural resources have been exhausted, Ecoban is powered by pollution. The citizens of Ecoban need to continue creating this pollution leading them into conflict with the inhabitants of Marr while one man just wants to clear away the clouds and see the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot2pohox9Hbmt5eH1JzNYleOgL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14258'),
  ('542439561997522789', 'Wonderful Nightmare', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Kim Jae-keun, Kang Hyo-jin, Sohn Won-ho', 'Kim Je-young', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Song Seung-heon, Kim Sang-ho, Ra Mi-ran, Seo Shin-ae, Lee Jun-hyeok, Kim Byong-chul, Lee Yong-nyeo', null, 'When a woman dies after a mistake by personalities in the afterlife, she needs to exist as a different woman for a while.', 'When a woman dies after a mistake by personalities in the afterlife, she needs to exist as a different woman for a while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvuYtGoct3GUxzdvMg9IIQ0PRyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342055'),
  ('904497405698434482', 'Wonderful to Be Young!', 1961, 'Comedy, Music', 'Sidney J. Furie, Douglas Slocombe, Robert Lennard', 'Ronald Cass, Peter Myers', 'Cliff Richard, Robert Morley, Carole Gray, Jet Harris, Hank Marvin, Bruce Welch, Teddy Green, Richard O''Sullivan', null, 'Nicky and his friends find that their youth club is in danger of being flattened to make way for a new office block unless they can come up with £1500 to pay the new owner, the ruthless property tycoon Hamilton Black. To help raise the cash, Nicky records a song and his friends broadcast it via a pirate radio station, touting him as "The Mystery Singer" - the plan works and interest in their up and coming show is heightened by this new but unknown heart-throb. But Nicky has an even bigger secret and one that he cannot share, even with his girlfriend Toni... Hamilton Black is his father.', 'Nicky and his friends find that their youth club is in danger of being flattened to make way for a new office block unless they can come up with £1500 to pay the new owner, the ruthless property tycoon Hamilton Black. To help raise the cash, Nicky records a song and his friends broadcast it via a pirate radio station, touting him as "The Mystery Singer" - the plan works and interest in their up and coming show is heightened by this new but unknown heart-throb. But Nicky has an even bigger secret and one that he cannot share, even with his girlfriend Toni... Hamilton Black is his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVceeDimc6g2NsQpdzC82GB3Qy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115494'),
  ('216372747100269936', 'Wonderful Town', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aditya Assarat, Umpornpol Yugala', 'Aditya Assarat', 'Anchalee Saisoontorn, Supphasit Kansen, Dul Yaambunying, Prateep Harnudomlap, Sorawit Poolsawat, Aroon Auisakul', null, 'Local girl Na runs a small hotel where every day is more of less the same until Ta arrives one day. Ta is an architect from the city who has come to oversee the building of a new development and very slowly the two build a friendship that develops into something more romantic.', 'Local girl Na runs a small hotel where every day is more of less the same until Ta arrives one day. Ta is an architect from the city who has come to oversee the building of a new development and very slowly the two build a friendship that develops into something more romantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjEK439jikdkjc1qAJqPIVxiE9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37285'),
  ('867719406372737387', 'Wonderful World', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Goldin, Daniel Shulman, Benjamin T. Brammeier', 'Joshua Goldin', 'Matthew Broderick, Sanaa Lathan, Michael Kenneth Williams, Philip Baker Hall, Jesse Tyler Ferguson, Jodelle Ferland, Ally Walker, Mia Ford', 'R', 'Ben Singer is a failed children''s folk singer, a career proofreader, a less-than-extraordinary weekend dad, and perhaps the most negative man alive. Floundering in all aspects of his life, Ben''s only comfort comes from regular chess games and friendly debates on game theory with his Senegalese roommate Ibou. When Ibou is suddenly struck ill, Ben''s pessimistic worldview seems unequivocally confirmed. It takes an extended visit from Ibou''s sister Khadi for Ben to realize that cynicism may be all a matter of perspective.', 'Ben Singer is a failed children''s folk singer, a career proofreader, a less-than-extraordinary weekend dad, and perhaps the most negative man alive. Floundering in all aspects of his life, Ben''s only comfort comes from regular chess games and friendly debates on game theory with his Senegalese roommate Ibou. When Ibou is suddenly struck ill, Ben''s pessimistic worldview seems unequivocally confirmed. It takes an extended visit from Ibou''s sister Khadi for Ben to realize that cynicism may be all a matter of perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30uwX2GkaHdB6sPcG0b2RUWb2KF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27735'),
  ('507997547775469289', 'Wonderland', 1999, 'Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, Sean Bobbitt, Michael Elliott', 'Laurence Coriat', 'Shirley Henderson, Gina McKee, Molly Parker, Ian Hart, John Simm, Stuart Townsend, Kika Markham, Jack Shepherd', null, 'There''s little wonder in the working-class lives of Bill, Eileen, and their three grown daughters. They''re lonely Londoners. Nadia, a cafe waitress, places personal ads, looking for love; Debbie, a single mom, entertains men at the hair salon after hours; her son spends part of the weekend with her ex, a man with a hair-trigger temper. Molly is expecting her first baby and its father acts as if the responsibility is too much for him.', 'There''s little wonder in the working-class lives of Bill, Eileen, and their three grown daughters. They''re lonely Londoners. Nadia, a cafe waitress, places personal ads, looking for love; Debbie, a single mom, entertains men at the hair salon after hours; her son spends part of the weekend with her ex, a man with a hair-trigger temper. Molly is expecting her first baby and its father acts as if the responsibility is too much for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddm9mDHoWP4bnzJ9pRgItKCvGh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32640'),
  ('460811441999464195', 'Wonderland', 2003, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Michael Grady, James Cox, Luke Scully', 'Captain Mauzner, Todd Samovitz, D. Loriston Scott', 'Val Kilmer, Kate Bosworth, Dylan McDermott, Lisa Kudrow, Carrie Fisher, Josh Lucas, Christina Applegate, Ted Levine', 'R', 'On the afternoon of July 1, 1981, Los Angeles police responded to a distress call on Wonderland Avenue and discovered a grisly quadruple homicide. The police investigation that followed uncovered two versions of the events leading up to the brutal murders - both involving legendary porn actor John Holmes.', 'On the afternoon of July 1, 1981, Los Angeles police responded to a distress call on Wonderland Avenue and discovered a grisly quadruple homicide. The police investigation that followed uncovered two versions of the events leading up to the brutal murders - both involving legendary porn actor John Holmes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfG8S7D4rYeVqvTzjc3D36PAK3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4997'),
  ('2770129548706617', 'Wonderland', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lionel Rupp, Mike Scheiwiller, Benny Jaberg', null, 'Luna Arzoni, Nicolas Bachmann, Egon Betschart, Soumeya Ferro-Luzzi, Morgane Ferru', null, 'An apocalyptical storm threatens to wipe out an entire country. A state of emergency is raised while mayhem breaks out.', 'An apocalyptical storm threatens to wipe out an entire country. A state of emergency is raised while mayhem breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WL0wAjiMtm7iG7XBAntNjHcaYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367584'),
  ('1023318176833220985', 'Wonderland', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Park Hong-yeol, Kim Seung-gyu, Kim Hyeong-yong', 'Min Ye-ji, Kim Tae-yong', 'Tang Wei, Suzy, Park Bo-gum, Jung Yu-mi, Choi Woo-shik, Gong Yoo, Tang Joon-sang, Seong Byeong-suk', null, 'In a world where an AI programme allows people to communicate with their deceased loved ones, a flight attendant and a mother question the meaning of reality and humanity.', 'In a world where an AI programme allows people to communicate with their deceased loved ones, a flight attendant and a mother question the meaning of reality and humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGFjhFkqpOpFFUkEQjetKS11AWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635996'),
  ('1144279459179511159', 'Wonders in the Suburbs', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jeanne Balibar, André Chemetoff', 'Jeanne Balibar, Camille Fontaine', 'Jeanne Balibar, Ramzy Bedia, Emmanuelle Béart, Mathieu Amalric, Bulle Ogier, Marlène Saldana, Philippe Katerine, Jean-Quentin Châtelain', null, 'Political rivals try to sabotage a new mayor and her eccentric plans for an underprivileged French municipality.', 'Political rivals try to sabotage a new mayor and her eccentric plans for an underprivileged French municipality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1FnZukLz5JTCQQeIxuhSyhhUhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592566'),
  ('36202665091805016', 'Wonderstruck', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mark Friedberg, Todd Haynes, Edward Lachman', 'Brian Selznick', 'Oakes Fegley, Millicent Simmonds, Julianne Moore, Michelle Williams, Cory Michael Smith, James Urbaniak, Damian Young, Patrick Murney', 'PG', 'The story of a young boy in the Midwest is told simultaneously with a tale about a young girl in New York from fifty years ago as they both seek the same mysterious connection.', 'The story of a young boy in the Midwest is told simultaneously with a tale about a young girl in New York from fifty years ago as they both seek the same mysterious connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hPnW1yWlIJcKCEQ5Kbr5dMtrDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383709'),
  ('1014396107469633457', 'Wonderwall', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe Massot, Jonathan Benson, Arnold Chapkis', 'Guillermo Cabrera Infante', 'Jack MacGowran, Jane Birkin, Irene Handl, Richard Wattis, Iain Quarrier, Beatrix Lehmann, Brian Walsh, Sean Lynch', null, 'The eccentric professor Collins lives completely secluded in his chaotic apartment. When the model Penny moves in next to him, he becomes fascinated by her. He drills holes in her walls and ceiling and peeps on her day and night. He loses himself in daydreams and delusions.', 'The eccentric professor Collins lives completely secluded in his chaotic apartment. When the model Penny moves in next to him, he becomes fascinated by her. He drills holes in her walls and ceiling and peeps on her day and night. He loses himself in daydreams and delusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms6RGdU5z59WFkKg732718YIA8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39309'),
  ('990615748976401363', 'Wonderwell', 2023, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Vlad Marsavin, Kenji Katori', 'William Brookfield', 'Kiera Milward, Nell Tiger Free, Carrie Fisher, Rita Ora, Sebastian Croft, Vincent Spano, Megan Dodds, Lloyd Owen', 'PG-13', 'In an idyllic Italian village, a young American girl on the threshold of adolescence is swept into a timeless magical adventure in Wonderwell.', 'In an idyllic Italian village, a young American girl on the threshold of adolescence is swept into a timeless magical adventure in Wonderwell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deoxTZeVAULpVvbbxrNxAcyHAkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456483'),
  ('771400841510502161', 'Wondrous Boccaccio', 2015, 'Comedy, History, Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani, Simone Zampagni', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Lello Arena, Paola Cortellesi, Carolina Crescentini, Flavio Parenti, Vittoria Puccini, Michele Riondino, Kim Rossi Stuart, Riccardo Scamarcio', null, 'It''s 1348. The plague has brutally hit Florence. A group of then young people, seven women and three men, rebel against the feeling of death that is about to swallow them. They flee the city and find refuge in an abandoned villa in the Tuscan hills. Here, between moral doubts and the tasks needed to survive, they kill time by telling each other stories until they will decide to return. The stories are varied - tragic, bizarre, funny or erotic - but common and central to all of them is the female presence.', 'It''s 1348. The plague has brutally hit Florence. A group of then young people, seven women and three men, rebel against the feeling of death that is about to swallow them. They flee the city and find refuge in an abandoned villa in the Tuscan hills. Here, between moral doubts and the tasks needed to survive, they kill time by telling each other stories until they will decide to return. The stories are varied - tragic, bizarre, funny or erotic - but common and central to all of them is the female presence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woTiRqHTSaXlTDEAQqDjSA5hKYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314404'),
  ('211075145996737492', 'Wonka', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'James Rhodes, John Sorapure, Suzanne Austin', 'Simon Farnaby, Paul King', 'Timothée Chalamet, Calah Lane, Keegan-Michael Key, Hugh Grant, Paterson Joseph, Olivia Colman, Tom Davis, Jim Carter', 'PG', 'Willy Wonka – chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time – is proof that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.', 'Willy Wonka – chock-full of ideas and determined to change the world one delectable bite at a time – is proof that the best things in life begin with a dream, and if you’re lucky enough to meet Willy Wonka, anything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhb1qOilapbapxWQn9jtRCMwXJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787699'),
  ('461656697362822682', 'Woo', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daisy von Scherler Mayer, Jean Lépine', 'David C. Johnson', 'Jada Pinkett Smith, Tommy Davidson, Duane Martin, Michael Ralph, Darrel Heath, Dave Chappelle, Paula Jai Parker, LL Cool J', 'R', 'Woo is a woman in control of her world. She is smart, self-confident, sophisticated and snarky. And she doesn''t have any trouble attracting members of the opposite sex. But for some reason no one ever sticks around. Woo meets Tim, a paralegal who is her complete opposite. They shouldn''t click. However, Woo and Tim begin to bond when a series of weird and stressful calamities hits them while they are on their first date.', 'Woo is a woman in control of her world. She is smart, self-confident, sophisticated and snarky. And she doesn''t have any trouble attracting members of the opposite sex. But for some reason no one ever sticks around. Woo meets Tim, a paralegal who is her complete opposite. They shouldn''t click. However, Woo and Tim begin to bond when a series of weird and stressful calamities hits them while they are on their first date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K1IfJXWPW1N5J6ar8ZOLU47c98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58680'),
  ('800641783848081088', 'Woochi: The Demon Slayer', 2009, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Kim Sung-kwan, Choi Young-hwan', 'Choi Dong-hoon', 'Gang Dong-won, Kim Yun-seok, Lim Soo-jung, Yoo Hai-jin, Song Young-chang, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Sang-ho, Sun Woo-sun', null, 'Spanning four centuries in Korea, this epic action-adventure concerns a powerful pipe and a trio of wizards who will do anything to protect it.', 'Spanning four centuries in Korea, this epic action-adventure concerns a powerful pipe and a trio of wizards who will do anything to protect it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al1V9H2GEjMQNcAnUpWZvkXX0gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40171'),
  ('429604965651278887', 'Wood & Stock: Sex, Oregano and Rock''n''Roll', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Otto Guerra, Rodrigo John, Marta Machado', 'Rodrigo John, Angeli, Otto Guerra', 'Zé Victor Castiel, Sepé Tiaraju, Rita Lee, Janaína Kremer, Tom Zé, Felipe Mônaco, Léo Machado, Michele Frantz', null, 'Experience an adventure of counterculture, psychedelia, and an abundance of peace and love with Angeli’s beloved comic characters, the hippies Wood & Stock. As the euphoria of the 1970s fades, it''s time to focus on family and work. However, a new rock band might just rekindle the spirit of those iconic years.', 'Experience an adventure of counterculture, psychedelia, and an abundance of peace and love with Angeli’s beloved comic characters, the hippies Wood & Stock. As the euphoria of the 1970s fades, it''s time to focus on family and work. However, a new rock band might just rekindle the spirit of those iconic years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjE4se4cCIyMH7xt5eUaghMnnF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90374'),
  ('731535255587047113', 'Wood Job!', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Akiko Ashizawa, Yûsuke Inoue', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Shota Sometani, Masami Nagasawa, Hideaki Ito, Yûka, Naomi Nishida, Makita Sports, Masashi Arifuku, Yoshimasa Kondo', null, 'After failing his university entrance exam, Yuki Hirano sets his eyes on the role of a forestry trainee. Setting off for training he doubts his decision many times, but eventually after passing the training course, he is sent to Kamusari Village for a year of work experience - where he becomes assimilated with the beauty of nature and the warm-hearted people of the village.', 'After failing his university entrance exam, Yuki Hirano sets his eyes on the role of a forestry trainee. Setting off for training he doubts his decision many times, but eventually after passing the training course, he is sent to Kamusari Village for a year of work experience - where he becomes assimilated with the beauty of nature and the warm-hearted people of the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvo0367R3pWJJrwGDRMMOCZnSwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274817'),
  ('84162996372758009', 'Woodchipper Massacre', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jon McBride', 'Jon McBride', 'Jon McBride, Denice Edeal, Tom Casiello, Patricia McBride, Kim Bailey, Perren Page', null, 'Jon, Tom, and Denise accidently kill their senile old Aunt while she''s looking after them while their father is away on business. Not sure what to do, they decide to dispose of the body in the rented woodchipper in the backyard. But more trouble comes a-knocking when their cousin Kim, their Aunt''s son, shows up unexpectedly.', 'Jon, Tom, and Denise accidently kill their senile old Aunt while she''s looking after them while their father is away on business. Not sure what to do, they decide to dispose of the body in the rented woodchipper in the backyard. But more trouble comes a-knocking when their cousin Kim, their Aunt''s son, shows up unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXDCdnREil3cLEIioxvPo7dbMRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69852'),
  ('411865787965960583', 'Wooden Crosses', 1932, 'Drama, War', 'Raymond Bernard, Jules Kruger, René Ribault', 'Raymond Bernard, André Lang', 'Pierre Blanchar, Gabriel Gabrio, Charles Vanel, Antonin Artaud, Paul Azaïs, René Bergeron, Raymond Cordy, Marcel Delaître', null, 'The young and patriotic student Demachy joins the French army in 1914 to defend his country. But he and his comrades soon experience the terrifying, endless trench war in Champagne, where more and more wooden crosses have to be erected for this cannon fodder.', 'The young and patriotic student Demachy joins the French army in 1914 to defend his country. But he and his comrades soon experience the terrifying, endless trench war in Champagne, where more and more wooden crosses have to be erected for this cannon fodder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcIwbiZn57HR9xpQD1U8pUC0PBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32859'),
  ('1118310596914078508', 'Woodland Café', 1937, 'Animation, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid', null, 'Elvia Allman, Jimmie Cushman, Margie Hines, C.B. Johnson, James Miller, Thelma Porter, Eddie Prinz, Clarrie Collins', 'NR', 'Bugs of all kinds convene on a jazz club for an evening of fun.', 'Bugs of all kinds convene on a jazz club for an evening of fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19Wtx5HVppbZUlonkxjKmZAsJbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109335'),
  ('627284739738413327', 'Woodlands Dark and Days Bewitched: A History of Folk Horror', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Kier-La Janisse', 'Kier-La Janisse', 'Abraham Castillo Flores, Adam Scovell, Alexandra Heller-Nicholas, Alice Lowe, Amanda Reyes, Andy Paciorek, Bernice M. Murphy, Briony Kidd', null, 'An exploration of the cinematic history of the folk horror, from its beginnings in the UK in the late sixties; through its proliferation on British television in the seventies and its many manifestations, culturally specific, in other countries; to its resurgence in the last decade.', 'An exploration of the cinematic history of the folk horror, from its beginnings in the UK in the late sixties; through its proliferation on British television in the seventies and its many manifestations, culturally specific, in other countries; to its resurgence in the last decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hW1TFe8Q6W4p6hxFbWOTWvwoySg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614637'),
  ('1038433883207443594', 'Woodlawn', 2015, 'Drama', 'Andrew Erwin, Jon Erwin, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jon Erwin, Quinton Peeples', 'C. Thomas Howell, Sean Astin, Jon Voight, Virginia Williams, Brando Eaton, Sherri Shepherd, Nic Bishop, Caleb Castille', 'PG', 'Love and unity in a school torn by racism and hate in the 1970s. A gifted high school football player must learn to embrace his talent and his faith as he battles racial tensions on and off the field.', 'Love and unity in a school torn by racism and hate in the 1970s. A gifted high school football player must learn to embrace his talent and his faith as he battles racial tensions on and off the field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BJ1XNBBEiqaCM4SQhHYTrWqCfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333596'),
  ('801611372029208520', 'Woodpeckers', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'José María Cabral, Hernan Herrera', 'José María Cabral', 'Jean Jean, Judith Rodriguez Perez, Ramón Emilio Candelario, Manuel Raposo, Carlota Carretero, Aleja Johnson, Mario Nuñez, Merionne Toussaint', null, 'Julián finds love and a reason for living in the last place imaginable: the Dominican Republic''s Najayo Prison. His romance, with fellow prisoner Yanelly, must develop through sign language and without the knowledge of dozens of guards.', 'Julián finds love and a reason for living in the last place imaginable: the Dominican Republic''s Najayo Prison. His romance, with fellow prisoner Yanelly, must develop through sign language and without the knowledge of dozens of guards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui0bda7B2MkF4cRKFxhs6HRsijC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428479'),
  ('724523881602262343', 'Woodshock', 1985, 'Documentary, Music', 'Richard Linklater, Lee Daniel', null, 'Daniel Johnston', 'NR', 'It''s just a simple stretch of interviews and images capturing the people who camp out, dope up, drink up, sometimes get naked, and jump into a nearby waterfall, whilst listening to musicians like Daniel Johnston.', 'It''s just a simple stretch of interviews and images capturing the people who camp out, dope up, drink up, sometimes get naked, and jump into a nearby waterfall, whilst listening to musicians like Daniel Johnston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8W56O0i0h3UVKZrIxJU3gbzJvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201304'),
  ('454608995966188812', 'Woodshock', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kate Mulleavy, Laura Mulleavy, Peter Flinckenberg', 'Kate Mulleavy, Laura Mulleavy', 'Kirsten Dunst, Joe Cole, Pilou Asbæk, Steph DuVall, Jack Kilmer, Susan Traylor, Joel McCoy, Michael Pavlicek', 'R', 'Theresa, a haunted young woman spiraling in the wake of profound loss, is torn between her fractured emotional state and the reality-altering effects of a potent cannabinoid drug.', 'Theresa, a haunted young woman spiraling in the wake of profound loss, is torn between her fractured emotional state and the reality-altering effects of a potent cannabinoid drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXbgY04zMSqMKdNLTcSMP6m5sSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396777'),
  ('247633678000252480', 'Woodstock', 1970, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Michael Wadleigh, Malcolm Hart, Michael Margetts', 'Michael Wadleigh', 'Richie Havens, Joan Baez, Roger Daltrey, John Entwistle, Keith Moon, Pete Townshend, Joe Cocker, Country Joe McDonald', 'R', 'An intimate look at the Woodstock Music & Art Festival held in Bethel, NY in 1969, from preparation through cleanup, with historic access to insiders, blistering concert footage, and portraits of the concertgoers; negative and positive aspects are shown, from drug use by performers to naked fans sliding in the mud, from the collapse of the fences by the unexpected hordes to the surreal arrival of National Guard helicopters with food and medical assistance for the impromptu city of 500,000.', 'An intimate look at the Woodstock Music & Art Festival held in Bethel, NY in 1969, from preparation through cleanup, with historic access to insiders, blistering concert footage, and portraits of the concertgoers; negative and positive aspects are shown, from drug use by performers to naked fans sliding in the mud, from the collapse of the fences by the unexpected hordes to the surreal arrival of National Guard helicopters with food and medical assistance for the impromptu city of 500,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnfhelfQucSb4Y54yFgtnSNhsAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9459'),
  ('625397085530301196', 'Woodstock 99: Peace, Love, and Rage', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Garret Price', null, 'Michael Lang, John Scher, Wesley Morris, Maureen Callahan, Steven Hyden, Tariq Trotter, Jonathan Davis, Moby', 'R', 'Explore Woodstock 99, a three-day music festival promoted to echo unity and counterculture idealism of the original 1969 concert but instead devolved into riots, looting and sexual assaults.', 'Explore Woodstock 99, a three-day music festival promoted to echo unity and counterculture idealism of the original 1969 concert but instead devolved into riots, looting and sexual assaults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EKvQJgLg0wX4uYq9WhBlq3pxD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848562'),
  ('573136654606570489', 'Woodstock: Three Days That Defined a Generation', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Barak Goodman, Jamila Ephron', 'Barak Goodman, Don Kleszy', 'Joan Baez, David Crosby, Wavy Gravy, Richie Havens, Stephen Stills, Bonnie Beecher, Bill Graham, Joel Rosenman', null, '50 years after the legendary fest, Barak Goodman’s electric retelling of Woodstock, from the point of view of those who were on the ground, evokes the freedom, passion, community, and joy the three-day music festival created.', '50 years after the legendary fest, Barak Goodman’s electric retelling of Woodstock, from the point of view of those who were on the ground, evokes the freedom, passion, community, and joy the three-day music festival created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejPrzjG17UrYHjUn8xE3EAYnoDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588226'),
  ('587848521041973839', 'Woodwalkers', 2024, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Damián John Harper, Raphael Domanski, Caroline Howard', 'David Sandreuter', 'Emile Chérif, Lilli Falk, Johan von Ehrlich, Sophie Lelenta, Oliver Masucci, Martina Gedeck, Hannah Herzsprung, Emil Bloch', null, 'Humans who can shapeshift into animals struggle to integrate with others without revealing their special abilities. As a group, they strive to inform and institute change in the perspective of deforestation and the importance of natural habitats. However, when that cannot happen, they''re forced to take matters into their own hands.', 'Humans who can shapeshift into animals struggle to integrate with others without revealing their special abilities. As a group, they strive to inform and institute change in the perspective of deforestation and the importance of natural habitats. However, when that cannot happen, they''re forced to take matters into their own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bC1r04ohuxv5feaGDzQ0lXz7Bbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241894'),
  ('344265472108828017', 'Woodwalkers 2', 2026, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Peter Krause, Marc Kluge', 'David Sandreuter', 'Emile Chérif, Lilli Falk, Johan von Ehrlich, Sophie Lelenta, Olivia Sinclair, Oliver Masucci, Martina Gedeck, Hannah Herzsprung', null, 'For shapeshifter Carag and his friends Brandon, Holly, and Lou, a new school year begins at Clearwater High. But first, the Woodwalker Council must decide whether Carag''s mentor and patron of the school, Andrew Milling, is guilty of attacking humans. Carag is in a dilemma: he wants to put a stop to Milling''s actions, but Milling promises to take him to his true puma family if he covers for him before the council.', 'For shapeshifter Carag and his friends Brandon, Holly, and Lou, a new school year begins at Clearwater High. But first, the Woodwalker Council must decide whether Carag''s mentor and patron of the school, Andrew Milling, is guilty of attacking humans. Carag is in a dilemma: he wants to put a stop to Milling''s actions, but Milling promises to take him to his true puma family if he covers for him before the council.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WrGxlyXnoV0ecLiA76wNaga8pK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278853'),
  ('886877860763210908', 'Woody Allen: A Documentary', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Robert B. Weide, Nancy Schreiber, Neve Cunningham', 'Robert B. Weide', 'Woody Allen, Letty Aronson, Antonio Banderas, Marshall Brickman, Josh Brolin, Dick Cavett, Penélope Cruz, John Cusack', 'NR', 'An intense portrait of the iconic filmmaker, writer, actor, comedian and musician Woody Allen: his life, family and friends; his writing and directing habits, and his relationship with performers.', 'An intense portrait of the iconic filmmaker, writer, actor, comedian and musician Woody Allen: his life, family and friends; his writing and directing habits, and his relationship with performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WyMPd6dcMUw58QIwb3XPci4Vkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81167'),
  ('922216716604682127', 'Woody Dines Out', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shamus Culhane', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ben Hardaway, Hans Conried', 'NR', 'Woody Woodpecker goes out to dine and accidentally stumbles into a taxidermist''s shop, thinking it is a restaurant. The taxidermist, wanting a woodpecker to stuff, doesn''t inform Woody otherwise.', 'Woody Woodpecker goes out to dine and accidentally stumbles into a taxidermist''s shop, thinking it is a restaurant. The taxidermist, wanting a woodpecker to stuff, doesn''t inform Woody otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kT1wLuBESTtC8WjOBj8KIDo0GDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100160'),
  ('834283681764956020', 'Woody Woodpecker', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walter Lantz', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Danny Webb', 'NR', 'Woody Woodpecker spends his day singing loudly and pecking holes in trees. He infuriates the other woodland creatures - when he isn''t baffling them with his bizarre behavior. Woody overhears a squirrel and a group of birds gossiping about him. Even though he just sang a song proclaiming his craziness, he denies their whispered accusations that he''s nuts. But after they trick him into knocking his head on a statue, the poor bird hears voices in his head and decides the animals might be right. He decides to see a psychiatrist.', 'Woody Woodpecker spends his day singing loudly and pecking holes in trees. He infuriates the other woodland creatures - when he isn''t baffling them with his bizarre behavior. Woody overhears a squirrel and a group of birds gossiping about him. Even though he just sang a song proclaiming his craziness, he denies their whispered accusations that he''s nuts. But after they trick him into knocking his head on a statue, the poor bird hears voices in his head and decides the animals might be right. He decides to see a psychiatrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oV40uVKadL0VhtilkZAaBj0JqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100165'),
  ('1050844881921221999', 'Woody Woodpecker', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Alex Zamm, Barry Donlevy, Andrew Pavel', 'Alex Zamm, William Robertson', 'Eric Bauza, Timothy Omundson, Thaila Ayala, Graham Verchere, Jordana Largy, Scott McNeil, Adrian Glynn McMorran, Chelsea Miller', 'PG', 'Woody Woodpecker enters a turf war with a big city lawyer wanting to tear down his home in an effort to build a house to flip.', 'Woody Woodpecker enters a turf war with a big city lawyer wanting to tear down his home in an effort to build a house to flip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSo4vsBdzTNJG24VYgAkGgeYkAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462883'),
  ('930044446987146394', 'Woody Woodpecker Goes to Camp', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Ross Emery, Jonathan A. Rosenbaum', 'Stephen Mazur, Cory Edwards, Jim Martin', 'Eric Bauza, Kevin Michael Richardson, Tom Kenny, Mary-Louise Parker, Josh Lawson, Chloe De Los Santos, Kershawn Theodore, Savannah La Rain', 'PG', 'After getting kicked out of the forest, Woody thinks he''s found a forever home at Camp Woo Hoo — until an inspector threatens to shut down the camp.', 'After getting kicked out of the forest, Woody thinks he''s found a forever home at Camp Woo Hoo — until an inspector threatens to shut down the camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaINMBMGIow4kd8Dq06aytoomtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239146'),
  ('834781446505224282', 'Woongnami', 2023, 'Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'Park Sung-kwang, Hwang Jeong-yeon, Lee Jong-seok', 'Kim Hwang-do', 'Park Sung-woong, Lee Yi-kyung, Yeom Hye-ran, Oh Dal-su, Choi Min-soo, Yoon Je-moon, Baek Ji-hye, Seo Dong-won', null, 'The bear man who was once a bear become human by eating garlic and mugwort for 100 days. One day, after retirement as a policeman, a terrorist brings the deadly virus and he looks exactly the same as the bear man! With help of a detective and Youtuber, he tries to save the world now.', 'The bear man who was once a bear become human by eating garlic and mugwort for 100 days. One day, after retirement as a policeman, a terrorist brings the deadly virus and he looks exactly the same as the bear man! With help of a detective and Youtuber, he tries to save the world now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHNb1nfiYe07vmwFWz2Pa5wLEkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995063'),
  ('501919798879837739', 'Word and Utopia', 2000, 'History', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Renato Berta', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Lima Duarte, Luis Miguel Cintra, Ricardo Trêpa, Leonor Silveira, Renato De Carmine, Diogo Dória, Paulo Matos, António Reis', null, 'The story of Father Antonio Vieira, a 17th-century Portuguese priest who lived in Brazil and worked for better treatment of the Indians and to abolish slavery.', 'The story of Father Antonio Vieira, a 17th-century Portuguese priest who lived in Brazil and worked for better treatment of the Indians and to abolish slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAT0xlIagVsFq3eTFMCtk6Ghinv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61841'),
  ('739840158130601022', 'Word Is Out: Stories of Some of Our Lives', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Rob Epstein, Nancy Adair, Peter Adair', null, 'Sally M. Gearhart, Pat Bond, John Burnside, Elsa Gidlow, Donald Hackett, Harry Hay, Pam Jackson, Rusty Millington', null, 'More than two dozen men and women of various backgrounds, ages, and races talk to the camera about being gay or lesbian. Their stories are arranged in loose chronology: early years, fitting in (which for some meant marriage), coming out, establishing adult identities, and reflecting on how things have changed and how things should be.', 'More than two dozen men and women of various backgrounds, ages, and races talk to the camera about being gay or lesbian. Their stories are arranged in loose chronology: early years, fitting in (which for some meant marriage), coming out, establishing adult identities, and reflecting on how things have changed and how things should be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3FercI7QurqOm5IpuaAIPV8uqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143322'),
  ('201128413751414603', 'Word Wars', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Julian Petrillo, Eric Chaikin, Laela Kilbourn', null, 'Mike Birbiglia, Joe Edley, Matt Graham, Marlon Hill, Joel Sherman, Aldo Cardia', null, 'The classic board game, Scrabble, has been popular for decades. In addition, there are fanatics who devote heart and soul to this game to the expense of everything else. This film profiles a group of these enthusiasts as they converge for a Scrabble convention where the word game is almost a bloodsport.', 'The classic board game, Scrabble, has been popular for decades. In addition, there are fanatics who devote heart and soul to this game to the expense of everything else. This film profiles a group of these enthusiasts as they converge for a Scrabble convention where the word game is almost a bloodsport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOZFWlATXn0Ux3UPOITLDxKhCam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28105'),
  ('211732169065381319', 'Wordplay', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Creadon, Patrick Creadon', 'Christine O''Malley, Patrick Creadon', 'Will Shortz, Merl Reagle, Bill Clinton, Jon Stewart, Tyler Hinman, Trip Payne, Al Sanders, Ellen Ripstein', 'NR', 'From the masters who create the mind-bending diversions to the tense competition at the American Crossword Puzzle Tournament, Patrick Creadon''s documentary reveals a fascinating look at a decidedly addictive pastime. Creadon captures New York Times editor Will Shortz at work, talks to celebrity solvers -- including Bill Clinton and Ken Burns -- and presents an intimate look at the national tournament and its competitors.', 'From the masters who create the mind-bending diversions to the tense competition at the American Crossword Puzzle Tournament, Patrick Creadon''s documentary reveals a fascinating look at a decidedly addictive pastime. Creadon captures New York Times editor Will Shortz at work, talks to celebrity solvers -- including Bill Clinton and Ken Burns -- and presents an intimate look at the national tournament and its competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AY7EkxJwB8Ow5iPe41GOJesxzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35199'),
  ('984759397933682957', 'Words and Music', 1948, 'Drama, Music', 'Norman Taurog, Harry Stradling Sr., Charles Rosher', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe, Lorenz Hart', 'Tom Drake, Mickey Rooney, Janet Leigh, Marshall Thompson, Betty Garrett, Jeanette Nolan, Ann Sothern, Perry Como', 'NR', 'Encomium to Larry Hart (1895-1943), seen through the fictive eyes of his song-writing partner, Richard Rodgers (1902-1979): from their first meeting, through lean years and their breakthrough, to their successes on Broadway, London, and Hollywood. We see the fruits of Hart and Rodgers'' collaboration - elaborately staged numbers from their plays, characters'' visits to night clubs, and impromptu performances at parties. We also see Larry''s scattered approach to life, his failed love with Peggy McNeil, his unhappiness, and Richard''s successful wooing of Dorothy Feiner.', 'Encomium to Larry Hart (1895-1943), seen through the fictive eyes of his song-writing partner, Richard Rodgers (1902-1979): from their first meeting, through lean years and their breakthrough, to their successes on Broadway, London, and Hollywood. We see the fruits of Hart and Rodgers'' collaboration - elaborately staged numbers from their plays, characters'' visits to night clubs, and impromptu performances at parties. We also see Larry''s scattered approach to life, his failed love with Peggy McNeil, his unhappiness, and Richard''s successful wooing of Dorothy Feiner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2EKiMGFeKk3VVz7lZz0HaXXjH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43458'),
  ('1027708001622553157', 'Words and Pictures', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard Cowan, Eddy Santos, James Steuart', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Clive Owen, Juliette Binoche, Bruce Davison, Adam DiMarco, Valerie Tian, Navid Negahban, Amy Brenneman, Keegan Connor Tracy', 'PG-13', 'An art instructor and an English teacher form a rivalry that ends up with a competition at their school in which students decide whether words or pictures are more important.', 'An art instructor and an English teacher form a rivalry that ends up with a competition at their school in which students decide whether words or pictures are more important.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d557IKXSWFgWMi5dAlqhLy0fj5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214075'),
  ('485476566281755590', 'Words Bubble Up Like Soda Pop', 2021, 'Animation, Romance, Drama', 'Chie Yamashiro, Naomi Kaneda, Cédric Hérole', 'Dai Sato, Kyohei Ishiguro', 'Somegoro Ichikawa, Hana Sugisaki, Megumi Han, Natsuki Hanae, Yuuichirou Umehara, Megumi Nakajima, Sumire Morohoshi, Shizuka Itoh', 'PG', 'After meeting one day, a shy boy who expresses himself through haiku and a bubbly but self-conscious girl share a brief, magical summer.', 'After meeting one day, a shy boy who expresses himself through haiku and a bubbly but self-conscious girl share a brief, magical summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooISQS2rzVqgkt2aq5HNoz8n2sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579741'),
  ('638534547596459393', 'Words for an End of the World', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Pablo Ontoria, Manuel Menchón, Javier Calvo', 'Manuel Menchón', 'José Sacristán, Marian Álvarez, Víctor Clavijo, Andrés Gertrúdix, Antonio de la Torre, Miguel Cubero, Ramón Mayrata, Vicente León', null, 'Spain, April 14, 1931. The Second Republic is born. From the beginning, the writer Miguel de Unamuno is considered one of the ethical pillars of the new regime. Five years later, on December 31, 1936, a few months after the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), Unamuno dies at his home in Salamanca, capital of the rebel side, led by General Francisco Franco, and main center of dissemination of its propaganda apparatus.', 'Spain, April 14, 1931. The Second Republic is born. From the beginning, the writer Miguel de Unamuno is considered one of the ethical pillars of the new regime. Five years later, on December 31, 1936, a few months after the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39), Unamuno dies at his home in Salamanca, capital of the rebel side, led by General Francisco Franco, and main center of dissemination of its propaganda apparatus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3XIT3wWXwUG5f2gIz9xA5fcHGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764557'),
  ('371733722980128465', 'Words of Devotion', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Satoshi Kaneda, Yuji Imai', 'Rie Yokota', 'Hidenori Tokuyama, Saito Yasuka, Rinako Matsuoka, Yui Iwata, Junko Ookura, Masashi Kagami, Kentarô Sakai', null, 'Their love feels solid—until an old friend reappears and Ootani starts wondering if he’s really the one Tachibana wants.', 'Their love feels solid—until an old friend reappears and Ootani starts wondering if he’s really the one Tachibana wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7zjtBF6Bf6CKYfTgTehMlE7lTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249330'),
  ('12837687451681079', 'Words of War', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'James Strong, Mike Eley, Nika Stepanova', 'Eric Poppen', 'Maxine Peake, Ciarán Hinds, Jason Isaacs, Naomi Battrick, Harry Lawtey, Ellie Bamber, Ben Miles, Ian Hart', null, 'World-renowned journalist and human rights activist Anna Politkovskaya went from being a local print journalist to braving the Chechen killing fields and exposing Russian state corruption under Vladimir Putin. She refused to give up reporting on the war in Chechnya despite numerous acts of intimidation and violence, including being poisoned. She was ultimately murdered in the elevator of her block of flats and it remains unclear who paid for the contract killing.', 'World-renowned journalist and human rights activist Anna Politkovskaya went from being a local print journalist to braving the Chechen killing fields and exposing Russian state corruption under Vladimir Putin. She refused to give up reporting on the war in Chechnya despite numerous acts of intimidation and violence, including being poisoned. She was ultimately murdered in the elevator of her block of flats and it remains unclear who paid for the contract killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fszN3PSB40FYsFzkHvNZrXLes0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975615'),
  ('32467585023127959', 'Words, Words, Words', 1993, 'Animation', 'Michaela Pavlátová, Jaroslava Zimová', 'Michaela Pavlátová', null, null, 'In a cafe, people talk, their words become expresively-shaped balloons. An older waiter tries to connect with a young woman who''s reading. She brushes him off, but gets into an animated and romantic conversation with a young man. A dog goes from table to table drinking beer and wine when people aren''t looking. Older men talk about sexual conquests until one of their wives interrupts them. The young couple argues; he starts to leave, she pleads, he leaves anyway. The waiter tries to help. Old guys talk until they nod off. Women chat. Later, as the waiter cleans up, the finds the young woman''s book. He sighs, the dog sleeps it off.', 'In a cafe, people talk, their words become expresively-shaped balloons. An older waiter tries to connect with a young woman who''s reading. She brushes him off, but gets into an animated and romantic conversation with a young man. A dog goes from table to table drinking beer and wine when people aren''t looking. Older men talk about sexual conquests until one of their wives interrupts them. The young couple argues; he starts to leave, she pleads, he leaves anyway. The waiter tries to help. Old guys talk until they nod off. Women chat. Later, as the waiter cleans up, the finds the young woman''s book. He sighs, the dog sleeps it off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a64PLup2QGACxxiMaxymR6XynYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116152'),
  ('1058234563626524826', 'Work', 1915, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Harry Ensign, Roland Totheroh', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Charles Inslee, Edna Purviance, Billy Armstrong, Marta Golden, Leo White, Paddy McGuire', 'NR', 'Charlie and his boss have difficulties just getting to the house they are going to wallpaper. The householder is angry because he can''t get breakfast and his wife is screaming at the maid as they arrive. The kitchen gas stove explodes, and Charlie offers to fix it. The wife''s secret lover arrives and is passed off as the workers'' supervisor, but the husband doesn''t buy this and fires shots. The stove explodes violently, destroying the house.', 'Charlie and his boss have difficulties just getting to the house they are going to wallpaper. The householder is angry because he can''t get breakfast and his wife is screaming at the maid as they arrive. The kitchen gas stove explodes, and Charlie offers to fix it. The wife''s secret lover arrives and is passed off as the workers'' supervisor, but the husband doesn''t buy this and fires shots. The stove explodes violently, destroying the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lun18UZ3cOMj7J0X8sc2ElYXAbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53408'),
  ('1095770237042539337', 'Work', 1997, 'Drama', 'Steven Guiliano, Rachel Reichman', 'Rachel Reichman', 'Cynthia Kaplan, Sonja Sohn, Geordie White, Heather Murphy, Peter Sprague', null, 'In an economically struggling small town, Jenny, a young married woman, begins an affair with June, her college-bound, African-American neighbor.', 'In an economically struggling small town, Jenny, a young married woman, begins an affair with June, her college-bound, African-American neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44KQts4mZkq2vHdODmBP273hBmG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459646'),
  ('508349371718951007', 'Work Hard Play Hard', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Carmen Losmann', 'Carmen Losmann', null, null, 'A film about non-territorial office space, multi-mobile knowledge workers, Blackberries and Miles&More. A road movie discovering the working world of tomorrow. This documentary will take you on a journey through the post-industrial knowledge and services workshops, our supposed future working place. In this new world work will be handled more liberally. Time clocks cease to exist. Attention is not compulsory any more. The resource “human“ comes into focus. The film closely follows the high-tech work force – people who are highly mobile and passionate to make their work their purpose in life. Further episodes resume this topic and lead into the world of modern office architecture and into the world of Human Resource Management.', 'A film about non-territorial office space, multi-mobile knowledge workers, Blackberries and Miles&More. A road movie discovering the working world of tomorrow. This documentary will take you on a journey through the post-industrial knowledge and services workshops, our supposed future working place. In this new world work will be handled more liberally. Time clocks cease to exist. Attention is not compulsory any more. The resource “human“ comes into focus. The film closely follows the high-tech work force – people who are highly mobile and passionate to make their work their purpose in life. Further episodes resume this topic and lead into the world of modern office architecture and into the world of Human Resource Management.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKKCZExCYzLhQtmcmzTI1TWwJi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95827'),
  ('48215599464499300', 'Work Hard, Play Hard', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marc Moutout', 'Olivier Gorce, Jean-Marc Moutout, Ghislaine Jégou', 'Jérémie Renier, Laurent Lucas, Cylia Malki, Olivier Perrier, Samir Guesmi, Martine Chevallier', null, 'Philippe Seigner starts his career in business consulting at the posh Paris seat of McGregor. His first serious task is delicate: An audit at a factory, which is about to be taken over. As he soon realizes, this will mean sacking about 80 employees. However, his girl friend reproaches him collaborating with ruthless capitalism, as if any of the downsizing could be mitigated by him bowing out.', 'Philippe Seigner starts his career in business consulting at the posh Paris seat of McGregor. His first serious task is delicate: An audit at a factory, which is about to be taken over. As he soon realizes, this will mean sacking about 80 employees. However, his girl friend reproaches him collaborating with ruthless capitalism, as if any of the downsizing could be mitigated by him bowing out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjjleu6amnWM6K2JNmW3Q5erWha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36296'),
  ('250858678673033192', 'Work in Progress', 2001, 'Documentary', 'José Luis Guerín, Joan Antoni Barjau, Abel García Roure', 'José Luis Guerín', null, null, 'An author spends a year and a half filming what happens as a new apartment building is built in a neighborhood of Barcelona.', 'An author spends a year and a half filming what happens as a new apartment building is built in a neighborhood of Barcelona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wY3wZp5JbLGWZT0XP7WO86awOOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148353'),
  ('87052735958172165', 'Work It', 2020, 'Comedy, Music', 'Laura Terruso, Rogier Stoffers, Rich Delia', 'Alison Peck', 'Sabrina Carpenter, Liza Koshy, Keiynan Lonsdale, Michelle Buteau, Jordan Fisher, Drew Ray Tanner, Jayne Eastwood, Naomi Snieckus', 'PG-13', 'A brilliant but clumsy high school senior vows to get into her late father''s alma mater by transforming herself and a misfit squad into dance champions.', 'A brilliant but clumsy high school senior vows to get into her late father''s alma mater by transforming herself and a misfit squad into dance champions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5XfICAvUe8beWExBz97i0Qw4Qh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612706'),
  ('70001694559890589', 'Workers', 2013, 'Drama', 'César Gutiérrez Miranda, José Luis Valle', 'José Luis Valle', 'Jesús Padilla, Susana Salazar, Barbara Perrin Rivemar, Sergio Limon, Vera Talaia, Adolfo Madera, Giancarlo Ruiz, Rey Castro', null, 'Lidia is a responsible and dedicated maid for a hugely wealthy, elderly Tijuana matron who loves only her pet whippet. Rafael is a quiet and dignified janitor who buys a new pair of shoes to celebrate his imminent retirement from the large corporate facility where he''s worked for 30 years. When Lidia''s boss dies, leaving everything to her dog, and Rafael''s plans get derailed, they both turn to criminal subterfuge to get what their harsh lot in life has denied them.', 'Lidia is a responsible and dedicated maid for a hugely wealthy, elderly Tijuana matron who loves only her pet whippet. Rafael is a quiet and dignified janitor who buys a new pair of shoes to celebrate his imminent retirement from the large corporate facility where he''s worked for 30 years. When Lidia''s boss dies, leaving everything to her dog, and Rafael''s plans get derailed, they both turn to criminal subterfuge to get what their harsh lot in life has denied them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQXk0hDHkGFQ1EON5MFBfMnO5SX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201837'),
