  ('601693120398669215', 'Working Slowly (Radio Alice)', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Gherardo Gossi, Roy Bava, Guido Chiesa', 'Guido Chiesa, Roberto Bui', 'Marco Luisi, Tommaso Ramenghi, Claudia Pandolfi, Valerio Mastandrea, Valerio Binasco, Jacopo Bonvicini, Max Mazzotta, Massimo Coppola', null, 'Bologna, 1976. The paths of two aimless young friends intertwine with those of Radio Alice, a pirate radio politically aligned with the leftist student movement.', 'Bologna, 1976. The paths of two aimless young friends intertwine with those of Radio Alice, a pirate radio politically aligned with the leftist student movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jevzNwOqlHyQbmg6mx0xSBEtV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57626'),
  ('726909134756066713', 'Working Tra$h', 1990, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alan Metter, Brian Capener', 'Jon Connolly, David Loucka', 'George Carlin, Ben Stiller, Buddy Ebsen, Leslie Hope, Michael J. Pollard, Jack Blessing, Dan Castellaneta, Ellen Ratner', null, 'Ralph and Freddy work as janitors at a brokerage firm and become rich by making investments based on insider information they gather from the brokers'' garbage.', 'Ralph and Freddy work as janitors at a brokerage firm and become rich by making investments based on insider information they gather from the brokers'' garbage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJctRvUQIqyD3ecoI8VLQjQ1F1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258381'),
  ('716060949124534864', 'Workingman''s Death', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Michael Glawogger, Wolfgang Thaler', null, null, null, 'Is heavy manual labour disappearing or is it just becoming invisible? Where can we still find it in the 21st century? Workingman''s Death follows the trail of the HEROES in the illegal mines of the Ukraine, sniffs out GHOST among the sulphur workers in Indonesia, finds itself face to face with LIONS at a slaughterhouse in Nigeria, mingles with BROTHERS as they cut a huge oil tanker into pieces in Pakistan, and joins Chinese steel workers in hoping for a glorious FUTURE.', 'Is heavy manual labour disappearing or is it just becoming invisible? Where can we still find it in the 21st century? Workingman''s Death follows the trail of the HEROES in the illegal mines of the Ukraine, sniffs out GHOST among the sulphur workers in Indonesia, finds itself face to face with LIONS at a slaughterhouse in Nigeria, mingles with BROTHERS as they cut a huge oil tanker into pieces in Pakistan, and joins Chinese steel workers in hoping for a glorious FUTURE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zCEfxS3LCNTBMfMCxfUDnZ2g1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63290'),
