  ('175374907170313371', 'World Builder', 2007, 'Romance, Science Fiction', 'Bruce Branit', null, 'Brian Paulette, Erin McGrane', null, '"World Builder" is a short film by Bruce Branit (co-creator of "405") in which a man uses holographic tools to create a virtual world for a woman he loves. The filming was completed in a single day, but the post-production computer graphics required 2 years.', '"World Builder" is a short film by Bruce Branit (co-creator of "405") in which a man uses holographic tools to create a virtual world for a woman he loves. The filming was completed in a single day, but the post-production computer graphics required 2 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rldBLtagYBM5YN7stsVFf3G1SSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53268'),
  ('116357026541667263', 'World Famous Lover', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ved Aitharaju, Kranthi Madhav, Jayakrishna Gummadi', 'Kranthi Madhav', 'Vijay Deverakonda, Raashii Khanna, Catherine Tresa, Aishwarya Rajesh, Izabelle Leite, Chakrapani Ananda, Shatru', null, 'An amalgamation of four different love stories: Seenayya and Suvarna, a middle-class couple in a small town; Gautham, an uber-cool youngster romancing in the streets of Paris with his girlfriend Iza, Union Leader Srinu head over heels in love with his boss lady, and and the first college romance.', 'An amalgamation of four different love stories: Seenayya and Suvarna, a middle-class couple in a small town; Gautham, an uber-cool youngster romancing in the streets of Paris with his girlfriend Iza, Union Leader Srinu head over heels in love with his boss lady, and and the first college romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zlyNE6CtDTzXhnaYNP4c4dXZS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659674'),
  ('195716790267885183', 'World for Ransom', 1954, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Lindsay Hardy, Hugo Butler', 'Dan Duryea, Gene Lockhart, Patric Knowles, Reginald Denny, Nigel Bruce, Marian Carr, Arthur Shields, Douglass Dumbrille', 'NR', 'In Singapore, a private detective and the British authorities are on the trail of a crime syndicate that kidnaps a nuclear physicist with the aim of selling him to the highest bidder.', 'In Singapore, a private detective and the British authorities are on the trail of a crime syndicate that kidnaps a nuclear physicist with the aim of selling him to the highest bidder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jm1MA2qtWznOzeQ2Y9nFyOwaaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28661'),
  ('284826049031287320', 'World Gone Mad', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Filippou, Dinos Katsouridis, Stavros Tsiolis', 'Dinos Katsouridis', 'Kostas Hatzihristos, Nikos Rizos, Kostas Doukas, Marika Nezer, Nikos Fermas, Dina Trianti, Thanasis Mylonas, Nelly Pappa', null, 'This classic Greek comedy revolves around the constant fights between Zikos who works as a clerk at a small grocer''s shop and the shop''s owner. Zikos just can''t keep his mouth shut every time his boss behaves as being an aristocrat. Things go even worse when Zikos finds out that his boss, by taking advantage of his wealth and with the help of the local match-maker, is planning to marry a young poor girl living in the same neighborhood.', 'This classic Greek comedy revolves around the constant fights between Zikos who works as a clerk at a small grocer''s shop and the shop''s owner. Zikos just can''t keep his mouth shut every time his boss behaves as being an aristocrat. Things go even worse when Zikos finds out that his boss, by taking advantage of his wealth and with the help of the local match-maker, is planning to marry a young poor girl living in the same neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaQ4zzEpZkmEWPvoLFFW1W5POlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81365'),
  ('157349306398332490', 'World Gone Wild', 1987, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Lee H. Katzin, Don Burgess', 'Jorge Zamacona', 'Michael Paré, Catherine Mary Stewart, Bruce Dern, Adam Ant, Anthony James, Rick Podell, Julius Carry, Alan Autry', 'R', 'In the nuclear ravaged wasteland of Earth 2087 water is as precious as life itself. The isolated Lost Wells outpost survived the holocaust and the inhabitants guard the source of their existence. Now an evil cult of renegades want control of their valuable water supply. And the villagers are no match for such brute military force. Only one man can help the stricken community - a mercenary living in a distance cannibal city. But even he, and his strange henchmen, may not be able to survive in the world gone wild.', 'In the nuclear ravaged wasteland of Earth 2087 water is as precious as life itself. The isolated Lost Wells outpost survived the holocaust and the inhabitants guard the source of their existence. Now an evil cult of renegades want control of their valuable water supply. And the villagers are no match for such brute military force. Only one man can help the stricken community - a mercenary living in a distance cannibal city. But even he, and his strange henchmen, may not be able to survive in the world gone wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJ5iqjzIKfMCtVq5xBl1n9myuf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38141'),
  ('309899556588819011', 'World of Glory', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roy Andersson, István Borbás, Jacob Jørgensen', 'Roy Andersson', 'Klas-Gösta Olsson, Lennart Björklund, Christer Christensen, Bernhard Eiger, Rolf Engström, Gun Fors, Udo Künnapas, Hans Söderholm', null, 'The narrative portrays a plain man who guides the viewer through his life in a bleakly stylised world.', 'The narrative portrays a plain man who guides the viewer through his life in a bleakly stylised world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkmArVfTaXS9SPqOjWe80TY0vCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44238'),
  ('391147996659319388', 'World of Tomorrow Episode Three: The Absent Destinations of David Prime', 2020, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Julia Pott, Jack Parrett', null, 'A hidden memory sends David across the far reaches of time and space to solve a deadly mystery involving his time-traveling future selves.', 'A hidden memory sends David across the far reaches of time and space to solve a deadly mystery involving his time-traveling future selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9ntSDEUqnSvZYEHDKzvjbhikoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729775'),
