  ('1141539237307126044', 'World Record', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Takeshi Koike, Takeshi Koike, Ryu Takizawa', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Victor Williams, John Wesley, Alex Fernandez, Allison Smith, Tara Strong, Matt McKenzie, Kevin Michael Richardson, Julia Fletcher', null, 'A record-breaking competitive runner begins to stretch the limits of the Matrix. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'A record-breaking competitive runner begins to stretch the limits of the Matrix. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RAWp6zbxRyC4ddutyZLqwAr8Lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24960'),
  ('1116414575482005947', 'World Trade Center', 2006, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Oliver Stone, Seamus McGarvey, Kyle Rudolph', 'Andrea Berloff', 'Nicolas Cage, Maria Bello, Connor Paolo, Anthony Piccininni, Alexa Gerasimovich, Morgan Flynn, Michael Peña, Armando Riesco', 'PG-13', 'Two police officers struggle to survive when they become trapped beneath the rubble of the World Trade Center on September 11, 2001.', 'Two police officers struggle to survive when they become trapped beneath the rubble of the World Trade Center on September 11, 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfTiVc8kxq8uRXeblV3Ct35APGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1852'),
  ('742423410879600937', 'World Traveler', 2002, 'Drama', 'Bart Freundlich, Terry Stacey', 'Bart Freundlich', 'Billy Crudup, Julianne Moore, Cleavant Derricks, Liane Balaban, David Keith, Mary McCormack, Francie Swift, Karen Allen', 'R', 'After hitting the road a man encounters characters that make him realize the importance of family.', 'After hitting the road a man encounters characters that make him realize the importance of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24d6LPAYXhudU8HAlxohPaVPRuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59199'),
  ('1022597176411154183', 'World War III', 2023, 'Drama', 'Houman Seyyedi', 'Houman Seyyedi, Arian Vazirdaftari, Azad Jafarian', 'Mohsen Tanabandeh, Mahsa Hejazi, Neda Jebraeili, Navid Nosrati, Morteza Khanjani, Hatam Mashmouli, Lotfollah Seifi, Bahman Sadegh Hassani', null, 'Shakib is a homeless day laborer who never got over the loss of his wife and son in an earthquake years ago. Over the last couple of years, he has developed a relationship with a deaf and mute woman, Ladan. The construction site on which he works today turns out to be the set of a film about the atrocities committed by Hitler during WWII. Against all odds, he is given a movie role, a house and a chance at being somebody. When Ladan learns about this, she comes to his workplace begging for help. Shakib’s scheme to hide her goes tragically wrong and threatens to ruin his newfound status and what seemed to be the opportunity of a lifetime.', 'Shakib is a homeless day laborer who never got over the loss of his wife and son in an earthquake years ago. Over the last couple of years, he has developed a relationship with a deaf and mute woman, Ladan. The construction site on which he works today turns out to be the set of a film about the atrocities committed by Hitler during WWII. Against all odds, he is given a movie role, a house and a chance at being somebody. When Ladan learns about this, she comes to his workplace begging for help. Shakib’s scheme to hide her goes tragically wrong and threatens to ruin his newfound status and what seemed to be the opportunity of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe377kZmYHlQTuEGqMjS6YauqCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005299'),
  ('543178420872678022', 'World War Z', 2013, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Marc Forster, Ben Seresin, Toby Hefferman', 'Damon Lindelof, Drew Goddard, Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Brad Pitt, Mireille Enos, Daniella Kertesz, James Badge Dale, Ludi Boeken, Matthew Fox, Fana Mokoena, David Morse', 'PG-13', 'Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.', 'Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72190'),
  ('594901083207058152', 'World Without End', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Edward Bernds, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Edward Bernds', 'Hugh Marlowe, Nancy Gates, Rod Taylor, Lisa Montell, Nelson Leigh, Christopher Dark, Everett Glass, Booth Colman', 'NR', 'Four astronauts returning from man''s first mission to Mars enter a time warp and crash on a 26th-century Earth devastated by atomic war. At first unaware where they are, but finding the atmosphere safe to breathe, they start exploring and find themselves in a divided future where disfigured mutants living like cavemen inhabit the surface, while the normals live comfortably below the surface but are dying as a race from lack of natural water, air and sunlight.', 'Four astronauts returning from man''s first mission to Mars enter a time warp and crash on a 26th-century Earth devastated by atomic war. At first unaware where they are, but finding the atmosphere safe to breathe, they start exploring and find themselves in a divided future where disfigured mutants living like cavemen inhabit the surface, while the normals live comfortably below the surface but are dying as a race from lack of natural water, air and sunlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flvqHHFMBCks5Mlb4HWydUZcwbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75506'),
  ('1055473512071080706', 'World Without Sun', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau', 'James Dugan, James Schmerer', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau', null, 'Fascinating underwater documentary filmed with hand-held cameras by frogmen and mostly filmed in deep-water seas from within a special designed batiscaff, by the Cousteau family of sea explorers. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', 'Fascinating underwater documentary filmed with hand-held cameras by frogmen and mostly filmed in deep-water seas from within a special designed batiscaff, by the Cousteau family of sea explorers. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvgkry9Nnp9vmLjDvCssMHdV0J4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91288'),
  ('896660106495081413', 'World''s End', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Simone Bartesaghi, Philip Kim, Brayton Austin', 'Philip Kim, Neil Kinsella', 'Jonathon Trent, Elizabeth Roberts, Jonno Roberts, Billy Drago, Lenny Von Dohlen, Mickey Jones, Michelle Lang, Fiona Gubelmann', null, 'Wes Keller is a young man living in a world where oil has collapsed, the food supply has been wiped out, and cancer rates for women have skyrocketed, depleting the female population. In a barbaric environment where bio fuel, batteries, bullets and people are currency and marauders roam free, Wes tries to escape to a mythical world run on cold fusion "Plutopia", a place that may only exist in the mind. THE BILL IS DUE. ''Downstream'' is a view of the not so distant future. We follow a young man (everyone''s son) as he pays the price for society''s decadence.', 'Wes Keller is a young man living in a world where oil has collapsed, the food supply has been wiped out, and cancer rates for women have skyrocketed, depleting the female population. In a barbaric environment where bio fuel, batteries, bullets and people are currency and marauders roam free, Wes tries to escape to a mythical world run on cold fusion "Plutopia", a place that may only exist in the mind. THE BILL IS DUE. ''Downstream'' is a view of the not so distant future. We follow a young man (everyone''s son) as he pays the price for society''s decadence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8D3vd77rLqNSsw1ATwlkyV9N1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44216'),
  ('280793586165942444', 'World''s First Christmas', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dante Belluti, Susana Garcia, Gigi Soares', 'Alessandra Ruiz, Guilherme Ruiz, Carolina Minardi', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Lázaro Ramos, Fabiana Karla, Igor Jansen, Yasmin Londuik, Theo Mattos, Valen Gaspar, Wilson Rabelo', null, 'A young girl wishes Christmas was over for good, and her wish is granted with unexpected consequences.', 'A young girl wishes Christmas was over for good, and her wish is granted with unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UOl0hlPFyWiJprpMxYRkhi2vSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103787'),
  ('108043361624088456', 'World''s Greatest Dad', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Horacio Marquínez', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Robin Williams, Alexie Gilmore, Daryl Sabara, Evan Martin, Geoff Pierson, Henry Simmons, Mitzi McCall, Jermaine Williams', 'R', 'In the wake of a freak accident, Lance suffers the worst tragedy and the greatest opportunity of his life. He is suddenly faced with the possibility of fame, fortune and popularity, if he can only live with the knowledge of how he got there.', 'In the wake of a freak accident, Lance suffers the worst tragedy and the greatest opportunity of his life. He is suddenly faced with the possibility of fame, fortune and popularity, if he can only live with the knowledge of how he got there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ESsZLvZPIvbCPCh7CPCSnF4EeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20178'),
  ('202774572231518377', 'World''s Greatest Dad', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zizhao Wang', 'Liu Xiaodian, Zizhao Wang, Xu Luyang', 'Yu Hewei, Guo Qilin, Ni Hongjie, Natalie Hsu, Zhang Zixian, Ning Hao', null, 'After an accident puts his son in a coma, his father writes a fake suicide note creating a situation that spirals out of control.', 'After an accident puts his son in a coma, his father writes a fake suicide note creating a situation that spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nnaovllxETxPv88w1MgCmHMRbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181865'),
  ('94934709032755743', 'Worldbreaker', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Brad Anderson, Daniel Aranyó', 'Joshua Rollins', 'Milla Jovovich, Luke Evans, Billie Boullet, Meadow Williams, Mila Harris, Kevin Glynn, Chris Finlayson, Charis Agbonlahor', 'R', 'Five years ago, a tear in the fabric of reality brought creatures to our world from an alternate dimension bent on our destruction. A father hides his daughter on an island to keep her safe while he prepares her for survival and the battles to come. But when the world is about to break, no place is safe.', 'Five years ago, a tear in the fabric of reality brought creatures to our world from an alternate dimension bent on our destruction. A father hides his daughter on an island to keep her safe while he prepares her for survival and the battles to come. But when the world is about to break, no place is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xx25oYs08myEelHiSbOuVi80Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196067'),
  ('921283963167726972', 'Worldly Girl', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marco Danieli, Emanuele Pasquet', 'Marco Danieli, Antonio Manca', 'Sara Serraiocco, Michele Riondino, Marco Leonardi, Stefania Montorsi, Pippo Delbono, Lucia Mascino, Martina Cerroni, Giorgio Careccia', null, 'Giulia’s is a poised world, made of rigour and sacred texts, which fiercely excludes those who do not belong to it. Libero''s world is the world of all the others, of those who make mistakes, who fend for themselves looking for another chance and who love unconditionally. When Giulia meets Libero, she realizes she can have another destiny, one she will have to choose and build.', 'Giulia’s is a poised world, made of rigour and sacred texts, which fiercely excludes those who do not belong to it. Libero''s world is the world of all the others, of those who make mistakes, who fend for themselves looking for another chance and who love unconditionally. When Giulia meets Libero, she realizes she can have another destiny, one she will have to choose and build.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EB63zsR8QKVLIJpX5cVJGhKaPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412093'),
  ('1002006440948870381', 'Worlds Apart', 2008, 'Drama', 'Niels Arden Oplev', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Steen Bille', 'Pilou Asbæk, Rosalinde Mynster, Sarah Boberg, Anders W. Berthelsen, Charlotte Fich, Jens Jørn Spottag, Sarah Juel Werner, Jacob Ottensten', null, '17-year-old Sara leads a sheltered existence with her family, members of Jehovah’s Witnesses, when she meets the outsider Teis and falls in love. Sara, herself a believer, now faces an important turning point in her life as she is forced to choose between religion and love.', '17-year-old Sara leads a sheltered existence with her family, members of Jehovah’s Witnesses, when she meets the outsider Teis and falls in love. Sara, herself a believer, now faces an important turning point in her life as she is forced to choose between religion and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NQ98gYGwQjoh9eJe2lmmWVxobP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16015'),
  ('962774816591116833', 'Worlds Apart', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christopher Papakaliatis, Yannis Drakoularakos', 'Christopher Papakaliatis', 'J.K. Simmons, Maria Kavoyianni, Andrea Osvárt, Christopher Papakaliatis, Tawfeek Barhom, Minas Hatzisavvas, Niki Vakali, Odysseas Papaspiliopoulos', null, 'Three separate narratives each following a love story between a foreigner and a Greek. Each story represents a different generation falling in love during a time of socioeconomic turmoil that dominates Southern Europe as a whole, only to connect as a single story in the end.', 'Three separate narratives each following a love story between a foreigner and a Greek. Each story represents a different generation falling in love during a time of socioeconomic turmoil that dominates Southern Europe as a whole, only to connect as a single story in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZMfmZdGnt9J5ZGrSJfmc62ig31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350845'),
  ('48204569906660617', 'Worlds Apart', 2024, 'Drama', 'Natsuki Seta, Tomohiro Kubo, Kazuhiro Ohta', 'Natsuki Seta', 'Yui Aragaki, Hayase Ikoi, Koji Seto, Kaho, Rina Komiyama, Gin Pun Chou, Yuko Nakamura, Himena Irei', null, 'Makio Kōdai is a shy 35-year-old woman. She works as a novelist. One day, her sibling and her sibling''s married partner die in a car accident. Makio Kōdai attends their funeral and meets her 15-year-old niece Asa Takumi, who is now left alone due to her parents’ death. The other relatives at the funeral speak insensitive words around Asa Takumi. Makio Kōdai gets furious at them and decides to take in her niece. Makio Kōdai, who has problems having relationships with other people, and Asa Takumi now begin to live together.', 'Makio Kōdai is a shy 35-year-old woman. She works as a novelist. One day, her sibling and her sibling''s married partner die in a car accident. Makio Kōdai attends their funeral and meets her 15-year-old niece Asa Takumi, who is now left alone due to her parents’ death. The other relatives at the funeral speak insensitive words around Asa Takumi. Makio Kōdai gets furious at them and decides to take in her niece. Makio Kōdai, who has problems having relationships with other people, and Asa Takumi now begin to live together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYV0hJg1hjFjVc0g9QGD93mixaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1163269'),
  ('1046254191861935873', 'Wormtown', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Sergio Pinheiro, Roy Rossovich', 'Andrew James Myers', 'Caitlin McWethy, Rachel Ryu, Emily Soppe, Maggie Lou Rader, A.J. Baldwin, Jordan Mullins, Jim Azelvandre, Madison Murrah', 'NR', 'One year into a plague of flesh-eating, mind-altering worms, the nocturnal town of Ashland, Ohio, has embraced the parasites’ rule. Under cult-like Mayor Joshua, zealous Ranchers spread their gospel—by persuasion or by force. A trio of uninfected women cling to survival through scavenging, extreme hygiene, and evasion. But everyone breaks eventually, unleashing betrayal, sacrilege, and body horror.', 'One year into a plague of flesh-eating, mind-altering worms, the nocturnal town of Ashland, Ohio, has embraced the parasites’ rule. Under cult-like Mayor Joshua, zealous Ranchers spread their gospel—by persuasion or by force. A trio of uninfected women cling to survival through scavenging, extreme hygiene, and evasion. But everyone breaks eventually, unleashing betrayal, sacrilege, and body horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lE10ww38b7XA5LIagIsVQj9a8Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235192'),
  ('567855962994875024', 'Wormwood', 2017, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Errol Morris, Igor Martinović, Ellen Kuras', 'Steven Hathaway, Molly Rokosz', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Molly Parker, Christian Camargo, Scott Shepherd, Tim Blake Nelson, Michael Chernus, Jack Doke, David Kairys', 'NR', 'In this genre-bending tale, Errol Morris explores the mysterious death of a U.S. scientist entangled in a secret Cold War program known as MK-Ultra.', 'In this genre-bending tale, Errol Morris explores the mysterious death of a U.S. scientist entangled in a secret Cold War program known as MK-Ultra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDNeVq8JJq7BWxVuKnzQ84e88Xw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482806'),
  ('943114853914926800', 'Worry Dolls', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Matthews, Padraig Reynolds, Adam Sampson', 'Danny Kolker, Christopher Wiehl', 'Christopher Wiehl, Kym Jackson, Tina Lifford, Samantha Smith, Yohance Myles, Kennedy Brice, Brea Grant, R. Brandon Johnson', 'NR', 'A brutal serial killer is finally gunned down in the middle of carrying out one last heinous act of bloody murder. In the maniac’s possession, a box of Guatemalan talismans, which mistakenly end up being sold as charm jewelry in Chloe’s Collectables thrift shop. Soon those who bought the Worry Dolls begin to act strangely out of character and cause another rash of senseless slaughter. An ancient curse is consuming the city and pits a hardened detective against the clock to save his 8 year-old daughter’s life.', 'A brutal serial killer is finally gunned down in the middle of carrying out one last heinous act of bloody murder. In the maniac’s possession, a box of Guatemalan talismans, which mistakenly end up being sold as charm jewelry in Chloe’s Collectables thrift shop. Soon those who bought the Worry Dolls begin to act strangely out of character and cause another rash of senseless slaughter. An ancient curse is consuming the city and pits a hardened detective against the clock to save his 8 year-old daughter’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXD8DxoEkyzpW5nbTNbDY1myz1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347757'),
  ('813993031700447387', 'Worst by Chance', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Su-yeon Gu', 'Mitsunori Gu', 'Hayato Ichihara, Mika Nakashima, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Shin Yazawa, Tasuku Emoto, Yu Aoi, Yoshinori Okada, Jun Fubuki', null, 'Hidenori is a Japanese-Korean man with no sense of belonging, destination or education. He drifts around and meanders through life until a death reminds him of his heritage and so begins a journey to South Korea.', 'Hidenori is a Japanese-Korean man with no sense of belonging, destination or education. He drifts around and meanders through life until a death reminds him of his heritage and so begins a journey to South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oWacMY8mYNZ8KDx8gYg5cfDnHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45428'),
  ('473709358802852489', 'Worst Case, We Get Married', 2017, 'Drama', 'Léa Pool, Denis Jutzeler', 'Sophie Bienvenu, Léa Pool', 'Sophie Nélisse, Karine Vanasse, Jean-Simon Leduc, Mehdi Djaadi, Isabelle Nélisse, Iannicko N''Doua, Guillaume Rodrigue, Gilles Tschudi', null, 'Aïcha is a troubled teenage girl who cannot forgive her mother for kicking out the stepfather she adored. Aïcha longs for him to come back and take her away. When she meets Baz, a man twice her age, it’s love at first sight for her; the real kind, the one that hurts. Baz wants to help this lost little girl, but she wants much more from him, and is ready to do anything to get it.', 'Aïcha is a troubled teenage girl who cannot forgive her mother for kicking out the stepfather she adored. Aïcha longs for him to come back and take her away. When she meets Baz, a man twice her age, it’s love at first sight for her; the real kind, the one that hurts. Baz wants to help this lost little girl, but she wants much more from him, and is ready to do anything to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxurwUpSvL0kIVubyA0nQUMO56T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457920'),
  ('174413419305546063', 'Worth', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Pepe Avila del Pino, Ronen Gevint, Anthony Pennachio', 'Max Borenstein', 'Michael Keaton, Amy Ryan, Stanley Tucci, Tate Donovan, Shunori Ramanathan, Talia Balsam, Laura Benanti, Chris Tardio', 'PG-13', 'Kenneth Feinberg, a powerful D.C. lawyer appointed Special Master of the 9/11 Fund, fights off the cynicism, bureaucracy, and politics associated with administering government funds and, in doing so, discovers what life is worth.', 'Kenneth Feinberg, a powerful D.C. lawyer appointed Special Master of the 9/11 Fund, fights off the cynicism, bureaucracy, and politics associated with administering government funds and, in doing so, discovers what life is worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMFKTgRRCxfZGmFQVxBsQYAQufo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649394'),
  ('645268642938214268', 'Worth Winning', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Will Mackenzie, Adam Greenberg', 'Josann McGibbon, Sara Parriott', 'Mark Harmon, Madeleine Stowe, Lesley Ann Warren, Maria Holvoe, Mark Blum, Andrea Martin, Tony Longo, Alan Blumenfeld', 'PG-13', 'Taylor is a man who has no problems with women. So confident is he that he accepts a challenge from his friends: he has to secure proposals of marriage from three women of their choice.', 'Taylor is a man who has no problems with women. So confident is he that he accepts a challenge from his friends: he has to secure proposals of marriage from three women of their choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYJrnizH2npzhiZOCLr2GnYGRhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32330'),
  ('264497231582509868', 'Wotakoi: Love is Hard for Otaku', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yuichi Fukuda, Tetsuya Kudô, Takuya Ideue', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Mitsuki Takahata, Kento Yamazaki, Takumi Saitoh, Nanao, Jiro Sato, Mio Imada, Kento Kaku, Tsuyoshi Muro', null, 'An effervescent musical about one of the most unlikely couples seen on screen: two Otaku intent on hiding their nerdiness from their colleagues!', 'An effervescent musical about one of the most unlikely couples seen on screen: two Otaku intent on hiding their nerdiness from their colleagues!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Im0EqH9PmgurlbmZ0P2xSPTclu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552687'),
  ('307655296191035148', 'Would I Lie to You: The Beginning', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Bitton, Michel Munz, Jérôme Alméras', 'Michel Munz, Gérard Bitton', 'Mickaël Lumière, Yohan Manca, Anton Csaszar, Jeremy Lewin, Gilbert Melki, Audrey Dana, François Berléand, Gladys Cohen', null, 'In 1980s Paris - Patrick, Dov, Yvan and Serge are young men seeking success in love and business... with varying success.', 'In 1980s Paris - Patrick, Dov, Yvan and Serge are young men seeking success in love and business... with varying success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRM8U54mYremiqTXvWbmGrv0UL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589980'),
  ('584754352020459088', 'Would I Lie to You?', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Jacques Bouhon, Thomas Gilou', 'Michel Munz, Gérard Bitton', 'Richard Anconina, Vincent Elbaz, Richard Bohringer, José Garcia, Amira Casar, Aure Atika, Élie Kakou, Bruno Solo', null, 'Jobless loner Eddie Vuibert gets a lucky break when a rich Jewish entrepreneur mistakes him for a Jew and gives him a sweet job in the Parisian fashion district.', 'Jobless loner Eddie Vuibert gets a lucky break when a rich Jewish entrepreneur mistakes him for a Jew and gives him a sweet job in the Parisian fashion district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1JRKYnac2SvvQsCbHaVM2E5x0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39385'),
  ('165684681883488413', 'Would I Lie to You? 2', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Gilou', 'Gérard Bitton, Michel Munz', 'Richard Anconina, José Garcia, Gad Elmaleh, Aure Atika, Elisa Tovati, Enrico Macias, Bruno Solo, Amira Casar', null, 'Eddie, Dov, and Yvan are back, still working in Paris'' Sentier textile district, This time they''re confronting the high-stakes world of large distribution after striking a deal with Eurodiscount, a European hypermarket chain.', 'Eddie, Dov, and Yvan are back, still working in Paris'' Sentier textile district, This time they''re confronting the high-stakes world of large distribution after striking a deal with Eurodiscount, a European hypermarket chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWth1wr5DvErZKh0S5CAFUZDm10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31359'),
  ('131325862293789621', 'Would I Lie to You? 3', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Gilou', 'Michel Munz, Gérard Bitton', 'Richard Anconina, José Garcia, Bruno Solo, Vincent Elbaz, Amira Casar, Léa Drucker, Aure Atika, Enrico Macias', null, 'Eddie, Dov, Yvan and the others ... Our warm friends have migrated from the moribund Sentier to the flourishing suburb of Aubervilliers ... Where the old Jewish entrepreneurs left the ground to young courageous and dynamic Chinese wholesalers ... The little band is as close to each other as in previous episodes, and life goes on at the mercy of small family events and business. Dov still seems frivolous, enterprising Eddie, chilled Yvan, casual Karine, resolute Sandra, naive Chochana, irresponsible Serge and mythomaniac. As for Patrick, he is in love and the happy elected is far from easy to access. Everything would be fine until a bad wind brings its share of adversity seriously compromising the cohesion of the group. Will they succumb under the storm to the turmoil, or, once again, by mutual aid, cunning and skill, will they triumph over the crisis with panache?', 'Eddie, Dov, Yvan and the others ... Our warm friends have migrated from the moribund Sentier to the flourishing suburb of Aubervilliers ... Where the old Jewish entrepreneurs left the ground to young courageous and dynamic Chinese wholesalers ... The little band is as close to each other as in previous episodes, and life goes on at the mercy of small family events and business. Dov still seems frivolous, enterprising Eddie, chilled Yvan, casual Karine, resolute Sandra, naive Chochana, irresponsible Serge and mythomaniac. As for Patrick, he is in love and the happy elected is far from easy to access. Everything would be fine until a bad wind brings its share of adversity seriously compromising the cohesion of the group. Will they succumb under the storm to the turmoil, or, once again, by mutual aid, cunning and skill, will they triumph over the crisis with panache?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2U9VV2WWBXeA3Zc0jQFfYqnqB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86868'),
  ('929849600135899571', 'Would You Rather', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Joshua Fruehling, Daniel Leef, David Guy Levy', 'Steffen Schlachtenhaufen', 'Brittany Snow, Jeffrey Combs, Jonny Coyne, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Enver Gjokaj, Sasha Grey, John Heard, Charlie Hofheimer', 'NR', 'Desperate to help her ailing brother, a young woman agrees to compete in a deadly game of "Would You Rather" hosted by a sadistic aristocrat.', 'Desperate to help her ailing brother, a young woman agrees to compete in a deadly game of "Would You Rather" hosted by a sadistic aristocrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unYQSQWX66qmQwUYDBaBkOOFEGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97051'),
  ('66617511054102785', 'Wounded', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Richard Martin, Gregory Middleton', 'Harry Longstreet, Lindsay Bourne', 'Mädchen Amick, Graham Greene, Adrian Pasdar, Robert Costanzo, Richard Joseph Paul, Daniel Kash, Jim Beaver, François Chau', 'R', 'After a grizzly-bear poacher named Hanaghan kills her fiance and fellow Fish &amp; Wildlife Deptartment officer, Julie Clayton sets out to track the killer down and discover why the FBI is keeping its case secret from her. She is joined in her quest by Rollins, a police detective fresh out of alcohol-dependency rehabilitation.', 'After a grizzly-bear poacher named Hanaghan kills her fiance and fellow Fish &amp; Wildlife Deptartment officer, Julie Clayton sets out to track the killer down and discover why the FBI is keeping its case secret from her. She is joined in her quest by Rollins, a police detective fresh out of alcohol-dependency rehabilitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQ9kkDciXjdFxcvlSjgQKvjrhmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207177'),
  ('186867515625374955', 'Wounded', 2013, 'Drama', 'Fernando Franco, Santiago Racaj', 'Fernando Franco, Enric Rufas', 'Marian Álvarez, Andrés Gertrúdix, Rosana Pastor, Ramon Agirre, Manolo Solo, Patricia López Arnaiz, Ramón Barea, Elena Arranz Martínez', null, 'The first work from Fernando Franco revolves around Ana, a 30 year old ambulance driver. Though good at her job, Ana has problems relating in her personal life. She doesn''t know it, but she suffers from a condition known by psychiatrists as Borderline Personality Disorder. The situation pushes her to outbreaks of self-destructive behaviour, alcohol abuse and self-harm. Ana is incapable of getting what she wants most: to be happy.', 'The first work from Fernando Franco revolves around Ana, a 30 year old ambulance driver. Though good at her job, Ana has problems relating in her personal life. She doesn''t know it, but she suffers from a condition known by psychiatrists as Borderline Personality Disorder. The situation pushes her to outbreaks of self-destructive behaviour, alcohol abuse and self-harm. Ana is incapable of getting what she wants most: to be happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUdzCQDFm1saAxdGIYHjihsNQNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209418'),
  ('154253981585671325', 'Wounds', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Babak Anvari, Kit Fraser', 'Babak Anvari', 'Armie Hammer, Dakota Johnson, Zazie Beetz, Brad William Henke, Karl Glusman, Christin Rankins, Benny Thrasher, Alexander Biglane', 'R', 'Disturbing and mysterious things begin to happen to a bartender in New Orleans after he picks up a phone left behind at his bar.', 'Disturbing and mysterious things begin to happen to a bartender in New Orleans after he picks up a phone left behind at his bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1omoZD5ExFvjm1JM7n35UccXf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505423'),
  ('796147197455489524', 'Wow!', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Podalydès, Patrick Blossier, Nicolas Bureau', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Karin Viard, Bruno Podalydès, Sabine Azéma, Eddy Mitchell, Victor Lefebvre, Agnès Jaoui, Isabelle Candelier, Patrick Ligardes', null, 'Catherine and Oracio are real estate advisors, and are visiting two properties in quick succession: a large bourgeois house "which can have a swimming pool and RER view", and a small modern apartment in the heart of Bougival''s golden triangle.', 'Catherine and Oracio are real estate advisors, and are visiting two properties in quick succession: a large bourgeois house "which can have a swimming pool and RER view", and a small modern apartment in the heart of Bougival''s golden triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYMvwDJjVf1aCYSitGJPa43PkQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063872'),
  ('1006201799709354130', 'Wow! A Talking Fish!', 1983, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Robert Sahakyants, Robert Sahakyants, Alice Kyurdyan', 'Robert Sahakyants', 'Irina Kartashyova, Artyom Karapetyan, Leonid Belozorovich, Boris Plotnikov', null, 'A fisherman catches a talking fish and spares its life. After that, he meets a grotesque, evil monster in a state of constant change.', 'A fisherman catches a talking fish and spares its life. After that, he meets a grotesque, evil monster in a state of constant change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tr28r8BddkRBTcLXAg2tcXhn3XA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165095'),
  ('257669449254495383', 'Woyzeck', 1979, 'Drama', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Werner Herzog', 'Klaus Kinski, Eva Mattes, Wolfgang Reichmann, Willy Semmelrogge, Josef Bierbichler, Paul Burian, Volker Prechtel, Dieter Augustin', 'NR', 'Having fathered an illegitimate child with his lover, Marie, feckless soldier Franz Woyzeck takes odd jobs around his small town to provide some extra money for them. One job is volunteering for experiments conducted by a local doctor, who puts Woyzeck on a diet of peas. This serves to drive him close to madness, and the discovery that Marie is involved in an affair with the local drum major exacerbates the situation. Pushed too far, Woyzeck resorts to violence.', 'Having fathered an illegitimate child with his lover, Marie, feckless soldier Franz Woyzeck takes odd jobs around his small town to provide some extra money for them. One job is volunteering for experiments conducted by a local doctor, who puts Woyzeck on a diet of peas. This serves to drive him close to madness, and the discovery that Marie is involved in an affair with the local drum major exacerbates the situation. Pushed too far, Woyzeck resorts to violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxJThwhfqvyIRD6VszknCNCSokK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10319'),
  ('24222156207904650', 'Woyzeck', 1994, 'Drama', 'János Szász, Katalin Joó, Károly Szekeres', 'János Szász', 'Lajos Kovács, Diana Vacaru, Éva Igó, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Gábor Reviczky, Péter Haumann, Sándor Gáspár, Sándor Varga', null, 'Lajos Kovács (WINGS OF DESIRE) stars as the misused Woyzeck, who ekes out a miserable existence sweeping train tracks, running errands for a bullying army captain and acting as a human guinea pig for a local doctor with ideas about free will. When his common-law wife begins an affair with a local cop, Woyzeck''s pocket Bible and near-starvation diet point him on a downward spiral of twisted redemption.', 'Lajos Kovács (WINGS OF DESIRE) stars as the misused Woyzeck, who ekes out a miserable existence sweeping train tracks, running errands for a bullying army captain and acting as a human guinea pig for a local doctor with ideas about free will. When his common-law wife begins an affair with a local cop, Woyzeck''s pocket Bible and near-starvation diet point him on a downward spiral of twisted redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0vzrgnecwARGcUsRcZzmSwWHFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48199'),
  ('574980611226961807', 'WR: Mysteries of the Organism', 1971, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Dušan Makavejev, Aleksandar Petković', 'Dušan Makavejev', 'Milena Dravić, Ivica Vidović, Jagoda Kaloper, Tuli Kupferberg, Zoran Radmilović, Jackie Curtis, Miodrag Andrić, Živka Matić', null, 'What does the energy harnessed through orgasm have to do with the state of communist Yugoslavia circa 1971? Only counterculture filmmaker extraordinaire Dušan Makavejev has the answers (or the questions). His surreal documentary-fiction collision begins as an investigation into the life and work of controversial psychologist and philosopher Wilhelm Reich and then explodes into a free-form narrative of a beautiful young Slavic girl’s sexual liberation.', 'What does the energy harnessed through orgasm have to do with the state of communist Yugoslavia circa 1971? Only counterculture filmmaker extraordinaire Dušan Makavejev has the answers (or the questions). His surreal documentary-fiction collision begins as an investigation into the life and work of controversial psychologist and philosopher Wilhelm Reich and then explodes into a free-form narrative of a beautiful young Slavic girl’s sexual liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0TNEVnIUgMIQrkcBasprdZh5Bz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42529'),
  ('201144660146851520', 'Wrath', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jota Aronak', 'Jota Aronak', 'Urko Olazábal, Nacho Marraco, Diana Facen, Roberto Mori, Santiago Ruiz, Stephen Hughes', null, 'A journalist filming his 1st documentary when he meets CESAR MAYO, witness of the absolution of the murderer of his son. Cesar proposes that Iker film the preparation and execution of a revenge killing. Iker accepts with the goal of filming the preparation, but of stopping the crime before it actually takes place. Iker investigates the case of the murdered youth and the strange circumstances surrounding it. Meanwhile Cesar fine tunes his plan to manipulate the penal code to eliminate or at least minimize any punishment for the crime he is planning, so as to show how justice is an illusion. As he designs the plan to avenge himself on Fabian Arias, the alleged killer of his son, he uses the penal code and his plans for a legal defense to decide the form, timing and manner in which he will carry out his version of Justice.', 'A journalist filming his 1st documentary when he meets CESAR MAYO, witness of the absolution of the murderer of his son. Cesar proposes that Iker film the preparation and execution of a revenge killing. Iker accepts with the goal of filming the preparation, but of stopping the crime before it actually takes place. Iker investigates the case of the murdered youth and the strange circumstances surrounding it. Meanwhile Cesar fine tunes his plan to manipulate the penal code to eliminate or at least minimize any punishment for the crime he is planning, so as to show how justice is an illusion. As he designs the plan to avenge himself on Fabian Arias, the alleged killer of his son, he uses the penal code and his plans for a legal defense to decide the form, timing and manner in which he will carry out his version of Justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqpCEimQYlqEg6zvPLCdHehLnts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418662'),
  ('440138418762523128', 'Wrath of Daimajin', 1966, 'Fantasy, Horror, Adventure', 'Hitoshi Obuchi, Kazuo Mori, Hiroshi Imai', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Hideki Ninomiya, Chikara Hashimoto, Shinji Hori, Masahide Iizuka, Muneyuki Nagatomo, Junichiro Yamashita, Tōru Abe, Hiroshi Nawa', 'PG', 'In a mountainous region of Japan, Lord Arakawa kidnaps the men of nearby villages to use as slave labor, producing gunpowder from his sulfur pits. A band of young boys decide to rescue their enslaved fathers on their own.', 'In a mountainous region of Japan, Lord Arakawa kidnaps the men of nearby villages to use as slave labor, producing gunpowder from his sulfur pits. A band of young boys decide to rescue their enslaved fathers on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GR0G6B1YozsdhzJ2GCDnHyjrhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28856'),
  ('1093763485314734204', 'Wrath of Man', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Guy Ritchie, Alan Stewart, Bruce McCleery', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Éric Besnard', 'Jason Statham, Holt McCallany, Rocci Williams, Josh Hartnett, Jeffrey Donovan, Scott Eastwood, Andy Garcia, Deobia Oparei', 'R', 'A cold and mysterious new security guard for a Los Angeles cash truck company surprises his co-workers when he unleashes precision skills during a heist. The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from. Soon, the marksman''s ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.', 'A cold and mysterious new security guard for a Los Angeles cash truck company surprises his co-workers when he unleashes precision skills during a heist. The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from. Soon, the marksman''s ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M7SUK85sKjaStg4TKhlAVyGlz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637649'),
  ('417448827301696109', 'Wrath of Silence', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'He Shan, Xin Yukun', 'Xin Yukun', 'Song Yang, Jiang Wu, Yuan Wenkang, Tan Zhuo, Yi Tiankai, An Hu, Wang Zichen, Duan Pengyu', null, 'Northern China, 2004. When miner Zhang Baomin returns to his home, a small and isolated mining village, his wife tells him that their son has mysteriously disappeared while shepherding his small flock.', 'Northern China, 2004. When miner Zhang Baomin returns to his home, a small and isolated mining village, his wife tells him that their son has mysteriously disappeared while shepherding his small flock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldZWRUdfFkXkCYNzHJgTdVMurf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473328'),
  ('982793391062916292', 'Wrath of the Ninja: The Yotoden Movie', 1989, 'Animation', 'Osamu Yamasaki, Toshiyuki Sakurai, Yosuke Moriguchi', 'Takeshi Narumi, Sho Aikawa', 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Keiko Toda, Takeshi Watabe, Eken Mine, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kazuki Yao, Kei Tomiyama, Kiyoshi Kobayashi', null, 'The year is 1580, and the unholy armies of Lord Nobunaga Oda spread across Japan, murdering all who oppose them. Narrowly escaping the slaughter of her clan, a young ninja steals into the shadows. She is the last of her kind, and the dagger she wields is one of three mystical blades that can end Lord Oda''s rule. On her quest to overthrow the tyrant, she is joined by two other renegade ninja, possessors of the sacred sword and spear. Together, these shadow warriors must unite their weapons and skills to fulfill the Prophesy of the Enchanted Swords... or die trying.', 'The year is 1580, and the unholy armies of Lord Nobunaga Oda spread across Japan, murdering all who oppose them. Narrowly escaping the slaughter of her clan, a young ninja steals into the shadows. She is the last of her kind, and the dagger she wields is one of three mystical blades that can end Lord Oda''s rule. On her quest to overthrow the tyrant, she is joined by two other renegade ninja, possessors of the sacred sword and spear. Together, these shadow warriors must unite their weapons and skills to fulfill the Prophesy of the Enchanted Swords... or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SDSohIGxm92zwxM9l9HclCjNPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55708'),
  ('622584495248768865', 'Wrath of the Titans', 2012, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Ben Davis, Jonathan Liebesman, Ray Chan', 'Dan Mazeau, David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick', 'Sam Worthington, Liam Neeson, Ralph Fiennes, Rosamund Pike, Bill Nighy, Edgar Ramírez, Toby Kebbell, Danny Huston', 'PG-13', 'Perseus tries to live a quieter life as a village fisherman while – dangerously weakened by humanity''s lack of devotion – the gods are losing control of the long-imprisoned Titans and their ferocious leader, Kronos.', 'Perseus tries to live a quieter life as a village fisherman while – dangerously weakened by humanity''s lack of devotion – the gods are losing control of the long-imprisoned Titans and their ferocious leader, Kronos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9n2R3xZWQ8MVZgndQoV34stS0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57165'),
  ('557744501725053184', 'Wrath of the Wind', 1970, 'Drama', 'Mario Camus, Adolfo Aristarain', null, 'Terence Hill, Maria Grazia Buccella, Mario Pardo, Máximo Valverde, Carlo Alberto Cortina, Ángel Lombarte, William Layton, Manuel Alexandre', null, 'A mute gunslinger takes on an oppressive landlord in 19th century Valencia and falls in love with a local woman.', 'A mute gunslinger takes on an oppressive landlord in 19th century Valencia and falls in love with a local woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7j0AAXYKKcPfy4hkvvwvLdBlJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46446'),
  ('31111830009972407', 'Wrath of Van Helsing', 2022, 'Horror', 'Soner Metin, Jack Peter Mundy', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Michael Hoad, Darrell Griggs, Antonia Whillans, Abi Casson Thompson, Elspeth Foster, Beatrice Fletcher, Mark Sears, Richard Harfst', null, 'Van Helsing is called upon to help save a missing girl and her friends from a hoard of demons.', 'Van Helsing is called upon to help save a missing girl and her friends from a hoard of demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bISowtQExr3WvygNFjqPaitC730.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980605'),
  ('257108224528062571', 'Wreaths at the Foot of the Mountain', 1984, 'Drama, War', 'Xie Jin, Wu Zhennian, Qiu Yuan', 'Zhun Li', 'Lü Xiaohe, Tang Guoqiang, HeWei, Tong Chao, 盖克, Wang Yumei, Liu Yansheng, Siqin Gaowa', null, 'Wreaths at the Foot of the Mountain is a 1984 Chinese film about the life of the soldiers in a PLA army company before, during and after the Sino-Vietnamese War.', 'Wreaths at the Foot of the Mountain is a 1984 Chinese film about the life of the soldiers in a PLA army company before, during and after the Sino-Vietnamese War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZVM4fvH5d7AOlj41jh04UGQWBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258424'),
  ('189041910742392696', 'Wreck-It Ralph', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Erik Eulen, David S. Dunn, Jan Berger', 'Jennifer Lee, Phil Johnston', 'John C. Reilly, Sarah Silverman, Jack McBrayer, Jane Lynch, Alan Tudyk, Rich Moore, Raymond S. Persi, Mindy Kaling', 'PG', 'Wreck-It Ralph is the 9-foot-tall, 643-pound villain of an arcade video game named Fix-It Felix Jr., in which the game''s titular hero fixes buildings that Ralph destroys. Wanting to prove he can be a good guy and not just a villain, Ralph escapes his game and lands in Hero''s Duty, a first-person shooter where he helps the game''s hero battle against alien invaders. He later enters Sugar Rush, a kart racing game set on tracks made of candies, cookies and other sweets. There, Ralph meets Vanellope von Schweetz who has learned that her game is faced with a dire threat that could affect the entire arcade, and one that Ralph may have inadvertently started.', 'Wreck-It Ralph is the 9-foot-tall, 643-pound villain of an arcade video game named Fix-It Felix Jr., in which the game''s titular hero fixes buildings that Ralph destroys. Wanting to prove he can be a good guy and not just a villain, Ralph escapes his game and lands in Hero''s Duty, a first-person shooter where he helps the game''s hero battle against alien invaders. He later enters Sugar Rush, a kart racing game set on tracks made of candies, cookies and other sweets. There, Ralph meets Vanellope von Schweetz who has learned that her game is faced with a dire threat that could affect the entire arcade, and one that Ralph may have inadvertently started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWoIgZ7mgmPkaZjG0102BSKFIqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82690'),
  ('832638489070725378', 'Wreckage and Rage: Making ''Alien³''', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Charles de Lauzirika', 'Charles de Lauzirika', 'David Giler, Gordon Carroll, Renny Harlin, Michael Biehn, Carrie Henn, Sigourney Weaver, Vincent Ward, Jon Landau', 'R', 'The creation of the film Alien³ (1992) is covered here in this feature-length documentary in exhaustive detail. Many interviews with the cast and crew give us an idea of how hard of a time David Fincher had creating his first feature film, as well as present us with much information about every element that went into making this film, including how the plot and script changed drastically through filming.', 'The creation of the film Alien³ (1992) is covered here in this feature-length documentary in exhaustive detail. Many interviews with the cast and crew give us an idea of how hard of a time David Fincher had creating his first feature film, as well as present us with much information about every element that went into making this film, including how the plot and script changed drastically through filming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st2oN24aB66omHdJnyCiiuwXsWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70849'),
  ('187668502974383940', 'Wrecked', 2010, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'James Liston, Michael Greenspan, Peter Bien', 'Christopher Dodd', 'Adrien Brody, Caroline Dhavernas, Ryan Robbins, Adrian Holmes, Adrian G. Griffiths, Lloyd Adams, Mark McConchie, Jacob Blair', 'R', 'A man awakens in a car wreck at the bottom of a steep cliff. He can''t remember who he is or how he got there, but a report over the radio fills in some of the blanks, as it describes a violent bank robbery and names a perpetrator who happens to be sitting dead in the back seat.', 'A man awakens in a car wreck at the bottom of a steep cliff. He can''t remember who he is or how he got there, but a report over the radio fills in some of the blanks, as it describes a violent bank robbery and names a perpetrator who happens to be sitting dead in the back seat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlMaBNaC7FATlWq5lq9LmWijBOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50838'),
  ('732059673048885127', 'Wrecker', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Michael Bafaro, Ian MacDougall, Jon Thomas', 'Michael Bafaro', 'Anna Hutchison, Andrea Whitburn, Jennifer Koenig, Michael Dickson, Kurtis Maguire, Andy Nez, Lori Watt, Steve Thackray', null, 'Best friends Emily and Lesley go on a road trip to the desert. When Emily decides to get off the highway and take a "short cut," they become the target of a relentless and psychotic trucker who forces them to play a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'Best friends Emily and Lesley go on a road trip to the desert. When Emily decides to get off the highway and take a "short cut," they become the target of a relentless and psychotic trucker who forces them to play a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFYMEhWEBo3UYaU28n7g1nWqTgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365805'),
  ('698536329889484899', 'Wreckers', 2011, 'Drama', 'D.R. Hood, Annemarie Lean-Vercoe', 'Dictynna Hood', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Claire Foy, Shaun Evans, Sinéad Matthews, Peter McDonald, June Watson, Ruairi Conaghan, Sophie Brooke', null, 'A married couple move back to his childhood village to start a family but a surprise visit from the husband''s brother ignites sibling rivalry and exposes the lies embedded in the couple''s relationship.', 'A married couple move back to his childhood village to start a family but a surprise visit from the husband''s brother ignites sibling rivalry and exposes the lies embedded in the couple''s relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq9immUha27mEH1D6FZx4PPwHsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95675'),
  ('1002807221370615776', 'WrestleMania 39: Saturday', 2023, 'Action', 'Vince McMahon', 'Bruce Prichard, Ed Koskey, Vince McMahon', 'Joshua Fatu, Jonathan Solofa Fatu, Rami Sebei, Kevin Steen, Ashley Fliehr, Rhea Ripley, Óscar Gutiérrez Rubio, Dominik Gutiérrez', 'PG', 'WrestleMania goes Hollywood as WWE Superstars compete on The Grandest Stage of Them All in Los Angeles. John Cena challenges Austin Theory for the WWE United States Championship. Charlotte Flair defends the WWE SmackDown Women’s Championship against Rhea Ripley.', 'WrestleMania goes Hollywood as WWE Superstars compete on The Grandest Stage of Them All in Los Angeles. John Cena challenges Austin Theory for the WWE United States Championship. Charlotte Flair defends the WWE SmackDown Women’s Championship against Rhea Ripley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPxzwbWfDx6lYgy89F9FOJzdJnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005575'),
  ('149695225480495798', 'WrestleMania XL Saturday', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Paul Levesque', null, 'Joe Anoa''i, Cody Rhodes, Dwayne Johnson, Colby Lopez, Masami Odate, Pam Martinez, Rhea Ripley, Joshua Fatu', 'PG', 'The Undisputed WWE Universal Championship will be on the line when Roman Reigns defends his title against the winner of the 2024 Royal Rumble, Cody Rhodes. The Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre will finally get his chance to win a world title in front of the masses as he faces World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins at The Showcase of the Immortals. Plus a big tag team match on night 1 where Cody Rhodes and World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins will go head to head with Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson and Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in a match with huge WrestleMania implications. Bayley is hellbent on seizing the WWE Women''s Champion when she goes to war against her former ally IYO SKY at WrestleMania. ''Mami'' Rhea Ripley defends her Women''s World Title against ''The Man'' Becky Lynch in what should be a legendary championship fight and many more.', 'The Undisputed WWE Universal Championship will be on the line when Roman Reigns defends his title against the winner of the 2024 Royal Rumble, Cody Rhodes. The Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre will finally get his chance to win a world title in front of the masses as he faces World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins at The Showcase of the Immortals. Plus a big tag team match on night 1 where Cody Rhodes and World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins will go head to head with Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson and Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in a match with huge WrestleMania implications. Bayley is hellbent on seizing the WWE Women''s Champion when she goes to war against her former ally IYO SKY at WrestleMania. ''Mami'' Rhea Ripley defends her Women''s World Title against ''The Man'' Becky Lynch in what should be a legendary championship fight and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xx0kqs1iMot9Xpz1lBp5ZAAe9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005576'),
  ('533809868864560371', 'WrestleMania XL Sunday', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Paul Levesque', 'Bruce Prichard', 'Joe Anoa''i, Cody Rhodes, Dwayne Johnson, Paul Heyman, Jonathan Solofa Fatu, Joseph Fatu, John Cena, Mark Calaway', 'PG', 'The Undisputed WWE Universal Championship will be on the line when Roman Reigns defends his title against the winner of the 2024 Royal Rumble, Cody Rhodes. The Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre will finally get his chance to win a world title in front of the masses as he faces World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins at The Showcase of the Immortals. Plus a big tag team match on night 1 where Cody Rhodes and World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins will go head to head with Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson and Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in a match with huge WrestleMania implications. Bayley is hellbent on seizing the WWE Women''s Champion when she goes to war against her former ally IYO SKY at WrestleMania. ''Mami'' Rhea Ripley defends her Women''s World Title against ''The Man'' Becky Lynch in what should be a legendary championship fight and many more.', 'The Undisputed WWE Universal Championship will be on the line when Roman Reigns defends his title against the winner of the 2024 Royal Rumble, Cody Rhodes. The Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre will finally get his chance to win a world title in front of the masses as he faces World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins at The Showcase of the Immortals. Plus a big tag team match on night 1 where Cody Rhodes and World Heavyweight Champion Seth "Freakin" Rollins will go head to head with Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson and Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in a match with huge WrestleMania implications. Bayley is hellbent on seizing the WWE Women''s Champion when she goes to war against her former ally IYO SKY at WrestleMania. ''Mami'' Rhea Ripley defends her Women''s World Title against ''The Man'' Becky Lynch in what should be a legendary championship fight and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUWm19RtvAxWySD9VXFKl0P29Bh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005578'),
  ('704342554387029417', 'Wrestlemaniac', 2006, 'Horror', 'Jesse Baget', 'Jesse Baget', 'Adam Huss, Catherine Wreford, Miguel Ángel López Díaz, Fred Tatasciore, Margaret Scarborough, Zack Bennett, Tabbert Fiiller, Jeremy Radin', 'NR', 'On their way to Cabo San Lucas, the cast and crew of a low-budget film get lost and come upon "La Sangre De Dios", a ghost town with a spine-tingling legend about an insane Mexican wrestler. One by one, the cast and crew are snatched, beaten and dragged to a bloody death. The few left alive must figure out how to beat the wrestler at his own deadly game, or die trying.', 'On their way to Cabo San Lucas, the cast and crew of a low-budget film get lost and come upon "La Sangre De Dios", a ghost town with a spine-tingling legend about an insane Mexican wrestler. One by one, the cast and crew are snatched, beaten and dragged to a bloody death. The few left alive must figure out how to beat the wrestler at his own deadly game, or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Lyf9uHr5vrqujhBhTRcIZSzkLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17319'),
  ('894693825477261909', 'Wrestling Ernest Hemingway', 1993, 'Drama', 'Randa Haines, Lajos Koltai', 'Steven Conrad', 'Robert Duvall, Richard Harris, Shirley MacLaine, Sandra Bullock, Marty Belafsky, Piper Laurie, Micole Mercurio, Adam Arkin', 'PG-13', 'Frank, a retired Irish seaman, and Walter, a retired Cuban barber, are two lonely old men trapped in the emptiness of their own lives. When they meet in a park Frank is able to start a conversation after several attempts. They begin to spend time together and become friends. But because of their different characters they often quarrel with each other and finally seperate after Frank misbehaves to Walter''s friend Elaine.', 'Frank, a retired Irish seaman, and Walter, a retired Cuban barber, are two lonely old men trapped in the emptiness of their own lives. When they meet in a park Frank is able to start a conversation after several attempts. They begin to spend time together and become friends. But because of their different characters they often quarrel with each other and finally seperate after Frank misbehaves to Walter''s friend Elaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMWkpitaM33HgDv25RzeMy9ZNFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40509'),
  ('264671508350869660', 'Wrestling Women vs. the Killer Robot', 1969, 'Horror', 'René Cardona, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Joaquín Cordero, Regina Torné, Héctor Lechuga, Malú Reyes, Carlos Agostí, Genaro Moreno, Pascual García Peña, Gloria Chávez', null, 'A lady wrestler and her boyfriend, a policeman, battle a mad scientist who has developed a murderous killer robot and uses it to kidnap wealthy people.', 'A lady wrestler and her boyfriend, a policeman, battle a mad scientist who has developed a murderous killer robot and uses it to kidnap wealthy people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boACMhIoODJMwlJUMUH78GLH69d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341790'),
  ('769812161915030197', 'Wrinkles', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Ignacio Ferreras, David Cubero', 'Rosanna Cecchini, Ignacio Ferreras', 'Tacho González, Álvaro Guevara, Mabel Rivera, Raul Dans, Montse Davila, Chelo Diaz, Isabel Vallejo, Carolina Vázquez', null, 'At an elder-care facility, a geriatric con artist tries to prevent his new friend with early Alzheimer''s symptoms from being transferred to the ''lost causes'' floor.', 'At an elder-care facility, a geriatric con artist tries to prevent his new friend with early Alzheimer''s symptoms from being transferred to the ''lost causes'' floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aamZ9pJpWnPjYvQz68dsX15YwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85444'),
  ('164598581394499011', 'Wrinkles the Clown', 2019, 'Documentary, Horror, Comedy', 'Michael Beach Nichols', 'Michael Beach Nichols, Christopher K. Walker', 'Wrinkles the Clown, Lillian Grubbs, D.B. Lambert, Brett Abramson, George Holden', null, 'In Florida, parents can hire Wrinkles the Clown to scare their misbehaving children.', 'In Florida, parents can hire Wrinkles the Clown to scare their misbehaving children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifH9eohqttl6TlpAPHM3BoZrgjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619262'),
  ('302668334035726580', 'Wristcutters: A Love Story', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Goran Dukić, Vanja Černjul, James Roland', 'Goran Dukić', 'Patrick Fugit, Shannyn Sossamon, Shea Whigham, Leslie Bibb, Mikal P. Lazarev, Mark Boone Junior, Abraham Benrubi, Mary Pat Gleason', 'R', 'Zia, distraught over breaking up with his girlfriend, decides to end it all. Unfortunately, he discovers that there is no real ending, only a run-down afterlife that is strikingly similar to his old one, just a bit worse. Discovering that his ex-girlfriend has also "offed" herself, he sets out on a road trip to find her.', 'Zia, distraught over breaking up with his girlfriend, decides to end it all. Unfortunately, he discovers that there is no real ending, only a run-down afterlife that is strikingly similar to his old one, just a bit worse. Discovering that his ex-girlfriend has also "offed" herself, he sets out on a road trip to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qModiIR60IMLP28ruGZluQOtsOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13198'),
  ('132079925004600706', 'Write Before Christmas', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Pat Williams, Randal Platt', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Torrey DeVitto, Chad Michael Murray, Lolita Davidovich, Drew Seeley, David Quinlan, Kimberley Shoniker, Lanie McAuley, Madison Smith', null, 'A recently single Jessica sends Christmas cards to people who have impacted her life—the aunt who raised her, her younger brother in the military, a popstar who was part of the soundtrack of her life, the music teacher who inspired her, and the best friend who always tells the truth.', 'A recently single Jessica sends Christmas cards to people who have impacted her life—the aunt who raised her, her younger brother in the military, a popstar who was part of the soundtrack of her life, the music teacher who inspired her, and the best friend who always tells the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiC9CTgWVi9ytFrP01PtfvBamuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626319'),
  ('153652444971221614', 'Write It on the Walls', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Giancarlo Scarchilli, Blasco Giurato', 'Giancarlo Scarchilli', 'Cristiana Capotondi, Primo Reggiani, Ludovico Fremont, Daniele De Angelis, Mattia Braccialarghe, Yvonne Sciò, Davide Silvestri, Stefania Orsola Garello', null, 'Sole, a university student bored of her daily routine, meets graffiti artists Pierpaolo and Alex, and her life changes until she falls in love with one of them.', 'Sole, a university student bored of her daily routine, meets graffiti artists Pierpaolo and Alex, and her life changes until she falls in love with one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx1KbiJRm3shsn4X0tP1HsxwgSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110314'),
  ('149080541977294484', 'Write Me A Letter When You Return Home', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jacob Healt', 'Vivian Rose', 'Gail LaQuay, Gerald LaQuay', 'PG', '75-year-old Enola Niaga finds comfort in writing letters back and forth with her sweetheart.', '75-year-old Enola Niaga finds comfort in writing letters back and forth with her sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz8bF7wG2mpF6keXLBv6cJLFNlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113693'),
  ('845854037613888906', 'Writing Backwards', 1896, null, 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Félicien Trewey', null, 'Félicien Trewey performs a trick by writing backwards the words "Ladies and gentlemen, my grateful thanks" on a board.', 'Félicien Trewey performs a trick by writing backwards the words "Ladies and gentlemen, my grateful thanks" on a board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6YPn6TNPLVsgmgmBx7cHii2Zul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194110'),
  ('233615726436731797', 'Writing with Fire', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Rintu Thomas, Sushmit Ghosh', null, 'Meera Devi, Suneeta Prajapati, Shyamkali Devi', 'PG-13', 'In a cluttered news landscape dominated by men, emerges India’s only newspaper run by Dalit women. Armed with smartphones, Chief Reporter Meera and her journalists break traditions on the frontlines of India’s biggest issues and within the confines of their own homes, redefining what it means to be powerful.', 'In a cluttered news landscape dominated by men, emerges India’s only newspaper run by Dalit women. Armed with smartphones, Chief Reporter Meera and her journalists break traditions on the frontlines of India’s biggest issues and within the confines of their own homes, redefining what it means to be powerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM9og12G8vCNelCdM7bCW6pfrkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776557'),
  ('516645959700633079', 'Written on the Wind', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Sirk, William Holland, Russell Metty', 'George Zuckerman', 'Rock Hudson, Lauren Bacall, Robert Stack, Dorothy Malone, Robert Keith, Grant Williams, Robert J. Wilke, Edward Platt', 'NR', 'Mitch Wayne is a geologist working for the Hadleys, an oil-rich Texas family. While the patriarch, Jasper, works hard to establish the family business, his irresponsible son, Kyle, is an alcoholic playboy, and his daughter, Marylee, is the town tramp. Mitch harbors a secret love for Kyle''s unsatisfied wife, Lucy -- a fact that leaves him exposed when the jealous Marylee accuses him of murder.', 'Mitch Wayne is a geologist working for the Hadleys, an oil-rich Texas family. While the patriarch, Jasper, works hard to establish the family business, his irresponsible son, Kyle, is an alcoholic playboy, and his daughter, Marylee, is the town tramp. Mitch harbors a secret love for Kyle''s unsatisfied wife, Lucy -- a fact that leaves him exposed when the jealous Marylee accuses him of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paeBU70fHsFAOooWM5V35q562f2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69605'),
  ('52438578337324613', 'Wrong', 2012, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Jack Plotnick, Éric Judor, Alexis Dziena, Steve Little, Bob Jennings, William Fichtner, Arden Myrin, Todd Giebenhain', 'NR', 'Dolph Springer wakes up one morning to realize he has lost the love of his life, his dog, Paul. During his quest to get Paul (and his life) back, Dolph radically changes the lives of others -- risking his sanity all the while.', 'Dolph Springer wakes up one morning to realize he has lost the love of his life, his dog, Paul. During his quest to get Paul (and his life) back, Dolph radically changes the lives of others -- risking his sanity all the while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6IvmVvfsoIL8HNVusb4oAQr6Rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83186'),
  ('7495766525886086', 'Wrong Again', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Lloyd French, Lewis R. Foster', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Harry Bernard, Josephine Crowell, William Gillespie, Charlie Hall, Dell Henderson, Jack Hill', 'NR', 'Stable hands Stan and Ollie are tending a thoroughbred named "Blue Boy." But when they overhear two men talking about a $5000 reward for the return of the stolen "Blue Boy," they miss the part about it being the painting, not the horse. They take the horse to the owner''s house to claim the reward. The owner instructs them to put "Blue Boy" on the piano and Ollie explains, "these millionaires are peculiar."', 'Stable hands Stan and Ollie are tending a thoroughbred named "Blue Boy." But when they overhear two men talking about a $5000 reward for the return of the stolen "Blue Boy," they miss the part about it being the painting, not the horse. They take the horse to the owner''s house to claim the reward. The owner instructs them to put "Blue Boy" on the piano and Ollie explains, "these millionaires are peculiar."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAFRS9QWTAROG1Bh505pbySCnjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50921'),
  ('93955390803245528', 'Wrong Cops', 2013, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Mark Burnham, Steve Little, Éric Judor, Marilyn Manson, Arden Myrin, Eric Wareheim, Grace Zabriskie, Eric Roberts', 'NR', 'A group of bad cops look to dispose of a body that one of them accidentally shot.', 'A group of bad cops look to dispose of a body that one of them accidentally shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15SXDNERXh3QEffPxDDbt0DVHij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158990'),
  ('885634894866200864', 'Wrong Is Right', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Brooks, Fred J. Koenekamp, Tom Seidman', 'Richard Brooks', 'Sean Connery, George Grizzard, Robert Conrad, Katharine Ross, G.D. Spradlin, John Saxon, Henry Silva, Leslie Nielsen', 'R', 'Political double-talk, dirty tricks, hidden microphones, spy satellites, bugging the Oval Office and a nuclear bomb for sale are all ingredients in this swift, funny and frightening look at the possibilities in today''s political arenas. Sean Connery stars as TV Newsman Patrick Hale on an international chase to track two suitcase sized nuclear weapons and to uncover the twisting maze of apparent involvement of US Government agencies.', 'Political double-talk, dirty tricks, hidden microphones, spy satellites, bugging the Oval Office and a nuclear bomb for sale are all ingredients in this swift, funny and frightening look at the possibilities in today''s political arenas. Sean Connery stars as TV Newsman Patrick Hale on an international chase to track two suitcase sized nuclear weapons and to uncover the twisting maze of apparent involvement of US Government agencies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFEucZZiCvKMX8GLlyepwppoX9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31661'),
  ('262523729397751771', 'Wrong Move', 1975, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Robby Müller, Micky Kley', 'Peter Handke', 'Rüdiger Vogler, Hans Christian Blech, Hanna Schygulla, Nastassja Kinski, Peter Kern, Ivan Desny, Marianne Hoppe, Lisa Kreuzer', 'NR', 'Six days in the life of Wilhelm: a detached man without qualities. He wants to write, so his mother gives him a ticket to Bonn, telling him to live. On the train he meets an older man, an athlete in the 1936 Olympics, and his mute teen companion, Mignon. She''s an acrobat in market squares for spare change.', 'Six days in the life of Wilhelm: a detached man without qualities. He wants to write, so his mother gives him a ticket to Bonn, telling him to live. On the train he meets an older man, an athlete in the 1936 Olympics, and his mute teen companion, Mignon. She''s an acrobat in market squares for spare change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXdpTmRMPZyZQKWcY7GA8M2gaae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20017'),
  ('1044702327144329899', 'Wrong Place', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Peter A. Holland, Mike Burns', 'Bill Lawrence', 'Ashley Greene, Bruce Willis, Michael Sirow, Texas Battle, Stacey Danger, Massi Furlan, Adam Huel Potter, Josh Rhett Noble', null, 'A methamphetamine cook hunts down the former police chief of a small town in order to silence him before he can deliver eyewitness testimony against his family, but ultimately finds himself up against more than he had bargained for.', 'A methamphetamine cook hunts down the former police chief of a small town in order to silence him before he can deliver eyewitness testimony against his family, but ultimately finds himself up against more than he had bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlEtOQAQVy6eW65sHz3UduvzRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921353'),
  ('1061575620612992223', 'Wrong Rosary', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mahmut Fazıl Coşkun', 'Tarık Tufan, Bektas Topaloglu, Görkem Yeltan', 'Nadir Sarıbacak, Görkem Yeltan, Ersan Uysal, Burçin Şenkal, Murat Ergün, Ayşe Çakar, Tarık Günersel, Can Kolukısa', null, 'Muezzin Musa falls for his neighbor, the Catholic nurse Clara. The story gets even more exceptional when Musa meets Yakup, who turns out to be connected with Clara.', 'Muezzin Musa falls for his neighbor, the Catholic nurse Clara. The story gets even more exceptional when Musa meets Yakup, who turns out to be connected with Clara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG2rQYfUpZj4VJdB4I6Bb6SzBHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34420'),
  ('646539034902236676', 'Wrong Side of Town', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David DeFalco, Tom Lembcke', 'David DeFalco', 'Rob Szatkowski, Dave Bautista, Lara Grice, Randal Reeder, Ja Rule, Louis Herthum, Ross Britz, Edrick Browne', 'R', 'Ex-Navy Seal Bobby Kalinowski lives a quiet, peaceful life as a landscape architect in an LA suburb with his wife Dawn and 16 year old daughter Brianna. Tonight they are invited out for an evening on the town by new neighbors clay and Elise Freeman to a happening club downtown. Little did they know that this would be the start of a life or death ordeal for the group.', 'Ex-Navy Seal Bobby Kalinowski lives a quiet, peaceful life as a landscape architect in an LA suburb with his wife Dawn and 16 year old daughter Brianna. Tonight they are invited out for an evening on the town by new neighbors clay and Elise Freeman to a happening club downtown. Little did they know that this would be the start of a life or death ordeal for the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqkL6OH8lCp5w4ggxMraZGOjswd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32845'),
  ('292555106457096309', 'Wrong Turn', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Schmidt, John S. Bartley, Doug Slater', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Eliza Dushku, Desmond Harrington, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Jeremy Sisto, Kevin Zegers, Lindy Booth, Julian Richings, Garry Robbins', 'R', 'Chris crashes into a carload of other young people, and the group of stranded motorists is soon lost in the woods of West Virginia, where they''re hunted by three cannibalistic mountain men who are grossly disfigured by generations of inbreeding.', 'Chris crashes into a carload of other young people, and the group of stranded motorists is soon lost in the woods of West Virginia, where they''re hunted by three cannibalistic mountain men who are grossly disfigured by generations of inbreeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lyxwOg7SdGff79yKCQmJ3AKWSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9902'),
  ('1152108018091625733', 'Wrong Turn', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nancy Nayor, Mike P. Nelson, Tami Kumin', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Charlotte Vega, Adain Bradley, Bill Sage, Emma Dumont, Dylan McTee, Daisy Head, Matthew Modine, Vardaan Arora', 'R', 'Jen and a group of friends set out to hike the Appalachian Trail. Despite warnings to stick to the trail, the hikers stray off course—and cross into land inhabited by The Foundation, a hidden community of mountain dwellers who use deadly means to protect their way of life.', 'Jen and a group of friends set out to hike the Appalachian Trail. Despite warnings to stick to the trail, the hikers stray off course—and cross into land inhabited by The Foundation, a hidden community of mountain dwellers who use deadly means to protect their way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4U1SBHmwHkNA0eHZ2n1CuiC1K1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630586'),
  ('721483983463179274', 'Wrong Turn 2: Dead End', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joe Lynch, Robin Loewen, Ken Shane', 'Turi Meyer, Alfredo Septién', 'Erica Leerhsen, Henry Rollins, Texas Battle, Aleksa Palladino, Daniella Alonso, Steve Braun, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Kimberly Caldwell', 'R', 'Retired military commander Colonel Dale Murphy hosts the simulated post-apocalyptic reality show where participants are challenged to survive a remote West Virginia wasteland. But the show turns into a nightmarish showdown when each realizes they are being hunted by an inbred family of cannibals determined to make them all dinner!', 'Retired military commander Colonel Dale Murphy hosts the simulated post-apocalyptic reality show where participants are challenged to survive a remote West Virginia wasteland. But the show turns into a nightmarish showdown when each realizes they are being hunted by an inbred family of cannibals determined to make them all dinner!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow3IMhTVLryZuCEoQznVTTmFYuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13186'),
  ('232792178347503687', 'Wrong Turn 3: Left for Dead', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Declan O''Brien, Lorenzo Senatore, Todor Chapkanov', 'Connor James Delaney', 'Tom Frederic, Janet Montgomery, Louise Cliffe, Jack Gordon, Emma Clifford, Todd Jensen, Gil Kolirin, Charles Venn', 'NR', 'A group of people find themselves trapped in the backwoods of West Virginia, fighting for their lives against a group of vicious and horribly disfigured inbred cannibals.', 'A group of people find themselves trapped in the backwoods of West Virginia, fighting for their lives against a group of vicious and horribly disfigured inbred cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84s4LMWuGbm4xPWW5PSbHyQhh33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23823'),
  ('304344796112881974', 'Wrong Turn 4: Bloody Beginnings', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Declan O''Brien, Michael Marshall, Megan Basaraba', 'Declan O''Brien', 'Jennifer Pudavick, Tenika Davis, Terra Vnesa, Kristen Harris, Kaitlyn Leeb, Dean Armstrong, Ali Tataryn, Victor Zinck, Jr.', 'R', 'A group of friends take refuge in a deserted sanatorium after they are left stranded in a snowstorm. Later, the place becomes a death trap when man-eating cannibals surround them.', 'A group of friends take refuge in a deserted sanatorium after they are left stranded in a snowstorm. Later, the place becomes a death trap when man-eating cannibals surround them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1vD4GY7tlT420KJ3xWTzyQ2Aa9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71672'),
  ('528639669105267268', 'Wrong Turn 5: Bloodlines', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Declan O''Brien, Emil Topuzov, Natasha Roth', 'Declan O''Brien', 'Camilla Arfwedson, Doug Bradley, Borisa Tyutyundzhieva, Roxanne McKee, Paul Luebke, Rosie Holden, Simon Ginty, Amy Lennox', 'R', 'A small West Virginia town is hosting the legendary Mountain Man Festival on Halloween, where throngs of costumed party goers gather for a wild night of music and mischief. But an inbred family of hillbilly cannibals kill the fun when they trick and treat themselves to a group of visiting college students.', 'A small West Virginia town is hosting the legendary Mountain Man Festival on Halloween, where throngs of costumed party goers gather for a wild night of music and mischief. But an inbred family of hillbilly cannibals kill the fun when they trick and treat themselves to a group of visiting college students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fABep8FSRpeo8Ea4j3rfnoVgkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125509'),
  ('391023698793250514', 'Wrong Turn 6: Last Resort', 2014, 'Horror', 'Valeri Milev, Martin Chichov, Stanimir Stamatov', 'Frank H. Woodward', 'Anthony Ilott, Aqueela Zoll, Sadie Katz, Chris Jarvis, Joe Gaminara, Roxanne Pallett, Rollo Skinner, Billy Ashworth', 'R', 'A sudden and mysterious inheritance brings Danny and his friends to Hobb Springs, a forgotten resort deep in the West Virginia hills. Hobb Springs is being looked after under the watchful care of Jackson and Sally, a socially awkward couple who introduce Danny to the long lost family he''s never known. A clan by the name of Hillicker. But soon Danny learns his relatives have a different way of living, that for generations, the Hillickers have observed ancient traditions rooted in cannibalism and other taboo rituals.', 'A sudden and mysterious inheritance brings Danny and his friends to Hobb Springs, a forgotten resort deep in the West Virginia hills. Hobb Springs is being looked after under the watchful care of Jackson and Sally, a socially awkward couple who introduce Danny to the long lost family he''s never known. A clan by the name of Hillicker. But soon Danny learns his relatives have a different way of living, that for generations, the Hillickers have observed ancient traditions rooted in cannibalism and other taboo rituals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cV1biK7jlHVXlQ7ErYe5MUSBGcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259072'),
  ('172146765413053477', 'Wrong Turn at Tahoe', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Franck Khalfoun, Christopher LaVasseur', 'Eddie Nickerson', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Harvey Keitel, Alex Meneses, Miguel Ferrer, Louis Mandylor, Genevieve Alexandra, Leonor Varela, Michael Sean Tighe', 'R', 'A small-time crime boss kills a drug dealer without realizing that the drug dealer works for the biggest crime boss in the country.', 'A small-time crime boss kills a drug dealer without realizing that the drug dealer works for the biggest crime boss in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0n2vU0Apv4xpDJMVVDbmADl5Lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25594'),
  ('1075520002925928655', 'Wrongfully Accused', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Pat Proft, Glen MacPherson, Pete Whyte', 'Pat Proft', 'Leslie Nielsen, Richard Crenna, Kelly LeBrock, Melinda McGraw, Aaron Pearl, Leslie Jones, Ben Immanuel, Sandra Bernhard', 'PG-13', 'Ryan Harrison, a violin god, superstar and sex symbol does not want to cheat on sexy Lauren Goodhue''s husband with her. Mr. Goodhue is found murdered and Ryan suddenly finds himself being the main suspect. After being sentenced to death he manages to flee while being transferred to his execution site. Now, all the world is after him as he stumbles from one unfortunate incident to the next in order to prove himself innocent - by finding a mysterious one-eyed, one-armed, one-legged man...', 'Ryan Harrison, a violin god, superstar and sex symbol does not want to cheat on sexy Lauren Goodhue''s husband with her. Mr. Goodhue is found murdered and Ryan suddenly finds himself being the main suspect. After being sentenced to death he manages to flee while being transferred to his execution site. Now, all the world is after him as he stumbles from one unfortunate incident to the next in order to prove himself innocent - by finding a mysterious one-eyed, one-armed, one-legged man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FG3aldS4eVD4baKwmAi9P8kdRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9417'),
  ('958765551232645665', 'WTF', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Raphaël Frydman', 'Raphaël Frydman', 'Rémi Gaillard, Nicole Ferroni, Alban Ivanov, Franc Bruneau, Sylvain Katan, Quentin Jodar, Grégory Nardela, Patrick Raynal', null, 'Rémi Gaillard is the real character of the World network, troll, provocateur, one of the biggest-selling comic actor in Europe. One and a half milliards of viewing and millions of fans. A day came, and he decided to steady down: got married, settled down on work on a parking place, promised a pregnant wife, that also «goes away to the decree» and gives up the pranks. But how to deafen talent and disorderly conduct of fantasy?. Fans can not assume his care. Gaillard returns.', 'Rémi Gaillard is the real character of the World network, troll, provocateur, one of the biggest-selling comic actor in Europe. One and a half milliards of viewing and millions of fans. A day came, and he decided to steady down: got married, settled down on work on a parking place, promised a pregnant wife, that also «goes away to the decree» and gives up the pranks. But how to deafen talent and disorderly conduct of fantasy?. Fans can not assume his care. Gaillard returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahhKJctk2MzeA6tXh2u5trzzzA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252773'),
  ('1106231642175106478', 'Wu Dang', 2012, 'Action, Adventure', 'Patrick Leung Pak-Kin, Liu Fang', 'Chan Hon', 'Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Yang Mi, Josie Xu Jiao, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Dennis To Yu-Hang, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Henry Fong Ping, Shaun Tam Chun-Yin', null, 'In early Republican China, rumors were going around about the treasure in Wudang Mountain. An American conspirator took his well-trained kung fu daughter to Wudang by sponsoring a Taoist martial arts competition, to steal the treasure. Out of expectation, a disciple represented Wudang to compete with other martial arts masters for the championship. During the competition, resentment incurred against different parties, the relationship became complicated, a Korean female Tai Chi descendant fell in love with the American conspirator and the secret of the treasure had been revealed. The treasure is the key of the magnetic field of Wudang, if it''s stolen, Wudang would be devastated. To protect Wudang, a group of young heroes rallied around to defeat grant masters. It''s the time the long-lost Wudang martial arts returned', 'In early Republican China, rumors were going around about the treasure in Wudang Mountain. An American conspirator took his well-trained kung fu daughter to Wudang by sponsoring a Taoist martial arts competition, to steal the treasure. Out of expectation, a disciple represented Wudang to compete with other martial arts masters for the championship. During the competition, resentment incurred against different parties, the relationship became complicated, a Korean female Tai Chi descendant fell in love with the American conspirator and the secret of the treasure had been revealed. The treasure is the key of the magnetic field of Wudang, if it''s stolen, Wudang would be devastated. To protect Wudang, a group of young heroes rallied around to defeat grant masters. It''s the time the long-lost Wudang martial arts returned', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6gTQhmeqGkbodjXD6R8XqDmf0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120713'),
  ('560700753505031698', 'Wu Yen', 2001, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Johnnie To, Wai Ka-Fai, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Wai Ka-Fai, Ben Wong', 'Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Cecilia Cheung, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Lam Suet, Lung Tin-Sang, Hung Wai-Leung, Cheng Ka-Sang', null, 'Lost in the woods, the Emperor Qi stumbles across local chief Wu Yen, his predestined bride, only to accidentally free a promiscuous fox fairy who promptly falls in love with both of them, changing between man and woman to clumsily woo each, setting the scene for a constantly shifting triangle with the emperor torn between both the fox fairy and Wu Yen and the fox fairy after whichever one will agree to marry her first.', 'Lost in the woods, the Emperor Qi stumbles across local chief Wu Yen, his predestined bride, only to accidentally free a promiscuous fox fairy who promptly falls in love with both of them, changing between man and woman to clumsily woo each, setting the scene for a constantly shifting triangle with the emperor torn between both the fox fairy and Wu Yen and the fox fairy after whichever one will agree to marry her first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy53OOjWiqL6DlDuaTFSIUGm6Bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45417'),
  ('696098687666004110', 'Wuff', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Detlev Buck', null, 'Kostja Ullmann, Emily Cox, Marie Burchard, Johanna Wokalek, Maite Kelly, Frederick Lau, Katharina Thalbach, Judy Winter', null, 'Romantic comedy about the love confusion of four girlfriends, whose lives are properly turned upside down by their four-legged friends. After being abandoned by her boyfriend, Ella adopts a half-breed called Bozer, who jumbled up her everyday life, but also makes her happy again. Cecile, on the other hand, is about to divorce, but the meek four-legged Simpson averts the worst and is also there for the children. Silke works as a dog trainer and knows very well about the animals, but she has her problems with her fellow human beings. She meets former footballer Olli. And also Lulu has met someone, but her acquaintance is a dog lover, while she has a preference for cats.', 'Romantic comedy about the love confusion of four girlfriends, whose lives are properly turned upside down by their four-legged friends. After being abandoned by her boyfriend, Ella adopts a half-breed called Bozer, who jumbled up her everyday life, but also makes her happy again. Cecile, on the other hand, is about to divorce, but the meek four-legged Simpson averts the worst and is also there for the children. Silke works as a dog trainer and knows very well about the animals, but she has her problems with her fellow human beings. She meets former footballer Olli. And also Lulu has met someone, but her acquaintance is a dog lover, while she has a preference for cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olqWsQAt00kKXn0qcNZ3i8VDLdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538057'),
  ('383995892104297101', 'Wunderkinder', 2011, 'Drama, War, Music', 'Roman Nowocien, Marcus O. Rosenmüller', 'Stephen Glantz, Kris Karathomas, Marcus O. Rosenmüller', 'Mathilda Adamik, Elin Kolev, Imogen Burrell, Kai Wiesinger, Catherine Flemming, Gudrun Landgrebe, Konstantin Wecker, John Friedmann', null, 'Three musically talented children look to the future, but their hopes crumble when Germany and Russia enter into war.', 'Three musically talented children look to the future, but their hopes crumble when Germany and Russia enter into war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96DaIP2UX6H0gcsbJLMcTm57LGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103156'),
  ('302012943507316205', 'Wunderland', 2018, 'Action, War, Drama, Thriller', 'Steven Luke, Per Prinz', 'Steven Luke', 'Jeremy Michael Pereira, Tom Berenger, Steven Luke, Aaron Courteau, Cody Fleury, Andrew Stecker', 'PG-13', 'Christmas 1944, The Germans make one final push against the attacking allied armies in the West. Lt. Robert Cappa and his platoon of 2nd Infantry Division soldiers have been ordered to hold a vital road junction against the German aggressors. Cappa and his men must find their faith and strength to stand against their enemy in the epic fight know as "The Battle of The Bulge."', 'Christmas 1944, The Germans make one final push against the attacking allied armies in the West. Lt. Robert Cappa and his platoon of 2nd Infantry Division soldiers have been ordered to hold a vital road junction against the German aggressors. Cappa and his men must find their faith and strength to stand against their enemy in the epic fight know as "The Battle of The Bulge."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WRTtEKVKkCKBJBVGQart22fXap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480465'),
  ('589974943323336448', 'Wunderland', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Sabine Howe, Till Vielrose', null, 'Frederik Braun, Gerrit Braun, Sebastian Drechsler, Gaston Burkhardt', null, 'The train carriages in "Miniatur Wunderland" wind their way for kilometers through blooming landscapes and rocky mountain gorges. With the creation of this magical model universe, twin brothers Frederik and Gerrit Braun have fulfilled their childhood dream of building the largest model railroad in the world. Opened in 2001 in Hamburg''s Speicherstadt warehouse district, the exhibition now stretches from the Elbphilharmonie concert hall to Antarctica and is one of the biggest crowd pullers in Europe, attracting more than 1.5 million visitors a year. This film now brings this fabulous dream world to the big screen for the first time with elaborate Cinemascope footage as a documentary event.', 'The train carriages in "Miniatur Wunderland" wind their way for kilometers through blooming landscapes and rocky mountain gorges. With the creation of this magical model universe, twin brothers Frederik and Gerrit Braun have fulfilled their childhood dream of building the largest model railroad in the world. Opened in 2001 in Hamburg''s Speicherstadt warehouse district, the exhibition now stretches from the Elbphilharmonie concert hall to Antarctica and is one of the biggest crowd pullers in Europe, attracting more than 1.5 million visitors a year. This film now brings this fabulous dream world to the big screen for the first time with elaborate Cinemascope footage as a documentary event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9LfQ7mX2PJeZNrLhyLOJD5BZ2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186103'),
  ('39367015461459601', 'Wunderlich''s World', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dani Levy, Carl-Friedrich Koschnick', 'Dani Levy', 'Katharina Schüttler, Peter Simonischek, Christiane Paul, Hannelore Elsner, Martin Feifel, Steffen Groth, Ernst Wilhelm Rodriguez, Thomas Anders', null, 'Mimi has her hands full. Her son Felix is hyperactive, her ex-husband Johnny is a mess, her father is a chronic gambler. Then Felix signs her up for a Swiss casting show, because Mimi wanted to be a musician originally. So Mimi decides to head for Switzerland, since it could pay all their debts. But then the whole family wants to come...', 'Mimi has her hands full. Her son Felix is hyperactive, her ex-husband Johnny is a mess, her father is a chronic gambler. Then Felix signs her up for a Swiss casting show, because Mimi wanted to be a musician originally. So Mimi decides to head for Switzerland, since it could pay all their debts. But then the whole family wants to come...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53vfD77vMVOakYP2eQQgvPbZYX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402928'),
  ('1008146051685636039', 'Wunderschön', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Karoline Herfurth, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Lena Stahl, Karoline Herfurth, Monika Fäßler', 'Karoline Herfurth, Nora Tschirner, Martina Gedeck, Emilia Schüle, Dilara Aylin Ziem, Joachim Król, Friedrich Mücke, Maximilian Brückner', null, 'After two pregnancies, Sonja struggles with her body feeling and the relationship with her husband Milan. Frauke, shortly before her 60th birthday, shares this fate and feels almost invisible to her husband. Daughter Julie is working on her modeling career, but a flaw is discovered on her body again and again ...', 'After two pregnancies, Sonja struggles with her body feeling and the relationship with her husband Milan. Frauke, shortly before her 60th birthday, shares this fate and feels almost invisible to her husband. Daughter Julie is working on her modeling career, but a flaw is discovered on her body again and again ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeHjNQw3lOozlZyAtPW6mEhNEH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750466'),
  ('952648256820566919', 'WUSA', 1970, 'Drama', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Richard Moore', 'Robert Stone', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Anthony Perkins, Laurence Harvey, Don Gordon, Pat Hingle, Bruce Cabot, Cloris Leachman', 'PG-13', 'Rheinhardt, a cynical drifter, gets a job as an announcer for right-wing radio station WUSA in New Orleans. Rheinhardt is content to parrot WUSA''s reactionary editorial stance on the air, even if he doesn''t agree with it. Rheinhardt finds his cynical detachment challenged by a lady friend, Geraldine, and by Rainey, a neighbour and troubled idealist who becomes aware of WUSA''s sinister, hidden purpose. And when events start spinning out of control, even Rheinhardt finds he must take a stand.', 'Rheinhardt, a cynical drifter, gets a job as an announcer for right-wing radio station WUSA in New Orleans. Rheinhardt is content to parrot WUSA''s reactionary editorial stance on the air, even if he doesn''t agree with it. Rheinhardt finds his cynical detachment challenged by a lady friend, Geraldine, and by Rainey, a neighbour and troubled idealist who becomes aware of WUSA''s sinister, hidden purpose. And when events start spinning out of control, even Rheinhardt finds he must take a stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qR3xr9SqlJnSMUy1SjMFWGWzKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49411'),
  ('948309066471889072', 'Wushu', 2008, 'Drama, Action', 'Antony Szeto, Guo Yu-Dan, Dennis Chan Kwok-San', 'Lau Ho-Leung', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Liu Fengchao, Wang Wenjie, Wang Xichao, Mao Junjie, Max Zhang, Tie Nan, He Sirong', null, 'A group of Wushu students stumble into a child kidnapping ring run by an alumnus.', 'A group of Wushu students stumble into a child kidnapping ring run by an alumnus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xims8UJUe91CPnwobdNwpy1kIMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16687'),
  ('851791748984455265', 'Wuthering Heights', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Wyler, Gregg Toland, Walter Mayo', 'Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur', 'Merle Oberon, Laurence Olivier, David Niven, Flora Robson, Donald Crisp, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Hugh Williams, Leo G. Carroll', 'NR', 'Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.', 'Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwHdSzXwlUFAcYGcFutKcPcX2OW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3084'),
  ('668520001761051867', 'Wuthering Heights', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Buñuel, Agustín Jiménez, Ignacio Villareal', null, 'Irasema Dilián, Jorge Mistral, Lilia Prado, Ernesto Alonso, Francisco Reiguera, Hortensia Santoveña, Jaime González Quiñones, Luis Aceves Castañeda', null, 'In 19th-century Mexico, young orphan Alejandro is adopted by the wealthy, landowning Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Catalina. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Catalina, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Eduardo, a man of means who befits her stature. Alejandro vows to win her back.', 'In 19th-century Mexico, young orphan Alejandro is adopted by the wealthy, landowning Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Catalina. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Catalina, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Eduardo, a man of means who befits her stature. Alejandro vows to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1u2bDkzfzRgbwdJ8njHXdCchC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43328'),
