  ('48629591018231993', 'X', 2002, 'Thriller', 'Luis Marías', 'Luis Marías', 'Antonio Resines, Esperanza Roy, María Adánez, Manuel Galiana, Marta Belaustegui, Pere Arquillué, Antonio Dechent, Paco Hidalgo', null, 'The film tells the obsession of a policeman to find out who is the murderer of a young homosexual. The character played by Antonio Resines, is a cop who gets up in a strange house with a huge hangover and has no memory of what he did last night, when the homosexual was killed. He is the prime suspect.', 'The film tells the obsession of a policeman to find out who is the murderer of a young homosexual. The character played by Antonio Resines, is a cop who gets up in a strange house with a huge hangover and has no memory of what he did last night, when the homosexual was killed. He is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4F7QeyeCEvZR8FSYITD1ftF7cM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71801'),
  ('604108238655259767', 'X', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Jon Hewitt', 'Belinda McClory, Jon Hewitt', 'Viva Bianca, Hanna Mangan Lawrence, Peter Docker, Stephen Phillips, Eamon Farren, Belinda McClory, Darren Moss, Freya Tingley', 'NR', 'A veteran call girl and a runaway prostitute witness a murder which sends them on an out-of-control roller coaster ride through the twilight zone of sex-for-sale.', 'A veteran call girl and a runaway prostitute witness a murder which sends them on an out-of-control roller coaster ride through the twilight zone of sex-for-sale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvU6uTwSpMpitM6mnuYXb1LgxxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73454'),
