  ('559118585519171344', 'X', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tomas Deckaj, Sophie Massey Broadbery, Ant Davies', 'Ti West', 'Mia Goth, Jenna Ortega, Brittany Snow, Kid Cudi, Martin Henderson, Owen Campbell, Stephen Ure, James Gaylyn', 'R', 'In 1979, a group of young filmmakers set out to make an adult film in rural Texas, but when their reclusive, elderly hosts catch them in the act, the cast find themselves fighting for their lives.', 'In 1979, a group of young filmmakers set out to make an adult film in rural Texas, but when their reclusive, elderly hosts catch them in the act, the cast find themselves fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lopZSVtXzhFY603E9OqF7O1YKsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760104'),
