  ('55786696204952493', 'X312 - Flight to Hell', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino', 'Artur Brauner, Jesús Franco', 'Thomas Hunter, Gila von Weitershausen, Hans Hass Jr., Fernando Sancho, Esperanza Roy, Ewa Strömberg, Siegfried Schürenberg, Howard Vernon', null, 'A plane leaving the turmoil of a South American country in the midst of a revolution crash-lands in the Amazon jungle in Brazil. Among the passengers are a corrupt banker who is smuggling diamonds out of the country, a reporter, a mysterious beauty and a shady flight attendant. The survivors find themselves up against not only the dangers of the jungle itself but a band of headhunters and a gang of revolutionaries who are looking for the smuggled diamonds.', 'A plane leaving the turmoil of a South American country in the midst of a revolution crash-lands in the Amazon jungle in Brazil. Among the passengers are a corrupt banker who is smuggling diamonds out of the country, a reporter, a mysterious beauty and a shady flight attendant. The survivors find themselves up against not only the dangers of the jungle itself but a band of headhunters and a gang of revolutionaries who are looking for the smuggled diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU0ZzAfG7RemhgpSdmQ5nCxI6Lf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121980'),
  ('813422455146535114', 'Xala', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Ousmane Sembène, Orlando ''Cachaíto'' López, Farba Seck', 'Ousmane Sembène', 'Thierno Leye, Myriam Niang, Seune Samb, Fatim Diagne, Younousse Sèye, Mustapha Ture, Iliamane Sagna, Dieynaba Niang', null, 'A rich businessman in Senegal is cursed with crippling erectile dysfunction upon the day of his marriage to his third wife; the only cure is brutal public humiliation.', 'A rich businessman in Senegal is cursed with crippling erectile dysfunction upon the day of his marriage to his third wife; the only cure is brutal public humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bx6Wceii1OZf0e3qp4EurUFoK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76636'),
  ('255050440040464561', 'Xanadu', 1980, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Robert Greenwald, Victor J. Kemper, Dan Kolsrud', 'Richard Christian Danus, Marc Reid Rubel, Edwin Blum', 'Olivia Newton-John, Gene Kelly, Michael Beck, James Sloyan, Katie Hanley, Fred McCarren, Ren Woods, Dimitra Arliss', 'PG', 'Kira, a Greek muse incarnated on Earth to inspire people, helps Dan McGuire and an artist named Sonny Malone to meet. She inspires them to build a huge disco roller rink called Xanadu.', 'Kira, a Greek muse incarnated on Earth to inspire people, helps Dan McGuire and an artist named Sonny Malone to meet. She inspires them to build a huge disco roller rink called Xanadu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r1cHzhksHO3u1QS1Ct9mId7kQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15668'),
  ('380213472732088088', 'Xander De Rycke: Houdt het voor bekeken 2025', 2026, 'Comedy', null, 'Xander De Rycke', 'Joel McHale, Arjen Lubach, Xander De Rycke', null, 'Nearly a decade ago, Xander De Rycke took to the stage armed with nothing more than a dozen pages of jokes and a slideshow filled with screenshots. What began as a small internet show grew, thanks to a loyal fanbase, into a phenomenon that managed to fill nine Lotto Arenas. Today, the show is known as the most spectacular end-of-year comedy conference in Flanders. In 2025, that success reaches its peak in the country’s largest venue: the AFAS Dome in Antwerp. Not just the 2025 edition of ‘Houdt het voor bekeken’, but a true celebration of everything that has made ten years of #HHVB what it is. Expect a barrage of sharp jokes, affectionate nods to past shows, and of course contributions from both friends and “frenemies”.', 'Nearly a decade ago, Xander De Rycke took to the stage armed with nothing more than a dozen pages of jokes and a slideshow filled with screenshots. What began as a small internet show grew, thanks to a loyal fanbase, into a phenomenon that managed to fill nine Lotto Arenas. Today, the show is known as the most spectacular end-of-year comedy conference in Flanders. In 2025, that success reaches its peak in the country’s largest venue: the AFAS Dome in Antwerp. Not just the 2025 edition of ‘Houdt het voor bekeken’, but a true celebration of everything that has made ten years of #HHVB what it is. Expect a barrage of sharp jokes, affectionate nods to past shows, and of course contributions from both friends and “frenemies”.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fm8I8IuklqS06b96chk2Qsq9JRdm.jpg', 'plex:movie:xander-de-rycke-houdt-het-voor-bekeken-2025'),
  ('570375353387575452', 'Xaver und sein außerirdischer Freund', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Werner Possardt', 'Werner Possardt', 'Carlos Pavlidis, Gabi Fischer, Marinus Brand, Heinz-Josef Braun, Josef Thalmaier, Rupert Seidl', null, 'Xaver is a rural rube who comes across a disabled spaceship in this light comedy. Alois is the alien who is befriended by Xaver and his busty sweetheart. Alois is disguised as just another Alpine tourist as the three search for a fuel pump to fix the engine of the spacecraft.', 'Xaver is a rural rube who comes across a disabled spaceship in this light comedy. Alois is the alien who is befriended by Xaver and his busty sweetheart. Alois is disguised as just another Alpine tourist as the three search for a fuel pump to fix the engine of the spacecraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SYMG2yZAnBPivK9PSSgi8RWyt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6397'),
  ('921103110260719012', 'Xavier', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ricky Mastro', 'Eduardo Mattos, Ricky Mastro', 'André Guerreiro Lopes, Gregorio Musatti, Netuno Trindade, Rodrigo Audi, Alessa Previdelli, Natan Felix Matiusso, Gustavo Henrique da Cunha Assumpção, Gabriel Lisbôa dos Santos', null, 'Nicolas notices that his eleven year old son Xavier spends his time not only playing drums, but also paying attention to a certain type of boys.', 'Nicolas notices that his eleven year old son Xavier spends his time not only playing drums, but also paying attention to a certain type of boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSnzoWbFD1SVccfxM3KOZvAadWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388763'),
  ('925956467019581906', 'Xchange', 2001, 'Science Fiction', 'Allan Moyle, Pierre Gill', 'Léopold St-Pierre, Christopher Pelham', 'Stephen Baldwin, Pascale Bussières, Kim Coates, Kyle MacLachlan, Tom Rack, Arnold Pinnock, Judah Katz, Sean Devine', 'R', 'In the near future, a company called Xchange owns a mind transference technology that enables instantaneous travel by swapping bodies with someone at the destination. A member of the privileged corporate class ("Corpie") Xchanging for the first time unwittingly switches bodies with a terrorist. Forced to hide in a limited life span cloned body with just 2 days remaining, he races against time to stop the terrorist and regain his body.', 'In the near future, a company called Xchange owns a mind transference technology that enables instantaneous travel by swapping bodies with someone at the destination. A member of the privileged corporate class ("Corpie") Xchanging for the first time unwittingly switches bodies with a terrorist. Forced to hide in a limited life span cloned body with just 2 days remaining, he races against time to stop the terrorist and regain his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awEsQWTKi0yTfzFjrNPH4BDzn7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26446'),
  ('963245819962369749', 'Xcuse Me', 2003, 'Comedy', 'N. Chandra', null, 'Sharman Joshi, Sahil Khan, Snehal Dabi, Sudhir Dalvi, Mushtaq Khan, Monica Patel, Jaya Seal Ghosh, Shashi Sharma', null, 'Bantu and Chantu are unemployed, and are not able to get any jobs due to lack of experience. They come across an advertisement for a hotel management program in Goa, and make their way there. Once there, they hoodwink the trainer by posing as the nephew of the owner of the hotel, and thus enroll themselves in the training course. In the course of the program, they expose several employees and guests as cheats, earning their wrath but also the admiration of the two daughters of the hotel owners. Things turn sore for the two when the guests and former employees get together to avenge their humiliation.', 'Bantu and Chantu are unemployed, and are not able to get any jobs due to lack of experience. They come across an advertisement for a hotel management program in Goa, and make their way there. Once there, they hoodwink the trainer by posing as the nephew of the owner of the hotel, and thus enroll themselves in the training course. In the course of the program, they expose several employees and guests as cheats, earning their wrath but also the admiration of the two daughters of the hotel owners. Things turn sore for the two when the guests and former employees get together to avenge their humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DYhOlXfYyNs4e3LufsnnuAdqs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48244'),
  ('990173084537564386', 'Xenia', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Panos H. Koutras, Stavros Liokalos, Hélène Louvart', 'Panagiotis Evangelidis, Panos H. Koutras', 'Kostas Nikouli, Nikos Gelia, Yannis Stankoglou, Marissa Triantafyllidou, Aggelos Papadimitriou, Romanna Lobats, Patty Pravo, Menelas', null, 'Strangers in their own birthplace, 16-year-old Danny and 18-year-old Odysseus cross the entire country in search of their Greek father, after their Albanian mother passes away.', 'Strangers in their own birthplace, 16-year-old Danny and 18-year-old Odysseus cross the entire country in search of their Greek father, after their Albanian mother passes away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plCXgcDPlxo07ZQDKTNWw7gfOZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266061'),
  ('672990596495052565', 'Xeno', 2025, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Loren Oates, Paul Marschall', 'Matthew Loren Oates', 'Lulu Wilson, Wrenn Schmidt, Trae Romano, Omari Hardwick, Paul Schneider, Josh Cooke, Ron Roggé, Garrett Vander Leun', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl develops an otherworldly bond with an alien after it crash-lands in the desert. As government agents close in, she must protect her new friend, while uncovering a secret that could change the fate of both their worlds.', 'A teenage girl develops an otherworldly bond with an alien after it crash-lands in the desert. As government agents close in, she must protect her new friend, while uncovering a secret that could change the fate of both their worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXJD04oDre4ZiW6CapzBuJyyp4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119377'),
  ('1032802266402494515', 'Xenogenesis', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'James Cameron, Randall Frakes', 'Randall Frakes, James Cameron', 'William Wisher, Margaret Undiel', null, 'A woman and an engineered man are sent in a gigantic sentient starship to search space for a place to start a new life cycle. Raj decides to take a look around the ship. He comes across a gigantic robotic cleaner. Combat ensues.', 'A woman and an engineered man are sent in a gigantic sentient starship to search space for a place to start a new life cycle. Raj decides to take a look around the ship. He comes across a gigantic robotic cleaner. Combat ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvHVoRhnZRCCYPKLW0KjCpcQRVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25639'),
  ('1119325666361637931', 'Xica', 1976, 'History, Drama, Comedy', 'Carlos Diegues, José Medeiros, Paulo Sérgio de Almeida', 'Carlos Diegues, Antonio Callado', 'Zezé Motta, Walmor Chagas, Altair Lima, Elke Maravilha, Stepan Nercessian, Rodolfo Arena, José Wilker, Marcus Vinícius', null, 'The romanced story of Xica da Silva, a slave that used her "feminine atributes" in order to get power.', 'The romanced story of Xica da Silva, a slave that used her "feminine atributes" in order to get power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhy28j9WkVBxDdyKqSSg716OUEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238334'),
  ('824907417736810391', 'Xico''s Journey', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Eric Cabello', 'Enrique Renteria', 'Pablo Gama Iturrarán, Verónica Álvarez, Luis Ángel Jaramillo, Lila Downs, Elena Poniatowska, Verónica Castro, Enrique Guzmán, Alex Lora', 'NR', 'The peace of a small town is endangered when a corporation wants to destroy the mountain that protects them. A girl named Copi and her best friend Xico, a Xoloitzcuintle dog, will go into the mountains to try to save the town.', 'The peace of a small town is endangered when a corporation wants to destroy the mountain that protects them. A girl named Copi and her best friend Xico, a Xoloitzcuintle dog, will go into the mountains to try to save the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8ZyfUC0THygJkVoO2J7NxsdPI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749618'),
  ('508755749690571380', 'Xingu', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Cao Hamburger, Adriano Goldman, Márcia Faria', 'Chris Riera', 'João Miguel, Felipe Camargo, Caio Blat, Maiarim Kaiabi, Awakari Tumã Kaiabi, Adana Kambeba, Tapaié Waurá, Totomai Yawalapiti', null, 'Three brothers embark on a journey that begins with a kinship with Brazil''s indigenous tribes, to their creation of South America''s largest national park.', 'Three brothers embark on a journey that begins with a kinship with Brazil''s indigenous tribes, to their creation of South America''s largest national park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z41DkjNycIZ5xRMsRJRO6g06rv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107203'),
  ('1034349331294103197', 'Xiu Xiu: The Sent-Down Girl', 1998, 'Drama', 'Joan Chen, Lü Yue, Michael Chin', 'Joan Chen', 'Li Xiaolu, Lopsang, Zheng Qian, Lü Yue, Gao Jie, Li Zhizhi, Lü Zhong, Qiao Qian', null, 'Young teen girl Xiu Xiu is sent away to a remote corner of the Sichuan steppes for manual labor in 1975 (sending young people to there was a part of Cultural Revolution in China). A year later, she agrees to go to even more remote spot with a Tibetan saddle tramp Lao Jin to learn horse herding.', 'Young teen girl Xiu Xiu is sent away to a remote corner of the Sichuan steppes for manual labor in 1975 (sending young people to there was a part of Cultural Revolution in China). A year later, she agrees to go to even more remote spot with a Tibetan saddle tramp Lao Jin to learn horse herding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f60ZzxvcNjQG1aXomXuKWEzS2pP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33194'),
  ('492790330165388876', 'XOXO', 2016, 'Music, Drama', 'Christopher Louie, Damián Acevedo', 'Dylan Meyer', 'Sarah Hyland, Hayley Kiyoko, Chris D''Elia, Graham Phillips, LaMonica Garrett, Ryan Hansen, Ione Skye, Ian Anthony Dale', null, 'XOXO follows six strangers whose lives collide in one frenetic, dream-chasing, hopelessly romantic night.', 'XOXO follows six strangers whose lives collide in one frenetic, dream-chasing, hopelessly romantic night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hbTuc8Lbw7N8RwMOc9bjAcSjuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352492'),
  ('493137585418464147', 'XTC Just Don''t Do It', 2006, 'Family, Drama, Crime', 'Maria Peters, Hein Groot, Peter De Bont', 'Maria Peters', 'Matthijs van de Sande Bakhuyzen, Sem Veeger, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Jim Bakkum, Tommie Venneker, Tessa Schram, Juliann Ubbergen, Melody Klaver', null, 'Melissa is a 15-year-old girl who loves to dance. Her parents think she is taking classes in classical ballet, but once at the dance school she devotes herself to the hip-hop dance classes. Melissa is good friends with Jordi and he is very happy for Melissa when she is asked to dance in the music video of the famous rapper Brainpower. But because of bad influences, her life becomes a nightmare. Until her real friends decide to get her out of there.', 'Melissa is a 15-year-old girl who loves to dance. Her parents think she is taking classes in classical ballet, but once at the dance school she devotes herself to the hip-hop dance classes. Melissa is good friends with Jordi and he is very happy for Melissa when she is asked to dance in the music video of the famous rapper Brainpower. But because of bad influences, her life becomes a nightmare. Until her real friends decide to get her out of there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCrdAWHHfRDbOyaTtpzLC8mZa5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28011'),
  ('964595059903786705', 'Xtreme', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Daniel Benmayor', 'Iván Ledesma', 'Óscar Jaenada, Teo García, Óscar Casas, Andrea Duro, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Alberto Jo Lee, Luis Zahera, Juan Diego', 'NR', 'Two years after the murder of his son and father, a retired hitman sets in motion a carefully crafted revenge plan against the killer: his own brother.', 'Two years after the murder of his son and father, a retired hitman sets in motion a carefully crafted revenge plan against the killer: his own brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwUhVcDeMYYeu8fq5q1OPOoSbZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726429'),
  ('556406665391705407', 'Xtro', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Harry Bromley Davenport, John Metcalfe, Jake Wright', 'Robert Smith, Iain Cassie', 'Philip Sayer, Bernice Stegers, Danny Brainin, Maryam D''Abo, Simon Nash, Peter Mandell, David Cardy, Anna Wing', 'R', 'Tony''s father Sam, abducted by aliens three years earlier, returns to earth and seeks out his wife and son, but Rachel has since been living with Joe and the reunion is awkward. Joe doesn''t trust Sam, and Rachel can''t quite decide what her feelings are for her two men. Sam is not the same as when he left, and he begins affecting Tony in frightening ways.', 'Tony''s father Sam, abducted by aliens three years earlier, returns to earth and seeks out his wife and son, but Rachel has since been living with Joe and the reunion is awkward. Joe doesn''t trust Sam, and Rachel can''t quite decide what her feelings are for her two men. Sam is not the same as when he left, and he begins affecting Tony in frightening ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLaGTdIHIPoIxm0mdPanmLmXDRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25834'),
  ('324101840713272169', 'Xtro 2: The Second Encounter', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Harry Bromley Davenport, Nathaniel Massey, Marion Malone', 'John A. Curtis, Stephen Lister, Robert Smith', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Paul Koslo, Tara Buckman, Jano Frandsen, Nicholas Lea, W.F. Wadden, Rolf Reynolds, Nic Amoroso', 'R', 'An underground government facility is locked down by its A.I.-controlled computer when an alien entity travels through a dimensional portal and threatens the lives of everybody inside.', 'An underground government facility is locked down by its A.I.-controlled computer when an alien entity travels through a dimensional portal and threatens the lives of everybody inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKAViKJOJYwcFYA7SjvTSKwxlvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55952'),
  ('92157294397607366', 'Xtro 3: Watch the Skies', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Harry Bromley Davenport, Irv Goodnoff, Olivia Mears', 'Daryl Haney', 'Sal Landi, Andrew Divoff, Lisa London, J. Marvin Campbell, Douglas Cavanaugh, Robert Culp, Daryl Haney, Jim Hanks', 'R', 'Marines on a deserted island are ordered to defuse bombs, but then an alien creature terrorizes them.', 'Marines on a deserted island are ordered to defuse bombs, but then an alien creature terrorizes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvJYVmHya0WuCOUb04JTKlWbZLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57597'),
  ('1127247861005730884', 'Xuan Zang', 2016, 'History, Drama', 'Huo Jianqi, Sun Ming', 'Zou Jingzhi', 'Huang Xiaoming, Xu Zheng, Bajia Pu, Luo Jin, Tan Kai, Vivian Dawson, Andrew Lin Hoi, Jonathan Kos-Read', null, 'Chinese-Indian historical adventure of Xuan Zang''s seventeen-year overland journey to India during the Tang dynasty in the seventh century.', 'Chinese-Indian historical adventure of Xuan Zang''s seventeen-year overland journey to India during the Tang dynasty in the seventh century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5tAP82x7Zi1cJyIB5IengQI1z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403580'),
  ('498058079423017674', 'Xuxa Abracadabra', 2003, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Moacyr Góes, Edgar Moura, Cris D''amato', 'Flávio de Souza', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Brunno Abrahão, Maria Mariana Azevedo, Márcio Garcia, Leandro Hassum, Tom Cavalcante, Talita Castro, Cláudio Heinrich', null, 'Sofia goes to her cousin Matheus''s house to take care of his two children, Júlia and Lucas, while he goes to a party. She finds a magical book, which transports them to the Magic Forest, where they meet fairytale characters such as Pinocchio and Little Red Riding Hood. But their presence starts interfering with the original stories, and so Matheus tries to bring them back to the real world.', 'Sofia goes to her cousin Matheus''s house to take care of his two children, Júlia and Lucas, while he goes to a party. She finds a magical book, which transports them to the Magic Forest, where they meet fairytale characters such as Pinocchio and Little Red Riding Hood. But their presence starts interfering with the original stories, and so Matheus tries to bring them back to the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu4YDeNXGWO4nRutI0aEG0TnSV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84761'),
  ('178977606132981932', 'Xuxa and the Elves', 2001, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Rogério Gomes, Paulo Sérgio de Almeida', 'Vivian Perl, Wagner de Assis', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Gugu Liberato, Guilherme Karan, Angélica, Wanessa Camargo, Ana Maria Braga, Luciano Huck, Tadeu Mello', null, 'Kira is a botanist with magical abilities, though the origins of her powers remain unknown to her. Her life takes an unexpected turn when her friend Nanda discovers an elf named Damiz trapped in her room. They soon learn that Damiz is the prince of the elves and has been captured by Gorgon, a greedy executive who seeks to purchase the house where Nanda’s family lives. In order to help defeat Gorgon, Kira decides to venture into the world of the elves, where she uncovers hidden secrets about her past.', 'Kira is a botanist with magical abilities, though the origins of her powers remain unknown to her. Her life takes an unexpected turn when her friend Nanda discovers an elf named Damiz trapped in her room. They soon learn that Damiz is the prince of the elves and has been captured by Gorgon, a greedy executive who seeks to purchase the house where Nanda’s family lives. In order to help defeat Gorgon, Kira decides to venture into the world of the elves, where she uncovers hidden secrets about her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v69LPA006babc7fS12PT2fvEAnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84751'),
  ('747005821046885747', 'Xuxa and the Elves 2: The Road of The Fairies', 2002, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Rogério Gomes, Paulo Sérgio de Almeida', 'Vivian Perl, Wagner de Assis', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Luciano Szafir, Debby Lagranha, Maria Mariana Azevedo, Brunno Abrahão, Thainá Medeiros, Deborah Secco, Thiago Fragoso', null, 'Kira, a botanist who is also the daughter of elves, must fight the evil wicked witch Algaz. In her quest, Kira will be helped by Epifania, agood witch, elf Daphnis and even Queen Dara, the fairy mother.', 'Kira, a botanist who is also the daughter of elves, must fight the evil wicked witch Algaz. In her quest, Kira will be helped by Epifania, agood witch, elf Daphnis and even Queen Dara, the fairy mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwiUW35R0NXLA9sGUg5MW9Veomp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84756'),
  ('1134338083085205969', 'Xuxa and the Mystery of the Little Ugly Princess', 2009, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Tizuka Yamasaki, André Horta', 'Gabriela Amaral Almeida', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Sasha Meneghel, Luciano Szafir, Samantha Schmütz, Dani Valente, Angélica, Lavínia Vlasak, Simone Soares', null, 'Based on the book O Fantástico Mistério de Feiurinha, the story combines real world and fantasy, dream and determination, with a surprising end, even for a fairy tale. The movie shows the fight of the fairy tale characters, now adults, who come together to recover the fable of the Little Ugly Princess, a beautiful Princess with a strange name, which only makes sense for those who know her story. The problem is that children and adults have forgotten the story of the Little Ugly Princess, which is as wonderful as other major fables for children. Cinderella brings together other fairy tale characters to meet the writer who keeps, lost in a small notebook, the Little Ugly Princess story.', 'Based on the book O Fantástico Mistério de Feiurinha, the story combines real world and fantasy, dream and determination, with a surprising end, even for a fairy tale. The movie shows the fight of the fairy tale characters, now adults, who come together to recover the fable of the Little Ugly Princess, a beautiful Princess with a strange name, which only makes sense for those who know her story. The problem is that children and adults have forgotten the story of the Little Ugly Princess, which is as wonderful as other major fables for children. Cinderella brings together other fairy tale characters to meet the writer who keeps, lost in a small notebook, the Little Ugly Princess story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52nHfcXZVb3vicfJG0Xf8QgRkE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50642'),
  ('312682045476338200', 'Xuxa and The Treasure of the Lost City', 2004, 'Adventure, Family', 'Moacyr Góes', 'Flávio de Souza', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Marcos Pasquim, Sergio Malheiros, Bruna Marquezine, Peter Brandão, Rocco Pitanga, Milton Gonçalves, Zezé Motta', null, 'Deep in the Amazon rain forest, there is a lost subterranean city. The place was built by Vikings who crossed the Atlantic Ocean and ventured up the Amazon River, and shelters a mysterious treasure. In order to find the secret location, Bárbara and the children Riacho and Manhã will have to face many challenges. Vicious snakes and dangerous pendulum blades are only the beginning of our heroes'' adventures.', 'Deep in the Amazon rain forest, there is a lost subterranean city. The place was built by Vikings who crossed the Atlantic Ocean and ventured up the Amazon River, and shelters a mysterious treasure. In order to find the secret location, Bárbara and the children Riacho and Manhã will have to face many challenges. Vicious snakes and dangerous pendulum blades are only the beginning of our heroes'' adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HgVQnNhzIrZspYVGyuvBGoNR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298298'),
  ('1096097651503355048', 'Xuxa in Girl''s Dream', 2007, 'Family', 'Rudi Lagemann, André Horta, Paulo Souza', 'Flávio de Souza', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Leticia Botelho, Alice Borges, Carlos Casagrande, Dirce Migliaccio, Raquel Bonfante, Ilana Kaplan, Serjão Loroza', null, 'Kika, a math teacher, accidentaly becomes a child again after eating a magic cupcake. This leads her in a journey of self-discovery, while also helping Juju, a 10-year old girl chasing her dreams.', 'Kika, a math teacher, accidentaly becomes a child again after eating a magic cupcake. This leads her in a journey of self-discovery, while also helping Juju, a 10-year old girl chasing her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prDf7Wp4GpTU3w17kqHl0IbqSQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354305'),
  ('153353606542406783', 'Xuxa Popstar', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Paulo Sérgio de Almeida, Tizuka Yamasaki', 'Elizeu Ewald, Vivian Perl, Wagner de Assis', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Luigi Baricelli, Marcos Frota, Deborah Blando, Sílvia Pfeifer, Cláudio Corrêa e Castro, Cláudia Rodrigues, Luiz Salém', null, 'Nick, a famous fashion model, decides to retire and goes back to her home country Brazil, after a briliant international career. She becomes the head executive of Popstar, the modeling agency where she started her career, and has to deal with intrigues, fashion faux pas and a budding online romance with Sunshine, a mysterious online friend.', 'Nick, a famous fashion model, decides to retire and goes back to her home country Brazil, after a briliant international career. She becomes the head executive of Popstar, the modeling agency where she started her career, and has to deal with intrigues, fashion faux pas and a budding online romance with Sunshine, a mysterious online friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYDlVmrzsMHR0A7NMZIOBJlO2dG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84748'),
  ('19814264214013587', 'Xuxa Requebra', 1999, 'Music, Family', 'Tizuka Yamasaki, César Moraes', 'Eliana Fonseca, Evandro Mesquita, Alexandre Roit', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Daniel, Alice Borges, Yara Lins, Luciano Huck, Carla Perez, Ricardo Blat, Serjão Loroza', null, 'Nena, a journalist and former student of the Two Hearts dance academy, tries to stop the school from being sold to a group of drug dealers. She trains a group to win the Requebra dance contest that would give them the necessary money to carry their plans.', 'Nena, a journalist and former student of the Two Hearts dance academy, tries to stop the school from being sold to a group of drug dealers. She trains a group to win the Requebra dance contest that would give them the necessary money to carry their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4CAEG3Fxj5qGry8mRWHXOWIKbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84746'),
