  ('444145207882062642', 'XX: Beautiful Hunter', 1994, 'Thriller', 'Masaru Konuma', 'Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Makiko Kuno, Maiko Kazama, Johnny Ohkura, Katsuo Tokashiki, Kenji Mitamura, Ryohei Takaoka, Kōji Shimizu', null, 'Shion, ruthless assassin for the Magnificat crime syndicate, is as sexy as she is deadly. But when her latest target turns out to be the man she loves, Shion is torn between duty and her heart. Her reluctance marks her for death by Magnificat, and her decision forces her into a life on the run, with her fellow assassins always a step behind.', 'Shion, ruthless assassin for the Magnificat crime syndicate, is as sexy as she is deadly. But when her latest target turns out to be the man she loves, Shion is torn between duty and her heart. Her reluctance marks her for death by Magnificat, and her decision forces her into a life on the run, with her fellow assassins always a step behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flrKX9xx48cHD4mQL5L77zEDiSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274693'),
  ('451214207963951841', 'XX: Beautiful Killing Machine', 1996, 'Crime, Action', 'Takahito Hara', 'Toshiyuki Tabe', 'Rei Natsume, Saiko Isshiki, Shunsuke Kariya, Naomasa Musaka, Kenichi Endo, Tetsu Watanabe, Ito Yozaburo', null, 'Cheryl, a sexy bodyguard, crosses paths with a hit man from her past; she is forced to use all her skills, including the art of seduction, to escape.', 'Cheryl, a sexy bodyguard, crosses paths with a hit man from her past; she is forced to use all her skills, including the art of seduction, to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6afm76L91CoWQO7dOiQatBAx7hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203153'),
  ('359302484657867523', 'XX: Beautiful Prey', 1996, 'Thriller, Action, Romance, Horror', 'Toshiharu Ikeda, Haruhi Taguchi', 'Setsu Yamaguchi, Tamiya Takebashi', 'Ren Osugi, Kei Marimura, Makiko Watanabe, Minori Terada, Atsushi Okuno', null, 'This Japanese thriller finds a sexy policewoman becoming entangled in Japan''s S&M underground while investigating a gruesome murder. Soon, her investigation has led her to a seductive sadist and his equally appealing masochist victim. Falling prey to her suspects'' powerful allure, she struggles to extricate herself from an increasingly torrid affair to solve the mystery she set out to investigate.', 'This Japanese thriller finds a sexy policewoman becoming entangled in Japan''s S&M underground while investigating a gruesome murder. Soon, her investigation has led her to a seductive sadist and his equally appealing masochist victim. Falling prey to her suspects'' powerful allure, she struggles to extricate herself from an increasingly torrid affair to solve the mystery she set out to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awKVJOpMGwGhmJgFHpy243UoRA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202438'),
  ('524782716927769940', 'XX: Beautiful Target', 1995, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Naosuke Kurosawa', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Yoko Natsuki, Takanori Higuchi, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Toru Minegishi, Michihiro Yamanishi, SHIHO', null, 'When beautiful forensic scientist Kyoko and her colleagues fail to uncover clues to the identity of a man who brutally attacks and kills women, she agrees to become the bait to lure the killer into a police snare. But as the murderer remains frustratingly aloof, Kyoko discovers that she will have to risk everything in order to apprehend him. Naosuke Kurosawa directs this steamy thriller.', 'When beautiful forensic scientist Kyoko and her colleagues fail to uncover clues to the identity of a man who brutally attacks and kills women, she agrees to become the bait to lure the killer into a police snare. But as the murderer remains frustratingly aloof, Kyoko discovers that she will have to risk everything in order to apprehend him. Naosuke Kurosawa directs this steamy thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pM4hZ135lNM9KElOusXPgcKg0PG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334673'),
  ('343539892409933721', 'XX/XY', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Austin Chick, Uta Briesewitz', 'Austin Chick', 'Mark Ruffalo, Maya Stange, Kathleen Robertson, Kel O''Neill, Ben Tolpin, William Keeler, Paula Roth, Lee Cobb', 'R', 'Three friends begin a dangerous three-way relationship that spirals out of control, leading to dire consequences that haunt them ten years later.', 'Three friends begin a dangerous three-way relationship that spirals out of control, leading to dire consequences that haunt them ten years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avc51Le5NQbjbzE1PVmLFdi1nVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42383'),
  ('667295479974793884', 'XXL', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Julio Sánchez Valdés, Carlos Suárez', 'Joaquín Andújar', 'Óscar Jaenada, Mónica Godoy, Antonio Dechent, Miriam Díaz-Aroca, Ivan Massagué, Pablo Vega, Juanfra Juárez, Rebeca Valls', 'NR', 'Fali (Oscar Jaenada) has been blessed with an ample gift below the belt. But his extra-large asset ends up getting him into trouble when he agrees to help his friend (Antonio Dechent) get rid of his annoying lover and save his marriage. Fali''s romantic entanglements are all the more hilarious considering the only reason he''s doing it is so he can get the dream car he''s always wanted: a brand-new BMW.', 'Fali (Oscar Jaenada) has been blessed with an ample gift below the belt. But his extra-large asset ends up getting him into trouble when he agrees to help his friend (Antonio Dechent) get rid of his annoying lover and save his marriage. Fali''s romantic entanglements are all the more hilarious considering the only reason he''s doing it is so he can get the dream car he''s always wanted: a brand-new BMW.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB3VdbdLWfdzBTcChOCbMRdVxn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116560'),
  ('804233638046787127', 'xXx', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Rob Cohen, Anthony Caron-Delion, Milena Koubková', 'Rich Wilkes', 'Vin Diesel, Asia Argento, Marton Csokas, Samuel L. Jackson, Michael Roof, Richy Müller, Werner Daehn, Petr Jákl', 'PG-13', 'Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government "recruits" him to go on a mission, he''s not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.', 'Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government "recruits" him to go on a mission, he''s not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7451'),
  ('321397844476772132', 'XXX', 1989, null, 'Askolds Saulītis', null, null, null, 'A grotesque story about life in the Soviet Union during the Awakening. The film uses techniques that were innovative at the time, such as scratching the film stock and coloring frames. The film has been screened at several international film festivals and won the Grand Prix at the Baltic Amateur Film Festival in 1990.', 'A grotesque story about life in the Soviet Union during the Awakening. The film uses techniques that were innovative at the time, such as scratching the film stock and coloring frames. The film has been screened at several international film festivals and won the Grand Prix at the Baltic Amateur Film Festival in 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktmmHhROYPvE5imFHmyddsU713p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806675'),
  ('920877862129223267', 'XXX', 2014, null, 'María José Alós', null, null, null, 'Found footage short film piece conceived through the articulation of appropriated and recycled film fragments to conform a unified sex scene composed by different bodies, ambients and characters. Structuring a begging, a climax and an ending. It is an inquiry into the construction of (self) identity, gender issues, memory, and the process of rewriting/reimagining personal recollections. It was assembled as a chapter for an autobiographical long film called An Appropriated Self-Portrait, edited using a fragmentary structure that relies on a linear narrative.', 'Found footage short film piece conceived through the articulation of appropriated and recycled film fragments to conform a unified sex scene composed by different bodies, ambients and characters. Structuring a begging, a climax and an ending. It is an inquiry into the construction of (self) identity, gender issues, memory, and the process of rewriting/reimagining personal recollections. It was assembled as a chapter for an autobiographical long film called An Appropriated Self-Portrait, edited using a fragmentary structure that relies on a linear narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66spwde2E9gGzivMzJWIMUancLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946620'),
  ('517971369559098436', 'xXx: Return of Xander Cage', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Dan Bradley, D.J. Caruso, Russell Carpenter', 'F. Scott Frazier', 'Vin Diesel, Donnie Yen, Ruby Rose, Deepika Padukone, Toni Collette, Samuel L. Jackson, Ice Cube, Rory McCann', 'PG-13', 'Xander Cage is left for dead after an incident, though he secretly returns to action for a new, tough assignment with his handler Augustus Gibbons.', 'Xander Cage is left for dead after an incident, though he secretly returns to action for a new, tough assignment with his handler Augustus Gibbons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hba8zREJpP1AYhaXgb2oJLQeO0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47971'),
  ('703541757483498085', 'xXx: State of the Union', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Tamahori, David Tattersall, Luke Freeborn', 'Simon Kinberg', 'Ice Cube, Samuel L. Jackson, Willem Dafoe, Scott Speedman, Peter Strauss, Xzibit, Michael Roof, Sunny Mabrey', 'PG-13', 'Darius Stone''s criminal record and extreme sports obsession make him the perfect candidate to be the newest XXX agent. He must save the U.S. government from a deadly conspiracy led by five-star general and Secretary of Defense George Deckert.', 'Darius Stone''s criminal record and extreme sports obsession make him the perfect candidate to be the newest XXX agent. He must save the U.S. government from a deadly conspiracy led by five-star general and Secretary of Defense George Deckert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL9J0N3HJSdZTKRsd5xcE6IzL5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11679'),
  ('288734089186955663', 'xxxHOLiC', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mika Ninagawa, Daisuke Soma', 'Erika Yoshida', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Ko Shibasaki, Hokuto Matsumura, Tina Tamashiro, DAOKO, Serena Motola, Nanase Nishino, Ai Hashimoto', null, 'To be free of his dark visions, Kimihiro Watanuki will work for Dimensional Witch Yūko, a mystical woman quick to help those in a bind—for a fee.', 'To be free of his dark visions, Kimihiro Watanuki will work for Dimensional Witch Yūko, a mystical woman quick to help those in a bind—for a fee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9anVNOiOTBhO1vet1Q31rQR2xtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901410'),
  ('1020514402521162291', 'xxxHOLiC The Movie: A Midsummer Night''s Dream', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Tsutomu Mizushima, Hisashi Ezura, Kazuchika Kise', 'Junichi Fujisaku, Taiki Sakurai', 'Sayaka Ohara, Jun Fukuyama, Kazuya Nakai, Shizuka Itoh, Mika Kikuchi, Hisayo Mochizuki, Miyu Irino, Kazuko Kojima', 'PG-13', 'Invited to a wealthy client''s mansion, time-traveling witch Yuko and her companions arrive to find a group of collectors assembled to participate in a mysterious auction. And the mystery only deepens when the collectors go missing one by one. As more guests disappear and strange occurrences abound, Yuko and her friends realize they must solve the mystery before they vanish as well.', 'Invited to a wealthy client''s mansion, time-traveling witch Yuko and her companions arrive to find a group of collectors assembled to participate in a mysterious auction. And the mystery only deepens when the collectors go missing one by one. As more guests disappear and strange occurrences abound, Yuko and her friends realize they must solve the mystery before they vanish as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzIc4K5QS9F7PAjujmDjSokCS4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38567'),
  ('428818909017564940', 'xxxHolic: Rō', 2010, 'Animation, Mystery', 'Tsutomu Mizushima', 'Nanase Okawa', 'Jun Fukuyama, Sayaka Ohara, Kazuya Nakai, Rina Hidaka, Hisayo Mochizuki, Kazuko Kojima, Mika Kikuchi, Shizuka Itoh', null, 'It has been several years after the events of Shunmuki and Watanuki has become the new proprietor of Yūko''s shop following her death. Domeki has taken a position at a university to study folklore and Kohane has become a student at the same university studying under Domeki. Due to Domeki''s position, a series of events have occurred that requires Watanuki''s services. The episode outlines the process by which Watanuki fulfills the request while presenting changes in many of the characters in the series. The ending theme is "Kaza Nagi" (風なぎ?) by Shikao Suga.', 'It has been several years after the events of Shunmuki and Watanuki has become the new proprietor of Yūko''s shop following her death. Domeki has taken a position at a university to study folklore and Kohane has become a student at the same university studying under Domeki. Due to Domeki''s position, a series of events have occurred that requires Watanuki''s services. The episode outlines the process by which Watanuki fulfills the request while presenting changes in many of the characters in the series. The ending theme is "Kaza Nagi" (風なぎ?) by Shikao Suga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NgbjljesNUFO1Z8CVN2LuWfBfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53269'),
