  ('57637389949050174', 'Yadang: The Snitch', 2025, 'Crime, Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Hwang Byeong-gug, Lee Mo-gae, Lee Seong-hwan', 'Kim Hyo-seok', 'Kang Ha-neul, Yoo Hai-jin, Park Hae-joon, Ryu Kyung-soo, Chae Won-been, You Seong-joo, Kim Keum-soon, Lim Sung-kyun', 'NR', 'Navigating both the criminal underworld and law enforcement agencies, professional snitches called "yadang" provide covert information about the drug world to prosecutors and police. When a drug bust at a party attended by high-profile second-generation VIPs entangles those involved into a dangerous conspiracy, a seasoned yadang must do everything in his power not just to make it out on top, but alive.', 'Navigating both the criminal underworld and law enforcement agencies, professional snitches called "yadang" provide covert information about the drug world to prosecutors and police. When a drug bust at a party attended by high-profile second-generation VIPs entangles those involved into a dangerous conspiracy, a seasoned yadang must do everything in his power not just to make it out on top, but alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7dsDbG8zVWkrkyOhA6ckZXX1uC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137179'),
