  ('432696101329465446', 'Yakari: A Spectacular Journey', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Toby Genkel, Xavier Giacometti', 'Xavier Giacometti', 'Diana Amft, Patrick Bach, Oscar Douieb, Kathleen Renish, Hans Sigl, Tom Trouffier', null, 'With his tribe''s move to follow the migrating bison, Yakari, the little Sioux boy, sets out on his own to follow the trail of Little Thunder, a wild mustang said to be untameable. Travelling far from home and deep into the territory of the terrible cougarskins, Yakari and Little Thunder undertake a great adventure and find their way back home.', 'With his tribe''s move to follow the migrating bison, Yakari, the little Sioux boy, sets out on his own to follow the trail of Little Thunder, a wild mustang said to be untameable. Travelling far from home and deep into the territory of the terrible cougarskins, Yakari and Little Thunder undertake a great adventure and find their way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S0SmnNcEcnUDl0XAX3W2pm5G6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670497'),
