  ('552428855836190430', 'Yakuza Demon', 2003, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike', 'Shigenori Takechi', 'Riki Takeuchi, Mickey Curtis, Kenichi Endo, Renji Ishibashi, Koichi Iwaki, Hiroshi Katsuno, Ryôsuke Miki, Yūta Sone', null, 'Seiji and Yoshifumi are the only members of the Muto branch of the Date Family. The two respect and love their leader, Mr. Muto, like a father and the three share a firm bond. But their fate is sealed when the Family is involved in a conflict. Muto is unable to pay his share of funds for the oncoming battle but tells executives of the Family that he would fight at the front line instead. In the wish to protect Muto, Seiji has him arrested by the police. Ignoring the Family executives'' mocks of "Muto escaped to prison", Seiji prepares for the battle and attacks like a demon on behalf of his boss...', 'Seiji and Yoshifumi are the only members of the Muto branch of the Date Family. The two respect and love their leader, Mr. Muto, like a father and the three share a firm bond. But their fate is sealed when the Family is involved in a conflict. Muto is unable to pay his share of funds for the oncoming battle but tells executives of the Family that he would fight at the front line instead. In the wish to protect Muto, Seiji has him arrested by the police. Ignoring the Family executives'' mocks of "Muto escaped to prison", Seiji prepares for the battle and attacks like a demon on behalf of his boss...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMRpvjLPXLUQ2EMmt4FoTWRT9gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64579'),
  ('740275331970666218', 'Yakuza Graveyard', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tôru Nakajima, Hideo Suzuki', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Tetsuya Watari, Meiko Kaji, Jirô Chiba, Hideo Murota, Takuzō Kawatani, Kin Sugai, Takako Yagi, Masaru Shiga', null, 'A police investigator cracks down on yakuza business, but once he realizes the police are in negotiations with certain factions, he sides with his own syndicate of choice.', 'A police investigator cracks down on yakuza business, but once he realizes the police are in negotiations with certain factions, he sides with his own syndicate of choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bF0YXY1UOEfKphZaz5qWcv2lzhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64578'),
