  ('1016881158258824546', 'Yakuza Princess', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Marina Watson-Wood, Gustavo Hadba, João Londres', 'Fernando Toste, Tubaldini Shelling, Vicente Amorim', 'Masumi, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Eijiro Ozaki, Toshiji Takeshima, Mariko Takai, Kenny Leu, Nicolas Trevijano', 'R', 'In Brazil, Akemi finds out that she''s the heiress to the Yakuza empire. Just after that, her destiny enters a spiral of violence and mystery, where a gaijin (foreigner) who''s been protecting her all this time, Shirô, may have been actually sent to kill her.', 'In Brazil, Akemi finds out that she''s the heiress to the Yakuza empire. Just after that, her destiny enters a spiral of violence and mystery, where a gaijin (foreigner) who''s been protecting her all this time, Shirô, may have been actually sent to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2X0bI2z7Q6u6HJ9NU4KqRqPJ0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661595'),
  ('308277154598991643', 'Yakuza Weapon', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Yudai Yamaguchi, Satoshi Yoshida', 'Ken Ishikawa', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Jun Murakami, Mei Kurokawa, Shingo Tsurumi, Akaji Maro, Takashi Nishina, Akihiko Sai, Arata Yamanaka', null, 'After four years overseas, Shozo returns to Japan to avenge his yakuza boss who was assassinated by his own treacherous top man, Kurawaki. The resulting battle leaves both men severely injured, and Shozo awakens in a mysterious medical facility to find his arm replaced with an M61 Vulcan cannon and his leg replaced with a rocket launcher. Meanwhile, Kurawaki has been fitted with mechanical augmentations of his own. Get ready for the second round.', 'After four years overseas, Shozo returns to Japan to avenge his yakuza boss who was assassinated by his own treacherous top man, Kurawaki. The resulting battle leaves both men severely injured, and Shozo awakens in a mysterious medical facility to find his arm replaced with an M61 Vulcan cannon and his leg replaced with a rocket launcher. Meanwhile, Kurawaki has been fitted with mechanical augmentations of his own. Get ready for the second round.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWOLAVrfbBxLfG1GYJlpZBRseEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83192'),
  ('968995806905456862', 'Yakuza: Like a Dragon', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Hideo Yamamoto, Takashi Miike', 'Seiji Togawa, Masashi Sogo', 'Kazuki Kitamura, Goro Kishitani, Show Aikawa, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Kenichi Endo, Takashi Itō, Haruhiko Kato, Claude Maki', null, 'Former yakuza underling Kazuma Kiryū has recently been released from prison after a lengthy incarceration and is trying to piece his life together and distance himself from his yakuza past. Unfortunately, Kiryū''s problems slowly escalate as he is pursued by a former associate, the baseball-bat-wielding psycho Gorō Majima, who has a grudge to settle with Kiryū.', 'Former yakuza underling Kazuma Kiryū has recently been released from prison after a lengthy incarceration and is trying to piece his life together and distance himself from his yakuza past. Unfortunately, Kiryū''s problems slowly escalate as he is pursued by a former associate, the baseball-bat-wielding psycho Gorō Majima, who has a grudge to settle with Kiryū.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6h0siX2U2bpmWETslk2dANAYWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28796'),
