  ('161531841299883435', 'Yalda', 2020, 'Drama', 'Massoud Bakhshi, Julian Atanassov', 'Massoud Bakhshi', 'Sadaf Asgari, Behnaz Jafari, Babak Karimi, Fereshteh Sadr Orafaee, Forough Ghajebeglou, Zakieh Behbahani, Fereshteh Hosseini, Ramona Shah', null, 'Maryam accidentally killed her husband Nasser and is sentenced to death. The only person who can save her is Mona, Nasser''s daughter. All Mona has to do is appear on a TV show and forgive Maryam. But forgiveness proves difficult when they are forced to relive the past.', 'Maryam accidentally killed her husband Nasser and is sentenced to death. The only person who can save her is Mona, Nasser''s daughter. All Mona has to do is appear on a TV show and forgive Maryam. But forgiveness proves difficult when they are forced to relive the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icr4yFsFkaXNbTNLATAJf88ORAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584356'),
  ('917482357280009007', 'Yamada-kun to 7-nin no Majo (OVA)', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seiki Takuno', null, 'Saori Hayami, Ryota Osaka, Toshiki Masuda, Eri Kitamura', null, 'Shiraishi Urara is the top student in her school. One day, due to an accidental kiss, Urara finds herself in the body of the school delinquent, Yamada Ryuu! In trying to switch back to their own bodies, Urara and Ryuu discover that kissing causes them to switch bodies, which leads to their discovery that there are 7 witches in their school. They soon try to uncover the identities of the 7 witches...', 'Shiraishi Urara is the top student in her school. One day, due to an accidental kiss, Urara finds herself in the body of the school delinquent, Yamada Ryuu! In trying to switch back to their own bodies, Urara and Ryuu discover that kissing causes them to switch bodies, which leads to their discovery that there are 7 witches in their school. They soon try to uncover the identities of the 7 witches...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKDyPxWpZQ05Gg4ZiG2Tsr7eAEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410272'),
  ('621970727893946721', 'Yamadonga', 2007, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'S. S. Rajamouli, K.K. Senthil Kumar', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Vijayendra Prasad', 'N.T. Rama Rao Jr., Priyamani, Mamta Mohandas, Mohan Babu, Brahmanandam, Ali Basha, Jayaprakash Reddy, Raghu Babu', null, 'Raja, an orphaned thief, dies while helping a gang in kidnapping a wealthy heiress, Mahi, in exchange of money. He then lands in Yamlok and fights with Yama, the god of death, to get his life back.', 'Raja, an orphaned thief, dies while helping a gang in kidnapping a wealthy heiress, Mahi, in exchange of money. He then lands in Yamlok and fights with Yama, the god of death, to get his life back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CcAZYYkG0dralHCyOmouS6dNPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77043'),
  ('12843884922175813', 'Yamakasi', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Julien Seri, Ariel Zeitoun, Philippe Piffeteau', 'Luc Besson, Philippe Lyon, Julien Seri', 'Châu Belle Dinh, Williams Belle, Malik Diouf, Yann Hnautra, Guylain N''Guba-Boyeke, Charles Perrière, Laurent Piemontesi, Maher Kamoun', null, 'Yamakasi - Les samouraïs des temps modernes is a 2001 French movie written by Luc Besson. It demonstrates the skills of the Yamakasi, a group of traceurs who battle against injustice in the Paris ghetto. They use parkour to steal from the rich in order to pay off medical bills for a kid injured copying their techniques.', 'Yamakasi - Les samouraïs des temps modernes is a 2001 French movie written by Luc Besson. It demonstrates the skills of the Yamakasi, a group of traceurs who battle against injustice in the Paris ghetto. They use parkour to steal from the rich in order to pay off medical bills for a kid injured copying their techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7INcVJWvyT5pwnGHTYrhZXD7zvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6935'),
  ('919041226901816930', 'Yamato', 2005, 'War, History', 'Junya Satō, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Junya Satō', 'Takashi Sorimachi, Shido Nakamura, Yu Aoi, Noboru Takachi, Junichi Haruta, Ryô Hashizume, Ryūzō Hayashi, Hiroyuki Hirayama', null, 'Directed by Junya Sato and based on a book by Jun Henmi, "Yamato" has a framing story set in the present day and uses flashbacks to tell the story of the crew of the World War II Japanese battleship Yamato. The film was never released in the United States, where reviewers who have seen it have compared the military epic to "Titanic" and "Saving Private Ryan."', 'Directed by Junya Sato and based on a book by Jun Henmi, "Yamato" has a framing story set in the present day and uses flashbacks to tell the story of the crew of the World War II Japanese battleship Yamato. The film was never released in the United States, where reviewers who have seen it have compared the military epic to "Titanic" and "Saving Private Ryan."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTCUAlGakuDkbltkSEEzUUOR7gL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19659'),
  ('815962161279081046', 'Yamla Pagla Deewana', 2011, 'Music, Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Samir Karnik, Kabir Lal', null, 'Dharmendra, Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Kulraj Randhawa, Anupam Kher, Nafisa Ali, Puneet Issar, Mukul Dev', null, 'An NRI visits India to look for his estranged father and brother. He soon learns that both are expert conmen. He is forced to join them and go to Punjab to fix his younger brother''s love life.', 'An NRI visits India to look for his estranged father and brother. He soon learns that both are expert conmen. He is forced to join them and go to Punjab to fix his younger brother''s love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Po2YSBz2vloFxjYbs3CNO7I1vf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54639'),
  ('532378576097795532', 'Yamla Pagla Deewana 2', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sangeeth Sivan, Karan Deol, Sharib Sabri', null, 'Dharmendra, Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Anupam Kher, Johny Lever, Neha Sharma, Kristina Akheeva, Annu Kapoor', null, 'Dharam and Gajodhar, a father-son duo, claim to be the owners of a massive company to swindle a business tycoon. To add to their troubles, Gajodhar''s brother jumps on to the bandwagon.', 'Dharam and Gajodhar, a father-son duo, claim to be the owners of a massive company to swindle a business tycoon. To add to their troubles, Gajodhar''s brother jumps on to the bandwagon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHvy2RxE4bTCoi80IoE4oCSqm2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199687'),
  ('565054465636161704', 'Yamla Pagla Deewana: Phir Se', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Navaniat Singh, Rahul Maniktala, Sujit Dube', 'Dheeraj Rattan', 'Dharmendra, Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Kriti Kharbanda, Satish Kaushik, Asrani, Shatrughan Sinha, Binnu Dhillon', null, 'An upright Ayurveda practitioner is hounded by big pharma giants for his age-old formula called Vajra Kawach that cures everything from pimples to impotency. But how long can he keep this magic pill only for the poor?', 'An upright Ayurveda practitioner is hounded by big pharma giants for his age-old formula called Vajra Kawach that cures everything from pimples to impotency. But how long can he keep this magic pill only for the poor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t52FVHgb7zDFg2dSVkjquCMGGP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512180'),
  ('1140145654531034250', 'Yana''s Friends', 1999, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Arik Kaplun', 'Semyon Vinokur, Arik Kaplun', 'Evelyn Kaplun, Nir Levy, Mosko Alkalai, Vladimir Friedman, Israel Damidov', null, 'Three parallel stories of immigrants in Tel Aviv during the Gulf War and about coming together while sealed in a room during the Scud attacks.', 'Three parallel stories of immigrants in Tel Aviv during the Gulf War and about coming together while sealed in a room during the Scud attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqYwcaeQrI6QPm5emi72m9ffh24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173925'),
  ('842625683870259268', 'Yanagawa', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Park Jung-hun, Tu Duu-chih, Zhang Lu', 'Zhang Lu', 'Ni Ni, Zhang Luyi, Xin Baiqing, Sosuke Ikematsu, Ryoko Nakano, Ninon, Wang Jiajia, Nai An', null, 'At a Japanese restaurant nestled within the busy streets of Beijing, Li Dong convinces his older brother Li Chun to travel together to the Japanese city of Yanagawa to find and catch up with their childhood sweetheart Liu Chuan.', 'At a Japanese restaurant nestled within the busy streets of Beijing, Li Dong convinces his older brother Li Chun to travel together to the Japanese city of Yanagawa to find and catch up with their childhood sweetheart Liu Chuan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNegrRHPFfWxi34oZLgczYrw64R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661337'),
  ('362461425761475326', 'Yanco', 1961, 'Drama', 'Servando González, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Servando González', 'Ricardo Ancona, Jesús Medina, María Bustamante', null, 'The engaging and sentimental tale begins when the little boy (Ricardo Ancona) starts manifesting a greater and greater talent at music and at the same time, a supersensitivity to sounds. His overly astute hearing drives him into the woods and away from the cacophony of the town''s hustle and bustle. Once in the woods, he meets a kindly old hermit who teaches him how to play the violin he made. After the old man dies, the violin ends up at a pawn shop, and each night the boy sneaks in to play it in secret. It is this haunting, nightly music that sets the town on edge -- people think an evil spirit is on the loose.', 'The engaging and sentimental tale begins when the little boy (Ricardo Ancona) starts manifesting a greater and greater talent at music and at the same time, a supersensitivity to sounds. His overly astute hearing drives him into the woods and away from the cacophony of the town''s hustle and bustle. Once in the woods, he meets a kindly old hermit who teaches him how to play the violin he made. After the old man dies, the violin ends up at a pawn shop, and each night the boy sneaks in to play it in secret. It is this haunting, nightly music that sets the town on edge -- people think an evil spirit is on the loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UkfkZ5xb6MQ8T7oCJbD99ChYD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255576'),
  ('957931771755187422', 'Yang Yang', 2009, 'Drama', 'Cheng Yu-chieh, Jake Pollock', 'Cheng Yu-chieh', 'Sandrine Pinna, Ray Chang, Jag Huang, Khan Lee, Yu Tai-Yan, Chu Lu-hao, Edison Wang, Sy-huoy Her', null, 'Yang-yang is a French-Chinese mix. She has never seen her French father. She does not speak a single French word. Her mum has re-married but she has been very lonely. She started working at the entertainment industry. The fact that she is a mix is a good selling point. The film depicts how Yang-yang dealt with her life, her relationships with men, with her mother and friends.', 'Yang-yang is a French-Chinese mix. She has never seen her French father. She does not speak a single French word. Her mum has re-married but she has been very lonely. She started working at the entertainment industry. The fact that she is a mix is a good selling point. The film depicts how Yang-yang dealt with her life, her relationships with men, with her mother and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4F8scwFcenoDD1gfKpEURq7gzkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43723'),
