  ('101873443688066851', 'Yangtse Incident: The Story of H.M.S. Amethyst', 1957, 'War', 'Michael Anderson, Denis Johnson', 'Eric Ambler', 'Richard Todd, William Hartnell, Akim Tamiroff, Donald Houston, Keye Luke, Sophie Stewart, Robert Urquhart, Richard Leech', null, 'While sailing lawfully up the Yangste in 1949, the British warship Amethyst found its return to the open sea blocked by Communist Chinese shore batteries that unexpectedly opened fire. In charge, Lietenant Commander Kerans was not however prepared for his crew and his ship to remain as a hostage for the Chinese to use as an international pawn.', 'While sailing lawfully up the Yangste in 1949, the British warship Amethyst found its return to the open sea blocked by Communist Chinese shore batteries that unexpectedly opened fire. In charge, Lietenant Commander Kerans was not however prepared for his crew and his ship to remain as a hostage for the Chinese to use as an international pawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RT0GtwMSeG9bc75tfhSi1ZfoHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37604'),
  ('189333787674770505', 'Yanka y el espíritu del volcán', 2018, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Iván Abello', 'Julieta Ledesma, Iván Abello, Fernando Regueira', 'Maite Lanata, Hugo Arana, Ezequiel Volpe, Juan Palomino, Aymará Rovera, Enrique Dumont, Beatríz Pichi Malen, Gastón Pauls', null, 'A 13-year-old girl named Yanka goes on a search for her mother, who has been presumed dead in a dangerous forest.', 'A 13-year-old girl named Yanka goes on a search for her mother, who has been presumed dead in a dangerous forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1JVWhnjuvS3HTTh9oo5rGwLw6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547447'),
  ('537455591067235655', 'Yankee', 1966, 'Western', 'Tinto Brass, Alfio Contini', 'Alberto Silvestri, Alfonso Balcázar, Giancarlo Fusco', 'Philippe Leroy, Adolfo Celi, Víctor Israel, Valentino Macchi, Jacques Herlin, Mirella Martin, Tomás Torres, Francisco Sanz', null, 'A man known only as ''Yankee'' rides into a dying, desolate frontier New Mexico town completely controlled by ''The Grand Cougar'', setting off a chain of events where dominance is the prize.', 'A man known only as ''Yankee'' rides into a dying, desolate frontier New Mexico town completely controlled by ''The Grand Cougar'', setting off a chain of events where dominance is the prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnmb46rtc8c8rbx4RemMJNFMKwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101553'),
