  ('325593994899488262', 'Yankee Doodle Daffy', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', null, 'Daffy is an agent representing Sleepy Lagoon, trying to sell him to talent scout Porky. Daffy spends a great deal of time and energy explaining and demonstrating what the kid can do, while the kid sits on a couch licking a giant sucker.', 'Daffy is an agent representing Sleepy Lagoon, trying to sell him to talent scout Porky. Daffy spends a great deal of time and energy explaining and demonstrating what the kid can do, while the kid sits on a couch licking a giant sucker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cueV8yrJKnWSePGaZ1GJTE0bSQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100390'),
