  ('18221894909803079', 'Yankee High School Girls’ Road to National Domination 2 Tokyo Edition', 2015, 'Action', 'Naoyuki Uchida, Tetsuro Imai', 'Naoyuki Uchida', 'Yura Sakura, Ai Narita, Yuta Nakagawa, Kazuto Nakamura', null, 'Hachioji North Technical High School is notorious for its delinquents. Rina, a recent transfer student, finds herself harassed by some of them—until she''s rescued by Kaito. Unlike the other delinquents, there''s something different and compelling about him, and Rina begins to feel drawn to him. But her involvement catches the attention of Suzumiya, the reigning queen and feared "shadow boss" of the school, who also happens to be Kaito''s childhood friend…', 'Hachioji North Technical High School is notorious for its delinquents. Rina, a recent transfer student, finds herself harassed by some of them—until she''s rescued by Kaito. Unlike the other delinquents, there''s something different and compelling about him, and Rina begins to feel drawn to him. But her involvement catches the attention of Suzumiya, the reigning queen and feared "shadow boss" of the school, who also happens to be Kaito''s childhood friend…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkvcYRw9nD82G7RnPVFsqw6wU4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1501273'),
  ('743302629861141279', 'Yankee Zulu', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Gray Hofmeyr, James Robb, Andre Scholtz', 'Leon Schuster, Craig Gardner', 'Leon Schuster, John Matshikiza, Wilson Dunster, Terri Treas, Michelle Bowes, Skye Svorinic, Ruan Mandelstam, Bobo Seritsani', null, 'Two South African boys, one white, Rhino, and one black, Zulu, go their separate ways after an incident. Many years later, they meet up again as adults, when one, after living for years in the United States, is now a wanted criminal. The two end up being a part of a madcap chase involving a check for a large amount of lottery money, pursued by Gen. Diehard and Rhino''s ex-wife Rowena, who was the cause of the rift between the two protagonists.', 'Two South African boys, one white, Rhino, and one black, Zulu, go their separate ways after an incident. Many years later, they meet up again as adults, when one, after living for years in the United States, is now a wanted criminal. The two end up being a part of a madcap chase involving a check for a large amount of lottery money, pursued by Gen. Diehard and Rhino''s ex-wife Rowena, who was the cause of the rift between the two protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOPkzkmi5XkGDUkurhpBK9gNHpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16417'),
  ('443646584864257042', 'Yanks', 1979, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'John Schlesinger, Dick Bush, Simon Relph', 'Colin Welland, Walter Bernstein', 'Richard Gere, Lisa Eichhorn, Vanessa Redgrave, William Devane, Chick Vennera, Wendy Morgan, Rachel Roberts, Tony Melody', 'R', 'During WWII, the United States set up army bases in Great Britain as part of the war effort. Against their proper sensibilities, many of the Brits don''t much like the brash Yanks, especially when it comes to the G.I.s making advances on the lonely British girls. One relationship that develops is between married John, an Army Captain, and the aristocratic Helen, whose naval husband is away at war. Helen loves her husband, but Helen and John are looking for some comfort during the difficult times.', 'During WWII, the United States set up army bases in Great Britain as part of the war effort. Against their proper sensibilities, many of the Brits don''t much like the brash Yanks, especially when it comes to the G.I.s making advances on the lonely British girls. One relationship that develops is between married John, an Army Captain, and the aristocratic Helen, whose naval husband is away at war. Helen loves her husband, but Helen and John are looking for some comfort during the difficult times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsTyD3U9iiFDYGWW3Xix4Q2Opuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21666'),
  ('907110070364277494', 'Yanni: Live at the Acropolis', 1994, 'Documentary, Music', null, null, 'Yanni, Charlie Adams, Karen Briggs, Michael "Kalani" Bruno, Ric Fierabracci, Julie Homi, Bradley Joseph, Darlene Koldenhoven', null, 'A concert by contemporary instrumental musician, Yanni, recorded live at the Herodes Atticus Theatre in Athens on 25 Sep 1993.', 'A concert by contemporary instrumental musician, Yanni, recorded live at the Herodes Atticus Theatre in Athens on 25 Sep 1993.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11sKGwGN8SPGootoIXxvpojw8nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80269'),
  ('518432119975611248', 'Yannick', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Raphaël Quenard, Pio Marmaï, Blanche Gardin, Sébastien Chassagne, Agnès Hurstel, Jean-Paul Solal, Laurent Nicolas, Mustapha Abourachid', null, 'In the middle of a performance of the play "Le Cocu", a bad boulevard comedy at a Parisian theatre, Yannick gets up and interrupts the show to take the evening back in hand.', 'In the middle of a performance of the play "Le Cocu", a bad boulevard comedy at a Parisian theatre, Yannick gets up and interrupts the show to take the evening back in hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZtteptwaNpZmdB1YwlyXOmUVw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110358'),
  ('525978158636587', 'Yao', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Philippe Godeau, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Agnès de Sacy', 'Omar Sy, Fatoumata Diawara, Lionel Louis Basse, Germaine Acogny, Alibeta, Gwendolyn Gourvenec, Abdoulaye Diop, Ismaël Charles Amine Saleh', null, 'From his village in northern Senegal, Yao is a 13-year-old boy ready to do anything to meet his hero: Seydou Tall, a famous French actor. Invited to Dakar to promote his new book, the latter goes to his country of origin for the first time. To fulfill his dream, the young Yao organizes his fugue and brave 387 kilometers alone to the capital. Touched by this child, the actor decides to flee his obligations and to accompany him home. But on the dusty and uncertain roads of Senegal, Seydou understands that while rolling towards the village of the child, it also rolls towards its roots.', 'From his village in northern Senegal, Yao is a 13-year-old boy ready to do anything to meet his hero: Seydou Tall, a famous French actor. Invited to Dakar to promote his new book, the latter goes to his country of origin for the first time. To fulfill his dream, the young Yao organizes his fugue and brave 387 kilometers alone to the capital. Touched by this child, the actor decides to flee his obligations and to accompany him home. But on the dusty and uncertain roads of Senegal, Seydou understands that while rolling towards the village of the child, it also rolls towards its roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzQRAziC7vkgPlAX35HFc0w1ppj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515818'),
  ('191287815185599827', 'Yapışık Kardeşler', 2015, 'Comedy', 'İlker Ayrık', null, 'İlker Ayrık, Hakan Bulut, Ivana Sert, Suat Sungur, Suzan Kardeş, Erdal Tosun, Ayberk Atilla, Halil Sezai Paracıkoğlu', null, 'Conjoined twins Halim and Selim have led a carefree life in their small village but, unable to find suitable brides, journey to Istanbul in search of marriage prospects.', 'Conjoined twins Halim and Selim have led a carefree life in their small village but, unable to find suitable brides, journey to Istanbul in search of marriage prospects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZeiawbHTClEf5NWUuGmqiS6NFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326470'),
  ('311524534748897923', 'Yara', 2021, 'Drama', 'Roy Bava, Alberto Mangiapane, Michele Luigi Digeronimo', 'Giacomo Martelli', 'Isabella Ragonese, Alessio Boni, Thomas Trabacchi, Sandra Toffolatti, Roberto Zibetti, Mario Pirrello, Miro Landoni, Andrea Bruschi', null, 'The murder of 13-year-old Yara Gambirasio shocks the little town of Brembate di Sopra, Italy. To bring the culprit to justice, prosecutors have only scant DNA evidence and no database to compare them to. Based on a true story.', 'The murder of 13-year-old Yara Gambirasio shocks the little town of Brembate di Sopra, Italy. To bring the culprit to justice, prosecutors have only scant DNA evidence and no database to compare them to. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcVFI8t5QAvXGzQRKA82glDdOr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747688'),
  ('778918143303256782', 'Yardie', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Idris Elba, John Conroy', 'Martin Stellman', 'Aml Ameen, Stephen Graham, Shantol Jackson, Calvin Demba, Sheldon Shepherd, Adnan Mustafa, Duramaney Kamara, Everaldo Creary', null, 'Jamaica, 1973. When a young boy witnesses his brother’s assassination, a powerful Don gives him a home. But 10 years later, when he’s sent to London, his past catches up to him.', 'Jamaica, 1973. When a young boy witnesses his brother’s assassination, a powerful Don gives him a home. But 10 years later, when he’s sent to London, his past catches up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toK5rixhrjA98ENLb2wSOV10eJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420915'),
  ('261660192950846267', 'Yarukkya Knight', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Katsutoshi Hirabayashi, Shin Hayasaka', 'Nonki Miyasu, Katsutoshi Hirabayashi, Lion Hitoshizuku', 'Tomoya Nakamura, Nina Endo, Reiya Masaki, Elisa Yanagi', null, 'Makoto Gousuke has just transferred to a new high school with the intention of being the toughest kid there. Little does he know that there‘s an entire group of toughs who already rule the school, and they‘re all girls! After being humiliated by their leader, the pretty Misaki Shizuka, he vows revenge and starts a lengthy battle between the sexes at the school.', 'Makoto Gousuke has just transferred to a new high school with the intention of being the toughest kid there. Little does he know that there‘s an entire group of toughs who already rule the school, and they‘re all girls! After being humiliated by their leader, the pretty Misaki Shizuka, he vows revenge and starts a lengthy battle between the sexes at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncYkYLpluKSBgdEhNUIlyQc97n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362882'),
  ('561966114403161482', 'Yaşam Koçu', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Burak Kuka, Deniz Değerli, Elif Nas', 'Doğu Demirkol', 'Doğu Demirkol, Yağmur Tanrısevsin, Bülent Çolak, Hakan Meriçliler, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Ebrar Alya Demirbilek, Sude Özyürek', null, 'Failing to confess his love and reluctantly accompanying the famous actress Helin as a mandatory friend Cafer who mocked life coaches, energetic individuals, fortune-tellers, suddenly finds himself as the country''s most popular life coach.', 'Failing to confess his love and reluctantly accompanying the famous actress Helin as a mandatory friend Cafer who mocked life coaches, energetic individuals, fortune-tellers, suddenly finds himself as the country''s most popular life coach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBAlDtj2dyRBHFQH04YQeW7DLn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229504'),
  ('649229677985968080', 'Yaşamak Güzel Şey', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı', null, 'Müfit Can Saçıntı, Yasemin Baştan, Günay Karacaoğlu, Zihni Göktay, Ayşegül Atik, Merve Hazer, Fulden Akyürek, Reha Özcan', null, 'The story of Müfit, who learns a painful truth and transforms into an extraordinary hero. Constantly scolded by everyone around him and taken seriously by no one, Müfit begins to question his life and the system imposed on him after an unfortunate incident. He then begins to discover many beauties he had never seen before and to enjoy life.', 'The story of Müfit, who learns a painful truth and transforms into an extraordinary hero. Constantly scolded by everyone around him and taken seriously by no one, Müfit begins to question his life and the system imposed on him after an unfortunate incident. He then begins to discover many beauties he had never seen before and to enjoy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/981YahoG3JA1FlnfGQGJ9piPajd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464847'),
  ('938747545188190768', 'Yashoda', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'M. Sukumar, Hareesh Narayan, K. Hari Shankar', 'K. Hari Shankar, Hareesh Narayan', 'Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Varalaxmi Sarathkumar, Unni Mukundan, Madhurima Narla, Rao Ramesh, Murali Sharma, Sampath Raj, Shatru', null, 'Looking to save her sister, Yashoda, a desperate woman agrees to be a surrogate and move in to a plush facility - but nothing is as it seems. In the world outside Eva, a Hollywood starlet dies under mysterious circumstances, so do a tycoon and a super model. An unknown drug seem to hold the key to the whole mystery.', 'Looking to save her sister, Yashoda, a desperate woman agrees to be a surrogate and move in to a plush facility - but nothing is as it seems. In the world outside Eva, a Hollywood starlet dies under mysterious circumstances, so do a tycoon and a super model. An unknown drug seem to hold the key to the whole mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSYkMzVRBeYwBgvQ155oORPJzmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900222'),
  ('518537740338146816', 'Yatterman', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto, Yoshitaka Yamaguchi', 'Midori Sato, Kohei Kiyasu, Eisuke Naito', 'Sho Sakurai, Saki Fukuda, Kyoko Fukada, Kendo Kobayashi, Katsuhisa Namase, Koichi Yamadera, Sadao Abe, Shin''ichi Hatori', null, 'Gan and his girlfriend Ai are mild-mannered toy shop owners by day but, when evil lurks, they transform into superheroes Yatterman 1 & 2. With the help of a dog-shaped robot, Yatterwoof, they take on the Doronbow gang, lead by the sexy Lady Doronjo. Together, they must stop the evil gang from finding the four magical skull pieces that will allow them to control the world!', 'Gan and his girlfriend Ai are mild-mannered toy shop owners by day but, when evil lurks, they transform into superheroes Yatterman 1 & 2. With the help of a dog-shaped robot, Yatterwoof, they take on the Doronbow gang, lead by the sexy Lady Doronjo. Together, they must stop the evil gang from finding the four magical skull pieces that will allow them to control the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3ig9QssXPf64Telz4wmMe93jFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24561'),
  ('62216665145599314', 'Yavanika', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery', 'K. G. George, K. Ramachandra Babu', 'K. G. George', 'Gopi, Jalaja, Mammootty, Venu Nagavalli, Nedumudi Venu, Thilakan, Jagathy Sreekumar, Ashokan', null, 'Ayyappan, a tabla player of a touring drama group, goes missing. Later on, Sub-Inspector Jacob Eeraly is assigned to investigate the case and finds out disturbing truths.', 'Ayyappan, a tabla player of a touring drama group, goes missing. Later on, Sub-Inspector Jacob Eeraly is assigned to investigate the case and finds out disturbing truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buEMJVo78Inr9S8asTzZyQpKHcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249572'),
