  ('34385458629566097', 'Yaya & Lennie: The Walking Liberty', 2021, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Alessandro Rak, Alessandro Rak', 'Alessandro Rak', 'Ciro Priello, Fabiola Balestriere, Lina Sastri, Francesco Pannofino, Massimiliano Gallo, Tommaso Ragno, Fabrizio Botta, Fabio Balsamo', null, 'Immersed in the jungle, among relics of a "forgotten future", two kids, Yaya and Lennie, meander. The two live freely in their Eden until armed men, who carry with them an "ancient" concept of civilization, force them to leave their territory. It is the beginning of a journey in search of their place in a world that no longer belongs to man.', 'Immersed in the jungle, among relics of a "forgotten future", two kids, Yaya and Lennie, meander. The two live freely in their Eden until armed men, who carry with them an "ancient" concept of civilization, force them to leave their territory. It is the beginning of a journey in search of their place in a world that no longer belongs to man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZP1oC1guPd1reEN2YUJYyERUE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636594'),
  ('430661682047183676', 'Ydessa, the Bears and etc.', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, John Holosko, Claire Duguet', 'Agnès Varda', 'Ydessa Hendeles, Agnès Varda', null, 'Ydessa Hendeles'' exhibition entitled "The living and the Artificial" (consisting of works of art all comprising a photograph of living persons in the company of one or several teddy bears) had puzzled Agnès Varda so much that she decided to go to Toronto where the artist lives and interview her. In front of Agnes Varda''s DV camera, Ydessa tells about the singularity of her artistic approach. She also expresses herself about the Holocaust, which both her parents survived.', 'Ydessa Hendeles'' exhibition entitled "The living and the Artificial" (consisting of works of art all comprising a photograph of living persons in the company of one or several teddy bears) had puzzled Agnès Varda so much that she decided to go to Toronto where the artist lives and interview her. In front of Agnes Varda''s DV camera, Ydessa tells about the singularity of her artistic approach. She also expresses herself about the Holocaust, which both her parents survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3M7nNmfhS61gXjdNSk5WUJEw4p3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283514'),
  ('801527570152866089', 'Ye Olden Days', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Billy Bletcher, Count Cutelli', 'NR', 'The princess is to wed the Prince against her wishes. When she refuses, the king locks her in the tower. Minstrel Mickey sees her and rescues her, making a rope from the clothes of lady-in-waiting Clarabell. The king spots them and prepares to chop off Mickey''s head until Minnie intercedes. The king calls for a joust. Mickey wins and they live happily ever after.', 'The princess is to wed the Prince against her wishes. When she refuses, the king locks her in the tower. Minstrel Mickey sees her and rescues her, making a rope from the clothes of lady-in-waiting Clarabell. The king spots them and prepares to chop off Mickey''s head until Minnie intercedes. The king calls for a joust. Mickey wins and they live happily ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bz6ARhFsKEpNSA0dBvegSvgN1jM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67790'),
  ('1087083140960463045', 'Year 10', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ben Goodger', 'Ben Goodger', 'Toby Goodger, Duncan Lacroix, Hannah Khalique-Brown, Alexander Anderson, Emma Cole, Joseph Coleman, Tom Gaskin, King Gayle', null, 'After the fall of civilization, the few survivors have been driven to cannibalism. A young man must confront a violent tribe that has murdered his father and stolen the medicine that keeps his girlfriend alive.', 'After the fall of civilization, the few survivors have been driven to cannibalism. A young man must confront a violent tribe that has murdered his father and stolen the medicine that keeps his girlfriend alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqeFM6cjHjYmgjqJExjt1NPBPdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320330'),
  ('356062223698915499', 'Year of Enlightment', 1986, 'Drama, War', 'Fernando Trueba, Carmen Martínez Rebé, Eusebio Graciani', 'Rafael Azcona, Fernando Trueba', 'Jorge Sanz, Verónica Forqué, Maribel Verdú, Rafaela Aparicio, Santiago Ramos, Chus Lampreave, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Manuel Alexandre', null, 'April, 1940. Manolo, 16 years old, and Jesus, who is just 8, are taken by their older brother Pepe, a lieutenant in the Army, to a sanatorium for children suffering from tuberculosis, situated on the border with Portugal. Once in the sanatorium, Manolo, surrounded by boys all much younger than he is, feels a bit like the cock of the walk since the only other man around is the handyman Emilio who looks after the gardens and does whatever needs to be done about the place. His wife, Rafaela, is the cook. Manolo meets Irene, a falangist who runs the sanatorium, and the school teacher, Miss Transito, a crabby spinster. He has his first sexual experience, albeit as a voyeur, with his nurse Vicenta. When she has to leave, her place is taken by a girl from the village, Maria Jesus, with whom Manolo falls hopelessly in love. A relationship grows up between them which will mark them both for ever.', 'April, 1940. Manolo, 16 years old, and Jesus, who is just 8, are taken by their older brother Pepe, a lieutenant in the Army, to a sanatorium for children suffering from tuberculosis, situated on the border with Portugal. Once in the sanatorium, Manolo, surrounded by boys all much younger than he is, feels a bit like the cock of the walk since the only other man around is the handyman Emilio who looks after the gardens and does whatever needs to be done about the place. His wife, Rafaela, is the cook. Manolo meets Irene, a falangist who runs the sanatorium, and the school teacher, Miss Transito, a crabby spinster. He has his first sexual experience, albeit as a voyeur, with his nurse Vicenta. When she has to leave, her place is taken by a girl from the village, Maria Jesus, with whom Manolo falls hopelessly in love. A relationship grows up between them which will mark them both for ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAqkstX4WzgkJTJ3UlrwIXUKRNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104089'),
