  ('592437964603313186', 'Year of the Dragon', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Cimino, Alex Thomson, Michael Stevenson', 'Oliver Stone, Michael Cimino', 'Mickey Rourke, John Lone, Ariane, Leonard Termo, Raymond J. Barry, Caroline Kava, Eddie Jones, Joey Chin', 'R', 'In New York, racist Capt. Stanley White becomes obsessed with destroying a Chinese-American drug ring run by Joey Tai, an up-and-coming young gangster as ambitious as he is ruthless. While pursuing an unauthorized investigation, White grows increasingly willing to violate police protocol, resorting to progressively violent measures -- even as his concerned wife, Connie, and his superiors beg him to consider the consequences of his actions.', 'In New York, racist Capt. Stanley White becomes obsessed with destroying a Chinese-American drug ring run by Joey Tai, an up-and-coming young gangster as ambitious as he is ruthless. While pursuing an unauthorized investigation, White grows increasingly willing to violate police protocol, resorting to progressively violent measures -- even as his concerned wife, Connie, and his superiors beg him to consider the consequences of his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8SfIgwR5mfu0c0qTBKbsvBfecJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11018'),
