  ('403730214631357245', 'Yeh Saali Aashiqui', 2019, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Cheraagg Ruparel, Pratik Shah', 'Cheraagg Ruparel, Vardhaan Puri', 'Vardhaan Puri, Shivaleeka Oberoi, Jessey Lever, Ruslaan Mumtaz', null, 'When Sahil met Mittee in a hotel management school, it was love at first sight for both of them. Their love was everything - picture perfect and flawless. But an unlikely event at school turns their dream-come-true romance into a nightmare and makes them realize how important it is to know your partner thoroughly before getting into any kind of romantic relationship.', 'When Sahil met Mittee in a hotel management school, it was love at first sight for both of them. Their love was everything - picture perfect and flawless. But an unlikely event at school turns their dream-come-true romance into a nightmare and makes them realize how important it is to know your partner thoroughly before getting into any kind of romantic relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z83KrUMwgXPZM442lhl0Mth0pPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646173'),
  ('1065854995276335624', 'Yeh Saali Zindagi', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Sudhir Mishra, Sachin K. Krishn', 'Sudhir Mishra', 'Irrfan Khan, Aditi Rao Hydari, Chitrangada Singh, Arunoday Singh, Saurabh Shukla, Yashpal Sharma, Sushant Singh, Vipul Gupta', null, 'Arun who has seen his lover in other man''s arms cant forget her beauty and is always distracted by it. And wants to help her in any sought of situation even save her love from kidnappers.', 'Arun who has seen his lover in other man''s arms cant forget her beauty and is always distracted by it. And wants to help her in any sought of situation even save her love from kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbJ8UP16wjesxRo4l0oksoMqDm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56901'),
  ('1056161015664502899', 'Yeh Teraa Ghar Yeh Meraa Ghar', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Priyadarshan, Jeeva', 'Neeraj Vora', 'Suniel Shetty, Mahima Chaudhry, Saurabh Shukla, Aanjjan Srivastav, Suhasini Mulay, Asrani', null, 'After the death of his dad, Dayashankar Pandey arranges the marriage of his two sisters. In debt, he goes to the city to ask the tenants to leave his house, as he intends to sell it and repay his debts. A woman, her two daughters, Jyoti, Saraswati, and one son, Chotu are living there. When Dayashankar asks them to vacate, they refuse. What results is Dayashankar''s hilarious attempts to force them to vacate - from seeking legal advice; filing police reports; asking goons to remove them - moving in himself. Will Dayashankar succeed in his attempts to evict his tenants?', 'After the death of his dad, Dayashankar Pandey arranges the marriage of his two sisters. In debt, he goes to the city to ask the tenants to leave his house, as he intends to sell it and repay his debts. A woman, her two daughters, Jyoti, Saraswati, and one son, Chotu are living there. When Dayashankar asks them to vacate, they refuse. What results is Dayashankar''s hilarious attempts to force them to vacate - from seeking legal advice; filing police reports; asking goons to remove them - moving in himself. Will Dayashankar succeed in his attempts to evict his tenants?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1gDlv4Yu49zkZF2ntbH6lPwalY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64049'),
  ('154034383875455268', 'Yell for the Blue Sky', 2016, 'Drama', 'Takahiro Miki', 'Yukiko Mochiji', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Ryoma Takeuchi, Shono Hayama, Mirai Shida, Arata Horii, Fujiko Kojima, Airi Matsui, Yuna Taira', null, 'As a child, Ono Tsubasa saw a Shirato baseball game on TV and was amazed at the Trumpet player in the band playing. Now, in order to play the Trumpet, she enters Shirato High School. There, she meets Yamada Daisuke, a catcher for the baseball team. With each others support, they go towards their dream of playing at Koushien.', 'As a child, Ono Tsubasa saw a Shirato baseball game on TV and was amazed at the Trumpet player in the band playing. Now, in order to play the Trumpet, she enters Shirato High School. There, she meets Yamada Daisuke, a catcher for the baseball team. With each others support, they go towards their dream of playing at Koushien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQXURsG1goUJxOfSWsAonhQajNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438524'),
  ('578018279868422621', 'Yella', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Ires Jung', 'Christian Petzold', 'Nina Hoss, Devid Striesow, Hinnerk Schönemann, Burghart Klaußner, Barbara Auer, Christian Redl, Selin Bademsoy, Wanja Mues', null, 'A young East German woman leaves her controlling husband/business partner and relocates to a West German city to start anew as an accountant, but he soon catches up with her.', 'A young East German woman leaves her controlling husband/business partner and relocates to a West German city to start anew as an accountant, but he soon catches up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axC6pBrFc7Y2I6pFzvvte9uRf9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3037'),
  ('185156989551477788', 'Yellow', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfredo De Villa, Zoraida Sanjurjo López', 'Nacoma Whobrey', 'Roselyn Sánchez, Sully Diaz, Bill Duke, Jamie Tirelli, D. B. Sweeney, Ana Isabelle, Kisha Tikina Burgos', null, 'Amaryllis Campos is a young, classically trained Puerto Rican ballerina, who dreams of leaving her impoverished home in Puerto Rico to pursue fame and fortune as a dancer. Amaryllis heads for New York City, where she is forced to work in a seedy strip club to make ends meet. Setting audiences afire with her erotic moves, Amaryllis quickly becomes the strip club''s hottest attraction, but must finally decide between true love and realizing her dream of becoming a star.', 'Amaryllis Campos is a young, classically trained Puerto Rican ballerina, who dreams of leaving her impoverished home in Puerto Rico to pursue fame and fortune as a dancer. Amaryllis heads for New York City, where she is forced to work in a seedy strip club to make ends meet. Setting audiences afire with her erotic moves, Amaryllis quickly becomes the strip club''s hottest attraction, but must finally decide between true love and realizing her dream of becoming a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZZ3YzmXLdfj7VPkrrnzyfFDMLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39796'),
  ('817227357236872551', 'Yellow Canary', 1943, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Herbert Wilcox, Mutz Greenbaum', 'P.M. Bower', 'Anna Neagle, Richard Greene, Nova Pilbeam, Albert Lieven, Lucie Mannheim, George Thorpe, Marjorie Fielding, Franklin Dyall', 'NR', 'A socialite poses as a Nazi spy to mask her activities as a British agent.', 'A socialite poses as a Nazi spy to mask her activities as a British agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MG7y1Sh0lCS7s8L9sUfUXbdgZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68250'),
  ('477346842893767783', 'Yellow Cat', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Adilkhan Yerzhanov, Yerkinbek Ptyraliyev, Ilya Gariyev', 'Yerken Gubashev, Adilkhan Yerzhanov, Inna Smailova', 'Azamat Nigmanov, Kamila Nugmanova, Sanzhar Madi, Yerzhan Zhamankulov, Yerken Gubashev, Arslan Akubaev, Konstantin Kozlov, Adema Yerzhanova', null, 'Ex-con Kermek and his beloved Eva want to leave their crime-infested lives on the Kazakh steppes behind. He has a dream: building a movie theater in the mountains. Will Kermek''s love of Alain Delon be strong enough to keep them out of the violent clutches of the mafia?', 'Ex-con Kermek and his beloved Eva want to leave their crime-infested lives on the Kazakh steppes behind. He has a dream: building a movie theater in the mountains. Will Kermek''s love of Alain Delon be strong enough to keep them out of the violent clutches of the mafia?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0nblrrBtoUHaw2qlZ1ZJ02NmbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728145'),
  ('364512801169016428', 'Yellow Devil', 1964, 'Adventure, Western', 'Robert Siodmak, Aleksandar Sekulović, Richard R. Rimmel', 'Georg Marischka, Robert Siodmak', 'Lex Barker, Marie Versini, Ralf Wolter, Rik Battaglia, Dieter Borsche, Chris Howland, Marianne Hold, Maria Grazia Francia', null, 'When a villain named "Der Schut" terrorizes the constituents of Albanian country, which he rules, heroic Kara Ben Nemsi and his sidekick are the only ones who can stop him.', 'When a villain named "Der Schut" terrorizes the constituents of Albanian country, which he rules, heroic Kara Ben Nemsi and his sidekick are the only ones who can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ensY9Sj4uibWnmInozU52lyH34E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12553'),
  ('622052486721689908', 'Yellow Earth', 1984, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Chen Kaige, Zhang Yimou', 'Ziliang Zhang, Chen Kaige', 'Xue Bai, Wang Xueqi, Tuo Tan, Quiang Liu', null, 'A communist soldier is sent to a remote region of China in order to collect folk songs. Staying with a peasant family (a widower with two small children), he discovers a community whose way of life is completely alien to him, but he gradually wins their trust.', 'A communist soldier is sent to a remote region of China in order to collect folk songs. Staying with a peasant family (a widower with two small children), he discovers a community whose way of life is completely alien to him, but he gradually wins their trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9zxjL9cLgBysC8YR3BTPlppn1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92990'),
  ('811868520256115805', 'Yellow Elephant', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, 島根淳, Shinji Kuma', 'Hisako Kurosawa', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Osamu Mukai, Lily Franky, Chieko Matsubara, Tatsuomi Hamada, Himeka Asami, Akira Emoto, Miyu Honda', null, 'Married couple Aiko Tsumari and Ayumu Muko live a happy and peaceful life. Aiko is bit naive, while Ayumu works as a not so popular novelist. One day, a letter arrives for Ayumu. Because of this letter, the couple become estranged...', 'Married couple Aiko Tsumari and Ayumu Muko live a happy and peaceful life. Aiko is bit naive, while Ayumu works as a not so popular novelist. One day, a letter arrives for Ayumu. Because of this letter, the couple become estranged...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Pyp4UMQEuBZiWN8vhaEG5tUnjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174938'),
  ('589405250310061401', 'Yellow Emanuelle', 1977, 'Drama', 'Bitto Albertini, Guglielmo Mancori, Giacomo Dell''Orso', 'Ambrogio Molteni, Bitto Albertini', 'Chai Lee, Giuseppe Pambieri, Ilona Staller, Rik Battaglia, Claudio Giorgi, Seyna Seyn, Chan Lap-Ban, Frank Nuyen', null, 'In this sexpolitation effort, a British pilot is assaulted by a gang of hoodlums and left on the street. He''s eventually taken to a hospital, where he is nursed back to health by Dr. Emy Wong, a beautiful Asian physician. As the pilot is restored to full health, he becomes increasingly infatuated with Emy.', 'In this sexpolitation effort, a British pilot is assaulted by a gang of hoodlums and left on the street. He''s eventually taken to a hospital, where he is nursed back to health by Dr. Emy Wong, a beautiful Asian physician. As the pilot is restored to full health, he becomes increasingly infatuated with Emy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1Gi788yGDb1tkL5U5glzXceEyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254493'),
  ('703475733532931073', 'Yellow Hair', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Yu-min', null, 'Kim Gi-yeon, Lee Jae-eun, Hyeong-chul Kim, Min Kyung-jin, Kim Byeong-se', null, 'Sang-hui has run away to Seoul from her quiet country life. She feels no regrets as she becomes nightclub hopper. In one of these clubs she meets the hard and bitter Yu-na who had suffered from many years of abuse at her father''s hands. They become close friends and eventually meet a young man Yang-gu who seems to be a perfect match for Yu-na. However he is carrying a torch for a former lover. Sang-hui and Yu-na decide to hunt down and eliminate the competition...', 'Sang-hui has run away to Seoul from her quiet country life. She feels no regrets as she becomes nightclub hopper. In one of these clubs she meets the hard and bitter Yu-na who had suffered from many years of abuse at her father''s hands. They become close friends and eventually meet a young man Yang-gu who seems to be a perfect match for Yu-na. However he is carrying a torch for a former lover. Sang-hui and Yu-na decide to hunt down and eliminate the competition...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9RAW55nIY1emaj5yk7bo3N0Xpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134189'),
  ('1099402368546578389', 'Yellow Is the New Black', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Crime', 'Serguei Kouchnerov, Fabien Polack', 'Jeff Lowell, Ted Travelstead', 'Pierre Coffin, Brian T. Delaney, Carlos Alazraqui', null, 'An adventure about two Minions who make a daring (though temporary) escape from jail. As they navigate the chaos of their breakout, their antics showcase the Minions'' signature blend of resourcefulness and mischief, resulting in a short filled with hilariously unpredictable moments.', 'An adventure about two Minions who make a daring (though temporary) escape from jail. As they navigate the chaos of their breakout, their antics showcase the Minions'' signature blend of resourcefulness and mischief, resulting in a short filled with hilariously unpredictable moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQN3wqHwvYoYIDFkKQ4QcuNQxoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553903'),
  ('674589105262162541', 'Yellow Letters', 2026, 'Drama', 'İlker Çatak, Judith Kaufmann, Ceren Sena Akgun', 'Enis Köstepen, Ayda Meryem Çatak, İlker Çatak', 'Özgü Namal, Tansu Biçer, Leyla Smyrna Cabas, İpek Bilgin, Kerem Can, Yusuf Akgün, Şiir Eloğlu, Elit İşcan', null, 'The marriage of Derya and Aziz is under pressure after losing their jobs because of state arbitrariness and moving to Istanbul to live with Aziz''s parents. They and their 13-year-old daughter Ezgi have to redefine their way of life.', 'The marriage of Derya and Aziz is under pressure after losing their jobs because of state arbitrariness and moving to Istanbul to live with Aziz''s parents. They and their 13-year-old daughter Ezgi have to redefine their way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Sxp3QIdamyoAfgLsUaGCQ1Z1ID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315657'),
  ('976839357263904966', 'Yellow River Fighter', 1988, 'Drama, Action', 'Cheung Sing-Yim', 'Mai-chuan Huang', 'Yu Chenghui, Chi-kang Chao, Chunyu Shanshan, Jianqiang Hu, Ji Chunhua, Jin Demao, Liu Huai-Liang, Sun Jiankui', null, 'In this martial arts action-drama, a swordsman named Toh Hong travels home after a long battle to discover his wife and children have been brutally murdered.', 'In this martial arts action-drama, a swordsman named Toh Hong travels home after a long battle to discover his wife and children have been brutally murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ltlp7bXABEzlbbi1Ol3WyDgV3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336945'),
  ('394124704987357657', 'Yellow Room', 2002, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Hélène Cattet, Bruno Forzani, Manuel Dacosse', 'Hélène Cattet, Bruno Forzani', 'Jean-Michel Vovk, Sandrine Laroche, Lea Capraro', null, 'The Giallo film reinvented as an experimental S&M-tinged fever dream, told through a combination of color-gelled cinematography and jump-cut photographs, infused with dark sensuality and perverse cruelty. The short films of the directors of Amer are technically rawer than that film, but they show what was to come in terms of themes based on giallo films and an abstract style, from the use of still frames like in Chris Marker''s La Jetée to harsh coloured lighting. They are worth seeing by themselves as a refining of their ideas into a fantastic debut feature film.', 'The Giallo film reinvented as an experimental S&M-tinged fever dream, told through a combination of color-gelled cinematography and jump-cut photographs, infused with dark sensuality and perverse cruelty. The short films of the directors of Amer are technically rawer than that film, but they show what was to come in terms of themes based on giallo films and an abstract style, from the use of still frames like in Chris Marker''s La Jetée to harsh coloured lighting. They are worth seeing by themselves as a refining of their ideas into a fantastic debut feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgDSpfgdECUhUKRhSXyfoBduD0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116996'),
  ('359935538356330552', 'Yellow Rose', 1982, 'History, Action', 'Doru Năstase', 'Eugen Barbu, Nicolae Paul Mihail', 'Florin Piersic, Marga Barbu, George Motoi, Ion Dichiseanu, Mihai Mereuţă, Constantin Codrescu, Ion Marinescu, Traian Stănescu', null, 'The second movie in the "Margelatu" series. Continuing the adventure of the Road of the Eagles, the heroes of the movie led by Margelatu after a series of events and overcoming obstacles, bring in the country the weapons bought from Vienna with the money from the sale of the heirlooms and values left by Tudor Vladimirescu for this purpose. Thus, they contribute to the preparation of the 1848 revolution in the Romanian lands.', 'The second movie in the "Margelatu" series. Continuing the adventure of the Road of the Eagles, the heroes of the movie led by Margelatu after a series of events and overcoming obstacles, bring in the country the weapons bought from Vienna with the money from the sale of the heirlooms and values left by Tudor Vladimirescu for this purpose. Thus, they contribute to the preparation of the 1848 revolution in the Romanian lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMLRL4OwtE1Nl4hJ9wvoQwMoLwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315480'),
  ('664082383359230463', 'Yellow Sky', 1948, 'Western', 'William A. Wellman, Joseph MacDonald, William Eckhardt', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Gregory Peck, Anne Baxter, Richard Widmark, Robert Arthur, John Russell, Harry Morgan, James Barton, Charles Kemper', 'NR', 'In 1867, a gang robs a bank and flees into the desert. Out of water, the outlaws encounter a ghost town called Yellow Sky and its only residents, a hostile young woman and her grandfather.', 'In 1867, a gang robs a bank and flees into the desert. Out of water, the outlaws encounter a ghost town called Yellow Sky and its only residents, a hostile young woman and her grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahS9YKQSkckF5XSWkAJxpwLmuef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20638'),
  ('749436122530931996', 'Yellow Submarine', 1968, 'Music, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'George Dunning, John Williams, George Martin', 'Al Brodax, Jack Mendelsohn, Lee Minoff', 'Paul Angelis, John Clive, Dick Emery, Geoffrey Hughes, Lance Percival, Peter Batten, George Harrison, John Lennon', 'G', 'The wicked Blue Meanies take over Pepperland, eliminating all color and music. As the only survivor, the Lord Admiral escapes in the yellow submarine and journeys to Liverpool to enlist the help of the Beatles.', 'The wicked Blue Meanies take over Pepperland, eliminating all color and music. As the only survivor, the Lord Admiral escapes in the yellow submarine and journeys to Liverpool to enlist the help of the Beatles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pmeLKaLFNggcsAk5FiouIvo3ST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12105'),
  ('740194456243809991', 'Yellow: The Cousins', 1969, 'Crime', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Sergio Colasanti', 'Augusto Finocchi', 'Lisa Seagram, Maurizio Bonuglia, Caterina Barbero, Franco Ricci, Renato De Carmine, Attilio Dottesio, Luigi Ida, Enzo Mondino', null, 'Following the death of her grandfather, Valentina settles with her husband Pierre, a sculptor, in the old family villa which she partly inherited (half of it belongs to her cousin Marta, who already resides there). Co-habitation proves to be awkward: Valentina is unscrupulous and uninhibited, while Marta is austere and virtuous - at least, on the surface. In fact, when Valentina suddenly dies, the woman initiates a seduction which eventually coaxes Pierre into her arms. The cosy situation soon changes when a police officer turns up to investigate Valentina''s death...', 'Following the death of her grandfather, Valentina settles with her husband Pierre, a sculptor, in the old family villa which she partly inherited (half of it belongs to her cousin Marta, who already resides there). Co-habitation proves to be awkward: Valentina is unscrupulous and uninhibited, while Marta is austere and virtuous - at least, on the surface. In fact, when Valentina suddenly dies, the woman initiates a seduction which eventually coaxes Pierre into her arms. The cosy situation soon changes when a police officer turns up to investigate Valentina''s death...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24aprzBv8JILUlv0xe027A6SACH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104949'),
  ('525480536144280418', 'Yellowbeard', 1983, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Gerry Fisher, Mel Damski', 'Bernard McKenna, Peter Cook, Graham Chapman', 'Graham Chapman, Martin Hewitt, Eric Idle, Peter Cook, Michael Hordern, Peter Boyle, Madeline Kahn, Marty Feldman', 'PG', 'For years Yellowbeard had looted the Spanish Main, making men eat their lips and swallow their hearts. Caught and convicted for tax evasion, he''s sentenced to 20 years in St. Victim''s Prison for the Extremely Naughty. In a scheme to confiscate his fabulous treasure, the Royal Navy allows him to escape and follows him, where saucy tarts, lisping demigods and some awful puns and punishments await.', 'For years Yellowbeard had looted the Spanish Main, making men eat their lips and swallow their hearts. Caught and convicted for tax evasion, he''s sentenced to 20 years in St. Victim''s Prison for the Extremely Naughty. In a scheme to confiscate his fabulous treasure, the Royal Navy allows him to escape and follows him, where saucy tarts, lisping demigods and some awful puns and punishments await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qom9prcVvoERJ6bzOOcBSdSUzin.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11609'),
  ('951123507884352657', 'Yellowbird', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Christian De Vita', 'Antoine Barraud, Guilhem Lesaffre, Cory Edwards', 'Seth Green, Dakota Fanning, Christine Baranski, Danny Glover, Elliott Gould, Jim Rash, Ryan Lee, Brady Corbet', 'PG', 'Yellowbird lives in the ruins of an old house. He lacks the confidence to leave his home, no matter how much Bug, his labybird friend, tries to convince him to go out into the world. Attempts to toughen him up have had little success, so Bug seizes an opportunity that leaves Yellowbird unexpectedly finding himself the new leader of the flock that is migrating to Africa. Still, lacking faith in his own abilities and with danger and imminent failure lurking around every corner, our feathered hero is forced to either find the strength required to work with the team or bow out and stay hidden away forever.', 'Yellowbird lives in the ruins of an old house. He lacks the confidence to leave his home, no matter how much Bug, his labybird friend, tries to convince him to go out into the world. Attempts to toughen him up have had little success, so Bug seizes an opportunity that leaves Yellowbird unexpectedly finding himself the new leader of the flock that is migrating to Africa. Still, lacking faith in his own abilities and with danger and imminent failure lurking around every corner, our feathered hero is forced to either find the strength required to work with the team or bow out and stay hidden away forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8i4YGjJxMTiUCXi1wunEItkVTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292795'),
  ('490039207403472267', 'YellowBrickRoad', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jesse Holland, Andy Mitton, Michael Hardwick', 'Andy Mitton, Jesse Holland', 'Michael Laurino, Anessa Ramsey, Alex Draper, Cassidy Freeman, Clark Freeman, Tara Giordano, Sam Elmore, Laura Heisler', 'R', 'In the Fall of 1940, the entire population of Friar, New Hampshire walked together up a winding mountain trail and into the wilderness. Without warning, they left behind everything: their homes, their clothes, and their money. The only clue where they went was a single word etched into stone near the forest’s edge: YELLOWBRICKROAD.', 'In the Fall of 1940, the entire population of Friar, New Hampshire walked together up a winding mountain trail and into the wilderness. Without warning, they left behind everything: their homes, their clothes, and their money. The only clue where they went was a single word etched into stone near the forest’s edge: YELLOWBRICKROAD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZRnAPskc9fhVetTm7XaVrUxs7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47386'),
  ('800914401410677220', 'Yellowstone Kelly', 1959, 'Adventure, Western', 'Carl E. Guthrie, Gordon Douglas', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Clint Walker, Edd Byrnes, John Russell, Ray Danton, Claude Akins, Rhodes Reason, Andra Martin, Gary Vinson', 'NR', 'A fur-trapper named Kelly, who once saved the life of a Sioux chief, is allowed to set his traps in Sioux territory during the late 1870s. Reluctantly he takes on a tenderfoot assistant named Anse and together they give shelter to a runaway Arapaho woman. Tensions develop when Anse falls in love with this woman and when the Sioux chief arrives with his warriors to re-claim her.', 'A fur-trapper named Kelly, who once saved the life of a Sioux chief, is allowed to set his traps in Sioux territory during the late 1870s. Reluctantly he takes on a tenderfoot assistant named Anse and together they give shelter to a runaway Arapaho woman. Tensions develop when Anse falls in love with this woman and when the Sioux chief arrives with his warriors to re-claim her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrjzLXi1VpwUx3kvJ0sgQzlYUxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72160'),
  ('40506161869328254', 'Yellowstone Romance', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Marita Grabiak, Dan Dumouchel', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Kathryn Kohut, Stephanie Bennett, Darien Martin, Aadila Dosani, Caleb Di Pomponio, Christopher Russell, Bruce Dawson', 'PG', 'As maid of honor, Olivia plans her best friend’s bridal shower at a ranch where handsome rancher Travis shows her that life, and love, could be great on a ranch.', 'As maid of honor, Olivia plans her best friend’s bridal shower at a ranch where handsome rancher Travis shows her that life, and love, could be great on a ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sox6LCMuJsvDQ3U6IkynSasiMb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877824'),
  ('106378370990818764', 'Yennai Arindhaal', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, Dan MacArthur', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon', 'Ajith Kumar, Arun Vijay, Anikha Surendran, Vivek, Anushka Shetty, Trisha Krishnan, Parvatii Nair, Ashish Vidhyarthi', null, 'Sathyadev, who is on a career break, is forced to put on his cop shoes ones again to save Thenmozhi, a young woman who is the target of a criminal organ harvesting group, led by a ghost from his past.', 'Sathyadev, who is on a career break, is forced to put on his cop shoes ones again to save Thenmozhi, a young woman who is the target of a criminal organ harvesting group, led by a ghost from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGQYVXiB16I7pPqQVSGqvgWIMkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300983'),
  ('915239906423868963', 'Yentl', 1983, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'David Watkin, Barbra Streisand, Mirek Lux', 'Barbra Streisand, Jack Rosenthal', 'Barbra Streisand, Mandy Patinkin, Amy Irving, Nehemiah Persoff, Steven Hill, Allan Corduner, Ruth Goring, David de Keyser', 'PG', 'In a time when girls were forbidden to study religious scriptures, a Jewish girl masquerades as a boy to enter religious training and unexpectedly finds love along the way.', 'In a time when girls were forbidden to study religious scriptures, a Jewish girl masquerades as a boy to enter religious training and unexpectedly finds love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcCX4tKqwP5BTfRTQEqZW3qabl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10269'),
  ('23749979610949725', 'Yes', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sally Potter, Alexey Rodionov', 'Sally Potter', 'Joan Allen, Simon Abkarian, Sam Neill, Shirley Henderson, Stephanie Leonidas, Sheila Hancock, Gary Lewis', null, 'She is a scientist. He is a Lebanese doctor. They meet at a banquet and fall into a carefree, passionate relationship. But difficulties abound because of his heritage and her loveless marriage. She flies to Havana to sort things out on the beach and in the cabarets. She sends him a ticket, but harbors no illusions that He will join her in this Caribbean melting pot.', 'She is a scientist. He is a Lebanese doctor. They meet at a banquet and fall into a carefree, passionate relationship. But difficulties abound because of his heritage and her loveless marriage. She flies to Havana to sort things out on the beach and in the cabarets. She sends him a ticket, but harbors no illusions that He will join her in this Caribbean melting pot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70PQCYF3ExuKHqyieJhYV0GJg9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25312'),
  ('425723144018492', 'Yes Boss', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aziz Mirza, Rafiq Lasne, Raaj Kumar Dahima', 'Mangesh Kulkarni', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Aditya Pancholi, Kashmera Shah, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Gulshan Grover, Ashok Saraf, Johny Lever', 'PG', 'Rahul Joshi wants to be a successful businessman so he works hard for his boss Siddharth. One day Rahul meets Seema, an up and coming model, and he feels like he''s finally met his match. Will Seema fall for Rahul?', 'Rahul Joshi wants to be a successful businessman so he works hard for his boss Siddharth. One day Rahul meets Seema, an up and coming model, and he feels like he''s finally met his match. Will Seema fall for Rahul?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayp76lRwyp5izlZVnxcZscgHofH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79982'),
  ('716154302218558941', 'YES DAY', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mike Piccirillo, Shauna Duggins, Miguel Arteta', 'Justin Malen', 'Jennifer Garner, Edgar Ramírez, Jenna Ortega, Julian Lerner, Everly Carganilla, H.E.R., Nat Faxon, Molly Sims', 'PG', 'A mom and dad who usually say no decide to say yes to their kids'' wildest requests — with a few ground rules — on a whirlwind day of fun and adventure.', 'A mom and dad who usually say no decide to say yes to their kids'' wildest requests — with a few ground rules — on a whirlwind day of fun and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rejrD9ovTHJbfmpLM0mbEliEPV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638597'),
  ('478285140311606765', 'Yes Madam 5', 1996, 'Action', 'Lau Shing, Cheung Ging-Nin', 'Yip Siu-Man', 'Cynthia Khan, Chin Siu-Ho, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Chang Hong-Sang, Phillip Ko Fai, Sharon Yeung, Chan Mei-Ngo, James Ha Chim-Si', null, 'A disc with the names of Triad members is taken away, and when the gangsters try and find about where it is, they kill the only person who knows the hiding-place. So, what can be done now to retrieve the disc? The Hong Kong police are looking for the murderer and the disc, but Inspector Yeung has to realize her fiancée Ho Chan is one of the gangsters! The trace of the disappeared disc leads to Malaysia, where the victim''s girlfriend lives...', 'A disc with the names of Triad members is taken away, and when the gangsters try and find about where it is, they kill the only person who knows the hiding-place. So, what can be done now to retrieve the disc? The Hong Kong police are looking for the murderer and the disc, but Inspector Yeung has to realize her fiancée Ho Chan is one of the gangsters! The trace of the disappeared disc leads to Malaysia, where the victim''s girlfriend lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2u6SGY4wxUif87FNG6blDirOxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107500'),
  ('328811023140146991', 'Yes Man', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peyton Reed, Robert D. Yeoman, Todd Amateau', 'Nicholas Stoller, Jarrad Paul, Andrew Mogel', 'Jim Carrey, Zooey Deschanel, Bradley Cooper, John Michael Higgins, Rhys Darby, Danny Masterson, Fionnula Flanagan, Terence Stamp', 'PG-13', 'Carl Allen, a guy whose life is going nowhere, signs up for a self-help program based on one simple covenant: say yes to everything…and anything.', 'Carl Allen, a guy whose life is going nowhere, signs up for a self-help program based on one simple covenant: say yes to everything…and anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Vk2nQF1kY34x53YnWd5zDaTht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10201'),
  ('738965453366711857', 'Yes Nurse! No Nurse!', 2002, 'Comedy, Music', 'Pieter Kramer, Piotr Kukla', null, 'Loes Luca, Tjitske Reidinga, Waldemar Torenstra, Edo Brunner, Lennart Vader, Beppe Costa, Paul Kooij, Paul de Leeuw', null, 'In the guest-house of sister Klivia, the inhabitants are very cheerful and good-hearted persons whose open communal lifestyle is contrasted with the life of somewhat nasty and complaining neighbour Mr Boordevool. Boordevool has spent ages looking for reasons to shut the guest-house. One day a girl from the guest-house meets a nice young guy Gerrit. Sister Klivia lets Gerrit stay regardless of him being a thief. Will that give a chance to the insinuations of the neighbour?', 'In the guest-house of sister Klivia, the inhabitants are very cheerful and good-hearted persons whose open communal lifestyle is contrasted with the life of somewhat nasty and complaining neighbour Mr Boordevool. Boordevool has spent ages looking for reasons to shut the guest-house. One day a girl from the guest-house meets a nice young guy Gerrit. Sister Klivia lets Gerrit stay regardless of him being a thief. Will that give a chance to the insinuations of the neighbour?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pam1zGMb7M2Fy1qhXOQ9LhScASU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21896'),
  ('268522977741000627', 'Yes or No', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Saratswadee Wongsomphet, Ruengwit Ramasoota', 'Nepali', 'Sushar Manaying, Suppanad Jittaleela, Arisara Thongborisut, Soranut Yupanun, Nattharinphon Phrommin, Maneerat Wongsjirasakdi, Puttipong Promsaka Na Sakolnakorn, Chanwut Promsaka Na Sakolnakorn', null, 'Traditional girl Pie is initially uncomfortable with her tomboyish new roommate. But as time goes on, she finds herself increasingly attracted to her.', 'Traditional girl Pie is initially uncomfortable with her tomboyish new roommate. But as time goes on, she finds herself increasingly attracted to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYFANh7Eernv6GEai7YYCcSbaRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64786'),
  ('567151268423245486', 'Yes or No 2', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Saratswadee Wongsomphet, Ruengwit Ramasoota', 'Saratswadee Wongsomphet', 'Sushar Manaying, Suppanad Jittaleela, Sarunthorn Klaiudom, Nattharinphon Phrommin, Maneerat Wongsjirasakdi, Puttipong Promsaka Na Sakolnakorn, Apapattra Meesang, Premprida Sakulsripong', null, 'Kim and Pie are in love, but after graduation they have to travel into two different directions for their internship; Kim is going to work in a farm in the northern province of Nan, while Pie is going South to work in a fishery center. Their love is being tested by the distance between them.', 'Kim and Pie are in love, but after graduation they have to travel into two different directions for their internship; Kim is going to work in a farm in the northern province of Nan, while Pie is going South to work in a fishery center. Their love is being tested by the distance between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e51qvFQu71rkT2taOBmpkMO4t5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132518'),
  ('302321557125160878', 'Yes or No 2.5', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sakchai Siritanakorn, Kirati Nakintanon', 'Melalin Mahavongtrakul', 'Suppanad Jittaleela, Sunanta Yoonniyom, Chansakorn Kittiwattanakorn, Pimpakan Bangchawong, Todsapon Kaenthip, Pijika Jittaputta, Bhawat Yupabhorn, Chindarat Kasuya', null, 'Roommates Wine and Pii find their lives turned upside down when two more ladies move in next door, bringing up past heartaches and new attractions.', 'Roommates Wine and Pii find their lives turned upside down when two more ladies move in next door, bringing up past heartaches and new attractions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1rlx1vG83xFsWVtr1ea8bxuJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367805'),
