  ('644403641100138475', 'Yes Virginia, There Is a Santa Claus', 1991, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Charles Jarrott', 'Andrew J. Fenady, Val De Crowl', 'Richard Thomas, Charles Bronson, Katharine Isabelle, Ed Asner, Tamsin Kelsey, Shawn Macdonald, Garry Chalk, Frank C. Turner', null, 'While newspaper writer Church struggles with the death of his wife, he receives a "special" assignment. He must answer a little girl''s question about whether Santa Claus really exists.', 'While newspaper writer Church struggles with the death of his wife, he receives a "special" assignment. He must answer a little girl''s question about whether Santa Claus really exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crRJySe95iA2cITXjjUSzwKBfoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190879'),
  ('250678562763799136', 'Yes-People', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gísli Darri Halldórsson', 'Gísli Darri Halldórsson', 'Helga Braga Jónsdóttir, Ilmur Kristjánsdóttir, Jón Gnarr, Kristján Franklín Magnús, Sigurður Sigurjónsson, Thorvaldur Kristjansson', null, 'Six people. Living in one building but following different paths. Each gets through the day in their own way – and with their own voice.', 'Six people. Living in one building but following different paths. Each gets through the day in their own way – and with their own voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0Y6zYIhi9M9VB5QCNaEmg69cPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663343'),
  ('57390943313468935', 'Yes, But...', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Yves Lavandier, Pascal Caubère', 'Yves Lavandier', 'Émilie Dequenne, Gérard Jugnot, Alix de Konopka, Cyrille Thouvenin, Vanessa Jarry, Patrick Bonnel, Pierre Bianco, Ahmed Guedayia', null, 'At age 17, Eglantine is troubled by a number of things. Her argumentative parents comprise an absentee and philandering father and an overprotective, occasionally alcoholic mother. Her boyfriend Sébastien is a couple of years older; he''s ready, but she isn''t. Frequent furtive visits to her therapist help her to see that these issues are not ''problems'', but ''difficulties'', which she has the strength to overcome.', 'At age 17, Eglantine is troubled by a number of things. Her argumentative parents comprise an absentee and philandering father and an overprotective, occasionally alcoholic mother. Her boyfriend Sébastien is a couple of years older; he''s ready, but she isn''t. Frequent furtive visits to her therapist help her to see that these issues are not ''problems'', but ''difficulties'', which she has the strength to overcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhYylH1RVlM7WMYzM0EsrnXm90h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64362'),
  ('1037947456708725727', 'Yes, Giorgio', 1982, 'Music, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Norman Steinberg', 'Luciano Pavarotti, Kathryn Harrold, Eddie Albert, Paola Borboni, James Hong, Beulah Quo, Norman Steinberg, Rod Colbin', 'PG', 'A famous opera singer, Giorgio Fini, loses his voice during an American tour. He goes to a female throat specialist, Pamela Taylor, whom he falls in love with.', 'A famous opera singer, Giorgio Fini, loses his voice during an American tour. He goes to a female throat specialist, Pamela Taylor, whom he falls in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tlLS2hbj98C3CnY2BnmE9y4opx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88451'),
  ('655592764451606417', 'Yes, God, Yes', 2017, 'Drama', 'Karen Maine, Jason Shahinfar', 'Karen Maine', 'Natalia Dyer, John Doherty, Joe Reece, Merissa Czyz, Wendy Susan Hammer, Maggie Davolos, Suzanne Lenz, Marc DiFrancesco', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Alice has always been a good Catholic, but when an innocent AOL chat turns unexpectedly racy, she finds herself suddenly obsessed with sex.', 'Fifteen-year-old Alice has always been a good Catholic, but when an innocent AOL chat turns unexpectedly racy, she finds herself suddenly obsessed with sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftR7yM9zfPooU9qnlxvhivesvP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421465'),
  ('544870378670443520', 'Yes, God, Yes', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Karen Maine, Todd Antonio Somodevilla, Jason Shahinfar', 'Karen Maine', 'Natalia Dyer, Timothy Simons, Wolfgang Novogratz, Francesca Reale, Susan Blackwell, Parker Wierling, Alisha Boe, Donna Lynne Champlin', 'R', 'Alice, a young innocent Catholic girl, is tempted into masturbating after an AOL chat suddenly turns sexual, however is conflicted as the act would be considered a sin.', 'Alice, a young innocent Catholic girl, is tempted into masturbating after an AOL chat suddenly turns sexual, however is conflicted as the act would be considered a sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69SYznq2mSbgKyQF3QHYwblmqAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527660'),
  ('843504657514782810', 'Yes, I Do', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Christie Will Wolf', 'Joel Canfield, Lisa Canfield', 'Jen Lilley, Marcus Rosner, Jessica Lowndes, Christie Laing, Rhonda Dent, Mark Brandon, Beau Daniels, Alistair Abell', null, 'Busy chocolatier Charlotte has left her boyfriend James at the altar three times and now she needs to prove to him that she really does want to marry him. Things are complicated when James’ ex-girlfriend Nicole, who is also the owner of Chocolate Monthly Magazine, arrives on the scene and says she wants him back.', 'Busy chocolatier Charlotte has left her boyfriend James at the altar three times and now she needs to prove to him that she really does want to marry him. Things are complicated when James’ ex-girlfriend Nicole, who is also the owner of Chocolate Monthly Magazine, arrives on the scene and says she wants him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGucFJGHeTqrK5Au4rYFzaZ8JIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529250'),
  ('981390021089486496', 'Yes, Madam!', 1985, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Corey Yuen, Chan Yuk-Ming, Ng Hon-Keung', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Michelle Yeoh, Cynthia Rothrock, John Shum Kin-Fun, Mang Hoi, Tsui Hark, James Tien Chun, Dick Wei, Paul Chung Fat', null, 'Two unlucky thieves break into a just murdered man''s hotel room and steal his passport, with a hidden microfilm, wanted by a triad boss. Two ass-kicking women cops—one Chinese, one British—are on the case.', 'Two unlucky thieves break into a just murdered man''s hotel room and steal his passport, with a hidden microfilm, wanted by a triad boss. Two ass-kicking women cops—one Chinese, one British—are on the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KcufMSckdPInz4VAxg3VTpQtDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39448'),
  ('245194159624470567', 'Yes, No, or Maybe?', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Masahiro Takata', 'Masahiro Takata', 'Atsushi Abe, Yoshihisa Kawahara', 'NR', 'A polished newscaster hides behind a mask when he meets a gentle artist—but the lie complicates everything when feelings start to grow.', 'A polished newscaster hides behind a mask when he meets a gentle artist—but the lie complicates everything when feelings start to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPiCFGiDqcAPUYoX96hwitcUScI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719088'),
  ('1047377986092545813', 'Yes, Virginia', 2009, 'Animation, Family', 'Pete Circuitt', 'Chris Plehal', 'Neil Patrick Harris, Bea Miller, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Alfred Molina, Robb Pruitt, Andrew Cherry, Taylor Hay, Michael Buscemi', null, 'New York City, 1897. A little girl named Virginia O''Hanlon loves Christmas more than anything else in the world. When a schoolyard bully challenges her belief in Santa Claus, Virginia embarks on a quest across the city to prove he is real. Based on the true story of the most famous newspaper editorial of all time.', 'New York City, 1897. A little girl named Virginia O''Hanlon loves Christmas more than anything else in the world. When a schoolyard bully challenges her belief in Santa Claus, Virginia embarks on a quest across the city to prove he is real. Based on the true story of the most famous newspaper editorial of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1doADp8CdRDHYMe77BMD02Dkgm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54443'),
  ('306063121611716518', 'Yes, We Fuck!', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Centeno, Raúl de la Morena', null, null, null, 'A documentary that addresses sexuality in people with functional diversity through six real stories which show that sex belongs to everybody. It explores not only what sexuality can do for the people with disabilities, but what functional diversity may contribute to human sexuality. It breaks the pairing dependence-infantilization using explicit images that portray disabled people as sexual and sexed beings and as desiring and desirable bodies.', 'A documentary that addresses sexuality in people with functional diversity through six real stories which show that sex belongs to everybody. It explores not only what sexuality can do for the people with disabilities, but what functional diversity may contribute to human sexuality. It breaks the pairing dependence-infantilization using explicit images that portray disabled people as sexual and sexed beings and as desiring and desirable bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJlD2UCVbKilK5W1Na2BezF8guR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370482'),
  ('719674914514949368', 'Yes, We Have No Bonanza', 1939, 'Comedy, Western', 'Del Lord', 'Elwood Ullman, Searle Kramer', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dick Curtis, Lynton Brent, Suzanne Kaaren, Vernon Dent, Chuck Callahan', 'NR', 'Set in a western town, the stooges are working as waiters in a saloon with the three girls they hope to marry. The proprietor of the saloon is a crook who, with his partner, has buried $40,000 of stolen money. The boys go prospecting in hopes of raising enough money to pay off the debts of their fiancée father, who owes money to their boss. They dig up the stolen money, which the crooks recognize as their loot and abscond with. A wild chase ensues, ending with the bad guy''s car crashing into the Sheriff''s office.', 'Set in a western town, the stooges are working as waiters in a saloon with the three girls they hope to marry. The proprietor of the saloon is a crook who, with his partner, has buried $40,000 of stolen money. The boys go prospecting in hopes of raising enough money to pay off the debts of their fiancée father, who owes money to their boss. They dig up the stolen money, which the crooks recognize as their loot and abscond with. A wild chase ensues, ending with the bad guy''s car crashing into the Sheriff''s office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHGgU0EnJIKmjdv5FELslX5oVk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115924'),
  ('282153683209157688', 'Yes, Yes, Nanette', 1925, 'Comedy', 'Stan Laurel, Clarence Hennecke, Clarence Morehouse', 'Carl Harbaugh', 'James Finlayson, Lyle Tayo, Grant Gorman, Sue O''Neill, Oliver Hardy, Jack Gavin, Pete the Dog, Florence Lee', null, 'Nanette sends a letter to her family telling of her new husband, Hillory. When Hillory arrives to meet the family, he gets insulted by each member, including the dog, and loses his wig. After having dinner with the family, Nanette''s former lover returns, and Hillory must confront him', 'Nanette sends a letter to her family telling of her new husband, Hillory. When Hillory arrives to meet the family, he gets insulted by each member, including the dog, and loses his wig. After having dinner with the family, Nanette''s former lover returns, and Hillory must confront him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp1gm9UOj8jWPkkDViwQw436CQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107296'),
  ('1151601723137793543', 'Yes! Precure 5: The Great Miracle Adventure in the Country of Mirrors', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Emiko Miyamoto, Toshie Kawamura, Tatsuya Nagamine', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Yuko Sanpei, Junko Takeuchi, Mariya Ise, Ai Nagano, Ai Maeda, Eri Sendai, Takeshi Kusao, Miyu Irino', null, 'While Nozomi and her friends are enjoying themselves at Princess Land, an amusement park, Coco and Nuts have been abducted into the Mirror Kingdom. At the same time, Shadow is after the Dream Collet so that he can use the power of the Pinkies to rule the Mirror Kingdom. To prevent this from happening, Migirin and Hidarin, who are residents of the Mirror Kingdom, become allies with Pretty Cure to assist in the fight against Shadow and rescuing Coco and Nuts. Source: Wapedia', 'While Nozomi and her friends are enjoying themselves at Princess Land, an amusement park, Coco and Nuts have been abducted into the Mirror Kingdom. At the same time, Shadow is after the Dream Collet so that he can use the power of the Pinkies to rule the Mirror Kingdom. To prevent this from happening, Migirin and Hidarin, who are residents of the Mirror Kingdom, become allies with Pretty Cure to assist in the fight against Shadow and rescuing Coco and Nuts. Source: Wapedia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3BtPKfq43tkaCq3IJfFp1D21es.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153577'),
  ('766950036207760846', 'Yesenia', 1971, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Julio Alejandro, Yolanda Vargas Dulché', 'Jacqueline Andere, Jorge Lavat, Irma Lozano, Oscar Morelli, Pilar Sen, Isabela Corona, Claudia Martell, Augusto Benedico', null, 'A beautiful gypsy named Yesenia has no set path in life. During a caravan trip she meets Osvaldo who is enrolled in the militia, they both fall in love despite their differences and social prejudices.', 'A beautiful gypsy named Yesenia has no set path in life. During a caravan trip she meets Osvaldo who is enrolled in the militia, they both fall in love despite their differences and social prejudices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivB2OQagK0uRwC9JHHFjTSGSeq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76378'),
  ('301138915861404946', 'Yeshwant', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Anil Mattoo', null, 'Nana Patekar, Madhoo, Atul Agnihotri, Mohan Joshi, Shafi Inamdar, Gavin Packard', null, 'After arresting a drug dealer during an undercover operation, police officer Yeshwant Lohar is framed for murder and imprisoned by his corrupt supervisor, Salim Shaikh, who is involved in distributing narcotics. Determined to prove her husband''s innocence, wife Ragini resists Salim''s attempts to intimidate or bribe her. Salim then releases false photos of Ragini having an affair with police officer Atul, shaking Yeshwant''s faith in his wife.', 'After arresting a drug dealer during an undercover operation, police officer Yeshwant Lohar is framed for murder and imprisoned by his corrupt supervisor, Salim Shaikh, who is involved in distributing narcotics. Determined to prove her husband''s innocence, wife Ragini resists Salim''s attempts to intimidate or bribe her. Salim then releases false photos of Ragini having an affair with police officer Atul, shaking Yeshwant''s faith in his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vqNYrsEHp0m0T1S4GfUwud4Z1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370645'),
  ('482760517146714570', 'Yesterday', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Radosław Piwowarski, Witold Adamek', 'Radosław Piwowarski', 'Piotr Siwkiewicz, Anna Kaźmierczak, Andrzej Zieliński, Krzysztof Majchrzak, Krystyna Feldman, Henryk Bista, Waldemar Ignaczak, Robert Piechota', null, 'Set in the 60''s in a provincial town: four high school teenagers approach graduation, but all they think about are The Beatles.', 'Set in the 60''s in a provincial town: four high school teenagers approach graduation, but all they think about are The Beatles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lZY0Cfl9V63phrfFT5d0yjRYAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273611'),
  ('738263520186248856', 'Yesterday', 1988, 'Drama', 'Ivan Andonov, Krasimir Kostov', 'Ivan Andonov, Vlado Daverov', 'Hristo Shopov, Georgi Staykov, Sofiya Kuzeva, Svetla Todorova, Georgi Rusev, Nikola Rudarov, Stoyan Aleksiev, Krasimir Rankov', null, 'The 1960s was the time of Beatles and Rolling Stones, the time of sexual revolution. These events have their echo in Bulgarian English-learning school. The school order provokes a protest of the students due to the narrow-minded teachers.', 'The 1960s was the time of Beatles and Rolling Stones, the time of sexual revolution. These events have their echo in Bulgarian English-learning school. The school order provokes a protest of the students due to the narrow-minded teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFGJwHaxBV8pVP4SFBY373N5vbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265910'),
  ('830705795374179193', 'Yesterday', 2002, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chong Yun-su, Yeom Hyo-sang', 'Chong Yun-su', 'Kim Seung-woo, Yunjin Kim, Kim Seon-a, Choi Min-soo, Jung Eun-Chan, Jeon Moo-song, Lee Seung-chae, Lee Ho-jae', 'R', 'In 1990, number of children suddenly disappear. Meanwhile, the Ministry of Defense selects an elite group of scientists for a top-secret mission. Then, 30 years later ... The year is 2020 on a reunified Korean Peninsula. A string of murders is committed against retired scientists. The Special Investigations (SI) unit staffed by a crack team from the former North and South Koreas and outfitted with the latest technology is brought in to investigate. The killer, however, far from being deterred, taunts them with a signature pendant at every murder scene. In an act of devilish boldness he even kidnaps the son of the investigation team''s leader, Seok', 'In 1990, number of children suddenly disappear. Meanwhile, the Ministry of Defense selects an elite group of scientists for a top-secret mission. Then, 30 years later ... The year is 2020 on a reunified Korean Peninsula. A string of murders is committed against retired scientists. The Special Investigations (SI) unit staffed by a crack team from the former North and South Koreas and outfitted with the latest technology is brought in to investigate. The killer, however, far from being deterred, taunts them with a signature pendant at every murder scene. In an act of devilish boldness he even kidnaps the son of the investigation team''s leader, Seok', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5arIh7rb08kSW9XjHOrG8DBEbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50575'),
  ('270720336972820819', 'Yesterday', 2004, 'Drama', 'Darrell James Roodt, Michael Swan, Michael Alan Brierley', 'Darrell James Roodt', 'Leleti Khumalo, Kenneth Khambula, Lihle Mvelase, Camilla Walker, Mmamputhi Khasu, Charmaine Kweyama, Aletta Majola, Elliot Makhubo', 'R', 'After falling ill, Yesterday learns that she is HIV positive. With her husband in denial and young daughter to tend to, Yesterday''s one goal is to live long enough to see her child go to school.', 'After falling ill, Yesterday learns that she is HIV positive. With her husband in denial and young daughter to tend to, Yesterday''s one goal is to live long enough to see her child go to school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNCjiLoU1Pg3pgK6jGnFn3R60zE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6934'),
  ('660382431606746981', 'Yesterday', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music, Romance', 'Steven Hall, Seeta Lingam, Jeremy Braben', 'Richard Curtis', 'Himesh Patel, Lily James, Sophia Di Martino, Ellise Chappell, Meera Syal, Harry Michell, Vincent Franklin, Joel Fry', 'PG-13', 'A struggling musician realizes he''s the only person on Earth who can remember The Beatles after waking up in an alternate reality where the group was forgotten.', 'A struggling musician realizes he''s the only person on Earth who can remember The Beatles after waking up in an alternate reality where the group was forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fYka5CQt9nrb6LOtKicysUf9NA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515195'),
  ('673533907152881181', 'Yesterday Girl', 1967, 'Drama', 'Alexander Kluge, Edgar Reitz', 'Alexander Kluge', 'Alexandra Kluge, Günter Mack, Hans Korte, Werner Kreindl, Eva Maria Meineke, Edith Kuntze-Pellogio, Palma Falck, Ado Riegler', null, 'A young German woman searches for happiness, liberation, and independence in the illusive wake of a transformative national recovery.', 'A young German woman searches for happiness, liberation, and independence in the illusive wake of a transformative national recovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNZE31JyFxGWbjgQ3ThAsFtGgfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89785'),
  ('530288251800622032', 'Yesterday Never Ends', 2013, 'Drama', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Javier Cámara, Candela Peña, Tamara Cunill, Carla Sospedra Salvadó, Lucy Tillett', null, 'A couple meets at their son’s grave ten years after his death; his plot is to make way for a casino city. Anger, hatred and bitterness erupt. A nightmarish drama that goes far beyond this couple’s private grief and points towards the end of society.', 'A couple meets at their son’s grave ten years after his death; his plot is to make way for a casino city. Anger, hatred and bitterness erupt. A nightmarish drama that goes far beyond this couple’s private grief and points towards the end of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJnUKTsuW5QfX4CxgTQmi8uOWmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163718'),
  ('751114833421893008', 'Yesterday Once More', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Johnnie To, Pad Chan Wai-Hung, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'The Hermit, Au Kin-Yee', 'Andy Lau, Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Jenny Hu Yan-Ni, Carl Ng Ka-Lung, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Chun Wong, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Teddy Lin Wai-Kin', null, 'Mr. and Mrs. To are wealthy, creative jewel thieves who divorce for no apparent reason after a successful diamond heist. A year later, she''s engaged to the son of a rich woman who begrudgingly lets her son give his fiancée a family heirloom after she signs a pre-nup.', 'Mr. and Mrs. To are wealthy, creative jewel thieves who divorce for no apparent reason after a successful diamond heist. A year later, she''s engaged to the son of a rich woman who begrudgingly lets her son give his fiancée a family heirloom after she signs a pre-nup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAZqexxUU4BUR2dd96eaQirlJeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33840'),
  ('561546789748682711', 'Yesterday Once More', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhou Wencao, Yao Tingting', 'Yao Tingting, Ning Zhong, Bo Tian', 'Bai Jingting, Guo Shutong, Li Hongyi, Wang Herun, Guanlin Ding, Liu Mintao, Liu Yan, Zhang Chaoli', null, 'Lin Tianjiao is the top girl in her school. During one of her tests, she resorted to copying from notes, and is spotted by Gao Xiang, who is considered a wayward student. When the note was discovered by the teacher, Gao Xiang chooses to claim responsibility for trying to cheat. Lin Tianjiao feels apologetic towards Gao Xiang, and begins their friendship. Meanwhile, Lin Tianjiao''s good friend, Lu Tiantian is courting Ou Xiaoyang. However, due to his poor academic standing, Lin Tianjiao ignores him completely. Classmate Huang Tao is secretly in love with Lin Tianjiao, but is too shy to express it. As a result, he and his best buddy, Li Tao are at loggerheads with Gao Xiang.', 'Lin Tianjiao is the top girl in her school. During one of her tests, she resorted to copying from notes, and is spotted by Gao Xiang, who is considered a wayward student. When the note was discovered by the teacher, Gao Xiang chooses to claim responsibility for trying to cheat. Lin Tianjiao feels apologetic towards Gao Xiang, and begins their friendship. Meanwhile, Lin Tianjiao''s good friend, Lu Tiantian is courting Ou Xiaoyang. However, due to his poor academic standing, Lin Tianjiao ignores him completely. Classmate Huang Tao is secretly in love with Lin Tianjiao, but is too shy to express it. As a result, he and his best buddy, Li Tao are at loggerheads with Gao Xiang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCD2cqTRHOw1CdJF91Tw3bWrNLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399460'),
  ('62064152839273733', 'Yesterday Once More', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Gavin Lin', 'Xu Yi', 'Arthur Chen, Zhou Ye, Sun Tianyu, Zhao Xiaotang, Fu Bohan, Luo Yichun', null, 'Gu Yuxuan and Han Shuyan almost had a fated encounter when they were children. After they grew up, the two met again as they are destined to fall in love. After experiencing the happiness and sweetness of love, they had to face the test of fate together. Can the miracle of love keep them together?', 'Gu Yuxuan and Han Shuyan almost had a fated encounter when they were children. After they grew up, the two met again as they are destined to fall in love. After experiencing the happiness and sweetness of love, they had to face the test of fate together. Can the miracle of love keep them together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkzBQDDWfuFUxHdY2G09fbeRXo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094457'),
  ('878699050700488296', 'Yesterday Wonder I Was', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Gabriel Mariño', 'Gabriel Mariño', 'Hoze Meléndez, Siouzana Melikián, Sonia Franco, Rubén Cristiany', null, 'The existence of a lonely figure in Mexico City is slipped uncontrollably throughout bodies every so often, making his essence travel through bodies of men and women. Boredom and hopelessness of this being are faced by the love for Luisa and the need to be with her. He starts a struggle to communicate that love via different faces and bodies until he may be with her in spite of his condition.', 'The existence of a lonely figure in Mexico City is slipped uncontrollably throughout bodies every so often, making his essence travel through bodies of men and women. Boredom and hopelessness of this being are faced by the love for Luisa and the need to be with her. He starts a struggle to communicate that love via different faces and bodies until he may be with her in spite of his condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8pbrkbSsNM24OzhCBRD4ibMfHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483810'),
  ('136087537292150535', 'Yesterday, Today and Tomorrow', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vittorio De Sica, Giuseppe Rotunno, Luisa Alessandri', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Cesare Zavattini, Billa Billa', 'Sophia Loren, Marcello Mastroianni, Aldo Giuffrè, Agostino Salvietti, Lino Mattera, Tecla Scarano, Silvia Monelli, Carlo Croccolo', null, 'Three tales of very different women using their sexuality as a means to getting what they want.', 'Three tales of very different women using their sexuality as a means to getting what they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vydCOfhrnKqMSbYcI0cUkkKuCND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42801'),
  ('929817162078933071', 'Yesterday''s Children', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Marcus Cole, Mary Gough, Steven Tramz', 'Richard Leder, Sarah Bird', 'Jane Seymour, Clancy Brown, Kyle Howard, Denis Conway, Eoin McCarthy, Cillian Caffrey, Stanley Anderson, Claire Bloom', null, 'After having strange dreams, Jenny Cole discovers that in her last incarnation she was Mary Sutton, an Irishwoman who died in the 1930s. Suspicious, Jenny goes to Ireland to investigate her past life.', 'After having strange dreams, Jenny Cole discovers that in her last incarnation she was Mary Sutton, an Irishwoman who died in the 1930s. Suspicious, Jenny goes to Ireland to investigate her past life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w48F7Nxb84q5n2S7XF1zxXlG8jx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81207'),
  ('1089850718667091475', 'Yesterday''s Enemy', 1959, 'War, Drama', 'John Peverall, Val Guest, Arthur Grant', 'Peter R. Newman', 'Stanley Baker, Guy Rolfe, Leo McKern, Gordon Jackson, David Oxley, Richard Pasco, Philip Ahn, Bryan Forbes', 'NR', 'Set during the Burma Campaign of World War 2, this is the story of courage and endurance of the soldiers struggling at close quarters against the enemy. The film examines the moral dilemmas ordinary men face during war, when the definitions of acceptable military action and insupportable brutality become blurred and distorted.', 'Set during the Burma Campaign of World War 2, this is the story of courage and endurance of the soldiers struggling at close quarters against the enemy. The film examines the moral dilemmas ordinary men face during war, when the definitions of acceptable military action and insupportable brutality become blurred and distorted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piYJtlIlOFyDjui7j6NAuywNGbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94135'),
  ('448790023501960972', 'Yesterday''s Target', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Barry Samson, Brian Capener', 'David Bourla', 'Daniel Baldwin, Stacy Haiduk, T.K. Carter, Richard Herd, LeVar Burton, Malcolm McDowell, Frank Birney, Trevor Goddard', 'R', 'Memory loss, separation and assassins threaten three time-travelers with special powers who are stuck in the past.', 'Memory loss, separation and assassins threaten three time-travelers with special powers who are stuck in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbTrT8FGO9DusRDk56Vy2hRw60d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135119'),
  ('735042253013296613', 'Yeti: Curse of the Snow Demon', 2008, 'Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Paul Ziller, Curtis Petersen', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Carly Pope, Ona Grauer, Ed Marinaro, Marc Menard, Adam O''Byrne, Kris Pope, Brandon Jay McLaren', 'NR', 'Surviving the plane crash was only the beginning ... After their plane crashes into uncharted territory in the Himalayas, the survivors set out to find help in the freezing cold. As the days pass and with no sign of a rescue, tensions begin to mount. The survivors wrestle with their consciences as they realise that in order to survive, they must use the bodies of the dead as food. But when it appears that something else is already feeding upon the dead, the survivors realise that their biggest danger is not hunger but something infinitely more sinister: a legendary Yeti is stalking them and is moving in for the kill. Can they outsmart the beast or will they die trying?', 'Surviving the plane crash was only the beginning ... After their plane crashes into uncharted territory in the Himalayas, the survivors set out to find help in the freezing cold. As the days pass and with no sign of a rescue, tensions begin to mount. The survivors wrestle with their consciences as they realise that in order to survive, they must use the bodies of the dead as food. But when it appears that something else is already feeding upon the dead, the survivors realise that their biggest danger is not hunger but something infinitely more sinister: a legendary Yeti is stalking them and is moving in for the kill. Can they outsmart the beast or will they die trying?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtHGZ525XUnEybYfHoGjxmcfnyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53245'),
  ('1015554156495879629', 'Yeti: The Giant of the 20th Century', 1977, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Mystery, Crime, Fantasy', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Mario Di Nardo', 'Antonella Interlenghi, Mimmo Crao, Jim Sullivan, Tony Kendall, Edoardo Faieta, John Stacy, Donald O''Brien, Aldo Canti', null, 'Professor Wassermann is asked by industry magnate Morgan Hunnicut to lead an expedition to study the giant Yeti creature found frozen in a large ice block on Newfoundland''s coast. The professor does not know that Hunnicut intends to use the prehistoric creature as a trademark of its multinational industrial group. A very big mistake.', 'Professor Wassermann is asked by industry magnate Morgan Hunnicut to lead an expedition to study the giant Yeti creature found frozen in a large ice block on Newfoundland''s coast. The professor does not know that Hunnicut intends to use the prehistoric creature as a trademark of its multinational industrial group. A very big mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiGY4EXnz2kKXKoO1WOJLGW2jNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92316'),
  ('1079657231804463832', 'Yevadu', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Vamshi Paidipally, Chota K. Naidu', 'Vamshi Paidipally, Vakkantham Vamsi', 'Ram Charan, Sai Kumar, Jayasudha, Shruti Haasan, Amy Jackson, Allu Arjun, Kajal Aggarwal, Brahmanandam', null, 'Satya is given a different face after he suffers burn-related injuries. After being released from the hospital, he deals with the murderer of his lover Deepti. But his new face has given him new foes.', 'Satya is given a different face after he suffers burn-related injuries. After being released from the hospital, he deals with the murderer of his lover Deepti. But his new face has given him new foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zU68BHsIPHqhFRXwI3qnT4rnlAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215248'),
  ('508327879364261692', 'Yevdokiya', 1961, 'Drama', 'Tatyana Lioznova, Pyotr Kataev, Iosif Martov', 'Vera Panova', 'Lyudmila Khityaeva, Nikolai Lebedev, Lyubov Basova, Olga Narovchatova, Alevtina Rumyantseva, Yuri Akhmadulin, Yevgeni Anufriyev, Aleksandr Barsov', null, 'On the outskirts of the provincial town, Yevdokim and Yevdokiya live, raising foster children. Yevdokim works at a factory, Yevdokiya is a housewife. The family seems to be safe and happy: the only trouble is that Yevdokiya cannot forget the love of her youth. This Yevdokim cannot stand and offers Yevdokiya freedom, while he will remain with the children. But all these contradictions are drowned in mutual love for children and for each other.', 'On the outskirts of the provincial town, Yevdokim and Yevdokiya live, raising foster children. Yevdokim works at a factory, Yevdokiya is a housewife. The family seems to be safe and happy: the only trouble is that Yevdokiya cannot forget the love of her youth. This Yevdokim cannot stand and offers Yevdokiya freedom, while he will remain with the children. But all these contradictions are drowned in mutual love for children and for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wzwYyqt26HPEaphJeUmlp4VVtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273120'),
  ('774365044165428007', 'Yggdrasill: Whose Roots Are Stars in the Human Mind', 1997, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This film, a combination of hand-painting and photography, is a fulsome exposition of the themes of DOG STAR MAN. In that early epic I had envisioned The World Tree as dead, fit only for firewood; and at end of DOG STAR MAN I had chopped it up amidst a flurry of stars (finally Cassiopia''s Chair): now, these many years later, I am compelled to comprehend YGGDRASILL as rooted in the complex electrical synapses of thought process, to sense it being alive today as when nordic legendry hatched it. I share this compulsion with Andrei Tarkovsky, whose last film The Sacrifice struggles to revive The World Tree narratively, whereas I simply present (one might almost say "document") a moving graph approximate to my thought process, whereby The Tree roots itself as the stars we, reflectively, are.', 'This film, a combination of hand-painting and photography, is a fulsome exposition of the themes of DOG STAR MAN. In that early epic I had envisioned The World Tree as dead, fit only for firewood; and at end of DOG STAR MAN I had chopped it up amidst a flurry of stars (finally Cassiopia''s Chair): now, these many years later, I am compelled to comprehend YGGDRASILL as rooted in the complex electrical synapses of thought process, to sense it being alive today as when nordic legendry hatched it. I share this compulsion with Andrei Tarkovsky, whose last film The Sacrifice struggles to revive The World Tree narratively, whereas I simply present (one might almost say "document") a moving graph approximate to my thought process, whereby The Tree roots itself as the stars we, reflectively, are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0tYRhY1mJMpB3XwshpxpuUHdt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164609'),
  ('493162133624650507', 'Yield to the Night', 1956, 'Drama, Crime', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gilbert Taylor, Harold V. King', 'Frederick Gotfurt', 'Diana Dors, Yvonne Mitchell, Michael Craig, Marie Ney, Geoffrey Keen, Liam Redmond, Olga Lindo, Joan Miller', 'NR', 'Locked in her cell, a murderer reflects on the events that have led her to death row.', 'Locked in her cell, a murderer reflects on the events that have led her to death row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2M9Ivv0PklA0LpUTKxrWCPqW6Iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20806'),
  ('469316470489400852', 'Yippie', 1968, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Abbie Hoffman, Allen Ginsberg', null, 'Allen Ginsberg, Abbie Hoffman, Richard J. Daley', null, 'The Youth International Party, whose members were commonly called Yippies, was a radically youth-oriented and countercultural revolutionary group opposed to war and the status quo of American culture. Known for using theatrics and humor to advocate social change, several Yippies were notably on trial as the Chicago 7. Primarily consisting of footage from the 1968 Democratic National Convention in Chicago which sparked massive demonstrations that were met by violence and hysteria caused by the police. This film also includes found newsreel footage as well as Pigasus - the pig the Yippies advanced as a candidate for President of the United States.', 'The Youth International Party, whose members were commonly called Yippies, was a radically youth-oriented and countercultural revolutionary group opposed to war and the status quo of American culture. Known for using theatrics and humor to advocate social change, several Yippies were notably on trial as the Chicago 7. Primarily consisting of footage from the 1968 Democratic National Convention in Chicago which sparked massive demonstrations that were met by violence and hysteria caused by the police. This film also includes found newsreel footage as well as Pigasus - the pig the Yippies advanced as a candidate for President of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HiJWgeMJIc87yj7cB88aQONpJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148048'),
  ('23068667557978685', 'YMCA Baseball Team', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Kim Hyun-seok, Han Choul-hee, Park Hyeon-cheol', 'Kim Hyun-seok', 'Song Kang-ho, Kim Hye-soo, Kim Joo-hyuk, Hwang Jung-min, Lee Dae-yeon, Kim Il-woong, Ha Deok-bu, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'Hochang accidentally sees missionaries and Jeongrim play baseball at the YMCA hall. He falls in love with Jeongrim, and takes interest in baseball. As a result, he gathers people to form the first YMCA baseball team of Joseon.', 'Hochang accidentally sees missionaries and Jeongrim play baseball at the YMCA hall. He falls in love with Jeongrim, and takes interest in baseball. As a result, he gathers people to form the first YMCA baseball team of Joseon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTP11kretJD4eLlFmFBbOTRXprU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120244'),
  ('114770160226343663', 'Yo hice a Roque III', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Raúl Artigot', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Andrés Pajares, Fernando Esteso, Antonio Ozores, Florinda Chico, Mirta Miller, Narciso Ibáñez Menta, Loreta Tovar, Belinda Corel', null, 'Third Roque Gonzalez is a freeloader who lives with his friend Federico, famous ex-jockey who is now racing in hours after low fat. Federico can not shake off Roque, as it constantly reminds that when they were seven, saved his life. The thing is that Frederic attends a gym with the hope of returning to thin enough to ride again, and learns that there Botija Kid, the champion of Spain in the welterweights, need to stake his title to qualify for the European Championship boxing. But of course, nobody wants to take a beating the champion, despite offering her coach bag. Among Paco, the owner of the gym, and Frederick, Roque to get rolling, deceived, you agree to fight the champion ... Parody of the popular movie "Rocky."', 'Third Roque Gonzalez is a freeloader who lives with his friend Federico, famous ex-jockey who is now racing in hours after low fat. Federico can not shake off Roque, as it constantly reminds that when they were seven, saved his life. The thing is that Frederic attends a gym with the hope of returning to thin enough to ride again, and learns that there Botija Kid, the champion of Spain in the welterweights, need to stake his title to qualify for the European Championship boxing. But of course, nobody wants to take a beating the champion, despite offering her coach bag. Among Paco, the owner of the gym, and Frederick, Roque to get rolling, deceived, you agree to fight the champion ... Parody of the popular movie "Rocky."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6LG3xaejVB7c6dUyC0BqVw9ppZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120501'),
  ('1060131917034563061', 'Yo Mama', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Leïla Sy, Amadou Mariko, Nicolas Borowsky', 'Leïla Sy, Jean-Pascal Zadi', 'Sophie-Marie Larrouy, Claudia Tagbo, Zaho, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Ted Etienne, Diamadoua Sissoko, Abdelmadjid Guemri, Yanis Salliot', null, 'Three housewives decide to get into rap music with an explosive videoclip, in order to reconnect with their 11 years old sons. Against all odds, they find success and they are overwhelmed by theit sudden fame in this strange world...', 'Three housewives decide to get into rap music with an explosive videoclip, in order to reconnect with their 11 years old sons. Against all odds, they find success and they are overwhelmed by theit sudden fame in this strange world...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm4mtRlPy6X18PuX1djEpHSPUgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998582'),
  ('524176950589054406', 'Yo quiero ser mala', 1950, 'Romance, Comedy', 'René Cardona, Ezequiel Carrasco, Luis Abbadie', null, 'María Elena Marqués, Abel Salazar, Óscar Pulido, Queta Lavat, Aurora Walker, Luis Mussot, José Pulido, Amparo Arozamena', null, 'In this Romantic-Comedy from Director Rene Cardona, Actress Maria Elena Marques plays a hard-living woman named Leticia, who suffers from a recently broken heart after being deceived by her ex-boyfriend. Soured on anything to do with love and while drinking away her sorrows, she sets out to marry the very first man she sees. This man just happens to be a nice guy named Roberto, (Abel Salazar). Although the pair''s mutual attraction to each other is obvious, Roberto has no idea what he is in for, and he soon proposes. Not long after the marriage, Leticia starts to take advantage of both Roberto and her new Father-in-Law (played by Oscar Pulido), who shows kindness towards the girl. Predictably, marital bliss soon turns into discord, and the couple agree to divorce after a year passes. Their love-hate relationship and pending break-up provides a perfect backdrop for several comedic situations before the two realize that they are actually in love.', 'In this Romantic-Comedy from Director Rene Cardona, Actress Maria Elena Marques plays a hard-living woman named Leticia, who suffers from a recently broken heart after being deceived by her ex-boyfriend. Soured on anything to do with love and while drinking away her sorrows, she sets out to marry the very first man she sees. This man just happens to be a nice guy named Roberto, (Abel Salazar). Although the pair''s mutual attraction to each other is obvious, Roberto has no idea what he is in for, and he soon proposes. Not long after the marriage, Leticia starts to take advantage of both Roberto and her new Father-in-Law (played by Oscar Pulido), who shows kindness towards the girl. Predictably, marital bliss soon turns into discord, and the couple agree to divorce after a year passes. Their love-hate relationship and pending break-up provides a perfect backdrop for several comedic situations before the two realize that they are actually in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWzmwKaInQBGWLYXWjCkWgdoecR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673876'),
  ('221866578379398302', 'Yo-kai Watch Shadowside: The Return of the Oni King', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Akira Takeuchi, Kyoko Niimura, Shinji Ushiro', 'Akihiro Hino, Akihiro Hino', 'Mone Kamishiraishi, Yudai Chiba, Mutsumi Tamura, Tomokazu Seki, Takaya Kuroda, Daisuke Hirakawa, Ryohei Kimura, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'When a meteor is about to approach Earth, Summer Adams, Cole and Bruno meet up and work together to stop the Onimaro invasion with the power of a new Yo-kai Watch and Yo-kai that can change between Lightside and Shadowside forms.', 'When a meteor is about to approach Earth, Summer Adams, Cole and Bruno meet up and work together to stop the Onimaro invasion with the power of a new Yo-kai Watch and Yo-kai that can change between Lightside and Shadowside forms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsd50CLuSsPwY609LNhN9bKKygm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545841'),
  ('92824349674791369', 'Yo-kai Watch The Movie 2: Lord Enma and the Stories, Nyan!', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Shigeharu Takahashi, Shinji Ushiro, Shinsuke Terasawa', 'Yoichi Kato, Akihiro Hino', 'Haruka Tomatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Etsuko Kozakura, Aoi Yuuki, Kotori Shigemoto, Yuki Kaji, Ryohei Kimura, Chiemi Hori', null, 'When Keita frees Whisper, a ghost-like yōkai, from 190 years of imprisonment, Whisper pledges to protect Keita from supernatural dangers. Whisper also gives Keita a watch that allows Keita to see other yōkai. Together with the twin-tailed cat spirit Jibanyan, they encounter lots of yōkai-related problems and solve them.', 'When Keita frees Whisper, a ghost-like yōkai, from 190 years of imprisonment, Whisper pledges to protect Keita from supernatural dangers. Whisper also gives Keita a watch that allows Keita to see other yōkai. Together with the twin-tailed cat spirit Jibanyan, they encounter lots of yōkai-related problems and solve them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHM16IGtPOjOiyERNsIukGQhWPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412869'),
  ('474198011441247025', 'Yo-kai Watch: Friends Forever', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Shunya Yamada, Akira Takeuchi, Shinsuke Terasawa', 'Akihiro Hino', 'Ryohei Kimura, Atsumi Tanezaki, Nao Toyama, Etsuko Kozakura, Takehito Koyasu, Tomokazu Seki, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Shun Oguri', null, 'The film tells the story of interweaving friendships between three children and yo-kai. The film is set in 1960s Tokyo, in Sakura Motomachi. A boy named Shin lives a poor but happy life. When his mother — his only family member — dies, Shin''s unhappiness hits rock bottom. That is when another boy named Itsuki saves Shin. Itsuki has also lost his older sister. Shin, Itsuki, and a young girl named Tae who can see yo-kai all become friends. Shin''s guardian spirit Suu-san, a "Nekomata" cat, and other new yo-kai join their group, and this group is able to regain what it means to have a precious family. This new family must now face a mysterious incident, and a shocking reality awaits them.', 'The film tells the story of interweaving friendships between three children and yo-kai. The film is set in 1960s Tokyo, in Sakura Motomachi. A boy named Shin lives a poor but happy life. When his mother — his only family member — dies, Shin''s unhappiness hits rock bottom. That is when another boy named Itsuki saves Shin. Itsuki has also lost his older sister. Shin, Itsuki, and a young girl named Tae who can see yo-kai all become friends. Shin''s guardian spirit Suu-san, a "Nekomata" cat, and other new yo-kai join their group, and this group is able to regain what it means to have a precious family. This new family must now face a mysterious incident, and a shocking reality awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9og4mdprkXaFyMtAjWZOCp4nE4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550104'),
  ('1087756624037121850', 'Yo-kai Watch: The Movie', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Hiroko Oguri, Chizuko Kusakabe, Satoshi Nakano', 'Yoichi Kato', 'Haruka Tomatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Etsuko Kozakura, Romi Park, Yuki Kaji, Ainosuke Kataoka, Vanilla Yamazaki, Mika Kanai', null, 'When the evil Yo-Kai Kin, Gin and Bronzlow makes the Yo-Kai Watch disappear from time so they can help Dame Dedtime prevent humans and Yo-Kai from being friends, Nate Adams finds help in the Yo-Kai Hovernyan, who takes Nate, Whisper and Jibanyan 60 years to the past, when the Yo-Kai Watch was first invented by Nate''s grandfather, Nathaniel Adams, while he was a boy. Together, the 2 boys fight Dame Dedtime and her evil Wicked Yo-Kai minions to save the world from her evil plans.', 'When the evil Yo-Kai Kin, Gin and Bronzlow makes the Yo-Kai Watch disappear from time so they can help Dame Dedtime prevent humans and Yo-Kai from being friends, Nate Adams finds help in the Yo-Kai Hovernyan, who takes Nate, Whisper and Jibanyan 60 years to the past, when the Yo-Kai Watch was first invented by Nate''s grandfather, Nathaniel Adams, while he was a boy. Together, the 2 boys fight Dame Dedtime and her evil Wicked Yo-Kai minions to save the world from her evil plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10o6WvilSGr6UhOEjiYf8Xed7JE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358651'),
  ('735841213359529211', 'Yo-kai Watch: The Movie - The Great Adventure of the Flying Whale & the Double World, Meow!', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Shinji Ushiro, Takeshi Yokoi, Kyouko Takeuchi', 'Yoichi Kato, Akihiro Hino', 'Haruka Tomatsu, Tomokazu Seki, Etsuko Kozakura, Aya Endo, Ryoka Minamide, Minami Hamabe, Yuina Kuroshima, Yu Sawabe', null, 'A giant whale appears and flies above Sakura New Town. With the whale’s sound of crying, some changes occur to Kenta Amano and Yokai.', 'A giant whale appears and flies above Sakura New Town. With the whale’s sound of crying, some changes occur to Kenta Amano and Yokai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiVQhYmFW5GXw0fsPZ5hgCdDzZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433145'),
  ('223749813304531540', 'Yo-Yo Girl Cop', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Shibayama Nobuhiro, Kenta Fukasaku, Takashi Komatsu', null, 'Aya Matsuura, Rika Ishikawa, Erika Miyoshi, Yui Okada, Yuki Saito, Tak Sakaguchi, Hiroyuki Nagato, Shunsuke Kubozuka', null, 'Recruited by a clandestine police organization, "K" must stop a plot by student radicals to create anarchy in Japan. Armed with a hi-tech steel yo-yo, and a new name (Asamiya Saki), she must infiltrate an elite high school to find the terrorists but finds an even more sinister plan is about to unfold.', 'Recruited by a clandestine police organization, "K" must stop a plot by student radicals to create anarchy in Japan. Armed with a hi-tech steel yo-yo, and a new name (Asamiya Saki), she must infiltrate an elite high school to find the terrorists but finds an even more sinister plan is about to unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atuLBXMZmLljTVIoZAhsa1XzXkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16851'),
  ('4522851311973610', 'Yo-Yo Sexy Girl Cop', 2006, 'Action, Crime', 'Daigo Udagawa', 'Daigo Udagawa', 'Mihiro, Haruki Jo, Seiji Nakamitsu, Rio Nakamura, Shou Nishino, Naoya Ohshima, Ikko Suzuki, Yūken Yoshida', null, 'A beautiful "special student undercover cop" attends a prestigious high school in order to bust up a student prostitution ring in this sexy spoof of the popular Yo-Yo Girl Cop series. Saki (Mihiro) may look like you''re average innocent schoolgirl, but in reality she''s a highly skilled agent for the Japanese government. Armed with a lethal yo-yo and a special pair of see through underwear, Saki befriends a student prostitute named Asuka in hopes of identifying of the ringleaders and gathering the evidence that will bring them to justice. Accomplishing that goal is no simple task, however, because in addition to being bullied about her unconventional undergarments, Saki soon finds herself falling for handsome young classmate Takuya. Now torn between love and duty, Saki is shocked to learn that Asuka has been murdered after her double life was discovered, and that the leaders of the prostitution are none other than the Headmaster of the school and a highly respected teacher.', 'A beautiful "special student undercover cop" attends a prestigious high school in order to bust up a student prostitution ring in this sexy spoof of the popular Yo-Yo Girl Cop series. Saki (Mihiro) may look like you''re average innocent schoolgirl, but in reality she''s a highly skilled agent for the Japanese government. Armed with a lethal yo-yo and a special pair of see through underwear, Saki befriends a student prostitute named Asuka in hopes of identifying of the ringleaders and gathering the evidence that will bring them to justice. Accomplishing that goal is no simple task, however, because in addition to being bullied about her unconventional undergarments, Saki soon finds herself falling for handsome young classmate Takuya. Now torn between love and duty, Saki is shocked to learn that Asuka has been murdered after her double life was discovered, and that the leaders of the prostitution are none other than the Headmaster of the school and a highly respected teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAYcM6G1GNOWTRDP24pS1flHTzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50133'),
  ('939332065163397692', 'Yobi, The Five-Tailed Fox', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lee Sung-gang, Ryu Jung-oo', 'Lee Sung-gang', 'Son Ye-jin, Ryu Deok-hwan, Gong Hyung-jin, Lee Jong-gu, Lee Hyang-sook, Choi Do-yeong, Lee Hyun-joo, Kim So-hyeong', null, 'After losing her family to fox hunters, five-tailed Yobi lives in the forest with some shipwrecked aliens, far away from the humans. When one of her alien friends gets captured by a villager, Yobi has no choice but to adventure into the human world to rescue him. At the village, Yobi meets many humans, including Geum Yee who studies at a school for maladjusted children. Interested in Geum Yee, Yobi joins the students and revels in the fun of human life, but both a fox hunter and a mysterious shadow man are on her trail.', 'After losing her family to fox hunters, five-tailed Yobi lives in the forest with some shipwrecked aliens, far away from the humans. When one of her alien friends gets captured by a villager, Yobi has no choice but to adventure into the human world to rescue him. At the village, Yobi meets many humans, including Geum Yee who studies at a school for maladjusted children. Interested in Geum Yee, Yobi joins the students and revels in the fun of human life, but both a fox hunter and a mysterious shadow man are on her trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MSJ9rpaHvxCJLBmWpkoaRCW0nU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58700'),
  ('780162904140716859', 'Yoddha', 1992, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Sangeeth Sivan, Santosh Sivan', 'Sasidharan Arattuvazhi', 'Mohanlal, Siddharth Lama, Madhoo, Jagathy Sreekumar, Puneet Issar, Urvashi, M S Thrippunithura, Oduvil Unnikrishnan', null, 'Fate brings a young man from rural Kerala to be the protector of a young Lama in Nepal, who is being chased by a dangerous cult.', 'Fate brings a young man from rural Kerala to be the protector of a young Lama in Nepal, who is being chased by a dangerous cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gff3TrVV2QMdPA9oow4vpkOBYBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210737'),
  ('338429753305681192', 'Yodeling Yokels', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko and Honey yodel happily in the Alps until a series of disasters end with Honey rushing downriver on an ice floe.', 'Bosko and Honey yodel happily in the Alps until a series of disasters end with Honey rushing downriver on an ice floe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMkJQwgl1Mkd3cy2BnaznmfRP1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162676'),
  ('71754122270844303', 'Yodha', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Pushkar Ojha, Sagar Ambre', 'Sagar Ambre', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Raashii Khanna, Disha Patani, Sunny Hinduja, Tanuj Virwani, Shivangi Bhardwaj, Chittaranjan Tripathy, Mikhail Yawalkar', null, 'When terrorists hijack a passenger plane, a suspended commando onboard under mysterious circumstances, crafts a plan to thwart the hijackers and safeguard the passengers'' survival despite the engine''s failure.', 'When terrorists hijack a passenger plane, a suspended commando onboard under mysterious circumstances, crafts a plan to thwart the hijackers and safeguard the passengers'' survival despite the engine''s failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkCRwuWgrkGTya4vLqwFugwSqeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899718'),
  ('606713367618082836', 'Yoga', 2009, 'Horror', 'Yun Jae-yeon, Jay Seung Jaegal, Park Jun-gyu', 'Yun Jae-yeon', 'Eugene, Cha Soo-yeon, Cho Eun-ji, Park Han-byul, Kim Hye-na, Rie Young-zin, Hwang Seung-eon, Lee Hye-sang', null, 'After being replaced by a younger coworker, TV host Hyo-jeong enrolls in an intensive yoga course that has serious consequences for anyone who fails to follow its rules.', 'After being replaced by a younger coworker, TV host Hyo-jeong enrolls in an intensive yoga course that has serious consequences for anyone who fails to follow its rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Jv2Kcimluzr9ngjQNlw09DKH7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50458'),
  ('709662279949849519', 'Yoga Hosers', 2016, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Action', 'Kevin Smith, James Laxton', 'Kevin Smith', 'Lily-Rose Depp, Harley Quinn Smith, Natasha Lyonne, Adam Brody, Vanessa Paradis, Ashley McCauley, Justin Long, Ralph Garman', 'PG-13', 'Two teenage yoga enthusiasts team up with a legendary man-hunter to battle with an ancient evil presence that is threatening their major party plans.', 'Two teenage yoga enthusiasts team up with a legendary man-hunter to battle with an ancient evil presence that is threatening their major party plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc40P3lKEiK0H8ZSd8hmBBI0HEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290825'),
  ('364825701827550131', 'Yogi and the Invasion of the Space Bears', 1988, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Don Lusk, Ray Patterson', 'Neal Barbera', 'Daws Butler, Don Messick, Julie Bennett, Susan Blu, Peter Cullen, Townsend Coleman, Rob Paulsen, Linda Harmon', 'G', 'Yogi Bear and Boo-Boo discover aliens who plan to conquer Earth.', 'Yogi Bear and Boo-Boo discover aliens who plan to conquer Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkk9royHvqPUiXKXslKJnfsSJ5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269735'),
  ('538243065729805421', 'Yogi Bear', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Eric Brevig, Peter James', 'Joshua Sternin, Brad Copeland, Jennifer Ventimilia', 'Dan Aykroyd, Justin Timberlake, Anna Faris, Tom Cavanagh, T.J. Miller, Nate Corddry, Andy Daly, David Stott', 'PG', 'A documentary filmmaker travels to Jellystone Park to shoot a project and soon crosses paths with Yogi Bear, his sidekick Boo-Boo, and Ranger Smith.', 'A documentary filmmaker travels to Jellystone Park to shoot a project and soon crosses paths with Yogi Bear, his sidekick Boo-Boo, and Ranger Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5u6kGhqKVorNwcvz6zETWUPRmus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41515'),
  ('145619971047847561', 'Yogi Bear and the Magical Flight of the Spruce Goose', 1987, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ray Patterson, John Kimball, Oscar Dufau', 'Dennis Marks', 'Daws Butler, Dave Coulier, Don Messick, Marilyn Schreffler, John Stephenson, Frank Welker, Paul Winchell, William Woodson', 'NR', 'Yogi and the gang mistakenly board the famous Howard Hughes'' plane The Spruce Goose. They accidentally start the plane, so they decide to take it for a spin, helping animals and people along the way.', 'Yogi and the gang mistakenly board the famous Howard Hughes'' plane The Spruce Goose. They accidentally start the plane, so they decide to take it for a spin, helping animals and people along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42g6caqNpYVe1AbXHJCAiOYMFqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174405'),
  ('1135133782859503906', 'Yogi Bear''s All-Star Comedy Christmas Caper', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Geoff Collins, Steve Lumley', null, 'Daws Butler, Mel Blanc, Henry Corden, Georgi Irene, Allan Melvin, Don Messick, Hal Smith, John Stephenson', null, 'Yogi escapes from Jellystone and hides out in a department store - posing as the Store''s Santa. Along the way, he helps a little girl to rediscover her faith in Christmas.', 'Yogi escapes from Jellystone and hides out in a department store - posing as the Store''s Santa. Along the way, he helps a little girl to rediscover her faith in Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a081hLVIroLDv434FgzwKzNh6vA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49245'),
  ('719964182548422262', 'Yogi the Easter Bear', 1994, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Robert Alvarez, Hawley Pratt, Kris Zimmerman', null, 'Greg Burson, Don Messick, Charlie Adler, Rob Paulsen, Jeff Doucette, Gregg Berger, Jonathan Winters, Ed Gilbert', null, 'Ranger Smith arranges a truckload of candy for the Park’s Easter celebaration, and Yogi helps himself to the entire truck. To fix things, Boo Boo and Yogi set off to find the real Easter Bunny, who has been kidnapped. It''s up to Yogi and Boo Boo to save the Easter Bunny and Ranger Smith''s reputation!', 'Ranger Smith arranges a truckload of candy for the Park’s Easter celebaration, and Yogi helps himself to the entire truck. To fix things, Boo Boo and Yogi set off to find the real Easter Bunny, who has been kidnapped. It''s up to Yogi and Boo Boo to save the Easter Bunny and Ranger Smith''s reputation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Rc8bzPibNKKm20bW0cic4Rpdbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62434'),
  ('158262647497835320', 'Yogi''s Ark Lark', 1972, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Daws Butler, Henry Corden, Walker Edmiston, Allan Melvin, Don Messick, John Stephenson, Jean Vander Pyl, Lennie Weinrib', null, 'Yogi, Boo Boo and many of his friends including Huckleberry Hound, Snagglepuss, Magilla Gorilla among others decide to build an ark to look for the mythical Perfect Place which is peaceful and hasn''t been affected by man and pollution. They hire the Jellystone''s janitor Noah Smith to act as captain and travel throughout the world looking for such a place. Even though they think every place they land is a "Perfect place", they soon find out that there is definitely no place like home.', 'Yogi, Boo Boo and many of his friends including Huckleberry Hound, Snagglepuss, Magilla Gorilla among others decide to build an ark to look for the mythical Perfect Place which is peaceful and hasn''t been affected by man and pollution. They hire the Jellystone''s janitor Noah Smith to act as captain and travel throughout the world looking for such a place. Even though they think every place they land is a "Perfect place", they soon find out that there is definitely no place like home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4hb56ik6Fuj4GUhoHY3hBqMZ9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531754'),
  ('991746480282493581', 'Yogi''s First Christmas', 1980, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Gerry Chiniquy, Hawley Pratt, Gerard Baldwin', null, 'Daws Butler, Janet Waldo, Hal Smith, Don Messick, Marilyn Schreffler, John Stephenson, Sue Allen, John Richard Bolks', null, 'Businesswoman Sophie Throckmorton plans to sell the Jellystone Lodge, devastating the regular guests – including Huckleberry Hound, Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy, and Snagglepuss – and it''s up to Ranger Smith, manager Mr. Dingwell, and the newly awake Yogi, Boo Boo and Cindy keep the Christmas spirit alive amidst the mischievous attempts of two villains to ruin the fun.', 'Businesswoman Sophie Throckmorton plans to sell the Jellystone Lodge, devastating the regular guests – including Huckleberry Hound, Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy, and Snagglepuss – and it''s up to Ranger Smith, manager Mr. Dingwell, and the newly awake Yogi, Boo Boo and Cindy keep the Christmas spirit alive amidst the mischievous attempts of two villains to ruin the fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drUigP4dcVx4I3ZZpo2zzSO6CJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45851'),
  ('357957133248959371', 'Yogi''s Great Escape', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie, Comedy, Western', 'Bob Goe, Paul Sommer, Rudy Zamora', 'Neal Barbera', 'Daws Butler, Susan Blu, William Callaway, Hamilton Camp, Dustin Diamond, Pat Fraley, Edan Gross, Tress MacNeille', null, 'One spring, Yogi Bear and Boo Boo Bear awake from hibernation to discover three orphaned bear cubs left at the front door of their cave. Despite their initial reservations, Yogi and Boo Boo take the bear cubs into their home and take care of them. Meanwhile, Jellystone Park has gone over budget and the park commissioner orders Ranger Smith to close it down. This means that Yogi, along with the other bears at the park, must be sent to a zoo. Because Yogi can''t stand the thought of being cooped up in a zoo for the rest of his life, he hatches an elaborate escape plan. Salvaging car parts from a failed fishing expedition, he constructs a getaway "Supercar," complete with a picnic basket rumble seat for the three orphaned cubs. Together they make their escape from the park to find a new home.', 'One spring, Yogi Bear and Boo Boo Bear awake from hibernation to discover three orphaned bear cubs left at the front door of their cave. Despite their initial reservations, Yogi and Boo Boo take the bear cubs into their home and take care of them. Meanwhile, Jellystone Park has gone over budget and the park commissioner orders Ranger Smith to close it down. This means that Yogi, along with the other bears at the park, must be sent to a zoo. Because Yogi can''t stand the thought of being cooped up in a zoo for the rest of his life, he hatches an elaborate escape plan. Salvaging car parts from a failed fishing expedition, he constructs a getaway "Supercar," complete with a picnic basket rumble seat for the three orphaned cubs. Together they make their escape from the park to find a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4s201ANFITtjdgAgesqnnjEZB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108862'),
  ('849087983070389511', 'Yogida', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Goutham Krishna, S. K. Boopathy', 'Goutham Krishna', 'Sai Dhanshika, Kabir Duhan Singh, Sayaji Shinde', null, 'A female police officer embarks on an anti-corruption mission in her town, confronting criminals through various means including unconventional fighting methods.', 'A female police officer embarks on an anti-corruption mission in her town, confronting criminals through various means including unconventional fighting methods.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqG8xiHPIJJqdH9WKpZXaeOaiouk.jpg', 'plex:movie:yogi-da'),
  ('179125947923216663', 'Yoh! Bestie', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Johnny Barbuzano', 'Tiffany Barbuzano, Gillian Breslin, Wendy Gumede', 'Katlego Lebogang, Didie Makobane, Kagiso Modupe, Fikile Mthwalo, Siya Sepotekele, Yonda Thomas, Didie Makobane', null, 'Thando is perpetually unlucky in love, but when her bestie returns from his travels with a fiancée in tow, she''s forced to face a new emotion — jealousy.', 'Thando is perpetually unlucky in love, but when her bestie returns from his travels with a fiancée in tow, she''s forced to face a new emotion — jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wBzRaeWfELNOPmcvOVTmB3kDEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1618945'),
  ('723108609561026666', 'Yokai Monsters: 100 Monsters', 1968, 'Horror', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Jun Fujimaki, Jun Hamamura, Miwa Takada, Takashi Kanda, Keiko Koyanagi, Tatsuo Hananuno, Masaru Hiraizumi, Shinobu Araki', null, 'A greedy developer, in league with a corrupt Shrine Magistrate, brutally tries to drive people out of a tenement building and destroy the shrine in back. But he makes the fatal mistake of hosting a 100 Ghost Stories ceremony without the closing cleansing ritual, opening the door for the Yokai Monsters to punish the wicked.', 'A greedy developer, in league with a corrupt Shrine Magistrate, brutally tries to drive people out of a tenement building and destroy the shrine in back. But he makes the fatal mistake of hosting a 100 Ghost Stories ceremony without the closing cleansing ritual, opening the door for the Yokai Monsters to punish the wicked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNUlTFJ3OwwNbmejRdxF6Lq9jEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91756'),
  ('75614145261791822', 'Yokai Monsters: Along with Ghosts', 1969, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Yoshiyuki Kuroda, Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Hiroshi Imai', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Kōjirō Hongō, Pepe Hozumi, Masami Burukido, Toura Sakiichi, Yoshito Yamaji, Bokuzen Hidari, Shinjiro Akatsuki, Mutsuhiro Toura', null, 'In feudal Japan, gangsters chase a young girl who might testify against their boss. When the gangsters murder the girl''s grandfather on sacred ground, the door is opened for the Yokai Monsters to step in.', 'In feudal Japan, gangsters chase a young girl who might testify against their boss. When the gangsters murder the girl''s grandfather on sacred ground, the door is opened for the Yokai Monsters to step in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6fB4xAIVBlrZlkEAHIDzy3lyEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76818'),
  ('330861937901386649', 'Yokai Monsters: Spook Warfare', 1968, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Toshiaki Kunihara, Yoshiyuki Kuroda, Hiroshi Imai', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Yoshihiko Aoyama, Akane Kawasaki, Takashi Kanda, Hideki Hanamura, Chikara Hashimoto, Hiromi Inoue, Mari Kanda, Gen Kimura', null, 'When a Babylonian vampire comes to old Japan, an army of Japanese demons and ghosts gather and battle him.', 'When a Babylonian vampire comes to old Japan, an army of Japanese demons and ghosts gather and battle him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZn8vcPaQ2YNKsU8X80J4b1eTxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136069'),
  ('616065471926381654', 'Yoko', 2012, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Franziska Buch, Jan Fehse', 'Gerrit Hermans, Claudia Boysen, Knister', 'Jessica Schwarz, Jamie Bick, Hoang Dang-Vu, Friedrich Heine, Tobias Moretti, Lilly Reulein, Justus von Dohnányi, Helmfried von Lüttichau', 'G', 'Pia''s life, a girl from a small German town, changes when surprisingly, finds in her garden a huge black monster. She soon discovers that the mysterious creature, which is called Yoko, is actually a kind yeti spiritually protecting animals and children worldwide. Its great value calls attention to two hunters who want to take advantage of the yeti.', 'Pia''s life, a girl from a small German town, changes when surprisingly, finds in her garden a huge black monster. She soon discovers that the mysterious creature, which is called Yoko, is actually a kind yeti spiritually protecting animals and children worldwide. Its great value calls attention to two hunters who want to take advantage of the yeti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppaGs7e2HFWJegZylKXrda1FtLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129357'),
  ('18127838899070932', 'Yoksul', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Melahat Cengiz, Mehmet Ulukan, Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Şehnaz Dilan, Yaman Okay, Kerem Yılmazer, İsmet Kazancıoğlu, Avni Yalçın, Şekip Taşpınar, Nurettin Şen', null, 'A kind-hearted tea maker works in a bustling commercial inn, where his good nature makes him an easy target. The business owner takes advantage of his generosity, while the woman he loves manipulates him for money, playing on his trust. As he faces these challenges, his simple routine slowly begins to shift, leading to unexpected turns that force him to rethink his place in the world.', 'A kind-hearted tea maker works in a bustling commercial inn, where his good nature makes him an easy target. The business owner takes advantage of his generosity, while the woman he loves manipulates him for money, playing on his trust. As he faces these challenges, his simple routine slowly begins to shift, leading to unexpected turns that force him to rethink his place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwCEPahe7SWlcKu0x8BaAtY2dyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436072'),
  ('1076678608906358475', 'Yolanda and the Thief', 1945, 'Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Charles Rosher', 'Irving Brecher, Ludwig Bemelmans', 'Fred Astaire, Lucille Bremer, Frank Morgan, Mildred Natwick, Mary Nash, Leon Ames, Ludwig Stössel, Jane Green', 'NR', 'Johnny Riggs, a con man on the lam, finds himself in a Latin-American country named Patria. There, he overhears a convent-bred rich girl praying to her guardian angel for help in managing her tangled business affairs. Riggs decides to materialize as the girl''s "angel", gains her unquestioning confidence, and helps himself to the deluded girl''s millions. Just as he and his partner are about to flee Patria with their booty, Riggs realizes he has fallen in love with the girl and returns the money, together with a note that is part confession and part love letter. But the larcenous duo''s escape from Patria turns out to be more difficult than they could ever have imagined.', 'Johnny Riggs, a con man on the lam, finds himself in a Latin-American country named Patria. There, he overhears a convent-bred rich girl praying to her guardian angel for help in managing her tangled business affairs. Riggs decides to materialize as the girl''s "angel", gains her unquestioning confidence, and helps himself to the deluded girl''s millions. Just as he and his partner are about to flee Patria with their booty, Riggs realizes he has fallen in love with the girl and returns the money, together with a note that is part confession and part love letter. But the larcenous duo''s escape from Patria turns out to be more difficult than they could ever have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y2LPO85Dzozhvoti8oa9pxAQP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43498'),
  ('412553452925116501', 'Yolo', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Action', 'Liu Yin, Jia Ling, Zhao Nan', 'Sun Jibin, Jia Ling, Guo Yupeng', 'Jia Ling, Lei Jiayin, Zhang Xiaofei, Yang Zi, Sha Yi, Qiao Shan, Li Xueqin, Ma Li', 'PG-13', 'After an argument with her younger sister, Le Ying moves out on her own. She meets a boxing trainer and starts boxing.', 'After an argument with her younger sister, Le Ying moves out on her own. She meets a boxing trainer and starts boxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD1mfjEeDUOAAsptZjQA6skrdJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229349'),
  ('1108485922784255746', 'Yona Yona Penguin', 2009, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Rintaro, Dripha Benseghir', 'Tomoko Konparu', 'Ei Morisako, Hikari Ota, Rena Tanaka, Akira Emoto, Hideyuki Tanaka, Ichiro Nagai, Shunji Fujimura, Yuko Minaguchi', null, 'Rintaro directs a tale of three children who visit a land of wonder. This is the first "3D anime" that Madhouse has produced. Oh, and there are penguins.', 'Rintaro directs a tale of three children who visit a land of wonder. This is the first "3D anime" that Madhouse has produced. Oh, and there are penguins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4s7OLUAKmNaoVzxvEipXeOcJRJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37425'),
  ('162633486068953736', 'Yongary, Monster from the Deep', 1967, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kim Kee-duk, Lee Seong-chun, Byeon In-jib', 'Seo Yun-sung', 'Oh Yeong-il, Nam Jeong-im, Lee Soon-jae, Lee Kwang-ho, Cho Kyoung-min, Moon Kang, Twist Kim, Kim Shin-jae', null, 'Earthquakes in central Korea turn out to be the work of Yongary, a prehistoric gasoline-eating reptile that soon goes on a rampage through Seoul.', 'Earthquakes in central Korea turn out to be the work of Yongary, a prehistoric gasoline-eating reptile that soon goes on a rampage through Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o0ZwBHqueNvlynd2VX4xySRrFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42699'),
  ('43248790301811415', 'Yonggary', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Shim Hyung-rae', 'Shim Hyung-rae, Marty Poole', 'Dan Cashman, Bruce Cornwell, Dennis Howard, Matt Landers, Richard Livingston, Donna Philipson, Harrison Young', 'PG-13', 'A team of scientists working on a remote dig site find the buried body of an enormous monster, perfectly preserved even after 200 million years. As soon as the beast is uncovered, however, an alien spacecraft suddenly appears above them and brings the monster back to life! The creature immediately sets about levelling the surrounding urban landscape and shrugging off the best firepower the military can throw at it. A lone scientist, working on decrypting an ancient set of hieroglyphics, may be on the verge of finding the aliens'' weak point, but will it be too late?', 'A team of scientists working on a remote dig site find the buried body of an enormous monster, perfectly preserved even after 200 million years. As soon as the beast is uncovered, however, an alien spacecraft suddenly appears above them and brings the monster back to life! The creature immediately sets about levelling the surrounding urban landscape and shrugging off the best firepower the military can throw at it. A lone scientist, working on decrypting an ancient set of hieroglyphics, may be on the verge of finding the aliens'' weak point, but will it be too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cvqGP48RZX10gyrNcSoJzRZk1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143136'),
  ('488390545998346524', 'Yongju Valley', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Woo-seong', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Min Do-yoon, Jin Seo-hyeon, Joo Hyang-woon, Park Jong-hwan, Lee Sin-ho', null, 'Yong-hwa is a gangster from the Yongju Valley. He is harassed for money by Chairman Kang and in the end decides to start an adult broadcasting system online. With sexy BJ Marshal in the lead, Yong-hwa manages to get a tremendous reaction from the online viewers. BJ Bang-wool becomes jealous of BJ Marshal and soon they start competing... Will their sexy scandal be a success?', 'Yong-hwa is a gangster from the Yongju Valley. He is harassed for money by Chairman Kang and in the end decides to start an adult broadcasting system online. With sexy BJ Marshal in the lead, Yong-hwa manages to get a tremendous reaction from the online viewers. BJ Bang-wool becomes jealous of BJ Marshal and soon they start competing... Will their sexy scandal be a success?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z71W04S43PfM4Vdvz3NgGLEF7He.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398222'),
  ('234047702890256422', 'Yonlu', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hique Montanari, Juarez Pavelak', 'Hique Montanari', 'Thalles Cabral, Nelson Diniz, Lorena Lorenzo, Liane Venturella, Leonardo Machado, Mirna Spritzer, Rodrigo Waschburger, Anderson Salles', null, 'A fiction film based on the real story of a 16 year-old boy who, aided by the internet, won over the world with his talent for music and art. Fluent in five languages, Yonlu had a network of virtual friends on all continents. However, no one suspected he was also taking part in a forum for potential suicide.', 'A fiction film based on the real story of a 16 year-old boy who, aided by the internet, won over the world with his talent for music and art. Fluent in five languages, Yonlu had a network of virtual friends on all continents. However, no one suspected he was also taking part in a forum for potential suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqV8kaWOwhR67zpbbxmRmIP5TIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480252'),
  ('1050475019169744336', 'Yoon-Yool and Russian Sexy Woman', 2022, 'Romance', 'Kim Deok-gyu', null, 'Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo', null, 'Eun-ha''s happiness of living in a big mansion by chance does not last long. Bella, the real landlord from Russia, begins to live together with her, and Bella shows interest in Eun-ha''s men.', 'Eun-ha''s happiness of living in a big mansion by chance does not last long. Bella, the real landlord from Russia, begins to live together with her, and Bella shows interest in Eun-ha''s men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30Yju7mD4O4gWq55Y4uOKur83Pu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016011'),
  ('81258293703141352', 'Yoon-Yool''s Men Affairs', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mr. Na', null, 'Yoon Yool, Lee Chae-dam, Min Do-yoon, Han Seok-bong, Seung Hwan', null, 'Na-ri joined the company as a new employe, capturing the hearts of her colleagues with her outstanding skills and looks, but she had a plan! She pretends to be in love with the president''s son, registered her marriage with him, and have other male motives who don''t know about it pay for him recklessly. It''s a love-war-like story where Hye-seon, who was in an internal relationship with the president, proceeds with the plan that Na-ri has made and eventually takes over the company.', 'Na-ri joined the company as a new employe, capturing the hearts of her colleagues with her outstanding skills and looks, but she had a plan! She pretends to be in love with the president''s son, registered her marriage with him, and have other male motives who don''t know about it pay for him recklessly. It''s a love-war-like story where Hye-seon, who was in an internal relationship with the president, proceeds with the plan that Na-ri has made and eventually takes over the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s68Pe8JclbbTZlh8Tso6faW4nad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938090'),
  ('476490201925952820', 'Yor: The Hunter from the Future', 1983, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Antonio Margheriti, Marcello Masciocchi, Ignazio Dolce', 'Robert D. Bailey, Antonio Margheriti', 'Reb Brown, Corinne Cléry, John Steiner, Carole André, Luciano Pigozzi, Ayşegül Ünsal, Aytekin Akkaya, Luigina Rocchi', 'PG', 'Yor is an extremely blond prehistoric warrior who comes to question his origins, particularly with regard to a mysterious medallion he wears. When he learns of a desert goddess who supposedly wears the same medallion, Yor decides that he must find her and learn his true identity. Along the way, he encounters ape-men, dinosaurs, and a strange futuristic society.', 'Yor is an extremely blond prehistoric warrior who comes to question his origins, particularly with regard to a mysterious medallion he wears. When he learns of a desert goddess who supposedly wears the same medallion, Yor decides that he must find her and learn his true identity. Along the way, he encounters ape-men, dinosaurs, and a strange futuristic society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cMkOOHlJaeQKgGPakxc6sEHHKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38219'),
  ('654489751754700592', 'Yoroï', 2025, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'David Tomaszewski, Steve Berron, Zoé Chadeau', 'Orelsan, David Tomaszewski', 'Orelsan, Clara Choï, Kazuya Tanabe, Bob Brahmi, Skread, Ablaye, Gringe, Clément Cotentin', null, 'After a gruelling final tour, Aurélien decides to settle in Japan with his wife Nanako, who is pregnant with their first child. As the young couple move into a traditional house in the Japanese countryside, Aurélien discovers an ancient suit of armour in a well, which is about to awaken strange creatures known as Yokaïs.', 'After a gruelling final tour, Aurélien decides to settle in Japan with his wife Nanako, who is pregnant with their first child. As the young couple move into a traditional house in the Japanese countryside, Aurélien discovers an ancient suit of armour in a well, which is about to awaken strange creatures known as Yokaïs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39DriTpvzihb8OYuL039IGPWNZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358491'),
  ('1142181968885514717', 'Yossi', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eytan Fox, Guy Raz, Orna Libkind', 'Itay Segal', 'Ohad Knoller, Oz Zehavi, Lior Ashkenazi, Orly Zilberschatz, Ola Schur Selektar, Meir Golan, Shlomi Ben Attar, Amir Jerassi', 'NR', 'The sequel to "Yossi and Jagger" finds character Yossi (Ohad Knoller) leading a sad existence after losing his partner Jagger on the battlefield. A chance encounter with a middle-aged woman linked to his past shakes up his otherwise staid routine and sends him on a spontaneous pilgrimage to Tel Aviv. It is on the roads of southern Israel that he reignites the fire of his former self.', 'The sequel to "Yossi and Jagger" finds character Yossi (Ohad Knoller) leading a sad existence after losing his partner Jagger on the battlefield. A chance encounter with a middle-aged woman linked to his past shakes up his otherwise staid routine and sends him on a spontaneous pilgrimage to Tel Aviv. It is on the roads of southern Israel that he reignites the fire of his former self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwFA7j1qeKuycXY8kLT3zO0kGv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117629'),
  ('182695983973167300', 'Yossi & Jagger', 2002, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Eytan Fox, Yaron Scharf', 'Avner Bernheimer', 'Ohad Knoller, Yehuda Levi, Assi Cohen, Aya Steinovitz, Sharon Raginiano, Hani Furstenberg', null, 'A sociological study of two men in the Israeli army who are lovers. The others in the unit react to their situation, suspecting, but not always understanding. One will leave the military soon, a few months away, as a snowy and desolate outpost is guarded from attack.', 'A sociological study of two men in the Israeli army who are lovers. The others in the unit react to their situation, suspecting, but not always understanding. One will leave the military soon, a few months away, as a snowy and desolate outpost is guarded from attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAaoY66dkJiZftsj3bmbWLeNgRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17614'),
  ('193331940384138456', 'Yotsuya Ghost Story Part 1', 1949, 'Horror', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Masaki Kobayashi, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Eijiro Hisaita', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Ken Uehara, Hisako Yamane, Haruko Sugimura, Chōko Iida, Osamu Takizawa, Jūkichi Uno, Keiji Sada', null, 'Iemon Tamiya is an impoverished masterless samurai who craves a better life, which he cannot have because of his marriage to Oiwa, who is completely devoted to her husband.', 'Iemon Tamiya is an impoverished masterless samurai who craves a better life, which he cannot have because of his marriage to Oiwa, who is completely devoted to her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMpattLVXmhfRABjbpsC5uZKLlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219252'),
  ('335642640571159159', 'Yotsuya Ghost Story Part 2', 1949, 'Horror', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Eijiro Hisaita', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Keiji Sada, Ken Mitsuda, Haruko Sugimura, Ken Uehara, Jūkichi Uno, Chōko Iida, Daisuke Katō', null, 'Part 2 starts where the first film ended, with Iemon disposing of the bodies of his wife and Kohei, marrying upward, and being blackmailed by the evil Naosuke.', 'Part 2 starts where the first film ended, with Iemon disposing of the bodies of his wife and Kohei, marrying upward, and being blackmailed by the evil Naosuke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pq6Nwzz9WNGJT14YwPAZ1ZSkt2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219253'),
  ('127067612954414699', 'You', 1963, 'Romance, Comedy', 'István Szabó, Thomas Vámos', 'István Szabó', 'Cecília Esztergályos', null, 'A playful portrait of a young woman who merrily roams the streets of Budapest. A New Wave love letter in motion.', 'A playful portrait of a young woman who merrily roams the streets of Budapest. A New Wave love letter in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t53Das5aNwFQFVNoGL8iYISH02k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331219'),
  ('784236592233751240', 'You & I', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nils Bökamp', 'Nils Bökamp', 'George Taylor, Eric Klotzsch, Michał Grabowski', null, 'Summer in Berlin. Jonas is planning a trip through the little known area of the Uckermark in preparation for a photography project. He invites his best friend, Phillip, to come along. When they pick up a hitchhiker named Boris, the friendship of the two starts to fray. Maybe three’s a crowd after all? By the end of the summer, things between Jonas and Phillip won’t ever be the same again.', 'Summer in Berlin. Jonas is planning a trip through the little known area of the Uckermark in preparation for a photography project. He invites his best friend, Phillip, to come along. When they pick up a hitchhiker named Boris, the friendship of the two starts to fray. Maybe three’s a crowd after all? By the end of the summer, things between Jonas and Phillip won’t ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59OmxhLZVh3ZXLAu6iaywYYx01S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322127'),
  ('800080949127530274', 'You & Me', 2011, 'Drama', 'Takashi Kubota', 'Hiroe Sawabe, Takashi Kubota', 'Aoi Nakamura, Maaya Sakamoto, Eriko Nakamura', null, 'Nakamura Aoi stars as a young aspiring manga artist who''s able to deal with loneliness and separation from his family through the companionship of an American Shorthair cat named Gin-o-gou.', 'Nakamura Aoi stars as a young aspiring manga artist who''s able to deal with loneliness and separation from his family through the companionship of an American Shorthair cat named Gin-o-gou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OLun8aqdpRLYCX1xGuAUt5mUTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444839'),
  ('927584038928357990', 'You & Me & Me', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Wanweaw Hongvivatana, Kitsada Nakagate, Weawwan Hongvivatana', 'Wanweaw Hongvivatana, Weawwan Hongvivatana', 'Thitiya Jirapornsilp, Anthony Buisseret, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Natee Ngamneawprom, Karuna Looktumthong, Kantapon Jindataweephol, Pratya Patong, Pasakorn Saisombut', null, 'A nostalgic, coming-of-age story of identical twin sisters who share every aspect of their lives with one another, until one day a boy walks into their lives and puts their strong bond to the test.', 'A nostalgic, coming-of-age story of identical twin sisters who share every aspect of their lives with one another, until one day a boy walks into their lives and puts their strong bond to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gveBJl4lipeLNbQJRdXOazbTqPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977179'),
  ('1104275921522210636', 'You ＆ Me XXX', 2017, null, 'Laddawan Rattanadilokchai', 'Laddawan Rattanadilokchai', 'Carissa Springett, Best Vichayut Limratanamongkol, Jularat Hanrungroj, Chatchawit Techarukpong', null, 'Pong meets an aggressive girl named Pik who he gets a crush on. However, Pik likes Book and wishes to play soccer with him. After eating cupcakes made by Pik, she and Pong switch bodies. Pik uses this as a chance to get close to Book as she can finally play soccer with him.', 'Pong meets an aggressive girl named Pik who he gets a crush on. However, Pik likes Book and wishes to play soccer with him. After eating cupcakes made by Pik, she and Pong switch bodies. Pik uses this as a chance to get close to Book as she can finally play soccer with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MTI3fKMh9qeXw2UOpI6fKapa47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469178'),
  ('614372602369527339', 'You Again', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Andy Fickman, David Hennings, Ian Calip', 'Moe Jelline', 'Kristen Bell, Jamie Lee Curtis, Sigourney Weaver, Odette Annable, Victor Garber, Betty White, James Wolk, Kristin Chenoweth', 'PG', 'History -- make that high school -- may repeat itself when Marni learns that Joanna, the mean girl from her past, is set to be her sister-in-law. Before the wedding bells toll, Marni must show her brother that a tiger doesn''t change its stripes. On Marni''s side is her mother, while Joanna''s backed by her wealthy aunt.', 'History -- make that high school -- may repeat itself when Marni learns that Joanna, the mean girl from her past, is set to be her sister-in-law. Before the wedding bells toll, Marni must show her brother that a tiger doesn''t change its stripes. On Marni''s side is her mother, while Joanna''s backed by her wealthy aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qI5JE6yjmtakTankuDOMZ1vgEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38303'),
  ('121713580101019543', 'You Ain''t Seen Nothin'' Yet', 2012, 'Drama', 'Alain Resnais, Éric Gautier, Matthieu Beutter', 'Alain Resnais, Laurent Herbiet', 'Lambert Wilson, Mathieu Amalric, Michel Piccoli, Anne Consigny, Sabine Azéma, Hippolyte Girardot, Denis Podalydès, Pierre Arditi', null, 'From beyond the grave, celebrated playwright Antoine d''Anthac gathers together all his friends who have appeared over the years in his play "Eurydice." These actors watch a recording of the work performed by a young acting company, La Compagnie de la Colombe. Do love, life, death and love after death still have any place on a theater stage? It''s up to them to decide. And the surprises have only just begun...', 'From beyond the grave, celebrated playwright Antoine d''Anthac gathers together all his friends who have appeared over the years in his play "Eurydice." These actors watch a recording of the work performed by a young acting company, La Compagnie de la Colombe. Do love, life, death and love after death still have any place on a theater stage? It''s up to them to decide. And the surprises have only just begun...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXWGsizU1BQEbwn2mIlvHesBUtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103717'),
  ('1047707965431424412', 'You and I', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Julie Lopes-Curval, Philippe Guilbert', 'Sophie Hiet, Julie Lopes-Curval', 'Marion Cotillard, Julie Depardieu, Jonathan Zaccaï, Éric Berger, Tomer Sisley, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Chantal Lauby, Philippe Le Fèvre', null, 'In Paris, Ariane and Lena are sisters. Ariane writes photo novellas for the magazine "Toi et Moi." She''s emotional and her long-time boyfriend, Farid, has her in a state because he won''t propose, won''t ask her to live with him, and often is unavailable. Lena is a cellist, quiet and circumspect in life and in her playing. She lives without passion with her boyfriend François; they''re talking about having a baby.', 'In Paris, Ariane and Lena are sisters. Ariane writes photo novellas for the magazine "Toi et Moi." She''s emotional and her long-time boyfriend, Farid, has her in a state because he won''t propose, won''t ask her to live with him, and often is unavailable. Lena is a cellist, quiet and circumspect in life and in her playing. She lives without passion with her boyfriend François; they''re talking about having a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meUGhBS4QDWVZkMEYOZFnYZYE5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44886'),
  ('1036367471573838079', 'You and Me', 1938, 'Crime, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Lang, Fritz Lang, Boris Morros', 'Virginia Van Upp', 'Sylvia Sidney, George Raft, Barton MacLane, Harry Carey, Roscoe Karns, George E. Stone, Warren Hymer, Robert Cummings', 'NR', 'Mr. Morris, the owner of a large metropolitan department store, gives jobs to paroled ex-convicts in an effort to help them reform and go straight. Among his ''employed-prison-graduates'' are Helen Roberts and Joe Dennis, working as sales clerks. Joe is in love with Helen and asks her to marry him, but she is forbidden to marry as she is still on parole, but she says yes and they are married. In spite of their poverty-level life, their marriage is a happy one until Joe discovers she has lied about her past, in order to marry him. Disillusioned, he leaves, goes back to his old gang and plans to rob the department store.', 'Mr. Morris, the owner of a large metropolitan department store, gives jobs to paroled ex-convicts in an effort to help them reform and go straight. Among his ''employed-prison-graduates'' are Helen Roberts and Joe Dennis, working as sales clerks. Joe is in love with Helen and asks her to marry him, but she is forbidden to marry as she is still on parole, but she says yes and they are married. In spite of their poverty-level life, their marriage is a happy one until Joe discovers she has lied about her past, in order to marry him. Disillusioned, he leaves, goes back to his old gang and plans to rob the department store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqfLuqm98JpIxSUFgRBm4y6uyPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45971'),
  ('492746624528934399', 'You and Me', 1971, 'Drama', 'Larisa Shepitko, Aleksandr Knyazhinsky, Lev Trakhtenberg', 'Gennady Shpalikov, Larisa Shepitko', 'Leonid Dyachkov, Yuri Vizbor, Alla Demidova, Natalya Bondarchuk, Leonid Markov, Vladimir Nosik, Oleg Efremov, Viktor Shulgin', null, 'Pyotr, a once-promising neurosurgeon who left his groundbreaking research and career abroad, returns home years later in search of fulfillment. Encountering old friends, strained relationships, and the realities of his choices, Pyotr grapples with regret, identity, and the value of his work.', 'Pyotr, a once-promising neurosurgeon who left his groundbreaking research and career abroad, returns home years later in search of fulfillment. Encountering old friends, strained relationships, and the realities of his choices, Pyotr grapples with regret, identity, and the value of his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tZZYAGIsEmNFkfnox62n1m05mZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146428'),
  ('493121875563125536', 'You and Me', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ma Liwen, Jiang Ming', 'Ma Liwen', 'Gong Zhe, Jie Sun, Zhongxue Luo, Yaqin Jin, Yan Guanying, 刘正亮, 张淑芳', null, 'Xiaoma, a young woman who has recently moved to Beijing, finds an apartment in an old courtyard apartment complex owned by Grandma, an elderly woman. Xiaoma and Grandma’s relationship almost immediately becomes strained. After trying to tidy up the courtyard, Grandma insists that Xiaoma turn over her share of the profits. Tightfisted, the elderly landlady resists even allowing Xiaoma to install a telephone. At the same time the older woman becomes increasingly interested in Xiaoma’s personal (and romantic) life. Grandma, for example, tries to pass off her grandson to the younger woman. Annoyed, Xiaoma nevertheless is flattered at the older woman’s concern. Over the course of four seasons, Xiaoma begins to learn from her landlady of the old world that the modern city of Beijing has left behind, while Grandma begins to enjoy the youth and vitality of her tenant. The two women become closer and eventually develop a deep friendship.', 'Xiaoma, a young woman who has recently moved to Beijing, finds an apartment in an old courtyard apartment complex owned by Grandma, an elderly woman. Xiaoma and Grandma’s relationship almost immediately becomes strained. After trying to tidy up the courtyard, Grandma insists that Xiaoma turn over her share of the profits. Tightfisted, the elderly landlady resists even allowing Xiaoma to install a telephone. At the same time the older woman becomes increasingly interested in Xiaoma’s personal (and romantic) life. Grandma, for example, tries to pass off her grandson to the younger woman. Annoyed, Xiaoma nevertheless is flattered at the older woman’s concern. Over the course of four seasons, Xiaoma begins to learn from her landlady of the old world that the modern city of Beijing has left behind, while Grandma begins to enjoy the youth and vitality of her tenant. The two women become closer and eventually develop a deep friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFPcgfjz4OgqT1LKcLrLDZHLvcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170876'),
  ('280179530075244941', 'You and the Night', 2013, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yann Gonzalez', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Yann Gonzalez', 'Kate Moran, Niels Schneider, Nicolas Maury, Éric Cantona, Fabienne Babe, Alain-Fabien Delon, Julie Brémond, Béatrice Dalle', 'NR', 'Around midnight, a young couple and their transvestite maid prepare for an orgy. Their guests will be The Slut, The Star, The Stud and The Teen.', 'Around midnight, a young couple and their transvestite maid prepare for an orgy. Their guests will be The Slut, The Star, The Stud and The Teen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knBzPNsPZFqrfS5JO8LgE7jZqNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191718'),
  ('98539906757831031', 'You Are a Widow, Sir', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Václav Vorlíček, Jaroslav Pour, Stanislava Hutková', 'Miloš Macourek, Václav Vorlíček', 'Iva Janžurová, Jiří Sovák, Eduard Cupák, Olga Schoberová, František Filipovský, Čestmír Řanda, Jan Libíček, Otto Šimánek', null, 'After a soldier cuts off the arm of king''s cousin, king decides to deactivate the army. Of course, generals don''t like it at all and they try to kill the king. The assassin should be artificial body in the shape of actress Evelina Keleti and with brain of psychotic serial killer Fany Stubová. They also manage to kill king''s astrologer Stuart Hampl, who warns the king. Accidentally, Hampl''s brain is implanted into assassin''s body, actress Keleti is killed and chaos begins.', 'After a soldier cuts off the arm of king''s cousin, king decides to deactivate the army. Of course, generals don''t like it at all and they try to kill the king. The assassin should be artificial body in the shape of actress Evelina Keleti and with brain of psychotic serial killer Fany Stubová. They also manage to kill king''s astrologer Stuart Hampl, who warns the king. Accidentally, Hampl''s brain is implanted into assassin''s body, actress Keleti is killed and chaos begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6xYnDonVeOcSToOougYYndqIug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160170'),
  ('561981813744848087', 'You Are God', 2012, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Leszek Dawid, Grzegorz Dębowski, Radek Ładczuk', 'Maciej Pisuk', 'Marcin Kowalczyk, Tomasz Schuchardt, Dawid Ogrodnik, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Katarzyna Wajda, Ernest Lorek, Marcin Dorociński, Adam Nawojczyk', null, 'The story of the late 90s generation and the three friends behind the music: Magik, Fokus and Rahim. The fact-based film charts the relentless struggle for success of Paktofonika, against the backdrop of crumbling traditional values in dreary 90s Silesia.', 'The story of the late 90s generation and the three friends behind the music: Magik, Fokus and Rahim. The fact-based film charts the relentless struggle for success of Paktofonika, against the backdrop of crumbling traditional values in dreary 90s Silesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obzhVV6Pc51jjDrOy6ZHscLp1c8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135161'),
