  ('731070498830466975', 'You Are My Sunshine', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Park Jin-pyo, Sung Seung-taek, Gook Dong-seok', 'Park Jin-pyo', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Hwang Jung-min, Na Moon-hee, Seo Ju-hee, Yoon Je-moon, Jung You-seok, Koh Soo-hee, Kim Bu-seon', null, 'An old bachelor Seok-joong, who has no experience in dating, falls in love at first sight with a prostitute named Eun-ha. At first Eun-ha shows no interest in Seok-joong, but gradually she begins to be flattered by his devotion and eventually falls in love with him. They marry. However, one day, Eun-ha finds out that she is infected with HIV and decides to leave Seok-joong.', 'An old bachelor Seok-joong, who has no experience in dating, falls in love at first sight with a prostitute named Eun-ha. At first Eun-ha shows no interest in Seok-joong, but gradually she begins to be flattered by his devotion and eventually falls in love with him. They marry. However, one day, Eun-ha finds out that she is infected with HIV and decides to leave Seok-joong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAFj8oCQmTfBbQzDe2ptLzWUzD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112283'),
