  ('115216353571081383', 'You Promised Me the Sea', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nadir Moknèche, Kristy Baboul, Tiphaine Lemou', 'Naïla Guiguet, Michael Barnes', 'Youssouf Abi-Ayad, Kenza Fortas, Arturo Giusi, Saadia Bentaïeb, Zinedine Soualem, Lubna Azabal, Zahia Dehar, Florence Venant', null, 'Rennes, nowadays. Saïd still lives with his parents. He is having a secret affair with Vincent. Unable to face his family, he agrees to an arranged marriage with Hadjira. After an unhappy love affair and a few run-ins with the law, she too has resigned herself to obeying her mother. Trapped by their families, Saïd and Hadjira join forces in spite of themselves, to find their own freedom.', 'Rennes, nowadays. Saïd still lives with his parents. He is having a secret affair with Vincent. Unable to face his family, he agrees to an arranged marriage with Hadjira. After an unhappy love affair and a few run-ins with the law, she too has resigned herself to obeying her mother. Trapped by their families, Saïd and Hadjira join forces in spite of themselves, to find their own freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHjSSIAoUvQSUycfk6E0tSdfHz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977340'),
  ('795357055239792274', 'You Shall Not Sleep', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Guillermo Greco, Félix Rodríguez, Guillermo Nieto', 'Juma Fodde', 'Eva De Dominici, Belén Rueda, Natalia de Molina, Germán Palacios, Juan Manuel Guilera, Susana Hornos, Miguel Angel Maciel, Eugenia Tobal', null, 'In an abandoned psychiatric hospital, a theatre group experiments with insomnia for the preparation of a stage play. With the passage of days without sleep, they reach new thresholds of perception that expose them to the secrets of the place and the energies that inhabit it. When Bianca, a young, promising actress, joins the cast, competing for the lead role, she must survive not only the intensity of the work and her cast mates, but the unknown force that is pulling them towards a tragic outcome.', 'In an abandoned psychiatric hospital, a theatre group experiments with insomnia for the preparation of a stage play. With the passage of days without sleep, they reach new thresholds of perception that expose them to the secrets of the place and the energies that inhabit it. When Bianca, a young, promising actress, joins the cast, competing for the lead role, she must survive not only the intensity of the work and her cast mates, but the unknown force that is pulling them towards a tragic outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6sGMxkOeaUiltWQcmtFuIqXfno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496212'),
