  ('714084069935634174', 'You to Me, Me to You', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Sery, Viktor Listopadov, Vladimir Krachkovskiy', 'Grigori Gorin, Aleksandr Sery', 'Leonid Kuravlyov, Tatyana Pelttser, Alla Meshcheryakova, Svetlana Svetlichnaya, Yuri Medvedev, Valeriy Nosik, Roman Tkachuk, Yevgeni Shutov', null, 'Ivan Sergeevich Kashkin — the bath attendant of the most prestigious metropolitan bath. It’s not easy to get to him: reputable diplomats, well-known footballers, and the heads of the ministry are seeking the honor to steam. But Kashkin himself does not need to achieve anything, everything is at his service — from black caviar to tickets to the conservatory. And the hero’s cloudless life would have flowed, but then his twin brother Sergei fell ill and asked Ivan to replace him in his equally strange work.', 'Ivan Sergeevich Kashkin — the bath attendant of the most prestigious metropolitan bath. It’s not easy to get to him: reputable diplomats, well-known footballers, and the heads of the ministry are seeking the honor to steam. But Kashkin himself does not need to achieve anything, everything is at his service — from black caviar to tickets to the conservatory. And the hero’s cloudless life would have flowed, but then his twin brother Sergei fell ill and asked Ivan to replace him in his equally strange work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy1PkmBpbEqL9vWTRfbLpqqmHy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279539'),
  ('567486169997110972', 'You Upset Me', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Benigni, Stefano Consiglio, Ronaldo Bonacchi', 'Roberto Benigni, Giuseppe Bertolucci', 'Roberto Benigni, Nicoletta Braschi, Olimpia Carlisi, Claudio Bigagli, Giacomo Piperno, Carlo Monni, Serena Grandi, Mariangela D''Abbraccio', null, 'The first movie directed by Roberto Benigni in four surreal short stories: "Durante Cristo" (During Christ), "Angelo" (Angel), , "In Banca" (At the Bank) and "I Due Militi" (The Two Soldiers). An excursus in Benigni''s satirical views on man, religion and society.', 'The first movie directed by Roberto Benigni in four surreal short stories: "Durante Cristo" (During Christ), "Angelo" (Angel), , "In Banca" (At the Bank) and "I Due Militi" (The Two Soldiers). An excursus in Benigni''s satirical views on man, religion and society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Sk2R4fwjqDUoYZR9N4YqYZzpjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70088'),
