  ('839131342440062264', 'You Were Never Duckier', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Tedd Pierce', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Finding that the prize for best duck at the National Poultry Show is only $5.00, but $5,000 for the best rooster, Daffy disguises himself as one, but then becomes the object of Henery Hawk''s chicken hunt.', 'Finding that the prize for best duck at the National Poultry Show is only $5.00, but $5,000 for the best rooster, Daffy disguises himself as one, but then becomes the object of Henery Hawk''s chicken hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVkiK5BwAdDUViMWbp2meW4UL8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146645'),
