  ('498274727431500911', 'You Were Never Really Here', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lynne Ramsay, Thomas Townend, Scott Bowers', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Judith Roberts, Ekaterina Samsonov, John Doman, Alex Manette, Dante Pereira-Olson, Alessandro Nivola, Larry Canady', 'R', 'A traumatized veteran, unafraid of violence, tracks down missing girls for a living. When a job spins out of control, his nightmares begin to overtake him, and a conspiracy is uncovered—leading to what may be his death trip or his awakening.', 'A traumatized veteran, unafraid of violence, tracks down missing girls for a living. When a job spins out of control, his nightmares begin to overtake him, and a conspiracy is uncovered—leading to what may be his death trip or his awakening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx4lUyQNEzJowcF55VAP0TQEaX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398181'),
  ('762589611065675399', 'You Will Be Mine', 2009, 'Music, Drama', 'Sophie Laloy', 'Sophie Laloy, Jean-Luc Gaget, Éric Veniard', 'Judith Davis, Isild Le Besco, Johan Libéreau, Édith Scob, Fabienne Babe, Marc Chapiteau, Cécile Laloy, Ondine Desfosses', null, 'Marie leaves home to study the piano at the conservatory in Lyons. Through lack of money, she is obliged to share an apartment with Emma, a friend of the family who has lived alone since the death of her father. The two young women develop a strange fascination for one another, which soon develops into an intense mutual need...', 'Marie leaves home to study the piano at the conservatory in Lyons. Through lack of money, she is obliged to share an apartment with Emma, a friend of the family who has lived alone since the death of her father. The two young women develop a strange fascination for one another, which soon develops into an intense mutual need...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRCzZeG5ZjeCSKIU1tYHCiMgRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54865'),
  ('742986813182080946', 'You Will Be My Son', 2011, 'Drama', 'Gilles Legrand, Yves Angelo', 'Gilles Legrand, Delphine de Vigan', 'Lorànt Deutsch, Niels Arestrup, Patrick Chesnais, Anne Marivin, Nicolas Bridet, Valérie Mairesse, Jean-Marc Roulot, Urbain Cancelier', 'R', 'Paul de Marseul, a prestigious wine-maker and owner of a renowned chateau and vineyard in Saint-Emilion, is disheartened by the notion of his son Martin taking over the family business. Martin does not seem to have inherited the qualities that Paul esteems in a wine-maker: persistence, creative insight and technical prowess matched with passion for the job and the product, and Paul frequently reminds him of this, whether explicitly or in subtle gestures. When Philippe, the son of his manager, appears at the vineyard, Paul leaps at the chance to name him as his successor, neglecting the wishes of his own son...', 'Paul de Marseul, a prestigious wine-maker and owner of a renowned chateau and vineyard in Saint-Emilion, is disheartened by the notion of his son Martin taking over the family business. Martin does not seem to have inherited the qualities that Paul esteems in a wine-maker: persistence, creative insight and technical prowess matched with passion for the job and the product, and Paul frequently reminds him of this, whether explicitly or in subtle gestures. When Philippe, the son of his manager, appears at the vineyard, Paul leaps at the chance to name him as his successor, neglecting the wishes of his own son...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6kIWdz5I4JGT4upHUskjL08nen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68713'),
  ('1130250107049319196', 'You Will Die at Twenty', 2020, 'Drama', 'Amjad Abu Alala, Sébastien Goepfert, Abdelwahab Shawky', 'Amjad Abu Alala, Youssef Ibrahim', 'Mustafa Shehata, Mahmoud Alsarraj, Islam Mubark, Bunna Khalid, Talal Afifi, Amal Mustafa, Nahid Hassan, Rabeha Mahmoud', null, 'Shortly after Muzamil was born, the village''s holy man predicts that he will die at age 20. Muzamil''s father can''t stand the curse and leaves home. Sakina raises her son as a single mother, overly protective. One day, Muzamil turns 19.', 'Shortly after Muzamil was born, the village''s holy man predicts that he will die at age 20. Muzamil''s father can''t stand the curse and leaves home. Sakina raises her son as a single mother, overly protective. One day, Muzamil turns 19.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZjpqUFs3ffevZoLJsvoutpEIrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617710'),
  ('136297704032389883', 'You Will Die in 6 Hours', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Lee Yun-seok, Sun Sang-jae, Seo Ho-yeong', null, 'Park Ju-hyun, Jaehyun, Kwak Si-yang, Lee Soo-jung, Kim Min-sang, Lee Chul-woo, Ryoo Je-seung, Hwang Hwi', null, 'Jung-yoon was approached by a random stranger named Jun-woo, who told her she''d be dead in six hours. As she follows him for answers, she begins to question whether he''s her savior or the one trying to put her in danger.', 'Jung-yoon was approached by a random stranger named Jun-woo, who told her she''d be dead in six hours. As she follows him for answers, she begins to question whether he''s her savior or the one trying to put her in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HSvt2PF2tSyKL4GRRniwE1URGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147266'),
  ('756230086407945586', 'You Will Know What to Do With Me', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erwin Jaquez, Fernanda de la Peza, Camila Silva', 'Katina Medina Mora, Emma Bertrán, Samara Ibrahim', 'Ilse Salas, Pablo Derqui, Mariana Treviño, Rosa María Bianchi, Paula Serrano, Mora Ferriol Avails, Arturo Barba, José Ángel Bichir', null, 'Nicolás, a photographer, has suffered epilepsy since childhood and he is forced to take care of himself and sacrifice a lot, though he lives a normal life. On the other hand, Isabel is a woman who, apparently, has her whole life figured out although her mother is ill and she has no choice but to try to save her. Isabel and Nicolás fall in love in spite of themselves, their demons, their ghosts, and their weaknesses. Suddenly engaged in a relationship none of them would have even dared to imagine, they experience the love, passion, insecurity, fear, and allergy to commitment typical in people who are drifting away.', 'Nicolás, a photographer, has suffered epilepsy since childhood and he is forced to take care of himself and sacrifice a lot, though he lives a normal life. On the other hand, Isabel is a woman who, apparently, has her whole life figured out although her mother is ill and she has no choice but to try to save her. Isabel and Nicolás fall in love in spite of themselves, their demons, their ghosts, and their weaknesses. Suddenly engaged in a relationship none of them would have even dared to imagine, they experience the love, passion, insecurity, fear, and allergy to commitment typical in people who are drifting away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eztk17d9gzXBoq7vkpfClpCuYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317938'),
  ('1136620971416761449', 'You Will Meet a Tall Dark Stranger', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ben Howarth, Richard Selway, Olivia Lloyd', 'Woody Allen', 'Antonio Banderas, Josh Brolin, Anthony Hopkins, Gemma Jones, Freida Pinto, Lucy Punch, Naomi Watts, Pauline Collins', 'R', 'Two married couples find only trouble and heartache as their complicated lives unfold. After 40 years of marriage, Alfie leaves his wife to pursue what he thinks is happiness with a call girl. His wife, Helena, reeling from abandonment, decides to follow the advice of a psychic. Sally, the daughter of Alfie and Helena, is unhappy in her marriage and develops a crush on her boss, while her husband, Roy, falls for a woman engaged to be married.', 'Two married couples find only trouble and heartache as their complicated lives unfold. After 40 years of marriage, Alfie leaves his wife to pursue what he thinks is happiness with a call girl. His wife, Helena, reeling from abandonment, decides to follow the advice of a psychic. Sally, the daughter of Alfie and Helena, is unhappy in her marriage and develops a crush on her boss, while her husband, Roy, falls for a woman engaged to be married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBhnI8UZQzTkAH1LMEtrBUmfpjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38031'),
  ('801069650683423688', 'You Will Not Have My Hate', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kilian Riedhof, Tatiana Merizalde Dobles, Tim Schaer', 'Marc Blöbaum, Jan Braren, Stéphanie Kalfon', 'Pierre Deladonchamps, Zoé Iorio, Camélia Jordana, Thomas Mustin, Christelle Cornil, Anne Azoulay, Farida Rahouadj, Yannick Choirat', null, 'The night of November 13, 2015 changes everything for Antoine. Hélène, his wife and mother of his young son, dies during the terrorist attacks at the Bataclan club in Paris. In a moving Facebook post, he counters the assassins'' hatred with the love for his son – a message, that moves people worldwide.', 'The night of November 13, 2015 changes everything for Antoine. Hélène, his wife and mother of his young son, dies during the terrorist attacks at the Bataclan club in Paris. In a moving Facebook post, he counters the assassins'' hatred with the love for his son – a message, that moves people worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgoOkLRfURp3N5hYMXS68P645Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936391'),
  ('233603329492360935', 'You Will Remember Me', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pierre Gill, Éric Tessier', 'François Archambault, Éric Tessier', 'Rémy Girard, France Castel, Julie Le Breton, David Boutin, Karelle Tremblay, Frank Schorpion, Nicolas Dionne-Simard, Katrine Duhaime', null, 'A retired public figure and history professor begins to lose his memory and must learn to be more discreet as he expresses himself.', 'A retired public figure and history professor begins to lose his memory and must learn to be more discreet as he expresses himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB49HN4dt8skyesYu8hJRzVAeiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633929'),
  ('131506342338938538', 'You Wish!', 2003, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Donald Duncan, George Lyle', 'Christopher Reed, Cynthia Carle', 'A.J. Trauth, Spencer Breslin, Lalaine, Tim Reid, Sally Stockwell, Peter Feeney, Ari Boyland, Emma Lahana', 'G', 'A frustrated teen''s careless wish sends his little brother into a world of forgotten dreams. Now, he must navigate whimsical challenges and learn the true value of family before time runs out to bring him back!', 'A frustrated teen''s careless wish sends his little brother into a world of forgotten dreams. Now, he must navigate whimsical challenges and learn the true value of family before time runs out to bring him back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogsjMXr9xzi0sZ8BcgiaJAg85n6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111485'),
  ('806977647976936974', 'You Won''t Be Alone', 2022, 'Horror, Drama', 'Branislav Dimov, Nikola Zdravković, Klara Došlov', 'Goran Stolevski', 'Sara Klimoska, Anamaria Marinca, Alice Englert, Félix Maritaud, Carloto Cotta, Noomi Rapace, Irena Ristić, Kamka Tocinovski', 'R', 'In an isolated mountain village in 19th century Macedonia, a young feral witch accidentally kills a peasant. She assumes the peasant''s shape to see what life is like in her skin, igniting a deep seated curiosity to experience life inside the bodies of others.', 'In an isolated mountain village in 19th century Macedonia, a young feral witch accidentally kills a peasant. She assumes the peasant''s shape to see what life is like in her skin, igniting a deep seated curiosity to experience life inside the bodies of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVRADANU3JpMyapKjV3eM41VlDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883083'),
  ('682964417100152220', 'You Won''t Have Alsace-Lorraine', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Marc Monnet, Coluche', 'Coluche', 'Coluche, Dominique Lavanant, Anémone, Martin Lamotte, Michel Blanc, Roland Giraud, Gérard Jugnot, Gérard Lanvin', null, 'Whilst King Gros Pif I amuses himself at debauched banquets, his musketeers pursue their tax-collecting duties with a malicious zeal. Goaded by the court jester (who is also the Queen’s lover), the ministers decide to put an end to this regime and have the King locked up. Hearing the news, the famous Chevalier Blanc comes to his rescue. Aided by the knight and his cousin Lucienne, the King flees to Flanders, where he devises a scheme to win him back the throne of France...', 'Whilst King Gros Pif I amuses himself at debauched banquets, his musketeers pursue their tax-collecting duties with a malicious zeal. Goaded by the court jester (who is also the Queen’s lover), the ministers decide to put an end to this regime and have the King locked up. Hearing the news, the famous Chevalier Blanc comes to his rescue. Aided by the knight and his cousin Lucienne, the King flees to Flanders, where he devises a scheme to win him back the throne of France...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79k4R2ahO0Vw4RZBDGHCzAbMf1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59959'),
