  ('882085002223534145', 'You, Me & Tuscany', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kat Coiro, Danny Ruhlmann, Emiliano Novelli', 'Ryan Engle', 'Halle Bailey, Regé-Jean Page, Marco Calvani, Lorenzo de Moor, Aziza Scott, Nia Vardalos, Isabella Ferrari, Emanuele Pacca', 'PG-13', 'A free-spirited American chef and reserved British lawyer embark on a whirlwind romance during a destination wedding in coastal Italy.', 'A free-spirited American chef and reserved British lawyer embark on a whirlwind romance during a destination wedding in coastal Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJS0IF7Af3WpPRhSTDT6rGpiLzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1455079'),
  ('3597967029421951', 'You, Me and Dupree', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Russo, Joe Russo, Charles Minsky', 'Michael LeSieur', 'Owen Wilson, Kate Hudson, Matt Dillon, Michael Douglas, Seth Rogen, Amanda Detmer, Ralph Ting, Todd Stashwick', 'PG-13', 'After standing in as best man for his longtime friend Carl Petersen, Randy Dupree loses his job, becomes a barfly and attaches himself to the newlywed couple almost permanently -- as their houseguest. But the longer Dupree camps out on their couch, the closer he gets to Carl''s bride, Molly, leaving the frustrated groom wondering when his pal will be moving out.', 'After standing in as best man for his longtime friend Carl Petersen, Randy Dupree loses his job, becomes a barfly and attaches himself to the newlywed couple almost permanently -- as their houseguest. But the longer Dupree camps out on their couch, the closer he gets to Carl''s bride, Molly, leaving the frustrated groom wondering when his pal will be moving out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtqbg1CKR4dFdmHxmsiM3u9n71I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1819'),
  ('40556287534038363', 'You, Me and Him', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Ribeiro, Carol Alckmin, Tati Fujimori', 'Daniel Ribeiro', 'Daniel Tavares, Diego Torraca, Eduardo Melo, Eleio Calascibetta', null, 'When the plans for the future change, new bonds are created between Danilo, Lucas and Marcos. in between video-games and milk cups, pain and disappointment, they need to learn how to live together.', 'When the plans for the future change, new bonds are created between Danilo, Lucas and Marcos. in between video-games and milk cups, pain and disappointment, they need to learn how to live together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRmEqMHpyHoyZD5w1nVot1fazes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86531'),
  ('812586328789268053', 'You, Me and the Christmas Trees', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'David Winning, William McKnight', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Danica McKellar, Benjamin Ayres, Jason Hervey, Linda Darlow, Amanda Lisman, Keith MacKechnie, Karen Kruper, Daniel Bacon', 'G', 'An arborist helps a fourth generation Christmas tree farmer whose evergreens are dying just before the holiday. As she tries to get to the root of the problem before the town tree lighting, they begin to fall in love.', 'An arborist helps a fourth generation Christmas tree farmer whose evergreens are dying just before the holiday. As she tries to get to the root of the problem before the town tree lighting, they begin to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezgKTTz3ZT6wksXREympqR7G2eM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877692'),
  ('329757240154491622', 'You, the Living', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Roy Andersson, Christian Haag, Fredrik Borg', 'Roy Andersson', 'Håkan Angser, Eric Bäckman, Patrik Anders Edgren, Björn Englund, Lennart Eriksson, Pär Fredriksson, Elisabeth Helander, Gunnar Ivarsson', 'NR', 'In the Swedish city of Lethe, people from different walks of life take part in a series of short, deadpan vignettes that rush past. Some are just seconds long, none longer than a couple of minutes. A young woman remembers a fantasy honeymoon with a rock guitarist. A man awakes from a dream about bomber planes. A businessman boasts about success while being robbed by a pickpocket, and so on. The absurdist collection is accompanied by Dixieland jazz and similar music.', 'In the Swedish city of Lethe, people from different walks of life take part in a series of short, deadpan vignettes that rush past. Some are just seconds long, none longer than a couple of minutes. A young woman remembers a fantasy honeymoon with a rock guitarist. A man awakes from a dream about bomber planes. A businessman boasts about success while being robbed by a pickpocket, and so on. The absurdist collection is accompanied by Dixieland jazz and similar music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4FAPvqjqUvs1YrQi76p6fIDRUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5817'),
  ('218444951354043761', 'You''ll Die at Midnight', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lamberto Bava, Roy Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Lamberto Bava, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Valeria D''Obici, Leonardo Treviglio, Paolo Malco, Lara Wendel, Lea Martino, Eliana Miglio, Barbara Scoppa, Massimiliano Baratta', null, 'A cop suspects his wife''s infidelity, only to become the prime suspect when she''s murdered. A criminal psychologist believes the real killer is a presumed-dead serial killer, as more murders unfold.', 'A cop suspects his wife''s infidelity, only to become the prime suspect when she''s murdered. A criminal psychologist believes the real killer is a presumed-dead serial killer, as more murders unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtWXkGzeq07XdUgF15p0gbqIHPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29191'),
  ('17949477650599600', 'You''ll Find Out', 1940, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance, Music, Mystery', 'David Butler, Fred Fleck', 'James V. Kern', 'Kay Kyser, Peter Lorre, Boris Karloff, Bela Lugosi, Helen Parrish, Dennis O''Keefe, Alma Kruger, Joseph Eggenton', null, 'The manager of Kay Kyser’s band books them for a birthday party bash for an heiress at a spooky mansion, where sinister forces try to kill her.', 'The manager of Kay Kyser’s band books them for a birthday party bash for an heiress at a spooky mansion, where sinister forces try to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mo1iZWEMtGR1iH4Yo6yNOnpM1b7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80720'),
  ('975971175490233642', 'You''ll Like My Mother', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Lamont Johnson, Vincent Saizis, Jack A. Marta', 'Jo Heims', 'Patty Duke, Rosemary Murphy, Richard Thomas, Sian Barbara Allen, Dennis Rucker, Harold Congdon, James Glazman, James Neumann', 'PG', 'Francesca, a pregnant Los Angeles widow, journeys to her late husband''s Minnesota hometown to finally meet his mother and family. After being met with icy acceptance from her mother-in-law, then getting stranded with her in a blizzard, Francesca begins to discover terrifying secrets about her husband''s family.', 'Francesca, a pregnant Los Angeles widow, journeys to her late husband''s Minnesota hometown to finally meet his mother and family. After being met with icy acceptance from her mother-in-law, then getting stranded with her in a blizzard, Francesca begins to discover terrifying secrets about her husband''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpUxLKWlBDyrzeDt2NfaeHvO1ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143877'),
  ('663779942990228230', 'You''ll Never Be Alone', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Antonia Renard, Alex Anwandter, Matías Illanes', 'Alex Anwandter', 'Sergio Hernández, Andrew Bargsted, Jaime Leiva, Edgardo Bruna, Gabriela Hernández, Astrid Roldán, Benjamín Westfall, Antonia Zegers', null, 'When his cross-dressing teenage son suffers a brutally violent attack, a mannequin-factory manager desperately seeks help and, when none can be found, is forced to take matters into his own hands.', 'When his cross-dressing teenage son suffers a brutally violent attack, a mannequin-factory manager desperately seeks help and, when none can be found, is forced to take matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq7Ybz4DlGrJvW7cutsw1zHaVN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383526'),
  ('637158332436405188', 'You''ll Never Find Me', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Indianna Bell, Josiah Allen, Maxx Corkindale', 'Indianna Bell', 'Brendan Rock, Jordan Cowan, Elena Carapetis, Angela Korng, Finn Watson, Luca Trimboli', 'R', 'Patrick, a strange and lonely resident, lives in a mobile home at the back of an isolated caravan park. After a violent thunderstorm erupts, a mysterious young woman appears at his door, seeking shelter from the weather. The longer the night wears on and the more the young woman discovers about Patrick, the more difficult she finds it to leave. Soon she begins to question Patrick’s intentions, while Patrick begins to question his own grip on reality...', 'Patrick, a strange and lonely resident, lives in a mobile home at the back of an isolated caravan park. After a violent thunderstorm erupts, a mysterious young woman appears at his door, seeking shelter from the weather. The longer the night wears on and the more the young woman discovers about Patrick, the more difficult she finds it to leave. Soon she begins to question Patrick’s intentions, while Patrick begins to question his own grip on reality...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdDrzkq1vgQzR6vZPumyjHiKvFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117321'),
  ('178257142297960060', 'You''ll Never Get Rich', 1941, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Sidney Lanfield, Gene Anderson, Philip Tannura', 'Ernest Pagano, Michael Fessier', 'Fred Astaire, Rita Hayworth, Robert Benchley, John Hubbard, Osa Massen, Frieda Inescort, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Donald MacBride', 'PG', 'A Broadway choreographer gets drafted and coincidentally ends up in the same army base as the boyfriend of his object of affection.', 'A Broadway choreographer gets drafted and coincidentally ends up in the same army base as the boyfriend of his object of affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sdGOX0R1OVVT93kcZHz8xmOLOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28658'),
  ('1131479893933367546', 'You''ll Never Leave Me', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Danny J. Boyle, Robert Vardaros, Elle Sunkara', 'Stephen Romano', 'Christie Leverette, Cameron Jebo, Nicole Marie Johnson, Philip Boyd, Rachel Petsiavas, Brian Childers, Sharonne Lanier, Erin Dangler', null, 'After a car accident leaves her boyfriend in a coma, April’s panic attacks return and make her life a living hell. However, once she accepts the kindness of a stranger trying to help her, she realizes that he might not be the stranger she thought he is.', 'After a car accident leaves her boyfriend in a coma, April’s panic attacks return and make her life a living hell. However, once she accepts the kindness of a stranger trying to help her, she realizes that he might not be the stranger she thought he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1glJ78r2p9qm5lrexFvSnd5D0VW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971530'),
  ('528695483889911724', 'You''re a Big Boy Now', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Larry Sturhahn, Andrew Laszlo', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Elizabeth Hartman, Geraldine Page, Peter Kastner, Rip Torn, Michael Dunn, Karen Black, Tony Bill, Julie Harris', null, 'Naive library clerk Bernard Chanticleer moves out of his parents’ home and into a chaotic city full of eccentric landlords, meddling parents, and romantic missteps. Infatuated with a glamorous but manipulative go-go dancer, he learns through heartbreak—and the kindness of a steadfast admirer—what growing up really means.', 'Naive library clerk Bernard Chanticleer moves out of his parents’ home and into a chaotic city full of eccentric landlords, meddling parents, and romantic missteps. Infatuated with a glamorous but manipulative go-go dancer, he learns through heartbreak—and the kindness of a steadfast admirer—what growing up really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kjCCRZeZW7YiFZ6YPcI46tPTc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42728'),
  ('533056577031086562', 'You''re a Good Man, Charlie Brown', 1985, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Sam Jaimes, Desiree Goyette', 'Charles M. Schulz, Clark Gesner', 'Kevin Brando, Michael Dockery, Brad Kesten, Jeremy Scott Reinbolt, Tiffany Reinbolt, Jessica Lee Smith, Robert Towers, David Wagner', null, 'The Peanuts gang perform the classic Broadway musical. In addition to the classic songs, we see Charlie Brown and his friends perform the various comedy sketches of the play.', 'The Peanuts gang perform the classic Broadway musical. In addition to the classic songs, we see Charlie Brown and his friends perform the various comedy sketches of the play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbuCcWHp0LFRa9yLyJ5E4nE0MhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51330'),
  ('50011811156211812', 'You''re a Good Sport, Charlie Brown', 1975, 'Family, Animation', 'Phil Roman', null, 'Duncan Watson, Melanie Kohn, Stuart Brotman, Jimmy Ahrens, Liam Martin, Bill Melendez, Gail Davis', 'NR', 'A motorcross, a race of motorbikes through a series of obstacles, provides the occasion for Charlie Brown''s latest attempt to win at something. He selects Linus as his pit crew and goes to a store to select a bike, and due to insufficient funds, he must settle for a tiny, run-down putt-putt. The majority of Charlie''s opponents are eliminated in the race, and Charlie, wearing a makeshift helmet carved from a pumpkin, finds himself in close competition with his friend, tomboy Peppermint Patty, and the Masked Marvel (a.k.a. Snoopy, Charlie''s dog).', 'A motorcross, a race of motorbikes through a series of obstacles, provides the occasion for Charlie Brown''s latest attempt to win at something. He selects Linus as his pit crew and goes to a store to select a bike, and due to insufficient funds, he must settle for a tiny, run-down putt-putt. The majority of Charlie''s opponents are eliminated in the race, and Charlie, wearing a makeshift helmet carved from a pumpkin, finds himself in close competition with his friend, tomboy Peppermint Patty, and the Masked Marvel (a.k.a. Snoopy, Charlie''s dog).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSi3Xh3daiKU0jYPrdansdoOEZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40483'),
  ('98177081226851527', 'You''re a Sweetheart', 1937, 'Romance, Music', 'David Butler, George Robinson', 'Monte Brice, Charles Grayson', 'Alice Faye, George Murphy, Ken Murray, Charles Winninger, Andy Devine, William Gargan, Frank Jenks, Frances Hunt', 'NR', 'A Broadway producer is in a quandary when he discovers that the opening of his newest big production coincides with that of a major charity event. He despairs that the show will close after opening night until an ingenious writer suggests that he simply give the production snob-appeal by making the tickets nearly impossible to get by fabricating a story that they were all purchased by a flamboyant Texas oil baron who is totally besotted by the show''s star.', 'A Broadway producer is in a quandary when he discovers that the opening of his newest big production coincides with that of a major charity event. He despairs that the show will close after opening night until an ingenious writer suggests that he simply give the production snob-appeal by making the tickets nearly impossible to get by fabricating a story that they were all purchased by a flamboyant Texas oil baron who is totally besotted by the show''s star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8vwdg00mpjFWDuQFOCrBhTE57D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218347'),
  ('173360470697200134', 'You''re All Doomed', 2026, 'Horror', 'Mark Polonia', 'Aaron Drake', 'Yolie Canales, Marie DeLorenzo, Tim Hatch, Titus Himmelberger, Jeff Kirkendall', null, 'Burned alive in an accident and locked away, the urban legend of Crispy refuses to die. Escaping the asylum, the scarred killer returns to Camp Hollow, where a group of unsuspecting campers find their weekend of fun twisted into a nightmare of fire, blood, and vengeance as his rage consumes the woods once more.', 'Burned alive in an accident and locked away, the urban legend of Crispy refuses to die. Escaping the asylum, the scarred killer returns to Camp Hollow, where a group of unsuspecting campers find their weekend of fun twisted into a nightmare of fire, blood, and vengeance as his rage consumes the woods once more.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fo0jWl4exocm5xL3L66JXf6glnUS.jpg', 'plex:movie:youre-all-doomed'),
  ('809679436188157465', 'You''re Bacon Me Crazy', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Allan Harmon', 'Christopher Sey, Suzanne Nelson', 'Michael Rady, Natalie Hall, Rhiannon Fish, Olivia Steele-Falconer, Barbara Tyson, Brenda Crichlow, Michael Karl Richards, Corey Woods', null, 'Cleo Morelli, an aspiring Portland chef, tries to win a food truck competition while the competition tries to win her heart.', 'Cleo Morelli, an aspiring Portland chef, tries to win a food truck competition while the competition tries to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6FSxn0Myqq3uffXjdZXpOTGCn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677209'),
  ('172889545959691757', 'You''re Cordially Invited', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nicholas Stoller, John Guleserian', 'Nicholas Stoller', 'Will Ferrell, Reese Witherspoon, Geraldine Viswanathan, Meredith Hagner, Jimmy Tatro, Stony Blyden, Leanne Morgan, Rory Scovel', 'R', 'When two weddings are accidentally booked on the same day at the same venue, each bridal party is challenged with preserving their family''s special moment while making the most of the unanticipated tight quarters. In a hilarious battle of determination and grit, the father of the bride and sister of the other bride chaotically go head-to-head as they stop at nothing to uphold an unforgettable celebration for their loved ones.', 'When two weddings are accidentally booked on the same day at the same venue, each bridal party is challenged with preserving their family''s special moment while making the most of the unanticipated tight quarters. In a hilarious battle of determination and grit, the father of the bride and sister of the other bride chaotically go head-to-head as they stop at nothing to uphold an unforgettable celebration for their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muXnwAdVdEEktto0NBNMyqK3uQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996821'),
  ('124751624869406032', 'You''re Darn Tootin''', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Edgar Kennedy, Floyd Jackman', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Wilson Benge, Chet Brandenburg, Christian J. Frank, Dick Gilbert, Charlie Hall, Otto Lederer', 'NR', 'Members of a municipal band, Stanley and Oliver seem to be always following someone else''s lead, rather than that of the temperamental conductor.', 'Members of a municipal band, Stanley and Oliver seem to be always following someone else''s lead, rather than that of the temperamental conductor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIEZ3dTVhUKA3ZIlUZ6TRB02NRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50922'),
  ('431566060252248631', 'You''re Dating a Narcissist!', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ann Marie Allison, Martim Vian', 'Ann Marie Allison, Jenna Milly', 'Marisa Tomei, Sherry Cola, Ciara Bravo, Marco Pigossi, José María Yázpik', null, 'An outspoken psychologist rushes to Los Angeles with her best friend to stop her lovesick daughter''s wedding, fearing the groom is a narcissist.', 'An outspoken psychologist rushes to Los Angeles with her best friend to stop her lovesick daughter''s wedding, fearing the groom is a narcissist.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlU9nlPNSUca3rBjeT92kUwgYdxy.jpg', 'plex:movie:youre-dating-a-narcissist'),
  ('262796105112922710', 'You''re Everything To Me', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Tolga Örnek', 'Tolga Örnek', 'Tolga Çevik, Melis Birkan, Tuna Çevik, Cengiz Bozkurt, Reha Özcan, Tan Çevik, Hülya Gülşen Irmak, Tuncay Beyazıt', null, 'When an old fling shows up with their infant child, a dallying man-child must take on the role of father and create a fairytale world for his daughter.', 'When an old fling shows up with their infant child, a dallying man-child must take on the role of father and create a fairytale world for his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HmbURFQoXfVYLHaGrUDKM1t6EK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445650'),
  ('225243991879168026', 'You''re Fired', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Dmitriy Yashonkov, Nikolay Veretin, Igor Votintsev, Alisa Shitikova, Marina Soboleva, Vladimir Noskov, Anna Pestryakova, Yulia Denina, Alla Eremycheva', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Alexey Vorobyev, Boris Mokrousov, Timur Levchenko, Zina Itkina, Dmitry Lunev, Pavel Karnaukhov, Ekaterina Matvienko, Sergey Borodin, Dmitry Vidavsky', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Mikhail Galustyan, Aleksey Simonenko, Aleksei Badygov, Elena Fomina', null, 'Maks is a young and nimble provincial, not particularly burdened by morals and principles, energetically making a successful career in Moscow. He works in a recruitment agency, and his specialization is to fire top managers, help squeeze out shares in companies, and similar routine business issues. Maks''s next task is to get rid of Georgy, the chief programmer of a large IT company. At first glance, work for a couple of days, because who is Zhora? A bearded boy under 40, the embodiment of simplicity and harmlessness. But it turns out that this is a unique case, and it is incredibly difficult to fire Zhora. Especially considering what a charming half-sister he has. Maks has to go through a lot of funny, touching and dangerous trials that will help him understand that there are other values in life besides career, money and real estate.', 'Maks is a young and nimble provincial, not particularly burdened by morals and principles, energetically making a successful career in Moscow. He works in a recruitment agency, and his specialization is to fire top managers, help squeeze out shares in companies, and similar routine business issues. Maks''s next task is to get rid of Georgy, the chief programmer of a large IT company. At first glance, work for a couple of days, because who is Zhora? A bearded boy under 40, the embodiment of simplicity and harmlessness. But it turns out that this is a unique case, and it is incredibly difficult to fire Zhora. Especially considering what a charming half-sister he has. Maks has to go through a lot of funny, touching and dangerous trials that will help him understand that there are other values in life besides career, money and real estate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5jdCkK9xoxlh1EAjrjioVlWa51Q.jpg', 'plex:movie:youre-fired-2026'),
  ('696150151053692096', 'You''re in Love, Charlie Brown', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Sally Dryer, Christopher Shea, Ann Altieri, Cathy Steinberg, Bill Melendez, Gail DeFaria', null, 'With the school year coming to a close, Charlie Brown is trying to work up the courage to meet his dream girl, whom he only knows as "The Little Red Haired Girl." However, he''s too nervous to go meet her upfront and all his attempts to impress her at school backfire disastrously. His friends, Linus and Peppermint Patty, try to help, but only aggravate the situation, while Charlie Brown desperately tries to find a solution to this romantic conundrum.', 'With the school year coming to a close, Charlie Brown is trying to work up the courage to meet his dream girl, whom he only knows as "The Little Red Haired Girl." However, he''s too nervous to go meet her upfront and all his attempts to impress her at school backfire disastrously. His friends, Linus and Peppermint Patty, try to help, but only aggravate the situation, while Charlie Brown desperately tries to find a solution to this romantic conundrum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bSGFPFlPEimKxZbZH2FX6U9Ewd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51528'),
  ('593909803908748749', 'You''re in the Navy Now', 1951, 'Comedy, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Joseph MacDonald', 'John W. Hazard, Richard Murphy', 'Gary Cooper, Jane Greer, Millard Mitchell, Eddie Albert, John McIntire, Ray Collins, Harry von Zell, Jack Webb', 'NR', 'When Lt. John Harkness is assigned as the new skipper of a submarine chaser equipped with an experimental steam engine, he hopes that the U.S.S. Teakettle''s veterans will afford him enough help to accomplish the ship''s goals. Unfortunately, he finds the crew and its officers share his novice status or only have experience in diesel engines.', 'When Lt. John Harkness is assigned as the new skipper of a submarine chaser equipped with an experimental steam engine, he hopes that the U.S.S. Teakettle''s veterans will afford him enough help to accomplish the ship''s goals. Unfortunately, he finds the crew and its officers share his novice status or only have experience in diesel engines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtOFdhGWSRjjheulHoMTurCkqTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81305'),
  ('68876176336201987', 'You''re in the Super Bowl, Charlie Brown!', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez, Nick Vasu', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Jimmy Guardino, John Christian Graas, Molly Dunham, Haley Peel, Nicole Fisher, Crystal Kuns, Steve Stoliar, Bill Melendez', 'G', 'The Peanuts Gang competes in a punt, pass and kick contest. The winner gets a new bicycle and a trip to the Super Bowl. Meanwhile, Snoopy coaches the Birds football team (made up of a bunch of Woodstock-like birds) to the AFL (Animal Football League) Super Bowl.', 'The Peanuts Gang competes in a punt, pass and kick contest. The winner gets a new bicycle and a trip to the Super Bowl. Meanwhile, Snoopy coaches the Birds football team (made up of a bunch of Woodstock-like birds) to the AFL (Animal Football League) Super Bowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXdrRZMJyOyvFGCqEAEuKbI6HJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141891'),
  ('86638587532768550', 'You''re Invited to Mary-Kate & Ashley''s Sleepover Party', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, Music', 'Michael Kruzan', 'Michael Kruzan', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Cara DeLizia, Vanessa Croft, Trent Olsen', 'PG', 'Boys and girls pack up your pajamas and sleeping bags because You''re Invited to Mary-Kate & Ashley''s™ Sleepover Party™! Join in the fun as Mary-Kate & Ashley and all their friends have pillow fights, dance and share secrets about friends, school, and sports! The fun doesn''t stop as they outwit the pranks of their older brother and his buddies! With five dynamite new songs to sing along to, this is one slumber party boys and girls alike won''t want to miss!', 'Boys and girls pack up your pajamas and sleeping bags because You''re Invited to Mary-Kate & Ashley''s™ Sleepover Party™! Join in the fun as Mary-Kate & Ashley and all their friends have pillow fights, dance and share secrets about friends, school, and sports! The fun doesn''t stop as they outwit the pranks of their older brother and his buddies! With five dynamite new songs to sing along to, this is one slumber party boys and girls alike won''t want to miss!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMa4P45ncl9dZYoMKMXtB78QnNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456031'),
  ('697272831831088331', 'You''re Killing Me', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Jerren Lauder, Beth Hanna, Jeff Tomcho', 'Brad Martocello, Walker Hare', 'McKaley Miller, Dermot Mulroney, Anne Heche, Wil Deusner, Brice Anthony Heller, Morgana Van Peebles, Keyara Milliner, Jayson Warner Smith', 'NR', 'Eden goes to a coveted ''Heaven and Hell'' party, hoping to get a letter of recommendation to an elite university from the wealthy parents of her classmate, but the party quickly turns into a fight for her life.', 'Eden goes to a coveted ''Heaven and Hell'' party, hoping to get a letter of recommendation to an elite university from the wealthy parents of her classmate, but the party quickly turns into a fight for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAnwQKYkRlXS6Lgaq5XQ7JqS58x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975022'),
  ('571086060130032089', 'You''re Killing Me Susana', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Roberto Sneider', 'Roberto Sneider, Luis Cámara', 'Gael García Bernal, Verónica Echegui, Ashley Hinshaw, Hlyunr Harraldson, Barbara Garrick, Jadyn Wong, Adam Hurtig, Andrés Almeida', null, 'An actor''s world comes crashing down after he learns that his wife has left him.', 'An actor''s world comes crashing down after he learns that his wife has left him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQYzXhaj7nMyICTLnhLtyjspuXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264418'),
  ('298139620006016226', 'You’re Missing the Point', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Juan Bustillo Oro, Jack Draper', 'Juan Bustillo Oro, Humberto Gómez Landero', 'Cantinflas, Joaquín Pardavé, Sara García, Sofía Álvarez, Dolores Camarillo, Manuel Noriega, Antonio R. Frausto, Agustín Isunza', null, 'Cantinflas, the boyfriend of the servant of a rich industrial man, gets into the house in order to kill a mad dog. Suddenly this man appears so the servant tells him that Cantinflas is his wife''s brother (Leonardo), who had been lost for years. The rich man then remembers that his father in law''s testament could only be paid when all brothers get together, so treats Cantinflas, a real bum, as a king.', 'Cantinflas, the boyfriend of the servant of a rich industrial man, gets into the house in order to kill a mad dog. Suddenly this man appears so the servant tells him that Cantinflas is his wife''s brother (Leonardo), who had been lost for years. The rich man then remembers that his father in law''s testament could only be paid when all brothers get together, so treats Cantinflas, a real bum, as a king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7InpV6dgNluylBbIR2nYZ5N8aT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69060'),
  ('743688377805342826', 'You''re My Hero', 2003, 'Drama, Action', 'Antonio Cuadri, Álex Catalán', 'Antonio Cuadri, Carlos Asorey', 'Manuel Lozano, Toni Cantó, Félix López, Maru Valdivielso, Carmen Ruiz', null, 'Thirteen-year-old Ramon is on the verge of many adolescent discoveries -- and the confusion that goes along with them. Shy and awkward, he''s moved from town to town throughout his childhood and believes that life is about winning and losing. But he soon learns it''s all about survival. Like Ramon, Spain is in transition (President Francisco Franco is about to die); it''s a time of social upheaval marked by change, illusion and struggle.', 'Thirteen-year-old Ramon is on the verge of many adolescent discoveries -- and the confusion that goes along with them. Shy and awkward, he''s moved from town to town throughout his childhood and believes that life is about winning and losing. But he soon learns it''s all about survival. Like Ramon, Spain is in transition (President Francisco Franco is about to die); it''s a time of social upheaval marked by change, illusion and struggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNGhZvvDvkfxKlJ1Y96rBFGrTUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36004'),
  ('650386486564017171', 'You''re My Home', 2012, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Özcan Deniz', 'Özcan Deniz, Avni Tuna Dilligil', 'Özcan Deniz, Fahriye Evcen, Sait Genay, Özay Fecht, Levent Öktem, Güneş Hayat, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı, Gizem Denizci', null, 'After returning back to family, Leyla tries to fix everytihng while starting a new life wit Iskender. Everything goes smoothly until troubles find Leyla...', 'After returning back to family, Leyla tries to fix everytihng while starting a new life wit Iskender. Everything goes smoothly until troubles find Leyla...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTcQK4nPROXM0S20WiBYV7OVu7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141901'),
  ('923404056647302443', 'You''re Never Too Young', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Norman Taurog, Daniel L. Fapp, Michael D. Moore', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Diana Lynn, Nina Foch, Raymond Burr, Mitzi McCall, Veda Ann Borg, Margery Maude', 'NR', 'When an aspiring barber becomes inadvertently involved in the theft of a valuable diamond, necessity forces him to masquerade as a 12 year-old child - with humorous consequences.', 'When an aspiring barber becomes inadvertently involved in the theft of a valuable diamond, necessity forces him to masquerade as a 12 year-old child - with humorous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIy3vSiPmDvoH6EGtr86aS28zjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53441'),
  ('1053323877387668557', 'You''re Next', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrew Droz Palermo, Adam Wingard, Cory Johnson', 'Simon Barrett', 'Sharni Vinson, Nicholas Tucci, Wendy Glenn, AJ Bowen, Joe Swanberg, Margaret Laney, Amy Seimetz, Ti West', 'R', 'When the Davison family comes under attack during their wedding anniversary getaway, the gang of mysterious killers soon learns that one of their victims harbors a secret talent for fighting back.', 'When the Davison family comes under attack during their wedding anniversary getaway, the gang of mysterious killers soon learns that one of their victims harbors a secret talent for fighting back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l163jakfKvchUTVTtBi0KA7ZhIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83899'),
  ('879310097413734256', 'You''re Not Alone', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Eduardo Rodríguez', 'Andrew Wong', 'Katia Winter, Martin Barabas, Julee Cerda, Zach Avery, Bettina Skye, Richard Bekins, Emmy James, Sara Harman', null, 'After the premature death of her estranged husband, Emma (Winter) regains custody of their young daughter Isla (Jones) and hopes to rebuild their relationship after many years apart. But when an evil entity begins to torment them, mother and daughter are forced to face the inexplicable presence that inhabits the walls of their new home.', 'After the premature death of her estranged husband, Emma (Winter) regains custody of their young daughter Isla (Jones) and hopes to rebuild their relationship after many years apart. But when an evil entity begins to torment them, mother and daughter are forced to face the inexplicable presence that inhabits the walls of their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aBF1D5CXnYZ4eWLHHP3HtKCFph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522655'),
  ('542748506424355582', 'You''re Not Elected, Charlie Brown', 1972, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Chad Webber, Robin Kohn, Stephen Shea, Hilary Momberger-Powers, Todd Barbee, Linda Ercoli, Vince Guaraldi, Brian Kazanjian', null, 'With the school election looming, Linus is talked into running for school president. With Lucy and Charlie Brown as his campaign manager and Snoopy and Woodstock assisting, he stands a decent chance of victory. Soon however, he makes unrealistic promises and learns the hard way that preaching about the Great Pumpkin can not be considered a sound campaign strategy.', 'With the school election looming, Linus is talked into running for school president. With Lucy and Charlie Brown as his campaign manager and Snoopy and Woodstock assisting, he stands a decent chance of victory. Soon however, he makes unrealistic promises and learns the hard way that preaching about the Great Pumpkin can not be considered a sound campaign strategy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxo7gZX6SIVQxkfGsISjurwkqyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31732'),
  ('365862012254443215', 'You''re Not Normal, Either!', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Ikeuchi, Kôji Maeda, Takahiro Takasugi', 'Ryo Takada', 'Ryo Narita, Kaya Kiyohara, Rika Izumi, Kotaro Koizumi, Kasumi Yamaya, Yuki Kura, Mai Ohtani, Yua Shiraishi', null, 'Ono Yasuomi is a cram school teacher with poor communication skills. He hopes to get married but doesn''t know what ordinary means and feels awkward on dates with women. He asks Kasumi, a student who knows lots of trivia about romance, to teach him the meaning of ordinary.', 'Ono Yasuomi is a cram school teacher with poor communication skills. He hopes to get married but doesn''t know what ordinary means and feels awkward on dates with women. He asks Kasumi, a student who knows lots of trivia about romance, to teach him the meaning of ordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytmZGQmUwmWS9c8Ks8vnndRujtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768797'),
  ('126332132735684914', 'You''re Not You', 2014, 'Drama', 'George C. Wolfe, Steven Fierberg', 'Shana Feste, Jordan Roberts', 'Hilary Swank, Emmy Rossum, Josh Duhamel, Stephanie Beatriz, Julian McMahon, Ali Larter, Loretta Devine, Andrea Savage', 'R', 'When an accomplished pianist is diagnosed with the devastating and incurable disease ALS, she hires a directionless young woman who becomes her full-time caregiver. Complete opposites, the strangers form a life-changing bond inspiring each other to live life to fullest, while being brought together by the most challenging of circumstances.', 'When an accomplished pianist is diagnosed with the devastating and incurable disease ALS, she hires a directionless young woman who becomes her full-time caregiver. Complete opposites, the strangers form a life-changing bond inspiring each other to live life to fullest, while being brought together by the most challenging of circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvrdukoeCuVckHlbAxU0MPoIzPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290542'),
  ('920693909907110000', 'You''re on Your Own', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini, Mariano Laurenti, Carlo Carlini', 'Piero De Bernardi, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Peppino De Filippo, Totò, Laura Adani, Franca Valeri, Vittorio Caprioli, Cristina Gaïoni, Cathia Caro, Marcello Paolini', null, 'In post war Italy during the fifties it is very difficult to find a house to rent and a family ends up living in a former brothel.', 'In post war Italy during the fifties it is very difficult to find a house to rent and a family ends up living in a former brothel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FRYQYQi4TuqvqzVejZIMvo7m3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60193'),
  ('595033983617744979', 'You''re Only Young Once', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wade B. Rubottom, Edwin B. Willis, Douglas Shearer', 'Kay Van Riper', 'Lewis Stone, Cecilia Parker, Mickey Rooney, Fay Holden, Frank Craven, Ann Rutherford, Eleanor Lynn, Ted Pearson', 'NR', 'Andy Hardy and his sister find romance during a family vacation in Catalina.', 'Andy Hardy and his sister find romance during a family vacation in Catalina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MJsOBskKYumY30e94h7xyP6dCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116232'),
  ('119303992571638616', 'You''re Out of Your Mind, Madicken', 1979, 'Family', 'Göran Graffman, Jörgen Persson', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Jonna Liljendahl, Liv Alsterlund, Monica Nordquist, Björn Granath, Lis Nilheim, Birgitta Andersson, Allan Edwall, Sebastian Håkansson', null, 'Madicken is a Swedish girl from the upper level family, growing up during the time of first world war which did not include Sweden. She lives happily with her family, experiencing the world and making brave and crazy things.', 'Madicken is a Swedish girl from the upper level family, growing up during the time of first world war which did not include Sweden. She lives happily with her family, experiencing the world and making brave and crazy things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkI20XzqUNLUk6Qa0sTKZcTauaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27598'),
  ('135674253986036442', 'You''re Sleeping, Nicole', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stéphane Lafleur, Sara Mishara', 'Stéphane Lafleur', 'Julianne Côté, Catherine St-Laurent, Marc-André Grondin, Francis La Haye, Simon Larouche, Godefroy Reding, Alexis Lefebvre, Mark Barakat', null, 'Making the most of the family home while her parents are away, 22-year-old Nicole is enjoying a peaceful summer with her best friend Véronique. But when Nicole’s older brother shows up with his band to record an album, the girls’ friendship is put to the test.', 'Making the most of the family home while her parents are away, 22-year-old Nicole is enjoying a peaceful summer with her best friend Véronique. But when Nicole’s older brother shows up with his band to record an album, the girls’ friendship is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCsnPN6GS9tvOBpmLosnvhZJqRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270886'),
  ('812988730491920042', 'You''re So Cupid', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Romance, Family', 'John Lyde', 'Sally Meyer', 'Lauren Holly, Brian Krause, Jeremy Sumpter, Caitlin E.J. Meyer, Danielle Chuchran, Amanda Gallo, Melise, Chad Hively', null, 'Fraternal twin sisters Emma and Lilly are as different as night and day. Emma, the beautiful blonde tomboy, would rather be riding a horse than anything else in the world. While Lilly, her shy redheaded twin, loves to be left alone to curl up with a good book. Emma and Lilly have an insatiable desire to play matchmaker, because their father is actually Cupid. Life gets complicated when they discover they''re in love with the same guy and they become bitter rivals as they try to win his affection. But can Emma and Lily overcome their problems and use their matchmaking skills to bring their parents back together?', 'Fraternal twin sisters Emma and Lilly are as different as night and day. Emma, the beautiful blonde tomboy, would rather be riding a horse than anything else in the world. While Lilly, her shy redheaded twin, loves to be left alone to curl up with a good book. Emma and Lilly have an insatiable desire to play matchmaker, because their father is actually Cupid. Life gets complicated when they discover they''re in love with the same guy and they become bitter rivals as they try to win his affection. But can Emma and Lily overcome their problems and use their matchmaking skills to bring their parents back together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYVt2jwctIsZqKrbSLJzB5p9iHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77235'),
  ('985007941333894223', 'You''re Telling Me!', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Erle C. Kenton', 'Paul M. Jones, Walter DeLeon', 'W.C. Fields, Joan Marsh, Buster Crabbe, Adrienne Ames, Louise Carter, Kathleen Howard, Tammany Young, Dell Henderson', 'NR', 'Sam Bisbee is an inventor whose works (e.g., a keyhole finder for drunks) have brought him only poverty. His daughter is in love with the son of the town snob. Events conspire to ruin his bullet-proof tire just as success seems near. Another of his inventions prohibits him from committing suicide, so Sam decides to go on living.', 'Sam Bisbee is an inventor whose works (e.g., a keyhole finder for drunks) have brought him only poverty. His daughter is in love with the son of the town snob. Events conspire to ruin his bullet-proof tire just as success seems near. Another of his inventions prohibits him from committing suicide, so Sam decides to go on living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZVjzGlQEGcs0YZT6u71jO1d6LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131732'),
  ('132619748626703810', 'You''re the Greatest, Charlie Brown', 1979, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Arrin Skelley, Patricia Patts, Casey Carlson, Michelle Muller, Daniel Anderson, Bill Melendez, Mel Blanc, Scott Beach', 'NR', 'Charlie Brown, Marcie and Snoopy compete in the Junior Olympics'' decathlon event.', 'Charlie Brown, Marcie and Snoopy compete in the Junior Olympics'' decathlon event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fImQKuTSue5OYFm8i9GIFdsFN4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52446'),
  ('987593243073307929', 'You''re the One', 2000, 'Drama', 'José Luis Garci, Raúl Pérez Cubero', 'José Luis Garci, Horacio Valcárcel', 'Lydia Bosch, Julia Gutiérrez Caba, Juan Diego, Ana Fernández, Manuel Lozano, Iñaki Miramón, Fernando Guillén, Carlos Hipólito', null, 'Julia, an only child of an affluent, bank owning family living in Madrid, escapes from her family to get over her grief that her boyfriend has been imprisoned. Julia is a well educated woman, having studied in Switzerland and England, who wants to become a writer. Julia drives to a little village in Asturias called "Corralbos del Sella" and there she stays in a mansion "llendelabarca" of an old childhood friend "Pilara" she had spent many a happy summer with. Also living there is Pilara''s mother in law Tia Gala, and her grandson Juanito. Julia''s relationship with caretakers, teacher and priest makes Julia, a woman of the spanish capital, perhaps for the first time to not feel so alone.', 'Julia, an only child of an affluent, bank owning family living in Madrid, escapes from her family to get over her grief that her boyfriend has been imprisoned. Julia is a well educated woman, having studied in Switzerland and England, who wants to become a writer. Julia drives to a little village in Asturias called "Corralbos del Sella" and there she stays in a mansion "llendelabarca" of an old childhood friend "Pilara" she had spent many a happy summer with. Also living there is Pilara''s mother in law Tia Gala, and her grandson Juanito. Julia''s relationship with caretakers, teacher and priest makes Julia, a woman of the spanish capital, perhaps for the first time to not feel so alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7y5TR3afT4eAfkzp0QCYWq5KSLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156635'),
  ('297730075279895872', 'You''re Too Careless with Your Kisses!', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Johnny Murray, Rudolf Ising', null, 'A bee returns home late after a night out having too much honey. His wife leaves him, but quickly ends up in the clutches of an evil large predator.', 'A bee returns home late after a night out having too much honey. His wife leaves him, but quickly ends up in the clutches of an evil large predator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsFwbKtupZNANQgaPBX5YXdT5wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156497'),
  ('1096381330618132267', 'You''re Under Arrest: The Motion Picture', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Atsuko Nakajima, Junji Nishimura', 'Masashi Sogo', 'Akiko Hiramatsu, Sakiko Tamagawa, Bin Shimada, Etsuko Kozakura, Ikuya Sawaki, Issei Masamune, Masaki Aizawa, Masato Sako', 'PG-13', 'Officers Tsujimoto and Kobayakawa are transferred back to Bokuto Police Station after stints in other police departments. Shortly after this, the discovery of smuggled firearms and the recovery of a magnetic disc herald new troubles for Bokuto station as the Chief is thrown in jail for keeping silent over "Bee Number One", developed by Detective Emoto who went missing two years ago.', 'Officers Tsujimoto and Kobayakawa are transferred back to Bokuto Police Station after stints in other police departments. Shortly after this, the discovery of smuggled firearms and the recovery of a magnetic disc herald new troubles for Bokuto station as the Chief is thrown in jail for keeping silent over "Bee Number One", developed by Detective Emoto who went missing two years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9UpYIUzYn63FXNlPcbUzTw4vZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51106'),
  ('599110286582179888', 'You''ve Got A Friend', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Ryuichi Hiroki', 'Hisako Kurosawa', 'Jun Murakami, Nahana, Masao Yoshii, Momoka Ayukawa, Shima Onishi, Kenta Kiguchi, Kensuke Tanaka, Masato Hyugaji', null, 'Yoshio is a man who works for the city''s water department and live with his mother. He regularly visits to the SM Queen Miho, but he still cannot forget the legendary SM Queen Yukiko.', 'Yoshio is a man who works for the city''s water department and live with his mother. He regularly visits to the SM Queen Miho, but he still cannot forget the legendary SM Queen Yukiko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSNThy7gN1ChJYZDYCWr1wrOBIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002535'),
  ('169224778557404179', 'You''ve Got Beautiful Stairs, You Know...', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Patrick Blossier', null, 'Isabelle Adjani, Agnès Varda', 'NR', 'Short directed by Agnès Varda in 1986 on the occasion of the 50th anniversary of the French Cinematheque, presenting a contrast between the famous stairs from the place along with classic film images also revolving around stairs.', 'Short directed by Agnès Varda in 1986 on the occasion of the 50th anniversary of the French Cinematheque, presenting a contrast between the famous stairs from the place along with classic film images also revolving around stairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXBPYqQP8K7MHGBVORZnRSfmXB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264290'),
  ('145741061741070843', 'You''ve Got Mail', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Lindley, Nora Ephron, Maggie Murphy', 'Samson Raphaelson', 'Meg Ryan, Tom Hanks, Greg Kinnear, Parker Posey, Heather Burns, Dave Chappelle, Jean Stapleton, Steve Zahn', 'PG', 'Book superstore magnate Joe Fox and independent book shop owner Kathleen Kelly fall in love in the anonymity of the Internet—both blissfully unaware that he''s trying to put her out of business.', 'Book superstore magnate Joe Fox and independent book shop owner Kathleen Kelly fall in love in the anonymity of the Internet—both blissfully unaware that he''s trying to put her out of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2uVtH6TpMfUl7WeOM70ezkcjsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9489'),
  ('522891836351691232', 'You''ve Got Murder', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ali Atay', 'Aziz Kedi, Feyyaz Yiğit, Ali Atay', 'Uğur Yücel, Binnur Kaya, Cengiz Bozkurt, Feyyaz Yiğit, Mert Denizmen, Mehmet Özgür, Osman Alkaş, Açelya Topaloğlu', null, 'Istanbul Police Department homicide detectives encounter a murder nothing like they’ve seen before.Commissioners Emin, Salih, Asuman and deputy Alaattin begin investigating.But strange murders keep happening. They don’t have any evidence or any clues. Day by day, tempers flare and the police chiefs grow annoyed.As the murders keep piling up, the public’s interest rises. The pressure on Emin and his colleagues get intense. At last, the chief of police assigns “crime expert” Dizdar Koşu, who has recently come back from the US, to the team.Overwhelmed with panic, pressure and disdain, Emin and his friends try to solve the strangest series of murders with the most unusual methods.This fast race against time immediately turns into a tragicomedy.', 'Istanbul Police Department homicide detectives encounter a murder nothing like they’ve seen before.Commissioners Emin, Salih, Asuman and deputy Alaattin begin investigating.But strange murders keep happening. They don’t have any evidence or any clues. Day by day, tempers flare and the police chiefs grow annoyed.As the murders keep piling up, the public’s interest rises. The pressure on Emin and his colleagues get intense. At last, the chief of police assigns “crime expert” Dizdar Koşu, who has recently come back from the US, to the team.Overwhelmed with panic, pressure and disdain, Emin and his friends try to solve the strangest series of murders with the most unusual methods.This fast race against time immediately turns into a tragicomedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUwpfbOIYr9dpjG45pNkiqob9mC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629500'),
  ('248658051104894224', 'You''ve Got This', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Salvador Espinosa, Andrés León Becker', 'Tiaré Scanda, Leonardo Zimbrón', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Esmeralda Pimentel, Matteo Giannini, Regina Reynoso, Juan Martín Jáuregui, Tato Alexander, Moisés Arizmendi, Krizia Bajos', null, 'An ad creative and a successful exec have a great marriage — until he wants to be a dad just as her star is rising. Then he brings someone new home.', 'An ad creative and a successful exec have a great marriage — until he wants to be a dad just as her star is rising. Then he brings someone new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpY2ZhxqsHYXjaaFUHzQ0nmIjYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746957'),
  ('532960806333802459', 'Young & Beautiful', 2013, 'Drama', 'François Ozon, Pascal Marti', 'François Ozon', 'Marine Vacth, Géraldine Pailhas, Charlotte Rampling, Frédéric Pierrot, Nathalie Richard, Johan Leysen, Fantin Ravat, Laurent Delbecque', 'NR', 'Isabelle, a 17-year-old student, loses her virginity during a quick holiday romance. When she returns home, she begins a secret life as a prostitute for a year.', 'Isabelle, a 17-year-old student, loses her virginity during a quick holiday romance. When she returns home, she begins a secret life as a prostitute for a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RSjzqKIqL5g2OxVIEZQ6ksP1MW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184314'),
  ('939291150165627782', 'Young & Fine', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Toshiya Kominami, Takehiko Tamiya, Takehiko Tamiya', 'Hideo Jojo', 'Taisuke Niihara, Yuka Kouri, Araho Yuki, Yui Kitamura, Kensuke Takahashi, Ryutaro Yamasaki, Shohei Uno, On Nakano', null, 'In a quiet seaside town, high school students Haino and Reiko are dating. They try to go further than just kissing, but fail due to a condition set by Reiko: Haino must win his next rugby match to earn her consent. Motivated by this goal, Haino devotes himself to the game—until a new woman catches his eye: Izawa, a substitute teacher at their school. When Reiko sees Izawa getting close to Haino, she becomes consumed with jealousy.', 'In a quiet seaside town, high school students Haino and Reiko are dating. They try to go further than just kissing, but fail due to a condition set by Reiko: Haino must win his next rugby match to earn her consent. Motivated by this goal, Haino devotes himself to the game—until a new woman catches his eye: Izawa, a substitute teacher at their school. When Reiko sees Izawa getting close to Haino, she becomes consumed with jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a62946JcSc0arrcaYqfkRTbDgqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1447947'),
  ('758617365902175711', 'Young Adam', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'David Mackenzie, Giles Nuttgens, Michael Elliott', 'David Mackenzie', 'Ewan McGregor, Tilda Swinton, Peter Mullan, Emily Mortimer, Jack McElhone, Thérèse Bradley, Ewan Stewart, Stuart McQuarrie', 'R', 'A young drifter working on a river barge disrupts his employers'' lives while hiding the fact that he knows more about a dead woman found in the river than he admits.', 'A young drifter working on a river barge disrupts his employers'' lives while hiding the fact that he knows more about a dead woman found in the river than he admits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rU5GJ5r4tQbSx9C2ENKbPkD6nr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237'),
  ('93098579608255543', 'Young Adult', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jason Reitman, Eric Steelberg', 'Diablo Cody', 'Charlize Theron, Patton Oswalt, Patrick Wilson, Elizabeth Reaser, Collette Wolfe, Jill Eikenberry, Richard Bekins, Mary Beth Hurt', 'R', 'A divorced writer from the Midwest returns to her hometown to reconnect with an old flame, who''s now married with a family.', 'A divorced writer from the Midwest returns to her hometown to reconnect with an old flame, who''s now married with a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tGMz5xUs9sk8X9B28G6UalHK1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57157'),
  ('420876119014955077', 'Young Adult Matters', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lee Sang-moon, Lee Hwan, Kim Hyun-ok', 'Lee Hwan', 'Lee You-mi, Hani, Shin Haet-bit, Lee Hwan, Park Kang-seop, Bang Eun-jeong, Heo Joon-seok, Han Sung-soo', null, 'Se-jin, a high school student, becomes pregnant and gets ostracized by her family and school. While wandering the streets, she meets Joo-yeong, an experienced runaway, and tries to get an abortion with Joo-yeong''s help.', 'Se-jin, a high school student, becomes pregnant and gets ostracized by her family and school. While wandering the streets, she meets Joo-yeong, an experienced runaway, and tries to get an abortion with Joo-yeong''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GdI2d330vgaNHdqOv3gbsK562E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671040'),
  ('422847044621384556', 'Young Again', 1986, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Laszlo George, Steven Hilliard Stern', null, 'Lindsay Wagner, Robert Urich, Keanu Reeves, Jack Gilford, Jessica Steen, Jason Nicoloff, Jeremy Ratchford, Peter Spence', 'PG', 'A 40-year-old bachelor gets his wish to be 17 again, and he goes back to high school where he romances the daughter of the woman he dated in high school the first time.', 'A 40-year-old bachelor gets his wish to be 17 again, and he goes back to high school where he romances the daughter of the woman he dated in high school the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4ZW15twOPBgnMry2XrG0QNs5vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148175'),
  ('214614632670174770', 'Young Ahmed', 2019, 'Drama', 'Benoît Dervaux, Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Idir Ben Addi, Olivier Bonnaud, Myriem Akheddiou, Victoria Bluck, Claire Bodson, Othmane Moumen, Amine Hamidou', null, 'A young Belgian is incited by his imam to view a teacher as an apostate and assassinate her; after he fails, he is sent to juvenile reform.', 'A young Belgian is incited by his imam to view a teacher as an apostate and assassinate her; after he fails, he is sent to juvenile reform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4D3GE3JzyrFe7pnSUqDwdq1KhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522373'),
  ('643305264217953768', 'Young and Alive', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Matthieu Bareyre, Matthieu Bareyre', 'Sophia Collet, Matthieu Bareyre', 'Rose-Marie Ayoko Folly', null, 'In the months following the terrorist attacks in Paris, the youth have seized the nights, looking for a sense of belonging in a world they have ceased to understand. Seeking to change the rules, led by new faces, driven by their values and ideals, they open a new dialogue, challenge the state and are getting ready for a new kind of revolution.', 'In the months following the terrorist attacks in Paris, the youth have seized the nights, looking for a sense of belonging in a world they have ceased to understand. Seeking to change the rules, led by new faces, driven by their values and ideals, they open a new dialogue, challenge the state and are getting ready for a new kind of revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9p9JHK0uUqOlLUZWxfxl8Z1Vvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537632'),
  ('846261808214607970', 'Young and Dangerous', 1996, 'Action, Crime', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung, Gigi Lai Chi, Jason Chu Wing-Tong', null, 'Five young hoodlums sing karaoke, murder, joke around, get beaten up, win and lose women, and learn the value of blind loyalty.', 'Five young hoodlums sing karaoke, murder, joke around, get beaten up, win and lose women, and learn the value of blind loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLfEVzChm3akXJNhyQGWGrmEjd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39828'),
  ('191955102906584501', 'Young and Dangerous 2', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Cheang Pou-Soi', 'Sharon Hui, Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Kelly Lai Chen, Gigi Lai Chi, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi', null, 'Chicken is back in exile. Hung Hing, a triad, is trying to ally with Chicken''s new group, the Taiwanese triad San Luen. A contest is on in Hong Kong. The winner will head the Causeway Bay branch.', 'Chicken is back in exile. Hung Hing, a triad, is trying to ally with Chicken''s new group, the Taiwanese triad San Luen. A contest is on in Hong Kong. The winner will head the Causeway Bay branch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pFybR8t2IypYus46KBRuAuwSA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48938'),
  ('175967573904448929', 'Young and Dangerous 3', 1996, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Chau Ting', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Gigi Lai Chi, Simon Yam, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Jason Chu Wing-Tong', null, 'This time taking on the rival Tung Sing triad, who is attempting to usurp Hung Hing influence in Hong Kong by having Tung Sing member Crow frame Ho Nam for the murder of Hung Hing Chairman Chiang Tin Sang. On the plus side, Chicken finds a new love interest in Wasabi, the daughter of the comedic priest, Father Lethal Weapon Lam.', 'This time taking on the rival Tung Sing triad, who is attempting to usurp Hung Hing influence in Hong Kong by having Tung Sing member Crow frame Ho Nam for the murder of Hung Hing Chairman Chiang Tin Sang. On the plus side, Chicken finds a new love interest in Wasabi, the daughter of the comedic priest, Father Lethal Weapon Lam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx4COZ81XFPWAZ7H8h0GyZNCnHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48940'),
  ('274079991821903410', 'Young and Dangerous 4', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Jason Chu Wing-Tong, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi, Michael Tse Tin-Wah', null, 'The boss of the Hung Hing gang, Tian Sang, has died. Ho Nam and Hon Bun find Sangs younger brother, Yang to lead the gang. Meanwhile, Hon Bun receives news that his younger brother, a leader of the Tuen Mun gang has been assasinated. They travel to Hong Kong to settle the matter.', 'The boss of the Hung Hing gang, Tian Sang, has died. Ho Nam and Hon Bun find Sangs younger brother, Yang to lead the gang. Meanwhile, Hon Bun receives news that his younger brother, a leader of the Tuen Mun gang has been assasinated. They travel to Hong Kong to settle the matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJSXHiC6FBN2Y9pGV8d6UGQechZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48942'),
  ('630882233208275689', 'Young and Dangerous 5', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Chau Ting', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Shu Qi, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Chin Ka-Lok, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Paul Chun Pui, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Jason Chu Wing-Tong', null, 'Although Chicken does not make an appearance, Chan Ho Nam finds a new love interest in the form of Mei Ling. Meanwhile, Tung Sing returns to cause trouble again for Hung Hing, in the form of new leader Szeto Ho Nam.', 'Although Chicken does not make an appearance, Chan Ho Nam finds a new love interest in the form of Mei Ling. Meanwhile, Tung Sing returns to cause trouble again for Hung Hing, in the form of new leader Szeto Ho Nam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8t86BIBKo8IuhsJPfIK6sccZq7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48943'),
  ('338213194447806907', 'Young and Dangerous: The Prequel', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Ang Liu Cowman, Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Chau Ting', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Sam Lee, Yu Ka-Ho, Benjamin Yuen Wai-Ho, Lillian Ho Ga-Lai, Daniel Wu, Shu Qi, Francis Ng Chun-Yu', null, 'Showcasing the earlier years of Chan Ho Nam and Chicken, this prequel tells of their time during their willingness to follow Hung Hing''s Uncle Bee.', 'Showcasing the earlier years of Chan Ho Nam and Chicken, this prequel tells of their time during their willingness to follow Hung Hing''s Uncle Bee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbI6eAqD7DP9M05KI76gla2W6BH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48963'),
  ('1152647260476968479', 'Young and Healthy as a Rose', 1971, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Jovan Jovanović, Petar Lalović, Dragoljub Tripčevski', 'Jovan Jovanović', 'Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Aleksandar Gavrić, María Baxa, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković', null, 'Young and Healthy as a Rose follows Stevan Nikolić, "Stiv", a petty criminal born in Belgrade, and his rise to power along with drugs, sex and with the help of the local police.', 'Young and Healthy as a Rose follows Stevan Nikolić, "Stiv", a petty criminal born in Belgrade, and his rise to power along with drugs, sex and with the help of the local police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l17lWCRm0T0otFa7Rh3HiiC2PUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62067'),
  ('391662047071836798', 'Young and Innocent', 1937, 'Thriller, Romance, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Bernard Knowles, Pen Tennyson', 'Anthony Armstrong, Edwin Greenwood, Charles Bennett', 'Nova Pilbeam, Derrick De Marney, Percy Marmont, Edward Rigby, Mary Clare, John Longden, George Curzon, Basil Radford', 'NR', 'When a young writer is falsely accused of murdering a famous actress, he escapes custody and joins forces with the daughter of a police constable to prove his innocence.', 'When a young writer is falsely accused of murdering a famous actress, he escapes custody and joins forces with the daughter of a police constable to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knc0wcxarPM6Qy3uOm1RV38JGzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2762'),
  ('1128896608643192764', 'Young and old in action...', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Orestis Laskos, Spiros Kalakos', 'Asimakis Gialamas, Costas Pretederis', 'Mary Aroni, Labros Konstadaras, Vasilis Avlonitis, Giorgos Panjas, Viveta Tsiouni, Vagelis Seilinos, Eleni Anousaki, Bety Moshona', null, 'Antonis and Marianna are in love and, although they are no longer young, they plan to get married. The only problem is how to break the news to their children, Elina and Giorgos, who are studying abroad. Elina sends a telegram saying that she will soon be returning to Greece, and Antonis and Marianna think they will make her like Marianna so that they can gradually tell her the truth. However, they do not know that she is returning with George...', 'Antonis and Marianna are in love and, although they are no longer young, they plan to get married. The only problem is how to break the news to their children, Elina and Giorgos, who are studying abroad. Elina sends a telegram saying that she will soon be returning to Greece, and Antonis and Marianna think they will make her like Marianna so that they can gradually tell her the truth. However, they do not know that she is returning with George...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OZREONo8bE0zg9H5sOvFEVSEIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332409'),
  ('239347846807127534', 'Young and Wild', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marialy Rivas, Sergio Armstrong, Marialy Rivas', 'Marialy Rivas, Pedro Peirano, Sebastián Sepúlveda', 'Alicia Rodríguez, María Gracia Omegna, Felipe Pinto, Ingrid Isensee, Aline Küppenheim, Alejandro Goic, Tomás de Pablo, Pablo Krögh', null, 'Daniela, raised in the bosom of a strict Evangelical family and recently unmasked as a fornicator by her shocked parents, struggles to find her own path to spiritual harmony.', 'Daniela, raised in the bosom of a strict Evangelical family and recently unmasked as a fornicator by her shocked parents, struggles to find her own path to spiritual harmony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixTyxtsK6W63jrWjixczyeJSex2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84354'),
  ('625829110983613272', 'Young Aphrodites', 1963, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nikos Koundouros, Giovanni Varriano', 'Longus, Kostas Sfikas, Theokritos', 'Takis Emmanuel, Eleni Prokopiou, Vangelis Ioannidis, Kleopatra Rota, Zannino, Kostas Papakonstantinou, Anestis Vlahos, Stathis Giallelis', null, '200 BC. During a merciless drought, the brute nature of man and the delicate essence of woman become inextricably intertwined, as the omnipotence of the carnal instinct demands the total surrender of the flesh.', '200 BC. During a merciless drought, the brute nature of man and the delicate essence of woman become inextricably intertwined, as the omnipotence of the carnal instinct demands the total surrender of the flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ariRzMfwePqmTAeJxvCFI8sBIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80988'),
  ('150548488337323353', 'Young at Heart', 1954, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Gordon Douglas, Ted D. McCord, Al Alleborn', 'Liam O''Brien', 'Doris Day, Frank Sinatra, Gig Young, Ethel Barrymore, Dorothy Malone, Robert Keith, Elisabeth Fraser, Alan Hale Jr.', null, 'The lives and romances of three sisters in a musical family; the youngest daughter''s life is complicated by the subsequent arrival of a charming composer and a cynical music arranger.', 'The lives and romances of three sisters in a musical family; the youngest daughter''s life is complicated by the subsequent arrival of a charming composer and a cynical music arranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4n74mKJAfx1ln1CTGSa9vxS1z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43340'),
  ('424715759011204934', 'Young At Heart', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Stephen Walker, Sally George, Ed Marritz', null, 'Joe Benoit, Helen Boston, Louise Canady, Elaine Fligman, Jean Florio, Len Fontaine, Stan Goldman, Jeanne Hatch', 'PG', 'Documents the true story of the final weeks of rehearsal for the Young at Heart Chorus in Northampton, MA, and many of whom must overcome health adversities to participate. Their music goes against the stereotype of their age group. Although they have toured Europe and sang for royalty, this account focuses on preparing new songs for a concert in their hometown.', 'Documents the true story of the final weeks of rehearsal for the Young at Heart Chorus in Northampton, MA, and many of whom must overcome health adversities to participate. Their music goes against the stereotype of their age group. Although they have toured Europe and sang for royalty, this account focuses on preparing new songs for a concert in their hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxBmL96MrP0OQLXXMIsmSi6urGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21182'),
  ('970895425865655212', 'Young Aunt', 2018, 'Romance', 'Kye Jang-hyuk', null, 'Park Joo-bin, Lee Eun-mi, Min Do-yoon', null, 'Jung-hoon manages to get into a university in the outskirst of the city after years of trying, but he can''t find a place to stay so he stays at his aunt''s house. Ji-hyun runs a shopping mall with her friend Eun-young. Jung-hoon arrives at Ji-hyun''s house with just an address and runs into Eun-young who happens to be completely naked.', 'Jung-hoon manages to get into a university in the outskirst of the city after years of trying, but he can''t find a place to stay so he stays at his aunt''s house. Ji-hyun runs a shopping mall with her friend Eun-young. Jung-hoon arrives at Ji-hyun''s house with just an address and runs into Eun-young who happens to be completely naked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSsyYVPKlfEaAHq3xNCpI6TkLjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544581'),
  ('149550662716807358', 'Young Aunt 3', 2020, 'Romance', 'Kye Jang-hyuk', null, 'Sae Bom, Ah Reum, Hae Il, Si Woo, Park Do-jin', null, 'Seok-yeong has been living with his father ever since his parents got divorced when he was young. His father, Joong-nam, would always introduce his new girlfriends to Seok-yeong, but Seok-yeong didn''t like running into strangers in his house. At the same time, Seok-yeong feels more comfortable with women older than him. One day, Joong-nam says he''s going to marry his new girlfriend, Gyeo-won. At a family dinner, Seok-yeong feels attracted to Gyeo-won''s sister, Gyeo-woon, but he has to call her ''aunt''', 'Seok-yeong has been living with his father ever since his parents got divorced when he was young. His father, Joong-nam, would always introduce his new girlfriends to Seok-yeong, but Seok-yeong didn''t like running into strangers in his house. At the same time, Seok-yeong feels more comfortable with women older than him. One day, Joong-nam says he''s going to marry his new girlfriend, Gyeo-won. At a family dinner, Seok-yeong feels attracted to Gyeo-won''s sister, Gyeo-woon, but he has to call her ''aunt''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD7kT9LysayisTiCrdFyhZWIuK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665142'),
  ('511453778721582505', 'Young Bess', 1953, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'George Sidney, Charles Rosher, George Rhein', 'Arthur Wimperis, Jan Lustig', 'Jean Simmons, Stewart Granger, Deborah Kerr, Charles Laughton, Kay Walsh, Guy Rolfe, Kathleen Byron, Cecil Kellaway', 'NR', 'The mother died under the executioner''s axe; the daughter rose to become England''s greatest monarch -- the brilliant and cunning Queen Elizabeth I. Jean Simmons portrays young Bess in this rich tapestry of a film that traces the tumultuous, danger-fraught years from Elizabeth''s birth to her unexpected ascension to the throne at a mere 25. Charles Laughton reprises his Academy Award®-winning* role as her formidable father Henry VIII. Deborah Kerr plays her last stepmother (and Henry''s last of six wives), gentle Catherine Parr. And Simmons'' then real-life husband, Stewart Granger, adds heroics as Lord Admiral Thomas Seymour. In a resplendent world of adventure, romance and court intrigue, Young Bess reigns.', 'The mother died under the executioner''s axe; the daughter rose to become England''s greatest monarch -- the brilliant and cunning Queen Elizabeth I. Jean Simmons portrays young Bess in this rich tapestry of a film that traces the tumultuous, danger-fraught years from Elizabeth''s birth to her unexpected ascension to the throne at a mere 25. Charles Laughton reprises his Academy Award®-winning* role as her formidable father Henry VIII. Deborah Kerr plays her last stepmother (and Henry''s last of six wives), gentle Catherine Parr. And Simmons'' then real-life husband, Stewart Granger, adds heroics as Lord Admiral Thomas Seymour. In a resplendent world of adventure, romance and court intrigue, Young Bess reigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI8vCadGjFtMnJdkRWDGnXrB8rv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44711'),
  ('531193144035166531', 'Young Billy Young', 1969, 'Western', 'Burt Kennedy, Harry Stradling Jr., Maxwell O. Henry', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Robert Mitchum, Angie Dickinson, Robert Walker Jr., David Carradine, Jack Kelly, John Anderson, Paul Fix, Willis Bouchey', 'G', 'A peace-loving man named Ben Kane takes a job as deputy marshal of Lords, in the old West. Kane is no lawman, but he accepts the badge because he has an old score to settle with the town''s chief trouble-maker. Once on the job, Kane must also deal with a young sharpshooter named Billy Young and a sharp and sassy saloon dancer, Lily.', 'A peace-loving man named Ben Kane takes a job as deputy marshal of Lords, in the old West. Kane is no lawman, but he accepts the badge because he has an old score to settle with the town''s chief trouble-maker. Once on the job, Kane must also deal with a young sharpshooter named Billy Young and a sharp and sassy saloon dancer, Lily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOCkCr7GbdaWaL1gf1pNJ3HPdsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39295'),
  ('642004176976894976', 'Young Black Stallion', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Simon Wincer, Reed Smoot, Andrew Power', 'Jeanne Rosenberg', 'Biana Tamimi, Richard Romanus, Patrick Elias, Gérard Rudolf, Ali Al Ameri, Andries Rossouw', 'G', 'When courageous young Neera becomes separated from her family in the desert, she chances upon a wild colt. Together they find friendship, trust, and their way back home only to discover her family is about to lose everything!', 'When courageous young Neera becomes separated from her family in the desert, she chances upon a wild colt. Together they find friendship, trust, and their way back home only to discover her family is about to lose everything!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emHK0UPlznLOkeu1Ml4ctoEQGp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42418'),
  ('597482316755262756', 'Young Buffalo Bill', 1940, 'Western', 'Joseph Kane, William Nobles', 'Harrison Jacobs, Robert Yost, Gerald Geraghty', 'Roy Rogers, Pauline Moore, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Trevor Bardette, Chief Thundercloud, Hugh Sothern, Steve Pendleton, Wade Boteler', null, 'It''s 1860 and the old Spanish land grants are being surveyed. Montez is after part of Don Regas'' rancho and gets the surveyor to alter the boundary. But Don Regas still has the original grant written on a bandanna. Montez sends Indians after it but Bill Cody and Gabby fight them off and a wounded Gabby unknowingly ends up with the missing million dollar deed wrapped around his arm for a bandage.', 'It''s 1860 and the old Spanish land grants are being surveyed. Montez is after part of Don Regas'' rancho and gets the surveyor to alter the boundary. But Don Regas still has the original grant written on a bandanna. Montez sends Indians after it but Bill Cody and Gabby fight them off and a wounded Gabby unknowingly ends up with the missing million dollar deed wrapped around his arm for a bandage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nv4gssb7ItVmpT36wthWqWg9cJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99291'),
  ('151474060536440112', 'Young Cassidy', 1965, 'Drama', 'Jack Cardiff, Edward Scaife, John Quested', 'John Whiting', 'Rod Taylor, Julie Christie, Maggie Smith, Michael Redgrave, Edith Evans, Flora Robson, Jack MacGowran, Siân Phillips', 'NR', 'In Dublin circa 1911, John Cassidy (Rod Taylor), an impoverished idealist, whose ambitions are restricted by the demands of looking after his family, journeys through the social injustices of Dublin life, involving himself with the rowdy tramway-men strike, dawdling with prostitute Daisy Battles (Julie Christie), and seeking a better life. He falls in love with bookshop assistant Nora (Dame Maggie Smith) who encourages him toward a life of writing. Finding success at the Abbey Theatre, his unorthodox views estrange him from family, friends, and his own past.', 'In Dublin circa 1911, John Cassidy (Rod Taylor), an impoverished idealist, whose ambitions are restricted by the demands of looking after his family, journeys through the social injustices of Dublin life, involving himself with the rowdy tramway-men strike, dawdling with prostitute Daisy Battles (Julie Christie), and seeking a better life. He falls in love with bookshop assistant Nora (Dame Maggie Smith) who encourages him toward a life of writing. Finding success at the Abbey Theatre, his unorthodox views estrange him from family, friends, and his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHEiiXdVeZbks3AIFHXKvbT86Yy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130474'),
  ('1064153510013939071', 'Young Detective Dee: Rise of the Sea Dragon', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tsui Hark, Choi Sung-Fai, Tony Miu Kin-Fai', 'Zhang Jialu, Chen Kuofu, Tsui Hark', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, AngelaBaby, William Feng, Kim Bum, Carina Lau, Chen Kun, Sheng Chien, Lin Gengxin', 'NR', 'Young Dee Renjie arrives in the empire''s capital to join the Supreme Court as police judge of his region. He wants to become a prosecutor. Empress Wu, who is at the beginning of her reign, has commissioned the fierce detective Yuchi to investigate a sea monster that stalks the city at night and makes it unsafe.', 'Young Dee Renjie arrives in the empire''s capital to join the Supreme Court as police judge of his region. He wants to become a prosecutor. Empress Wu, who is at the beginning of her reign, has commissioned the fierce detective Yuchi to investigate a sea monster that stalks the city at night and makes it unsafe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsnioYKR2C2FlAYZxZTzihW2TVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217923'),
  ('380981991131383470', 'Young Doctors in Love', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Garry Marshall, Donald Peterman', 'Michael Elias, Rich Eustis', 'Sean Young, Michael McKean, Gary Friedkin, Kyle T. Heffner, Rick Overton, Crystal Bernard, Ted McGinley, Saul Rubinek', 'R', 'An ''Airplane!''-style spoof of hospital soap operas—a brilliant young trainee can''t stand the sight of blood; a doctor romances the head nurse in order to get the key to the drugs cabinet; and there''s a mafioso on the loose disguised as a woman.', 'An ''Airplane!''-style spoof of hospital soap operas—a brilliant young trainee can''t stand the sight of blood; a doctor romances the head nurse in order to get the key to the drugs cabinet; and there''s a mafioso on the loose disguised as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JTPSVDEFilY09hqtWPHrCDFneV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47947'),
  ('477569574202434764', 'Young Einstein', 1988, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Darling, Yahoo Serious, Keith Heygate', 'Yahoo Serious, David Roach', 'Yahoo Serious, Odile Le Clezio, Ian "Peewee" Wilson, Su Cruickshank, John Howard, Christian Manon, Basil Clarke, Adam Bowen', 'PG', 'Albert Einstein is the son of a Tasmanian apple farmer, who discovers the secret of splitting the beer atom to put the bubbles back into beer. When Albert travels to Sydney to patent his invention he meets beatuiful French scientist Marie Curie, as well as several unscrupulous types who try to take advantage of the naive genius and his invention.', 'Albert Einstein is the son of a Tasmanian apple farmer, who discovers the secret of splitting the beer atom to put the bubbles back into beer. When Albert travels to Sydney to patent his invention he meets beatuiful French scientist Marie Curie, as well as several unscrupulous types who try to take advantage of the naive genius and his invention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6D4yLH2gMBt8S64f8Arrt39cFFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10001'),
  ('1150768050184798384', 'Young Fury', 1964, 'Western', 'Christian Nyby, Haskell B. Boggs', 'Steve Fisher', 'Rory Calhoun, Virginia Mayo, Preston Pierce, Lon Chaney Jr., John Agar, William Bendix, Richard Arlen, Linda Foster', null, 'A group of young thugs rides into the town of Dawson and take it over. When the cowardly sheriff is unable to restore control, the parents of the leader must take action. The leader''s father is an infamous ex-gunfighter, and he straps his guns on one more time.', 'A group of young thugs rides into the town of Dawson and take it over. When the cowardly sheriff is unable to restore control, the parents of the leader must take action. The leader''s father is an infamous ex-gunfighter, and he straps his guns on one more time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6o5xpbmVI6k7hjeX6llPlu5emEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192451'),
  ('261238282205133370', 'Young Girls in Ecstasy', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Lemoine, Maxime Jean, Catherine Saint-Martin', 'Michel Lemoine', 'Jacques Bernard, Marie Hélène Règne, Nathalie Zeiger, Martine Azencot, Robert de Laroche, Catherine Mouton, Philippe Dumont, Jerry Brouer', null, 'The friends who attended the same boarding school meet and take turns telling their recent romantic experiences. These turn out to be as varied as they are crisp, from the initiation of a student by a teacher to the misunderstanding in the company of a lord, through the false English but true seducer, the swimmer obsessed with his physical condition and, obviously, love in a group (Le Chat Qui Fume).', 'The friends who attended the same boarding school meet and take turns telling their recent romantic experiences. These turn out to be as varied as they are crisp, from the initiation of a student by a teacher to the misunderstanding in the company of a lord, through the false English but true seducer, the swimmer obsessed with his physical condition and, obviously, love in a group (Le Chat Qui Fume).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGRgF0p5Bzhvs4665oXQxdMQcP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860521'),
  ('742522027018922403', 'Young Gods', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'JP Siili, Jarkko T. Laine, Marko Talli', 'Jukka Vieno', 'Jussi Nikkilä, Reino Nordin, Jarkko Niemi, Jenni Banerjee, Ville Kivelä, Evi Suppala, Mervi Takatalo, Laura Malmivaara', null, 'Taavi,the enigmatic 18-year-old lead, has just inherited his long-deceased wealthy parents home and estate. It is high school graduation and Taavi''s birthday, and after his fiends greet him au natural and are arrested, Taavi invites his friends to the mansion for a wild party. Taavi lives with a recording camera to his eye, a machine that allows his to keep interpersonal distance from everyone. Among his friends are Jere who considers himself a woman''s man, Markus (who appears the well-adjusted one, and chubby, pierced Sami whose sexuality is ambiguous. The party gets wild, guests sleep around, and Taavi records it all!', 'Taavi,the enigmatic 18-year-old lead, has just inherited his long-deceased wealthy parents home and estate. It is high school graduation and Taavi''s birthday, and after his fiends greet him au natural and are arrested, Taavi invites his friends to the mansion for a wild party. Taavi lives with a recording camera to his eye, a machine that allows his to keep interpersonal distance from everyone. Among his friends are Jere who considers himself a woman''s man, Markus (who appears the well-adjusted one, and chubby, pierced Sami whose sexuality is ambiguous. The party gets wild, guests sleep around, and Taavi records it all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LdUdayoATafbwCIEzeuqiuppdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50988'),
  ('1020958762027980740', 'Young Goethe in Love', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Philipp Stölzl', 'Alexander Dydyna, Philipp Stölzl, Christoph Müller', 'Alexander Fehling, Miriam Stein, Moritz Bleibtreu, Volker Bruch, Burghart Klaußner, Henry Hübchen, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Anna Böttcher', null, 'After aspiring poet Johann Wolfgang von Goethe fails his law exams, he''s sent to a sleepy provincial court to reform. Instead, he falls for Lotte, a young woman who is promised to another man.', 'After aspiring poet Johann Wolfgang von Goethe fails his law exams, he''s sent to a sleepy provincial court to reform. Instead, he falls for Lotte, a young woman who is promised to another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oyq7zDxGjq5qUdxY9KL7RLSpXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52475'),
  ('114225929353174042', 'Young Guns', 1988, 'Western, Action, Adventure', 'Christopher Cain, Dean Semler, Charles Myers', 'John Fusco', 'Emilio Estevez, Kiefer Sutherland, Lou Diamond Phillips, Charlie Sheen, Dermot Mulroney, Casey Siemaszko, Terence Stamp, Jack Palance', 'R', 'A group of young gunmen, led by Billy the Kid, become deputies to avenge the murder of the rancher who became their benefactor. But when Billy takes their authority too far, they become the hunted.', 'A group of young gunmen, led by Billy the Kid, become deputies to avenge the murder of the rancher who became their benefactor. But when Billy takes their authority too far, they become the hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AgCq7xY1rHRAAn0iVcnNr2OWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11967'),
  ('883651999157589520', 'Young Guns II', 1990, 'Western, Adventure', 'Geoff Murphy, Dean Semler', 'John Fusco', 'Emilio Estevez, Kiefer Sutherland, Lou Diamond Phillips, Christian Slater, William Petersen, Alan Ruck, R. D. Call, Balthazar Getty', 'PG-13', 'Three of the original five "young guns" — Billy the Kid, Jose Chavez y Chavez, and Doc Scurlock — return in Young Guns, Part 2, which is the story of Billy the Kid and his race to safety in Old Mexico while being trailed by a group of government agents led by Pat Garrett.', 'Three of the original five "young guns" — Billy the Kid, Jose Chavez y Chavez, and Doc Scurlock — return in Young Guns, Part 2, which is the story of Billy the Kid and his race to safety in Old Mexico while being trailed by a group of government agents led by Pat Garrett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kMjla98srGHlFzAEmoGRcr6GN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9086'),
  ('468239312161518387', 'Young Hearts', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Schatteman, Pieter Van Campe, Brecht Jansegers', 'Anthony Schatteman', 'Lou Goossens, Marius De Saeger, Geert Van Rampelberg, Emilie De Roo, Dirk van Dijck, Jul Goossens, Ezra van Dongen, Olivier Englebert', 'NR', '14-year-old Elias increasingly feels like an outsider in his village. When he meets his new neighbour of the same age, Alexander, Elias is confronted with his burgeoning sexuality.', '14-year-old Elias increasingly feels like an outsider in his village. When he meets his new neighbour of the same age, Alexander, Elias is confronted with his burgeoning sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGCtYxfuvXfy0BD5m6p7vKuPOxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232449'),
  ('765459395365565900', 'Young Hercules', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy', 'T.J. Scott, John Mahaffie', 'Andrew Dettmann, Daniel Truly', 'Ian Bohen, Dean O''Gorman, Chris Conrad, Johna Stewart-Bowden, Kevin Smith, Meighan Desmond, Nathaniel Lees, Rachel Blakely', null, 'At an academy for mythological warriors, 17-year-old Hercules meets Jason, the next in line to rule Corinth. When Jason discovers that his father is ill, Hercules decides to seek out the Golden Fleece that could cure him. But limitations to his powers, as well as his half-brother Ares, stand in his way.', 'At an academy for mythological warriors, 17-year-old Hercules meets Jason, the next in line to rule Corinth. When Jason discovers that his father is ill, Hercules decides to seek out the Golden Fleece that could cure him. But limitations to his powers, as well as his half-brother Ares, stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWFGMqymyO4TWzfhTSiFOlUtYRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182532'),
  ('416183386390119020', 'Young Hunter', 2020, 'Drama', 'María Fernández Aramburu, Yael Szmulewicz, Vicente Vila', 'Marco Berger', 'Juan Pablo Cestaro, Lautaro Rodríguez, Juan Barberini, Patricio Rodríguez, Luis Margani, Antonia De Michelis, Tomás Agüero, Cecilia Cósero', null, 'Ezequiel, a sixteen-year-old gay teenager in his sexual awakening, meets a boy of twenty-one. They quickly start a relationship and the situation unravels unexpectedly.', 'Ezequiel, a sixteen-year-old gay teenager in his sexual awakening, meets a boy of twenty-one. They quickly start a relationship and the situation unravels unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufLW18r5L29dCWZ6FCCZ8eabsEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623666'),
  ('496133499904502486', 'Young Husbands', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mauro Bolognini, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Carlo Bernari, Enzo Curreli', 'Isabelle Corey, Antonio Cifariello, Franco Interlenghi, Raf Mattioli, Gérard Blain, Ennio Girolami, Rosy Mazzacurati, Anna Maria Guarnieri', null, 'In a small Italian town, the local youngsters realize that their youth is coming to an end and marriage will soon follow. They gather together for one last time in an attempt to revive their younger days, but this comes to a dismal conclusion. Gradually it dawns on the group that childhood is over and the next stage in human growth must be faced.', 'In a small Italian town, the local youngsters realize that their youth is coming to an end and marriage will soon follow. They gather together for one last time in an attempt to revive their younger days, but this comes to a dismal conclusion. Gradually it dawns on the group that childhood is over and the next stage in human growth must be faced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvixysF9OFN4FqO9TD91lFUD1KP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199184'),
  ('661461583449254923', 'Young Ip Man: Crisis Time', 2020, 'Action', 'Li Liming', null, 'Zhao Wenhao, Mou Fengbin, Li Hao-xuan, Shi Yuqing, Tong Xiaohu, Jonathan Kos-Read, Shao Xia', null, 'In 1917 young Ip Man first came to Hong Kong to study, but his peaceful campus life was unexpectedly broken. A shocking hostage situation occurred on the day when the school held an English speech contest. All students in the school were held hostage, and one person was killed every minute. Facing the immediate crisis, Ip Man stepped forward, but unexpectedly discovered that the kidnapper was his master, and his good brother turned out to be an accomplice of the kidnapper.', 'In 1917 young Ip Man first came to Hong Kong to study, but his peaceful campus life was unexpectedly broken. A shocking hostage situation occurred on the day when the school held an English speech contest. All students in the school were held hostage, and one person was killed every minute. Facing the immediate crisis, Ip Man stepped forward, but unexpectedly discovered that the kidnapper was his master, and his good brother turned out to be an accomplice of the kidnapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWeP8CIjHY7iPpcV9mWPWJEWez9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751391'),
  ('842076489886742836', 'Young Jönsson Gang Showing Off', 1997, 'Family, Comedy', 'Christjan Wegner, Henrik Gyllenskiöld', 'Christjan Wegner, Björn Carlström', 'Robert Gustafsson, Johan Rabaeus, Ulla Skoog, Loa Falkman, Peter Harryson, Kalle Eriksson, Jonathan Flumee, Fredrik Glimskär', null, 'When their circus tickets get swiped, the Jönsson League boys hatch a plan to steal them back, but end up suspects in an even bigger crime!', 'When their circus tickets get swiped, the Jönsson League boys hatch a plan to steal them back, but end up suspects in an even bigger crime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyA8ITfknEPmc2ypcMbiQ5VQagM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57548'),
  ('789019941298651049', 'Young Jönsson Gang: The Cornflakes Robbery', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', 'Christjan Wegner, Per Källberg', 'Mikael Ruttkay Hylin, Christjan Wegner', 'Kalle Eriksson, Jonathan Flumee, Fredrik Glimskär, Jonna Sohlmér, Anders Öström, Mats Wennberg, Claes Månsson, Peter Rangmar', null, 'The young Jönsson gang''s plan to steal "millions of filmisar" faces problem after problem before uncovering something much greater.', 'The young Jönsson gang''s plan to steal "millions of filmisar" faces problem after problem before uncovering something much greater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAqlfXN8LmSbox7DnWmZeqb9kVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54257'),
  ('1108884700205830814', 'Young Lady Chatterley', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Roberts, Danny Biederman', 'Steve Michaels', 'Harlee McBride, Peter Ratray, William Beckley, Ann Michelle, Joi Staton, Mary Forbes, Patrick Wright, Edgar Daniels', 'R', 'Cynthia inherits a large estate and moves in. She reads her aunt''s diary and finds out how she was taught in the ways of love by her gardener in 1901 at the age of 21. She decides to continue the fruitful relationship and gets it on with the handsome young gardener herself.', 'Cynthia inherits a large estate and moves in. She reads her aunt''s diary and finds out how she was taught in the ways of love by her gardener in 1901 at the age of 21. She decides to continue the fruitful relationship and gets it on with the handsome young gardener herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7qGcnhERfYhXupDqurEIlkXBSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77756'),
  ('968481659286779713', 'Young Lady Chatterley II', 1985, 'Drama', 'Alan Roberts', 'Anthony Williams', 'Harlee McBride, Sybil Danning, Adam West, Ed Quinlan, Brett Baxter Clark, Alexandra Day, Wendy Barry, Monique Gabrielle', 'R', 'Cynthia, new lady of Chatterly, feels neglected by her husband. During his absences she tries to amuse herself with gardener Thomas, but always gets interrupted by new visitors. While she''s busy her staff amuses itself. One of her guests is a professor who wants to do research in her land-seat. He''s quite repressed, but she knows how to lighten him up.', 'Cynthia, new lady of Chatterly, feels neglected by her husband. During his absences she tries to amuse herself with gardener Thomas, but always gets interrupted by new visitors. While she''s busy her staff amuses itself. One of her guests is a professor who wants to do research in her land-seat. He''s quite repressed, but she knows how to lighten him up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bsx75fZpFP3A34F4bQ9P55dKmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125778'),
  ('82990138881595238', 'Young Light', 2016, 'Drama', 'Adolf Winkelmann, David Slama, Jenny Eichelmeyer', 'Till Beckmann, Nils Beckmann, Adolf Winkelmann', 'Charly Hübner, Oscar Brose, Peter Lohmeyer, Nina Petri, Stephan Kampwirth, Ludger Pistor, Caroline Peters, Patrick Joswig', null, 'Julian is a 12-year-old boy whose family is just scraping by in the Ruhr industrial region of Germany in the early 1960s . When his mother and younger sister go away for a while, he is left mostly alone in the apartment while his father works in the coal mine. He has to confront the confusing world of adults and older boys and the older girl next door on his own. Finally events build up and threaten to tear the family apart.', 'Julian is a 12-year-old boy whose family is just scraping by in the Ruhr industrial region of Germany in the early 1960s . When his mother and younger sister go away for a while, he is left mostly alone in the apartment while his father works in the coal mine. He has to confront the confusing world of adults and older boys and the older girl next door on his own. Finally events build up and threaten to tear the family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w85cXXVp2EllJJHY9ln01SD78xZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388022'),
  ('148148573260952227', 'Young Love', 1951, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Guy Lefranc, Maurice Delbez, Michel Monbailly', 'Michel Audiard', 'Louis Jouvet, Daniel Gélin, Dany Robin, Georges Chamarat, Yolande Laffon, Renée Passeur, Catherine Erard, Pierre Moncorbier', null, 'Catherine, 18, loved Jean, a young accountant, who loved her in return. And yet, one morning, two policemen find their dead bodies on a stretch of waste ground. The case is obvious: the two young people have killed themselves. But why? Chief Inspector Ernest Plonche, feeling upset, decides to investigate personally.', 'Catherine, 18, loved Jean, a young accountant, who loved her in return. And yet, one morning, two policemen find their dead bodies on a stretch of waste ground. The case is obvious: the two young people have killed themselves. But why? Chief Inspector Ernest Plonche, feeling upset, decides to investigate personally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dryQi45Cev6eQghqWdkmO8FRSRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64241'),
  ('218807280076217568', 'Young Love', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Hanus Polak, Walter Bannert, Harald Scholz', 'Anton Moho, Eitan Evan', 'Yftach Katzur, Zachi Noy, Jonathan Sagall, Sonja Martin, Sissi Pitz, Sibylle Rauch, Eva Astor, Michael Gahr', 'R', 'While his parents are on holiday, Huey and his buddies borrow their car and go out. After pursuing a gang of girls, Huey crashes the car, and discovering that the repairs will cost a small fortune, the boys must get jobs to pay for the repairs before Huey''s parents get home. The boys all land jobs as porters in the Beachfront Hotel, where their minds are taken off their problems by girls!!', 'While his parents are on holiday, Huey and his buddies borrow their car and go out. After pursuing a gang of girls, Huey crashes the car, and discovering that the repairs will cost a small fortune, the boys must get jobs to pay for the repairs before Huey''s parents get home. The boys all land jobs as porters in the Beachfront Hotel, where their minds are taken off their problems by girls!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcjnZpZYVYl4mR3nuvwlU8znwsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10584'),
  ('457936166105381202', 'Young Love', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arto Lehkamo, Johann Sigfússon', 'Arto Lehkamo', 'Joonas Nordman, Saija Lentonen, Sari Havas, Pekka Lukka, Antti Aro, Marc Gassot, Anna-Leena Härkönen, Ari-Pekka Tervahauta', null, 'Jukka, 13, is coached in photography by his openly gay art teacher. With his dead father''s old camera, Jukka sees Johanna, a beautiful girl in her early twenties being physically abused by her stepfather. With the help of the local fire department, Jukka comes to her rescue. He quickly befriends the girl who works in a nearby supermarket, claims to become her manager and enters her in a beauty contest.', 'Jukka, 13, is coached in photography by his openly gay art teacher. With his dead father''s old camera, Jukka sees Johanna, a beautiful girl in her early twenties being physically abused by her stepfather. With the help of the local fire department, Jukka comes to her rescue. He quickly befriends the girl who works in a nearby supermarket, claims to become her manager and enters her in a beauty contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CMHlUldZBEQNGvlkCaK2k32gi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79236'),
  ('504276973486107818', 'Young Love Lost', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Xiang Guo Qiang', 'Lu Nei', 'Dong Zijian, Li Meng, Shang Tielong, Yang Haoyu, Zhang Lu, Mengke Bateer', null, 'In the latter part of the last century, Lu Xiaolu has just graduated from technical school and is currently working in a chemical factory. He hasn''t a clue about what he will do in the future or how he should lead his life. Lu Xiaolu lacks skills. Moreover, he loves to play games, fight with his colleagues and is often found redoing poorly executed tasks. However, Lu Xiaolu is captivated by a beautiful young girl named Bai Lan, who he pursues and eventually falls in love with. Bai Lan in the end applies for graduate school and abruptly leaves for Shanghai...', 'In the latter part of the last century, Lu Xiaolu has just graduated from technical school and is currently working in a chemical factory. He hasn''t a clue about what he will do in the future or how he should lead his life. Lu Xiaolu lacks skills. Moreover, he loves to play games, fight with his colleagues and is often found redoing poorly executed tasks. However, Lu Xiaolu is captivated by a beautiful young girl named Bai Lan, who he pursues and eventually falls in love with. Bai Lan in the end applies for graduate school and abruptly leaves for Shanghai...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH0X9eCt0sDyf47YHvsaM2nU0PI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365815'),
  ('367392026732804106', 'Young Lucrezia', 1974, 'Drama', 'Luciano Ercoli', 'Luciano Ercoli', 'Simonetta Stefanelli, Massimo Foschi, Ettore Manni, Anna Orso, Paolo Malco, Elizabeth Turner, Fred Robsahm, Aldo Reggiani', null, 'In the early 16th century Italy is ruled by the powerful Borgia family, led by Cesare Borgia and his sister Lucrezia. In a ruthless power play, Cesare plots to have his sister’s husband murdered.', 'In the early 16th century Italy is ruled by the powerful Borgia family, led by Cesare Borgia and his sister Lucrezia. In a ruthless power play, Cesare plots to have his sister’s husband murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/C43V5cnoakMwuHe8ehlCPAnbZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201272'),
  ('693027889057451838', 'Young Man on the Bar Masturbating with Rage and Nerve', 2015, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Julián Hernández', 'Emiliano Arenales Osorio', 'Cristhian Rodríguez, Akram, Saúl Sánchez, Javier Oliván, Rubén Santiago, Omar Francisco Armella, Luis Fernando Loyola, Carlos Eduardo Sánchez', null, 'Dance and prostitution play the same role for Cristhian’s body. Virtuosity, desire, technique, and sex intertwine, granting coherence to a way of life that offers many answers to few questions. A leitmotiv that reconciles opposites and contradictions. Answers that are sometimes painful, like all truths.', 'Dance and prostitution play the same role for Cristhian’s body. Virtuosity, desire, technique, and sex intertwine, granting coherence to a way of life that offers many answers to few questions. A leitmotiv that reconciles opposites and contradictions. Answers that are sometimes painful, like all truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHSpdHN05JssmvX6gnoPy46eYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380270'),
