  ('739731323099012912', 'Young Style', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Liu Jie', null, 'Dong Zijian, Qin Hailu, Yong Mei, Jiao Gang, An Yuexi, Qie Lutong, Jiang Xueming', null, 'A story of a high school boy as he processes the loss of his first love and learns to experience high school over again. For 3 years of high school, JU Ran has silently had a love for a young girl in his class. At the end of his senior year, as the college entrance examination looms overhead, JU Ran''s situation changes, and he is given the chance to repeat his senior year. Through this year, he studies again for the examination, and has a second chance at his high school experience. JU Ran''s tale is that of growing up, and a caution to take joy in every moment, because even second chances are not perfect.', 'A story of a high school boy as he processes the loss of his first love and learns to experience high school over again. For 3 years of high school, JU Ran has silently had a love for a young girl in his class. At the end of his senior year, as the college entrance examination looms overhead, JU Ran''s situation changes, and he is given the chance to repeat his senior year. Through this year, he studies again for the examination, and has a second chance at his high school experience. JU Ran''s tale is that of growing up, and a caution to take joy in every moment, because even second chances are not perfect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1ZkDLydCpQ0zZZMpQdZ4QuiivQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412555'),
  ('961029525529299255', 'Young Swordsman', 1963, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Kazuo Yamada', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Takeshi Kimura', 'Matsumoto Hakuō II, Hiroyuki Nagato, Junko Ikeuchi, Yuki Nakagawa, Nami Tamura, Masao Shimizu, Ryōsuke Kagawa, Bokuzen Hidari', null, 'This Japanese action-adventure is set in the 17th century when all forms of swordplay were banned. One fighter, an excellent swordsman believes the law is unfair. His brother keeps his opinions about the law to himself. The swordsman vents his frustration by cutting off the thumbs of an enemy. The fighter is then banished. To live, he becomes a thief. To restore the family''s lost honor, the other brother is forced to challenge the fighter to a duel.', 'This Japanese action-adventure is set in the 17th century when all forms of swordplay were banned. One fighter, an excellent swordsman believes the law is unfair. His brother keeps his opinions about the law to himself. The swordsman vents his frustration by cutting off the thumbs of an enemy. The fighter is then banished. To live, he becomes a thief. To restore the family''s lost honor, the other brother is forced to challenge the fighter to a duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDRIskPP7PFXDZRspfbH9kbqaTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451514'),
  ('892011853533394076', 'Young Thugs: Nostalgia', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Naoto Takenaka, Yuki Nagata, Saki Takaoka, Toshikazu Nakaba, Akihiro Shimizu, Yoshinori Yasuda, Setsuko Karasuma, Takeshi Caesar', null, 'Nostalgia is Takashi Miike’s favorite film of his considerable body of work. Including biographical elements, Nostalgia centers around the home and school of a young boy, whose family mix the violent and dysfunctional with the comic and the loveable. Though containing elements of the sudden and shocking brutality that many associate with this director, Young Thugs – Nostalgia is more concerned with a child’s moment of leaving the internalized world of fantasy, and passing on eagerly to the next stage of life. A wonderful, touching, startling vision that is uniquely Miike’s.', 'Nostalgia is Takashi Miike’s favorite film of his considerable body of work. Including biographical elements, Nostalgia centers around the home and school of a young boy, whose family mix the violent and dysfunctional with the comic and the loveable. Though containing elements of the sudden and shocking brutality that many associate with this director, Young Thugs – Nostalgia is more concerned with a child’s moment of leaving the internalized world of fantasy, and passing on eagerly to the next stage of life. A wonderful, touching, startling vision that is uniquely Miike’s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olGPdOyC8IJh4pg3ssrlfefNmAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80314'),
  ('843756197098763543', 'Young Tiger', 2015, 'Drama', 'Cyprien Vial, Pierre Cottereau', 'Cyprien Vial', 'Harmandeep Palminder, Vikram Sharma, Elisabeth Lando, Bilal Baggad, Billel Brima, Amandeep Singh, Karim Leklou, Aurore Broutin', null, 'Bébé Tigre is Many, a 17-year-old Indian boy who has been living in France for two years. A teenager like any other, he divides his time between school, friends, and his girlfriend. But the pressures placed on him by his parents in India force him to put his own life at risk...', 'Bébé Tigre is Many, a 17-year-old Indian boy who has been living in France for two years. A teenager like any other, he divides his time between school, friends, and his girlfriend. But the pressures placed on him by his parents in India force him to put his own life at risk...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MNJQvfEhsK93RaJUkkBrTu4y72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318373'),
  ('613889468779171893', 'Young Tom Edison', 1940, 'Drama', 'Norman Taurog, Sidney Wagner', 'Bradbury Foote, Hugo Butler, Dore Schary', 'Mickey Rooney, George Bancroft, Fay Bainter, Virginia Weidler, Eugene Pallette, Victor Kilian, Bobby Jordan, Lloyd Corrigan', 'NR', 'Inventor Thomas Edison''s boyhood is chronicled and shows him as a lad whose early inventions and scientific experiments usually end up causing disastrous results. As a result, the towns folk all think Tom is crazy, and creating a strained relationship between Tom and his father. Tom''s only solace is his understanding mother who believes he''s headed to do great things.', 'Inventor Thomas Edison''s boyhood is chronicled and shows him as a lad whose early inventions and scientific experiments usually end up causing disastrous results. As a result, the towns folk all think Tom is crazy, and creating a strained relationship between Tom and his father. Tom''s only solace is his understanding mother who believes he''s headed to do great things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5SpgdQkz5QpoiGVUHSc5eoa7hG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56154'),
  ('376936089862212355', 'Young Törless', 1966, 'Drama', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Franz Rath', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Herbert Asmodi', 'Mathieu Carrière, Marian Seidowsky, Bernd Tischer, Fred Dietz, Lotte Ledl, Jean Launay, Barbara Steele, Hanna Axmann-Rezzori', null, 'At an Austrian boys'' boarding school in the early 1900s, shy, intelligent Törless observes the sadistic behavior of his fellow students, doing nothing to help a victimized classmate—until the torture goes too far. Adapted from Robert Musil''s acclaimed novel, Young Törless launched the New German Cinema movement and garnered the 1966 Cannes Film Festival International Critics'' Prize for first-time director Volker Schlöndorff.', 'At an Austrian boys'' boarding school in the early 1900s, shy, intelligent Törless observes the sadistic behavior of his fellow students, doing nothing to help a victimized classmate—until the torture goes too far. Adapted from Robert Musil''s acclaimed novel, Young Törless launched the New German Cinema movement and garnered the 1966 Cannes Film Festival International Critics'' Prize for first-time director Volker Schlöndorff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJWcKXABcww5u2kgPEQTYQ85G7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45694'),
  ('315643973099573879', 'Young Warriors', 1983, 'Action, Drama', 'Lawrence D. Foldes, Jacques Haitkin, Adam Slater', 'Russell W. Colgin, Lawrence D. Foldes', 'Ernest Borgnine, Richard Roundtree, Lynda Day George, James Van Patten, Anne Lockhart, Tom Reilly, Mike Norris, Linnea Quigley', null, 'After a young woman is gang raped and murdered in a California college town, her brother takes up arms by night with a gang of like-minded vigilantes from his fraternity, brutally punishing any miscreants they catch in a criminal act.', 'After a young woman is gang raped and murdered in a California college town, her brother takes up arms by night with a gang of like-minded vigilantes from his fraternity, brutally punishing any miscreants they catch in a criminal act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xs5Az75SN3MbcruU1sDcmAqQFen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30642'),
  ('650621913313057622', 'Young Winston', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, War', 'Richard Attenborough, Gerry Turpin', 'Carl Foreman', 'Simon Ward, Peter Cellier, Robert Shaw, Anne Bancroft, Jack Hawkins, Ian Holm, Anthony Hopkins, Edward Woodward', 'PG', 'This historical drama is an account of the early life of British politician Winston Churchill, including his childhood years, his time as a war correspondent in Africa, and culminating with his first election to Parliament.', 'This historical drama is an account of the early life of British politician Winston Churchill, including his childhood years, his time as a war correspondent in Africa, and culminating with his first election to Parliament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBrw76I5NSsHwS8IcPPCe49JjqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66775'),
  ('12981805306986697', 'Young Wives'' Tale', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Cass, Jack Martin, Erwin Hillier', 'Ronald Jeans', 'Joan Greenwood, Nigel Patrick, Derek Farr, Guy Middleton, Athene Seyler, Helen Cherry, Audrey Hepburn, Fabia Drake', null, 'A post-war housing crisis leaves a shy woman to share a house with two couples. Comic situations arise as the new roomer becomes infatuated with one of the husbands.', 'A post-war housing crisis leaves a shy woman to share a house with two couples. Comic situations arise as the new roomer becomes infatuated with one of the husbands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbBmuKsPXHgqsOFthWUu9kgNF1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237446'),
  ('103992827175582182', 'Young, Beautiful and Screwed Up', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Philippe Gosselin, Fritz Seemann, Michel Thiriet', 'Rodolphe Sand, Igor Sekulic, David Talbot', 'Matthias Van Khache, Hervé Lassïnce, Mareva Galanter, Richard Bohringer, Stéphane Soo Mongo, Ticky Holgado, Jean-Marie Bigard, Cyrielle Clair', null, 'A young boy from the south of France falls madly in love with a posh Parisian girl and follows her for crazy adventures to the big city.', 'A young boy from the south of France falls madly in love with a posh Parisian girl and follows her for crazy adventures to the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAm5o0b7svnUjLb8fEC6NaYGKAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54915'),
  ('1068516954981542930', 'Young, Violent, Dangerous', 1976, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Erico Menczer', 'Fernando Di Leo, Nico Ducci', 'Tomas Milian, Eleonora Giorgi, Stefano Patrizi, Benjamin Lev, Max Delys, Diego Abatantuono, Venantino Venantini, Salvatore Billa', null, 'Paul, Joe and Louie are three young men from good families who decide to go on a bloodthirsty and pointless crime spree, much to the dismay of paul’s girlfriend (Eleonora Giorgi) and the local police commissioner (Tomas Milian). the group starts by robbing a gas station where paul guns down three innocent bystanders. When they later decide to rob a bank and a grocery store, paul ends up killing more people. It isn’t long before the entire police force is looking for the three criminals, who pick up the girl and hightail it to the Swiss border, killing everyone in their path.', 'Paul, Joe and Louie are three young men from good families who decide to go on a bloodthirsty and pointless crime spree, much to the dismay of paul’s girlfriend (Eleonora Giorgi) and the local police commissioner (Tomas Milian). the group starts by robbing a gas station where paul guns down three innocent bystanders. When they later decide to rob a bank and a grocery store, paul ends up killing more people. It isn’t long before the entire police force is looking for the three criminals, who pick up the girl and hightail it to the Swiss border, killing everyone in their path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfMBhvERRQ3tTyM9yiPHWCevFnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95375'),
  ('816581311721704290', 'Youngblood', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Markle, Neil Huhta, Alta Louise Doyle', 'Peter Markle', 'Rob Lowe, Cynthia Gibb, Patrick Swayze, Ed Lauter, Jim Youngs, Eric Nesterenko, Fionnula Flanagan, Ken James', 'R', 'A skilled young hockey prospect hoping to attract the attention of professional scouts is pressured to show that he can fight if challenged during his stay in a Canadian minor hockey town. His on-ice activities are complicated by his relationship with the coach''s daughter.', 'A skilled young hockey prospect hoping to attract the attention of professional scouts is pressured to show that he can fight if challenged during his stay in a Canadian minor hockey town. His on-ice activities are complicated by his relationship with the coach''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SLQRH3AlTJHXk6ZuW0yMAelMlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17465'),
  ('549687067196759062', 'Youngblood', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Sport', 'Hubert Davis, Stuart James Cameron, Markian Saray, Neille Brockie, Louisa Pang, Gerard Goco', 'Charles Officer, Josh Epstein, Kyle Rideout, Seneca Aaron, Peter Markle, John Whitman', 'Ashton James, Henri Picard, Blair Underwood, Shawn Doyle, Alexandra McDonald', 'PG-13', 'Detroit hockey prodigy Dean Youngblood joins the Hamilton Mustangs, where his pride and prowess are tested.', 'Detroit hockey prodigy Dean Youngblood joins the Hamilton Mustangs, where his pride and prowess are tested.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F8%2Fgracenote%2F8eb7e5e70d12e2ab9d0d79b56036271a.jpg', 'plex:movie:youngblood-2026'),
  ('1607122238483834', 'Youngblood Hawke', 1964, 'Drama', 'Charles Lawton Jr., Delmer Daves, Russell Llewellyn', 'Delmer Daves', 'James Franciscus, Suzanne Pleshette, Geneviève Page, Eva Gabor, Mary Astor, Lee Bowman, Edward Andrews, Don Porter', 'NR', 'An unknown Kentucky writer comes to New York and pursues fame and women.', 'An unknown Kentucky writer comes to New York and pursues fame and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TEvpP3mU2s4j3n4t5eH6KEDFqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123281'),
  ('431125028955307844', 'Younger and Younger', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Percy Adlon, Bernd Heinl, Francis R. Mahony III', 'Percy Adlon, Felix O. Adlon', 'Donald Sutherland, Lolita Davidovich, Brendan Fraser, Sally Kellerman, Julie Delpy, Linda Hunt, Pit Krüger, Nicholas Gunn', 'R', 'The eccentric owner of a Los Angeles self-storage company finds his world come crashing down when his long-suffering wife dies, only to return as a beautiful ghost.', 'The eccentric owner of a Los Angeles self-storage company finds his world come crashing down when his long-suffering wife dies, only to return as a beautiful ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gh24M7PMbY3mW0vWkgXwKV89Aca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260448'),
  ('457380681166197305', 'Youngest Sister Class', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Seung Ha, Yoon Yool, Kim Dong-woo, Kang Min-woo, Park Do-jin', null, 'Lim Da-yeong, the older sister, intercepted the lover of her younger sister, Lim Da-jeong, who is Yoon Tae-jin. As if this were not enough, Da-yeong imprisoned her younger sister in a mental hospital and lived a happy married life with Tae-jin. Then one day, the Da-jeong escapes from the mental hospital and conspires with helper Jo Yong-hwan, who is her ward friend, to exact cruel revenge on her older sister and her former lover. Both Da-yeong and Tae-jin endure Da-jeong''s bloody kidnapping, domesticated slave life and harsh punishments. They look for opportunities to escape with a scary plot in their hearts. What will be the ending for these crazy sisters?', 'Lim Da-yeong, the older sister, intercepted the lover of her younger sister, Lim Da-jeong, who is Yoon Tae-jin. As if this were not enough, Da-yeong imprisoned her younger sister in a mental hospital and lived a happy married life with Tae-jin. Then one day, the Da-jeong escapes from the mental hospital and conspires with helper Jo Yong-hwan, who is her ward friend, to exact cruel revenge on her older sister and her former lover. Both Da-yeong and Tae-jin endure Da-jeong''s bloody kidnapping, domesticated slave life and harsh punishments. They look for opportunities to escape with a scary plot in their hearts. What will be the ending for these crazy sisters?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce29t67HRvnOwjEHuDaUByPnJXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791128'),
  ('229354988640005176', 'Youngistaan', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Syed Ahmed Afzal, Kunal M. Shah', 'Ramiz Ilham Khan, Maitrey Bajpai, Syed Ahmed Afzal', 'Boman Irani, Farooq Shaikh, Jacky Bhagnani, Neha Sharma, Kayoze Irani, Prakash Belawadi, Dipankar Dey, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Abhimanyu Kaul - a young, independent, Games Developer, living in Japan and the love of his life, Anwita Chauhan - a bubbly, passionate and full of life, summer intern. Their happy and content life faces the test of time, when blood ties and the pressure of being born into the first family of India tears a young Abhimanyu between his love for Anwita and a promise made to his dying father, the Prime Minister of India. Being a public figure, by reluctantly accepting to represent the governing party, much against his own wishes and at the cost of his private life, is a double-edged sword that Abhimanyu must walk on.', 'Abhimanyu Kaul - a young, independent, Games Developer, living in Japan and the love of his life, Anwita Chauhan - a bubbly, passionate and full of life, summer intern. Their happy and content life faces the test of time, when blood ties and the pressure of being born into the first family of India tears a young Abhimanyu between his love for Anwita and a promise made to his dying father, the Prime Minister of India. Being a public figure, by reluctantly accepting to represent the governing party, much against his own wishes and at the cost of his private life, is a double-edged sword that Abhimanyu must walk on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89mWkdOnrXeq2V9B8piLYad3s9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263828'),
  ('726159407634864095', 'Youngling', 2026, 'Drama, War', 'Andrey Simonov, Ruslan Gerasimenkov, Ivan Rips', 'Andrey Simonov, Rinat Esenaliev, Kirill Imashev, Pavel Chertok, Roman Gusarov, Alexander Ryabyshev, Oleg Savtsov', 'Gleb Kalyuzhny, Ivan Alexeev, Oleg Vasilkov', null, 'An apolitical rapper from Donetsk volunteers to go to Mariupol to rescue his mother from the besieged city.', 'An apolitical rapper from Donetsk volunteers to go to Mariupol to rescue his mother from the besieged city.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6LwMybxScJTQ9M9DgMuhKi809tc.jpg', 'plex:movie:malysh-2026-1'),
  ('763627162365467834', 'Your Boyfriend Is Mine', 2022, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Stacia Crawford, Clint Owens, Christian Ortega', 'Bryan Dick', 'Eli Jane, Jamie Roy, Brey Noelle, Jesse Malinowski, Derek McDonnell, Sharonne Lanier, Chris Vaber, Will Poston', 'PG-13', 'Over the objection of his girlfriend, Ben agrees to take a job as the “live in” man servant to a wealthy businesswoman, Amanda, but quickly realizes he has made a deal with the devil, and has put himself and his girlfriend in mortal jeopardy', 'Over the objection of his girlfriend, Ben agrees to take a job as the “live in” man servant to a wealthy businesswoman, Amanda, but quickly realizes he has made a deal with the devil, and has put himself and his girlfriend in mortal jeopardy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OOYNZLKjdX8Z5KNyz7zZnHmodJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951368'),
